e](link_action_19856) and until the end of your next turn, the damage type of the affixed weapon changes to the type matching the [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw came from (see below). This change overrides the versatile trait and similar abilities.\n\n* * *\n\n#### Dragon Damage Types\n\nThe _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_ and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ use a type of damage depending on what kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw or tooth came from. These items are typically made from the [dragons](link_trait_2402) in Monster Core, but your GM might introduce uncommon or rare versions made from other types of [dragons](link_trait_2402).\n\n| Dragon Type | Damage Type |\n\n| --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Conspirator or horned | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Diabolic | [Fire](link_trait_1542) |\n\n| Empyreal | [Spirit](link_trait_1556) |\n\n| Fortune | [Force](link_trait_1560) |\n\n| Mirage or omen | [Mental](link_trait_1448) |","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one tooth from an adult or older dragon."}},{"table":"item","id":12325,"before":{"id":12325,"bulk":"0","name":"Resonating Fork (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2307628812193819","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1484,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4771","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"128"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":29}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:31.489653+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This two-pronged fork 