"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21196,"type":"action","before":{"id":21196,"cost":"","name":"Scout","type":"action","uuid":"3984163539396425","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2629","book":"Player Core","page":"439"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:23:24.749003+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You scout ahead and behind the group to watch danger, moving at half speed. At the start of the next encounter, every creature in your party gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their initiative rolls.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":21196,"cost":"","name":"Scout","type":"action","uuid":"3984163539396425","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2629","book":"Player Core","page":"439"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:23:24.749003+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You scout ahead and behind the group to watch danger, moving at half speed. At the start of the next encounter, every creature in your party gains a +1 circumstance bonus to their initiative rolls.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21200,"type":"action","before":{"id":21200,"cost":"","name":"Detect Magic","type":"action","uuid":"4449344104576553","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2624","book":"Player Core","page":"438"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:40:12.425533+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You cast [detect magic](link_spell_4562) at regular intervals. You move at half your travel speed or slower. You have no chance of accidentally overlooking a magic aura at a travel speed up to 300 feet per minute, but must be traveling no more than 150 feet per minute to detect magic auras before the party moves into them.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":21200,"cost":"","name":"Detect Magic","type":"action","uuid":"4449344104576553","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2624","book":"Player Core","page":"438"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:40:12.425533+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You cast [detect magic](link_spell_4562) at regular intervals. You move at half your travel speed or slower. You have no chance of accidentally overlooking a magic aura at a travel speed up to 300 feet per minute, but must be traveling no more than 150 feet per minute to detect magic auras before the party moves into them.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21201,"type":"action","before":{"id":21201,"cost":"","name":"Hustle","type":"action","uuid":"2826451599530988","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1505,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2626","book":"Player Core","page":"438"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:41:31.39009+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You strain yourself to move at double your travel speed. You can Hustle only for a number of minutes equal to your Constitution modifier × 10 (minimum 10 minutes). If you are in a group that is Hustling, use the lowest Constitution modifier among everyone to determine how fast the group can Hustle together.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":21201,"cost":"","name":"Hustle","type":"action","uuid":"2826451599530988","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1505,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2626","book":"Player Core","page":"438"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:41:31.39009+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You strain yourself to move at double your travel speed. You can Hustle only for a number of minutes equal to your Constitution modifier × 10 (minimum 10 minutes). If you are in a group that is Hustling, use the lowest Constitution modifier among everyone to determine how fast the group can Hustle together.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21202,"type":"action","before":{"id":21202,"cost":"","name":"Investigate","type":"action","uuid":"3736159947114578","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2627","book":"Player Core","page":"439"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:43:35.968462+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You seek out information about your surroundings while traveling at half speed. You use [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) as a [secret](link_trait_1463) check to discover clues among the various things you can see and engage with as you journey along. You can use any skill that has a [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) action while Investigating, but the GM determines whether the skill is relevant to the clues you could find.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":21202,"cost":"","name":"Investigate","type":"action","uuid":"3736159947114578","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1457],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2627","book":"Player Core","page":"439"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T06:43:35.968462+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You seek out information about your surroundings while traveling at half speed. You use [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) as a [secret](link_trait_1463) check to discover clues among the various things you can see and engage with as you journey along. You can use any skill that has a [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) action while Investigating, but the GM determines whether the skill is relevant to the clues you could find.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21205,"type":"action","before":{"id":21205,"cost":"","name":"Squeeze","type":"action","uuid":"5016194149183105","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1457,1505],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2372","book":"Player Core","page":"233"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T07:13:03.886165+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You contort yourself to squeeze through a space so small you can barely fit through. This action is for exceptionally small spaces; many tight spaces are difficult terrain that you can move through more quickly and without a check.\n\n**Critical Success** You squeeze through the tight space in 1 minute per 10 feet of squeezing.\n\n**Success** You squeeze through in 1 minute per 5 feet.\n\n**Critical Failure** You become stuck in the tight space. While you're stuck, you can spend 1 minute attempting another Acrobatics check at the same DC. Any result on that check other than a critical failure causes you to become unstuck.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":21205,"cost":"","name":"Squeeze","type":"action","uuid":"5016194149183105","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1457,1505],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Actions.aspx?ID=2372","book":"Player Core","page":"233"}},"created_at":"2024-04-13T07:13:03.886165+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You contort yourself to squeeze through a space so small you can barely fit through. This action is for exceptionally small spaces; many tight spaces are difficult terrain that you can move through more quickly and without a check.\n\n**Critical Success** You squeeze through the tight space in 1 minute per 10 feet of squeezing.\n\n**Success** You squeeze through in 1 minute per 5 feet.\n\n**Critical Failure** You become stuck in the tight space. While you're stuck, you can spend 1 minute attempting another Acrobatics check at the same DC. Any result on that check other than a critical failure causes you to become unstuck.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":21296,"type":"class-feature","before":{"id":21296,"cost":"","name":"Surprise Attack","type":"class-feature","uuid":"7691880008613073","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1345],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Classes.aspx?ID=37","book":"Player Core","page":"164"}},"created_at":"2024-04-16T05:21:48.900655+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You spring into combat faster than foes can react. On the first round of combat, if you roll Deception or Stealth for initiative, creatures that haven’t acted are off-guard to you.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":21296,"cost":"","name":"Surprise Attack","type":"class-feature","uui