reaction and the [Settle Emotions](link_feat_40630) activity.\n\n* * *\n\n**Emotional States:**\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Anger)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Awe)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Dedication)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Fear)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Hatred)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Joy)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Love)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Misery)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Pride)\n\nCatharsis Emotion (Remorse)","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["Charisma +2 or ability to cast spells from spell slots"],"content_source_id":13},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22553,"type":"feat","before":{"id":22553,"cost":null,"name":"Master Spellcasting","type":"feat","uuid":"3524591752097091","level":18,"access":null,"rarity":"RARE","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:54:14.954438+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Usually found at 18th level, these feats make you a master in spell attack modifiers and spell DCs and grant you a 7th-rank spell slot. If you have a spell repertoire, you can select a third spell from your repertoire as a signature spell. At 20th level, they grant you an 8th-rank spell slot. Archetypes refer to these benefits as the “master spellcasting benefits.”","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["Expert Spellcasting"],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":22553,"cost":null,"name":"Master Spellcasting","type":"feat","uuid":"3524591752097091","level":18,"access":null,"rarity":"RARE","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:54:14.954438+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Usually found at 18th level, these feats make you a master in spell attack modifiers and spell DCs and grant you a 7th-rank spell slot. If you have a spell repertoire, you can select a third spell from your repertoire as a signature spell. At 20th level, they grant you an 8th-rank spell slot. Archetypes refer to these benefits as the “master spellcasting benefits.”","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["Expert Spellcasting"],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22570,"type":"feat","before":{"id":22570,"cost":null,"name":"Raise a Tome","type":"feat","uuid":"8590994598803053","level":1,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2940],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=9046","book":"Impossible Magic","page":"17"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:54:26.393942+00:00","operations":[{"id":"35c43a36-d6d1-47ef-be39-8233d659945d","data":{"id":19750,"text":"**Raise a Tome** When you Raise a Shield, you can raise a book you’re wielding instead of a shield. While you have a book raised, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and a +1 circumstance bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) checks to identify creatures using a skill related to the subject of the book (Arcana if you’re using your [spellbook](link_item_7799)). If consulting the book normally grants an item bonus to the check for consulting the book, you gain this bonus as well.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"2e81708a-7c04-41f8-8067-b4f40a6759bd","data":{"id":20534,"text":"**Raise a Tome** You can use a raised tome for this feat as though it were a shield. The tome has Hardness 3, HP 12, and BT 6, and can benefit from the [reinforcing](link_item_7693) rune.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"You can flip open a book to simultaneously study and deflect attacks. When you [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750), you can raise a book you’re wielding instead of a shield. While you have a book raised, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and a +1 circumstance bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) checks to identify creatures using a skill related to the subject of the book (Arcana if you’re using your [spellbook](link_item_7799)). If consulting the book normally grants an item bonus to the check for consulting the book, you gain this bonus as well.\n\nIf you have [Shield Block](link_feat_20534), you can use a raised tome for that feat as though it were a shield. The tome has Hardness 3, HP 12, and BT 6.\n\nIn addition, you can inscribe the [reinforcing](link_item_7693) rune into your [spellbook](link_item_7799) to strengthen your tomes, using the same process as transferring a rune. The rune takes the form of a specialized diagram in your spellbook, occupying one page. The rune’s benefits apply to any one tome in your possession chosen during your daily preparations. If your [spellbook](link_item_7799) leaves your possession, the rune-granting benefit is suppressed until you get the book back.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"after":{"id":22570,"cost":null,"name":"Raise a Tome","type":"feat","uuid":"8590994598803053","level":1,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2940],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=9046","book":"Impossible Magic","page":"17"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:54:26.393942+00:00","operations":[{"id":"35c43a36-d6d1-47ef-be39-8233d659945d","data":{"id":19750,"text":"**Raise a Tome** When you Raise a Shield, you can raise a book you’re wielding instead of a shield. While you have a book raised, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and a +1 circumstance bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) checks to identify creatures using a skill related to the subject of the book (Arcana if you’re using your [spellbook](link_item_7799)). If consulting the book normally grants an item bonus to the check for consulting the book, you gain this bonus as well.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"2e81708a-7c04-41f8-8067-b4f40a6759bd","data":{"id":20534,"text":"**Raise a Tome** You can use a raised tome for this feat as though it were a shield. The tome has Hardness 3, HP 12, and BT 6, and can benefit from the [reinforcing](link_item_7693) rune.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"You can flip open a book to simultaneously study and deflect attacks. When you [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750), you can raise a book you’re wielding instead of a shield. While you have a book raised, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC and a +1 circumstance bonus to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) checks to identify creatures using a skill related to the subject of the book (Arcana if you’re using your [spellbook](link_item_7799)). If consulting the book normally grants an item bonus to the check for consulting the book, you gain this bonus as well.\n\nIf you have [Shield Block](link_feat_20534), you can use a raised tome for that feat as though it were a shield. The tome has Hardness 3, HP 12, and BT 6.\n\nIn addition, you can inscribe the [reinforcing](link_item_7693) rune into your [spellbook](link_item_7799) to strengthen your tomes, using the same process as transferring a rune. The rune takes the form of a specialized diagram in your spellbook, occupying one page. The rune’s benefits apply to any one tome in your possession chosen during your daily preparations. If your [spellbook](link_item_7799) leaves your possession, the rune-granting benefit is suppressed until you get the book back.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22634,"type":"feat","before":{"id":22634,"cost":null,"name":"Vibration Sense","type":"feat","uuid":"3471683797733760","level":4,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2943,2939],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=9243","book":"Impossible Magic","page":"81"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:55:12.238288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Your eidolon gains [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) as an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet. If [aquatic](link_trait_2429), it gains [wavesense](link_sense_21167) as an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet instead. If [amphibious](link_trait_2416), it gains both.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"after":{"id":22634,"cost":null,"name":"Vibration Sense","type":"feat","uuid":"3471683797733760","level":4,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2943,2939],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=9243","book":"Impossible Magic","page":"81"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-04-20T06:55:12.238288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Your eidolon gains [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) as an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet. If [aquatic](link_trait_2429), it gains [wavesense](link_sense_21167) as an imprecise sense with a range of 30 feet instead. If [amphibious](link_trait_2416), it gains both.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22879,"type":"sense","before":{"id":22879,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (precise 30 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"8415977977395588","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-04-20T19:54:42.667317+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1e04f745-f127-4ff1-a75c-710538bd8c6d","data":{"value":"motion sense, 30","variable":"SENSES_PRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":22879,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (precise 30 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"8415977977395588","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-04-20T19:54:42.667317+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1e04f745-f127-4ff1-a75c-710538bd8c6d","data":{"value":"motion sense, 30","variable":"SENSES_PRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22880,"type":"sense","before":{"id":22880,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (precise 20 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"3753339000371058","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-04-20T19:56:06.541443+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1e04f745-f127-4ff1-a75c-710538bd8c6d","data":{"value":"motion sense, 20","variable":"SENSES_PRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":22880,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (precise 20 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"3753339000371058","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-04-20T19:56:06.541443+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1e04f745-f127-4ff1-a75c-710538bd8c6d","data":{"value":"motion sense, 20","variable":"SENSES_PRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":22881,"type":"sens