ry\n\nYou gain the [Fascinating Performance](link_feat_20141) skill feat while wearing or wielding the [relic](link_trait_3460), even if you don't meet its prerequisites. If you critically succeed against an observer, that target doesn't become temporarily immune to this effect.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28850,"type":"feat","before":{"id":28850,"cost":"","name":"Inspiring","type":"feat","uuid":"2828952392808294","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,1486,1448,3483,3479,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=86","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T07:25:37.169226+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou create a vision of a token you could have crafted or make a short performance to inspire an ally within 60 feet. This otherwise works as the *[uplifting overture](link_spell_4923)* cantrip.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":28850,"cost":"","name":"Inspiring","type":"feat","uuid":"2828952392808294","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,1486,1448,3483,3479,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=86","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T07:25:37.169226+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou create a vision of a token you could have crafted or make a short performance to inspire an ally within 60 feet. This otherwise works as the *[uplifting overture](link_spell_4923)* cantrip.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"c