3460) is 17th level."}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) guides you in your art like a muse, giving you inspirational ideas and providing an item bonus to Crafting or Performance checks. (Choose one. If your [relic](link_trait_3460) allows you to do so, you can take this gift again to choose the other.) If the [relic](link_trait_3460) is 3rd level or higher, you gain a +1 item bonus. Once the [relic](link_trait_3460) attains 9th level, the bonus increases to +2. The bonus increases to +3 when the [relic](link_trait_3460) is 17th level.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":["The relic is 3rd level or higher"],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28852,"type":"feat","before":{"id":28852,"cost":"","name":"Charming","type":"feat","uuid":"7679797036646273","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,1469,1486,1481,1448,1432,3483,3480],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=88","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T07:59:30.062082+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou speak briefly about your craft or enact a short performance. The [relic](link_trait_3460) [casts](link_action_19611) [_charm_](link_spell_4516) at a rank equal to half its own level.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":28852,"cost":"","name":"Charming","type":"feat","uuid":"7679797036646273","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,1469,1486,1481,1448,1432,3483,3480],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=88","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T07:59:30.062082+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou speak briefly about your craft or enact a short performance. The [relic](link_trait_3460) [casts](link_action_19611) [_charm_](link_spell_4516) at a rank equal to half its own level.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28853,"type":"feat","before":{"id":28853,"cost":"","name":"Enthralling","type":"feat","uuid":"3514075040804793","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1486,3460,1432,3483,3480],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=89","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:01:14.945911+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou speak at length about or demonstrate your craft, or you enact a performance. The [relic](link_trait_3460) [casts](link_action_19611) [_enthrall_](link_spell_4603) at a rank equal to half its own level. If you have legendary proficiency in Crafting or Performance, creatures can't critically succeed on their saves against this spell. You can use [Sustain an Activation](link_action_19858) to [sustain](link_action_19858) the effect as you would the spell.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":28853,"cost":"","name":"Enthralling","type":"feat","uuid":"3514075040804793","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1486,3460,1432,3483,3480],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=89","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:01:14.945911+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYou speak at length about or demonstrate your craft, or you enact a performance. The [relic](link_trait_3460) [casts](link_action_19611) [_enthrall_](link_spell_4603) at a rank equal to half its own level. If you have legendary proficiency in Crafting or Performance, creatures can't critically succeed on their saves against this spell. You can use [Sustain an Activation](link_action_19858) to [sustain](link_action_19858) the effect as you would the spell.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28854,"type":"feat","before":{"id":28854,"cost":"","name":"Artistic Perfection","type":"feat","uuid":"1671354273411565","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3483,3481],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=90","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:02:52.804477+00:00","operations":[{"id":"13693d3c-4574-4c45-9324-31b4c1792a9e","data":{"title":"Select an Artistic Perfection","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"befae4c8-5729-4f47-92ba-89e166e2a686","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Crafting","operations":[{"id":"285a2d7a-346c-4a7a-a463-d9f00eb6f97a","data":{"text":"If you succeed at a check, you get a critical success instead.","variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"If you succeed at a Crafting check, you get a critical success instead."},{"id":"2529729e-38e7-49c7-9005-45618551d20c","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Performance","operations":[{"id":"e371932d-c813-44f7-87c7-da65a32c276c","data":{"text":"If you succeed at a check, you get a critical success instead.","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"If you succeed at a Performance check, you get a critical success instead."}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) enhances your skill with Crafting or Performance. (Choose one.) If you succeed at a check with the chosen skill, you get a critical success instead.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":28854,"cost":"","name":"Artistic Perfection","type":"feat","uuid":"1671354273411565","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3483,3481],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=90","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:02:52.804477+00:00","operations":[{"id":"13693d3c-4574-4c45-9324-31b4c1792a9e","data":{"title":"Select an Artistic Perfection","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"befae4c8-5729-4f47-92ba-89e166e2a686","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Crafting","operations":[{"id":"285a2d7a-346c-4a7a-a463-d9f00eb6f97a","data":{"text":"If you succeed at a check, you get a critical success instead.","variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"If you succeed at a Crafting check, you get a critical success instead."},{"id":"2529729e-38e7-49c7-9005-45618551d20c","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Performance","operations":[{"id":"e371932d-c813-44f7-87c7-da65a32c276c","data":{"text":"If you succeed at a check, you get a critical success instead.","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"If you succeed at a Performance check, you get a critical success instead."}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** artistry\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) enhances your skill with Crafting or Performance. (Choose one.) If you succeed at a check with the chosen skill, you get a critical success instead.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28856,"type":"sense","before":{"id":28856,"cost":"","name":"Scent (imprecise 10 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"87529836275882","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:05:26.267819+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1f2f3138-21d5-4ffd-baea-a18932cc9e9b","data":{"text":"whenever you’re trying to locate an undetected creature that is within the range of your scent","type":"circumstance","value":2,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"2f91cffb-a257-4efa-97ef-cc0adbafb02a","data":{"value":"scent, 10","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can use your sense of smell to determine the location of a creature. The GM will usually double the range if you’re downwind from the creature or halve the range if you’re upwind.\n\nIn addition, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks whenever you’re trying to locate an undetected creature that is within the range of your scent.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":28856,"cost":"","name":"Scent (imprecise 10 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"87529836275882","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-05T08:05:26.267819+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1f2f3138-21d5-4ffd-baea-a18932cc9e9b","data":{"text":"whenever you’re trying to locate an undetected creature that is within the range of your scent","type":"circumstance","value":2,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"2f91cffb-a257-4efa-97ef-cc0adbafb02a","data":{"value":"scent, 10","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can use your sense of smell to determine the location of a creature. The GM will usually double the range if you’re downwind from the creature or halve the range if you’re upwind.\n\nIn addition, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks whenever you’re trying to locate an undetected creature that is within the range of your scent.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":28884,"type":"physical-feature","before":{"id":28884,"cost":"","name":"Telepathy","type":"physical-feature","uuid":"7747103247218751","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1504,1448],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/MonsterAbilities.aspx?ID=79","book":"Monster Core","page":"360"}},"created_at":"2024-06-05T21:26:59.355322+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A monster with telepathy can communicate mentally with any creatures within the listed radius, as long as they share a language. This doesn't give any special access to their thoughts and communicates no more information than normal speech would.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":8},"after":{"id":28884,"cost":"","name":"Telepathy","type":"physical-feature","uuid":"7747103247218751","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1504,1448],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/MonsterAbilities.aspx?ID=79","book":"Monster Core","page":"360"}},"created_at":"2024-06-05T21:26:59.355322+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A monster with telepathy can communicate mentally with any creatures within the listed radius, as long as they share a language. This doesn't give any special access to their thoughts and communicates no more information than normal speech would.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":8},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29219,"type":"sense","before":{"id":29219,"cost":"","name":"Tremorsense (Imprecise 5 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"4145938929502227","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-10T16:51:56.849539+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f4176d1c-172b-44d3-921a-0abcc10b9116","data":{"value":"tremorsense, 5","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can feel the vibrations through a solid surface caused by movement. This functions only if you are on the same surface as the subject you're detecting, and only if the subject is moving along (or burrowing through) the surface.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":29219,"cost":"","name":"Tremorsense (Imprecise 5 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"4145938929502227","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-10T16:51:56.849539+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f4176d1c-172b-44d3-921a-0abcc10b9116","data":{"value":"tremorsense, 5","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can feel the vibrations through a solid surface caused by movement. This functions only if you are on the same surface as the subject you're detecting, and only if the subject is moving along (or burrowing through) the surface.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29457,"type":"sense","before":{"id":29457,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (imprecise 30 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"1391285324658127","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-14T01:51:38.884447+00:00","operations":[{"id":"19f2d4a9-0d3f-482e-81a9-3fa9f4531309","data":{"value":"motion sense, 30","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":18},"after":{"id":29457,"cost":"","name":"Motion Sense (imprecise 30 ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"1391285324658127","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-06-14T01:51:38.884447+00:00","operations":[{"id":"19f2d4a9-0d3f-482e-81a9-3fa9f4531309","data":{"value":"motion sense, 30","variable":"SENSES_IMPRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can sense nearby motion through vibration and air movement.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":18},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29511,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29511,"cost":"","name":"Dominant Emotion","type":"feat","uuid":"5447874288203188","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You would be adversely affected by an emotion effect","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=91","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:38:06.42136+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) tries to neutralize the triggering effect with its own emotion, attempting a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, you feel a sudden rush of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion and the [counteracted](link_action_27519) effect doesn't take hold of you.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29511,"cost":"","name":"Dominant Emotion","type":"feat","uuid":"5447874288203188","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You would be adversely affected by an emotion effect","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=91","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"198"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:38:06.42136+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) tries to neutralize the triggering effect with its own emotion, attempting a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, you feel a sudden rush of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion and the [counteracted](link_action_27519) effect doesn't take hold of you.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29512,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29512,"cost":"","name":"Emotion Surge","type":"feat","uuid":"7651757392697633","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=92","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:39:07.73405+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nA surge of emotion emanates from your [relic](link_trait_3460), granting a +1 status bonus to skill checks determined by the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion. This bonus lasts for 1 minute.\n\n**Anger** Athletics checks\n\n**Awe** Performance checks\n\n**Dedication** Checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753)\n\n**Fear** Stealth checks\n\n**Hatred** Intimidation checks\n\n**Joy** Diplomacy checks\n\n**Love** Medicine checks\n\n**Misery** Survival checks\n\n**Pride** Society checks\n\n**Remorse** Deception checks","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29512,"cost":"","name":"Emotion Surge","type":"feat","uuid":"7651757392697633","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=92","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:39:07.73405+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nA surge of emotion emanates from your [relic](link_trait_3460), granting a +1 status bonus to skill checks determined by the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion. This bonus lasts for 1 minute.\n\n**Anger** Athletics checks\n\n**Awe** Performance checks\n\n**Dedication** Checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753)\n\n**Fear** Stealth checks\n\n**Hatred** Intimidation checks\n\n**Joy** Diplomacy checks\n\n**Love** Medicine checks\n\n**Misery** Survival checks\n\n**Pride** Society checks\n\n**Remorse** Deception checks","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29513,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29513,"cost":"","name":"Fervor","type":"feat","uuid":"1690381693754808","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=93","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:40:03.178202+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nYou gain the emotional fervor benefits for your [relic's](link_trait_3460) [emotional state](link_feat_22493) for the next 3 rounds, but ignore the spell associated with the fervor. The feeling wears off quickly, so you experience no emotional fallout.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29513,"cost":"","name":"Fervor","type":"feat","uuid":"1690381693754808","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3479,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=93","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:40:03.178202+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nYou gain the emotional fervor benefits for your [relic's](link_trait_3460) [emotional state](link_feat_22493) for the next 3 rounds, but ignore the spell associated with the fervor. The feeling wears off quickly, so you experience no emotional fallout.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29514,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29514,"cost":"","name":"Emotion Conduit","type":"feat","uuid":"2738330996483994","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3480,1486,1448,1432,1433],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=94","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:40:59.091152+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nYou channel your [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion at a target within 30 feet, overpowering an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect on that creature. The [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, the target feels a sudden rush of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion, and the [counteracted](link_action_27519) effect ends on the target. The target is temporarily immune to your [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion conduit until you make your next daily preparations.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29514,"cost":"","name":"Emotion Conduit","type":"feat","uuid":"2738330996483994","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3480,1486,1448,1432,1433],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=94","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:40:59.091152+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nYou channel your [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion at a target within 30 feet, overpowering an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect on that creature. The [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, the target feels a sudden rush of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion, and the [counteracted](link_action_27519) effect ends on the target. The target is temporarily immune to your [relic's](link_trait_3460) emotion conduit until you make your next daily preparations.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29515,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29515,"cost":"","name":"Fervent Spell","type":"feat","uuid":"1452394365003138","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3480,1486,1448],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=95","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:42:05.753328+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ba2ad9c1-aabc-48f9-80f3-e81b190f7eb9","data":{"id":29513,"text":"**Fervent Spell** You have access to the spell provided by the emotional state, which you can [cast](link_action_19611) using your own spell slots. You also have access to the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The [relic](link_trait_3460) [Casts the Spell](link_action_19611) associated with its [emotional fervor](link_feat_22493) at the spell's lowest rank.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nWhile the [relic's](link_trait_3460) [fervor](link_feat_29513) gift lasts, you have access to the spell provided by the emotional state, which you can [cast](link_action_19611) using your own spell slots. You also have access to the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The [relic](link_trait_3460) [Casts the Spell](link_action_19611) associated with its [emotional fervor](link_feat_22493) at the spell's lowest rank.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":["fervor gift"],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29515,"cost":"","name":"Fervent Spell","type":"feat","uuid":"1452394365003138","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3480,1486,1448],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=95","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:42:05.753328+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ba2ad9c1-aabc-48f9-80f3-e81b190f7eb9","data":{"id":29513,"text":"**Fervent Spell** You have access to the spell provided by the emotional state, which you can [cast](link_action_19611) using your own spell slots. You also have access to the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The [relic](link_trait_3460) [Casts the Spell](link_action_19611) associated with its [emotional fervor](link_feat_22493) at the spell's lowest rank.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nWhile the [relic's](link_trait_3460) [fervor](link_feat_29513) gift lasts, you have access to the spell provided by the emotional state, which you can [cast](link_action_19611) using your own spell slots. You also have access to the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The [relic](link_trait_3460) [Casts the Spell](link_action_19611) associated with its [emotional fervor](link_feat_22493) at the spell's lowest rank.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":["fervor gift"],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29516,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29516,"cost":"","name":"Quickening Emotion","type":"feat","uuid":"3909611631486044","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3481,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You are the target of an emotion effect from a hostile source","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=96","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:42:52.380048+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, the [relic](link_trait_3460) absorbs the effect completely, negating it. Instead, you're quickened for up to 1 minute, but no longer than the triggering effect's duration. You then become temporarily immune to this effect for 1 hour.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29516,"cost":"","name":"Quickening Emotion","type":"feat","uuid":"3909611631486044","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3489,3481,1486,1448,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You are the target of an emotion effect from a hostile source","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=96","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:42:52.380048+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** emotion\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check. If the check succeeds, the [relic](link_trait_3460) absorbs the effect completely, negating it. Instead, you're quickened for up to 1 minute, but no longer than the triggering effect's duration. You then become temporarily immune to this effect for 1 hour.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29519,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29519,"cost":"","name":"Little Helper","type":"feat","uuid":"5131880897093585","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3490,3479,1846],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=156","book":"GM Core","page":"313"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:46:44.396217+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** fiend\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) awakens to sapience, developing a personality (usually one that clashes with your own). Your [relic](link_trait_3460) has a personality corresponding to the type of [fiend](link_trait_2415) associated with the item, the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait, [precise vision](link_sense_20776) and [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) each out to 30 feet, the ability to understand and speak one language you know, and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers of +0. Your item's total Perception and Will modifiers are equal to your proficiency modifiers in Perception and Will, respectively. It's trained in the Lore associated with its [fiend](link_trait_2415) type (such as Demon Lore), for a total modifier of 2 + the [relic's](link_trait_3460) level. Unlike most intelligent items, the [relic](link_trait_3460) has no actions or reactions and can't use any of its own activations.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":7},"after":{"id":29519,"cost":"","name":"Little Helper","type":"feat","uuid":"5131880897093585","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3490,3479,1846],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=156","book":"GM Core","page":"313"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:46:44.396217+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** fiend\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) awakens to sapience, developing a personality (usually one that clashes with your own). Your [relic](link_trait_3460) has a personality corresponding to the type of [fiend](link_trait_2415) associated with the item, the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait, [precise vision](link_sense_20776) and [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) each out to 30 feet, the ability to understand and speak one language you know, and Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers of +0. Your item's total Perception and Will modifiers are equal to your proficiency modifiers in Perception and Will, respectively. It's trained in the Lore associated with its [fiend](link_trait_2415) type (such as Demon Lore), for a total modifier of 2 + the [relic's](link_trait_3460) level. Unlike most intelligent items, the [relic](link_trait_3460) has no actions or reactions and can't use any of its own activations.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":7},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29520,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29520,"cost":"","name":"Fiendish Bargain","type":"feat","uuid":"513399317765363","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3490,3480,1846,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=157","book":"GM Core","page":"313"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:47:51.99941+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** fiend\n\nYou bargain with the evil force empowering your [relic](link_trait_3460) for a boon, though you must trade something in return. Select one of the following benefits to gain.\n\n*   Your [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) a harmful condition affecting you.\n    \n*   You regain 3d8+16 Hit Points. This is a [healing](link_trait_1442) effect.\n    \n*   You gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls for 1 minute.\n    \n\nOne of the following randomly determined effects occurs to you in payment, after applying the benefit.\n\n*   You are stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\n    \n*   You are clumsy 1 for 1 minute.\n    \n*   You lose 1d8 Hit Points.\n    \n*   You take a –1 penalty to damage rolls for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":7},"after":{"id":29520,"cost":"","name":"Fiendish Bargain","type":"feat","uuid":"513399317765363","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3490,3480,1846,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=157","book":"GM Core","page":"313"}},"created_at":"2024-06-15T07:47:51.99941+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** fiend\n\nYou bargain with the evil force empowering your [relic](link_trait_3460) for a boon, though you must trade something in return. Select one of the following benefits to gain.\n\n*   Your [relic](link_trait_3460) attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) a harmful condition affecting you.\n    \n*   You regain 3d8+16 Hit Points. This is a [healing](link_trait_1442) effect.\n    \n*   You gain a +2 status bonus to attack rolls for 1 minute.\n    \n\nOne of the following randomly determined effects occurs to you in payment, after applying the benefit.\n\n*   You are stupefied 1 for 1 minute.\n    \n*   You are clumsy 1 for 1 minute.\n    \n*   You lose 1d8 Hit Points.\n    \n*   You take a –1 penalty to damage rolls for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":7},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29688,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29688,"cost":"","name":"Intelligent Relic","type":"feat","uuid":"3638174940965762","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3493,3479,1613],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=109","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"200"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:34:25.34656+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** intelligent relic\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) becomes an [intelligent](link_trait_1613) item. The [relic](link_trait_3460) possesses [precise sight](link_sense_20776) at a range of 30 feet and [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) at a range of 30 feet. It is trained in Perception, increasing its proficiency when you increase yours. Choose whether it can speak aloud or communicate with you [telepathically](link_physical-feature_28884). It knows languages fitting its backstory, usually from among those you know.\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) is also trained in three skills, increasing one skill's proficiency each time the [relic](link_trait_3460) gains a new gift. Your [relic's](link_trait_3460) mental attribute modifiers begin at +3, +2, and +1, arranged as you choose. The [relic](link_trait_3460) is also trained in Will saves, and its proficiency increases as yours does. Each time you gain a new gift, increase one of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) mental attribute modifiers by 1. The [relic](link_trait_3460) otherwise functions as normal for an [intelligent](link_trait_1613) item.\n\nIf you’re sanctified to [holy](link_trait_1630) or to [unholy](link_trait_1846), you can choose to have your [relic](link_trait_3460) sanctified in the same way.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29688,"cost":"","name":"Intelligent Relic","type":"feat","uuid":"3638174940965762","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3493,3479,1613],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=109","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"200"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:34:25.34656+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** intelligent relic\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) becomes an [intelligent](link_trait_1613) item. The [relic](link_trait_3460) possesses [precise sight](link_sense_20776) at a range of 30 feet and [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) at a range of 30 feet. It is trained in Perception, increasing its proficiency when you increase yours. Choose whether it can speak aloud or communicate with you [telepathically](link_physical-feature_28884). It knows languages fitting its backstory, usually from among those you know.\n\nThe [relic](link_trait_3460) is also trained in three skills, increasing one skill's proficiency each time the [relic](link_trait_3460) gains a new gift. Your [relic's](link_trait_3460) mental attribute modifiers begin at +3, +2, and +1, arranged as you choose. The [relic](link_trait_3460) is also trained in Will saves, and its proficiency increases as yours does. Each time you gain a new gift, increase one of the [relic's](link_trait_3460) mental attribute modifiers by 1. The [relic](link_trait_3460) otherwise functions as normal for an [intelligent](link_trait_1613) item.\n\nIf you’re sanctified to [holy](link_trait_1630) or to [unholy](link_trait_1846), you can choose to have your [relic](link_trait_3460) sanctified in the same way.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29695,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29695,"cost":"","name":"Beginner's Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"5882971470994964","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a d20 roll you're untrained in","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=97","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:43:21.829559+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou treat your proficiency bonus as equal to half your level, or if the [relic](link_trait_3460) is 7th level or higher, as equal to your level. Then, roll twice, taking the better of the two results. This doesn't allow you to use a skill's trained actions.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29695,"cost":"","name":"Beginner's Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"5882971470994964","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a d20 roll you're untrained in","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=97","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:43:21.829559+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou treat your proficiency bonus as equal to half your level, or if the [relic](link_trait_3460) is 7th level or higher, as equal to your level. Then, roll twice, taking the better of the two results. This doesn't allow you to use a skill's trained actions.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29696,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29696,"cost":"","name":"Swap Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"1981134791002842","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You roll a failure or critical failure on a saving throw against an effect with multiple targets","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=98","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:44:24.3248+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou swap rolls with another target who's willing to swap with you. Each of you determines the new results with your new rolls.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29696,"cost":"","name":"Swap Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"1981134791002842","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You roll a failure or critical failure on a saving throw against an effect with multiple targets","version":null,"frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=98","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:44:24.3248+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou swap rolls with another target who's willing to swap with you. Each of you determines the new results with your new rolls.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29697,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29697,"cost":"","name":"Whammy","type":"feat","uuid":"141374155119148","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1677,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"An enemy within 30 feet rolls a success on an attack roll, saving throw, or skill check","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=99","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:45:02.042926+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) sends out a wave of bad luck, forcing the creature to reroll and take the worse result.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29697,"cost":"","name":"Whammy","type":"feat","uuid":"141374155119148","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3479,1677,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"An enemy within 30 feet rolls a success on an attack roll, saving throw, or skill check","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=99","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:45:02.042926+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Minor\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYour [relic](link_trait_3460) sends out a wave of bad luck, forcing the creature to reroll and take the worse result.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29698,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29698,"cost":"","name":"Clean Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"3091153423147566","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3480,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a d20 roll affected by a misfortune effect","version":null,"frequency":"once per 10 minutes","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=100","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:45:30.56957+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nNegate the [misfortune](link_trait_1677) effect. Any other [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect still applies.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29698,"cost":"","name":"Clean Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"3091153423147566","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3480,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a d20 roll affected by a misfortune effect","version":null,"frequency":"once per 10 minutes","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=100","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:45:30.56957+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nNegate the [misfortune](link_trait_1677) effect. Any other [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect still applies.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29699,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29699,"cost":"","name":"Steal Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"2819006159929673","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3480,2583,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You or a creature within 30 feet of you rolls two d20s for a fortune or misfortune effect and you like the higher roll","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=101","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:47:18.0765+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou steal the higher of the two numbers the triggering target rolled; the target must use the other result. Until you make your next daily preparations, you can substitute that number for one d20 roll made for a saving throw or skill check you have to make against an effect created by an enemy, hazard, or the environment. Doing so is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. If you fail to do so before your next daily preparations, you lose the stored number.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29699,"cost":"","name":"Steal Luck","type":"feat","uuid":"2819006159929673","level":9,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3480,2583,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You or a creature within 30 feet of you rolls two d20s for a fortune or misfortune effect and you like the higher roll","version":null,"frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=101","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"199"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:47:18.0765+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Major\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou steal the higher of the two numbers the triggering target rolled; the target must use the other result. Until you make your next daily preparations, you can substitute that number for one d20 roll made for a saving throw or skill check you have to make against an effect created by an enemy, hazard, or the environment. Doing so is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. If you fail to do so before your next daily preparations, you lose the stored number.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29700,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29700,"cost":"","name":"Against All Odds","type":"feat","uuid":"2187230208563513","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3481,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a skill check with a DC that is at least 15 higher than your bonus in the skill","version":null,"frequency":"once per 10 minutes","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=102","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"200"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:47:57.367573+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou roll twice and take the better result.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":29700,"cost":"","name":"Against All Odds","type":"feat","uuid":"2187230208563513","level":17,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3495,3481,1460,1432],"actions":"REACTION","special":"","trigger":"You attempt a skill check with a DC that is at least 15 higher than your bonus in the skill","version":null,"frequency":"once per 10 minutes","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=102","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"200"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T09:47:57.367573+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Gift Type** Grand\n\n**Aspect** luck\n\nYou roll twice and take the better result.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":29711,"type":"feat","before":{"id":29711,"cost":"","name":"Repository of Knowledge","type":"feat","uuid":"6603010972105935","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3460,3497,3479,1448],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Relics.aspx?ID=174","book":"GM Core","page":"316"}},"created_at":"2024-06-19T10:01:47.074426+00:00","operations":[{"id":"e459fa40-1fdf-486d-be71-2973d37246be","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"2513c96b-2807-449f-99cd-a2fb93886440","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":3},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":9,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"8bffc37b-eb2e-47e2-ac49-3ef1328ecf43","data":{"title":"Select a Lore","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"52766bc8-719b-4e58-a20b-602010b9f48c","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ADD-LORE","value":{"value":"T"}},"optionsPredefined":[],"selectionAliases":["12b99a0e-78fe-4f25-bd69-2d5f48b94953","e907bb08-1951-4c07-92ef-dadb4303be3c"]},"type":"select"},{"id":"70fed59d-09e9-4ad0-a