+00:00","operations":null,"description":"You can perform simple Interact actions with your tail, such as opening an unlocked door. Your tail can't perform actions that require fingers or significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check to accomplish, and you can't use it to hold items.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":32789,"type":"feat","before":{"id":32789,"cost":null,"name":"Snare Crafting","type":"feat","uuid":"6240052694357294","level":1,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1437,1438],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=6506","book":"Player Core 2","page":"234"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-08-08T18:43:36.454348+00:00","operations":null,"description":"You can use the [Craft](link_action_19617) activity to create [snares](link_trait_1540). When you select this feat, you add the formulas for four common 1st-level [snares](link_trait_1540) to your [formula book](link_item_6972).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["trained in Crafting"],"content_source_id":256},"after":{"id":32789,"cost":null,"name":"Snare Crafting","type":"feat","uuid":"6240052694357294","level":1,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1437,1438],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=6506","book":"Player Core 2","page":"234"},"foundry":{"rules":[]}},"created_at":"2024-08-08T18:43:36.454348+00:00","operations":null,"description":"You can use the [Craft](link_action_19617) activity to create [snares](link_trait_1540). When you select this feat, you add the formulas for four common 1st-level [snares](link_trait_1540) to your [formula book](link_item_6972).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["trained in Crafting"],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":32847,"type":"feat","before":{"id":32847,"cost":null,"name":"Surprise Attack","type":"feat","uuid":"6407825821812433","level":4,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3762],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=6259","book":"Player Core 2","page":"186"},"foundry":{"rules":[{"key":"EphemeralEffect","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard","predicate":["encounter:round:1",{"lt":["self:participant:initiative:rank","target:participant:initiative:rank"]},{"or":["self:participant:initiative:stat:deception","self:participant:initiative:stat:stealth"]}],"selectors":["strike-attack-roll","spell-attack-roll","strike-damage","attack-spell-damage"]}]}},"created_at":"2024-08-08T18:44:11.216362+00:00","operations":null,"description":"You act before foes can react. On the first round of combat, if you roll Deception or Stealth for initiative, creatures that haven't acted are off-guard to you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["Assassin Dedication"],"content_source_id":256},"after":{"id":32847,"cost":null,"name":"Surprise Attack","type":"feat","uuid":"6407825821812433","level":4,"access":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3762],"actions":null,"special":null,"trigger":null,"version":null,"frequency":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Feats.aspx?ID=6259","book":"Player Core 2","page":"186"},"foundry":{"rules":[{"key":"EphemeralEffect","uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Off-Guard","predicate":["encounter:round:1",{"lt":["self:participant:initiative:rank","target:participant:initiative:rank"]},{"or":["self:participant:initiative:stat:deception","self:participant:initiative:stat:stealth"]}],"selectors":["strike-attack-roll","spell-attack-roll","strike-damage","attack-spell-damage"]}]}},"created_at":"2024-08-08T18:44:11.216362+00:00","operations":null,"description":"You act before foes can react. On the first round of combat, if you roll Deception or Stealth for initiative, creatures that haven't acted are off-guard to you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"prerequisites":["Assassin Dedication"],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":32986,"type":"feat","before":{"id":32986,"cost":"","name":"Chirurgeon Research Field","type":"feat","uuid":"7496645061910116","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3855],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-08-08T21:13:21.465375+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ac175e74-731b-47d4-b411-aab3bcc8a9d6","data":{"id":15516,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"792932c1-e113-4259-b56f-b8213a314c7f","data":{"id":15517,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"c69179d7-5930-49a8-81d9-b09aad22665e","data":{"id":15518,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"6aa56d8f-049a-4985-9949-98b5e6beb1be","data":{"id":15519,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"8f200e36-ef0d-4202-bac0-b90437f89afa","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"99903699-0c53-4ce8-8a4d-09f4aee6c7f0","data":{"name":"CLASS_FEATURE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":[]},"name":"CLASS_FEATURE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":"advanced vials","operator":"INCLUDES"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"1f883fcb-cf5d-4a05-a97c-e18ff944d811","data":{"id":15516,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"4bef8f2e-1c89-4662-977b-a49c9ec4db86","data":{"id":15517,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"56d05f54-c036-4b10-a2a3-b4766154a7a2","data":{"id":15518,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"e62be7b9-cb47-42d1-9e4a-59a4774534fa","data":{"id":15519,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"You concentrate on healing others with alchemy.\n\n**Formulas** Two common 1st-level [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [elixirs](link_trait_1553) with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait (like [lesser antidote](link_item_6705), [lesser antiplague](link_item_6711), or [minor elixir of life](link_item_6905)).\n\n**Field Benefit** You can use your proficiency rank in Crafting for anything that requires a proficiency rank in Medicine (such as prerequisites) and use your Crafting modifier in place of your Medicine modifier for all Medicine checks.\n\n**Field Vials** Your [versatile vials](link_item_15516) can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.\n\n**Field Discovery (5th)** Your medicinal [elixirs](link_trait_1553) are quite fortifying. When a creature drinks an [infused](link_trait_3540) [elixir](link_trait_1553) with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait that you have created, that creature gains a number of temporary Hit Points equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum 0); these temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.\n\n**Advanced Vials (11th)** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.\n\n**Greater Field Discovery (13th)** When you use [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176) to create any type of [minor elixir of life](link_item_6905), the creature healed by the item regains the maximum Hit Points possible, instead of rolling to determine the number of Hit Points regained.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"after":{"id":32986,"cost":"","name":"Chirurgeon Research Field","type":"feat","uuid":"7496645061910116","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3855],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-08-08T21:13:21.465375+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ac175e74-731b-47d4-b411-aab3bcc8a9d6","data":{"id":15516,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"792932c1-e113-4259-b56f-b8213a314c7f","data":{"id":15517,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"c69179d7-5930-49a8-81d9-b09aad22665e","data":{"id":15518,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"6aa56d8f-049a-4985-9949-98b5e6beb1be","data":{"id":15519,"text":"**Field Vials** Your versatile vials can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"8f200e36-ef0d-4202-bac0-b90437f89afa","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"99903699-0c53-4ce8-8a4d-09f4aee6c7f0","data":{"name":"CLASS_FEATURE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":[]},"name":"CLASS_FEATURE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":"advanced vials","operator":"INCLUDES"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"1f883fcb-cf5d-4a05-a97c-e18ff944d811","data":{"id":15516,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"4bef8f2e-1c89-4662-977b-a49c9ec4db86","data":{"id":15517,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"56d05f54-c036-4b10-a2a3-b4766154a7a2","data":{"id":15518,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"e62be7b9-cb47-42d1-9e4a-59a4774534fa","data":{"id":15519,"text":"**Advanced Vials** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.","type":"item"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"You concentrate on healing others with alchemy.\n\n**Formulas** Two common 1st-level [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [elixirs](link_trait_1553) with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait (like [lesser antidote](link_item_6705), [lesser antiplague](link_item_6711), or [minor elixir of life](link_item_6905)).\n\n**Field Benefit** You can use your proficiency rank in Crafting for anything that requires a proficiency rank in Medicine (such as prerequisites) and use your Crafting modifier in place of your Medicine modifier for all Medicine checks.\n\n**Field Vials** Your [versatile vials](link_item_15516) can be used to heal a living creature a number of Hit Points equal to the vial’s initial damage. A creature can drink the vial for this benefit, or you can throw the vial at a willing creature within 20 feet as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to heal that creature. In either case, a vial used this way loses the [acid](link_trait_1528) and [splash](link_trait_1532) traits and gains the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) and [healing](link_trait_1442) traits, plus the [elixir](link_trait_1553) trait if a creature drinks it.\n\n**Field Discovery (5th)** Your medicinal [elixirs](link_trait_1553) are quite fortifying. When a creature drinks an [infused](link_trait_3540) [elixir](link_trait_1553) with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait that you have created, that creature gains a number of temporary Hit Points equal to your Intelligence modifier (minimum 0); these temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.\n\n**Advanced Vials (11th)** When you use a field vial to heal a creature that has half its maximum Hit Points or fewer, the [coagulant](link_trait_3658) trait doesn’t apply to that healing.\n\n**Greater Field Discovery (13th)** When you use [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176) to create any type of [minor elixir of life](link_item_6905), the creature healed by the item regains the maximum Hit Points possible, instead of rolling to determine the number of Hit Points regained.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":33008,"type":"feat","before":{"id":33008,"cost":"","name":"Devise a Stratagem","type":"feat","uuid":"4027929909543007","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3629,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per round","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-08-09T00:02:41.266135+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You assess a foe’s weaknesses in combat and use them to formulate a plan of attack. Choose a creature you can see. You can Devise a Stratagem as a free action if you’re aware that creature could help answer the question at the heart of one of your active investigations. Roll a d20, then decide on an attack stratagem or skill stratagem.\n\n**Attack Stratagem** If you [Strike](link_action_19856) the chosen creature before the start of your next turn, your [Strike](link_action_19856) gains the fortune trait and you must use the result of the d20 roll for your [Strike's](link_action_19856) attack roll instead of rolling. You make this substitution only for the first [Strike](link_action_19856) you make against the creature this round, not any subsequent ones. When you make this substitution, you can add your Intelligence modifier to your attack roll instead of your Strength or Dexterity modifier. If you [Strike](link_action_19856) with an melee weapon, melee [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack, or thrown weapon, it must have the [agile](link_trait_1569) or [finesse](link_trait_1570) trait to benefit from the substitution.\n\n**Skill Stratagem** You can’t attempt to [Strike](link_action_19856) the target until the start of your next turn. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next Intelligence-, Wisdom-, or Charisma-based skill check or Perception check involving the target before the start of your next turn. If you would gain your [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995) investigation bonus to such a check, that bonus increases by 1 instead of you gaining the +1 bonus listed.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"after":{"id":33008,"cost":"","name":"Devise a Stratagem","type":"feat","uuid":"4027929909543007","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3629,1432],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"once per round","meta_data":{"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-08-09T00:02:41.266135+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You assess a foe’s weaknesses in combat and use them to formulate a plan of attack. Choose a creature you can see. You can Devise a Stratagem as a free action if you’re aware that creature could help answer the question at the heart of one of your active investigations. Roll a d20, then decide on an attack stratagem or skill stratagem.\n\n**Attack Stratagem** If you [Strike](link_action_19856) the chosen creature before the start of your next turn, your [Strike](link_action_19856) gains the fortune trait and you must use the result of the d20 roll for your [Strike's](link_action_19856) attack roll instead of rolling. You make this substitution only for the first [Strike](link_action_19856) you make against the creature this round, not any subsequent ones. When you make this substitution, you can add your Intelligence modifier to your attack roll instead of your Strength or Dexterity modifier. If you [Strike](link_action_19856) with an melee weapon, melee [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack, or thrown weapon, it must have the [agile](link_trait_1569) or [finesse](link_trait_1570) trait to benefit from the substitution.\n\n**Skill Stratagem** You can’t attempt to [Strike](link_action_19856) the target until the start of your next turn. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to your next Intelligence-, Wisdom-, or Charisma-based skill check or Perception check involving the target before the start of your next turn. If you would gain your [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995) investigation bonus to such a check, that bonus increases by 1 instead of you gaining the +1 bonus listed.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":33010,"type":"class-feature","before":{"id":33010,"cost":"","name":"Strategic Strike","type":"class-feature","uuid":"550073146528372","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3629],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Classes.aspx?ID=59","book":"Player Core 2","page":"100"}},"created_at":"2024-08-09T00:06:00.390298+00:00","operations":[],"description":"When you strike carefully and with forethought, you deal a telling blow. When making a [Strike](link_action_19856) that adds your Intelligence modifier to your attack roll due to [Devising a Stratagem](link_feat_33008), you deal an additional 1d6 (⬆️ {{ceil(level/4)}}d6) precision damage.\n\nAs your investigator level increases, so too does the deadliness of your strategic strike. Increase the number of dice by one at 5th, 9th, 13th, and 17th levels.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"after":{"id":33010,"cost":"","name":"Strategic Strike","type":"class-feature","uuid":"550073146528372","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3629],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Classes.aspx?ID=59","book":"Player Core 2","page":"100"}},"created_at":"2024-08-09T00:06:00.390298+00:00","operations":[],"description":"When you strike carefully and with forethought, you deal a telling blow. When making a [Strike](link_action_19856) that adds your Intelligence modifier to your attack roll due to [Devising a Stratagem](link_feat_33008), you deal an additional 1d6 (⬆️ {{ceil(level/4)}}d6) precision damage.\n\nAs your investigator level increases, so too does the deadliness of your strategic strike. Increase the number of dice by one at 5th, 9th, 13th, and 17th levels.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":33779,"type":"feat","before":{"id":33779,"cost":"","name":"Draconic Bloodline","type":"feat","uuid":"6671409001245613","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","tra