he battlefield.\n\nWhen you enter [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) stance and at the start of each of your turns while you're in that stance, if you're wielding a melee weapon in two hands, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to half your level (minimum 1 temporary HP).\n\n**Conflux Spell** [thunderous strike](link_spell_5474)\n\n**Studious Spell** 7th: [enlarge](link_spell_4601); 11th: [earthbind](link_spell_4588); 13th [planar tether](link_spell_4773)","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"after":{"id":34421,"cost":"","name":"Inexorable Iron Hybrid Study","type":"feat","uuid":"8762194108040402","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3886],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-08-25T18:36:40.544616+00:00","operations":[{"id":"52c71713-3ff4-494c-8ffb-60311f485ad9","data":{"rank":1,"type":"FOCUS","spellId":5474,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"beb45746-6491-4526-8b2b-d2de054e9ec0","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"d8171fd4-f477-4c1b-be2b-0f1f03d5bb6d","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"7","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"5efeaaf8-7e92-489d-936b-eb2cb915f42c","data":{"rank":2,"type":"NORMAL","spellId":4601,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"1d270bf2-6c44-483d-8ae5-b75456d29e27","data":{"id":4601,"text":"**Studious Spells** When you cast a studious spell, you can use [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) as a free action as your next action this turn.","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"},{"id":"ea2242cc-43b5-41f1-9d7f-798cff521ca9","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"b29a1fdb-2a05-489d-a584-fd77e2a48dfd","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"11","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"b585709b-c55d-475e-89e3-2c86c6aaca2f","data":{"rank":