ng power or keep you standing on the battlefield.\n\nWhen you enter [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) stance and at the start of each of your turns while you're in that stance, if you're wielding a melee weapon in two hands, you gain temporary Hit Points equal to half your level (minimum 1 temporary HP).\n\n**Conflux Spell** [thunderous strike](link_spell_5474)\n\n**Studious Spell** 7th: [enlarge](link_spell_4601); 11th: [earthbind](link_spell_4588); 13th [planar tether](link_spell_4773)","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":34423,"type":"feat","before":{"id":34423,"cost":"","name":"Sparkling Targe Hybrid Study","type":"feat","uuid":"246262325251438","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3886],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-08-25T18:36:43.498345+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f812d0e4-4e01-4767-a9f2-28004b915301","data":{"rank":1,"type":"FOCUS","spellId":5448,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"4c6acdea-cd54-4634-99c8-650b0691d6a9","data":{"type":"feat","abilityBlockId":20534},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"1ed417a6-a61a-44f5-8ab0-b3407ec385d8","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"4222a8dd-5ecd-4ca1-949c-10ca27456dbb","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"7","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"11e8c858-77f6-4bce-aec5-aa090738cace","data":{"rank":2,"type":"NORMAL","spellId":4801,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"5d900d99-db17-409d-8eb3-cc3563ea093b","data":{"id":4801,"text":"**Studious Spells** When you cast a studious spell, you can use [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) as a free action as your next action this turn.","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"},{"id":"8174ec01-7804-4014-85dd-01a7fab7ac7a","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"5346fbbb-b0d9-4a99-9aa7-c73d1fd16657","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"11","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"ae5839b2-3388-4542-95d7-4eb20a9a9a5a","data":{"rank":3,"type":"NORMAL","spellId":5487,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"a4279c46-aaeb-4326-9779-f5535f6261ca","data":{"id":5487,"text":"**Studious Spells** When you cast a studious spell, you can use [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) as a free action as your next action this turn.","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"},{"id":"567fb85c-6c4e-4476-941c-4ccf9d5beb34","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"e60d6a63-4893-4400-9047-f7c617d776f7","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"13","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"65e8668e-45fe-4f1d-a39b-8c6735bc6e54","data":{"rank":4,"type":"NORMAL","spellId":4733,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"00f39b70-db62-4559-8a3b-0e4c1987989f","data":{"id":4733,"text":"**Studious Spells** When you cast a studious spell, you can use [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) as a free action as your next action this turn.","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"}],"falseOperations":[]},"type":"conditional"},{"id":"3b1a69c3-6de9-42b1-8c96-643c90f38530","data":{"id":25594,"text":"**Hybrid Study—Sparkling Targe** When you're in Arcane Cascade stance with your [shield raised](link_action_19750), your circumstance bonus to AC from your shield also applies to your saves against spells and other magical effects. In addition, damage you take as a result of a spell or magical effect while you're in Arcane Cascade can trigger your [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction, even if the damage isn't physical. When blocking damage in this way, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from Arcane Cascade (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"e96f09d8-4f62-4ac2-8d7a-0e2be7db0120","data":{"id":30043,"text":"**Hybrid Study—Sparkling Targe** When you're in Arcane Cascade stance with your [shield raised](link_action_19750), your circumstance bonus to AC from your shield also applies to your saves against spells and other magical effects. In addition, damage you take as a result of a spell or magical effect while you're in Arcane Cascade can trigger your [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction, even if the damage isn't physical. When blocking damage in this way, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from Arcane Cascade (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).","type":"mode"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"You've studied the applications of magic, training yourself to perform not just offensive maneuvers but defensive tactics as well. When magic flows through you, your shield can block impossible things, even a dragon's breath or a [force barrage](link_spell_4630).\n\nYou gain the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) general feat.\n\nWhen you're in [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) stance with your [shield raised](link_action_19750), your circumstance bonus to AC from your shield also applies to your saves against spells and other magical effects. In addition, damage you take as a result of a spell or magical effect while you're in [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) can trigger your [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction, even if the damage isn't physical. When blocking damage in this way, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).\n\n**Conflux Spell** [shielding strike](link_spell_5448)\n\n**Studious Spell** 7th: [resist energy](link_spell_4801); 11th: [warding aggression](link_spell_5487); 13th: [mountain resilience](link_spell_4733)","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"after":{"id":34423,"cost":"","name":"Sparkling Targe Hybrid Study","type":"feat","uuid":"246262325251438","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3886],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-08-25T18:36:43.498345+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f812d0e4-4e01-4767-a9f2-28004b915301","data":{"rank":1,"type":"FOCUS","spellId":5448,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"4c6acdea-cd54-4634-99c8-650b0691d6a9","data":{"type":"feat","abilityBlockId":20534},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"1ed417a6-a61a-44f5-8ab0-b3407ec385d8","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"4222a8dd-5ecd-4ca1-949c-10ca27456dbb","data":{"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":0},"name":"LEVEL","type":"num","value":"7","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"11e8c858-77f6-4bce-aec5-aa090738cace","data":{"rank":2,"type":"NORMAL","spellId":4801,"castingSource":"MAGUS"},"type":"giveSpell"},{"id":"5d900d99-db17-409d-8eb3-cc3563ea093b","data":{"id":4801,"text":"**Studious Spells** When you cast a studious spell, you can use [Arcane Cascade](link_feat_25594) as a free action as your next action this turn.","