, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from Arcane Cascade (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"e96f09d8-4f62-4ac2-8d7a-0e2be7db0120","data":{"id":30043,"text":"**Hybrid Study—Sparkling Targe** When you're in Arcane Cascade stance with your [shield raised](link_action_19750), your circumstance bonus to AC from your shield also applies to your saves against spells and other magical effects. In addition, damage you take as a result of a spell or magical effect while you're in Arcane Cascade can trigger your [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction, even if the damage isn't physical. When blocking damage in this way, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from Arcane Cascade (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).","type":"mode"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"You've studied the applications of magic, training yourself to perform not just offensive maneuvers but defensive tactics as well. When magic flows through you, your shield can block impossible things, even a dragon's breath or a [force barrage](link_spell_4630).\n\nYou gain the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) general feat.\n\nWhen you're in [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) stance with your [shield raised](link_action_19750), your circumstance bonus to AC from your shield also applies to your saves against spells and other magical effects. In addition, damage you take as a result of a spell or magical effect while you're in [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) can trigger your [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction, even if the damage isn't physical. When blocking damage in this way, increase your shield's Hardness by an amount equal to the extra damage from [Arcane Cascade](link_class-feature_25600) (typically 1, but 2 if you have weapon specialization, or 3 if you have greater weapon specialization). These benefits apply whether you're using an actual shield, the [shield](link_spell_4831) spell, or something else that works like a shield (such as a raised tome if you have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat).\n\n**Conflux Spell** [shielding strike](link_spell_5448)\n\n**Studious Spell** 7th: [resist energy](link_spell_4801); 11th: [warding aggression](link_spell_5487); 13th: [mountain resilience](link_spell_4733)","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":842},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ability_block","id":38041,"type":"sense","before":{"id":38041,"cost":"","name":"Tremorsense (Precise 30 Ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"7434581633477877","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":null,"frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"2024-09-27T17:29:52.047443+00:00","operations":[{"id":"c4a48ddb-1966-4421-9eef-85d1358a7753","data":{"value":"tremorsense, 30","variable":"SENSES_PRECISE"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"You can feel the vibrations through a solid surface caused by movement. This functions only if you are on the same surface as the subject you're detecting, and only if the subject is moving along (or burrowing through) the surface.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":38041,"cost":"","name":"Tremorsense (Precise 30 Ft)","type":"sense","uuid":"7434581633477877","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"action