th dominance displays and pushes them around the battlefield. Its proficiency ranks for Athletics and Intimidation increase to expert (or master if it was already expert from its type), its Strength modifier increases by 1, and its Charisma modifier increases by 3."},{"id":"9fd59ada-7b7c-449b-ab36-cdad5c2a4207","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Daredevil","operations":[{"id":"790fc0f9-ef4d-46ba-930d-6de4089b6582","data":{"value":{"value":"M"},"variable":"SKILL_ACROBATICS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"d05c98e9-c61d-408e-bed5-9ccc751a4f56","type":"conditional","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"14c0cd94-78a4-4eb9-9d99-e94119a0655b","name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS","value":"4"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"60b4a237-f04b-4177-af88-f58f3e3776aa","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"8fcdf4b9-4bbe-4982-9f40-d842caa7adaa","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"7a8075d9-34ea-4e3c-a88a-09bd2b0e7ffc","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"}]}},{"id":"feac04b8-7dee-4bb2-95e8-2c641d6013a6","data":{"value":{"value":"E"},"variable":"UNARMORED_DEFENSE"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"9246d78e-bfa0-47fd-9529-e9828c57a7f8","data":{"type":"class-feature","abilityBlockId":21318},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"}],"description":"Your companion joins the fray with graceful leaps and dives. It gains the [deny advantage](link_class-feature_21318) ability, so it isn't off-guard to hidden, undetected, or flanking creatures unless such a creature's level is greater than yours. Its proficiency rank in Acrobatics increases to master, and its Dexterity modifier increases by 1. Its proficiency rank in unarmored defense increases to expert."},{"id":"9583838c-21f6-4a82-b058-aab6246285b8","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Racer","operations":[{"id":"5c0488e4-fdba-4044-ad41-914322c805f1","data":{"title":"Select a Speed","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"9e495429-8f05-4741-b760-90180de05c7c","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Normal","operations":[{"id":"fce8f854-e0ba-4410-9e35-f58e43f4ebf7","data":{"text":"","type":"status","value":"10","variable":"SPEED"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"It gains a +10-foot status bonus to its Speed."},{"id":"8c0ec27f-c59b-4059-8172-a7eef53a983d","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Swim","operations":[{"id":"2ba56611-99b2-48bb-8904-667cf24949c9","data":{"text":"","type":"status","value":"10","variable":"SPEED_SWIM"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"It gains a +10-foot status bonus to its swim Speed."},{"id":"94e5be45-7b09-4e16-a950-1b69ac05afc3","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Fly","operations":[{"id":"278fa249-e8db-4875-b27d-308cbc5d450b","data":{"text":"","type":"status","value":"10","variable":"SPEED_FLY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"It gains a +10-foot status bonus to its fly Speed."}]},"type":"select"},{"id":"eb1db498-3b34-4ceb-8538-0001d2aa8a7e","data":{"value":{"value":"L"},"variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2e9d057a-653e-4a04-8e10-4f1e6c070b65","type":"conditional","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"5790d5b5-37e0-4dd3-bbf5-9d36a993d584","name":"ATTRIBUTE_CON","type":"attr","operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS","value":"4"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"45fcfff6-3537-4902-a563-afca11e049a7","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"839ead40-7e5a-4f4b-8d19-f5a48d150fb9","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"d4dacac7-1456-4fb4-a23c-69b155ff0c4a","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"}]}}],"description":"Your companion races. It gains a +10-foot status bonus to its Speed, swim Speed, or fly Speed (your choice). Its proficiency in Fortitude saves increases to legendary, and its Constitution modifier increases by 1."},{"id":"75f7d039-7200-447e-a08e-65c1c22c6182","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Tracker","operati