 body thrums with the primal vitality of the greatest of the ursine beasts. When in [Ursine Avenger Form](link_feat_26030), you gain fast healing 5.","availability":null,"requirements":"","prerequisites":["Ursine Avenger Form"],"content_source_id":16},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":3,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":3,"name":"Elf","uuid":"6069556547543259","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1348,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=60","book":"Player Core","page":"46"}},"created_at":"2023-12-02T22:15:58.556798+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":6,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":30,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":84},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Empyrean\",\n  \"Fey\",\n  \"Gnomish\",\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Kholo\",\n  \"Orcish\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":19330},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_INT"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"13e39aad-cd73-4b63-ae9b-2f8e5b0c12e3","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-elf-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Elves are a tall, long-lived people with a strong tradition of art and magic._\n\nAs an ancient people, elves have seen great change and have the perspective that can come only from watching the arc of history. After leaving Golarion in ancient times, they returned to a changed land, and they still struggle to reclaim their ancestral homes. Elves value kindness, intellect, and beauty, with many elves striving to improve their manners, appearance, and culture. Their studies delve into a level of detail that most shorter-lived peoples find excessive or inefficient. Elves are often rather private people, steeped in the secrets of their groves and kinship groups. They're slow to build friendships outside their kinsfolk, as elves who spend their lives among shorter-lived peoples often become morose after watching generations of companions age and die. These elves are known as Forlorn among their fellow elves.\n\nIf you want a character who is [magical](link_trait_1504), mystical, and mysterious, you should play an elf.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":3,"name":"Elf","uuid":"6069556547543259","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1348,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=60","book":"Player Core","page":"46"}},"created_at":"2023-12-02T22:15:58.556798+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":6,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":30,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":84},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Empyrean\",\n  \"Fey\",\n  \"Gnomish\",\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Kholo\",\n  \"Orcish\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":19330},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_INT"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"13e39aad-cd73-4b63-ae9b-2f8e5b0c12e3","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-elf-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Elves are a tall, long-lived people with a strong tradition of art and magic._\n\nAs an ancient people, elves have seen great change and have the perspective that can come only from watching the arc of history. After leaving Golarion in ancient times, they returned to a changed land, and they still struggle to reclaim their ancestral homes. Elves value kindness, intellect, and beauty, with many elves striving to improve their manners, appearance, and culture. Their studies delve into a level of detail that most shorter-lived peoples find excessive or inefficient. Elves are often rather private people, steeped in the secrets of their groves and kinship groups. They're slow to build friendships outside their kinsfolk, as elves who spend their lives among shorter-lived peoples often become morose after watching generations of companions age and die. These elves are known as Forlorn among their fellow elves.\n\nIf you want a character who is [magical](link_trait_1504), mystical, and mysterious, you should play an elf.","content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":4,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":4,"name":"Dwarf","uuid":"518845481186385","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1467,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=59","book":"Player Core","page":"42"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:35:20.980759+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":10,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":20,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":83},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Gnomish\",\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Jotun\",\n  \"Orcish\",\n  \"Petran\",\n  \"Sakvroth\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":20769},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"802db98f-dfe6-4dac-b370-650edb781046","data":{"type":"physical-feature","abilityBlockId":20771},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"1cfee0a2-58bd-41d0-9b56-6b1ec041198a","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-dwarf-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Dwarves are a short, stocky people who are often stubborn, fierce, and devoted._\n\nDwarves have a well-earned reputation as a stoic and stern people, but they also have an unbridled zeal and deeply value artisanship. To a stranger, they can seem untrusting and clannish, but to their friends and family, they are warm and caring. While trust from a dwarf is hard-won, once gained it is as strong as iron.\n\nIf you want to play a character who is as hard as nails, a stubborn and unrelenting adventurer, with a mix of rugged toughness and deep wisdom, you should play a dwarf.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4,"name":"Dwarf","uuid":"518845481186385","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1467,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=59","book":"Player Core","page":"42"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:35:20.980759+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":10,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":20,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca3