, a stubborn and unrelenting adventurer, with a mix of rugged toughness and deep wisdom, you should play a dwarf.","content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":5,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":5,"name":"Gnome","uuid":"2257579532369643","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1452,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=61","book":"Player Core","page":"50"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:38:09.147639+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":8,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"small","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_STR"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":90},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Dwarven\",\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Elven\",\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Jotun\",\n  \"Orcish\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":19330},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"cdd84645-ffd4-455b-86ff-a8402b15f8c6","data":{"languageId":85},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"74a80d85-13d4-4895-a027-699bef17fc6b","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-gnome-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Gnomes are short and hardy folk, with an unquenchable curiosity and eccentric habits._\n\nLong ago, early gnome ancestors emigrated from the First World, realm of the [fey](link_trait_2021). While it's unclear why the first gnomes wandered to Golarion, this lineage manifests in modern gnomes as bizarre reasoning, eccentricity, obsessive tendencies, and what some see as naivete.\n\nAlways hungry for new experiences, gnomes constantly wander both mentally and physically, attempting to stave off a terrible ailment that threatens all of their people. This affliction, known as the Bleaching, strikes gnomes who fail to dream, innovate, and take in new experiences. The Bleaching slowly drains the color— literally—from gnomes, and it plunges those affected into states of deep depression that eventually claim their lives. Very few gnomes survive this scourge, becoming deeply morose and wise survivors known as bleachlings.\n\nIf you want a character with boundless enthusiasm and an alien, fey outlook on morality and life, you should play a gnome.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":5,"name":"Gnome","uuid":"2257579532369643","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1452,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=61","book":"Player Core","page":"50"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:38:09.147639+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":8,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"small","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_STR"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":90},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Dwarven\",\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Elven\",\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Jotun\",\n  \"Orcish\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":19330},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"cdd84645-ffd4-455b-86ff-a8402b15f8c6","data":{"languageId":85},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"74a80d85-13d4-4895-a027-699bef17fc6b","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-gnome-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Gnomes are short and hardy folk, with an unquenchable curiosity and eccentric habits._\n\nLong ago, early gnome ancestors emigrated from the First World, realm of the [fey](link_trait_2021). While it's unclear why the first gnomes wandered to Golarion, this lineage manifests in modern gnomes as bizarre reasoning, eccentricity, obsessive tendencies, and what some see as naivete.\n\nAlways hungry for new experiences, gnomes constantly wander both mentally and physically, attempting to stave off a terrible ailment that threatens all of their people. This affliction, known as the Bleaching, strikes gnomes who fail to dream, innovate, and take in new experiences. The Bleaching slowly drains the color— literally—from gnomes, and it plunges those affected into states of deep depression that eventually claim their lives. Very few gnomes survive this scourge, becoming deeply morose and wise survivors known as bleachlings.\n\nIf you want a character with boundless enthusiasm and an alien, fey outlook on morality and life, you should play a gnome.","content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":6,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":6,"name":"Goblin","uuid":"5310427347615682","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1468,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=62","book":"Player Core","page":"54"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:41:20.25442+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":6,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"small","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":86},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Dwarven\",\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Gnomish\",\n  \"Halfling\",\n  \"Orcish\",\n  \"Kholo\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":20769},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"b2c01cdb-3d57-4309-98a1-1837b9ef3771","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-goblin-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Goblins are a short, scrappy, energetic people who have spent millennia maligned and feared._\n\nThe convoluted histories other people cling to don't interest goblins. These small folk live in the moment, and they prefer tall tales over factual records. Goblin virtues are about being present, creative, and honest. They strive to lead fulfilled lives, rather than worrying about how their journeys will end. To tell stories, not nitpick the facts. To be small, but dream big. Many goblins enjoy simpler delights like songs, fire, and eating, and hate reading, dogs, and horses. Other goblins might have more complex pursuits, though, such as tinkering with scraps or concocting snacks and explosives from most anything.\n\nIf you want a character who is eccentric, enthusiastic, and fun-loving, you should play a goblin.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":6,"name":"Goblin","uuid":"5310427347615682","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1468,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=62","book":"Player Core","page":"54"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:41:20.25442+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":6,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"small","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"ca332abb-d0ae-43d6-915b-bb85688cf91e","data":{"value":{"value":-1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":86},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Dwarven\",\n  \"Draconic\",\n  \"Gnomish\",\n  \"Halfling\",\n  \"Orcish\",\n  \"Kholo\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":20769},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"6849b687-67e5-4e8c-a232-7726c61a63f8","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"6e1941cd-a202-4d1c-a117-e3fc8ac9c1e3","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"b2c01cdb-3d57-4309-98a1-1837b9ef3771","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-goblin-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Goblins are a short, scrappy, energetic people who have spent millennia maligned and feared._\n\nThe convoluted histories other people cling to don't interest goblins. These small folk live in the moment, and they prefer tall tales over factual records. Goblin virtues are about being present, creative, and honest. They strive to lead fulfilled lives, rather than worrying about how their journeys will end. To tell stories, not nitpick the facts. To be small, but dream big. Many goblins enjoy simpler delights like songs, fire, and eating, and hate reading, dogs, and horses. Other goblins might have more complex pursuits, though, such as tinkering with scraps or concocting snacks and explosives from most anything.\n\nIf you want a character who is eccentric, enthusiastic, and fun-loving, you should play a goblin.","content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":8,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":8,"name":"Human","uuid":"8797965731613621","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1436,"meta_data":null,"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:41:58.710667+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":8,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"19f57f26-d317-47e8-a6b8-2518475b8fec","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"},{"id":"caaef25f-bf08-4ffb-acde-848fe25de069","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"6f2f6144-289c-4763-b96d-95e2d16d1fb9","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"d363245a-016b-4be7-96e2-5e8c5e1ae061","data":{"title":"Select a Language","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"LANGUAGE","optionsFilters":{"id":"ea13f297-bce0-47cf-9036-f893d308f58e","type":"LANGUAGE"},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-human-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Humans are diverse and adaptable people with wide potential and deep ambitions._\n\nAs unpredictable and varied as any of Golarion’s peoples, humans have exceptional drive and the capacity to endure and expand. Though many civilizations thrived before humanity rose to prominence, humans have built some of the greatest and the most terrible societies throughout the course of history, and today they are the most populous people in the realms around the Inner Sea.\n\nHumans’ ambition, versatility, and exceptional potential have led to their status as the world’s predominant ancestry. Their empires and nations are vast, sprawling things, and their citizens carve names for themselves with the strength of their sword arms and the power of their spells. Humanity is diverse and tumultuous, running the gamut from nomadic to imperial, sinister to saintly. Many of them venture forth to explore, to map the expanse of the multiverse, to search for long-lost treasure, or to lead mighty armies to conquer their neighbors—for no better reason than because they can.\n\nIf you want a character who can be just about anything, you should play a human.","content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":8,"name":"Human","uuid":"8797965731613621","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1436,"meta_data":null,"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:41:58.710667+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":8,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"19f57f26-d317-47e8-a6b8-2518475b8fec","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"},{"id":"caaef25f-bf08-4ffb-acde-848fe25de069","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"6f2f6144-289c-4763-b96d-95e2d16d1fb9","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"d363245a-016b-4be7-96e2-5e8c5e1ae061","data":{"title":"Select a Language","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"LANGUAGE","optionsFilters":{"id":"ea13f297-bce0-47cf-9036-f893d308f58e","type":"LANGUAGE"},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-human-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Humans are diverse and adaptable people with wide potential and deep ambitions._\n\nAs unpredictable and varied as any of Golarion’s peoples, humans have exceptional drive and the capacity to endure and expand. Though many civilizations thrived before humanity rose to prominence, humans have built some of the greatest and the most terrible societies throughout the course of history, and today they are the most populous people in the realms around the Inner Sea.\n\nHumans’ ambition, versatility, and exceptional potential have led to their status as the world’s predominant ancestry. Their empires and nations are vast, sprawling things, and their citizens carve names for themselves with the strength of their sword arms and the power of their spells. Humanity is diverse and tumultuous, running the gamut from nomadic to imperial, sinister to saintly. Many of them venture forth to explore, to map the expanse of the multiverse, to search for long-lost treasure, or to lead mighty armies to conquer their neighbors—for no better reason than because they can.\n\nIf you want a character who can be just about anything, you should play a human.","content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"ancestry","id":10,"type":"ancestry","before":{"id":10,"name":"Orc","uuid":"2005895293702434","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1461,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=66","book":"Player Core","page":"70"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:42:25.284011+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":10,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"72506287-ce22-4033-866d-ab849ac4ec9e","data":{"value":25,"variable":"SPEED"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"2406087d-787e-4a0d-9807-e167794d3471","data":{"languageId":81},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"d6dea13c-9849-4988-910b-786afad7f468","data":{"languageId":89},"type":"giveLanguage"},{"id":"e423312d-baab-4e75-91ec-11599102f395","data":{"value":"[\n  \"Goblin\",\n  \"Jotun\",\n  \"Petran\",\n  \"Sakvroth\"\n]","variable":"CORE_LANGUAGES"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"013967a1-ba53-4692-a13a-ceae609481af","data":{"type":"sense","abilityBlockId":20769},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"},{"id":"eabb4cd7-5aad-4f7c-a712-95d5e272bcf3","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"8c1e7659-5029-4d00-8d77-f10f50b4688d","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"},{"id":"d3f89920-a79a-4f46-b32a-0c88b543ccec","data":{"traitId":2399},"type":"giveTrait"},{"id":"da9c1890-53ff-4033-8396-da52153bd63c","data":{"title":"Select an Attribute","modeType":"FILTERED","optionType":"ADJ_VALUE","optionsFilters":{"id":"51fb1543-8428-4ad5-bc53-40b5b2225a48","type":"ADJ_VALUE","group":"ATTRIBUTE","value":{"value":1}},"optionsPredefined":[]},"type":"select"}],"artwork_url":"https://images.demiplane.com/elements/pathfinder-2e/ancestries/ancestry-orc-rm-detail.png?format=webp&quality=90&width=1920","description":"> _Orcs are proud, strong people with hardened physiques who value physical might and glory in combat._\n\nOrcs are forged in the fires of violence and conflict, often from the moment they are born. As they live lives that are frequently cut brutally short, orcs revel in testing their strength against worthy foes, often by challenging a higher-ranking member of their community for dominance. Orcs often struggle to gain acceptance among other communities, who frequently see them as brutes. Those who earn the loyalty of an orc friend, however, soon learn that an orc's fidelity and honesty are unparalleled. Orc culture teaches that they are shaped by the challenges they survive, and the most worthy survive the most hardships. Orcs who attain both a long life and great triumphs command immense respect.\n\nIf you want a character who is hardy, fearsome, and excels at feats of physical prowess, you should play an orc.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":10,"name":"Orc","uuid":"2005895293702434","rarity":"COMMON","version":"1.0","trait_id":1461,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Ancestries.aspx?ID=66","book":"Player Core","page":"70"}},"created_at":"2023-12-14T04:42:25.284011+00:00","deprecated":null,"operations":[{"id":"2ab7d55b-60a2-4051-9307-e4c73a6d6596","data":{"value":10,"variable":"MAX_HEALTH_ANCESTRY"},"type":"setValue"},{"id":"09cbf36d-44d6-436d-9456-5499516314aa","data":{"value":"medium","variable":"SIZE"},"type":"setValue"},