 those they feel wronged them in life (or their living descendants). A dullahan's concept of justice is swift and merciless, and once they've selected a target, they're unwavering in their cause.\n\nPerhaps even more than revenge, a dullahan desires their own rotted head. An individual who wields the head of a dullahan is powerful indeed, for a dullahan will grudgingly serve such a master in the hopes of reclaiming their missing skull. Mighty fiends such as devils command dullahans to harvest souls or lead armies for them, while a mortal might use such an undead warrior to fulfill a personal vendetta. A dullahan won't hesitate to kill their liege and reclaim their head when the opportunity presents itself."},"hp_temp":null,"version":"1.0","inventory":{"coins":{"cp":0,"gp":0,"pp":0,"sp":0},"items":[{"id":"54946dcb-b932-4b19-b053-38d04ed92d9a","item":{"id":1498039059488194,"name":"Keen Longsword","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1854],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"4 + Head Hunter","damageType":"slashing"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":12},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"","content_source_id":1},"is_formula":false,"is_equipped":true,"is_invested":false,"is_implanted":false,"container_contents":[]},{"id":"530d63b7-f128-4301-be35-5b364fb6afc1","item":{"id":8432379353565114,"name":"Keen Returning Hatchet","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1562],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"4 + Head Hunter","damageType":"slashing"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":11},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"","content_source_id":1},"is_formula":false,"is_equipped":true,"is_invested":false,"is_implanted":false,"container_contents":[]},{"id":"6d99e5c9-c4f