ity":"COMMON","traits":[1476],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"**Saving Throw** @Check\\[fortitude|dc:26\\]\n\n* * *\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 2d6 poison damage and \\[\\[Off-Guard\\]\\] (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 2d6 poison damage, \\[\\[Clumsy\\]\\]{Clumsy 1}, and off-guard (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 2d6 poison damage, \\[\\[Clumsy\\]\\]{Clumsy 2}, and off-guard (1 round)","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Ink Cloud","type":"action","level":8,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The octopus emits a cloud of black ink in a @Template\\[emanation|distance:30\\]. This cloud has no effect outside of water. Creatures inside the cloud are \\[\\[Undetected\\]\\] and can't use their sense of smell. The cloud dissipates after 1 minute.\n\nThe octopus can't use Ink Cloud again for \\[\\[/br 2d6 #rounds\\]\\]{2d6 rounds}.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Jet","type":"action","level":8,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1505],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The octopus moves up to 200 feet in a straight line through the water without triggering reactions.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Writhing Arms","type":"action","level":8,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The giant octopus makes up to four Strikes with different arms, each against a different target. Each attack counts separately for the octopus's multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase the until the octopus has made all the attacks.\n\nIf the octopus subsequently uses the \\[\\[Grab\\]\\] action, it can Grab any number of creatures it hit with Writhing Arms.","content_source_id":8}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":null,"resolve_current":null,"stamina_current":null,"content_source_id":8},"after":{"id":10079,"name":"Giant Octopus","type":"creature","uuid":"2430073861230208","level":8,"notes":null,"rarity":"COMMON","spells":{"list":[],"slots":[],"innate_casts":[],"focus_point_current":0},"details":{"image_url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Images/Monsters/Giant_Octopus.webp","description":"Giant octopuses are found in the heart of deep, dark oceans. Clever and adaptable, they hunt and devour all manner of animals. Despite growing up to 16 feet long, a giant octopus can compress its body to squeeze through small gaps as long as there's room for its beak.\n\nGiant octopuses favor shipwrecks, coral reefs, or underwater caverns as lairs, where they can take advantage of narrow confines for protection. Like their smaller kin, they're fond of adorning and decorating their lairs with found objects—many of which, in the giant octopus's case, are also magical weapons, shields, or works of art salvaged from sunken ships or fallen adventurers."},"hp_temp":null,"version":"1.0","inventory":{"coins":{"cp":0,"gp":0,"pp":0,"sp":0},"items":[{"id":"81b6e146-f351-478c-a263-17faccbb7feb","item":{"id":5429244174091331,"name":"Arm","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,4174],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d8","dice":2,"extra":"3 + Improved Grab","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":14},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"","content_source_id":1},"is_formula":false,"is_equipped":true,"is_invested":false,"is_implanted":false,"container_contents":[]},{"id":"860d50b5-0283-4cba-80f1-4a72433d4548","item":{"id":1607010203824784,"name":"Beak","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d8","dice":2,"extra":"3 + Gi