created_at":"","description":"* * *\n\n**Effect** The goliath spider automatically notices the creature and Strides, Climbs, or Descends on a Web before it rolls initiative.","requirements":"Initiative has not yet been rolled.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Descend on a Web","type":"action","level":11,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1505],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The goliath spider moves straight down up to 120 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage.\n\nA creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 5, 20 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Goliath Spider Venom","type":"action","level":11,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1481,1476],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"**Saving Throw** @Check\\[fortitude|dc:30\\]\n\n* * *\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 3d6 poison damage and \\[\\[Slowed\\]\\]{Slowed 1} (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d8 poison damage and \\[\\[Slowed\\]\\]{Slowed 2} (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 3d10 poison damage and \\[\\[Paralyzed\\]\\] for \\[\\[/br 2d4 #hours\\]\\]{2d4 hours}","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Web Tether","type":"action","level":11,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"A creature hit by the spider's web Strike is \\[\\[Restrained\\]\\] and tethered to the spider, preventing it from moving farther away from the spider.\n\nThe spider can have one creature tethered at a time. The DC to \\[\\[Escape\\]\\] or \\[\\[Force Open\\]\\] the web is 30. The tether can be severed with a Strike (AC 20, Hardness 5, HP 20), but this doesn't free the restrained creature.","content_source_id":8}],"operation_dat