ells","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"interaction"}},"created_at":"","description":"ConstantSpells","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Aura of Misfortune","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1475,1677],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"defensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"20 feet.\n\nLiving creatures in the aura must roll twice on all d20 rolls and use the lower result.\n\n\\[\\[Effect: Aura of Misfortune\\]\\]","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Lurking Death","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1470],"actions":"REACTION","trigger":"A creature within 100 feet makes a ranged attack or uses an action that has the concentrate, manipulate, or move trait","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"defensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"* * *\n\n**Effect** The Grim Reaper teleports to a square adjacent to the triggering creature and makes a melee Strike against it. If the Strike hits, the Grim Reaper disrupts the triggering action.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Void Healing","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"defensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The Grim Reaper can choose whether or not it takes vitality damage.\n\n* * *\n\nNegativeHealing","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Death Strike","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1904],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"A creature critically hit by any of the grim reaper's attacks or that critically fails against any of its spells must succeed at a @Check\\[fortitude|dc:47\\] save or die.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Energy Drain","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"When the Grim Reaper hits and deals damage with its scythe, it regains 20 healing Hit Points, and the target must succeed at a @Check\\[fortitude|dc:43\\] save or become \\[\\[Doomed\\]\\]{Doomed 1}. If the target is already doomed, the doomed value increases by 1 (to a maximum of \\[\\[Doomed\\]\\]{Doomed 3}).","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Final Death","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"A creature killed by the Grim Reaper can't be brought back to life by any means short of divine intervention.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Infuse Weapon","type":"action","level":21,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"Any scythe gains the agile trait, can't be disarmed, and becomes a _+3 major striking keen scythe_ while the Grim Reaper wields it.\n\nIf the Grim Reaper Strikes a creature with a weakness to any specific type of damage, the scythe's damage counts as that type of damage, in addition to slashing.","content_source_id":8}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":null,"resolve_current":null,"stamina_current":null,"content_source_id":8},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"creature","id":10115,"type":"creature","before":{"id":10115,"name":"Grizzly Bear","type":"creature","uuid":"5632923284425874","level":3,"notes":null,"rarity":"COMMON","spells":{"list":[],"slots":[],"innate_casts":[],"focus_point_current":0},"details":{"description":"This large and powerful omnivore inhabits forested hills. While it typically sustains itself on nuts, berries, fish, and small mammals, it's fiercely territorial and will chase off or kill any creature it views as competition. Grizzly bears are especially temperamental when their young are nearby. In combat, a grizzly bear often attempts to grab and maul its foe with surprising ferocity. It continues its assault until its foe seems like it is no longer a threat, though if the bear is hungry, it will not hesitate to feed.\n\n* * *\n\nBears are ferocious predators typically found in cold or temperate woodlands and hills. Many species of bear exist in addition to the two presented below, such as the smaller black bear or the arctic-dwelling polar bear."},"hp_temp":null,"version":"1.0","inventory":{"coins":{"cp":0,"gp":0,"pp":0,"sp":0},"items":[{"id":"19073f81-412d-4daf-9c20-18c351945c7b","item":{"id":6854279389319382,"name":"Jaws","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d8","dice":2,"damageType":"piercing"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":7},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"","content_source_id":1},"is_formula":false,"is_equipped":true,"is_invested":false,"is_implanted":false,"container_contents":[]},{"id":"785a1029-d0c4-4232-9f37-110e20284124","item":{"id":8947935143167787,"name":"Claw","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d10","dice":1,"extra":"Improved Grab","damageType":"slashing"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":7},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"","content_source_id":1},"is_formula":false,"is_equipped":true,"is_invested":false,"is_implanted":false,"container_contents":[]}]},"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Monsters.aspx?ID=2850","book":"Monster Core","page":"41"}},"created_at":"2024-12-29T21:53:27.649529+00:00","deprecated":null,"experience":null,"hp_current":null,"operations":[{"id":"e9082456-7454-454b-bdde-b01aa93454b8","data":{"value":{"value":4,"partial":false},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_STR"},"type":