:"Web Sense","type":"action","level":1,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"interaction"}},"created_at":"","description":"The hunting spider has imprecise tremorsense to detect the vibrations of creatures touching its web.\n\n* * *\n\nTremorsense","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Spring Upon Prey","type":"action","level":1,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520],"actions":"REACTION","trigger":"A creature touches the hunting spider's web while the spider is on it.","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"defensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"* * *\n\n**Effect** The hunting spider automatically notices the creature and Strides, Climbs, or Descends on a Web before it rolls initiative.","requirements":"Initiative has not yet been rolled.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Descend on a Web","type":"action","level":1,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1505],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The hunting spider moves straight down up to 40 feet, suspended by a web line. It can hang from the web or drop off. The distance it Descends on a Web doesn't count for falling damage.\n\nA creature that successfully Strikes the web (AC 20, Hardness 3, 5 HP) severs it, causing the spider to fall.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Hunting Spider Venom","type":"action","level":1,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1476],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"**Saving Throw** @Check\\[fortitude|dc:16\\]\n\n* * *\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 1d4 poison damage and \\[\\[Off-Guard\\]\\] (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 1d6 poison damage, \\[\\[Clumsy\\]\\]{Clumsy 1}, and off-guard (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 1d6 poison damage, \\[\\[Clumsy\\]\\]{Clumsy 2}, and off-guard (1 round)","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Web Trap","type":"action","level":1,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"A creature hit by the hunting spider's web Strike is \\[\\[Immobilized\\]\\] and stuck to the nearest surface until it \\[\\[/act escape dc=17\\]\\]{Escapes (DC 17)}.","content_source_id":8}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":null,"resolve_current":null,"stamina_current":null,"content_source_id":8},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"creature","id":10147,"type":"creature","before":{"id":10147,"name":"Imp","type":"creature","uuid":"7329660136027839","level":1,"notes":null,"rarity":"COMMON","spells":{"list":[],"slots":[],"innate_casts":[],"focus_point_current":0},"details":{"image_url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Images/Monsters/Imp.webp","description":"Imps are fiendish infiltrators and corrupters who, despite their diminutive stature, are more than capable of subtly influencing a weak-willed individual into performing increasingly evil acts over time. An imp will often agree to serve a mortal and act docile and loyal in a long-term plot to eventually get their master killed or damn their soul. Imps are born directly from the Outer Planes themselves, rather than from mortal souls, and thus they serve outside any fiendish hierarchies, granting them leeway to pursue their specialties. Despite standing a mere 2 feet tall, imps can be vicious combatants, flying out of reach and turning invisible to escape should the odds turn against them."},"hp_temp":null,"version":"1.0","inventory":{"coins":{"cp":0,"gp":0,"pp":0,"sp":0},"items":[{"id":"cc241153-858e-4bcf-962c-3f5c6639c967","item":{"id":3944222913975463,"name":"Stinger","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","level":0,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1504,4177,1846],"version":"","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"Imp Venom","damageType":"piercing"},"reload":"null","foundry":{},"category":"unarmed_attack","quantity":1,"attack_bonus":5},"cre