scription":"If a jah-tohl takes 30 damage from a critical hit or 25 mental damage, it must succeed at a DC 26 save (@Check\\[fortitude|dc:26\\]{Fortitude} for critical damage or @Check\\[will|dc:26\\]{Will} for mental damage) or one of its brain blisters is destroyed.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Collect Brain","type":"action","level":8,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1433],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"The jahtohl extracts the brain of a creature within its reach that has been dead for no more than 1 minute. It can then use an Interact action to secure the brain in one of its empty brain blisters and heal 20 Hit Points.","content_source_id":8},{"id":-1,"name":"Mind Snatcher Venom","type":"action","level":8,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1476],"actions":null,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"foundry":{"category":"offensive"}},"created_at":"","description":"**Saving Throw** @Check\\[fortitude|dc:26\\]\n\n* * *\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 1d6 poison and \\[\\[Enfeebled\\]\\]{Enfeebled 1} (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 1d6 poison, enfeebled 1, and \\[\\[Slowed\\]\\]{Slowed 1} (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 2d6 poison, \\[\\[Enfeebled\\]\\]{Enfeebled 2}, and slowed 1 (1 round)","content_source_id":8}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":null,"resolve_current":null,"stamina_current":null,"content_source_id":8},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"creature","id":10166,"type":"creature","before":{"id":10166,"name":"Kraken","type":"creature","uuid":"3391782585212583","level":18,"notes":null,"rarity":"UNCOMMON","spells":{"list":[],"slots":[],"innate_casts":[],"focus_point_current":0},"details":{"image_url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Images/Monsters/Kraken.webp","description":"A kraken is an enormous, squid-like leviathan with a cruel intelligence. It hunts ships, whales, and heroes alike. The hatred and envy krakens hold for alghollthus, their rivals, has led many krakens to make thei