":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[{"id":"736d0d8d-f336-4b53-beb7-2ff80b322b19","data":{"title":"Select Advancement","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"70849bef-dec0-4e04-bbc6-1c52fd9083d7","type":"CUSTOM","title":"- Not Yet","operations":[],"description":"No next advancement yet."},{"id":"44bdec61-3507-44ac-a220-54c460d756c3","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Mature","operations":[{"id":"3e3f105f-7ca8-4c28-935a-3ae81c755b9e","data":{"type":"feat","abilityBlockId":40304},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"}],"description":"When you advance a young animal companion to a mature animal companion:\n\n*   If your companion is Medium or smaller, it grows by one size.\n    \n*   Increase its Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, and Wisdom modifiers by 1.\n    \n*   Increase its proficiency rank for Perception and all saving throws to expert. Increase its proficiency ranks in Intimidation, Stealth, and Survival to trained, and if it was already trained in one of those skills from its type, increase its proficiency rank in that skill to expert.\n    \n*   Increase its unarmed attack damage from one die to two dice (for instance 1d8 to 2d8)"}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"You advance an animal companion, usually due to one of your class feat choices.","requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1},{"id":6838509766878516,"cost":"","name":"Support","type":"action","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"If the animal uses the Support action, the only other actions it can use on this turn are basic move actions to get into position to take advantage of the Support benefits; if it has already used any other action this turn, it can’t Support you.","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"Your bat flaps around your foes' arms and faces, getting in the way of their attacks. Until the start of your next t