ons":"ONE-ACTION","special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"once per day","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"The imp offers a non-[fiend](link_trait_2415) within 15 feet a bargain, granting a boon of good luck if the creature accepts. The boon lasts for 1 hour once accepted. Once during the hour, the creature can roll an attack roll or saving throw twice and use the higher result. If the creature dies while the boon is in place, the imp decides where the creature’s soul travels. This typically makes the soul bound for eternity in the imp’s home plane, and the creature is unable to be raised or resurrected except by the [wish](link_spell_4955) ritual or similar magic.","requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1},{"id":8242768878088759,"cost":"","name":"Imp Invisibility","type":"action","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"once per hour","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"Your imp familiar can cast [invisibility](link_spell_4689) on itself as a divine innate spell.","requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":[],"resolve_current":null,"stamina_current":null,"content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"creature","id":12807,"type":"creature","before":{"id":12807,"name":"Rootball Chair","type":"creature","uuid":"8343375655803581","level":-100,"notes":null,"rarity":"COMMON","spells":null,"details":{"description":"**Special** mount (_Your companion is especially suited for riding and ignores any restrictions on needing to be at least one size larger than the rider, only being able to use its land Speed, and being unable to move and [Support](link_feat_34004) you on the same turn._)\n\nYour companion is a woven sphere of living plant roots that rolls over the ground, while you sit on a stabilized seat above it."},"hp_temp":0,"versi