on","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":null,"special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[{"id":"12003f00-8ae0-40d1-92da-eb8d7e1ac030","data":{"title":"Select Advancement","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"fc2f7ae7-1061-4976-a6bc-d332f09c2949","type":"CUSTOM","title":"- Not Yet","operations":[],"description":"No next advancement yet."},{"id":"693c987e-46e6-4305-a23c-f766e91b8bb8","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Mature","operations":[{"id":"d95152c1-45bc-4acd-851c-b078e9767318","data":{"type":"feat","abilityBlockId":40304},"type":"giveAbilityBlock"}],"description":"When you advance a young animal companion to a mature animal companion:\n\n*   If your companion is Medium or smaller, it grows by one size.\n    \n*   Increase its Strength, Dexterity, Constitution, and Wisdom modifiers by 1.\n    \n*   Increase its proficiency rank for Perception and all saving throws to expert. Increase its proficiency ranks in Intimidation, Stealth, and Survival to trained, and if it was already trained in one of those skills from its type, increase its proficiency rank in that skill to expert.\n    \n*   Increase its unarmed attack damage from one die to two dice (for instance 1d8 to 2d8)"}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"You advance an animal companion, usually due to one of your class feat choices.","requirements":"","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1},{"id":3871585644345888,"cost":"","name":"Support","type":"action","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"ONE-ACTION","special":"If the animal uses the [Support](link_feat_34004) action, the only other actions it can use on this turn are basic [move](link_trait_1505) actions to get into position to take advantage of the [Support](link_feat_34004) benefits; if it has already used any other action this turn, it can’t [Support](link_feat_34004) you.","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"Your [rootball chair](link_creature_12807) extends its tendrils to move smoothly over terrain. It ignores difficult terrain until the end of the turn, and [Strides](link_action_19855).","requirements":"The creature is an animal companion.","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1},{"id":8674767643190342,"cost":"","name":"Seedpod Spring","type":"action","level":1,"access":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"actions":"TWO-ACTIONS","special":"","trigger":"","version":"1.0","frequency":"","meta_data":{},"created_at":"","operations":[],"description":"A seedpod within the chair bursts and uncoils, releasing a light clump of cottony material. Your [rootball chair](link_creature_12807) [Leaps](link_action_19735) up to 30 feet vertically or horizontally and drifts down, sinking 5 feet for every 5 feet traveled horizontally and causing you to take no falling damage. The cottony material disperses when you land.","requirements":"Advanced Maneuver access","prerequisites":[],"content_source_id":-1}],"operation_data":null,"abilities_added":[],"resolve_current":0,"stamina_current":0,"content_source_id":16},"after":{"id":12807,"name":"Rootball Chair","type":"creature","uuid":"8343375655803581","level":-100,"notes":null,"rarity":"COMMON","spells":null,"details":{"description":"**Special** mount (_Your companion is especially suited for riding and ignores any restrictions on needing to be at least one size larger than the rider, only being able to use its land Speed, and being unable to move and [Support](link_feat_34004) you on the same turn._)\n\nYour companion is a woven sphere of living plant roots that rolls over the ground, while you sit on a stabilized seat above it."},"hp_temp":0,"version":"1.0","inventory":null,"meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Companions.aspx?ID=56","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"107"}},"created_at":"2026-09-22T07:24:06.647342+00:00","deprecated":false,"experienc