e":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:29:32.749252+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This polished crystal sphere enhances [scrying](link_trait_1590) magic. Any [visual](link_trait_1479) information received through a spell with the [scrying](link_trait_1590) trait that was cast by the crystal ball appears within the sphere, and any [auditory](link_trait_1469) information sounds out from the surface of the sphere. When you [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) with the scrying trait by any other means while holding the sphere, you can relay any information you receive in the same way, allowing others to see or hear the target.\n\nThe base version of a crystal ball is a sphere of clear quartz, but other versions are made of different stones.\n\n**Activate—Clairvoyance** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** The crystal ball casts [clairvoyance](link_spell_4521) to your specifications.\n\n**Activate—Scrying** 10 minutes ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** twice per day; **Effect** The crystal ball casts a DC 33 [scrying](link_spell_4821) spell to your specifications.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":6849,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Crystal Ball (Clear Quartz)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4174194922566662","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3800},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1590],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3019","book":"GM Core","page":"273"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quan