and [mental](link_trait_1448) [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. On a hit, the target becomes frightened 1, or frightened 2 on a critical hit. Many types also grant an item bonus to attack rolls.\n\nYou gain a +1 item bonus to attack rolls. The bomb deals 2d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage and 2 [mental](link_trait_1448) [splash](link_trait_1532) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":6905,"type":"item","before":{"id":6905,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Elixir of Life (Minor)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2251827212811268","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2887","book":"GM Core","page":"247"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T17:21:12.954Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:43:06.014985+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nElixirs of life accelerate a living creature's natural healing processes and immune system. Upon drinking this elixir, you regain 1d6 Hit Points and gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [diseases](link_trait_1857) and [poisons](link_trait_1476) for 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":6905,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Elixir of Life (Minor)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2251827212811268","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2887","book":"GM Core","page":"247"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T17:21:12.954Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:43:06.014985+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nElixirs of life accelerate a living creature's natural healing processes and immune system. Upon drinking this elixir, you regain 1d6 Hit Points and gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [diseases](link_trait_1857) and [poisons](link_trait_1476) for 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":6913,"type":"item","before":{"id":6913,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Energy Breath Potion (Acid, Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"151298241869348","group":"GENERAL","hands":"1","level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2941","book":"GM Core","page":"259"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T16:19:30.662Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:45:51.12219+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDistilled from the energy of dangerous spells, an energy breath potion grants you the Energy Breath action for 1 hour after you imbibe the concoction. The potency of the breath depends on the potion's type, based on how long the distilled ingredients were aged. This potion has the [acid](link_trait_1528) trait.\n\n**Energy Breath** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> You create a 30-foot line of acid. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic Reflex save against a DC of 23, taking 4d6 acid damage on a failure (or half as much on a critical success). After you use Energy Breath, you can't do so again for 1d4 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":6913,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Energy Breath Potion (Acid, Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"151298241869348","group":"GENERAL","hands":"1","level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2941","book":"GM Core","page":"259"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T16:19:30.662Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:45:51.12219+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDistilled from the energy of dangerous spells, an energy breath potion grants you the Energy Breath action for 1 hour after you imbibe the concoction. The potency of the breath depends on the potion's type, based on how long the distilled ingredients were aged. This potion has the [acid](link_trait_1528) trait.\n\n**Energy Breath** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> You create a 30-foot line of acid. Each creature in the area must attempt a basic Reflex save against a DC of 23, taking 4d6 acid damage on a failure (or half as much on a critical success). After you use Energy Breath, you can't do so again for 1d4 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":6926,"type":"item","before":{"id":6926,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"860967069707925","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1650},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2788","book":"GM Core","page":"226"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T17:11:20.140Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:47.066606+00:00","operations":[{"id":"fa1ed842-41b9-4ad6-a046-d07b4b213824","data":{"value":"acid, 10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 10 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the rune. Multiple energy-resistant runes can be etched onto a suit of armor; rather than using only the strongest effect, each must provide resistance to a different damage type. For instance, a +2 acid-resistant greater fire-resistant breastplate would give you acid resistance 5 and fire resistance 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":6926,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"860967069707925","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1650},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2788","book":"GM Core","page":"226"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-05-03T17:11:20.140Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:47.066606+00:00","operations":[{"id":"fa1ed842-41b9-4ad6-a046-d07b4b213824","data":{"value":"acid, 10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 10 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the rune. Multiple energy-resistant runes can be etched onto a suit of armor; rather than using only the strongest effect, each must provide resistance to a different damage type. For instance, a +2 acid-resistant greater fire-resistant breastplate would give you acid resistance 5 and fire resistance 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":6927,"type":"item","before":{"id":6927,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8292860819286133","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":