's clothing is sturdy enough that it can be reinforced to protect you, even though it isn't a suit of armor. It comes in many forms, though the most common sorts look like clerical vestments, monk's garments, or wizard's robes, as members of all three classes are likely to avoid wearing armor.\n\n* * *\n\nAdventurers who don't wear armor travel in durable clothing. Though it's not armor and uses your unarmored defense proficiency, it still has a Dex Cap and can grant an item bonus to AC if etched with [armor potency](link_item_6719) runes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":6939,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Explorer's Clothing","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3739218359946675","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":1},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1599],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=39","book":"Player Core","page":"273"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:54:01.930215+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Explorer's clothing is sturdy enough that it can be reinforced to protect you, even though it isn't a suit of armor. It comes in many forms, though the most common sorts look like clerical vestments, monk's garments, or wizard's robes, as members of all three classes are likely to avoid wearing armor.\n\n* * *\n\nAdventurers who don't wear armor travel in durable clothing. Though it's not armor and uses your unarmored defense proficiency, it still has a Dex Cap and can gr