nstrument.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":7605,"bulk":"16","name":"Musical Instrument (Virtuoso Heavy)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7133907026819680","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":3,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2737","book":"Player Core","page":"290"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Virtuoso Instrument (playing it)","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["playing"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:22:44.3779+00:00","operations":[{"id":"04874b24-697d-461a-aa35-eef14f4fc253","data":{"text":"while playing the virtuoso instrument.","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"[Handheld instruments](link_item_7602) include bagpipes, a small set of chimes, small drums, fiddles and viols, flutes and recorders, small harps, lutes, trumpets, and similarly sized instruments. The GM might rule that an especially large handheld instrument (like a tuba) has greater Bulk. Heavy instruments such as large drums, a full set of chimes, and keyboard instruments are less portable and generally need to be stationary while being played.\n\nA virtuoso instrument is more finely made and gives a +1 item bonus to Performance checks using that instrument.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":7608,"type":"item","before":{"id":7608,"bulk":"1","name":"Net","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1865845508653025","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2738","book":"Player Core","page":"290"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:23:42.146223+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You can use a net either on its own or attached to a [rope](link_item_7715). When attached to a rope, you can use the net to [Grapple](link_action_19725) a Medium or smaller creature up to 10 feet away (instead of only adjacent creatures). You can continue to Grapple to keep your hold on the target so long as the target remains within 10 feet and you continue to hold the net. The grabbed creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) unless you are adjacent to them, and it can attempt a DC 16 Athletics check to [Force Open](link_action_19722) the net entirely. Once the target is no longer grabbed, the net is unwieldy until refolded with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action with the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait that requires two hands; if used without being refolded, Grapple checks made with the net take a –2 penalty.\n\nWhen the net is unattached, you can attempt a ranged attack roll using your simple weapon proficiency against a Medium or smaller creature within 20 feet. On a hit, the target is off-guard and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it Escapes, and on a critical hit, it's also immobilized until it Escapes. The Escape DC is 16. A creature adjacent to the target can Interact to remove the net.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":7608,"bulk":"1","name":"Net","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1865845508653025","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2738","book":"Player Core","page":"290"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:23:42.146223+00:00","operations":[],"description":"You can use a net either on its own or attached to a [rope](link_item_7715). When attached to a rope, you can use the net to [Grapple](link_action_19725) a Medium or smaller creature up to 10 feet away (instead of only adjacent creatures). You can continue to Grapple to keep your hold on the target so long as the target remains within 10 feet and you continue to hold the net. The grabbed creature gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) unless you are adjacent to them, and it can attempt a DC 16 Athletics check to [Force Open](link_action_19722) the net entirely. Once the target is no longer grabbed, the net is unwieldy until refolded with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action with the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait that requires two hands; if used without being refolded, Grapple checks made with the net take a –2 penalty.\n\nWhen the net is unattached, you can attempt a ranged attack roll using your simple weapon proficiency against a Medium or smaller creature within 20 feet. On a hit, the target is off-guard and takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it Escapes, and on a critical hit, it's also immobilized until it Escapes. The Escape DC is 16. A creature adjacent to the target can Interact to remove the net.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":7609,"type":"item","before":{"id":7609,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Nunchaku","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1314824299138450","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"sp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1619,1604,1570,3630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"nunchaku","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6,"base_item_content":{"id":7609,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Nunchaku","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1314824299138450,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"sp":2},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1570,1604,1619,3630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"nunchaku","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:23:55.855071+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The nunchaku is constructed of two wooden or metal bars connected by a short length of rope or chain.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:23:55.855071+00:00","operations":null,"description":