double-sided, but it's always capable of delivering powerful bludgeoning blows.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":7949,"type":"item","before":{"id":7949,"bulk":"0","name":"Wayfinder","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"787854304468574","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":28},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3117","book":"GM Core","page":"297"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"skill-check","option":"compass-in-possession","requiresEquipped":false}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:45:19.363116+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Access** member of the Pathfinder Society\n\nThis compact compass repurposes ancient technology to draw fantastic powers from the mysterious magical items called *[aeon stones](link_item_6678)*. It serves as a badge of office for agents of the Pathfinder Society and as a status symbol among adventurers of any stripe. A wayfinder functions as a [compass](link_item_6826).\n\nAn indentation in the middle of the wayfinder can hold a single *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)*. Placing an *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* in this indentation provides you all the benefits of having the *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* orbiting your head, but it protects the stone from being noticed or stolen as easily. You [invest](link_action_20775) a wayfinder and the *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* within it simultaneously, and they count as only one item toward your investiture limit. An invested *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* slotted in a wayfinder also grants its resonant power.\n\nIf you have more than one wayfinder with an invested *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* on your person at a given time, destructive interference from their resonance prevents you from gaining benefits from any of them. You can still benefit from additional *[aeon stones](link_item_6678)* orbiting your head, just not in wayfinders.\n\n**Activate—Light** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The wayfinder is targeted by a 1st-rank *[light](link_spell_4699)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":7949,"bulk":"0","name":"Wayfinder","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"787854304468574","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":28},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=3117","book":"GM Core","page":"297"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"skill-check","option":"compass-in-possession","requiresEquipped":false}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:45:19.363116+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Access** member of the Pathfinder Society\n\nThis compact compass repurposes ancient technology to draw fantastic powers from the mysterious magical items called *[aeon stones](link_item_6678)*. It serves as a badge of office for agents of the Pathfinder Society and as a status symbol among adventurers of any stripe. A wayfinder functions as a [compass](link_item_6826).\n\nAn indentation in the middle of the wayfinder can hold a single *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)*. Placing an *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* in this indentation provides you all the benefits of having the *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* orbiting your head, but it protects the stone from being noticed or stolen as easily. You [invest](link_action_20775) a wayfinder and the *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* within it simultaneously, and they count as only one item toward your investiture limit. An invested *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* slotted in a wayfinder also grants its resonant power.\n\nIf you have more than one wayfinder with an invested *[aeon stone](link_item_6678)* on your person at a given time, destructive interference from their resonance prevents you from gaining benefits from any of them. You can still benefit from additional *[aeon stones](link_item_6678)* orbiting your head, just not in wayfinders.\n\n**Activate—Light** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The wayfinder is targeted by a 1st-rank *[light](link_spell_4699)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":7950,"type":"item","before":{"id":7950,"bulk":"0","name":"Weapon Potency (+1)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2276636801913925","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2830","book":"GM Core","page":"236"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:45:26.540965+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Magical enhancements make this weapon [strike](link_action_19856) true. Attack rolls with this weapon gain a +1 item bonus, and the weapon can be etched with one property rune.\n\nYou can upgrade the weapon potency rune already etched on a weapon to a stronger version, increasing the values of the existing rune to those of the new rune. You must have the formula of the stronger rune to do so, and the Price of the upgrade is the difference between the two runes' Prices.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":"You are an expert in Crafting."},"after":{"id":7950,"bulk":"0","name":"Weapon Potency (+1)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2276636801913925","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2830","book":"GM Core","page":"236"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:45:26.540965+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Magical enhancements make this weapon [strike](link_action_19856) true. Attack rolls with this weapon gain a +1 item bonus, and the weapon can be etched with one property rune.\n\nYou can upgrade the weapon potency rune already etched on a weapon to a stronger version, increasing the values of the existing rune to those of the new rune. You must have the formula of the stronger rune to do so, and the Price of the upgrade is the difference between the two runes' Prices.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":"You are an expert in Crafting."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":7951,"type":"item","before":{"id":7951,"bulk":"0","name":"Weapon