r slashing melee weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"persistent bleed"},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2854","book":"GM Core","page":"239"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:47:41.435424+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Weapons with wounding runes are said to thirst for blood. When you hit a creature with a wounding weapon, you deal an extra 1d6 persistent bleed damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11676,"type":"item","before":{"id":11676,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Accompaniment Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6467396949597701","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1300},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4850","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:25.870477+00:00","operations":[{"id":"dbd949e0-14b7-4ee9-aabc-c9fe7a62d936","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This lush velvet capelet is embroidered with images of musicians playing a wide variety of instruments. The images animate when you make art, remaining embroidered, but smoothly unknitting and reknitting in time with your performance. The figures play music that perfectly accompanies your instrument, voice, or movements, granting you a +2 item bonus to Performance checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [bard](link_class_21) [composition](link_trait_1895) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You peel the musicians from the garment and fling them around you. The cloak casts a 4th-rank *[phantom crowd](link_spell_9000)* spell (DC 28); each of the 10-foot squares must be adjacent to you. The crowd looks like the musicians on the garment and continues to accompany your Performance checks. You can [Sustain](link_action_19858) this effect as described in the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a bard."},"after":{"id":11676,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Accompaniment Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6467396949597701","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1300},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4850","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:25.870477+00:00","operations":[{"id":"dbd949e0-14b7-4ee9-aabc-c9fe7a62d936","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This lush velvet capelet is embroidered with images of musicians playing a wide variety of instruments. The images animate when you make art, remaining embroidered, but smoothly unknitting and reknitting in time with your performance. The figures play music that perfectly accompanies your instrument, voice, or movements, granting you a +2 item bonus to Performance checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [bard](link_class_21) [composition](link_trait_1895) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You peel the musicians from the garment and fling them around you. The cloak casts a 4th-rank *[phantom crowd](link_spell_9000)* spell (DC 28); each of the 10-foot squares must be adjacent to you. The crowd looks like the musicians on the garment and continues to accompany your Performance checks. You can [Sustain](link_action_19858) this effect as described in the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a bard."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11677,"type":"item","before":{"id":11677,"bulk":"1","name":"Accursed Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8325273993846101","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rar