ge":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4521","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"66"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:40:35.518Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:32.73394+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Access** member of the [Red Mantis assassins](link_feat_40157)\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nKept as a closely guarded secret by the deadly members of the [Red Mantis assassins](link_feat_40157), this [poison](link_trait_1476) is treated with reverence for its ability to end lives. If the victim dies while affected by this [poison](link_trait_1476), its body decomposes to nothing in 1 minute, leaving only its gear behind. Non-magical preservation can't protect the tainted corpse. *[peaceful rest](link_spell_4755)* works on the poisoned body only if cast as a 5th-rank spell and the caster succeeds at a [counteract](link_action_27519) check against the [poison](link_trait_1476)'s saving throw DC when [casting the spell](link_action_19611). Even if cast successfully, *[peaceful rest](link_spell_4755)* only works as if it had been cast at 2nd rank.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 42 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 7d12 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and doomed 1 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 9d12 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and doomed 2 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 11d12 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and doomed 3 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"i