r [Swim](link_action_19859) instead of [Striding](link_action_19855) if you have the corresponding movement type.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11683,"type":"item","before":{"id":11683,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Aether Appendage","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2110790278805645","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2424,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4694","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:35.592805+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This otherworldly prosthetic arm is the product of [psychopomp](link_trait_2457) magic. An [aether appendage](link_item_11683) is [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) so long as no item is being held in the hand or worn on the arm. As a [concentrate](link_trait_1432) action, you can cause the arm to become corporeal until the end of your turn, allowing it to make [Strikes](link_action_19856) or grasp objects. It remains corporeal if you're holding an item or it's wearing an item at the end of your turn. Your [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack [Strikes](link_action_19856) made with the _[aether appendage](link_item_11683)_ become [magical](link_trait_1504). If they're already [magical](link_trait_1504), they instead gain the effect of the [ghost touch](link_item_6992) property rune.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're holding a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) item of light or negligible Bulk; **Effect** The item becomes [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) for 1 minute. Your _[aether appendage](link_item_11683)_ can use the [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) item normally.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11683,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Aether Appendage","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2110790278805645","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2424,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4694","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:35.592805+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This otherworldly prosthetic arm is the product of [psychopomp](link_trait_2457) magic. An [aether appendage](link_item_11683) is [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) so long as no item is being held in the hand or worn on the arm. As a [concentrate](link_trait_1432) action, you can cause the arm to become corporeal until the end of your turn, allowing it to make [Strikes](link_action_19856) or grasp objects. It remains corporeal if you're holding an item or it's wearing an item at the end of your turn. Your [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack [Strikes](link_action_19856) made with the _[aether appendage](link_item_11683)_ become [magical](link_trait_1504). If they're already [magical](link_trait_1504), they instead gain the effect of the [ghost touch](link_item_6992) property rune.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're holding a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) item of light or negligible Bulk; **Effect** The item becomes [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) for 1 minute. Your _[aether appendage](link_item_11683)_ can use the [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) item normally.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11684,"type":"item","before":{"id":11684,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Aged Arbor Wine","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7834054193272386","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T14:01:32.544Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1908","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"47"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:36.506439+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nWatering grape or berry bushes with certain [alchemical](link_trait_1529) liquids as they grow results in a ruby-red drink that’s rich and heady. The vines develop a connection to their natural environment and impart it onto the wine’s imbiber. For 1 minute after drinking a glass of [arbor wine](link_item_11720), you have [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) at a range of 30 feet.\n\n[Arbor wine](link_item_11720) that has been aged for several years—or artificially aged with alchemy—develops both a greater complexity of flavor and a stronger connection to nature. When you drink [aged arbor wine](link_item_11684), vegetation in a 20-foot emanation around you begins to writhe, becoming difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11684,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Aged Arbor Wine","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7834054193272386","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T14:01:32.544Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1908","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"47"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:36.506439+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nWatering grape or berry bushes with certain [alchemical](link_trait_1529) liquids as they grow results in a ruby-red drink that’s rich and heady. The vines develop a connection to their natural environment and impart it onto the wine’s imbiber. For 1 minute after drinking a glass of [arbor wine](link_item_11720), you have [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) at a range of 30 feet.\n\n[Arbor wine](link_item_11720) that has been aged for several years—or artificially aged with alchemy—develops both a greater complexity of flavor and a stronger connection to nature. When you drink [aged arbor wine](link_item_11684), vegetation in a 20-foot emanation around you begins to writhe, becoming difficult terrain until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11685,"type":"item","before":{"id":11685,"bulk":"0","name":"Aim-Aiding","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"503709821292686","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4361","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:23:53.279Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:37.414245+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Armor etched with this rune aids in routing ranged attacks aimed at an enemy around you. You don't provide enemies cover against your allies' ranged attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11685,"bulk":"0","name":"Aim-Aiding","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"503709821292686","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4361","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:23:53.279Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"creat