,"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4504","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"62"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"gauntlet","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:41.647439+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An [alchemical gauntlet](link_item_11689) emits small [alchemical](link_trait_1529) detonations when it makes contact with a foe. As an <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Interact](link_action_19733) action, you can place a [bomb](link_trait_1530) into a metal bracket near the wrist of the gauntlet. The [bomb](link_trait_1530) must be one that deals energy damage, such as an [acid flask](link_item_6671), [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689), [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), [frost vial](link_item_16419), or [blasting stone](link_item_16404). The next three attacks made with the gauntlet deal 1d4 damage of the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s damage type in addition to the gauntlet's normal damage. If the second and third attacks aren't all made within 1 minute of the first attack, the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s energy is wasted. These attacks never deal [splash](link_trait_1532) damage or other special effects of the [bomb](link_trait_1530) and aren't modified by any abilities that add to or modify a [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11689,"bulk":"0","name":"Alchemical Gauntlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"963271068841821","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1529,1714],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4504","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"62"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"gauntlet","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:41.647439+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An [alchemical gauntlet](link_item_11689) emits small [alchemical](link_trait_1529) detonations when it makes contact with a foe. As an <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Interact](link_action_19733) action, you can place a [bomb](link_trait_1530) into a metal bracket near the wrist of the gauntlet. The [bomb](link_trait_1530) must be one that deals energy damage, such as an [acid flask](link_item_6671), [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689), [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), [frost vial](link_item_16419), or [blasting stone](link_item_16404). The next three attacks made with the gauntlet deal 1d4 damage of the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s damage type in addition to the gauntlet's normal damage. If the second and third attacks aren't all made within 1 minute of the first attack, the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s energy is wasted. These attacks never deal [splash](link_trait_1532) damage or other special effects of the [bomb](link_trait_1530) and aren't modified by any abilities that add to or modify a [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11690,"type":"item","before":{"id":11690,"bulk":"1","name":"Alchemist's Flamethrower","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1336820397289639","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1529,1542],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4505","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:42.42914+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This long cylinder is topped by a pair of brass sockets and a collection of polished pipes and tubes. A total of two vials of [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) must be loaded into the sockets at the base of the weapon and the tubes cleaned and primed. Properly loading the flamethrower in this way takes 1 minute. When the trigger on a loaded flamethrower is pulled, the [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) is siphoned into the rifle and shot out of the muzzle in a line of [fire](link_trait_1542). The damage dealt by a flamethrower is determined by the strength of the weakest [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) loaded into the flamethrower.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([fire](link_trait_1542), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** The flamethrower is loaded\n\n**Effect** You pull the trigger, expending both loaded [alchemist's fires](link_item_6689) to shoot a line of [fire](link_trait_1542). Creatures in the area take [fire](link_trait_1542) damage based on the weakest [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) loaded into the flamethrower, as noted below. Creatures that critically fail the basic Reflex save additionally take the listed persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n\n*   **[Lesser Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6689)**: The flamethrower deals 1d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 15 basic Reflex) in a 30-foot line. 1 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Moderate Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6691)**: The flamethrower deals 2d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 17 basic Reflex) in a 60-foot line. 2 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Greater Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6688)**: The flamethrower deals 6d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 28 basic Reflex) in a 90-foot line. 3 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Major Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6690)**: The flamethrower deals 10d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 37 basic Reflex) in a 120-foot line. 4 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11690,"bulk":"1","name":"Alchemist's Flamethrower","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1336820397289639","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1529,1542],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4505","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:42.42914+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This long cylinder is topped by a pair of brass sockets and a collection of polished pipes and tubes. A total of two vials of [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) must be loaded into the sockets at the base of the weapon and the tubes cleaned and primed. Properly loading the flamethrower in this way takes 1 minute. When the trigger on a loaded flamethrower is pulled, the [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) is siphoned into the rifle and shot out of the muzzle in a line of [fire](link_trait_1542). The damage dealt by a flamethrower is determined by the strength of the weakest [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) loaded into the flamethrower.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([fire](link_trait_1542), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** The flamethrower is loaded\n\n**Effect** You pull the trigger, expending both loaded [alchemist's fires](link_item_6689) to shoot a line of [fire](link_trait_1542). Creatures in the area take [fire](link_trait_1542) damage based on the weakest [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689) loaded into the flamethrower, as noted below. Creatures that critically fail the basic Reflex save additionally take the listed persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n\n*   **[Lesser Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6689)**: The flamethrower deals 1d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 15 basic Reflex) in a 30-foot line. 1 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Moderate Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6691)**: The flamethrower deals 2d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 17 basic Reflex) in a 60-foot line. 2 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Greater Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6688)**: The flamethrower deals 6d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 28 basic Reflex) in a 90-foot line. 3 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n    \n*   **[Major Alchemist's Fire](link_item_6690)**: The flamethrower deals 10d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) (DC 37 basic Reflex) in a 120-foot line. 4 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11691,"type":"item","before":{"id":11691,"bulk":"1","name":"Alchemist's Haversack","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8377724879784881","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn backpack","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1527,1559],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{"ignored":50,"capacity":50,"held_or_stowed":1},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4837","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"crafting","predicate":["alchemical"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:43.510955+00:00","operations":[{"id":"b5fb99d6-9c68-419a-8fb6-ec38ff9f35c8","data":{"text":"to create alchemical items","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"An _[alchemist's haversack](link_item_11691)_ is a sturdy leather [backpack](link_item_6728) with two compartments. The main section contains an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space equivalent to a [spacious pouch type II](link_item_7794), perfect for carrying bulkier alchemist equipment. A secondary partition can hold 2 Bulk of items, 1 of which doesn't count against your Bulk limit. This second compartment can also be activated (see below).\n\nTwo shoulder straps and a thick belt for the waist hold the haversack on the wearer securely. These straps have pouches and loops for keeping [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items handy. They also contain magically expanded [alchemist's tools](link_item_6694) that grant you a +2 item bonus to Crafting checks to create [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\nWater and undesirable material can't seep into the haversack, which cleans itself once per hour. When you reach in any part of the haversack, the item you sought is the first one you find. Also, the haversack preserves mundane ingredients, food, and drink inside, so they stay fresh indefinitely. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [magic](link_trait_1504) or [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You can create [versatile vials](link_item_15516); **Effect** You pull a [versatile vial](link_item_15516) from the satchel’s secondary compartment. It’s as effective as the vials you create at the start of the day, not limited like ones created using [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an [alchemist](link_class_107)."},"after":{"id":11691,"bulk":"1","name":"Alchemist's Haversack","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8377724879784881","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn backpack","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1527,1559],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{"ignored":50,"capacity":50,"held_or_stowed":1},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4837","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"crafting","predicate":["alchemical"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:43.510955+00:00","operations":[{"id":"b5fb99d6-9c68-419a-8fb6-ec38ff9f35c8","data":{"text":"to create alchemical items","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"An _[alchemist's haversack](link_item_11691)_ is a sturdy leather [backpack](link_item_6728) with two compartments. The main section contains an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space equivalent to a [spacious pouch type II](link_item_7794), perfect for carrying bulkier alchemist equipment. A secondary partition can hold 2 Bulk of items, 1 of which doesn't count against your Bulk limit. This second compartment can also be activated (see below).\n\nTwo shoulder straps and a thick belt for the waist hold the haversack on the wearer securely. These straps have pouches and loops for keeping [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items handy. They also contain magically expanded [alchemist's tools](link_item_6694) that grant you a +2 item bonus to Crafting checks to create [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\nWater and undesirable material can't seep into the haversack, which cleans itself once per hour. When you reach in any part of the haversack, the item you sought is the first one you find. Also, the haversack preserves mundane ingredients, food, and drink inside, so they stay fresh indefinitely. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [magic](link_trait_1504) or [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You can create [versatile vials](link_item_15516); **Effect** You pull a [versatile vial](link_item_15516) from the satchel’s secondary compartment. It’s as effective as the vials you create at the start of the day, not limited like ones created using [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an [alchemist](link_class_107)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11692,"type":"item","before":{"id":11692,"bulk":"1","name":"Alghollthu Whip","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2741172225029982","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":350,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1604,1571,1570,1573,1537],"v