ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [occult](link_trait_1514), [visual](link_trait_1479)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was a successful [Strike](link_action_19856), [Grapple](link_action_19725), or [Trip](link_action_19865) with the _[alghollthu whip](link_item_11692)_; **Effect** Patterns on the skin of the whip strobe in a rapid pulse. The creature your attack succeeded against must attempt a DC 23 Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn.\n\n**Failure** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn and stunned 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn and stunned 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a tentacle from an aqudel."},"after":{"id":11692,"bulk":"1","name":"Alghollthu Whip","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2741172225029982","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":350,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1604,1571,1570,1573,1537],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"whip","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7954,"bulk":"1","name":"Whip","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":7870079335596488,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"sp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1537,1570,1571,1573,1604],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":8,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":2,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":4},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:45:56.152243+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This long strand of thick leather, often braided, delivers a painful but nonlethal slash at a distance, usually accompanied by a distinctive cracking sound.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1881","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"35"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:45.334848+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This fleshy [_+1_](link_item_7950) [_striking_](link_item_7862) [_whip_](link_item_7954) is obviously crafted from the tentacle of some fearsome beast, likely an aqudel, and constantly strobes with small patterns of light.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [occult](link_trait_1514), [visual](link_trait_1479)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was a successful [Strike](link_action_19856), [Grapple](link_action_19725), or [Trip](link_action_19865) with the _[alghollthu whip](link_item_11692)_; **Effect** Patterns on the skin of the whip strobe in a rapid pulse. The creature your attack succeeded against must attempt a DC 23 Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn.\n\n**Failure** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn and stunned 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is dazzled until the end of your next turn and stunned 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a tentacle from an aqudel."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11693,"type":"item","before":{"id":11693,"bulk":"2","name":"Alicorn Lance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"148021337601210","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1852,1649,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"spear","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"1 holy spirit","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4415","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"36"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","value":1,"selector":"{item|_id}-damage","damageType":"spirit"},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":40,"color":"#9b7337","bright":20,"shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"torch","speed":1,"intensity":4}},"predicate":["lit-alicorn-lance"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitAlicornLance","domain":"all","option":"lit-alicorn-lance","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/lance.webp","predicate":["lit-alicorn-lance"]}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"lance","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7065,"bulk":"2","name":"Lance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":657943437620199,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1852,1649,1573],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"spear","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:21:11.277009+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [spear](link_item_7797)\\-like weapon is used by a mounted creature to deal a great deal of damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:46.581967+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This white [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [lance](link_item_7065) is made from the horn of a [unicorn](link_creature_10352), willingly granted at the end of its lifetime. [Strikes](link_action_19856) made with this lance gain the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait and deal an additional 1 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage on successful attacks. You can make the lance glow like a [torch](link_item_7899) or suppress its light by using an action, which has the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([magical](link_trait_1504), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You evoke the spirit of the [unicorn](link_creature_10352) that donated the _[alicorn lance](link_item_11693)_'s horn, which you ride in a shining charge. Move up to twice your Speed and make a [Strike](link_action_19856) with the _[alicorn lance](link_item_11693)_; you gain the effects of the lance's [jousting](link_trait_2748) trait on this [Strike](link_action_19856). If you were already mounted when you Activate the horn, the [unicorn](link_creature_10352) spirit takes shape around your steed, granting it a +10–foot status bonus to its Speed for the charge.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a horn willingly gifted by a [unicorn](link_creature_10352). In rare instances, an [alicorn lance](link_item_11693) can be made with a forcibly taken horn. However, this heinous act pollutes the horn’s magic, causing it to glow with a sickly red light; remove the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait, add the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait to [Strikes](link_action_19856) instead of the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait, and make the [unicorn](link_creature_10352) spirit evoked in the charge whinny visibly in pain."},"after":{"id":11693,"bulk":"2","name":"Alicorn Lance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"148021337601210","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1852,1649,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"spear","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"1 holy spirit","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4415","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"36"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","value":1,"selector":"{item|_id}-damage","damageType":"spirit"},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":40,"color":"#9b7337","bright":20,"shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"torch","speed":1,"intensity":4}},"predicate":["lit-alicorn-lance"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitAlicornLance","domain":"all","option":"lit-alicorn-lance","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"systems/pf2e/icons/equipment/weapons/lance.webp","predicate":["lit-alicorn-lance"]}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"lance","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7065,"bulk":"2","name":"Lance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":657943437620199,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usa