e horn, the [unicorn](link_creature_10352) spirit takes shape around your steed, granting it a +10–foot status bonus to its Speed for the charge.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a horn willingly gifted by a [unicorn](link_creature_10352). In rare instances, an [alicorn lance](link_item_11693) can be made with a forcibly taken horn. However, this heinous act pollutes the horn’s magic, causing it to glow with a sickly red light; remove the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait, add the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait to [Strikes](link_action_19856) instead of the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait, and make the [unicorn](link_creature_10352) spirit evoked in the charge whinny visibly in pain."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11694,"type":"item","before":{"id":11694,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Amazing Pop-up Book","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3837764407163689","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4704","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"110"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:47.643323+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Goblin](link_trait_1468) [wizards](link_class_26) invented the _[amazing pop-up book](link_item_11694)_ to store their spells without written words, though the tradition has been spreading to illusionists from other cultures. These [grimoires](link_trait_2855) have colorful covers and open to reveal three-dimensional scenes illustrating various spells. [Goblins](link_trait_1468) delight in constructing the books just right so a terrifying creature, like a horse or dog, pops up toward the reader each time a page is turned.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** If your next action is to cast an [illusion](link_trait_1447) spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855) that creates illusory terrain or creatures, such as *[mirage](link_spell_4726)*, you draw forth the pop-up scene. If a creature succeeds, but doesn't critically succeed, at a saving throw to disbelieve the [illusion](link_trait_1447), then just as their mind recognizes the [illusion](link_trait_1447), a startling—though obviously false—[illusion](link_trait_1447) pops up somewhere unexpected in their field of vision, visible to only them, dealing [mental](link_trait_1448) damage equal to the spell's rank.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11694,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Amazing Pop-up Book","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3837764407163689","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4704","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"110"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:47.643323+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Goblin](link_trait_1468) [wizards](link_class_26) invented the _[amazing pop-up book](link_item_11694)_ to store their spells without written words, though the tradition has been spreading to illusionists from other cultures. These [grimoires](link_trait_2855) have colorful covers and open to reveal three-dimensional scenes illustrating various spells. [Goblins](link_trait_1468) delight in constructing the books just right so a terrifying creature, like a horse or dog, pops up toward the reader each time a page is turned.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** If your next action is to cast an [illusion](link_trait_1447) spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855) that creates illusory terrain or creatures, such as *[mirage](link_spell_4726)*, you draw forth the pop-up scene. If a creature succeeds, but doesn't critically succeed, at a saving throw to disbelieve the [illusion](link_trait_1447), then just as their mind recognizes the [illusion](link_trait_1447), a startling—though obviously false—[illusion](link_trait_1447) pops up somewhere unexpected in their field of vision, visible to only them, dealing [mental](link_trait_1448) damage equal to the spell's rank.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11695,"type":"item","before":{"id":11695,"bulk":"0","name":"Amnemonic Charm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7447324990267705","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":140},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4629","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:48.604459+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You fail or critically fail a Deception, Diplomacy, or Intimidation check to [Coerce](link_action_19613), [Lie](link_action_19737), [Make an Impression](link_action_19739), or [Request](link_action_19844); **Requirements** You're a master in the skill you failed with.\n\nThis ornate locket, usually containing a faceless, [humanoid](link_trait_2399) portrait, is typically worn on a chain around the neck or attached to your clothing. When activated, the charm casts a DC 26 [_rewrite memory_](link_spell_4808) spell against a single target of the check, removing all memory of your failed attempt and potentially allowing you to make another attempt. The effect can't remove more than 3 minutes of memories from its target.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11695,"bulk":"0","name":"Amnemonic Charm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7447324990267705","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":140},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4629","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:48.604459+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You fail or critically fail a Deception, Diplomacy, or Intimidation check to [Coerce](link_action_19613), [Lie](link_action_19737), [Make an Impression](link_action_19739), or [Request](link_action_19844); **Requirements** You're a master in the skill you failed with.\n\nThis ornate locket, usually containing a faceless, [humanoid](link_trait_2399) portrait, is typically worn on a chain around the neck or attached to your clothing. When activated, the charm casts a DC 26 [_rewrite memory_](link_spell_4808) spell against a single target of the check, removing all memory of your failed attempt and potentially allowing you to make another attempt. The effect can't remove more than 3 minutes of memories from its target.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11696,"type":"item","before":{"id":11696,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Amulet of the Third Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8545288026709121","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4665","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"102"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"perception"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T06:03:50.541Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:49.330343+00:00","operations":[{"id":"13923fa3-2df4-4f76-96af-d692afd60ad3","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":2,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"82d5f011-36b4-4f02-8b3c-8777f543649d","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"8fc0a98d-19f0-4bfc-aa93-c1e1d4ddb0a9","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":{"value":0,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"d796d121-87ae-4517-9189-d988f1d4b2c7","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"2d958fbe-7678-491e-9598-985fd1deb0e5","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"29cd408a-d3c4-4968-a36e-f16ddc4fcb60","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This large brass medallion hangs low on the torso. It's shaped in the form of an unblinking eye, with a ring of turquoise as the iris and an orb of jet serving as the pupil. The amulet grants you a +2 item bonus to Perception checks. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the amulet, you either increase your Wisdom modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[truesight](link_spell_4912)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11696,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Amulet of the Third Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8545288026709121","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4665","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"102"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"perception"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T06:03:50.541Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:49.330343+00:00","operations":[{"id":"13923fa3-2df4-4f76-96af-d692afd60ad3","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":2,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"82d5f011-36b4-4f02-8b3c-8777f543649d","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"8fc0a98d-19f0-4bfc-aa93-c1e1d4ddb0a9","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":{"value":0,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"d796d121-87ae-4517-9189-d988f1d4b2c7","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"2d958fbe-7678-491e-9598-985fd1deb0e5","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"29cd408a-d3c4-4968-a36e-f16ddc4fcb60","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This large brass medallion hangs low on the torso. It's shaped in the form of an unblinking eye, with a ring of turquoise as the iris and an orb of jet serving as the pupil. The amulet grants you a +2 item bonus to Perception checks. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the amulet, you either increase your Wisdom modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[truesight](link_spell_4912)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11697,"type":"item","before":{"id":11697,"bulk":"0","name":"Anathema Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3723130937066782","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"affixed to the ground in four spaces along a circle with a 20-foot radius","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4562","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"76"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:50.274929+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 hour\n\nFirst used by celestial-touched [nephilim](link_trait_1451) of Tianjing to weaken [qlippoth](link_trait_2418), an [anathema fulu](link_item_11697) comes in four pieces, one placed in each cardinal direction. Choose one of the following traits when activating the fulus: [celestial](link_trait_2404), [elemental](link_trait_2406), [fey](link_trait_2021), [fiend](link_trait_2415), [monitor](link_trait_2408), or [undead](link_trait_2425). If a creature with that trait starts its turn in the area, it must succeed at a DC 30 Fortitude saving throw or become sickened 2 until the start of its next turn. On a critical success, the creature becomes temporarily immune to any _[anathema fulus](link_item_11697)_ for 1 hour. Regardless of the save result, if you subsequently cast *[banishment](link_spell_4410)* on such a creature in the area, the creature takes the –2 penalty described in that spell for adding a special cost of an object that's anathema to that creature. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) acts as that object; you don't need to add it. If a creature affected by this penalty rolls a saving throw against *[banishment](link_spell_4410)*, the caster can use a free action to force the result one step lower. Doing so burns the whole [fulu](link_trait_2854) out, ending the effect. If any of the [fulu](link_trait_2854)'s pieces are moved or destroyed after activation, the effect ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11697,"bulk":"0","name":"Anathema Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3723130937066782","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"affixed to the ground in four spaces along a circle with a 20-foot radius","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4562","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"76"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:50.274929+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 hour\n\nFirst used by celestial-touched [nephilim](link_trait_1451) of Tianjing to weaken [qlippoth](link_trait_2418), an [anathema fulu](link_item_11697) comes in four pieces, one placed in each cardinal direction. Choose one of the following traits when activating the fulus: [celestial](link_trait_2404), [elemental](link_trait_2406), [fey](link_trait_2021), [fiend](link_trait_2415), [monitor](link_trait_2408), or [undead](link_trait_2425). If a creature with that trait starts its turn in the area, it must succeed at a DC 30 Fortitude saving throw or become sickened 2 until the start of its next turn. On a critical success, the creature becomes temporarily immune to any _[anathema fulus](link_item_11697)_ for 1 hour. Regardless of the save result, if you subsequently cast *[banishment](link_spell_4410)* on such a creature in the area, the creature takes the –2 penalty described in that spell for adding a special cost of an object that's anathema to that creature. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) acts as that object; you don't need to add it. If a creature affected by this penalty rolls a saving throw against *[banishment](link_spell_4410)*, the caster can use a free action to force the result one step lower. Doing so burns the whole [fulu](link_trait_2854) out, ending the effect. If any of the [fulu](link_trait_2854)'s pieces are moved or destroyed after activation, the effect ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11698,"type":"item","before":{"id":11698,"bulk":"0","name":"Ancestral Geometry","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6283919857367495","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4736","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:52.313391+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Geometric precision and perfect angles signify that an artist with exemplary knowledge of [dwarven](link_trait_1467) tattooing traditions created this body art. Your family's ancestral stories, recited throughout the tattooing process, bind your blood even tighter to theirs. During your daily preparations, you manifest a visitation by an ancestor—possibly via a dream, a vision, or a [magical](link_trait_1504) trinket left by your bedroll. Roll 2d20 and record the highest result. Then roll 1d6 and note a type of saving throw: 1–2 Fortitude, 3–4 Reflex, and 5–6 Will.\n\nIn addition, until the next visitation, you gain a +1 item bonus to one Lore skill related to the ancestor, as determined by the GM. Usually, the ancestor provides a kind of knowledge they believe you'll need. For [dwarven](link_trait_1467) ancestors, the Lore skill is usually Architecture Lore, Engineering Lore, Genealogy Lore, Labor Lore, Mining Lore, Warfare Lore, or Lore about a [dwarven](link_trait_1467) deity.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You rolled a saving throw of the noted type; **Effect** Replace the roll with the d20 roll from your ancestor's visitation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11698,"bulk":"0","name":"Ancestral Geometry","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6283919857367495","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4736","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:52.313391+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Geometric precision and perfect angles signify that an artist with exemplary knowledge of [dwarven](link_trait_1467) tattooing traditions created this body art. Your family's ancestral stories, recited throughout the tattooing process, bind your blood even tighter to theirs. During your daily preparations, you manifest a visitation by an ancestor—possibly via a dream, a vision, or a [magical](link_trait_1504) trinket left by your bedroll. Roll 2d20 and record the highest result. Then roll 1d6 and note a type of saving throw: 1–2 Fortitude, 3–4 Reflex, and 5–6 Will.\n\nIn addition, until the next visitation, you gain a +1 item bonus to one Lore skill related to the ancestor, as determined by the GM. Usually, the ancestor provides a kind of knowledge they believe you'll need. For [dwarven](link_trait_1467) ancestors, the Lore skill is usually Architecture Lore, Engineering Lore, Genealogy Lore, Labor Lore, Mining Lore, Warfare Lore, or Lore about a [dwarven](link_trait_1467) deity.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You rolled a saving throw of the noted type; **Effect** Replace the roll with the d20 roll from your ancestor's visitation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11699,"type":"item","before":{"id":11699,"bulk":"1","name":"Anchor of Aquatic Exploration","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6697613802086631","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":690},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4720","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"114"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:52.851771+00:00","operations":null,"description":"No matter how often it's washed, the last crystals of salt rime never quite leave this pitted anchor. When you're holding the _[anchor of aquatic exploration](link_item_11699)_, you can breathe underwater; however, you can't [Swim](link_action_19859), losing any [Swim](link_action_19859) speed you have, automatically failing any Athletics checks to [Swim](link_action_19859), and so on. Instead, when you enter a body of water, you sink to the bottom at a rate of 25 feet per round and can move across the bottom at your normal Speed. You're protected from environmental effects of deep water such as pressure, cold temperatures, and any negative consequences of depressurization.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're underwater; **Effect** You spend one minute digging the anchor into the seabed, after which the anchor casts a [_cozy cabin_](link_spell_4541) spell, summoning a sunken ship instead of a cabin. The sunken ship is filled with breathable air.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11699,"bulk":"1","name":"Anchor of Aquatic Exploration","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6697613802086631","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":690},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4720","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"114"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:52.851771+00:00","operations":null,"description":"No matter how often it's washed, the last crystals of salt rime never quite leave this pitted anchor. When you're holding the _[anchor of aquatic exploration](link_item_11699)_, you can breathe underwater; however, you can't [Swim](link_action_19859), losing any [Swim](link_action_19859) speed you have, automatically failing any Athletics checks to [Swim](link_action_19859), and so on. Instead, when you enter a body of water, you sink to the bottom at a rate of 25 feet per round and can move across the bottom at your normal Speed. You're protected from environmental effects of deep water such as pressure, cold temperatures, and any negative consequences of depressurization.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're underwater; **Effect** You spend one minute digging the anchor into the seabed, after which the anchor casts a [_cozy cabin_](link_spell_4541) spell, summoning a sunken ship instead of a cabin. The sunken ship is filled with breathable air.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11700,"type":"item","before":{"id":11700,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Animal Repellent (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4339739109574905","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4469","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:09:12.802Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:53.865814+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Animal repellent](link_item_11700) is a noxious [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance that makes you repulsive to a certain kind of [animal](link_trait_2409). You can, for example, make ape repellent, bear repellent, or snake repellent, but not a repellent that affects all [animals](link_trait_2409). The repellent doesn't work on creatures that are similar to the kind of [animal](link_trait_2409), but not actually [animals](link_trait_2409)—for example, bear repellent wouldn't work on [werebears](link_trait_2471). [Animal repellent](link_item_11700) is ineffective against [animals](link_trait_2409) with an Intelligence modifier of –3 or higher, such as [awakened animals](link_spell_4408). When you initially learn the formula for [animal repellent](link_item_11700), you learn the formulas for all common [animals](link_trait_2409). If no [animals](link_trait_2409) of a kind are common, such as [sea serpents](link_creature_10285), you must learn the formula for that kind separately, and it has the same rarity as the least-rare creature of that kind.\n\nYou Activate [animal repellent](link_item_11700) by sprinkling it on yourself or a creature within reach, or by spreading it on a surface in an area up to 10 feet square. The repellent lasts for 24 hours or until scrubbed clean with 1 minute of work (consisting of multiple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions). The designated kind of [animal](link_trait_2409) can smell the repellent from three times as far away as normal.\n\nThe designated kind of creature typically avoids the coated creature or area, which smells foul and feels unnerving to it. If in combat or otherwise distressed, the creature can approach within 20 feet of the affected creature or area only if it succeeds at a Will save with a DC determined by the type of [animal repellent](link_item_11700). Once it succeeds at this save, the [animal](link_trait_2409) is temporarily immune for 1 minute. If the [animal](link_trait_2409) attacks in a way that causes it to taste or ingest the repellent, it must succeed at a Fortitude 29 save or become sickened 1 (or sickened 2 on a critical failure).\n\nThe DC for saves is 29.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11700,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Animal Repellent (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4339739109574905","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4469","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:09:12.802Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:53.865814+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Animal repellent](link_item_11700) is a noxious [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance that makes you repulsive to a certain kind of [animal](link_trait_2409). You can, for example, make ape repellent, bear repellent, or snake repellent, but not a repellent that affects all [animals](link_trait_2409). The repellent doesn't work on creatures that are similar to the kind of [animal](link_trait_2409), but not actually [animals](link_trait_2409)—for example, bear repellent wouldn't work on [werebears](link_trait_2471). [Animal repellent](link_item_11700) is ineffective against [animals](link_trait_2409) with an Intelligence modifier of –3 or higher, such as [awakened animals](link_spell_4408). When you initially learn the formula for [animal repellent](link_item_11700), you learn the formulas for all common [animals](link_trait_2409). If no [animals](link_trait_2409) of a kind are common, such as [sea serpents](link_creature_10285), you must learn the formula for that kind separately, and it has the same rarity as the least-rare creature of that kind.\n\nYou Activate [animal repellent](link_item_11700) by sprinkling it on yourself or a creature within reach, or by spreading it on a surface in an area up to 10 feet square. The repellent lasts for 24 hours or until scrubbed clean with 1 minute of work (consisting of multiple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions). The designated kind of [animal](link_trait_2409) can smell the repellent from three times as far away as normal.\n\nThe designated kind of creature typically avoids the coated creature or area, which smells foul and feels unnerving to it. If in combat or otherwise distressed, the creature can approach within 20 feet of the affected creature or area only if it succeeds at a Will save with a DC determined by the type of [animal repellent](link_item_11700). Once it succeeds at this save, the [animal](link_trait_2409) is temporarily immune for 1 minute. If the [animal](link_trait_2409) attacks in a way that causes it to taste or ingest the repellent, it must succeed at a Fortitude 29 save or become sickened 1 (or sickened 2 on a critical failure).\n\nThe DC for saves is 29.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11701,"type":"item","before":{"id":11701,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Animal Repellent (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"809096620460907","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4469","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:54.655583+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Animal repellent](link_item_11701) is a noxious [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance that makes you repulsive to a certain kind of [animal](link_trait_2409). You can, for example, make ape repellent, bear repellent, or snake repellent, but not a repellent that affects all [animals](link_trait_2409). The repellent doesn't work on creatures that are similar to the kind of [animal](link_trait_2409), but not actually [animals](link_trait_2409)—for example, bear repellent wouldn't work on [werebears](link_trait_2471). [Animal repellent](link_item_11701) is ineffective against [animals](link_trait_2409) with an Intelligence modifier of –3 or higher, such as [awakened animals](link_spell_4408). When you initially learn the formula for [animal repellent](link_item_11701), you learn the formulas for all common [animals](link_trait_2409). If no [animals](link_trait_2409) of a kind are common, such as [sea serpents](link_creature_10285), you must learn the formula for that kind separately, and it has the same rarity as the least-rare creature of that kind.\n\nYou Activate [animal repellent](link_item_11701) by sprinkling it on yourself or a creature within reach, or by spreading it on a surface in an area up to 10 feet square. The repellent lasts for 24 hours or until scrubbed clean with 1 minute of work (consisting of multiple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions). The designated kind of [animal](link_trait_2409) can smell the repellent from three times as far away as normal.\n\nThe designated kind of creature typically avoids the coated creature or area, which smells foul and feels unnerving to it. If in combat or otherwise distressed, the creature can approach within 20 feet of the affected creature or area only if it succeeds at a Will save with a DC determined by the type of [animal repellent](link_item_11701). Once it succeeds at this save, the [animal](link_trait_2409) is temporarily immune for 1 minute. If the [animal](link_trait_2409) attacks in a way that causes it to taste or ingest the repellent, it must succeed at a Fortitude 18 save or become sickened 1 (or sickened 2 on a critical failure).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11701,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Animal Repellent (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"809096620460907","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4469","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:54.655583+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Animal repellent](link_item_11701) is a noxious [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance that makes you repulsive to a certain kind of [animal](link_trait_2409). You can, for example, make ape repellent, bear repellent, or snake repellent, but not a repellent that affects all [animals](link_trait_2409). The repellent doesn't work on creatures that are similar to the kind of [animal](link_trait_2409), but not actually [animals](link_trait_2409)—for example, bear repellent wouldn't work on [werebears](link_trait_2471). [Animal repellent](link_item_11701) is ineffective against [animals](link_trait_2409) with an Intelligence modifier of –3 or higher, such as [awakened animals](link_spell_4408). When you initially learn the formula for [animal repellent](link_item_11701), you learn the formulas for all common [animals](link_trait_2409). If no [animals](link_trait_2409) of a kind are common, such as [sea serpents](link_creature_10285), you must learn the formula for that kind separately, and it has the same rarity as the least-rare creature of that kind.\n\nYou Activate [animal repellent](link_item_11701) by sprinkling it on yourself or a creature within reach, or by spreading it on a surface in an area up to 10 feet square. The repellent lasts for 24 hours or until scrubbed clean with 1 minute of work (consisting of multiple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions). The designated kind of [animal](link_trait_2409) can smell the repellent from three times as far away as normal.\n\nThe designated kind of creature typically avoids the coated creature or area, which smells foul and feels unnerving to it. If in combat or otherwise distressed, the creature can approach within 20 feet of the affected creature or area only if it succeeds at a Will save with a DC determined by the type of [animal repellent](link_item_11701). Once it succeeds at this save, the [animal](link_trait_2409) is temporarily immune for 1 minute. If the [animal](link_trait_2409) attacks in a way that causes it to taste or ingest the repellent, it must succeed at a Fortitude 18 save or become sickened 1 (or sickened 2 on a critical failure).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11702,"type":"item","before":{"id":11702,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Animal Repellent (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3761934317362367","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4469","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_