)\n\nPrepared from brown mold, this liquid oscillates between rapidly absorbing and releasing heat from its victim. Each round the type of damage dealt by this [poison](link_trait_1476) changes, starting with [cold](link_trait_1519), then [fire](link_trait_1542), then [cold](link_trait_1519), and so on. If the victim of this [poison](link_trait_1476) takes [cold](link_trait_1519) damage from a source other than the oil, reduce the save DC to 22 for 1 round. If the victim takes [fire](link_trait_1542) damage from a source other than the oil, increase the save DC to 25 for 1 round.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 24 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** 2d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (1 round); **Stage 2** 3d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11706,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Antipode Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4413207533704791","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":45},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476,1567],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4522","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"67"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:12:21.228Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:58.721159+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nPrepared from brown mold, this liquid oscillates between rapidly absorbing and releasing heat from its victim. Each round the type of damage dealt by this [poison](link_trait_1476) changes, starting with [cold](link_trait_1519), then [fire](link_trait_1542), then [cold](link_trait_1519), and so on. If the victim of this [poison](link_trait_1476) takes [cold](link_trait_1519) damage from a source other than the oil, reduce the save DC to 22 for 1 round. If the victim takes [fire](link_trait_1542) damage from a source other than the oil, increase the save DC to 25 for 1 round.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 24 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** 2d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (1 round); **Stage 2** 3d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11707,"type":"item","before":{"id":11707,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Apparition Gloves","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1199845434955862","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"worn gloves","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1447],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4699","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"109"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:12:59.609106+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This set of gloves translates whatever the wearer says into the signed version of that language by projecting a ghostly, translucent version of the wearer's hands in front of them. The apparition is a purely visual [illusion](link_trait_1447) used for communication, so it can't move on its own, nor can it hold or manipulate objects, or attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11707,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Apparition Gloves","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1199845434955862","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"g