e charms reappear on the bracelet. The weapon and ammunition created with the charm are noticeably different from others and can't be sold.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11719,"type":"item","before":{"id":11719,"bulk":"0","name":"Artificer Spectacles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4480137888749791","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn eyeglasses","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4667","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"102"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"crafting"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Artificer Spectacles (Identify Magic)","value":3,"selector":"skill-check","predicate":["action:identify-magic"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:10.042907+00:00","operations":[{"id":"2ecfd812-e5a0-44b4-bc02-1ea05de5f7aa","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"0bcffd1f-79a0-46cb-8b76-4b1c0614a110","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_INT","type":"attr","value":{"value":6,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_INT","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"818ef124-9332-4faf-a7d3-2b78608d6bb0","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_INT"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"9109359c-78f6-486e-8648-ea44864b6d8e","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_INT"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"86c35e27-be82-4c0d-a097-a6fb72ab03a5","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_INT"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"},{"id":"dffb66df-be2c-4cbb-aa98-7434729601e0","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"3","variable":"SKILL_CRAFTING"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"e61091cc-9b48-4ef5-b308-20d0e578cbcf","data":{"id":19730,"text":"**Artificer Spectacles** You gain a +3 item bonus to any skill check made to Identify Magic.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"These seemingly ordinary rectangular eyeglasses feature clear lenses framed in copper. When invested and worn, they rest perfectly on the bridge of the nose and can only be removed by the wearer. You gain a +3 item bonus to Crafting checks and any skill check made to [Identify Magic](link_action_19730). When you [invest](link_action_20775) the spectacles, you either increase your Intelligence modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value. You must select the skills and languages the first time you [Invest](link_action_20775) the item, and whenever you [Invest](link_action_20775) the same [artificer spectacles](link_item_11719), you get the same skills and languages you chose the first time.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You cast a 3rd-rank *[mending](link_spell_4719)* spell on an item you touch.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11719,"bulk":"0","name":"Artificer Spectacles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4480137888749791","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn eyeglasses","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4667","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"102"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"crafting"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":