23,"bulk":"1","name":"Atlatl","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":7514233690502621,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":2},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1579],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"dart","range":60,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"atlatl","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:12.955894+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Atlatls are long, narrow pieces of shaped wood or antler used as levers to hurl darts faster and farther than would otherwise be possible. An atlatl uses darts as ammunition.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:12.955894+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Darts](link_item_6862)\n\n* * *\n\n[Atlatls](link_item_11723) are long, narrow pieces of shaped wood or antler used as levers to hurl [darts](link_item_6862) faster and farther than would otherwise be possible. An [atlatl](link_item_11723) uses [darts](link_item_6862) as ammunition.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11724,"type":"item","before":{"id":11724,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Auric Noodles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3353655749632580","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4442","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:15.159809+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Auric noodles](link_item_11724) are boiled, then pan-fried and tossed with sliced vegetables and a sticky, savory sauce incorporating [alchemical](link_trait_1529) reagents. After you eat the noodles, they boost your ability to sense magic for 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first. You gain a +1 item bonus to checks to [Identify Magic](link_action_19730), and you can move at full speed while using the [Detect Magic](link_action_21200) [exploration](link_trait_1457) activity.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11724,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Auric Noodles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3353655749632580","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4442","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:15.159809+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Auric noodles](link_item_11724) are boiled, then pan-fried and tossed with sliced vegetables and a sticky, savory sauce incorporating [alchemical](link_trait_1529) reagents. After you eat the noodles, they boost your ability to sense magic for 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first. You gain a +1 item bonus to checks to [Identify Magic](link_action_19730), and you can move at full speed while using the [Detect Magic](link_action_21200) [exploration](link_trait_1457) activity.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11725,"type":"item","before":{"id":11725,"bulk":"0","name":"Authorized","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4072182789056653","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4397","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"32"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:15.797864+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Sharp needles impale anyone who attempts to wield this weapon other than its rightful owner. Each _[authorized](link_item_11725)_ rune is etched with the blood of a specific creature. If any other creature wields the weapon, needles immediately erupt from the weapon’s hilt or shaft, dealing 1d8 piercing damage plus 1d4 persistent bleed damage to the wielder. If the weapon has a [_striking_](link_item_7862) rune, this damage increases to 1d8 per damage die and 1d4 persistent damage per damage die; this counts only the weapon’s base die and dice from the [_striking_](link_item_7862) rune. The persistent bleed damage can’t end while the creature still holds the weapon. The spikes retract once the creature lets go.\n\nWhen the rune is crafted, the crafter can choose to broaden the criteria for who can safely wield the item, expanding the users to creatures with a particular bloodline, patron deity, or sanctification, as the crafter chooses. This criterion must be shared by the creature who contributed the blood for the rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11725,"bulk":"0","name":"Authorized","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4072182789056653","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4397","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"32"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:15.797864+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Sharp needles impale anyone who attempts to wield this weapon other than its rightful owner. Each _[authorized](link_item_11725)_ rune is etched with the blood of a specific creature. If any other creature wields the weapon, needles immediately erupt from the weapon’s hilt or shaft, dealing 1d8 piercing damage plus 1d4 persistent bleed damage to the wielder. If the weapon has a [_striking_](link_item_7862) rune, this damage increases to 1d8 per damage die and 1d4 persistent damage per damage die; this counts only the weapon’s base die and dice from the [_striking_](link_item_7862) rune. The persistent bleed damage can’t end while the creature still holds the weapon. The spikes retract once the creature lets go.\n\nWhen the rune is crafted, the crafter can choose to broaden the criteria for who can safely wield the item, expanding the users to creatures with a particular bloodline, patron deity, or sanctification, as the crafter chooses. This criterion must be shared by the creature who contributed the blood for the rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11726,"type":"item","before":{"id":11726,"bulk":"1","name":"Autumn's Embrace","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3907058889255350","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7052,"name":"Invisibility","rune":{"id":7052,"bulk":"0","name":"Invisibility","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1312161067029585,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"etched onto light armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:18:53.01583+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Light seems to partially penetrate this armor.\n\n**Activate—Go Invisible** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** Once per day\n\n**Effect** With a thought, you become invisible for 1 minute, gaining the effects of a 2nd-rank *[invisibility](link_spell_4689)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of [invisibility](link_spell_4689)."}}],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4373","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"14"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":12147,"bulk":"1","name":"Leaf Weave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":693254247930899,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:21.462176+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Specialized crafters, often elves, create leaf weave out of sturdy leaves from ancient or magically enriched trees. Such leaves, when treated properly, have the strength of leather, and other tough plant materials hold the leaves together to form the armor. Such suits are popular among those who wish to avoid materials taken from slain beasts. As a material, leaf weave has the same statistics as thin wood.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:17.56835+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Woven by [fey](link_trait_2021) seamstresses as rewards for servants of nature, countless leaves continually changing colors in autumnal hues comprise _[autumn's embrace](link_item_11726)_, a suit of [_+2_](link_item_6720) [_invisibility_](link_item_7052) [_resilient_](link_item_7703) [_leaf weave_](link_item_12147). Leaves shed from the armor as they might fall in autumn. When activating the armor's _[invisibility](link_item_7052)_ property rune, you disappear in a swirl of colorful leaves.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([aura](link_trait_1492), [concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You call forth a storm of leaves from _[autumn's embrace](link_item_11726)_. These leaves swirl in a 20-foot emanation for 1 minute. Creatures within the area are concealed, and creatures outside the area are concealed to creatures within the leaves. However, you can see through this concealment. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11726,"bulk":"1","name":"Autumn's Embrace","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3907058889255350","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7052,"name":"Invisibility","rune":{"id":7052,"bulk":"0","name":"Invisibility","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1312161067029585,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"etched onto light armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:18:53.01583+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Light seems to partially penetrate this armor.\n\n**Activate—Go Invisible** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** Once per day\n\n**Effect** With a thought, you become invisible for 1 minute, gaining the effects of a 2nd-rank *[invisibility](link_spell_4689)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requir