ession of a rockslide. You gain a +3 item bonus to Athletics checks and a +2 circumstance bonus to [Force Open](link_action_19722) and [Shove](link_action_19849). When you [invest](link_action_20775) the boots, you either increase your Strength modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Trigger** You succeed or critically succeed with a [Shove](link_action_19849)\n\n**Effect** If the [Shove](link_action_19849) was a success, you push your opponent up to 10 feet instead of 5 feet. If the [Shove](link_action_19849) was a critical success, you push your opponent up to 20 feet, and you can then choose to knock them prone.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11727,"bulk":"1","name":"Avalanche Boots","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"925704570733986","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn shoes","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4668","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"102"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"athletics"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","label":"Avalanche Boots (Force Open or Shove)","value":2,"selector":"athletics","predicate":[{"or":["action:force-open","action:shove"]}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:18.145125+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While the insides of these boots are comfortable, fur-lined leather, the outsides are a jumble of slate plates, giving the impression of a rockslide. You gain a +3 item bonus to Athletics checks and a +2 circumstance bonus to [Force Open](