ull,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nMonster hunters favor [bane ammunition](link_item_11733) that contains a capsule of reagents tailored to a particular type of creature—[aberration](link_trait_2427), [animal](link_trait_2409), [beast](link_trait_2422), [dragon](link_trait_2402), [fey](link_trait_2021), [giant](link_trait_2431), [ooze](link_trait_2448), or both [fungus](link_trait_2445) and [plant](link_trait_1654). Each type requires a different formula. When activated [bane ammunition](link_item_11733) hits a target that has a trait matching the selected type, it takes 2d6 persistent [poison](link_trait_1476) damage in addition to the damage the attack normally deals.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11734,"type":"item","before":{"id":11734,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bane Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2220761048935518","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":12},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4601","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"86"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:24.302551+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Bane oil](link_item_11734) comes in as many forms as the [bane](link_item_23043) weapon property rune. Coating a weapon with the oil gives the weapon the benefit of one type of [Bane](link_item_23043) rune for 1 minute. A weapon can be coated in only one type of [bane oil](link_item_11734) at a time. Any new application of this oil supersedes any previous one. If a weapon has the [bane](link_item_23043) rune, this oil has no effect if it's of the same type as the rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11734,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bane Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2220761048935518","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":12},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4601","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"86"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:24.302551+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Bane oil](link_item_11734) comes in as many forms as the [bane](link_item_23043) weapon property rune. Coating a weapon with the oil gives the weapon the benefit of one type of [Bane](link_item_23043) rune for 1 minute. A weapon can be coated in only one type of [bane oil](link_item_11734) at a time. Any new application of this oil supersedes any previous one. If a weapon has the [bane](link_item_23043) rune, this oil has no effect if it's of the same type as the rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11735,"type":"item","before":{"id":11735,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bargainer's Instrument","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2939309921670122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4649","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:24.907057+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 1 hour ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA _[bargainer's instrument](link_item_11735)_ is a musical implement. The most typical version is a violin made from maple and spruce, its body stained so deep a purple it appears almost black. When activated, the instrument casts a [_binding circle_](link_spell_4412) ritual to conjure a willing extraplanar talent to compete with you in performance.\n\nThe contest could be a musical battle, a dance-off, an oratorical debate—the two of you could even use entirely different types of performance. The loser of the bout is magically bound to perform a task of the winner's choice within 1 week. The contest consists of taking turns to [Perform](link_action_19746), starting with your opponent. The Performance check's DC is the higher of the opponent's Perception DC or Will DC, though the two parties can mutually agree to use an impartial judge instead. The first to reach four successes wins, with each critical successes counting as two successes. If you play the _[bargainer's instrument](link_item_11735)_ as part of your performance, it grants you a +2 item bonus to the Performance checks.\n\nAfter the contest, the conjured creature can choose to return to where it came from or remain where you conjured it. The loser must endeavor to complete the task by all reasonable means within 1 week. Failing to complete it is shameful but has no further consequences. The instrument loses its magic and remains a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11735,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bargainer's Instrument","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2939309921670122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4649","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:24.907057+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 1 hour ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA _[bargainer's instrument](link_item_11735)_ is a musical implement. The most typical version is a violin made from maple and spruce, its body stained so deep a purple it appears almost black. When activated, the instrument casts a [_binding circle_](link_spell_4412) ritual to conjure a willing extraplanar talent to compete with you in performance.\n\nThe contest could be a musical battle, a dance-off, an oratorical debate—the two of you could even use entirely different types of performance. The loser of the bout is magically bound to perform a task of the winner's choice within 1 week. The contest consists of taking turns to [Perform](link_action_19746), starting with your opponent. The Performance check's DC is the higher of the opponent's Perception DC or Will DC, though the two parties can mutually agree to use an impartial judge instead. The first to reach four successes wins, with each critical successes counting as two successes. If you play the _[bargainer's instrument](link_item_11735)_ as part of your performance, it grants you a +2 item bonus to the Performance checks.\n\nAfter the contest, the conjured creature can choose to return to where it came from or remain where you conjured it. The loser must endeavor to complete the task by all reasonable means within 1 week. Failing to complete it is shameful but has no further consequences. The instrument loses its magic and remains a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11736,"type":"item","before":{"id":11736,"bulk":"3","name":"Barricade Buster","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7536122834906615","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":1,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2565,1461,2862,2863,2762],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":40,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d10","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"reload":"0","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=657","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"30"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:43:24.292Z"},"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:30.398911+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** [8-Round Magazine](link_item_17302)\n\n* * *\n\nDeveloped by a [dromaar](link_heritage_20733) inventor from Alkenstar who brought the technology north to battle the Whispering Tyrant alongside the [orc](link_trait_1461) hordes of Belkzen, the [barricade buster](link_item_11736) features eight barrels fixed around a central pivot attached to a handle and firing mechanism. A [barricade buster](link_item_11736) fires spheres of metal with extreme velocity and very little accuracy.","availabilit