te** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Requirements** You have the [Battle Medicine](link_feat_19946) action; **Effect** You use [Battle Medicine](link_feat_19946). The target is temporarily immune to your [Battle Medicine](link_feat_19946) for 1 hour instead of 1 day.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11743,"type":"item","before":{"id":11743,"bulk":"2","name":"Battle Saddle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3010727613045943","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":6},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1572,1562,2867],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"axe","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=608","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:40.433674+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The [battle saddle](link_item_11743) is a special saddle for a mount that has two large, winglike blades. These blades normally lie flat alongside the saddle, providing additional protection for the rider, but they can be deployed with a tug on the reins to slash at enemies adjacent to the mount. When using a [battle saddle](link_item_11743) to [parry](link_trait_1572), you can decide whether the circumstance bonus to AC applies to you or to your mount.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11743,"bulk":"2","name":"Battle Saddle","size":"MEDIUM","u