ared, you're affected by *[speak with animals](link_spell_4847)*. If you have [Animal Empathy](link_feat_19908), you gain a +1 circumstance bonus on checks using it.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n* **Cantrip** *[gouging claw](link_spell_4645)*\n* **1st** *[runic body](link_spell_4812)*, *[pest form](link_spell_4759)*\n* **2nd** *[animal form](link_spell_4396)*, *[enlarge](link_spell_4601)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11747,"type":"item","before":{"id":11747,"bulk":"0","name":"Beastmaster's Sigil (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1313886605470446","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4760","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"124"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":23}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:43.987549+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [silver](link_item_15062) disc displays an ever-changing etching of an [animal](link_trait_2409). When you affix the _[beastmaster's sigil](link_item_11747)_, the [animal](link_trait_2409) settles into a single form based on where you affix it, showing the [animal](link_trait_2409) the item can summon when affixed that way. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 23.\n\nA weapon can benefit from only the melee weapon benefit or ranged weapon benefit. A [thrown](link_trait_1575) melee weapon gets the melee weapon benefit, and a [combination](link_trait_3369) weapon gets only one benefit, which you choose when you affix the [spellheart](link_trait_2570). If it's unclear which one should apply, the GM decides.\n\n*   **Armor** The sigil grants you a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [poison](link_trait_1476).\n*   **Melee Weapon** The sigil grants you a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Trip](link_action_19865).\n*   **Ranged Weapon** If you critically hit with the affixed weapon, and the target is adjacent to a creature summoned with the sigil, the target takes 2d6 persistent bleed damage.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[tame](link_spell_9044)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 3rd-rank *[summon animal](link_spell_4866)* to summon a [giant monitor lizard](link_creature_10077) (armor), [boar](link_creature_9948) (melee), or [giant bat](link_creature_10068) (ranged).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11747,"bulk":"0","name":"Beastmaster's Sigil (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1313886605470446","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4760","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"124"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":23}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:43.987549+00:00","operations":