:{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:46.981303+00:00","operations":[{"id":"32a17396-8d62-42c3-aeeb-5e8fae32f993","data":{"text":"to your Perception DC when someone uses Deception against you.","type":"status","value":"-4","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"82b19837-96f8-4aaf-8db4-c34f84729752","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"0a247838-8ed1-4652-8a63-4cf7c89590ba","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":{"value":4,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"182df27e-2654-48de-9de5-6a99ceeaad7a","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"7bc03aea-cef1-4081-99f8-8f7477eda70a","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"6460087f-2b68-4067-a82e-2d6068ab7162","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"setValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This hugely massive crown is bedazzled with glimmering jewels and enchanted with powerful magics that make the gold seem to ripple and surge like strange glimmering tide pools. While uncomfortable to wear, the crown beguiles those within the wearer's presence. Creatures within 30 feet of you automatically improve their attitude toward you by one step (up to friendly). This doesn't prevent hostile creatures from attacking you, but it might give you a chance to talk to them before they strike. The dazzling nature of the crown makes it hard for you to read the intentions of others, and you take a –4 status penalty to your Perception DC when someone uses Deception against you. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the crown, you either increase your Charisma modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever is higher.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per round; **Effect** You're the subject of the *[sanctuary](link_spell_4816)* spell until the end of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** A creature succeeds at an attack roll against you; **Effect** The creature must succeed at a DC 41 Will save or the attack roll becomes a failure and the target is friendly to you until the end of its turn. On a critical failure, the target becomes friendly to you, drops to their knees, and begs your forgiveness for 1 minute or until another creature takes a hostile action against them.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460), [mental](link_trait_1448)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose one living creature within 30 feet of you. That creature must succeed at a DC 41 Will saving throw or become helpful to you for the next 24 hours. If they succeed, they become friendly to you for 1 hour. If they critically succeed they're immune to this effect for 1 year.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11751,"bulk":"2","name":"Beguiling Crown","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2286607542576290","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":80000},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4669","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:46.981303+00:00","operations":[{"id":"32a17396-8d62-42c3-aeeb-5e8fae32f993","data":{"text":"to your Perception DC when someone uses Deception against you.","type":"status","value":"-4","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"82b19837-96f8-4aaf-8db4-c34f84729752","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"0a247838-8ed1-4652-8a63-4cf7c89590ba","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":{"value":4,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"182df27e-2654-48de-9de5-6a99ceeaad7a","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"7bc03aea-cef1-4081-99f8-8f7477eda70a","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"adjValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"6460087f-2b68-4067-a82e-2d6068ab7162","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA"},"type":"setValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This hugely massive crown is bedazzled with glimmering jewels and enchanted with powerful magics that make the gold seem to ripple and surge like strange glimmering tide pools. While uncomfortable to wear, the crown beguiles those within the wearer's presence. Creatures within 30 feet of you automatically improve their attitude toward you by one step (up to friendly). This doesn't prevent hostile creatures from attacking you, but it might give you a chance to talk to them before they strike. The dazzling nature of the crown makes it hard for you to read the intentions of others, and you take a –4 status penalty to your Perception DC when someone uses Deception against you. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the crown, you either increase your Charisma modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever is higher.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per round; **Effect** You're the subject of the *[sanctuary](link_spell_4816)* spell until the end of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** A creature succeeds at an attack roll against you; **Effect** The creature must succeed at a DC 41 Will save or the attack roll becomes a failure and the target is friendly to you until the end of its turn. On a critical failure, the target becomes friendly to you, drops to their knees, and begs your forgiveness for 1 minute or until another creature takes a hostile action against them.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460), [mental](link_trait_1448)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose one living creature within 30 feet of you. That creature must succeed at a DC 41 Will saving throw or become helpful to you for the next 24 hours. If they succeed, they become friendly to you for 1 hour. If they critically succeed they're immune to this effect for 1 year.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11752,"type":"item","before":{"id":11752,"bulk":"1","name":"Bellflower Toolbelt","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"304242355217720","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"worn belt","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4840","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:17:44.263Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:47.537792+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Different versions of the [bellflower toolbelt](link_item_11752) are customized to appear to suit specific trades, so a belt used for carpentry would look different from a belt for baking.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You place an object of up to 1 Bulk into the belt, transforming that object into a tool befitting the trade for which the belt was created. Each object remains transformed until it has been removed from the belt for 24 hours or someone uses a single [Interact](link_action_19733) action to return it to its normal form. If enough transformed items are in it, the belt can be used as an [artisan's toolkit](link_item_6725) for that trade.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11752,"bulk":"1","name":"Bellflower Toolbelt","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"304242355217720","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"worn belt","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4840","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:17:44.263Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:47.537792+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Different versions of the [bellflower toolbelt](link_item_11752) are customized to appear to suit specific trades, so a belt used for carpentry would look different from a belt for baking.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You place an object of up to 1 Bulk into the belt, transforming that object into a tool befitting the trade for which the belt was created. Each object remains transformed until it has been removed from the belt for 24 hours or someone uses a single [Interact](link_action_19733) action to return it to its normal form. If enough transformed items are in it, the belt can be used as an [artisan's toolkit](link_item_6725) for that trade.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11753,"type":"item","before":{"id":11753,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bellicose Dagger","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4657521785505200","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1569,1558,1570,1504,1626,1837],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":7962,"name":"Wounding"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4903","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"190"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"dagger","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:48.783392+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The hilt of a [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) is etched with the word for \"war\" in various languages. Having absorbed the spirit of violence over the course of its existence, the weapon now craves bloodshed. A [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) is a _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [wounding](link_item_7962) [dagger](link_item_6854)_. However, anytime you interact with creatures, no matter the context, you must succeed at a DC 25 Will save or else find you have, as a reaction, drawn the dagger.\n\nWhen you use the [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) as a weapon for the first time, it fuses to you. While it's in your possession, you take a –2 circumstance penalty to Diplomacy checks and skill checks to avoid fighting, such as Deception checks to trick your way out of a scuffle or Stealth checks to sneak past enemies.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11753,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bellicose Dagger","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4657521785505200","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1569,1558,1570,1504,1626,1837],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":7962,"name":"Wounding"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4903","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"190"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"dagger","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:48.783392+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The hilt of a [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) is etched with the word for \"war\" in various languages. Having absorbed the spirit of violence over the course of its existence, the weapon now craves bloodshed. A [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) is a _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [wounding](link_item_7962) [dagger](link_item_6854)_. However, anytime you interact with creatures, no matter the context, you must succeed at a DC 25 Will save or else find you have, as a reaction, drawn the dagger.\n\nWhen you use the [bellicose dagger](link_item_11753) as a weapon for the first time, it fuses to you. While it's in your possession, you take a –2 circumstance penalty to Diplomacy checks and skill checks to avoid fighting, such as Deception checks to trick your way out of a scuffle or Stealth checks to sneak past enemies.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11754,"type":"item","before":{"id":11754,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bewildering Spellgun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8487086723973642","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":140},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1486,1504,1448,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4650","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:51.536216+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nWhen stared at, a _[bewildering spellgun](link_item_11754)_ seems to warp the space around it, creating a mind-bending sensation. Whispers of gibberish arise from it, making their way to nearby ears despite any other sounds in the area. You Activate the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This [spellgun](link_trait_2868) has a range increment of 15 feet. Once fired, the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) twists in your hand and melts away.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is confused for 1 minute.\n\n**Success** The target is confused for 1 minute but can attempt a DC 25 Will save at the end of each of its turns to end the effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11754,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bewildering Spellgun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8487086723973642","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":140},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1486,1504,1448,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4650","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:51.536216+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nWhen stared at, a _[bewildering spellgun](link_item_11754)_ seems to warp the space around it, creating a mind-bending sensation. Whispers of gibberish arise from it, making their way to nearby ears despite any other sounds in the area. You Activate the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This [spellgun](link_trait_2868) has a range increment of 15 feet. Once fired, the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) twists in your hand and melts away.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is confused for 1 minute.\n\n**Success** The target is confused for 1 minute but can attempt a DC 25 Will save at the end of each of its turns to end the effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11755,"type":"item","before":{"id":11755,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Amaranth)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2579690080374225","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":5500},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:52.122396+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of amaranths.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. The ally feels impervious, immortal. The next time they would take damage from a hazard, an enemy's attack, or an effect created by an enemy, that damage can't reduce the ally below 1 HP. This benefit ends if unused before the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11755,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Amaranth)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2579690080374225","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":5500},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:52.122396+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of amaranths.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. The ally feels impervious, immortal. The next time they would take damage from a hazard, an enemy's attack, or an effect created by an enemy, that damage can't reduce the ally below 1 HP. This benefit ends if unused before the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11756,"type":"item","before":{"id":11756,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Bellflower)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1709295227670985","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:52.744008+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of bellflowers.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. A need for freedom trills through your ally's blood. Until the end of that ally's next turn, they gain a +2 status bonus to rolls to recover from the confused, frightened, grabbed, paralyzed, and restrained conditions. When you Activate the bloom, the target can attempt a new save against a condition the bonus applies to, or they can use a reaction to attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) being grabbed, immobilized, or restrained, provided such an attempt is allowed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11756,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Bellflower)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1709295227670985","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:52.744008+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of bellflowers.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. A need for freedom trills through your ally's blood. Until the end of that ally's next turn, they gain a +2 status bonus to rolls to recover from the confused, frightened, grabbed, paralyzed, and restrained conditions. When you Activate the bloom, the target can attempt a new save against a condition the bonus applies to, or they can use a reaction to attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) being grabbed, immobilized, or restrained, provided such an attempt is allowed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11757,"type":"item","before":{"id":11757,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Cherry Blossom)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6457168794295","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:53.265302+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant repres