 value. The cherry blossom's activation can target an unconscious or dying ally.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11758,"type":"item","before":{"id":11758,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Lilac)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6772518805020338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:26:36.094Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:53.878563+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of lilacs.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. Memories bubble to the surface of your ally's mind. The ally attempts to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) with a +2 status bonus to the check from these vibrant memories.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11758,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Lilac)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6772518805020338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","