 your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of lotuses.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. A glow envelops your ally as a sense of enlightened peace ripples out from within. The ally gains a +2 status bonus to Will saves against [mental](link_trait_1448) effects for 1 minute. This bonus increases to +3 against [emotion](link_trait_1486) effects.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11760,"type":"item","before":{"id":11760,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Magnolia)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1954929123149301","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:55.015788+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of magnolias.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. Your ally seems more charming, though no one can pinpoint why. They gain a +1 status bonus to Diplomacy checks for 10 minutes. Once on their next turn, the ally can attempt to draw a creature's attention. To do so, the ally must spend 1 action (which has the [emotion](link_trait_1486), [mental](link_trait_1448), and [visual](link_trait_1479) traits) to select a creature the ally can see and make eye contact in a way the target can see. The target must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be fascinated with your ally until the end of that ally's next turn. If the save succeeds or the effect ends, the target is temporarily immune to being fascinated by any _[magnolia bewitching bloom](link_item_11760)_ for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11760,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Magnolia)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1954929123149301","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:55.015788+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of magnolias.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Choose a willing ally you can see within 30 feet. Your ally seems more charming, though no one can pinpoint why. They gain a +1 status bonus to Diplomacy checks for 10 minutes. Once on their next turn, the ally can attempt to draw a creature's attention. To do so, the ally must spend 1 action (which has the [emotion](link_trait_1486), [mental](link_trait_1448), and [visual](link_trait_1479) traits) to select a creature the ally can see and make eye contact in a way the target can see. The target must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be fascinated with your ally until the end of that ally's next turn. If the save succeeds or the effect ends, the target is temporarily immune to being fascinated by any _[magnolia bewitching bloom](link_item_11760)_ for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11761,"type":"item","before":{"id":11761,"bulk":"0","name":"Bewitching Bloom (Purple Iris)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1906978108390658","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4737","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:55.614688+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While dormant, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) appears to be a simple flower bud, but when activated the flower swiftly blossoms, remaining that way until the next time you make your daily preparations. These blooms are colorful, elegant representations of purple irises.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTI