rl":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4375","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"14"},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"custom","label":"PF2E.IWR.Custom.PhysicalRangedAttacks","value":10,"definition":["damage:category:physical","item:ranged"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"fortress-plate","check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:59.82239+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The joints of this black _[+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [fortification](link_item_6974) [fortress plate](link_item_12020)_ look like swirling vortices of silver. Non-[magical](link_trait_1504) ammunition and [thrown](link_trait_1575) weapons aimed at you are destroyed after they hit you and deal damage or miss you. You also have resistance 10 to physical damage from ranged attacks.\n\nWhen an enemy's ranged attack misses you or hits you and deals no damage, the armor absorbs the projectile. When it has absorbed six projectiles, the armor glows at the joints.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Trigger** A ranged weapon [Strike](link_action_19856) targets a creature within 20 feet of you and the attacker hasn't yet rolled its attack\n\n**Effect** The triggering [Strike](link_action_19856) targets you instead of its intended target.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** The [black hole armor](link_item_11764) has absorbed six or more projectiles\n\n**Effect** All the projectiles absorbed by the armor appear out of thin air, as though transported there, falling in a 10-foot burst within 120 feet of you. Each creature in the burst takes 10d8 piercing damage with a DC 35 Reflex save. The absorbed projectiles are all expended, and the armor's joints stop glowing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11764,"bulk":"5","name":"Black Hole Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4613287267296927","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":8500},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1594,2870,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":6974,"name":"Fortification"}],"resilient":2},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4375","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"14"},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"custom","label":"PF2E.IWR.Custom.PhysicalRangedAttacks","value":10,"definition":["damage:category:physical","item:ranged"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"fortress-plate","check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:13:59.82239+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The joints of this black _[+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [fortification](link_item_6974) [fortress plate](link_item_12020)_ look like swirling vortices of silver. Non-[magical](link_trait_1504) ammunition and [thrown](link_trait_1575) weapons aimed at you are destroyed after they hit you and deal damage or miss you. You also have resistance 10 to physical damage from ranged attacks.\n\nWhen an enemy's ranged attack misses you or hits you and deals no damage, the armor absorbs the projectile. When it has absorbed six projectiles, the armor glows at the joints.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Trigger** A ranged weapon [Strike](link_action_19856) targets a creature within 20 feet of you and the attacker hasn't yet rolled its attack\n\n**Effect** The triggering [Strike](link_action_19856) targets you instead of its intended target.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** The [black hole armor](link_item_11764) has absorbed six or more projectiles\n\n**Effect** All the projectiles absorbed by the armor appear out of thin air, as though transported there, falling in a 10-foot burst within 120 feet of you. Each creature in the burst takes 10d8 piercing damage with a DC 35 Reflex save. The absorbed projectiles are all expended, and the armor's joints stop glowing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11765,"type":"item","before":{"id":11765,"bulk":"0","name":"Black Tendril Shot (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1188318725182225","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2160},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4578","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:00.423262+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n* * *\n\nA glistening, tar-like substance that's displeasing to the touch coats a [black tendril shot](link_item_11765). When the activated ammunition hits a target, it exudes tendrils that encase the target, which must attempt a DC 39 Fortitude saving throw. The ammunition's effects last until the target [Escapes](link_action_19632) ([Escape](link_action_19632) DC 39).\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is slowed 1 but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) the ammunition's effect.\n\n**Failure** The target is slowed 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is slowed 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11765,"bulk":"0","name":"Black Tendril Shot (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1188318725182225","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2160},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4578","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:00.423262+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n* * *\n\nA glistening, tar-like substance that's displeasing to the touch coats a [black tendril shot](link_item_11765). When the activated ammunition hits a target, it exudes tendrils that encase the target, which must attempt a DC 39 Fortitude saving throw. The ammunition's effects last until the target [Escapes](link_action_19632) ([Escape](link_action_19632) DC 39).\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is slowed 1 but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) the ammunition's effect.\n\n**Failure** The target is slowed 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is slowed 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11766,"type":"item","before":{"i