\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n* * *\n\nA glistening, tar-like substance that's displeasing to the touch coats a [black tendril shot](link_item_11767). When the activated ammunition hits a target, it exudes tendrils that encase the target, which must attempt a DC 31 Fortitude saving throw. The ammunition's effects last until the target [Escapes](link_action_19632) ([Escape](link_action_19632) DC 31).\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is slowed 1 but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) the ammunition's effect.\n\n**Failure** The target is slowed 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is slowed 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11767,"bulk":"0","name":"Black Tendril Shot (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7183589546326786","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4578","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:04.209537+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n* * *\n\nA glistening, tar-like substance that's displeasing to the touch coats a [black tendril shot](link_item_11767). When the activated ammunition hits a target, it exudes tendrils that encase the target, which must attempt a DC 31 Fortitude saving throw. The ammunition's effects last until the target [Escapes](link_action_19632) ([Escape](link_action_19632) DC 31).\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is slowed 1 but gains a +2 circumstance bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) the ammunition's effect.\n\n**Failure** The target is slowed 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is slowed 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11768,"type":"item","before":{"id":11768,"bulk":"1","name":"Blade Byrnie (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3498721685453068","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1580,1582,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"chain","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4376","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"chain-shirt","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:05.388946+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Instead of chain links, this _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [chain shirt](link_item_6779)_ is assembled from metal \"leaves\" that each resemble a small blade.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a _[+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [Dagger](link_item_6854)_. The [dagger](link_item_6854) disappears and reappears as a link in the armor after you [Strike](link_action_19856) with it, or at the end of this turn if you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856). You can Activate the [blade byrnie](link_item_11768) in place of an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to draw a weapon for abilities such as the [Quick Draw](link_feat_20441) feat.\n\nUpgrading the runes on the [blade byrnie](link_item_11768) makes the [daggers](link_item_6854) pulled from it more powerful. The [daggers](link_item_6854) have a _[+3 weapon potency](link_item_7952)_ rune if the armor has a _[+3 armor potency](link_item_6721)_ rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11768,"bulk":"1","name":"Blade Byrnie (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3498721685453068","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1580,1582,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"chain","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4376","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"chain-shirt","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:05.388946+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Instead of chain links, this _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [chain shirt](link_item_6779)_ is assembled from metal \"leaves\" that each resemble a small blade.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a _[+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [Dagger](link_item_6854)_. The [dagger](link_item_6854) disappears and reappears as a link in the armor after you [Strike](link_action_19856) with it, or at the end of this turn if you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856). You can Activate the [blade byrnie](link_item_11768) in place of an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to draw a weapon for abilities such as the [Quick Draw](link_feat_20441) feat.\