rom metal \"leaves\" that each resemble a small blade.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a [_+1_](link_item_7950) [_striking_](link_item_7862) [dagger](link_item_6854). The [dagger](link_item_6854) disappears and reappears as a link in the armor after you [Strike](link_action_19856) with it, or at the end of this turn if you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856). You can Activate the [blade byrnie](link_item_11770) in place of an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to draw a weapon for abilities such as the [Quick Draw](link_feat_20441) feat.\n\nUpgrading the runes on the [blade byrnie](link_item_11770) makes the [daggers](link_item_6854) pulled from it more powerful. The [daggers](link_item_6854) have a [_+2 weapon potency_](link_item_7951) rune if the armor has a [_+2 armor potency_](link_item_6720) rune, or a [_+3 weapon potency_](link_item_7952) rune if the armor has a [_+3 armor potency_](link_item_6721) rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11770,"bulk":"1","name":"Blade Byrnie","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1206520845851480","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"chain","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4376","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"chain-shirt","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:06.576744+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Instead of chain links, this [_+1_](link_item_6719) [_chain shirt_](link_item_6779) is assembled from metal \"leaves\" that each resemble a small blade.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You pull a link from the armor, which transforms into a [_+1_](link_item_7950) [_striking_](link_item_7862) [dagger](link_item_6854). The [dagger](link_item_6854) disappears and reappears as a link in the armor after you [Strike](link_action_19856) with it, or at the end of this turn if you don't make a [Strike](link_action_19856). You can Activate the [blade byrnie](link_item_11770) in place of an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to draw a weapon for abilities such as the [Quick Draw](link_feat_20441) feat.\n\nUpgrading the runes on the [blade byrnie](link_item_11770) makes the [daggers](link_item_6854) pulled from it more powerful. The [daggers](link_item_6854) have a [_+2 weapon potency_](link_item_7951) rune if the armor has a [_+2 armor potency_](link_item_6720) rune, or a [_+3 weapon potency_](link_item_7952) rune if the armor has a [_+3 armor potency_](link_item_6721) rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11771,"type":"item","before":{"id":11771,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bleachguard Doll","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"886423240634135","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4922","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:07.201289+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +16; precise vision ([low-*light*](link_sense_19330)) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech (one language spoken by the doll's creator)\n\n**Skills** One Intelligence-, Wisdom-, or Charisma-based skill chosen by the creator at +16\n\n**Int** +3, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +3\n\n**Will** +16\n\nRather than seeking out new experiences to stave off the Bleaching, [gnome](link_trait_1452) spellcasters with the right know-how can infuse a small fragment of their consciousness into a doll, then send the doll off with a crew of adventurers to experience new things. Such [gnomes](link_trait_1452) might have difficulties that keep them from exploring or might be preoccupied with other pursuits, but the doll acts as an intermediary, transmitting the benefits of new experiences to its creator via a potent, but passive, psychic link. A [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) has the alignment and demeanor of its creator, but new experiences can cause the two to diverge. The doll's creator is neither able to control it nor are they constantly aware of its activities. If the original creator perishes, the doll sometimes becomes inert (essentially dying as well), sometimes remains an intelligent item, and sometimes becomes a normal soulbound doll, diminished in power but with some of the item's capabilities.\n\nOnce per day, the doll sends its creator a dream of the day's events. Each [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) can cast the cantrips *[light](link_spell_4699)* (3rd rank), *[prestidigitation](link_spell_4778)*, and one other 3rd-rank cantrip, along with one spell (at 3rd rank) that can be cast once per day. The creator chooses the cantrip and spells, which can't require an attack roll or saving throw, during the doll's creation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** The [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) casts one of its available cantrips or spells.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) animates per *[summon construct](link_spell_4868)* as a soulbound doll, retaining pertinent item statistics, cantrips, and its spell instead of those of the soulbound doll. The soulbound doll can [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) only if the [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) has a use of that spell remaining for the day. When reduced to 0 Hit Points or this activation ends, the [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) becomes inert but repairs itself at the rate of 1 Hit Point per hour. This activation is unavailable until the doll has 23 Hit Points again.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11771,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bleachguard Doll","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"886423240634135","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4922","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:07.201289+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +16; precise vision ([low-*light*](link_sense_19330)) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech (one language spoken by the doll's creator)\n\n**Skills** One Intelligence-, Wisdom-, or Charisma-based skill chosen by the creator at +16\n\n**Int** +3, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +3\n\n**Will** +16\n\nRather than seeking out new experiences to stave off the Bleaching, [gnome](link_trait_1452) spellcasters with the right know-how can infuse a small fragment of their consciousness into a doll, then send the doll off with a crew of adventurers to experience new things. Such [gnomes](link_trait_1452) might have difficulties that keep them from exploring or might be preoccupied with other pursuits, but the doll acts as an intermediary, transmitting the benefits of new experiences to its creator via a potent, but passive, psychic link. A [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) has the alignment and demeanor of its creator, but new experiences can cause the two to diverge. The doll's creator is neither able to control it nor are they constantly aware of its activities. If the original creator perishes, the doll sometimes becomes inert (essentially dying as well), sometimes remains an intelligent item, and sometimes becomes a normal soulbound doll, diminished in power but with some of the item's capabilities.\n\nOnce per day, the doll sends its creator a dream of the day's events. Each [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) can cast the cantrips *[light](link_spell_4699)* (3rd rank), *[prestidigitation](link_spell_4778)*, and one other 3rd-rank cantrip, along with one spell (at 3rd rank) that can be cast once per day. The creator chooses the cantrip and spells, which can't require an attack roll or saving throw, during the doll's creation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** The [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) casts one of its available cantrips or spells.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) animates per *[summon construct](link_spell_4868)* as a soulbound doll, retaining pertinent item statistics, cantrips, and its spell instead of those of the soulbound doll. The soulbound doll can [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) only if the [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) has a use of that spell remaining for the day. When reduced to 0 Hit Points or this activation ends, the [bleachguard doll](link_item_11771) becomes inert but repairs itself at the rate of 1 Hit Point per hour. This activation is unavailable until the doll has 23 Hit Points again.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11772,"type":"item","before":{"id":11772,"bulk":"0","name":"Blending Brooch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6028558870698059","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":275},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1447,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4630","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:07.829358+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You roll initiative using Stealth and can see a creature\n\n**Requirements** You are a master in Stealth\n\nThis small, matte-black pin always seems to be on the periphery of your vision, even when you stare directly at it. When you Activate the [talisman](link_trait_1544), choose one creature you can see. You become invisible to that creature unless it succeeds at a Will 28 save. This effect lasts for 1 minute or until the target hits you with an attack, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11772,"bulk":"0","name":"Blending Brooch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6028558870698059","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":275},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1447,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4630","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:07.829358+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You roll initiative using Stealth and can see a creature\n\n**Requirements** You are a master in Stealth\n\nThis small, matte-black pin always seems to be on the periphery of your vision, even when you stare directly at it. When you Activate the [talisman](link_trait_1544), choose one creature you can see. You become invisible to that creature unless it succeeds at a Will 28 save. This effect lasts for 1 minute or until the target hits you with an attack, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11773,"type":"item","before":{"id":11773,"bulk":"1","name":"Blessed Reformer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2337495145528563","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1475,1595,1630,1571],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"hammer","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4411","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"dawnsilver","grade":"standard"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"warhammer","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7947,"bulk":"1","name":"Warhammer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":4991426500193717,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1595],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"hammer","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:44:21.007479+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This weapon has a wooden shaft ending in a large, heavy metal head. The head of the hammer might be single-sided or double-sided, but it's always capable of delivering powerful bludgeoning blows.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:08.96882+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The [Empyreal](link_language_307) word for \"repent\" is etched in golden lettering on the shaft of this [+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [merciful](link_item_12204) [dawnsilver](link_item_15369) [warhammer](link_item_7947). If you are [unholy](link_trait_1846), you are enfeebled 2 while carrying or wielding this weapon.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You hold your weapon aloft, calling on righteousness to steel your resolve. You cast *[protection](link_spell_4782)* targeting yourself.\n\n* * *\n\n**Redeemer Wielder** If you're a [champion](link_class_109) of the redemption cause, you also gain the following two benefits.\n\n*   When you critically hit an [unholy](link_trait_1846) creature with the [blessed reformer](link_item_11773), until the end of your next turn, the creature takes a –10-foot penalty to its Speeds and can’t [Step](link_action_19853).\n\n*   You can Activate the weapon in the following way.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You hit a creature using the _[blessed reformer](link_item_11773)_ as your last action; **Effect** You cast *[calm](link_spell_4426)* at the same rank as your [champion](link_class_109) focus spells. It must target the creature you hit, and the creature takes a status penalty on its save against the spell equal to the [blessed reformer](link_item_11773)’s number of weapon damage dice.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You’re a [champion](link_class_109) with the redemption cause. The initial materials must include 140 gp of [dawnsilver](link_item_15369)."},"after":{"id":11773,"bulk":"1","name":"Blessed Reformer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2337495145528563","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1475,1595,1630,1571],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"hammer","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4411","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"dawnsilver","grade":"standard"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"warhammer","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7947,"bulk":"1","