r)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5680352503049316","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4429","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"42"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:11.386234+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Blister ammunition](link_item_11776) is loaded with alchemically processed irritants, such as pollen, pepper, and formic acid. A creature hit by activated [blister ammunition](link_item_11776) must attempt a DC 35 Fortitude save or begin to itch uncontrollably in addition to damage the attack normally deals. On a critical hit, increase the Fortitude DC by 2, and the target is dazzled for 1 round. For 10 rounds, each time the target attempts a [concentrate](link_trait_1432) action, it must attempt a DC 8 flat check, losing the action on a failure. An affected creature can use a single [Interact](link_action_19733) action to scratch and sneeze, allowing it to automatically pass the flat check. The effect ends early once an affected creature spends 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions scratching and sneezing. These [Interact](link_action_19733) actions don't need to be consecutive.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11776,"bulk":"0","name":"Blister Ammunition (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5680352503049316","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1400},"us