ersion":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:08:27.431Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2150","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"105"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:19.057217+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These _[olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251)_ can be enhanced to better localize scents.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Your _[olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251)_ twitch as they gather even more information. You gain [imprecise scent](link_sense_20773) with a range of 30 feet for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11783,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bloodhound Olfactory Stimulators","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7984270229188536","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":136},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:08:27.431Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2150","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"105"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:19.057217+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These _[olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251)_ can be enhanced to better localize scents.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** Your _[olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251)_ twitch as they gather even more information. You gain [imprecise scent](link_sense_20773) with a range of 30 feet for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11784,"type":"item","before":{"id":11784,"bulk":"1","name":"Bloodline Robe","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1004277469785382","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4851","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:19.706916+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Each _[bloodline robe](link_item_11784)_ has a design that befits a particular [sorcerer](link_class_113) bloodline, depicting creatures of that bloodline or using styles common among them. You gain a +2 item bonus to each of your bloodline skills.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You’re benefiting from your blood magic effect or gained its benefit earlier this turn; **Effect** You’re quickened on your next turn. You can use the extra action only as part of [casting](link_action_19611) a bloodline spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [sorcerer](link_class_113) bloodline spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [sorcerer](link_class_113) of the bloodline tied to the robe."},"after":{"id":11784,"bulk":"1","name":"Bloodline Robe","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1004277469785382","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4851","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:19.706916+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Each _[bloodline robe](link_item_11784)_ has a design that befits a particular [sorcerer](link_class_113) bloodline, depicting creatures of that bloodline or using styles common among them. You gain a +2 item bonus to each of your bloodline skills.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You’re benefiting from your blood magic effect or gained its benefit earlier this turn; **Effect** You’re quickened on your next turn. You can use the extra action only as part of [casting](link_action_19611) a bloodline spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [sorcerer](link_class_113) bloodline spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [sorcerer](link_class_113) of the bloodline tied to the robe."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11785,"type":"item","before":{"id":11785,"bulk":"0","name":"Bola Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"866381781857557","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4579","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:44:53.541Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:20.248593+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nThis ammunition bears a rune with three lines radiating out, each ending in a circle. When an activated _[bola shot](link_item_11785)_ hits a target, it deals [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) bludgeoning damage. Compare the attack roll to the target's Reflex DC to determine the shot's other effects.\n\n**Critical Success** The target falls prone and is stunned 1.\n\n**Success** The target falls prone.\n\n**Failure** No additional effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11785,"bulk":"0","name":"Bola Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"866381781857557","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4579","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T04:44:53.541Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:20.248593+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nThis ammunition bears a rune with three lines radiating out, each ending in a circle. When an activated _[bola shot](link_item_11785)_ hits a target, it deals [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) bludgeoning damage. Compare the attack roll to the target's Reflex DC to determine the shot's other effects.\n\n**Critical Success** The target falls prone and is stunned 1.\n\n**Success** The target falls prone.\n\n**Failure** No additional effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11786,"type":"item","before":{"id":11786,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bomb Coagulant Alembic","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"919666233339399","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4506","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:21.302739+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This apparatus increases the viscosity of the reagents in [alchemical](link_trait_1529) bombs, to deadly effect. As a 10-minute activity that has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait, you can use a [bomb coagulant alembic](link_item_11786) to distill the contents of one [infused](link_trait_3540) [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [bomb](link_trait_1530) that deals [splash](link_trait_1532) damage into a stickier substance. After distilling, the [bomb](link_trait_1530) deals no [splash](link_trait_1532) damage but instead deals persistent damage equal to and of the same type as its original [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. If the [bomb](link_trait_1530) already deals persistent damage, distilling increases that damage by the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s original [splash](link_trait_1532) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11786,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bomb Coagulant Alembic","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"919666233339399","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4506","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:21.302739+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This apparatus increases the viscosity of the reagents in [alchemical](link_trait_1529) bombs, to deadly effect. As a 10-minute activity that has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait, you can use a [bomb coagulant alembic](link_item_11786) to distill the contents of one [infused](link_trait_3540) [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [bomb](link_trait_1530) that deals [splash](link_trait_1532) damage into a stickier substance. After distilling, the [bomb](link_trait_1530) deals no [splash](link_trait_1532) damage but instead deals persistent damage equal to and of the same type as its original [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. If the [bomb](link_trait_1530) already deals persistent damage, distilling increases that damage by the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s original [splash](link_trait_1532) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11787,"type":"item","before":{"id":11787,"bulk":"5","name":"Bone Dreadnought Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4761202861176982","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4507","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:42:44.697Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"fortress-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:24.72742+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This suit of bone-based [fortress plate](link_item_12020) is a masterpiece of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) science. This armor has a receiver that can hold a single [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** A [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177) is installed in the armor; **Effect** The bomb shifts numerous small plates and hinges, offering a wide variety of protections, granting you resistance to [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), piercing, and slashing damage equal to the loaded [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177)'s [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. These effects last for 20 minutes, but each time you're hit by an attack that deals damage of one of these types, decrease the remaining duration by 1 minute. Once activated, the armor can't be deactivated. The activation uses up the [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177), and the armor can't be activated again until a new one is installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11787,"bulk":"5","name":"Bone Dreadnought Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4761202861176982","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4507","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:42:44.697Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"fortress-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:24.72742+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This suit of bone-based [fortress plate](link_item_12020) is a masterpiece of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) science. This armor has a receiver that can hold a single [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** A [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177) is installed in the armor; **Effect** The bomb shifts numerous small plates and hinges, offering a wide variety of protections, granting you resistance to [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), piercing, and slashing damage equal to the loaded [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177)'s [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. These effects last for 20 minutes, but each time you're hit by an attack that deals damage of one of these types, decrease the remaining duration by 1 minute. Once activated, the armor can't be deactivated. The activation uses up the [lodestone bomb](link_item_12177), and the armor can't be activated again until a new one is installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11788,"type":"item","before":{"id":11788,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Book of Warding Prayers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4421799302030646","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,2855],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4706","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:25.277959+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Script in a language of the Outer Planes adorns this book's spine, and a deity's symbol is etched on its cover. _[Books of warding prayers](link_item_11788)_ are each devoted to a particular deity and are also a [religious symbol](link_item_7697) of that deity.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** Your last action was to [cast](link_action_19611) a prepared [divine](link_trait_1475) spell granted by your deity; **Effect** You and all your allies in a 30-foot emanation gain resistance 10 to [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage for 1 minute. You can instead choose to grant resistance to [holy](link_trait_1630) effects instead of [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage if the spell you [cast](link_action_19611) had the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait, or resistance to [unholy](link_trait_1846) effects instead of [spirit](link_trait_1556) if your spell had the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11788,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Book of Warding Prayers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4421799302030646","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,2855],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4706","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:25.277959+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Script in a language of the Outer Planes adorns this book's spine, and a deity's symbol is etched on its cover. _[Books of warding prayers](link_item_11788)_ are each devoted to a particular deity and are also a [religious symbol](link_item_7697) of that deity.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** Your last action was to [cast](link_action_19611) a prepared [divine](link_trait_1475) spell