 face mask of a [bootstrap respirator](link_item_11790) fits snugly over your mouth and nose, fastened by two adjustable leather straps. A manual pump inserted into your footwear or under the arm circulates air through tubes and over filters fitted into the front of the mask. While wearing a [bootstrap respirator](link_item_11790), you gain a +1 item bonus to any saves that require you to smell or taste, such as [inhaled](link_trait_1578) [poisons](link_trait_1476) and airborne [diseases](link_trait_1857).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11790,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bootstrap Respirator","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2172145227194721","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1539],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4687","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"107"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":[{"or":["olfactory","inhaled"]}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:28.538193+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The city of Riddleport is notorious for its noxious air and water. While some inhabitants tolerate the haze, most wear [bootstrap respirators](link_item_11790) to filter out as many of the pollutants as possible. Designed by [dwarf](link_trait_1467) smiths operating the Gas Forges, the flexible face mask of a [bootstrap respirator](link_item_11790) fits snugly over your mouth and nose, fastened by two adjustable leather straps. A manual pump inserted into your footwear or under the arm circulates air through tubes and over filters fitted into the front of the mask. While wearing a [bootstrap respirator](link_item_11790), you gain a +1 item bonus to any saves that require you to smell or taste, such as [inhaled](link_trait_1578) [poisons](link_trait_1476) and airborne [diseases](link_trait_1857).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11791,"type":"item","before":{"id":11791,"bulk":"0","name":"Boozy Bottle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"56656395224548","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":140},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4738","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"119"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["poison"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:29.109701+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [tattoo](link_trait_2857) depicts a container of alcohol, traditionally a small, uncorked brown bottle. You gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [poison](link_trait_1476).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You fail (but don’t critically fail) an initial saving throw against a [poison](link_trait_1476), or you gain persistent [poison](link_trait_1476) damage; **Effect** You pick your poison. Calling out the name of a drink as though ordering at a bar, you negate the triggering [poison](link_trait_1476). Instead, you become slightly drunk. For 10 minutes you’re off-guard and gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":