75Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:32.757298+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis bottle contains a shrunken bird preserved with its feathers intact. When opened, the contents reconstitute into a Gargantuan effigy of a great [roc](link_creature_10277), which can appear in the air instead of on the ground. The [roc](link_creature_10277) Grabs up to two creatures, then [Flies](link_action_19721) up to 90 feet and [Releases](link_action_19755) the creatures. The creatures must be within 15 feet of the [roc](link_creature_10277) for it to Grab them; if any of them are unwilling to be grabbed, the [roc](link_creature_10277) must [Grapple](link_action_19725) them with a +17 Athletics modifier or fail to pick them up.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a [roc](link_creature_10277)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11796,"type":"item","before":{"id":11796,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Boulder Seed (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3258236377882296","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":3600},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1530,1531,1532],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"bomb","range":20,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":4,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4436","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"44"},"foundry":{"bonus":3,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":4},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"alchemical-bomb","broken_threshold":0,"attack_bonus":3},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:33.281711+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\nThis [bomb](link_trait_1530) is made of volatile fluids that rapidly expand and harden when exposed to air. A [boulder seed](link_item_11796) grants a +3 item bonus to attack rolls and deals 4d4 bludgeoning damage and 4 bludgeoning [splash](link_trait_1532) damage, according to the [bomb](link_trait_1530)'s type. When activated, the [bomb](link_trait_1530) fills a 5-foot cube with hardened foam, it creates a boulder as hard as stone (Hardness 10, HP 40) that pushes a Large or smaller primary target occupying that space 5 feet away from you. On a critical hit, the target also falls prone. The [splash](link_trait_1532) zone fills with rubble, creating difficult terrain. The \"boulder\" the [bomb](link_trait_1530) creates fails all saving throws and loses 1 Hardness per round, disintegrating into fine powder when the boulder's Hardness is reduced to 0. At that time, the difficult terrain the [bomb](link_trait_1530) created also disappears.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11796,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Boulder Seed (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3258236377882296","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":3600},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1530,1531,1532],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"bomb","range":20,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":4,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4436","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"44"},"foundry":{"bonus":3,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":4},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"alchemical-bomb","broken_threshold":0,"attack_bonus":3},"created_at":"2024-