e the opposing sides were equally matched. Sprigs of the flowers blow gently in a breeze of their own creation. If you cast *[mystic armor](link_spell_4734)* using _[deadlock mint](link_item_11803)_, you release a small blast of concussive air in an emanation of a size that depends on the catalyst’s type. Unattended objects of 1 Bulk or less are pushed 5 feet away from you. Large or smaller creatures must succeed at a Fortitude save equal to your spell save DC or be pushed the same distance away from you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11804,"type":"item","before":{"id":11804,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bravery Baldric (Fleet)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2523989470259370","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4841","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:39.408891+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ is a belt that wraps around the shoulder and draws on your well of courage. When you critically succeed on a save against a [fear](link_trait_1487) effect or reduce your frightened condition to 0, the baldric gains 1 charge, which slightly alters the color, turning it grass green. A _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ can hold up to 2 charges, and its charges reset to 0 when you [invest](link_action_20775) it. You can have only one _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ invested at a time.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Requirements** The baldric has a charge\n\n**Effect** One charge in the baldric expires, and you gain the effects of *[fleet step](link_spell_4625)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11804,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bravery Baldric (Fleet)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2523989470259370","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4841","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:39.408891+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ is a belt that wraps around the shoulder and draws on your well of courage. When you critically succeed on a save against a [fear](link_trait_1487) effect or reduce your frightened condition to 0, the baldric gains 1 charge, which slightly alters the color, turning it grass green. A _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ can hold up to 2 charges, and its charges reset to 0 when you [invest](link_action_20775) it. You can have only one _[bravery baldric](link_item_11804)_ invested at a time.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Requirements** The baldric has a charge\n\n**Effect** One charge in the baldric expires, and you gain the effects of *[fleet step](link_spell_4625)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11805,"type":"item","before":{"id":11805,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Bravery Baldric (Flight)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6663715565061410","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"