e baldric is dark gray when charged, and it casts *[mountain resilience](link_spell_4733)* on you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11810,"type":"item","before":{"id":11810,"bulk":"1","name":"Breaching Pike (legacy)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8639871030534494","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2862,1573,3280],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"spear","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=620","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"breaching-pike","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:43.026153+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Forged with a heavy metal wedge as a spearhead, [breaching pikes](link_item_11810) are often used by [hobgoblin](link_trait_3611) infantry alongside a [tower shield](link_item_7900). [Breaching pikes](link_item_11810) are particularly effective at damaging enemy shields, leaving large, triangular puncture holes behind.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11810,"bulk":"1","name":"Breaching Pike (legacy)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8639871030534494","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2862,1573,3280],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"spear","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=620","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"breaching-pike","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:43.026153+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Forged with a heavy metal wedge as a spearhead, [breaching pikes](link_item_11810) are often used by [hobgoblin](link_trait_3611) infantry alongside a [tower shield](link_item_7900). [Breaching pikes](link_item_11810) are particularly effective at damaging enemy shields, leaving large, triangular puncture holes behind.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11811,"type":"item","before":{"id":11811,"bulk":"2","name":"Breastplate of the Mountain","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5627585463359276","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4670","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":4,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"breastplate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":6765,"bulk":"2","name":"Breastplate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1626826033187409,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":4,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"breastplate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:10:07.273922+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Though referred to as a breastplate, this type of armor consists of several pieces of plate or [half-plate](link_item_7016) armor (see below) that protect the torso, chest, neck, and sometimes the hips and lower legs. It strategically grants some of the protection of plate while allowing greater flexibility and speed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:43.558677+00:00","operations":[{"id":"0aff4f9d-c741-4335-8ada-5fd30c2f07df","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"6e142c7a-6ae8-4dd2-89a4-a2ef929208b2","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CON","type":"attr","value":{"value":2,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CON","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"096ae3a0-6200-4aad-be7b-78707b26a12f","data":{"value":{"value":4,"partial":false},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"a8e7b6fd-d49e-4e54-9905-eed941eaa25c","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"040ddba6-cb47-4701-9007-648f79ffe321","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_CON"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"Constructed of dull gray metal, this breastplate is decorated with the symbol of a craggy black mountaintop. This breastplate functions as a [_+3_](link_item_6721) [_greater resilient_](link_item_7701) [_breastplate_](link_item_6765). When you're [Shoved](link_action_19849) or otherwise forced to move, you can reduce the amount you move by up to 10 feet. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the breastplate, you either increase your Constitution modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever is higher.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You pound a solid and constant rhythm on your breastplate and cast a 7th-rank *[regenerate](link_spell_4798)* spell on yourself.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** With a single tap, you gain immunity to [poison](link_trait_1476) for 1 minute.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You fail or critically fail a Fortitude saving throw; **Effect** If you failed the saving throw, it becomes a success. If you critically failed, it becomes a failure instead.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11811,"bulk":"2","name":"Breastplate of the Mountain","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5627585463359276","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4670","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":4,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"breastplate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalt