 effects don't end if the target uses a hostile action or moves at more than half its Speed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11819,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Camouflage Dye (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3102248541533154","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4470","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"52"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:50.060331+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Camouflage dye](link_item_11819) uses a variety of alchemically treated paints and crushed crystals to make the user particularly hard to distinguish from their surroundings. When you Activate the dye by sprinkling it on yourself or a creature within reach, the target and its clothing change colors, blending into their surroundings until the target makes a sudden movement. The target can [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850) without cover or concealment for 1 minute. The effects don't end if the target uses a hostile action or moves at more than half its Speed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11820,"type":"item","before":{"id":11820,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Camouflage Dye (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4583847556201560","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"hel