:["lit-candlecap"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitCandlecap","domain":"all","option":"lit-candlecap","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/equipment/head/cap-simple-leather-brown.webp","predicate":["lit-candlecap"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:52:55.534Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:51.299644+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The crown of a _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ is stitched leather sewn in the shape of a small bowl. Fixed inside the bowl is a melted nub of wax with a small black wick.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You shake your head, and the candle wick ignites. The _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ sheds dim light in a 20-foot radius. The candle doesn't require oxygen and can't be smothered or quenched. Activating the _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ again douses the light.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11821,"bulk":"0","name":"Candlecap","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4450592643997895","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":12},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1517,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4864","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":20,"color":"#9b7337","shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"torch","speed":1,"intensity":4}},"predicate":["lit-candlecap"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.LitCandlecap","domain":"all","option":"lit-candlecap","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/equipment/head/cap-simple-leather-brown.webp","predicate":["lit-candlecap"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:52:55.534Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:51.299644+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The crown of a _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ is stitched leather sewn in the shape of a small bowl. Fixed inside the bowl is a melted nub of wax with a small black wick.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You shake your head, and the candle wick ignites. The _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ sheds dim light in a 20-foot radius. The candle doesn't require oxygen and can't be smothered or quenched. Activating the _[candlecap](link_item_11821)_ again douses the light.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11822,"type":"item","before":{"id":11822,"bulk":"0","name":"Captivating Bauble","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5175875759700461","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1486,1458,1504,1544,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4631","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:48:31.998Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:52.539787+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** You are a master in Deception or Diplomacy.\n\nThis [talisman](link_trait_1544) appears as an ornate piece of jewelry of the highest quality. When you Activate it, your speech and mannerisms become supernaturally compelling for up to 1 hour. By engaging an intelligent creature in conversation for at least 1 minute, you can cause them to become fascinated unless they succeed at a DC 30 Will save. This fascination lasts for as long as you continue conversing or until you move at least 20 feet away. When the effect ends, the target becomes temporarily immune for 24 hours. If you or any ally within 120 feet takes an overtly hostile action while a creature is fascinated by the bauble, the bauble burns out in a shower of sparks and all its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":11822,"bulk":"0","name":"Captivating Bauble","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5175875759700461","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1486,1458,1504,1544,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4631","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:48:31.998Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:52.539787+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** You are a master in Deception or Diplomacy.\n\nThis [talisman](link_trait_1544) appears as an ornate piece of jewelry of the highest quality. When you Activate it, your speech and mannerisms become supernaturally compelling for up to 1 hour. By engaging an intelligent creature in conversation for at least 1 minute, you can cause them to become fascinated unless they succeed at a DC 30 Will save. This fascination lasts for as long as you continue conversing or until you move at least 20 feet away. When the effect ends, the target becomes temporarily immune for 24 hours. If you or any ally within 120 feet takes an overtly hostile action while a creature is fascinated by the bauble, the bauble burns out in a shower of sparks and all its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11823,"type":"item","before":{"id":11823,"bulk":"0","name":"Captivating Score","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"547610357824601","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1486,1481,1504,1448,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4593","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"84"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:03:51.160Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:54.368579+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [captivating score](link_item_11823) is a piece of parchment prepared for musical notation, long enough for a short song. You must be trained in Performance to properly [compose](link_action_43788) this [missive](link_trait_2874) (or trained in an appropriate Lore skill your GM allows). You choose one of the emotions described below and write a musical composition to convey that emotion about a subject of your choice, typically a person or group. When activated, the [missive](link_trait_2874) plays a note-perfect rendition of the inscribed score. Each creature that can hear the score must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or be influenced to feel the emotion you chose toward the subject of your composition. This lasts for 1 hour, typically returning the creature to its initial attitude unless new events have altered their attitude long-term.\n\n*   **Positive** Your song engenders sympathy, adoration, joy, or a similar emotion. An affected creature's attitude toward the subject improves by one step, such as from indifferent to friendly.\n*   **Negative** Your song spurs anger, sadness, jealousy, or a similar emotion. An affected creature's attitude toward the subject worsens by one step, such as from indifferent to unfriendly.\n\nWhen [composing](link_action_43788) this [missive](link_trait_2874), you can add a small notation or illustration of a type of instrument. If you do, the music sounds like that instrument, and if you didn't specify, it sounds vaguely like a recorder. The choice of a louder instrument doesn't make the music carry farther.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11823,"bulk":"0","name":"Captivating Score","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"547610357824601","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1486,1481,1504,1448,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4593","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"84"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:03:51.160Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:54.368579+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [captivating score](link_item_11823) is a piece of parchment prepared for musical notation, long enough for a short song. You must be trained in Performance to properly [compose](link_action_43788) this [missive](link_trait_2874) (or trained in an appropriate Lore skill your GM allows). You choose one of the emotions described below and write a musical composition to convey that emotion about a subject of your choice, typically a person or group. When activated, the [missive](link_trait_2874) plays a note-perfect rendition of the inscribed score. Each creature that can hear the score must succeed at a DC 28 Will save or be influenced to feel the emotion you chose toward the subject of your composition. This lasts for 1 hour, typically returning the creature to its initial attitude unless new events have altered their attitude long-term.\n\n*   **Positive** Your song engenders sympathy, adoration, joy, or a similar emotion. An affected creature's attitude toward the subject improves by one step, such as from indifferent to friendly.\n*   **Negative** Your song spurs anger, sadness, jealousy, or a similar emotion. An affected creature's attitude toward the subject worsens by one step, such as from indifferent to unfriendly.\n\nWhen [composing](link_action_43788) this [missive](link_trait_2874), you can add a small notation or illustration of a type of instrument. If you do, the music sounds like that instrument, and if you didn't specify, it sounds vaguely like a recorder. The choice of a louder instrument doesn't make the music carry farther.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11824,"type":"item","before":{"id":11824,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Careless Delight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8726275612272611","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1555,1448,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4528","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"67"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:55.179274+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSometimes called liquid persuasion, this sweet-tasting tincture induces euphoria that lowers inhibitions and increases trust. The status penalty from being stupefied due to this [poison](link_trait_1476) doubles when applied to Deception checks to [Lie](link_action_19737), Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847), and Perception DCs to detect a [Lie](link_action_19737).\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 28\n\n**Onset** 1 minute\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** stupefied 1 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** stupefied 2 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** stupefied 3, and the victim's attitude toward others improves by one step (1 minute)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11824,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Careless Delight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8726275612272611","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1555,1448,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4528","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"67"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:55.179274+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSometimes called liquid persuasion, this sweet-tasting tincture induces euphoria that lowers inhibitions and increases trust. The status penalty from being stupefied due to this [poison](link_trait_1476) doubles when applied to Deception checks to [Lie](link_action_19737), Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847), and Perception DCs to detect a [Lie](link_action_19737).\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 28\n\n**Onset** 1 minute\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** stupefied 1 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** stupefied 2 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** stupefied 3, and the victim's attitude toward others improves by one step (1 minute)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11825,"type":"item","before":{"id":11825,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cassisian Helmet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7156756846263766","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4865","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":1,"selector":["ac","saving-throw"],"predicate":["origin:trait:unholy"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:55.82908+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A small, feathered wing is attached to either side of this ornate brass helmet. A visor on the front lowers to cover your face. While wearing the [cassisian helmet](link_item_11825), you gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saves against [unholy](link_trait_1846) creatures and effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** Lowering the visor, you send out eye beams that deal your choice of 2d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or 2d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (DC 20 basic Reflex save) to all creatures in a 15-foot line.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11825,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cassisian Helmet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7156756846263766","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4865","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":1,"selector":["ac","saving-throw"],"predicate":["origin:trait:unholy"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:55.82908+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A small, feathered wing is attached to either side of this ornate brass helmet. A visor on the front lowers to cover your face. While wearing the [cassisian helmet](link_item_11825), you gain a +1 status bonus to AC and saves against [unholy](link_trait_1846) creatures and effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** Lowering the visor, you send out eye beams that deal your choice of 2d6 [cold](link_trait_1519) or 2d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage (DC 20 basic Reflex save) to all creatures in a 15-foot line.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11826,"type":"item","before":{"id":11826,"bulk":"1","name":"Caster's Targe","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5181323265098489","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2875],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":12,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=21","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:07:12.006Z"},"hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"casters-targe","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:57.497536+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This small shield is made from wood. It features a special panel of parchment along the inside surface that allows for writing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11826,"bulk":"1","name":"Caster's Targe","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5181323265098489","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2875],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":12,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=21","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:07:12.006Z"},"hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"casters-targe","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:57.497536+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This small shield is made from wood. It features a special panel of parchment along the inside surface that allows for writing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11827,"type":"item","before":{"id":11827,"bulk":"0","name":"Catching","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7343526630810739","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"applied to shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2299","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:58.06362+00:00","operations":[{"id":"dbc161bf-110a-4caf-b148-07bb3d33395f","data":{"text":"You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Disarm attempts made as part of a Shield Block.","type":"circumstance","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A _[catching](link_item_11827)_ rune creates a small, magical vacuum that attempts to pull weapons away from opponents. If you can attempt to [Disarm](link_action_19626) as part of a [Shield Block](link_feat_20534), such as with the [Disarming Block](link_feat_21972) feat or this rune's activated ability, a [catching](link_item_11827) shield grants you a +1 circumstance bonus to such [Disarm](link_action_19626) attempts.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) made with a held weapon; **Effect** You attempt to [Disarm](link_action_19626) the creature whose attack you blocked of the weapon they attacked you with. You can do so even if you don't have a hand free.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11827,"bulk":"0","name":"Catching","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7343526630810739","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"applied to shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2299","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:58.06362+00:00","operations":[{"id":"dbc161bf-110a-4caf-b148-07bb3d33395f","data":{"text":"You gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Disarm attempts made as part of a Shield Block.","type":"circumstance","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A _[catching](link_item_11827)_ rune creates a small, magical vacuum that attempts to pull weapons away from opponents. If you can attempt to [Disarm](link_action_19626) as part of a [Shield Block](link_feat_20534), such as with the [Disarming Block](link_feat_21972) feat or this rune's activated ability, a [catching](link_item_11827) shield grants you a +1 circumstance bonus to such [Disarm](link_action_19626) attempts.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) made with a held weapon; **Effect** You attempt to [Disarm](link_action_19626) the creature whose attack you blocked of the weapon they attacked you with. You can do so even if you don't have a hand free.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11828,"type":"item","before":{"id":11828,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cayden's Brew (Double)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7545509401085409","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":480},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1476,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4612","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"88"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:58.877824+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Cayden's brew](link_item_11828) is like rich beer or ale, with a golden-brown color and foamy head. For 1 hour after you drink it, you have a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects. Also, you can use a single action to breathe out a 15-foot cone of intoxicating vapor with a burp that can be heard for 100 feet. Any creature in the vapor must attempt a DC 31 Fortitude saving throw. After you unleash this magical burp, you can’t do so again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature becomes clumsy 2, stupefied 2, and sickened 1. The clumsy and stupefied conditions last until 1d4 rounds after the sickened condition ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11828,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cayden's Brew (Double)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7545509401085409","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":480},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1476,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4612","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"88"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:58.877824+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Cayden's brew](link_item_11828) is like rich beer or ale, with a golden-brown color and foamy head. For 1 hour after you drink it, you have a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects. Also, you can use a single action to breathe out a 15-foot cone of intoxicating vapor with a burp that can be heard for 100 feet. Any creature in the vapor must attempt a DC 31 Fortitude saving throw. After you unleash this magical burp, you can’t do so again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature becomes clumsy 2, stupefied 2, and sickened 1. The clumsy and stupefied conditions last until 1d4 rounds after the sickened condition ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":n