"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:00.068774+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Cayden's brew](link_item_11830) is like rich beer or ale, with a golden-brown color and foamy head. For 1 hour after you drink it, you have a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects. Also, you can use a single action to breathe out a 15-foot cone of intoxicating vapor with a burp that can be heard for 100 feet. Any creature in the vapor must attempt a DC 25 Fortitude saving throw. After you unleash this magical burp, you can’t do so again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is clumsy 1 and stupefied 1 for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature becomes clumsy 2, stupefied 2, and sickened 1. The clumsy and stupefied conditions last until 1d4 rounds after the sickened condition ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11831,"type":"item","before":{"id":11831,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cayden's Tankard","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"578544378028616","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":25,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1569,1568,1475,1843],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"hammer","range":null,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":15650,"name":"Hopeful"},{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4889","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"178"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"light-hammer","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:09.099247+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This ordinary-looking silver tankard functions as a _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [hopeful](link_item_15650) [returning](link_item_7708) [light hammer](link_item_7074)_ when wielded as a weapon. Imbued with Cayden Cailean's courage, you are immune to [fear](link_trait_1487) effects. Any liquid poured into the tankard transforms into a strong, alcoholic ambrosia that remains contained safely within until you drink it. Drinking the ambrosia Activates the tankard, with one of the following effects. If you aren't the one blessed to borrow the tankard, you are drained 4 and enfeebled 4 while holding it, and its magic doesn't function for you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You are targeted or included in the area of a [fear](link_trait_1487) effect\n\n**Effect** Calmly swigging a drink on the battlefield turns your foe's attempt to frighten you against them. The [fear](link_trait_1487) effect is counteracted for all targets, and the creature that created the effect must attempt a saving throw as if it alone were the original target of the effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You drink from the tankard, ending the controlled, grabbed, immobilized, paralyzed, restrained, and slowed conditions on yourself and creatures of your choice within 120 feet of you, as well as anything giving such targets a circumstance penalty to Speed. Any effect causing these conditions ends, and if the source of the effect is an item, that item can't produce the effect for 1 week, provided it is of a level lower than the tankard's. If a target needs to [Escape](link_action_19632) an effect imposing any of these conditions, it automatically does so on its next attempt. You can Activate this ability even if one of the listed conditions would normally prevent you from doing so (such as paralyzed).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You enhance yourself with a shard of Cayden's divine fortune and cast *[indestructibility](link_spell_4683)*.\n\n**Destruction** If an [unholy](link_trait_1846) creature carries _[Cayden's Tankard](link_item_11831)_ into the Starstone Cathedral, drinks from it, and returns outside with it, the tankard shatters.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11831,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cayden's Tankard","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"578544378028616","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":25,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1569,1568,1475,1843],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"hammer","range":null,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":15650,"name":"Hopeful"},{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4889","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"178"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"light-hammer","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:09.099247+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This ordinary-looking silver tankard functions as a _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [hopeful](link_item_15650) [returning](link_item_7708) [light hammer](link_item_7074)_ when wielded as a weapon. Imbued with Cayden Cailean's courage, you are immune to [fear](link_trait_1487) effects. Any liquid poured into the tankard transforms into a strong, alcoholic ambrosia that remains contained safely within until you drink it. Drinking the ambrosia Activates the tankard, with one of the following effects. If you aren't the one blessed to borrow the tankard, you are drained 4 and enfeebled 4 while holding it, and its magic doesn't function for you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You are targeted or included in the area of a [fear](link_trait_1487) effect\n\n**Effect** Calmly swigging a drink on the battlefield turns your foe's attempt to frighten you against them. The [fear](link_trait_1487) effect is counteracted for all targets, and the creature that created the effect must attempt a saving throw as if it alone were the original target of the effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You drink from the tankard, ending the controlled, grabbed, immobilized, paralyzed, restrained, and slowed conditions on yourself and creatures of your choice within 120 feet of you, as well as anything giving such targets a circumstance penalty to Speed. Any effect causing these conditions ends, and if the source of the effect is an item, that item can't produce the effect for 1 week, provided it is of a level lower than the tankard's. If a target needs to [Escape](link_action_19632) an effect imposing any of these conditions, it automatically does so on its next attempt. You can Activate this ability even if one of the listed conditions would normally prevent you from doing so (such as paralyzed).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You enhance yourself with a shard of Cayden's divine fortune and cast *[indestructibility](link_spell_4683)*.\n\n**Destruction** If an [unholy](link_trait_1846) creature carries _[Cayden's Tankard](link_item_11831)_ into the Starstone Cathedral, drinks from it, and returns outside with it, the tankard shatters.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11832,"type":"item","before":{"id":11832,"bulk":"1","name":"Celestial Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2628574946957144","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":17,"price":{"gp":14000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7040,"name":"Holy","rune":{"id":7040,"bulk":"0","name":"Holy","size":"MEDIUM","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"etched onto a weapon that isn't unholy","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"spirit"},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:15:30.995024+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A [holy](link_item_7040) weapon commands powerful celestial energy. [Strikes](link_action_19856) made with it gain the [holy](link_trait_1630) trait and deal an extra 1d4 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage, or an extra 2d4 against an [unholy](link_trait_1846) target. If you are [unholy](link_trait_1846), you are enfeebled 2 while carrying or wielding this weapon.\n\n**Activate—Holy Healing** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\