y](link_item_7040) [staff](link_item_7853)*. While wielding a *[celestial staff](link_item_11832)*, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against effects that have the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait and effects created by [unholy](link_trait_1846) creatures. When you prepare this staff, if you’re [unholy](link_trait_1846), you become drained 1 until your next daily preparations.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[divine lance](link_spell_4578)*\n*   **1st** *[bless](link_spell_4415)*, *[protection](link_spell_4782)*\n*   **2nd** *[everlight](link_spell_4607)*, *[inner radiance torrent](link_spell_8830)*\n*   **3rd** *[anointed ground](link_spell_6716)*, *[protection](link_spell_4782)*\n*   **4th** *[holy cascade](link_spell_6748)*, *[inner radiance torrent](link_spell_8830)*\n*   **5th** *[spiritual guardian](link_spell_4856)*, *[summon celestial](link_spell_4867)*\n*   **6th** *[holy cascade](link_spell_6748)*, *[summon celestial](link_spell_4867)*\n*   **7th** **[frigid flurry](link_spell_8891)**, *[howling blizzard](link_spell_4663)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You're [holy](link_trait_1630). Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":11832,"bulk":"1","name":"Celestial Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2628574946957144","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":17,"price":{"gp":14000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7040,"name":"Holy","rune":{"id":7040,"bulk":"0","name":"Holy","size":"MEDIUM","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"etched onto a weapon that isn't unholy","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","r