 the affixed weapon\n\nThis delicate [dawnsilver](link_item_15369) chain strung with tiny [shuriken](link_item_7768) is wound tightly around the handle of the affixed weapon. When you Activate the chain, three [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [shuriken](link_item_7768) made from magical [force](link_trait_1560) materialize in the target's space and split off to attack other creatures. Attempt up to three [shuriken](link_item_7768) [Strikes](link_action_19856) that must each target a different creature and can't target the creature you hit to trigger this [talisman](link_trait_1544). These [Strikes](link_action_19856) use your attack modifier but originate from the hit creature's space. These attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after all three attacks have been made. The [shuriken](link_item_7768) deal [force](link_trait_1560) damage instead of their normal type, and each [shuriken](link_item_7768) vanishes after its attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11834,"bulk":"0","name":"Chain of Stars","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7395381616649990","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"affixed-to-a-thrown-weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1560,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4632","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:11.319607+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You hit a creature with the affixed weapon\n\nThis delicate [dawnsilver](link_item_15369) chain strung with tiny [shuriken](link_item_7768) is wound tightly around the handle of the affixed weapon. When you Activate the chain, three [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [shuriken](link_item_7768) made from magical [force](link_trait_1560) materialize in the target's space and split off to attack other creatures. Attempt up to three [shuriken](link_item_7768) [Strikes](link_action_19856) that must each target a different creature and can't target the creature you hit to trigger this [talisman](link_trait_1544). These [Strikes](link_action_19856) use your attack modifier but originate from the hit creature's space. These attacks count toward your multiple attack penalty, but the penalty doesn't increase until after all three attacks have been made. The [shuriken](link_item_7768) deal [force](link_trait_1560) damage instead of their normal type, and each [shuriken](link_item_7768) vanishes after its attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11835,"type":"item","before":{"id":11835,"bulk":"1","name":"Chain Sword","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4024057621068574","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":6},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1570,1573,1562],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=638","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"chain-sword","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10,"base_item_content":{"id":11835,"bulk":"1","name":"Chain Sword","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":4024057621068574,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level"