+1 circumstance bonus to initiative rolls.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[time sense](link_spell_5526)*\n*   **1st** *[déjà vu](link_spell_6734)*, *[synchronize](link_spell_9042)*\n*   **2nd** *[loose time's arrow](link_spell_5136)*, *[synchronize](link_spell_9042)*\n*   **3rd** *[day's weight](link_spell_8851)*, *[haste](link_spell_4654)*, *[slow](link_spell_4839)*, *[time jump](link_spell_9051)*\n*   **4th** *[curse of lost time](link_spell_6733)*\n*   **5th** *[quicken time](link_spell_5168)*, *[rewinding step](link_spell_9017)*, *[stagnate time](link_spell_5169)*\n*   **6th** *[cast into time](link_spell_8825)*, *[day's weight](link_spell_8851)*\n*   **7th** *[time beacon](link_spell_7373)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11847,"type":"item","before":{"id":11847,"bulk":"0","name":"Cinnamon Seers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8970049625302506","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":14},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4443","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:49:31.060Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:22.079801+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nZippy, alchemically treated cinnamon suffuses [cinnamon seers](link_item_11847), a rock candy with a lively taste that provides a mental boost. A [cinnamon seer](link_item_11847) remains in your mouth for 1 hour, its stimulating flavor granting you a +1 item bonus to checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753).\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([fortune](link_trait_1460)) **Trigger** You gain no information from a [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) check; **Effect** Reroll the triggering check. If this was a [secret](link_trait_1463) check, the GM rerolls rather than you; the candy doesn't give you any insight into what the GM rolled, so in that case, you're rerolling based only on guesswork. The seer becomes inert. You become temporarily immune to [cinnamon seers](link_item_11847) until the next time you make your daily preparations.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11847,"bulk":"0","name":"Cinnamon Seers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8970049625302506","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":14},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4443","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:49:31.060Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:22.079801+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nZippy, alchemically treated cinnamon suffuses [cinnamon seers](link_item_11847), a rock candy with a lively taste that provides a mental boost. A [cinnamon seer](link_item_11847) remains in your mouth for 1 hour, its stimulating flavor granting you a +1 item bonus to checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753).\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([fortune](link_trait_1460)) **Trigger** You gain no information from a [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) check; **Effect** Reroll the triggering check. If this was a [secret](link_trait_1463) check, the GM rerolls rather than you; the candy doesn't give you any insight into what the GM rolled, so in that case, you're rerolling based only on guesswork. The seer becomes inert. You become temporarily immune to [cinnamon seers](link_item_11847) until the next time you make your daily preparations.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11848,"type":"item","before":{"id":11848,"bulk":"0","name":"Clarity Goggles (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5585732612766011","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":32500},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4846","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:37:56.168Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:22.65369+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f422c016-5fcc-40e8-9adb-532f20b64017","data":{"text":"to visual Perception checks.","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"_[Clarity goggles](link_item_11848)_ feature faceted lenses that filter your surroundings from several slightly different angles at once, giving you a sharper picture of them. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +3 item bonus to visual Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You focus on your environment and the creatures around you to see them as they really are. The GM rolls a [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check using your Perception bonus against any [illusion](link_trait_1447) effect created by a 9th-rank or lower spell or a creature of 19th level or lower. You must be able to see the [illusion](link_trait_1447), and it must be within 60 feet. If the check succeeds, you see through the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for 10 minutes.\n\n_PFS Note:_ The Item Level determines the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank, not the character level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11848,"bulk":"0","name":"Clarity Goggles (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5585732612766011","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":32500},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4846","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:37:56.168Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:22.65369+00:00","operations":[{"id":"f422c016-5fcc-40e8-9adb-532f20b64017","data":{"text":"to visual Perception checks.","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"_[Clarity goggles](link_item_11848)_ feature faceted lenses that filter your surroundings from several slightly different angles at once, giving you a sharper picture of them. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +3 item bonus to visual Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You focus on your environment and the creatures around you to see them as they really are. The GM rolls a [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check using your Perception bonus against any [illusion](link_trait_1447) effect created by a 9th-rank or lower spell or a creature of 19th level or lower. You must be able to see the [illusion](link_trait_1447), and it must be within 60 feet. If the check succeeds, you see through the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for 10 minutes.\n\n_PFS Note:_ The Item Level determines the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank, not the character level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11849,"type":"item","before":{"id":11849,"bulk":"0","name":"Clarity Goggles (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7610396629214118","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4846","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-1