at once, giving you a sharper picture of them. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +1 item bonus to visual Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You focus on your environment and the creatures around you to see them as they really are. The GM rolls a [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check using your Perception bonus against any [illusion](link_trait_1447) effect created by a 3rd-rank or lower spell or a creature of 8th level or lower. You must be able to see the [illusion](link_trait_1447), and it must be within 60 feet. If the check succeeds, you see through the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for 10 minutes.\n\n_PFS Note:_ The Item Level determines the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank, not the character level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11850,"type":"item","before":{"id":11850,"bulk":"0","name":"Clarity Goggles (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7747382518572657","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":2450},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4846","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:23.878158+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Clarity goggles](link_item_11850)_ feature faceted lenses that filter your surroundings from several slightly different angles at once, giving you a sharper picture of them. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +2 item bonus to visual Perception 