ironment and the creatures around you to see them as they really are. The GM rolls a [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check using your Perception bonus against any [illusion](link_trait_1447) effect created by a 6th-rank or lower spell or a creature of 13th level or lower. You must be able to see the [illusion](link_trait_1447), and it must be within 60 feet. If the check succeeds, you see through the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for 10 minutes.\n\n_PFS Note:_ The Item Level determines the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank, not the character level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11851,"type":"item","before":{"id":11851,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clockwork Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1662814490608575","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":20000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4842","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:25.995712+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Paper-thin interlocking gears and winding cogs make up this bronze cloak.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Trigger** You're struck by a melee attack with a held weapon\n\n**Effect** The folds of the cloak attempt to divert the attack and catch the weapon in the cloak's gears. Make an Athletics check to [Disarm](link_action_19626) the attacking creature.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You wrap the cloak around yourself and the winding gears decelerate your body, causing you to enter standby mode. While in standby mode you don't need to eat, drink, or sleep. You remain aware of your surroundings but take a -4 penalty to Perception checks. You can stay in standby mode indefinitely, although your body ages normally. You can leave standby mode as a free action. If you do so to initiate combat, you gain a +2 item bonus to your initiative roll.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11851,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clockwork Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1662814490608575","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":20000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4842","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:25.995712+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Paper-thin interlocking gears and winding cogs make up this bronze cloak.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Trigger** You're struck by a melee attack with a held weapon\n\n**Effect** The folds of the cloak attempt to divert the attack and catch the weapon in the cloak's gears. Make an Athletics check to [Disarm](link_action_19626) the attacking creature.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You wrap the cloak around yourself and the winding gears decelerate your body, causing you to enter standby mode. While in standby mode you don't need to eat, drink, or sleep. You remain aware of your surroundings but take a -4 penalty to Perception checks. You can stay in standby mode indefinitely, although your body ages normally. You can leave standby mode as a free action. If you do so to initiate combat, you gain a +2 item bonus to your initiative roll.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11852,"type":"item","before":{"id":11852,"bulk":"1","name":"Clockwork Shield (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2443724860300095","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":22000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":130,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":130,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4390","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"","hardness":17,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"steel-shield","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":65},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:26.546849+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ec824709-3978-4fd6-9085-9e905d9b8919","data":{"itemId":15901},"type":"giveItem"}],"description":"This brass-coated, [steel shield](link_item_7855) (Hardness 17, HP 130, and BT 65) has [_+3_](link_item_7952) [_greater striking_](link_item_7860) [_shield spikes_](link_item_7754) made of bronze gears.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield's gears begin to spin, subtly adjusting the shield's position as you fight. You gain an extra reaction this turn and at the start of each of your turns for the next minute that you can use only to [Shield Block](link_feat_20534).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11852,"bulk":"1","name":"Clockwork Shield (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"244372486030