","page":"22"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"","hardness":12,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":"steel-shield","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":45},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:27.21426+00:00","operations":[{"id":"d8fc705b-d88e-4348-8ac7-05e835a6b874","data":{"itemId":15900},"type":"giveItem"}],"description":"This brass-coated, [steel shield](link_item_7855) (Hardness 12, HP 90, BT 45) has [_+2_](link_item_7951) [_striking_](link_item_7862) [_shield spikes_](link_item_7754) made of bronze gears.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield's gears begin to spin, subtly adjusting the shield's position as you fight. You gain an extra reaction this turn and at the start of each of your turns for the next minute that you can use only to [Shield Block](link_feat_20534).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11853,"bulk":"1","name":"Clockwork Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2317284900492432","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1300},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":90,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":90,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4390","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"","hardness":12,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":"steel-shield","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":45},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:27.21426+00:00","operations":[{"id":"d8fc705b-d88e-4348-8ac7-05e835a6b874","data":{"itemId":15900},"type":"giveItem"}],"description":"This brass-coated, [steel shield](link_item_7855) (Hardness 12, HP 90, BT 45) has [_+2_](link_item_7951) [_striking_](link_item_7862) [_shield spikes_](link_item_7754) made of bronze gears.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield's gears begin to spin, subtly adjusting the shield's position as you fight. You gain an extra reaction this turn and at the start of each of your turns for the next minute that you can use only to [Shield Block](link_feat_20534).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11854,"type":"item","before":{"id":11854,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1137973105322609","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:27.769422+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8b50cf36-b478-4347-8ec7-f2a13802f40d","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11854)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) with the [focused](link_trait_1526) trait and grants a +2 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level. The robe also has the skill bonuses and activation of [devoted vestments](link_item_6872). When you cast *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, healing granted to followers of that deity is increased by the rank of the spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [cleric](link_class_22) domain spell for a domain belonging to the deity the robe is dedicated to. If you don't spend this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) by the end of this turn, it is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"after":{"id":11854,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1137973105322609","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:27.769422+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8b50cf36-b478-4347-8ec7-f2a13802f40d","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11854)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) with the [focused](link_trait_1526) trait and grants a +2 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level. The robe also has the skill bonuses and activation of [devoted vestments](link_item_6872). When you cast *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, healing granted to followers of that deity is increased by the rank of the spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [cleric](link_class_22) domain spell for a domain belonging to the deity the robe is dedicated to. If you don't spend this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) by the end of this turn, it is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11855,"type":"item","before":{"id":11855,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4579804228843875","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:28.387392+00:00","operations":[{"id":"d6d153fe-e018-4212-9b04-fc218f11f4d9","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11855)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+1](link_item_6719) [resilient](link_item_7703) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) and grants a +1 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"after":{"id":11855,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4579804228843875","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:28.387392+00:00","operations":[{"id":"d6d153fe-e018-4212-9b04-fc218f11f4d9","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11855)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+1](link_item_6719) [resilient](link_item_7703) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) and grants a +1 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11856,"type":"item","before":{"id":11856,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3612452907841261","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":32000},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:00:25.163Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:30.837081+00:00","operations":[{"id":"a495fb65-0a73-4181-966b-4c082c674dc3","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11856)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+3](link_item_6721) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) with the [focused](link_trait_1526) trait and grants a +2 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level. The robe also has the skill bonuses and activation of [devoted vestments](link_item_6872). When you cast *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, healing granted to followers of that deity is increased by the rank of the spell.\n\n**Activate—Domain Devotion** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [cleric domain spell](link_feat_20077) for a domain belonging to the deity the robe is dedicated to. If you don't spend this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) by the end of this turn, it is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"after":{"id":11856,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3612452907841261","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":32000},"usage":"worn garment",