ink_item_6872). When you cast *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, healing granted to followers of that deity is increased by the rank of the spell.\n\n**Activate—Domain Devotion** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [cleric domain spell](link_feat_20077) for a domain belonging to the deity the robe is dedicated to. If you don't spend this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) by the end of this turn, it is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11857,"type":"item","before":{"id":11857,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"149660427908043","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:31.454468+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ad749be8-10fc-4cb1-9b38-54ff3946e930","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11857)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) and grants a +2 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"after":{"id":11857,"bulk":"1","name":"Cloister Robe (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"149660427908043","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"worn garment","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4853","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"explorers-clothing","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:31.454468+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ad749be8-10fc-4cb1-9b38-54ff3946e930","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The most devoted, [cloistered clerics](link_feat_34053) wear a _[cloister robe](link_item_11857)_. Decorations symbolic of a specific deity adorn the robe, and the robe's colors and the complexity of its construction fit the deity's outlook. The robe serves as a [religious symbol](link_item_7696) of that deity, and it doesn't need to be wielded to provide that benefit.\n\nThe robe is [+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [explorer's clothing](link_item_6939) and grants a +2 item bonus to Religion checks. The robe doesn't grant any benefits to a wearer who doesn't worship the deity tied to the robe. In addition, when you cast a domain spell from one of the deity's domains, you gain resistance to damage from [divine](link_trait_1475) spells until the end of your next turn. This resistance is equal to half the robe's level.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [cleric](link_class_22) who worships the deity tied to the robe."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11858,"type":"item","before":{"id":11858,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cloning Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4953320418700431","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":5000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4613","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"88"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:32.448368+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you drink a [cloning potion](link_item_11858), you split in two, one version of you remaining in your space and the other moving into an adjacent space. Your clone, which has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait, looks like you and remains for 1 minute. Provided you are both on the same plane, you can command your clone telepathically with a single action with the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait. You can also issue verbal commands, as normal for a [minion](link_trait_2527). As an action that has the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait, you can sense through your clone. When you do, you lose all sensory information from your own body. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) this sense-sharing effect.\n\nYou and your clone share Hit Points, and the clone uses your statistics. Spells and effects target you and your clone as if you are separate creatures. The clone can Activate your abilities and [Cast your Spells](link_action_19611), limited by its number of actions, but you share elements such as use limits, frequency, and spell slots. In other words, your clone using one of your resources works as if you did so in or from your clone's space. Your clone has gear identical to your own, excepting [artifacts](link_trait_1568) and [consumables](link_trait_1531). Any item taken from the clone melts into silvery dust within seconds, with ammunition or thrown objects lasting just long enough to travel to and possibly hit their target.\n\nWhen the duration lapses, your clone melts into silvery dust. You become temporarily immune to [cloning potion](link_item_11858) for 1d4 days.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11858,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cloning Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4953320418700431","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":5000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4613","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"88"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:32.448368+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you drink a [cloning potion](link_item_11858), you split in two, one version of you remaining in your space and the other moving into an adjacent space. Your clone, which has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait, looks like you and remains for 1 minute. Provided you are both on the same plane, you can command your clone telepathically with a single action with the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait. You can also issue verbal commands, as normal for a [minion](link_trait_2527). As an action that has the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait, you can sense through your clone. When you do, you lose all sensory information from your own body. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) this sense-sharing effect.\n\nYou and your clone share Hit Points, and the clone uses your statistics. Spells and effects target you and your clone as if you are separate creatures. The clone can Activate your abilities and [Cast your Spells](link_action_19611), limited by its number of actions, but you share elements such as use limits, frequency, and spell slots. In other words, your clone using one of your resources works as if you did so in or from your clone's space. Your clone has gear identical to your own, excepting [artifacts](link_trait_1568) and [consumables](link_trait_1531). Any item taken from the clone melts into silvery dust within seconds, with ammunition or thrown objects lasting just long enough to travel to and possibly hit their target.\n\nWhen the duration lapses, your clone melts into silvery dust. You become temporarily immune to [cloning potion](link_item_11858) for 1d4 days.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11859,"type":"item","before":{"id":11859,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clown Monarch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5531536345345289","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":21},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4530","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:33.011748+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA victim of [clown monarch](link_item_11859) is amusing to behold as they repeatedly suffer slapstick pratfalls. This [poison](link_trait_1476) disrupts the victim's sense of balance.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 22\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** falls prone and must succeed at a Flat 5 when attempting a [Stand](link_action_19851) action or the action fails and is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** as stage 1 but a Flat 10 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** as stage 1 but a Flat 15 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11859,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clown Monarch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5531536345345289","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":21},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4530","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:33.011748+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA victim of [clown monarch](link_item_11859) is amusing to behold as they repeatedly suffer slapstick pratfalls. This [poison](link_trait_1476) disrupts the victim's sense of balance.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 22\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** falls prone and must succeed at a Flat 5 when attempting a [Stand](link_action_19851) action or the action fails and is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** as stage 1 but a Flat 10 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** as stage 1 but a Flat 15 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11860,"type":"item","before":{"id":11860,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clubhead Poison","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5108747944059799","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":340},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4531","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:33.529698+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) is named for the strain of fungi from which it's distilled. Hallucinations assail the victim's mind, causing them to see imaginary foes.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 32\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 3d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, and can't take reactions (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 4d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, can't take reactions, stunned 1 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 5d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, can't take reactions, and stunned 1 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11860,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Clubhead Poison","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5108747944059799","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":340},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4531","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:33.529698+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) is named for the strain of fungi from which it's distilled. Hallucinations assail the victim's mind, causing them to see imaginary foes.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 32\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 3d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, and can't take reactions (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 4d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, can't take reactions, stunned 1 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 5d8 [poison](link_trait_1476), off-guard, can't take reactions, and stunned 1 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11861,"type":"item","before":{"id":11861,"bulk":"","name":"Coating","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1922126300648590","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4398","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"32"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:34.125989+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When etched, this rune creates an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space that links to the weapon that wields it. The space can hold up to 1 Bulk but can contain only [poisons](link_trait_1476) and [magic](link_trait_1504) [oils](link_trait_1543) that could be applied to the weapon. Stowing or retrieving an item in the space requires an [Interact](link_action_19733) action, except when using the rune's activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** At least one [magic](link_trait_1504) [oil](link_trait_1543) or [poison](link_trait_1476) is stored inside the rune's [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space; **Effect** For 1 minute, you can apply stored [oils](link_trait_1543) and [poisons](link_trait_1476) to the weapon without needing any hands free. Applying them takes the same number of actions as normal. An [oil](link_trait_1543) or [poison](link_trait_1476) applied this way pours directly from the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space onto the weapon, and when it's fully applied, its empty vial is ejected.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11861,"bulk":"","name":"Coating","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1922126300648590","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4398","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"32"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:34.125989+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When etched, this rune creates an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space that links to the weapon that wields it. The space can hold up to 1 Bulk but can contain only [poisons](link_trait_1476) and [magic](link_trait_1504) [oils](link_trait_1543) that could be applied to the weapon. Stowing or retrieving an item in the space requires an [Interact](link_action_19733) action, except when using the rune's activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** At least one [magic](link_trait_1504) [oil](link_trait_1543) or [poison](link_trait_1476) is stored inside the rune's [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space; **Effect** For 1 minute, you can apply stored [oils](link_trait_1543) and [poisons](link_trait_1476) to the weapon without needing any hands free. Applying them takes the same number of actions as normal. An [oil](link_trait_1543) or [poison](link_trait_1476) applied this way pours directly from the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space onto the weapon, and when it's fully applied, its empty vial is ejected.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11862,"type":"item","before":{"id":11862,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Codex of Destruction and Renewal","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1076716059266349","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4707","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:34.626176+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An unsmiling mask, half obsidian and half ivory, is embossed on the cover of this weighty tome, the opposite color forming the background of each half. Each _[codex of destruction and renewal](link_item_11862)_ is said to contain a fragment of the knowledge Nethys gained in his apotheosis and they're sacred to his church.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a damage-dealing spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855), the spell wreaks even greater destruction. The spell ignores 10 resistance and you reroll any damage dice that roll a 1. If the spell reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points, they're torn apart at an infinitesimal level, not even leaving a fine ash; this is a [death](link_trait_1904) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a [healing](link_trait_1442) spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855) that restores Hit Points, the spell renews the target constantly and perfectly. The spell grants the target regeneration 20, restoring 20 Hit Points at the start of its turn and preventing the target both from dying due to damage and from its dying condition increasing to a value that would result in its death. Each time the creature regains Hit Points from regeneration, it regrows all damaged or ruined organs; it can also regrow any severed body parts as a free action immediately after the body part is severed, with the original crumbling to ash. The effect lasts for 4 rounds.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11862,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Codex of Destruction and Renewal","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1076716059266349","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4707","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:34.626176+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An unsmiling mask, half obsidian and half ivory, is embossed on the cover of this weighty tome, the opposite color forming the background of each half. Each _[codex of destruction and renewal](link_item_11862)_ is said to contain a fragment of the knowledge Nethys gained in his apotheosis and they're sacred to his church.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a damage-dealing spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855), the spell wreaks even greater destruction. The spell ignores 10 resistance and you reroll any damage dice that roll a 1. If the spell reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points, they're torn apart at an infinitesimal level, not even leaving a fine ash; this is a [death](link_trait_1904) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a [healing](link_trait_1442) spell prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855) that restores Hit Points, the spell renews the target constantly and perfectly. The spell grants the target regeneration 20, restoring 20 Hit Points at the start of its turn and preventing the target both from dying due to damage and from its dying condition increasing to a value that would result in its death. Each time the creature regains Hit Points from regeneration, it regrows all damaged or ruined organs; it can also regrow any severed body parts as a free action immediately after the body part is severed, with the original crumbling to ash. The effect lasts for 4 rounds.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11863,"type":"item","before":{"id":11863,"bulk":"1","name":"Coldstar Pistols","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4424371737933208","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":23,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1569,1568,1841,1686,3073],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":120,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":6960,"name":"Flaming (Greater)"},{"id":6975,"name":"Frost (Greater)"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"0","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4890","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"178"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"siccatite","grade":"high"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"dueling-pistol","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:35.849953+00:00","operations":null,"description":"One [dueling pistol](link_item_13844) in this paired set is etched with flames along its barrel, while the other is etched with icicles. In these separate forms, one gun comprising the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ functions as a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)_ and the other as a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [greater frost](link_item_6975) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)_. When joined, the guns form a double-barreled weapon that functions as a _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [greater frost](link_item_6975) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)._ The combined form has a range increment of 120 feet. In either form, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ have the [agile](link_trait_1569), [concealable](link_trait_1841), [concussive](link_trait_3073), and [fatal d10](link_trait_1686) traits. As star guns, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ run on magic and don't use ammunition or [black powder](link_item_13495).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You switch the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ from one form to the other. Attempt a Deception check to [Feint](link_action_19633) with a +4 circumstance bonus.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per round\n\n**Effect** Make two [Strikes](link_action_19856) against one target, taking the highest of the two attack rolls and applying it to both attacks. Your multiple attack penalty increases only after these [Strikes](link_action_19856).\n\n**Destruction** If Deft Onki's name and deeds ever fade from mortal memory entirely, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ can be destroyed like a normal object.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11863,"bulk":"1","name":"Coldstar Pistols","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4424371737933208","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":23,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1569,1568,1841,1686,3073],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":120,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":6960,"name":"Flaming (Greater)"},{"id":6975,"name":"Frost (Greater)"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"0","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4890","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"178"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"siccatite","grade":"high"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"dueling-pistol","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:35.849953+00:00","operations":null,"description":"One [dueling pistol](link_item_13844) in this paired set is etched with flames along its barrel, while the other is etched with icicles. In these separate forms, one gun comprising the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ functions as a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)_ and the other as a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [greater frost](link_item_6975) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)_. When joined, the guns form a double-barreled weapon that functions as a _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [greater frost](link_item_6975) [dueling pistol](link_item_13844)._ The combined form has a range increment of 120 feet. In either form, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ have the [agile](link_trait_1569), [concealable](link_trait_1841), [concussive](link_trait_3073), and [fatal d10](link_trait_1686) traits. As star guns, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ run on magic and don't use ammunition or [black powder](link_item_13495).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You switch the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ from one form to the other. Attempt a Deception check to [Feint](link_action_19633) with a +4 circumstance bonus.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per round\n\n**Effect** Make two [Strikes](link_action_19856) against one target, taking the highest of the two attack rolls and applying it to both attacks. Your multiple attack penalty increases only after these [Strikes](link_action_19856).\n\n**Destruction** If Deft Onki's name and deeds ever fade from mortal memory entirely, the _[Coldstar Pistols](link_item_11863)_ can be destroyed like a normal object.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11864,"type":"item","before":{"id":11864,"bulk":"1","name":"Collar of the Shifting Spider","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8496311104382092","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":133},"usage":"worn collar","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4508","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:08:10.408Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:36.466577+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This intimidating collar contains a hollow central tube and ends in twin metal points shaped like spider fangs. The collar can be loaded with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [mutagen](link_trait_1563) as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** A [mutagen](link_trait_1563) is loaded in the collar; **Effect** The metal points dig into your neck, inflicting 1 piercing damage and injecting the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) directly into your bloodstream. This has the same effect as if you drank the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) conventionally, except the duration of the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) is halved due to the more direct administration.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11864,"bulk":"1","name":"Collar of the Shifting Spider","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8496311104382092","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":133},"usage":"worn collar","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4508","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:08:10.408Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:36.466577+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This intimidating collar contains a hollow central tube and ends in twin metal points shaped like spider fangs. The collar can be loaded with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [mutagen](link_trait_1563) as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** A [mutagen](link_trait_1563) is loaded in the collar; **Effect** The metal points dig into your neck, inflicting 1 piercing damage and injecting the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) directly into your bloodstream. This has the same effect as if you drank the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) conventionally, except the duration of the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) is halved due to the more direct administration.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11865,"type":"item","before":{"id":11865,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Blue)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5052441963356793","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:37.088023+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11865) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11865) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Blue colorful coating](link_item_11865) contains bonding compounds that firm up a surface, making it more stable and more supportive of weight. When applied to material that’s loose or unstable, the square can hold twice as much weight before giving way. The coating also slows any collapse, making it easier to avoid and granting a +1 circumstance bonus to Reflex saving throws in reaction to the coated surface’s collapse.\n\nThis coating can shore up a wall, ceiling, door, or similar opening, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to the DC for Athletics checks to [Force Open](link_action_19722) the coated surface.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11865,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Blue)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5052441963356793","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:37.088023+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11865) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11865) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Blue colorful coating](link_item_11865) contains bonding compounds that firm up a surface, making it more stable and more supportive of weight. When applied to material that’s loose or unstable, the square can hold twice as much weight before giving way. The coating also slows any collapse, making it easier to avoid and granting a +1 circumstance bonus to Reflex saving throws in reaction to the coated surface’s collapse.\n\nThis coating can shore up a wall, ceiling, door, or similar opening, granting a +2 circumstance bonus to the DC for Athletics checks to [Force Open](link_action_19722) the coated surface.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11866,"type":"item","before":{"id":11866,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Green)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5785677594511110","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:58:13.512Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:37.818908+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11866) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11866) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Green colorful coating](link_item_11866) dries into a low-friction surface. It makes the square slippery, making it both difficult terrain and uneven ground with a DC to [Balance](link_action_19608) of 20. A creature that [Steps](link_action_19853) or [Crawls](link_action_19618) doesn't have to attempt to [Balance](link_action_19608).\n\nThe coating also makes a coated wall or ceiling harder to [climb](link_action_19612). It imposes a –2 circumstance penalty to checks to [Climb](link_action_19612) the coated surface.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) and [green colorful coating](link_item_11866) have opposite effects. If they're both applied to the same surface, they negate one another.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11866,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Green)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5785677594511110","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:58:13.512Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:37.818908+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11866) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11866) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Green colorful coating](link_item_11866) dries into a low-friction surface. It makes the square slippery, making it both difficult terrain and uneven ground with a DC to [Balance](link_action_19608) of 20. A creature that [Steps](link_action_19853) or [Crawls](link_action_19618) doesn't have to attempt to [Balance](link_action_19608).\n\nThe coating also makes a coated wall or ceiling harder to [climb](link_action_19612). It imposes a –2 circumstance penalty to checks to [Climb](link_action_19612) the coated surface.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) and [green colorful coating](link_item_11866) have opposite effects. If they're both applied to the same surface, they negate one another.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11867,"type":"item","before":{"id":11867,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Indigo)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2091883847279270","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"i