ity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:38.363397+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11867) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11867) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\nIndigo [colorful coating](link_item_11867) contains agents that destroy weaker objects. When applied to a surface or object, the coating treats the object’s Hardness as 2 lower and deals 1d4 [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to the object each round. The damage this coating deals remains after the coating becomes inert.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11868,"type":"item","before":{"id":11868,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Orange)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"332084623674258","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":12},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:38.878289+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11868) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11868) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\nOrange [colorful coating](link_item_11868) contains a mixture of acidic substances. As it dries, caustic ingredients rise to the coating’s surface. The square becomes hazardous terrain, dealing 1d4 [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to any creature that moves through it. A creature can take this [acid](link_trait_1528) damage only once per round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11868,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Orange)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"332084623674258","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":12},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:38.878289+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11868) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11868) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\nOrange [colorful coating](link_item_11868) contains a mixture of acidic substances. As it dries, caustic ingredients rise to the coating’s surface. The square becomes hazardous terrain, dealing 1d4 [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to any creature that moves through it. A creature can take this [acid](link_trait_1528) damage only once per round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11869,"type":"item","before":{"id":11869,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Red)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6904027926884600","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:39.444183+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11869) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11869) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Red colorful coating](link_item_11869) contains rubbery compounds, turning any surface it covers into a trampoline. A creature or object that falls onto a square coated with [red colorful coating](link_item_11869) takes no falling damage and bounces half again as high as the original fall. If the creature fell straight down, then with several bounces, it comes safely to a stop. If it was moving horizontally, its bounce continues in the same direction, with a distance determined by the GM. If the coating is on a wall, a creature pushed or [Shoved](link_action_19849) into the wall bounces back half again as far and avoids taking any damage from being pushed into the wall. On a ceiling, [red colorful coating](link_item_11869) is useful only in unusual circumstances, such as in an area where gravity is reversed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11869,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Red)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6904027926884600","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:39.444183+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11869) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It’s possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM’s discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11869) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Red colorful coating](link_item_11869) contains rubbery compounds, turning any surface it covers into a trampoline. A creature or object that falls onto a square coated with [red colorful coating](link_item_11869) takes no falling damage and bounces half again as high as the original fall. If the creature fell straight down, then with several bounces, it comes safely to a stop. If it was moving horizontally, its bounce continues in the same direction, with a distance determined by the GM. If the coating is on a wall, a creature pushed or [Shoved](link_action_19849) into the wall bounces back half again as far and avoids taking any damage from being pushed into the wall. On a ceiling, [red colorful coating](link_item_11869) is useful only in unusual circumstances, such as in an area where gravity is reversed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11870,"type":"item","before":{"id":11870,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Violet)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8696078858758375","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:40.054768+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11870) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11870) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\nViolet [colorful coating](link_item_11870) contains compounds that become goopy and sticky. A square of this coating is difficult terrain. Any creature that enters the square must succeed at a DC 20 Reflex save or take a –15-foot penalty to its Speeds until the end of its next turn. On a critical failure, the creature is immobilized in the square until the end of its next turn. The target can end these effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 20) or spending 2 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to remove the sticky substances. These [Interact](link_action_19733) actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can help by providing the actions.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11870,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Violet)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8696078858758375","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:40.054768+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11870) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11870) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\nViolet [colorful coating](link_item_11870) contains compounds that become goopy and sticky. A square of this coating is difficult terrain. Any creature that enters the square must succeed at a DC 20 Reflex save or take a –15-foot penalty to its Speeds until the end of its next turn. On a critical failure, the creature is immobilized in the square until the end of its next turn. The target can end these effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 20) or spending 2 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to remove the sticky substances. These [Interact](link_action_19733) actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can help by providing the actions.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11871,"type":"item","before":{"id":11871,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Yellow)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8994316966235179","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:18:15.209Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:40.581022+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11871) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11871) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) contains a variety of compounds that fill small gaps and harden into a flat surface that increases friction, making it much easier to move on the square's surface. On the affected surface, the coating reduces difficult terrain caused by slipperiness, such as from ice or grease; this eliminates difficult terrain, reduces greater difficult terrain to difficult terrain, and reduces uneven ground to greater difficult terrain. The coating can't affect difficult terrain caused by features or effects not part of the surface, such as crowds, underbrush, wind, magic, and so on. The GM determines if [yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) can affect a surface's terrain.\n\nThe coating also makes a coated wall or ceiling easier to [climb](link_action_19612). It provides a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to [Climb](link_action_19612) the coated surface.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) and [green colorful coating](link_item_11866) have opposite effects. If they're both applied to the same surface, they negate one another.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11871,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Colorful Coating (Yellow)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8994316966235179","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4471","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"53"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:18:15.209Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:40.581022+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThese coatings come in different colors, each with a different special effect. A bottle of [colorful coating](link_item_11871) contains enough to slather over one 5-foot square within your reach or space and is made with a special dispenser that enables you to coat the surface using only one hand. It's possible to use the coating on any surface that can be painted (subject to the GM's discretion). [Colorful coating](link_item_11871) dries instantly, and its effect in the square you coated lasts for 1 minute. After that time, the coating turns to fine, inert powder, returning the square to its original condition unless otherwise noted.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) contains a variety of compounds that fill small gaps and harden into a flat surface that increases friction, making it much easier to move on the square's surface. On the affected surface, the coating reduces difficult terrain caused by slipperiness, such as from ice or grease; this eliminates difficult terrain, reduces greater difficult terrain to difficult terrain, and reduces uneven ground to greater difficult terrain. The coating can't affect difficult terrain caused by features or effects not part of the surface, such as crowds, underbrush, wind, magic, and so on. The GM determines if [yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) can affect a surface's terrain.\n\nThe coating also makes a coated wall or ceiling easier to [climb](link_action_19612). It provides a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to [Climb](link_action_19612) the coated surface.\n\n[Yellow colorful coating](link_item_11871) and [green colorful coating](link_item_11866) have opposite effects. If they're both applied to the same surface, they negate one another.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11872,"type":"item","before":{"id":11872,"bulk":"1","name":"Combat Lure","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8329563397567580","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1570,1535,1843,2878],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":8,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":8,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=621","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":2,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":4},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:42.663293+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A [combat lure](link_item_11872) is a weighted leather sack at the end of a length of toughened cord and can be used both to bludgeon opponents and signal directions to a trained avian or other [animal](link_trait_2409).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11872,"bulk":"1","name":"Combat Lure","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8329563397567580","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1570,1535,1843,2878],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":8,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":8,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=621","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"26"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":2,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":4},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:42.663293+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A [combat lure](link_item_11872) is a weighted leather sack at the end of a length of toughened cord and can be used both to bludgeon opponents and signal directions to a trained avian or other [animal](link_trait_2409).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11873,"type":"item","before":{"id":11873,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Communion Mat","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7324504003517443","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3750},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4708","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:43.455958+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This pageless [grimoire](link_trait_2855) is made up of two durable covers that open to display a small ritual circle. When you first [invest](link_action_20775) the [grimoire](link_trait_2855), you and your familiar each press a limb to a corner of the mat. The ritual circle then morphs to one matching the tradition of your patron, the spells contained in your familiar appearing in the margins. During your daily preparations, your familiar performs a small jaunt around the open ritual circle to strengthen its connection to your patron.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465)) **Frequency** once per 10 minutes; **Effect** If your next action is to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) your familiar learned from a lesson (whether a [cantrip](link_trait_1858) or from a spell slot), your patron notices that you’re putting their power to good use and strengthens your familiar with a surge of magic. Your familiar [Sustains](link_action_19858) one of your spells.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11873,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Communion Mat","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7324504003517443","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3750},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4708","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"111"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:43.455958+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This pageless [grimoire](link_trait_2855) is made up of two durable covers that open to display a small ritual circle. When you first [invest](link_action_20775) the [grimoire](link_trait_2855), you and your familiar each press a limb to a corner of the mat. The ritual circle then morphs to one matching the tradition of your patron, the spells contained in your familiar appearing in the margins. During your daily preparations, your familiar performs a small jaunt around the open ritual circle to strengthen its connection to your patron.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465)) **Frequency** once per 10 minutes; **Effect** If your next action is to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) your familiar learned from a lesson (whether a [cantrip](link_trait_1858) or from a spell slot), your patron notices that you’re putting their power to good use and strengthens your familiar with a surge of magic. Your familiar [Sustains](link_action_19858) one of your spells.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11874,"type":"item","before":{"id":11874,"bulk":"1","name":"Composer Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5954594157509814","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":8,"price":{"gp":480},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1546],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4783","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"132"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["composer"]},{"key":"RollOption","domain":"performance","option":"composer"}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T03:39:48.364Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7853,"bulk":"1","name":"Staff","size":"MEDIUM","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3630,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"