ich otherwise remains active for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11880,"type":"item","before":{"id":11880,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Confabulator","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5280156698985116","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"affixed-to-instrument","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4700","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"109"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["confabstrument"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Confabulator Instrument","domain":"performance","option":"confabstrument"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:48.090679+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This device attaches to any non-percussive musical instrument, allowing a non-verbal character to shape the sounds of the instrument into speech. The speech can be any language the character understands, and the sound of the speech resembles the instrument the device is attached to. You also gain a +1 item bonus to Performance checks made with the instrument.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11880,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Confabulator","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5280156698985116","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"affixed-to-instrument","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4700","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"109"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["confabstrument"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Confabulator Instrument","domain":"performance","option":"confabstrument"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:48.090679+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This device attaches to any non-percussive musical instrument, allowing a non-verbal character to shape the sounds of the instrument into speech. The speech can be any language the character understands, and the sound of the speech resembles the instrument the device is attached to. You also gain a +1 item bonus to Performance checks made with the instrument.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11881,"type":"item","before":{"id":11881,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Contagion Metabolizer (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2526884577628690","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4493","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:48.72433+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nContagion metabolizers seek out toxins in the bloodstream and attempt to purify them into humors the body processes naturally. When you drink this [elixir](link_trait_1553), it attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check with a +30 modifier to remove the highest-level [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) afflicting you. The [elixir](link_trait_1553) has a [counteract](link_action_27519) rank of 10. This takes longer for a [disease](link_trait_1857)—the [counteract](link_action_27519) check doesn't happen until 10 minutes after you drink the [elixir](link_trait_1553). After drinking, you become temporarily immune to contagion metabolizers for 1 hour.\n\nIf you're a [chirurgeon alchemist](link_feat_32986) and have [powerful alchemy](link_class-feature_31232), you can substitute your statistics when you create a [contagion metabolizer](link_item_11881) using [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176), if your stats are higher. This replaces the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank with half your level rounded up and the [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier with your class DC – 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11881,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Contagion Metabolizer (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2526884577628690","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4493","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:48.72433+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nContagion metabolizers seek out toxins in the bloodstream and attempt to purify them into humors the body processes naturally. When you drink this [elixir](link_trait_1553), it attempts a [counteract](link_action_27519) check with a +30 modifier to remove the highest-level [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) afflicting you. The [elixir](link_trait_1553) has a [counteract](link_action_27519) rank of 10. This takes longer for a [disease](link_trait_1857)—the [counteract](link_action_27519) check doesn't happen until 10 minutes after you drink the [elixir](link_trait_1553). After drinking, you become temporarily immune to contagion metabolizers for 1 hour.\n\nIf you're a [chirurgeon alchemist](link_feat_32986) and have [powerful alchemy](link_class-feature_31232), you can substitute your statistics when you create a [contagion metabolizer](link_item_11881) using [Quick Alchemy](link_feat_31176), if your stats are higher. This replaces the [counteract](link_action_27519) rank with half your level rounded up and the [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier with your class DC – 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11882,"type":"item","before":{"id":11882,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Contagion Metabolizer (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5830916934492561","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4493","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:23:05.621Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:49.269278+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nContagion metabolizers seek out to