raits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4444","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:31:06.045Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:50.504501+00:00","operations":[{"id":"62690472-3dfa-43ee-8254-1c2101d4fe7d","data":{"id":21145,"text":"**Cooperative Waffles (Greater)** After you and another creature eat cooperative waffles together, when one of you uses Follow the Expert to follow the other, the circumstance bonus granted is 1 higher.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"708ff123-1023-449f-8c08-4926959b1edc","data":{"id":19604,"text":"**Cooperative Waffles (Greater)** After you and another creature eat cooperative waffles together, when one of you successfully Aids a skill check the other attempts, the circumstance bonus granted is 1 higher.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nFlash-cooked on a [waffle iron](link_item_15838) and drizzled with [alchemical](link_trait_1529) syrups and compound butter, [cooperative waffles](link_item_11884) bolster the supportive spirit of those who share the batch. You can split the waffles with one other creature. After you both eat half of the waffles to Activate them, when one of you uses [Follow the Expert](link_action_21145) to follow the other, the circumstance bonus granted is 1 higher. The benefit of the waffles also applies when one of you successfully [Aids](link_action_19604) a skill check the other attempts. The waffles' bonus lasts 24 hours or until you next make your daily preparations, whichever comes first. You can only be linked to one creature in this way at a time; if either of you eats [cooperative waffles](link_item_11884) again, the effect of your previous waffles ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11884,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Cooperative Waffles (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5884041608494004","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4444","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T07:31:06.045Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:50.504501+00:00","operations":[{"id":"62690472-3dfa-43ee-8254-1c2101d4fe7d","data":{"id":21145,"text":"**Cooperative Waffles (Greater)** After you and another creature eat cooperative waffles together, when one of you uses [Follow the Expert](link_action_21145) to follow the other, the circumstance bonus granted is 1 higher.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"708ff123-1023-449f-8c08-4926959b1edc","data":{"id":19604,"text":"**Cooperative Waffles (Greater)** After you and another creature eat cooperative waffles together, when one of you successfully [Aids](link_action_19604) a skill check the other attempts, the circumstance bonus granted is 1 higher.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nFlash-cooked on a [waffle iron](link_item_15838) and drizzled with [alche