ion-symbol\">2</abbr> ([sonic](link_trait_1484))\n\n**Effect** You blow a bubble with the gum until it pops, after which it becomes inert. The pop deals 8d4 [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage to all creatures in a 15-foot cone with a basic DC 30 Fortitude save. A creature that fails its save is also bound with sticky gum, taking a –10-foot item penalty to its Speed for 1 minute. The creature can remove the gum with a total of 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions. These actions don't have to be consecutive, and other creatures can provide the actions as well.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11893,"bulk":"0","name":"Crackling Bubble Gum (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"790575753270023","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4445","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:15:57.571676+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tangy gum cracks and pops in your mouth as you chew it. While you're chewing [crackling bubble gum](link_item_11893), for up to 10 minutes, you have a +2 item bonus to saving throws against [auditory](link_trait_1469) and [sonic](link_trait_1484) effects.\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([sonic](link_trait_1484))\n\n**Effect** You blow a bubble with the gum until it pops, after which it becomes inert. The pop deals 8d4 [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage to all creatures in a 15-foot cone with a basic DC 30 Fortitude save. A creature that fails its save is also bound with sticky gum, taking a –10-foot item penalty to its Speed for 1 minute