ull,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11905,"type":"item","before":{"id":11905,"bulk":"0","name":"Dawnflower Beads","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3848058931713292","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1442,1613,1478],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4923","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:13.043142+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +20; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81), [Empyrean](link_language_307), and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +21, Medicine +22, Religion +19, Sarenrae Lore +23\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +5, **Cha** +4\n\n**Will** +20\n\nPrayer beads given prolonged exposure to spiritual energies at sacred Sarenite sites can attain sapience as [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905). Other such objects hold the spirits of Sarenite priests who dedicated themselves to their work beyond death. [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905) function as a [greater shining symbol](link_item_7757). They don't re-attune to other deities but allow any [divine](link_trait_1475) spellcaster who isn't [unholy](link_trait_1846) to use them, though they attempt to talk their wielder out of morally questionable acts. [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905) have the following additional activations.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** The beads cast 4th-rank *[light](link_spell_4699)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The beads cast 5th-rank *[vital luminance](link_spell_4975)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11905,"bulk":"0","name":"Dawnflower Beads","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3848058931713292","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1442,1613,1478],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4923","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:13.043142+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +20; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81), [Empyrean](link_language_307), and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +21, Medicine +22, Religion +19, Sarenrae Lore +23\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +5, **Cha** +4\n\n**Will** +20\n\nPrayer beads given prolonged exposure to spiritual energies at sacred Sarenite sites can attain sapience as [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905). Other such objects hold the spirits of Sarenite priests who dedicated themselves to their work beyond death. [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905) function as a [greater shining symbol](link_item_7757). They don't re-attune to other deities but allow any [divine](link_trait_1475) spellcaster who isn't [unholy](link_trait_1846) to use them, though they attempt to talk their wielder out of morally questionable acts. [Dawnflower beads](link_item_11905) have the following additional activations.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** The beads cast 4th-rank *[light](link_spell_4699)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The beads cast 5th-rank *[vital luminance](link_spell_4975)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11906,"type":"item","before":{"id":11906,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Deadweight Mutagen (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"883318412448329","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":300},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4494","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:04:22.570Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:13.713376+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1c8d9833-facb-4ecf-95a4-29827ef184d2","data":{"text":"to Shove and Trip","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"fc8b83be-964b-482d-b034-04a99ce1fba2","data":{"text":"against attempts to Shove or Trip you and against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"e4d5512b-0e24-40f9-a86b-47e45574dd8a","data":{"text":"against attempts to Shove or Trip you and against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_REFLEX"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"9c49c899-b40e-4039-85e0-c611145104ef","type":"addBonusToValue","data":{"variable":"SAVE_WILL","type":"item","value":3,"text":"against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone"}}],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nFor 1 hour, your joints loosen and bones thicken, making your body incredibly weighty and difficult to maneuver around.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +3 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Shove](link_action_19849) and [Trip](link_action_19865), to your Fortitude and Reflex DCs against attempts to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you, and to saving throws against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone. You can attempt to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) creatures up to two sizes larger than you.\n\n**Drawback** You gain the encumbered condition and can't remove it while under the effects of the [mutagen](link_trait_1563).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11906,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Deadweight Mutagen (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"883318412448329","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":300},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4494","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T08:04:22.570Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:13.713376+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1c8d9833-facb-4ecf-95a4-29827ef184d2","data":{"text":"to Shove and Trip","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"fc8b83be-964b-482d-b034-04a99ce1fba2","data":{"text":"against attempts to Shove or Trip you and against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"e4d5512b-0e24-40f9-a86b-47e45574dd8a","data":{"text":"against attempts to Shove or Trip you and against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_REFLEX"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"9c49c899-b40e-4039-85e0-c611145104ef","type":"addBonusToValue","data":{"variable":"SAVE_WILL","type":"item","value":3,"text":"against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone"}}],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nFor 1 hour, your joints loosen and bones thicken, making your body incredibly weighty and difficult to maneuver around.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +3 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Shove](link_action_19849) and [Trip](link_action_19865), to your Fortitude and Reflex DCs against attempts to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you, and to saving throws against effects that attempt to force you to move or knock you prone. You can attempt to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) creatures up to two sizes larger than you.\n\n**Drawback** You gain the encumbered condition and can't remove it while under the effects of the [mutagen](link_trait_1563).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11907,"type":"item","before":{"id":11907,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Deadweight Mutagen (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7264113846438441","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4494","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"59"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade"