null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":30}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:23.986033+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The surface of this golden, heart-shaped locket is nearly worn through with cracks. If opened, it reveals a portrait of someone the bearer loved dearly and has lost. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 30.\n\n*   **Armor** The _[desolation locket](link_item_11922)_ numbs you to further despair, and you gain a +3 item bonus to saving throws against [emotion](link_trait_1486) effects.\n    \n*   **Weapon** ([emotion](link_trait_1486), [mental](link_trait_1448)) After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the locket, you emanate an [aura](link_trait_1492) of hopelessness in a 5-foot emanation until the start of your next turn. A creature that ends its turn in the [aura](link_trait_1492) must succeed at a Will saving throw against the locket's spell DC or become slowed 1 (slowed 2 on a critical failure) until the end of its next turn.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[haunting hymn](link_spell_6747)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[fear](link_spell_4616)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[wave of despair](link_spell_4950)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11922,"bulk":"0","name":"Desolation Locket (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3645739695468466","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":2800},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","ex