1) [striking](link_item_7862) [air repeater](link_item_13566)_ made from the still-living pitcher of a [dezullon](link_creature_10005), dealing [acid](link_trait_1528) damage instead of the gun's normal piercing damage.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The next creature you successfully [Strike](link_action_19856) with this weapon is exposed to amnesia venom.\n\n**Amnesia Venom** ([mental](link_trait_1448), [poison](link_trait_1476)); **Saving Throw** DC 29 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** off-guard (1 round); **Stage 2** off-guard and clumsy 1 (1 round); **Stage 3** confused, off-guard, and clumsy 2 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a pitcher from a dezullon or similar creature."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11927,"type":"item","before":{"id":11927,"bulk":"0","name":"Dimension Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8575324942736718","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4582","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:27.673144+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n[Dimension shot](link_item_11927) is deep blue black, but motes of light play upon it like stars in the night sky. The activated ammunition allows you to teleport to a location near where the ammunition hits. If you hit a creature, you can teleport to an unoccupied space adjacent to that creature. If you fire at a square, you can teleport to a space that contains that square or an unoccupied space adjacent to it. The [teleportation](link_trait_1470) fails if no unoccupied space is available to you","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11927,"bulk":"0","name":"Dimension Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8575324942736718","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4582","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:27.673144+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n[Dimension shot](link_item_11927) is deep blue black, but motes of light play upon it like stars in the night sky. The activated ammunition allows you to teleport to a location near where the ammunition hits. If you hit a creature, you can teleport to an unoccupied space adjacent to that creature. If you fire at a square, you can teleport to a space that contains that square or an unoccupied space adjacent to it. The [teleportation](link_trait_1470) fails if no unoccupied space is available to you","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11928,"type":"item","before":{"id":11928,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Diplomat's Charcuterie","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2160353204203403","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4447","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:28.301078+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA common sight at political gatherings, a [diplomat's charcuterie](link_item_11928) has fine meats, cheeses, nuts, fruits, and other finger foods mixed with reagents to engender friendly feelings between those consuming them. Contents of the plate vary by chef and the intended palates, from the hearty sausages and hard cheese of charcuterie from the Lands of the Linnorm Kings to the hot-pepper cheese curds and smoked almonds of Thuvian platters. After Activating the charcuterie by eating it, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy checks to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) and Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847). These bonuses last 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11928,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Diplomat's Charcuterie","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2160353204203403","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4447","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"47"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:28.301078+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA common sight at political gatherings, a [diplomat's charcuterie](link_item_11928) has fine meats, cheeses, nuts, fruits, and other finger foods mixed with reagents to engender friendly feelings between those consuming them. Contents of the plate vary by chef and the intended palates, from the hearty sausages and hard cheese of charcuterie from the Lands of the Linnorm Kings to the hot-pepper cheese curds and smoked almonds of Thuvian platters. After Activating the charcuterie by eating it, you gain a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy checks to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) and Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847). These bonuses last 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11929,"type":"item","before":{"id":11929,"bulk":"0","name":"Discord Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3216920733152927","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":22},"usage":"affixed to a creature","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1677],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4564","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:29.227158+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 hour\n\nIncorporating green in its writing, a _[discord fulu](link_item_11929)_ is a popular but unethical tool often deployed on romantic rivals to foil their advances. While the [fulu](link_trait_2854) is affixed to it, a creature treats its attitude toward other creatures as one step worse than it is. The creature also takes a –1 status penalty to Diplomacy checks. The first failure the creature rolls on a Diplomacy check becomes a critical failure instead, and the [fulu](link_trait_2854) turns to ash, ending its effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11929,"bulk":"0","name":"Discord Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3216920733152927","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":22},"usage":"affixed to a creature","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1677],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4564","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:29.227158+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 hour\n\nIncorporating green in its writing, a _[discord fulu](link_item_11929)_ is a popular but unethical tool often deployed on romantic rivals to foil their advances. While the [fulu](link_trait_2854) is affixed to it, a creature treats its attitude toward other creatures as one step worse than it is. The creature also takes a –1 status penalty to Diplomacy checks. The first failure the creature rolls on a Diplomacy check becomes a critical failure instead, and the [fulu](link_trait_2854) turns to ash, ending its effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11930,"type":"item","before":{"id":11930,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Burial Oil (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1982771243467005","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"di