"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":80000},"usage":"worn gloves","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1552,1570,1527,1504,1571,2398],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","range":null,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6960,"name":"Flaming (Greater)"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4671","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"foundry":{"bonus":1,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":4},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":4,"selector":"athletics","predicate":[{"or":["action:grapple","action:shove"]}]}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:32.281589+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These silken handwraps feature intricate embroidery of a serpentine red dragon adorned with golden thread. The handwraps function as [+3](link_item_7952) [major striking](link_item_7861) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [handwraps of mighty blows](link_item_7020). You also gain a +4 item bonus to Athletics checks made to [Grapple](link_action_19725) or [Shove](link_action_19849). When you invest the handwraps, you either increase your Strength modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You slap the bottom of your palms with hands splayed outward, casting a 7th-rank *[breathe fire](link_spell_4423)* spell (DC 41).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You succeed or critically succeed with a [Grapple](link_action_19725)\n\n**Effect** You gain a +2 status bonus to your Athletics DC against any checks made to [Escape](link_action_19632) your [grapple](link_action_19725) until the end of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11933,"bulk":"0","name":"Dragon Handwraps","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8479043194142030","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":80000},"usage":"worn gloves","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1552,1570,1527,1504,1571,2398],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","range":null,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6960,"name":"Flaming (Greater)"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4671","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"foundry":{"bonus":1,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":1},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"upgrade","path":"system.abilities.str.mod","value":4},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":4,"selector":"athletics","predicate":[{"or":["action:grapple","action:shove"]}]}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:32.281589+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These silken handwraps feature intricate embroidery of a serpentine red dragon adorned with golden thread. The handwraps function as [+3](link_item_7952) [major striking](link_item_7861) [greater flaming](link_item_6960) [handwraps of mighty blows](link_item_7020). You also gain a +4 item bonus to Athletics checks made to [Grapple](link_action_19725) or [Shove](link_action_19849). When you invest the handwraps, you either increase your Strength modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You slap the bottom of your palms with hands splayed outward, casting a 7th-rank *[breathe fire](link_spell_4423)* spell (DC 41).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You succeed or critically succeed with a [Grapple](link_action_19725)\n\n**Effect** You gain a +2 status bonus to your Athletics DC against any checks made to [Escape](link_action_19632) your [grapple](link_action_19725) until the end of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11934,"type":"item","before":{"id":11934,"bulk":"0","name":"Dragon Rune Bracelet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7049653182150151","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4854","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["origin:trait:dragon","fear"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["origin:trait:dragon","same-scale-type"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:32.825974+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_ is a gold bangle formed around the scale of a famous [dragon](link_trait_2402). The bracelet is etched with esoteric symbols or words in [Draconic](link_language_82) that indicate kinship with [dragons](link_trait_2402). As many types of _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_ exist as there are types of [dragons](link_trait_2402), though bracelets associated with uncommon or rare [dragons](link_trait_2402) have the same rarity as the [dragon](link_trait_2402). While wearing a _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_, you gain a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks while interacting with [dragons](link_trait_2402) of the same type as the bracelet's scale (such as red [dragons](link_trait_2402) or cloud [dragons](link_trait_2402)). You also gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects from any kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [sorcerer](link_class_113) [draconic bloodline](link_feat_33779) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [sorcerer](link_class_113) of a draconic bloodline."},"after":{"id":11934,"bulk":"0","name":"Dragon Rune Bracelet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7049653182150151","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4854","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["origin:trait:dragon","fear"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["origin:trait:dragon","same-scale-type"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:32.825974+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_ is a gold bangle formed around the scale of a famous [dragon](link_trait_2402). The bracelet is etched with esoteric symbols or words in [Draconic](link_language_82) that indicate kinship with [dragons](link_trait_2402). As many types of _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_ exist as there are types of [dragons](link_trait_2402), though bracelets associated with uncommon or rare [dragons](link_trait_2402) have the same rarity as the [dragon](link_trait_2402). While wearing a _[dragon rune bracelet](link_item_11934)_, you gain a +2 item bonus to Diplomacy checks while interacting with [dragons](link_trait_2402) of the same type as the bracelet's scale (such as red [dragons](link_trait_2402) or cloud [dragons](link_trait_2402)). You also gain a +2 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects from any kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can spend only to cast a [sorcerer](link_class_113) [draconic bloodline](link_feat_33779) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [sorcerer](link_class_113) of a draconic bloodline."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11935,"type":"item","before":{"id":11935,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Dragon Breath Scale","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8223644277679640","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2022","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"74"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:33.409562+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n* * *\n\nWhen used to cast *[breathe fire](link_spell_4423)* or *[chilling spray](link_spell_6725)*, a scale from a [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s throat changes the spell’s damage type and corresponding trait to the damage type and trait of the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s breath. You can instead choose the damage type and trait corresponding to the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s tradition if it’s different. The [dragons](link_trait_2402) from Monster Core and their damage types are as follows, with the tradition option listed if it’s different from the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s breath.\n\n**Adamantine** bludgeoning or [fire](link_trait_1542)\n\n**Conspirator** [mental](link_trait_1448) or [poison](link_trait_1476)\n\n**Diabolic** [fire](link_trait_1542) or [spirit](link_trait_1556)\n\n**Empyreal** [spirit](link_trait_1556)\n\n**Fortune** [force](link_trait_1560)\n\n**Horned** [fire](link_trait_1542) or [poison](link_trait_1476)\n\n**Mirage** [force](link_trait_1560) or [mental](link_trait_1448)\n\n**Omen** [mental](link_trait_1448)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11935,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Dragon Breath Scale","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8223644277679640","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2022","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"74"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:33.409562+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n* * *\n\nWhen used to cast *[breathe fire](link_spell_4423)* or *[chilling spray](link_spell_6725)*, a scale from a [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s throat changes the spell’s damage type and corresponding trait to the damage type and trait of the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s breath. You can instead choose the damage type and trait corresponding to the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s tradition if it’s different. The [dragons](link_trait_2402) from Monster Core and their damage types are as follows, with the tradition option listed if it’s different from the [dragon](link_trait_2402)’s breath.\n\n**Adamantine** bludgeoning or [fire](link_trait_1542)\n\n**Conspirator** [mental](link_trait_1448) or [poison](link_trait_1476)\n\n**Diabolic** [fire](link_trait_1542) or [spirit](link_trait_1556)\n\n**Empyreal** [spirit](link_trait_1556)\n\n**Fortune** [force](link_trait_1560)\n\n**Horned** [fire](link_trait_1542) or [poison](link_trait_1476)\n\n**Mirage** [force](link_trait_1560) or [mental](link_trait_1448)\n\n**Omen** [mental](link_trait_1448)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11936,"type":"item","before":{"id":11936,"bulk":"3","name":"Dragon Turtle Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7433133498907791","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4378","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"dragon-turtle-plate","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"ac","predicate":["dragon-turtle-plate","item:melee"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":5,"category":"heavy","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:44:58.874Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"half-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:34.036294+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This harness of _[+1](link_item_6719) [resilient](link_item_7703) [half plate](link_item_7016)_ is made from the shell plates of a [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015) and has the [aquadynamic](link_trait_2879) trait. To those who can craft with them, the dense organic plates on the [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015)'s body are as valuable as the creature's hoard of gold.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Trigger** A creature adjacent to you targets you with a melee attack; **Effect** You roll the hefty plates of the [dragon turtle armor](link_item_11936) toward the attacker to gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the shell of a [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015)."},"after":{"id":11936,"bulk":"3","name":"Dragon Turtle Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7433133498907791","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4378","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"dragon-turtle-plate","toggleable":true},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"ac","predicate":["dragon-turtle-plate","item:melee"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":5,"category":"heavy","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:44:58.874Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"half-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:34.036294+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This harness of _[+1](link_item_6719) [resilient](link_item_7703) [half plate](link_item_7016)_ is made from the shell plates of a [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015) and has the [aquadynamic](link_trait_2879) trait. To those who can craft with them, the dense organic plates on the [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015)'s body are as valuable as the creature's hoard of gold.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Trigger** A creature adjacent to you targets you with a melee attack; **Effect** You roll the hefty plates of the [dragon turtle armor](link_item_11936) toward the attacker to gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC against the triggering attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the shell of a [dragon turtle](link_creature_10015)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11937,"type":"item","before":{"id":11937,"bulk":"","name":"Dragonclaw Scutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4742342761897748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"affixed to a shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:34.576952+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Requirements** You have the affixed shield [raised](link_action_19750); **Trigger** You would take damage of a type depending on the [talisman](link_trait_1544)’s [dragon](link_trait_2402) type.\n\n* * *\n\nThis decorative shield emblem contains the gilded claw of a [dragon](link_trait_2402) mounted in a setting of high-grade adamantine alloy. It protects against a damage type depending on the type of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw came from (see below). When you Activate the scutcheon, you and all of your carried, wielded, or worn items gain immunity to all damage of that type until the end of your next turn.\n\nIf you have a _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_, _[dragonscale cameo](link_item_11941)_, and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ attached to your items, and they all correspond to the same type of [dragon](link_trait_2402), you gain an extra benefit. When you Activate any of these [talismans](link_trait_1544), you gain the ability to cast an 8th-rank, DC 35 *[dragon breath](link_spell_6435)* focus spell as an innate spell once before the end of your next turn. Use the [dragon](link_trait_2402) type that matches the [talismans](link_trait_1544); you can Cast the Spell this way without spending a [Focus Point](link_trait_1856). Because each [talisman](link_trait_1544) disintegrates when used, you can’t get this benefit again until you’ve attached a replacement.\n\n* * *\n\n#### Dragon Damage Types\n\nThe _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_ and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ use a type of damage depending on what kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw or tooth came from. These items are typically made from the [dragons](link_trait_2402) in Monster Core, but your GM might introduce uncommon or rare versions made from other types of [dragons](link_trait_2402).\n\n| Dragon Type | Damage Type |\n\n| --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Conspirator or horned | [Poison](link_trait_1476) |\n\n| Diabolic | [Fire](link_trait_1542) |\n\n| Empyreal | [Spirit](link_trait_1556) |\n\n| Fortune | [Force](link_trait_1560) |\n\n| Mirage or omen | [Mental](link_trait_1448) |","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one claw from an adult or older dragon."},"after":{"id":11937,"bulk":"","name":"Dragonclaw Scutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4742342761897748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":1600},"usage":"affixed to a shield","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"92"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:34.576952+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Requirements** You have the affixed shield [raised](link_action_19750); **Trigger** You would take damage of a type depending on the [talisman](link_trait_1544)’s [dragon](link_trait_2402) type.\n\n* * *\n\nThis decorative shield emblem contains the gilded claw of a [dragon](link_trait_2402) mounted in a setting of high-grade adamantine alloy. It protects against a damage type depending on the type of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw came from (see below). When you Activate the scutcheon, you and all of your carried, wielded, or worn items gain immunity to all damage of that type until the end of your next turn.\n\nIf you have a _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_, _[dragonscale cameo](link_item_11941)_, and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ attached to your items, and they all correspond to the same type of [dragon](link_trait_2402), you gain an extra benefit. When you Activate any of these [talismans](link_trait_1544), you gain the ability to cast an 8th-rank, DC 35 *[dragon breath](link_spell_6435)* focus spell as an innate spell once before the end of your next turn. Use the [dragon](link_trait_2402) type that matches the [talismans](link_trait_1544); you can Cast the Spell this way without spending a [Focus Point](link_trait_1856). Because each [talisman](link_trait_1544) disintegrates when used, you can’t get this benefit again until you’ve attached a replacement.\n\n* * *\n\n#### Dragon Damage Types\n\nThe _[dragonclaw scutcheon](link_item_11937)_ and _[dragontooth trophy](link_item_11944)_ use a type of damage depending on what kind of [dragon](link_trait_2402) the claw or tooth came from. These items are typically made from the [dragons](link_trait_2402) in Monster Core, but your GM might introduce uncommon or rare versions made from other types of [dragons](link_trait_2402).\n\n| Dragon Type | Damage Type |\n\n| --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | Bludgeoning |\n\n| Conspirator or horned | [Poison](link_trait_1476) |\n\n| Diabolic | [Fire](link_trait_1542) |\n\n| Empyreal | [Spirit](link_trait_1556) |\n\n| Fortune | [Force](link_trait_1560) |\n\n| Mirage or omen | [Mental](link_trait_1448) |","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one claw from an adult or older dragon."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11938,"type":"item","before":{"id":11938,"bulk":"0","name":"Dragonfly Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3156075247948748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4565","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:35.124955+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You take the [Leap](link_action_19735) action.\n\n* * *\n\nTradition says the _[dragonfly fulu](link_item_11938)_ should be affixed to the upper back, like the wings of an insect. When you Activate this [fulu](link_trait_2854), you gain a +2 status bonus to Athletics checks to [High Jump](link_action_19727) or [Long Jump](link_action_19738) for 1 minute. During this time, you can attempt an Athletics check to [High Jump](link_action_19727) or [Long Jump](link_action_19738) as a single action without the [Stride](link_action_19855) requirement. You can also [High Jump](link_action_19727) or [Long Jump](link_action_19738) from a nonsolid substance, such as air or water, but if you use this power of the [fulu](link_trait_2854), its effects ends after you jump.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11938,"bulk":"0","name":"Dragonfly Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3156075247948748","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk