:null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:07:11.852183+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This strong but slender [staff](link_item_7853) is tapered at the ends and well balanced. It's designed to be an offensive and defensive weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1884","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"36"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:38.506412+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [bo staff](link_item_6749) is covered in scales shed by or harvested from a [dragon](link_trait_2402). When benefiting from the circumstance bonus to AC granted by the [bo staff](link_item_6749)'s [parry](link_trait_1572) trait, you also gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws against [magical](link_trait_1504) effects of the tradition matching the [dragon](link_trait_2402) who provided the scales, plus resistance 5 to a damage type determined by that tradition: [force](link_trait_1560) for [arcane](link_trait_1459), [spirit](link_trait_1556) for [divine](link_trait_1475), [mental](link_trait_1448) for [occult](link_trait_1514), or [fire](link_trait_1542) for [primal](link_trait_1454). For instance, a _[dragonscale bo staff](link_item_11942)_ made with scales taken from an omen [dragon](link_trait_2402) would provide a +1 circumstance bonus to saves against [occult](link_trait_1514) effects and resistance 5 to [mental](link_trait_1448) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include scales from one type of dragon."},"after":{"id":11942,"bulk":"2","name":"Dragonscale Bo Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8533488578379664","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":240},"usage":"held in two hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[