":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":27},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4448","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T06:28:37.671Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:48.18047+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nContaining neither eggs nor cream, an [egg cream fizz](link_item_11955) contains milk or nut milk, sparkling water, and flavored syrup, frothed and chilled. Upon drinking, you feel lighter and more buoyant, gaining a +5-foot item bonus to your Speed for 10 minutes. During this time, you also gain another effect determined by the drink's syrup, which is chosen when the drink is created.\n\n*   **Chocolate** You gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks to [Balance](link_action_19608), [Maneuver in Flight](link_action_19740), and [Squeeze](link_action_21205).\n*   **Strawberry** You gain a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Climb](link_action_19612), [Leap](link_action_19735), and [Swim](link_action_19859).\n*   **Vanilla** You can [Step](link_action_19853) into difficult terrain.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11955,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Egg Cream Fizz","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4003297812771675","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":27},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4448","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T06:28:37.671Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:48.18047+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nContaining neither eggs nor cream, an [egg cream fizz](link_item_11955) contains milk or nut milk, sparkling water, and flavored syrup, frothed and chilled. Upon drinking, you feel lighter and more buoyant, gaining a +5-foot item bonus to your Speed for 10 minutes. During this time, you also gain another effect determined by the drink's syrup, which is chosen when the drink is created.\n\n*   **Chocolate** You gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks to [Balance](link_action_19608), [Maneuver in Flight](link_action_19740), and [Squeeze](link_action_21205).\n*   **Strawberry** You gain a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Climb](link_action_19612), [Leap](link_action_19735), and [Swim](link_action_19859).\n*   **Vanilla** You can [Step](link_action_19853) into difficult terrain.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11956,"type":"item","before":{"id":11956,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eidetic Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6284484952791396","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":40},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4614","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:48.792122+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nBright pink, pale lavender, and vibrant orange colors swirl through this purplish liquid, making the [eidetic potion](link_item_11956) resemble an unforgettable sunset. When you drink this [potion](link_trait_1565), for 1 round, anything you observe becomes locked into your memory. You can recall the memory perfectly and gain a +2 status bonus to create representations of that memory, whether using Crafting to create an artistic rendition or Society to create a [Forgery](link_action_19620). The memory remains locked for 1 week or until you benefit from the bonus it imparts for the first time, whichever comes first; afterward, it becomes a normal, fallible memory. You can only have a single memory locked in your mind at a time. Using this [potion](link_trait_1565) while you have a locked memory from a previous use makes the previously locked memory fallible but allows you to lock a new memory.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11956,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eidetic Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6284484952791396","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":40},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4614","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:48.792122+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nBright pink, pale lavender, and vibrant orange colors swirl through this purplish liquid, making the [eidetic potion](link_item_11956) resemble an unforgettable sunset. When you drink this [potion](link_trait_1565), for 1 round, anything you observe becomes locked into your memory. You can recall the memory perfectly and gain a +2 status bonus to create representations of that memory, whether using Crafting to create an artistic rendition or Society to create a [Forgery](link_action_19620). The memory remains locked for 1 week or until you benefit from the bonus it imparts for the first time, whichever comes first; afterward, it becomes a normal, fallible memory. You can only have a single memory locked in your mind at a time. Using this [potion](link_trait_1565) while you have a locked memory from a previous use makes the previously locked memory fallible but allows you to lock a new memory.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11957,"type":"item","before":{"id":11957,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eidolon Cape","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6556742087182889","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4855","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"eidolonCapeSelection","prompt":"Select your eidolon's tradition","choices":[{"label":"PF2E.TraitArcane","value":"arcana"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitDivine","value":"religion"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitOccult","value":"occultism"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitPrimal","value":"nature"}]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"{item|flags.pf2e.rulesSelections.eidolonCapeSelection}"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:49.39402+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Though it appears to be one elegant piece, an _[eidolon cape](link_item_11957)_ consists of a mantle for your shoulders and a detachable cape. The cape is designed to resemble your eidolon, either with a direct likeness or with features reminiscent of your eidolon. For instance, if your eidolon is a [dragon](link_trait_2402), the cape might depict a stylized dragon, or it might have a pattern of colorful scales with gold trim. An [eidolon cape](link_item_11957) features the sigil you share with your eidolon prominently in its design. You gain a +2 item bonus to the skill that matches your eidolon's tradition: Arcana for [arcane](link_trait_1459), Religion for [divine](link_trait_1475), Occultism for [occult](link_trait_1514), or Nature for [primal](link_trait_1454). When you [Manifest your Eidolon](link_feat_30027), the cape transforms into the eidolon, and when the eidolon unmanifests, it turns back into the cape. If the cape is attached to the mantle, it comes free immediately, and the eidolon appears adjacent to you as normal. If not, the eidolon appears in a space adjacent to the cape. With the cape detached, the mantle is still light Bulk, and the whole cloak remains invested. If the cape is out of range (beyond 100 feet, typically) or there's not enough open space for the eidolon to manifest, your attempt to [Manifest your Eidolon](link_feat_30027) fails.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [summoner](link_class_74) link spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [summoner](link_class_74)."},"after":{"id":11957,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eidolon Cape","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6556742087182889","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4855","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"eidolonCapeSelection","prompt":"Select your eidolon's tradition","choices":[{"label":"PF2E.TraitArcane","value":"arcana"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitDivine","value":"religion"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitOccult","value":"occultism"},{"label":"PF2E.TraitPrimal","value":"nature"}]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"{item|flags.pf2e.rulesSelections.eidolonCapeSelection}"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:49.39402+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Though it appears to be one elegant piece, an _[eidolon cape](link_item_11957)_ consists of a mantle for your shoulders and a detachable cape. The cape is designed to resemble your eidolon, either with a direct likeness or with features reminiscent of your eidolon. For instance, if your eidolon is a [dragon](link_trait_2402), the cape might depict a stylized dragon, or it might have a pattern of colorful scales with gold trim. An [eidolon cape](link_item_11957) features the sigil you share with your eidolon prominently in its design. You gain a +2 item bonus to the skill that matches your eidolon's tradition: Arcana for [arcane](link_trait_1459), Religion for [divine](link_trait_1475), Occultism for [occult](link_trait_1514), or Nature for [primal](link_trait_1454). When you [Manifest your Eidolon](link_feat_30027), the cape transforms into the eidolon, and when the eidolon unmanifests, it turns back into the cape. If the cape is attached to the mantle, it comes free immediately, and the eidolon appears adjacent to you as normal. If not, the eidolon appears in a space adjacent to the cape. With the cape detached, the mantle is still light Bulk, and the whole cloak remains invested. If the cape is out of range (beyond 100 feet, typically) or there's not enough open space for the eidolon to manifest, your attempt to [Manifest your Eidolon](link_feat_30027) fails.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [summoner](link_class_74) link spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [summoner](link_class_74)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11958,"type":"item","before":{"id":11958,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Elder Seed","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3799184817614834","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4899","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"187"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:54:41.127Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:49.956445+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn enormous, perfect, ripe seed from a tree important to a region's [druids](link_class_23), an [elder seed](link_item_11958) exudes [vitality](link_trait_1478). Plant life grows quickly and abundantly around it. Anyone who touches the seed understands the nature of its power. Swallowing it whole imparts its effects, but succeeding at the save against the boon causes the swallower to regurgitate the seed.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 1 (9 Days)** Your skin hardens, giving you a brownish-green tinge. You gain resistance to bludgeoning damage and piercing damage equal to your level, and you have [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) out to a range of 30 feet. Also, you can cast *[enlarge](link_spell_4601)*, *[speak with animals](link_spell_4847)*, 4th-rank *[speak with plants](link_spell_4848)*, and *[web](link_spell_6788)* each once per day as [primal](link_trait_1454) innate spells. The *[web](link_spell_6788)* is a dense mycelial net rather than spider silk.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 2 (1 Month)** You gain [low-light vision](link_sense_19330) and fluency in [Arboreal](link_language_663). However, your body feels stiffer, your mind slower to move to intense emotions, and you are prone to take your time making decisions. You become clumsy 1, take a –1 status penalty to initiative rolls, and gain a weakness to [fire](link_trait_1542) damage equal to half your level, and you take the same amount of additional damage from axes.\n\nIf you die at this stage or higher, your body sinks into the earth, forming rich soil. Over several days, a mature, full-sized tree of the seed's type grows where you fell. If plant growth is impossible, such as due to lack of sunlight, fungi grow there instead, extending mycelia through the earth until they reach a place the tree can grow. Then, the tree grows. An arboreal can tend this tree to cause it to regrow one _[elder seed](link_item_11958)_ after 3 years and 3 days.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 3 (1 Month)** You become more treelike and ponderous in body and mind, and when you cast the *[enlarge](link_spell_4601)* innate spell from this boon, you can cast it at 4th rank. The clumsy value increases to 2 and the status penalty increases to –2. Whenever you roll initiative, you automatically become slowed 1, slowed 2 if the d20 roll is 10 or lower, or slowed 3 if the d20 shows a 1. Your weakness to [fire](link_trait_1542) and vulnerability to axes equals your level.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 4** You die.\n\n* * *\n\n**Purging** You must seek out an arboreal, [druid](link_class_23), or nature-loving [fey](link_trait_2021) that is your level or higher whom you have never met, and pledge your allegiance to that being. Doing so places you under a *[geas](link_spell_4638)* to accomplish at least one meaningful service, usually a quest, for your new liege. While under the [geas](link_spell_4638), you can't advance to stage 4. Once you complete your service, you regurgitate the _[elder seed](link_item_11958)_, and its effects on you end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11958,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Elder Seed","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3799184817614834","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4899","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"187"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:54:41.127Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:49.956445+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn enormous, perfect, ripe seed from a tree important to a region's [druids](link_class_23), an [elder seed](link_item_11958) exudes [vitality](link_trait_1478). Plant life grows quickly and abundantly around it. Anyone who touches the seed understands the nature of its power. Swallowing it whole imparts its effects, but succeeding at the save against the boon causes the swallower to regurgitate the seed.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 1 (9 Days)** Your skin hardens, giving you a brownish-green tinge. You gain resistance to bludgeoning damage and piercing damage equal to your level, and you have [tremorsense](link_sense_21079) out to a range of 30 feet. Also, you can cast *[enlarge](link_spell_4601)*, *[speak with animals](link_spell_4847)*, 4th-rank *[speak with plants](link_spell_4848)*, and *[web](link_spell_6788)* each once per day as [primal](link_trait_1454) innate spells. The *[web](link_spell_6788)* is a dense mycelial net rather than spider silk.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 2 (1 Month)** You gain [low-light vision](link_sense_19330) and fluency in [Arboreal](link_language_663). However, your body feels stiffer, your mind slower to move to intense emotions, and you are prone to take your time making decisions. You become clumsy 1, take a –1 status penalty to initiative rolls, and gain a weakness to [fire](link_trait_1542) damage equal to half your level, and you take the same amount of additional damage from axes.\n\nIf you die at this stage or higher, your body sinks into the earth, forming rich soil. Over several days, a mature, full-sized tree of the seed's type grows where you fell. If plant growth is impossible, such as due to lack of sunlight, fungi grow there instead, extending mycelia through the earth until they reach a place the tree can grow. Then, the tree grows. An arboreal can tend this tree to cause it to regrow one _[elder seed](link_item_11958)_ after 3 years and 3 days.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 3 (1 Month)** You become more treelike and ponderous in body and mind, and when you cast the *[enlarge](link_spell_4601)* innate spell from this boon, you can cast it at 4th rank. The clumsy value increases to 2 and the status penalty increases to –2. Whenever you roll initiative, you automatically become slowed 1, slowed 2 if the d20 roll is 10 or lower, or slowed 3 if the d20 shows a 1. Your weakness to [fire](link_trait_1542) and vulnerability to axes equals your level.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 4** You die.\n\n* * *\n\n**Purging** You must seek out an arboreal, [druid](link_class_23), or nature-loving [fey](link_trait_2021) that is your level or higher whom you have never met, and pledge your allegiance to that being. Doing so places you under a *[geas](link_spell_4638)* to accomplish at least one meaningful service, usually a quest, for your new liege. While under the [geas](link_spell_4638), you can't advance to stage 4. Once you complete your service, you regurgitate the _[elder seed](link_item_11958)_, and its effects on you end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11959,"type":"item","before":{"id":11959,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eldritch Flare","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8601156238680335","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":15,"price":{"gp":1100},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4535","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:24:36.504Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:51.178126+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) draws power from the magic of its victim. If a creature under the effects of [eldritch flare](link_item_11959) [Casts a Spell](link_action_19611), excess magical energy feeds back into the toxin, increasing the DC of the [poison](link_trait_1476) by 2 that round. In addition, if the spell deals damage, the [poison](link_trait_1476) deals half its damage as one of the types of damage the spell deals (the other half remains [poison](link_trait_1476) damage). If the target is immune or has resistance to the spell's damage, the [poison](link_trait_1476) deals half its damage as [mental](link_trait_1448) damage instead. If the victim casts no spells during a round while affected, the [poison](link_trait_1476) still deals its [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 35 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** 8d6 damage (1 round); **Stage 2** 10d6 damage (1 round); **Stage 3** 12d6 damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11959,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Eldritch Flare","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8601156238680335","group":"GENERAL","hands":"2","level":15,"price":{"gp":1100},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4535","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:24:36.504Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:51.178126+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) draws power from the magic of its victim. If a creature under the effects of [eldritch flare](link_it