potion](link_trait_1565) renders you drained 2.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11963,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Elysian Dew","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7948864290485660","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":375},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4615","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:53.490345+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you drink sweet, sky-blue _[Elysian dew](link_item_11963)_, for 1 minute, you gain a 10-foot [aura](link_trait_1492) that evokes the vitality of Elysium, causing nearby objects to seem more colorful and plants to stand taller. You and any ally that starts its turn in the emanation gain 5 temporary Hit Points, a +1 item bonus to saving throws, and a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics and Athletics checks until the start of your or the ally's next turn. If you're evil and drink this [potion](link_trait_1565), it fails to work, and you must succeed at a DC 30 Fortitude save or the [potion](link_trait_1565) renders you drained 2.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11964,"type":"item","before":{"id":11964,"bulk":"0","name":"Emergency Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5406251125241709","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4637","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"93"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:12:29.987Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:54.190254+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You become blinded, or an effect otherwise impedes your [vision](link_sense_20776); **Requirements** You are an expert in Perception.\n\nThis eye, harvested from a monster, looks like it's peacefully sleeping but gives you a backup when you can't use your eyes. When the eye is activated, the eyelid pops open, and the eye stares frantically about. You see through the eye with normal [vision](link_sense_20776) until the end of your next turn, when the eye withers and flakes away.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11964,"bulk":"0","name":"Emergency Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5406251125241709","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4637","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"93"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:12:29.987Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:54.190254+0