e":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2220308294088219","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":120},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4472","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:55.885909+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nsickened creatures have difficulty swallowing, so you can Activate [emetic paste](link_item_11967) by applying it to your skin or that of a sickened creature within reach, typically on the throat. The paste makes it easy for the sickened creature to purge, granting it an immediate Fortitude save to reduce its sickened condition. The paste grants the target a +3 item bonus to that save and to all saving throws to reduce the sickened condition for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11968,"type":"item","before":{"id":11968,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Empath's Cordial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2934621232386590","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":65},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1448,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4616","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:56.457265+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe pale liquid of [empath's cordial](link_item_11968) changes color to reflect the mood of the creature nearest to it—turning blue for calm, red for anger, and green for envious, among other hues. For 1 hour after you drink this [potion](link_trait_1565), you can sense the presence of general emotions, such as hostility toward you or the presence of an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect impacting a creature's emotions, within 30 feet. A creature that failed a saving throw against [calm emotions](link_spell_4426) can't be detected. This [potion](link_trait_1565) doesn't allow you to automatically tell what emotions a specific creature is experiencing, but you can attempt a Perception check with a +2 item bonus (DC set by the GM) to discern that information. The [potion](link_trait_1565) also grants you a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) against creatures whose emotions you can sense.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11968,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Empath's Cordial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2934621232386590","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":65},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1448,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4616","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:56.457265+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe pale liquid of [empath's cordial](link_item_11968) changes color to reflect the mood of the creature nearest to it—turning blue for calm, red for anger, and green for envious, among other hues. For 1 hour after you drink this [potion](link_trait_1565), you can sense the presence of general emotions, such as hostility toward you or the presence of an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect impacting a creature's emotions, within 30 feet. A creature that failed a saving throw against [calm emotions](link_spell_4426) can't be detected. This [potion](link_trait_1565) doesn't allow you to automatically tell what emotions a specific creature is experiencing, but you can attempt a Perception check with a +2 item bonus (DC set by the GM) to discern that information. The [potion](link_trait_1565) also grants you a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) against creatures whose emotions you can sense.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11969,"type":"item","before":{"id":11969,"bulk":"0","name":"Empathy Charm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"697927895737338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"affixed-to-harness","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1538,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4685","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"106"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:56.973744+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This charm, usually placed on an [animal](link_trait_2409) companion's collar, contains a single strand of your hair, as well as one of your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion's, creating a link that better transmits emotional cues to a trained psychological assistance [animal](link_trait_2409).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You attempt a saving throw against an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect; **Requirements** Your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion wearing the [empathy charm](link_item_11969) is within 10 feet\n\n**Effect** Your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion senses the effect and attempts to calm you. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus against the triggering save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11969,"bulk":"0","name":"Empathy Charm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"697927895737338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":35},"usage":"affixed-to-harness","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1538,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4685","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"106"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:56.973744+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This charm, usually placed on an [animal](link_trait_2409) companion's collar, contains a single strand of your hair, as well as one of your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion's, creating a link that better transmits emotional cues to a trained psychological assistance [animal](link_trait_2409).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You attempt a saving throw against an [emotion](link_trait_1486) effect; **Requirements** Your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion wearing the [empathy charm](link_item_11969) is within 10 feet\n\n**Effect** Your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion senses the effect and attempts to calm you. You gain a +1 circumstance bonus against the triggering save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11970,"type":"item","before":{"id":11970,"bulk":"2","name":"Energizing Lattice","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2879054517568319","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1517,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"chain","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":6974,"name":"Fortification"}],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4379","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":4,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"base_item":"lattice-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:57.577596+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This suit of _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [fortification](link_item_6974) [lattice armor](link_item_12145)_ has latticework of fine golden wire. After negating a critical hit with its _[fortification](link_item_6974)_ rune, the latticework glows for 1 minute, shedding bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet). You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) this light.\n\n\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [force](link_trait_1560))\n\n**Requirements** The [energizing lattice](link_item_11970) is glowing because it negated an enemy's critical hit\n\n**Effect** You release the lattice's energy and make a weapon or [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack [Strike](link_action_19856) that deals 6d6 additional [force](link_trait_1560) damage. If your [Strike](link_action_19856) fails, but doesn't critically fail, the target still takes half the [force](link_trait_1560) damage. The latticework ceases glowing after the [Strike](link_action_19856).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11970,"bulk":"2","name":"Energizing Lattice","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"28