DIUM","uuid":"4226413200766035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4651","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:58.18995+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn [energizing treat](link_item_11971) is a treat made from meat or grains. When you feed your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion or [familiar](link_feat_20136) an [energizing treat](link_item_11971), it's quickened for 1 minute. It can use the extra action each round only for [Strike](link_action_19856), [Stride](link_action_19855), and [Support](link_feat_34004) actions, and it can do so only if it normally has those actions available and you take the proper action to command it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11971,"bulk":"0","name":"Energizing Treat","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4226413200766035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4651","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:58.18995+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn [energizing treat](link_item_11971) is a treat made from meat or grains. When you feed your [animal](link_trait_2409) companion or [familiar](link_feat_20136) an [energizing treat](link_item_11971), it's quickened for 1 minute. It can use the extra action each round only for [Strike](link_action_19856), [Stride](link_action_19855), and [Support](link_feat_34004) actions, and it can do so only if it normally has those actions available and you take the proper action to command it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11972,"type":"item","before":{"id":11972,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy Adaptive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"948034785528026","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":2600},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4363","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:58.803786+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A complex pattern of protective symbols gives protection against various forms of energy, but only part of the runic structure can be active at a given time.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You take [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage; **Effect** You gain resistance 5 to the triggering damage type. This doesn't apply to the triggering damage. This resistance lasts until you Activate this 