":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4495","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"60"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:37:59.595Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:16:59.428418+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen created, this [mutagen](link_trait_1563) is attuned to your choice of one of four energy types: [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). When consumed, the [mutagen](link_trait_1563) suffuses your body with energy that spills out of you whenever you attack. At higher levels, it can even grant you the ability to unleash the energy in controlled bursts.\n\n**Benefit** You gain resistance 15 to the attuned energy type. Whenever you score a hit with a melee weapon, add 1d6 damage of the attuned energy type. In addition, you can end the benefits of this [mutagen](link_trait_1563) to unleash a 30-foot cone of energy as a 2-action activity. This deals 2d6 damage of the attuned type for every full 10 minutes of duration remaining (maximum 8d6) to each creature in the area, with a DC 25 basic Reflex save.\n\n**Drawback** You gain weakness 5 to the other three energy types.\n\n**Duration** 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11973,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Energy Mutagen (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4390080148918999","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":300},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"