eck instead of the normal [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier and spell rank. However, if you critically fail the [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check the effect grants, your mind fills in false, nightmarish information. You become stupefied 1 for 1d4 rounds and stunned 1 as your brain struggles to process what you see.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11980,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Enigma-Sight Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2933063417374963","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565,1907],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4617","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"89"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:10.371156+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA vial of this _[enigma-sight potion](link_item_11980)_ seems to contain fragments of kaleidoscopic crystal that reflect mind-bending scenes. However, these \"crystals\" act like liquid when poured or consumed. Drinking the potion grants you the effects of a *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* spell, except that you use your Perception modifier and half your level, rounded up, for the [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check instead of the normal [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier and spell rank. However, if you critically fail the [secret](link_trait_1463) [counteract](link_action_27519) check the effect grants, your mind fills in false, nightmarish information. You become s