ane within the same range while wearing it. Although you can see these creatures and they can see you, you can affect each other only with abilities that cross between the Ethereal Plane and the Universe.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11986,"bulk":"0","name":"Ethersight Ring","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2405221518474220","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":325},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1907],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4874","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"153"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T03:16:04.562Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:15.274349+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[ethersight ring](link_item_11986)_ is a glass band containing a swirling cloud of gray smoke. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the ring, the smoke becomes as transparent as the glass encapsulating it, and you can see clearly into the Ethereal Plane with a range of 60 feet. Whether or not you have invested the ring, you are visible to creatures in the Ethereal Plane within the same range while wearing it. Although you can see these creatures and they can see you, you can affect each other only with abilities that cross between the Ethereal Plane and the Universe.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11987,"type":"item","before":{"id":11987,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Euphoric Loop (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6750115442850256","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4556","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"74"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:15.814109+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\nThis [catalyst](link_trait_2856) is made from twisted sapling bark harvested under a full moon. When used to cast a *[charm](link_spell_4516)* spell, the enchantment creates a blissful experience for all targets of the *[charm](link_spell_4516)* spell, up to 10. When the spell ends, even if you [Dismiss](link_action_19627) it, the sudden mental dissonance between the charmed state and reality forces the target to attempt a Will save against your spell DC.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is stunned 1 or, if the spell ended because of a hostile action, confused for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The target is stunned 2 or, if the spell ended because of a hostile action, confused for 1 round.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is stunned 3 or, if the spell ended because of a hostile action, confused for 2 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11987,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Euphoric Loop (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6750115442850256","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4556","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"74"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"