iking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4838","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:46:41.709Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:17.624561+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Constructed of green material and decorated with a white Glyph of the Open Road, an *[everyneed pack](link_item_11990)* has a dozen or more small pockets lining the inside. The pack is enchanted so that each pocket contains common, mundane gear, each item worth no more than 1 gp, such as [chalk](link_item_6781), [flint and steel](link_item_6962), and string. It doesn't contain any armor, shields, weapons, or items made of precious material. Keep track of the exact value of the gear you retrieve from the pack. The pack becomes a mundane [backpack](link_item_6728) after items of your choice with a combined value of 8 gp have been removed from it.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You draw any number of pieces of mundane gear from the pack with a combined value of 1 gp or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11990,"bulk":"1","name":"Everyneed Pack","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"883533234452124","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"worn backpack","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4838","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:46:41.709Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:17.624561+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Constructed of green material and decorated with a white Glyph of the Open Road, an *[everyneed pack](link_item_11990)* has a dozen or more small pockets lining the inside. The pack is enchanted so that each pocket contains common, mundane gear, each item worth no more than 1 gp, such as [chalk](link_item_6781), [flint and steel](link_item_6962), and string. It doesn't contain any armor, shields, weapons, or items made of precious material. Keep track of the exact value of the gear you retrieve from the pack. The pack becomes a mundane [backpack](link_item_6728) after items of your choice with a combined value of 8 gp have been removed from it.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You draw any number of pieces of mundane gear from the pack with a combined value of 1 gp or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11991,"type":"item","before":{"id":11991,"bulk":"0","name":"Explosive Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"772055277674557","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":13},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4594","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"84"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:41:16.326Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:18.279697+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn [explosive missive](link_item_11991) is slightly warm to the touch, regardless of the surrounding environment. When [composed](link_action_43788) and then activated, the [missive](link_trait_2874) explodes. The tenor of what you write or the theme of your illustration determines the damage type and adds the corresponding trait to the [missive](link_trait_2874): [acid](link_trait_1528) for a caustic inscription, [cold](link_trait_1519) for an aloof one, [electricity](link_trait_1576) for an energetic one, [fire](link_trait_1542) for an angry one, or [sonic](link_trait_1484) for an overly emphatic one. The [missive](link_trait_2874) deals 4d6 damage to each creature in a 5-foot burst from a corner of the [missive](link_trait_2874)'s space (DC 18 basic Reflex save). A creature who rolls a critical failure also takes 1d4 persistent damage of the same type. The [missive](link_trait_2874) burns to ash while releasing its magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11991,"bulk":"0","name":"Explosive Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"772055277674557","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":13},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4594","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"84"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:41:16.326Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:18.279697+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn [explosive missive](link_item_11991) is slightly warm to the touch, regardless of the surrounding environment. When [composed](link_action_43788) and then activated, the [missive](link_trait_2874) explodes. The tenor of what you write or the theme of your illustration determines the damage type and adds the corresponding trait to the [missive](link_trait_2874): [acid](link_trait_1528) for a caustic inscription, [cold](link_trait_1519) for an aloof one, [electricity](link_trait_1576) for an energetic one, [fire](link_trait_1542) for an angry one, or [sonic](link_trait_1484) for an overly emphatic one. The [missive](link_trait_2874) deals 4d6 damage to each creature in a 5-foot burst from a corner of the [missive](link_trait_2874)'s space (DC 18 basic Reflex save). A creature who rolls a critical failure also takes 1d4 persistent damage of the same type. The [missive](link_trait_2874) burns to ash while releasing its magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":11992,"type":"item","before":{"id":11992,"bulk":"1","name":"Extendable Tail","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3776629889515395","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1539],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4697","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:42:03.997Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:18.832684+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Built with collapsible poles and expanding hoops, this tail can extend to a length of 20 feet. While it's no more prehensile than a tail of a typical member of your ancestry, it ends with an anchor that you can secure around a sturdy object with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. While the tail is anchored, you can't move more than 20 feet from that spot, but you can use the tail to lower yourself up to 20 feet, as if it were a length of [rope](link_item_7715). You can use another [Interact](link_action_19733) action to disengage the anchor and retract your tail.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11992,"bulk":"1","name":"Extendable Tail","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3776629889515395","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1539],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4697","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:42:03.997Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:18.832684+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Built with collapsible poles and expanding hoops, this tail can extend to a length of 20 feet. While it's no more prehensile than a tail of a typical member of your ancestry, it ends with an anchor that you can secure around a sturdy object with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. While the tail is anchored, you can't move more than 20 feet from that spot, but you c