cone must attempt a DC 23 Will save. After you expel this [magical](link_trait_1504) breath, you can’t do so again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 minute and slowed 1 for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is stupefied 2 and slowed 1 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":11999,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fey Dragonet Liqueur (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3661721654671143","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1448,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2085","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"89"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:22.971028+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nEach draft of [fey dragonet liqueur](link_item_11999) has a different flavor. For 1 hour after you drink it, you can use a single action to breathe out a 15-foot cone of euphoric gas. Each creature in the cone must attempt a DC 23 Will save. After you expel this [magical](link_trait_1504) breath, you can’t do so again for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 minute and slowed 1 for 1d4 rounds.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is stupefied 2 and slowed 1 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12000,"type":"item","before":{"id":12000,"bulk":"1","name":"Faerie Queen's Bower","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7955748466843685","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1630,1613,2860,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7052,"name":"Invisibility"}],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4924","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:23.514555+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +23; precise vision ([darkvision](link_sense_20769)) 60 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy ([Empyrean](link_language_307), [Common](link_language_81))\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +25, Religion +25\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +4, **Cha** +6\n\n**Will** +25\n\nA suit of [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726) armor can gain sapience when lovingly crafted by a fae monarch of sufficient power; a suit of [faerie queen's bower](link_item_12000) is one such example. The armor is happy to give you and your companions counsel, hoping to guide you on a path of benevolence and aid you in battles against forces that seek to cause harm to the natural world. It refuses access to its magic to anyone who causes undue harm to plants or [animals](link_trait_2409). In addition to the features and activation of [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726), [faerie queen's bower](link_item_12000) has the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The armor casts 4th-rank *[safe passage](link_spell_4814)*, with the protected area beginning from your square and extending to a place of relative safety.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([aura](link_trait_1492), [concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You call forth a storm of leaves from [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726). These leaves swirl in a 20-foot emanation for 1 minute. Creatures within the area are concealed, and creatures outside the area are concealed to creatures within the leaves. However, you can see through this concealment. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12000,"bulk":"1","name":"Faerie Queen's Bower","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7955748466843685","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1630,1613,2860,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7052,"name":"Invisibility"}],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4924","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:23.514555+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +23; precise vision ([darkvision](link_sense_20769)) 60 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy ([Empyrean](link_language_307), [Common](link_language_81))\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +25, Religion +25\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +4, **Cha** +6\n\n**Will** +25\n\nA suit of [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726) armor can gain sapience when lovingly crafted by a fae monarch of sufficient power; a suit of [faerie queen's bower](link_item_12000) is one such example. The armor is happy to give you and your companions counsel, hoping to guide you on a path of benevolence and aid you in battles against forces that seek to cause harm to the natural world. It refuses access to its magic to anyone who causes undue harm to plants or [animals](link_trait_2409). In addition to the features and activation of [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726), [faerie queen's bower](link_item_12000) has the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The armor casts 4th-rank *[safe passage](link_spell_4814)*, with the protected area beginning from your square and extending to a place of relative safety.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([aura](link_trait_1492), [concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You call forth a storm of leaves from [autumn's embrace](link_item_11726). These leaves swirl in a 20-foot emanation for 1 minute. Creatures within the area are concealed, and creatures outside the area are concealed to creatures within the leaves. However, you can see through this concealment. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12001,"type":"item","before":{"id":12001,"bulk":"0","name":"Faith Tattoo (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8957377699987410","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4741","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:24.129984+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Prerequisites** worshipper of a deity\n\n* * *\n\nYou have marked your body to show your devotion to a deity. This [tattoo](link_trait_2857) could be the deity’s religious symbol, another image that evokes that deity, or another mark you gained through your devotion. The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) serves as a [silver religious symbol](link_item_7696) of the deity. Provided you keep the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) uncovered, you need not wield it to gain that benefit.\n\nWhen you get the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) and aren’t sanctified, you can choose to sanctify yourself to your deity.\n\nIf you cease meeting the prerequisites, the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades, and you lose its benefits until you perform an *[atone](link_spell_4405)* ritual and meet the prerequisites thereafter.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) casts *[harm](link_spell_4653)*, *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, or the 1st-rank spell from your deity’s [cleric](link_class_22) spells, heightened to 3rd rank. You can choose *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)* only in accord with the deity’s [divine font](link_class-feature_21194). If the deity allows either spell, choose one the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) can cast when you receive the [tattoo](link_trait_2857). The DC for any of these spells is 24.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"silver worth 2 gp to include in the ink"},"after":{"id":12001,"bulk":"0","name":"Faith Tattoo (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8957377699987410","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4741","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:24.129984+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Prerequisites** worshipper of a deity\n\n* * *\n\nYou have marked your body to show your devotion to a deity. This [tattoo](link_trait_2857) could be the deity’s religious symbol, another image that evokes that deity, or another mark you gained through your devotion. The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) serves as a [silver religious symbol](link_item_7696) of the deity. Provided you keep the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) uncovered, you need not wield it to gain that benefit.\n\nWhen you get the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) and aren’t sanctified, you can choose to sanctify yourself to your deity.\n\nIf you cease meeting the prerequisites, the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades, and you lose its benefits until you perform an *[atone](link_spell_4405)* ritual and meet the prerequisites thereafter.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) casts *[harm](link_spell_4653)*, *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, or the 1st-rank spell from your deity’s [cleric](link_class_22) spells, heightened to 3rd rank. You can choose *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)* only in accord with the deity’s [divine font](link_class-feature_21194). If the deity allows either spell, choose one the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) can cast when you receive the [tattoo](link_trait_2857). The DC for any of these spells is 24.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"silver worth 2 gp to include in the ink"},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12002,"type":"item","before":{"id":12002,"bulk":"0","name":"Faith Tattoo (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6443005346661474","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1700},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4741","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:24.743519+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Prerequisites** worshipper of a deity\n\n* * *\n\nYou have marked your body to show your devotion to a deity. This [tattoo](link_trait_2857) could be the deity’s religious symbol, another image that evokes that deity, or another mark you gained through your devotion. The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) serves as a [silver religious symbol](link_item_7696) of the deity. Provided you keep the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) uncovered, you need not wield it to gain that benefit.\n\nWhen you get the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) and aren’t sanctified, you can choose to sanctify yourself to your deity.\n\nIf you cease meeting the prerequisites, the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades, and you lose its benefits until you perform an *[atone](link_spell_4405)* ritual and meet the prerequisites thereafter.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) casts *[harm](link_spell_4653)*, *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, or the 1st-rank 