benefits until you perform an *[atone](link_spell_4405)* ritual and meet the prerequisites thereafter.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) casts *[harm](link_spell_4653)*, *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, or the 1st-rank spell from your deity’s [cleric](link_class_22) spells, heightened to 5th rank. You can choose *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)* only in accord with the deity’s [divine font](link_class-feature_21194). If the deity allows either spell, choose one the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) can cast when you receive the [tattoo](link_trait_2857). The DC for any of these spells is 30.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"silver worth 2 gp to include in the ink"},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12003,"type":"item","before":{"id":12003,"bulk":"0","name":"Faith Tattoo (True)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3240978538898229","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4741","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:25.329132+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Prerequisites** worshipper of a deity\n\n* * *\n\nYou have marked your body to show your devotion to a deity. This [tattoo](link_trait_2857) could be the deity’s religious symbol, another image that evokes that deity, or another mark you gained through your devotion. The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) serves as a [silver religious symbol](link_item_7696) of the deity. Provided you keep the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) uncovered, you need not wield it to gain that benefit.\n\nWhen you get the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) and aren’t sanctified, you can choose to sanctify yourself to your deity.\n\nIf you cease meeting the prerequisites, the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades, and you lose its benefits until you perform an *[atone](link_spell_4405)* ritual and meet the prerequisites thereafter.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The [tattoo](link_trait_2857) casts *[harm](link_spell_4653)*, *[heal](link_spell_4656)*, or the 1st-rank spell from your deity’s [cleric](link_class_22) spells, heightened to 7th rank. You can choose *[harm](link_spell_4653)* or *[heal](link_spell_4656)* only in accord with the deity’s [divine font](link_class-feature_21194). If the deity allows either spell, choose one the [tattoo](link_trait_2857) can cast when you receive the [tattoo](link_trait_2857). The DC for any of these spells is 35.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"silver worth 2 gp to include in the ink"},"after":{"id":12003,"bulk":"0","name":"Faith Tattoo (True)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3240978538898229","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1527,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4741","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:25.329132+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Prerequisites** worshipper 