ements":"silver worth 2 gp to include in the ink."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12005,"type":"item","before":{"id":12005,"bulk":"1","name":"Falcata","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"9000878159065011","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1670],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=635","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:26.859132+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The [falcata](link_item_12005) is a heavy, one-handed sword with a single cutting edge, usually flaring to be wider towards the point of the weapon and narrower towards the hilt.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12005,"bulk":"1","name":"Falcata","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"9000878159065011","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1670],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=635","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:26.859132+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The [falcata](link_item_12005) is a heavy, one-handed sword with a single cutting edge, usually flaring to be wider towards the point of the weapon and narrower towards the hilt.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12006,"type":"item","before":{"id":12006,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Falconsight Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7779120612797869","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4691","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:27.485787+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This prosthetic eye resembles that of a bird of prey. Along with the abilities of the _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_, it allows you to strike foes at greater range and with impressive accuracy.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You become keenly aware of your foes, even those seemingly out of reach. For 1 minute, you can close your eyes as a free action to see through a ranged weapon you're wielding, which reduces the penalty for firing into your weapon's second range increment from –2 to 0. This effect doesn't negate the blinded condition.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12006,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Falconsight Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7779120612797869","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4691","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:27.485787+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This prosthetic eye resembles that of a bird of prey. Along with the abilities of the _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_, it allows you to strike foes at greater range and with impressive accuracy.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You become keenly aware of your foes, even those seemingly out of reach. For 1 minute, you can close your eyes as a free action to see through a ranged weapon you're wielding, which reduces the penalty for firing into your weapon's second range increment from –2 to 0. This effect doesn't negate the blinded condition.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12007,"type":"item","before":{"id":12007,"bulk":"0","name":"False Death Vial (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8754021755176741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"affixed to explorer's clothing (or another item in the unarmored defense category)","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4639","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:28.084269+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points by damage but not immediately killed\n\n**Requirements** You are unarmored.\n\nThis tiny crystal vial of oily liquid is typically attached to a pin or worn on a tether attached to the affixed article of clothing. When you Activate the vial, you avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, your wounded condition increases by 1, and the [talisman](link_trait_1544) casts *[drop dead](link_spell_6737)* on you. You take no damage from the triggering effect.\n\nThe [talisman](link_trait_1544) teleports you to a clear space of your choice that you can see within 120 feet. This also transports any items you're wearing and holding with you, as well as up to one other creature currently in contact with you—including if you're carrying it in an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container. This effect has the [teleportation](link_trait_1470) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12007,"bulk":"0","name":"False Death Vial (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8754021755176741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"affixed to explorer's clothing (or another item in the unarmored defense category)","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4639","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:28.084269+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points by damage but not immediately killed\n\n**Requirements** You are unarmored.\n\nThis tiny crystal vial of oily liquid is typically attached to a pin or worn on a tether attached to the affixed article of clothing. When you Activate the vial, you avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, your wounded condition increases by 1, and the [talisman](link_trait_1544) casts *[drop dead](link_spell_6737)* on you. You take no damage from the triggering effect.\n\nThe [talisman](link_trait_1544) teleports you to a clear space of your choice that you can see within 120 feet. This also transports any items you're wearing and holding with you, as well as up to one other creature currently in contact with you—including if you're carrying it in an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container. This effect has the [teleportation](link_trait_1470) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12008,"type":"item","before":{"id":12008,"bulk":"0","name":"False Death Vial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4039063859101130","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"affixed to explorer's clothing (or another item in the unarmored defense category)","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2106","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"93"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:29.106505+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points by damage but not immediately killed\n\n**Requirements** You are unarmored.\n\n* * *\n\nThis tiny crystal vial of oily liquid is typically attached to a pin or worn on a tether attached to the affixed article of clothing. When you Activate the vial, you avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, your wounded condition increases by 1, and the [talisman](link_trait_1544) casts *[drop dead](link_spell_6737)* on you. You take no damage from the triggering effect.\n\nYou and any items you're wearing and holding are instantly transported from your current space to a clear space of your choice within 30 feet. If you are carrying another creature (even one contained inside an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container), it's left behind in your original space.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12008,"bulk":"0","name":"False Death Vial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4039063859101130","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"affixed to explorer's clothing (or another item in the unarmored defense category)","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2106","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"93"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:29.106505+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You would be reduced to 0 Hit Points by damage but not immediately killed\n\n**Requirements** You are unarmored.\n\n* * *\n\nThis tiny crystal vial of oily liquid is typically attached to a pin or worn on a tether attached to the affixed article of clothing. When you Activate the vial, you avoid being knocked out and remain at 1 Hit Point, your wounded condition increases by 1, and the [talisman](link_trait_1544) casts *[drop dead](link_spell_6737)* on you. You take no damage from the triggering effect.\n\nYou and any items you're wearing and holding are instantly transported from your current space to a clear space of your choice within 30 feet. If you are carrying another creature (even one contained inside an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container), it's left behind in your original space.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12009,"type":"item","before":{"id":12009,"bulk":"0.1","name":"False Hope","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"789531935911889","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2600},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476,1567],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4536","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:29.640804+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) is an insidious distillation of the venom of the boomslang snake. It acts slowly and cyclically, giving its victim a false sense that the [poison](link_trait_1476) has failed to take hold or its effects have ended. The GM makes the target's saving throws in [secret](link_trait_1463) during any stage that has no effect.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 37 Fortitude ([secret](link_trait_1463))\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** no effect (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 10d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** no effect\n\n**Stage 4** 12d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12009,"bulk":"0.1","name":"False Hope","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"789531935911889","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2600},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476,1567],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4536","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"68"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:29.640804+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [poison](link_trait_1476) is an insidious distillation of the venom of the boomslang snake. It acts slowly and cyclically, giving its victim a false sense that the [poison](link_trait_1476) has failed to take hold or its effects have ended. The GM makes the target's saving throws in [secret](link_trait_1463) during any stage that has no effect.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 37 Fortitude ([secret](link_trait_1463))\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** no effect (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 10d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** no effect\n\n**Stage 4** 12d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12010,"type":"item","before":{"id":12010,"bulk":"0","name":"Familiar Morsel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8561262583460627","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4652","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:51:07.270Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:30.238664+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Familiar morsels](link_item_12010) are little treats that come in a wide variety of flavors that appeal to numerous creatures. Each morsel is keyed to one [familiar](link_feat_20136) ability at its creation. When you feed the morsel to your [familiar](link_feat_20136), it gains that [familiar](link_feat_20136) ability for 1 hour. If your [familiar](link_feat_20136) doesn't meet the requirements, or if it already has an ability from a [familiar morsel](link_item_12010), the morsel is nothing more than a pleasing snack, its magic wasted.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12010,"bulk":"0","name":"Familiar Morsel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8561262583460627","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4652","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"96"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:51:07.270Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:30.238664+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Familiar morsels](link_item_12010) are little treats that come in a wide variety of flavors that appeal to numerous creatures. Each morsel is keyed to one [familiar](link_feat_20136) ability at its creation. When you feed the morsel to your [familiar](link_feat_20136), it gains that [familiar](link_feat_20136) ability for 1 hour. If your [familiar](link_feat_20136) doesn't meet the requirements, or if it already has an ability from a [familiar morsel](link_item_12010), the morsel is nothing more than a pleasing snack, its magic wasted.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12011,"type":"item","before":{"id":12011,"bulk":"0","name":"Fate Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4397781577712924","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4583","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:30.763304+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n[Fate shot](link_item_12011) is made of a nickel-steel alloy carved with the smiling face of a comedic player on one side, while the other side holds the frown of a tragic dramatist. When you hit a target with this ammunition, roll a DC 11 flat check. On a success, treat all the damage dice for your attack as though they rolled the average damage +1, rounded up (for example, a [fate shot](link_item_12011) arrow fired from a [shortbow](link_item_7763) would normally deal 1d6, which has an average of 3.5, so you deal 5 damage). This doesn't affect additional damage dice that only happen on a critical hit, such as those added by the deadly trait. On a failure, roll the damage, but your target takes half damage, and you take the remaining amount as [mental](link_trait_1448) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12011,"bulk":"0","name":"Fate Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4397781577712924","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4583","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:30.763304+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n[Fate shot](link_item_12011) is made of a nickel-steel alloy carved with the smiling face of a comedic player on one side, while the other side holds the frown of a tragic dramatist. When you hit a target with this ammunition, roll a DC 11 flat check. On a success, treat all the damage dice for your attack as though they rolled the average damage +1, rounded up (for example, a [fate shot](link_item_12011) arrow fired from a [shortbow](link_item_7763) would normally deal 1d6, which has an average of 3.5, so you deal 5 damage). This doesn't affect additional damage dice that only happen on a critical hit, such as those added by the deadly trait. On a failure, roll the damage, but your target takes half damage, and you take the remaining amount as [mental](link_trait_1448) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12012,"type":"item","before":{"id":12012,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fearcracker (legacy)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6138651179720069","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4557","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"74"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:31.365758+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\nA [fearcracker](link_item_12012) contains fragments of broken mirrors and reagents that pop and smoke when consumed. When thrown down in your space as part of a [Mirror Image](link_spell_5142) spell, your and your images' appearance twists nightmarishly. When an image is destroyed, it \"dies\" in a disturbing fashion, rendering the attacker frightened 1. This aspect of the spell has the [emotion](link_trait_1486), [fear](link_trait_1487), and [mental](link_trait_1448) traits.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12012,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fearcracker (legacy)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6138651179720069","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"versi