 against [fear](link_trait_1487).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You and each ally in a 5-foot emanation reduce your frightened values by 1.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12013,"bulk":"0","name":"Fearless Sash","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5166068302848362","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":325},"usage":"worn belt","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4843","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":1,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["fear"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:31.97764+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A feeling of security radiates out from this sash made of fine yellow fabric. You gain a +1 status bonus to saves against [fear](link_trait_1487).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You and each ally in a 5-foot emanation reduce your frightened values by 1.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12014,"type":"item","before":{"id":12014,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Feng Huo Lun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5053012011884887","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1604,1570,3630,1572,1691,1854],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=640","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:32.9853+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Also known as wind and fire wheels, these large, flat steel rings feature several protruding blades typically stylized to resemble flames.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12014,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Feng Huo Lun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5053012011884887","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1604,1570,3630,1572,1691,1854],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=640","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:32.9853+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Also known as wind and fire wheels, these large, flat steel rings feature several protruding blades typically stylized to resemble flames.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12015,"type":"item","before":{"id":12015,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fiddle of the Maestro","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7325106479468745","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":10000},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2861,1514,1546],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4802","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"136"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"dex-skill-check","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:3"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":1,"selector":"reflex","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:3"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"dex-skill-check","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:4"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":2,"selector":"reflex","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:4"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:33.517681+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This exquisite fiddle is perfectly carved and balanced to produce the purest sound while granting its player perfect balance and poise. It grants a +2 item bonus to Performance checks. If you're a master in Performance, while playing it you also gain a +1 status bonus to Reflex saves and a +1 item bonus to Dexterity-based skill checks. If you're legendary in Performance, the bonuses are +2.\n\nWhen you [Perform](link_action_19746) with the fiddle, you can choose to create a harsh and discordant note. You critically fail the Performance check, shred the strings of the fiddle, and create an 8th-rank *[noise blast](link_spell_4742)*, with a 40-foot emanation around you instead of a 10-foot burst. The fiddle can't be played again until the strings are replaced at a cost of 200 gp.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrips** *[figment](link_spell_4620)*, *[light](link_spell_4699)*, *[message](link_spell_4720)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[command](link_spell_4528)*\n    \n*   **2nd** *[calm](link_spell_4426)*, *[revealing light](link_spell_4806)*\n    \n*   **3rd** *[enthrall](link_spell_4603)*\n    \n*   **4th** *[honeyed words](link_spell_4661)*\n    \n*   **5th** *[sending](link_spell_4824)*\n    \n*   **6th** *[calm](link_spell_4426)*, *[dominate](link_spell_4581)*, *[vibrant pattern](link_spell_4932)*\n    \n*   **7th** *[dominate](link_spell_4581)*, *[mask of terror](link_spell_4717)*, *[true target](link_spell_4911)*, *[vibrant pattern](link_spell_4932)*, *[visions of danger](link_spell_6783)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12015,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fiddle of the Maestro","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7325106479468745","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":10000},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2861,1514,1546],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4802","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"136"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"dex-skill-check","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:3"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":1,"selector":"reflex","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:3"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"dex-skill-check","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:4"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":2,"selector":"reflex","predicate":["skill:prf:rank:4"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:33.517681+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This exquisite fiddle is perfectly carved and balanced to produce the purest sound while granting its player perfect balance and poise. It grants a +2 item bonus to Performance checks. If you're a master in Performance, while playing it you also gain a +1 status bonus to Reflex saves and a +1 item bonus to Dexterity-based skill checks. If you're legendary in Performance, the bonuses are +2.\n\nWhen you [Perform](link_action_19746) with the fiddle, you can choose to create a harsh and discordant note. You critically fail the Performance check, shred the strings of the fiddle, and create an 8th-rank *[noise blast](link_spell_4742)*, with a 40-foot emanation around you instead of a 10-foot burst. The fiddle can't be played again until the strings are replaced at a cost of 200 gp.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrips** *[figment](link_spell_4620)*, *[light](link_spell_4699)*, *[message](link_spell_4720)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[command](link_spell_4528)*\n    \n*   **2nd** *[calm](link_spell_4426)*, *[revealing light](link_spell_4806)*\n    \n*   **3rd** *[enthrall](link_spell_4603)*\n    \n*   **4th** *[honeyed words](link_spell_4661)*\n    \n*   **5th** *[sending](link_spell_4824)*\n    \n*   **6th** *[calm](link_spell_4426)*, *[dominate](link_spell_4581)*, *[vibrant pattern](link_spell_4932)*\n    \n*   **7th** *[dominate](link_spell_4581)*, *[mask of terror](link_spell_4717)*, *[true target](link_spell_4911)*, *[vibrant pattern](link_spell_4932)*, *[visions of danger](link_spell_6783)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12016,"type":"item","before":{"id":12016,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Firefoot Popcorn","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3586140782066122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4449","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:54:26.515Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:34.186151+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you consume [firefoot popcorn](link_item_12016), for 1 minute, you can [Leap](link_action_19735) double the normal distance. You can also attempt to [High Jump](link_action_19727) or [Long Jump](link_action_19738) as a single action. If you do, you don't perform the initial [Stride](link_action_19855) (nor do you fall if you don't [Stride](link_action_19855) 10 feet).\n\nEach time you [Leap](link_action_19735) 10 feet or more, your feet make a popping sound that can be heard from at least 100 feet, and the space you left fills with waves of intense heat. For 1 minute, that square is hazardous terrain that deals 1d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage to any creature that moves into it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12016,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Firefoot Popcorn","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3586140782066122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4449","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:54:26.515Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:34.186151+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you consume [firefoot popcorn](link_item_12016), for 1 minute, you can [Leap](link_action_19735) double the normal distance. You can also attempt to [High Jump](link_action_19727) or [Long Jump](link_action_19738) as a single action. If you do, you don't perform the initial [Stride](link_action_19855) (nor do you fall if you don't [Stride](link_action_19855) 10 feet).\n\nEach time you [Leap](link_action_19735) 10 feet or more, your feet make a popping sound that can be heard from at least 100 feet, and the space you left fills with waves of intense heat. For 1 minute, that square is hazardous terrain that deals 1d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage to any creature that moves into it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12017,"type":"item","before":{"id":12017,"bulk":"0","name":"Flurrying","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8297706382809799","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"etched-onto-melee-weapon-monk","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4400","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:34.777393+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you make a [Flurry of Blows](link_feat_30999) using the etched weapon and your first [Strike](link_action_19856) reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points, you can make your second [Strike](link_action_19856) with an echo of the weapon, increasing the reach to 30 feet.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [force](link_trait_1560))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The weapon casts a *[spiritual armament](link_spell_4855)* spell. The ghostly weapon looks like the etched weapon. Use your normal attack bonus and damage for the weapon instead of the damage listed in the spell, but use your Wisdom modifier instead of Strength when determining damage. You can choose to make a [Flurry of Blows](link_feat_30999) instead of a [Strike](link_action_19856) when the _[spiritual armament](link_spell_4855)_ attacks; this still counts as your [flourish](link_trait_1462) for the turn. You can [Sustain](link_action_19858) this activation in the same manner as the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12017,"bulk":"0","name":"Flurrying","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8297706382809799","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"etched-onto-melee-weapon-monk","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4400","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:34.777393+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you make a [Flurry of Blows](link_feat_30999) using the etched weapon and your first [Strike](link_action_19856) reduces a creature to 0 Hit Points, you can make your second [Strike](link_action_19856) with an echo of the weapon, increasing the reach to 30 feet.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [force](link_trait_1560))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The weapon casts a *[spiritual armament](link_spell_4855)* spell. The ghostly weapon looks like the etched weapon. Use your normal attack bonus and damage for the weapon instead of the damage listed in the spell, but use your Wisdom modifier instead of Strength when determining damage. You can choose to make a [Flurry of Blows](link_feat_30999) instead of a [Strike](link_action_19856) when the _[spiritual armament](link_spell_4855)_ attacks; this still counts as your [flourish](link_trait_1462) for the turn. You can [Sustain](link_action_19858) this activation in the same manner as the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12018,"type":"item","before":{"id":12018,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Flyssa","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5240755253168091","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1854],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=612","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:27:15.285Z"},"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:35.567757+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This single-edged blade has a guardless hilt. Often decorated with elaborate etchings, a [flyssa](link_item_12018) is longer than most [daggers](link_item_6854) but shorter than average for most swords, making it useful in close and pitched combat.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12018,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Flyssa","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5240755253168091","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1854],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=612","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:27:15.285Z"},"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:35.567757+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This single-edged blade has a guardless hilt. Often decorated with elaborate etchings, a [flyssa](link_item_12018) is longer than most [daggers](link_item_6854) but shorter than average for most swords, making it useful in close and pitched combat.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12019,"type":"item","before":{"id":12019,"bulk":"0","name":"Forgotten Signet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1400283446489085","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":21,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4891","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"179"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:36.185846+00:00","operations":null,"description":"At the center of this silver ring gleams an obsidian gem, its surface emblazoned with a bloodred rune of forgetting. While wearing a _[forgotten signet](link_item_12019)_, you're subjected to *[hidden mind](link_spell_6334)* (+32 counteract bonus) and easily fade from others' memory. Sapient creatures must attempt a DC 42 Will save each time you depart from their company or they forget you entirely.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature's memories of you are normal.\n\n**Success** The creature remembers you and your interactions but has difficulty describing either to others. Each time they attempt to share information about these subjects with someone else, they relate only confusing or unclear details about you and this interaction.\n\n**Failure** The creature remembers your existence but no details about you or your interactions. For example, they remember speaking with an individual of your most basic biological traits, such as a [human](link_trait_1436) woman, but not your name, appearance, or other specific features.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature retains no memories of you or this interaction.\n\n**Destruction** If a creature learns the true name of a _[forgotten signet](link_item_12019)_'s wearer and makes it public knowledge, that _[forgotten signet](link_item_12019)_ tarnishes and breaks in two.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12019,"bulk":"0","name":"Forgotten Signet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1400283446489085","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":21,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4891","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"179"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_