:0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:40.08764+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This coin is struck with the image of a beatific seraph in platinum on one side and a fearsome fiend with seven eyes enameled in black on the other. While it may seem nothing more than a curiosity, it's a powerful agent of fortune when activated.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Trigger** You fail a check or attack; **Effect** Flip the coin. If it lands on the seraph side, you get a 14 on the die instead of what you rolled. If it lands on the fiend side, one of the eyes on the fiend closes. Either way, you're temporarily immune to [fortune's coin](link_item_12022) for 1 hour. When all seven eyes are closed, the coin vanishes into a puff of smoke, disappearing forever. This activation is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect, regardless of how the coin flip lands.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12022,"bulk":"0","name":"Fortune's Coin (Platinum)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5769530547620602","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1460,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4724","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"charges":{"max":7},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:40.08764+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This coin is struck with the image of a beatific seraph in platinum on one side and a fearsome fiend with seven eyes enameled in black on the other. While it may seem nothing more than a