item","before":{"id":12027,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fundamental Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7592629621026706","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4603","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"86"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:43.930886+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nMade of elemental salts and essences from the Inner Sphere or where such planes leak onto the Universe, [fundamental oil](link_item_12027) is anathema to [elementals](link_trait_2406) and other creatures with a weakness to elemental damage. A weapon anointed with this oil acts as [Bane oil](link_item_11734) to [elementals](link_trait_2406), but the damage type is the same as the target's greatest weakness if the target has weakness to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage. If it has none of these, the additional damage is the same type as the weapon's damage type. These effects last 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12027,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fundamental Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7592629621026706","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4603","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"86"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:43.930886+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nMade of elemental salts and essences from the Inner Sphere or where such planes leak onto the Universe, [fundamental oil](link_item_12027) is anathema to [elementals](link_trait_2406) and other creatures with a weakness to elemental damage. A weapon anointed with this oil acts as [Bane oil](link_item_11734) to [elementals](link_trait_2406), but the damage type is the same as the target's greatest weakness if the target has weakness to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage. If it has none of these, the additional damage is the same type as the weapon's damage type. These effects last 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12028,"type":"item","before":{"id":12028,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fury Cocktail (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5584085442397161","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4450","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:44.438736+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [fury cocktail](link_item_12028) is a fortifying ginger beer spiked with rum and a mixer. It's rumored to have originated from a barbarian-themed festival in a popular mead hall specializing in [alchemical](link_trait_1529) beverages.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +4 item bonus to melee attack rolls and an additional effect depending on the additive chosen when the brew is created. The effects last 1 hour.\n\n*   **Animalistic** Lemon juice and powdered claws or talons are added to the cocktail. You gain an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack in the brawling group of your choice between a jaws attack that deals 1d6 piercing damage or a claw attack that has the [agile](link_trait_1569) trait and deals 1d4 slashing damage.\n*   **Double** This cocktail is just stronger, with more ginger and more rum. You gain resistance 5 to physical damage.\n*   **Mournful** A few flower petals add a powerful aroma to the drink. You gain resistance 10 to [void](link_trait_1485) damage, or resistance 10 to [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage if you have [void healing](link_physical-feature_27438).\n*   **Skeptical** A splash of bitters gives the drink a more complex flavor. You gain a +3 item bonus to saves against magic.\n*   **Titanic** Yuzu juice and powdered giant hair are added to this cocktail. If you're Medium or smaller, you gain the following effects: you become Large, are clumsy 1, and increase your reach by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if you started out Tiny).\n*   **Wyrmhide** Pomegranate juice and elemental reagents are added to the cocktail. You gain resistance 10 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to AC and a –2 penalty to Reflex saves.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12028,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fury Cocktail (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5584085442397161","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rari