 (or by 10 feet if you started out Tiny).\n*   **Wyrmhide** Pomegranate juice and elemental reagents are added to the cocktail. You gain resistance 10 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to AC and a –2 penalty to Reflex saves.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12029,"type":"item","before":{"id":12029,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fury Cocktail (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7778701163006202","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4450","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:45.109482+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [fury cocktail](link_item_12029) is a fortifying ginger beer spiked with rum and a mixer. It's rumored to have originated from a barbarian-themed festival in a popular mead hall specializing in [alchemical](link_trait_1529) beverages.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +2 item bonus to melee attack rolls and an additional effect depending on the additive chosen when the brew is created. The effects last 10 minutes.\n\n*   **Animalistic** Lemon juice and powdered claws or talons are added to the cocktail. You gain an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack in the brawling group of your choice between a jaws att