9) beverages.\n\n**Benefit** You gain an item bonus to melee attack rolls and an additional effect depending on the additive chosen when the brew is created.\n\n*   **Animalistic** Lemon juice and powdered claws or talons are added to the cocktail. You gain an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack in the brawling group of your choice between a jaws attack that deals 1d6 piercing damage or a claw attack that has the [agile](link_trait_1569) trait and deals 1d4 slashing damage.\n*   **Double** This cocktail is just stronger, with more ginger and more rum. You gain resistance 2 to physical damage.\n*   **Mournful** A few flower petals add a powerful aroma to the drink. You gain resistance 5 to [void](link_trait_1485) damage, or resistance 5 to [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage if you have [void healing](link_physical-feature_27438).\n*   **Skeptical** A splash of bitters gives the drink a more complex flavor. You gain a +2 item bonus to saves against magic.\n*   **Titanic** Yuzu juice and powdered giant hair are added to this cocktail. If you're Medium or smaller, you gain the following effects: you become Large, are clumsy 1, and increase your reach by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if you started out Tiny).\n*   **Wyrmhide** Pomegranate juice and elemental reagents are added to the cocktail. You gain resistance 5 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to AC and a –2 penalty to Reflex saves.\n\nYou gain a +3 item bonus to melee attack rolls, and the duration is 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12031,"type":"item","before":{"id":12031,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gaffe Glasses","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7561003909965165","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4909","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"191"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:20:24.945Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:46.27246+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These wire-rim glasses appear to be [glasses of sociability](link_item_23092), making you think they grant a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy when they grant none. The GM secretly adjusts your Diplomacy checks to ignore the bonus, and if you have multiple +1 item bonuses to Diplomacy, the glasses take precedence, negating those bonuses.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Effect** Like [glasses of sociability](link_item_23092), with the same limitations, you stare at another creature. If you've met and exchanged names, you expect to instantly remember the target's name. However, you recall the worst possible incorrect name, such as mistaking a famous artist for their hated rival. This blunder doesn't prevent you from realizing the creature's real name after you've been corrected. Once you use this activation, the glasses fuse to you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12031,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gaffe Glasses","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7561003909965165","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4909","book":"Treasure Vaul