"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4451","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:13:49.368Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:47.698073+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [galvanic chew](link_item_12033) is a processed ball of dried electric eel, roasted until chewy and coated in spicy, reagent-infused powder that tingles with [electricity](link_trait_1576) as you chew. For up to 1 hour, you have resistance 5 to [electricity](link_trait_1576).\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([electricity](link_trait_1576))\n\n**Trigger** You're hit by a melee attack or touched by a creature; **Effect** You channel [electricity](link_trait_1576) into the triggering creature, which must succeed at a DC 24 Fortitude save or be stunned 1 (or stunned 2 on a critical failure). The chew becomes inert. You're then temporarily immune to [galvanic chews](link_item_12033) for 24 hours or until the next time you make your daily preparations.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12033,"bulk":"0","name":"Galvanic Chew","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4243208051887790","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4451","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"48"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:13:49.368Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:47.698073+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [galvanic chew](link_item_12033) is a processed ball of dried electric eel, roasted until chewy and coated in spicy, reagent-infused powder that tingles with [electricity](link_trait_1576) as you chew. For up to 1 hour, you have resistance 5 to [electricity](link_trait_1576).\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([electricity](link_trait_1576))\n\n**Trigger** You're hit by a melee attack or touched by a creature; **Effect** You channel [electricity](link_trait_1576) into the triggering creature, which must succeed at a DC 24 Fortitude save or be stunned 1 (or stunned 2 on a critical failure). The chew becomes inert. You're then temporarily immune to [galvanic chews](link_item_12033) for 24 hours or until the next time you make your daily preparations.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12034,"type":"item","before":{"id":12034,"bulk":"1","name":"Gambler's Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3952361039479896","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4785","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"132"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:48.759257+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A small glass orb on the head of a _[gambler's staff](link_item_12034)_ holds a pair of six-sided dice that shift and roll within. Spellcasters who make their living via games of chance use _[gamblers' staves](link_item_12034)_ to encourage the odds in their favor. Most gambling dens ban players they discover using such magic items. A _[gambler's staff](link_item_12034)_ grants you a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to [Earn Income](link_action_19631) from gambling (typically using Games Lore). To get this benefit, the staff must be on your person during all the downtime you spend gambling.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** [_wash your luck_](link_spell_9068)\n    \n*   **1st** [_nudge the odds_](link_spell_8991)\n    \n*   **2nd** [_lucky number_](link_spell_8972)\n    \n*   **3rd** [_shift blame_](link_spell_5449)\n    \n*   **4th** [_read omens_](link_spell_4796), [_winning streak_](link_spell_9074)\n    \n*   **5th** [_nudge the odds_](link_spell_8991)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12034,"bulk":"1","name":"Gambler's Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3952361039479896","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4785","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"132"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:48.759257+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A small glass orb on the head of a _[gambler's staff](link_item_12034)_ holds a pair of six-sided dice that shift and roll within. Spellcasters who make their living via games of chance use _[gamblers' staves](link_item_12034)_ to encourage the odds in their favor. Most gambling dens ban players they discover using such magic items. A _[gambler's staff](link_item_12034)_ grants you a +2 circumstance bonus to checks to [Earn Income](link_action_19631) from gambling (typically using Games Lore). To get this benefit, the staff must be on your person during all the downtime you spend gambling.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** [_wash your luck_](link_spell_9068)\n    \n*   **1st** [_nudge the odds_](link_spell_8991)\n    \n*   **2nd** [_lucky number_](link_spell_8972)\n    \n*   **3rd** [_shift blame_](link_spell_5449)\n    \n*   **4th** [_read omens_](link_spell_4796), [_winning streak_](link_spell_9074)\n    \n*   **5th** [_nudge the odds_](link_spell_8991)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12035,"type":"item","before":{"id":12035,"bulk":"0","name":"Garrote Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5245878365331392","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4584","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","dieSize":"d12","category":"persistent","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","damageType":"slashing","diceNumber":2}],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:17:30.657Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:49.404538+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate—** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nWiry designs mark the silvery coating on a *[garrote shot](link_item_12035)*. When the activated ammunition hits a target, it transforms into a silvery garrote that wraps around one of the target's appendages, dealing 2d12 persistent slashing damage. On a critical hit, it wraps around the target's throat if it has one, and the target can't breathe until the persistent damage ends. If the persistent damage kills the target, the garrote severs the appendage it's wrapped around.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12035,"bulk":"0","name":"Garrote Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5245878365331392","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4584","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"80"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","dieSize":"d12","category":"persistent","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","damageType":"slashing","diceNumber":2}],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:17:30.657Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:49.404538+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate—** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nWiry designs mark the silvery coating on a *[garrote shot](link_item_12035)*. When the activated ammunition hits a target, it transforms into a silvery garrote that wraps around one of the target's appendages, dealing 2d12 persistent slashing damage. On a critical hit, it wraps around the target's throat if it has one, and the target can't breathe until the persistent damage ends. If the persistent damage kills the target, the garrote severs the appendage it's wrapped around.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12036,"type":"item","before":{"id":12036,"bulk":"1","name":"Gauntlet Bow","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5661104542090585","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3195,1714,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"crossbow","range":60,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=647","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"31"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:51.32822+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Bolts](link_item_6751)\n\n* * *\n\nThe [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) is a heavy metal glove with a built-in crossbow and rotating chamber mechanism for easy reloading. A [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) can be used to make melee attacks like a standard [gauntlet](link_item_6987), and it retains any valid runes when used as such. You can't reload a [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) with the hand wielding it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12036,"bulk":"1","name":"Gauntlet Bow","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5661104542090585","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3195,1714,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"crossbow","range":60,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=647","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"31"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:51.32822+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Bolts](link_item_6751)\n\n* * *\n\nThe [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) is a heavy metal glove with a built-in crossbow and rotating chamber mechanism for easy reloading. A [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) can be used to make melee attacks like a standard [gauntlet](link_item_6987), and it retains any valid runes when used as such. You can't reload a [gauntlet bow](link_item_12036) with the hand wielding it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12037,"type":"item","before":{"id":12037,"bulk":"1","name":"Gauntlet Buckler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7635880072734365","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2885],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":6,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":6,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=24","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"gauntlet-buckler","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":3},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:53.063864+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This buckler-sized shield is segmented, allowing it to collapse into a housing bound to a [gauntlet](link_item_6987) for easy storage. A small catch enables you to expand the shield quickly in battle when you're in need of defense.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12037,"bulk":"1","name":"Gauntlet Buckler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7635880072734365","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2885],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":6,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":6,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=24","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"gauntlet-buckler","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":3},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:53.063864+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This buckler-sized shield is segmented, allowing it to collapse into a housing bound to a [gauntlet](link_item_6987) for easy storage. A small catch enables you to expand the shield quickly in battle when you're in need of defense.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12038,"type":"item","before":{"id":12038,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gearbinder Oil (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4652774452224186","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1481],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4473","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:57.01634+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Gearbinder oil](link_item_12038) comes in a sealed pump that can squirt the oil a short distance. The oil is designed to flow through complex mechanisms and, agitated through mechanical action, foam up and form a paste that binds the works. The oil is effective against articulated [constructs](link_trait_2410) and machinery, including many [constructs](link_trait_2410), [clockworks](link_trait_2877), and mechanical hazards. You apply the oil to the target you want to bind, which must be within 10 feet of you. After the oil is applied, at the end of any round during which the target took an action with the [attack](link_trait_1520), [manipulate](link_trait_1433), or [move](link_trait_1505) trait, it must attempt a DC 38 Fortitude save. A mechanism that's slowed 2 or more by [gearbinder oil](link_item_12038) also can't use reactions. [Gearbinder oil](link_item_12038) functions for up to 6 rounds before becoming an inert, oily residue.\n\n**Critical Success** The oil becomes inert, and the effect ends.\n\n**Success** The target reduces its slowed condition by 1. If the slowed condition's value is 0, the effect ends.\n\n**Failure** The target increases its slowed condition by 1, to a maximum of slowed 3.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target increases its slowed condition by 2, to a maximum of slowed 3.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12038,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gearbinder Oil (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4652774452224186","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1481],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4473","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:17:57.01634+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Gearbinder oil](link_item_12038) comes in a sealed pump that can squirt the oil a short distance. The oil is designed to flow through complex mechanisms and, agitated through mechanical action, foam up and form a paste that binds the works. The oil is effective against articulated