link_trait_2447)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12043,"type":"item","before":{"id":12043,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghost Ampoule","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3638132873390205","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1486,1668,1487,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4481","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"56"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:03:31.947Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:05.209721+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA daub of ectoplasm twitches within this glass container, faintly glowing with ghostly light. When opened it forms the echo of a departed spirit, which looks like a Medium [ghost](link_trait_2446). You can throw the ampoule up to 30 feet when you Activate it. The [ghost](link_trait_2446) utters a final lament, forcing each living creature in a 15-foot emanation except you to attempt a DC 18 Will save. On a failure, a creature becomes frightened 2 (or frightened 3 on a critical failure).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply ectoplasmic residue from a destroyed [ghost](link_trait_2446)."},"after":{"id":12043,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghost Ampoule","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3638132873390205","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1486,1668,1487,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4481","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"56"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:03:31.947Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:05.209721+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA daub of ectoplasm twitches within this glass container, faintly glowing with ghostly light. When opened it forms the echo of a departed spirit, which looks like a Medium [ghost](link_trait_2446). You can throw the ampoule up to 30 feet when you Activate it. The [ghost](link_trait_2446) utters a final lament, forcing each living creature in a 15-foot emanation except you to attempt a DC 18 Will save. On a failure, a creature becomes frightened 2 (or frightened 3 on a critical failure).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply ectoplasmic residue from a destroyed [ghost](link_trait_2446)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12044,"type":"item","before":{"id":12044,"bulk":"0","name":"Ghost Courier Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1094525241955563","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4567","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:28:47.079Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:05.87069+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The inscription on a _[ghost courier fulu](link_item_12044)_ leaves space for a message, and a prominent red stamp indicates which [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) this [fulu](link_trait_2854) homes in on (see below). When you Activate this [fulu](link_trait_2854), you dictate a message up to 25 words long that then magically appears on the paper in the language you spoke. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) then disappears into the Ethereal Plane, arriving at the assigned [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) in 2d10 hours, provided that [fulu](link_trait_2854) is within 500 miles. There, the [fulu](link_trait_2854)'s magic dissipates, but the message remains. If the [fulu](link_trait_2854) takes any damage in transit, it has a 50% chance to drop back into the Universe, intact but bereft of magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12044,"bulk":"0","name":"Ghost Courier Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1094525241955563","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4567","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:28:47.079Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:05.87069+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** The inscription on a _[ghost courier fulu](link_item_12044)_ leaves space for a message, and a prominent red stamp indicates which [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) this [fulu](link_trait_2854) homes in on (see below). When you Activate this [fulu](link_trait_2854), you dictate a message up to 25 words long that then magically appears on the paper in the language you spoke. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) then disappears into the Ethereal Plane, arriving at the assigned [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) in 2d10 hours, provided that [fulu](link_trait_2854) is within 500 miles. There, the [fulu](link_trait_2854)'s magic dissipates, but the message remains. If the [fulu](link_trait_2854) takes any damage in transit, it has a 50% chance to drop back into the Universe, intact but bereft of magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12045,"type":"item","before":{"id":12045,"bulk":"0","name":"Ghost Delivery Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2405633429083631","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"affixed to structure, object, or creature","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4568","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:06.396002+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 week\n\nA [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045)'s inscription resembles a dovecote with spirits around it, and it has a prominent stamp in red wax. This [fulu](link_trait_2854) activates once affixed, becoming the homing location of [ghost courier fulus](link_item_12044) with a matching stamp. Delivered [ghost courier fulu](link_item_12044) messages stick to the [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) but can be easily removed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12045,"bulk":"0","name":"Ghost Delivery Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2405633429083631","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"affixed to structure, object, or creature","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4568","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:06.396002+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 week\n\nA [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045)'s inscription resembles a dovecote with spirits around it, and it has a prominent stamp in red wax. This [fulu](link_trait_2854) activates once affixed, becoming the homing location of [ghost courier fulus](link_item_12044) with a matching stamp. Delivered [ghost courier fulu](link_item_12044) messages stick to the [ghost delivery fulu](link_item_12045) but can be easily removed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12046,"type":"item","before":{"id":12046,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghost Lantern","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2762906254266206","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1850},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1517,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4725","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":60,"color":"#808080","bright":30,"shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"flame","speed":1,"intensity":4},"saturation":-0.9}},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/sundries/lights/lantern-steel.webp"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:06.962802+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Crafted from [cold iron](link_item_15059), this black [hooded lantern](link_item_7067) has gray glass and lenses that emit a pale gray light when the lantern is lit. Anything this light falls on looks gray or desaturated. The lantern uses oil as a standard [hooded lantern](link_item_7067). The lantern's light shines within the Ethereal Plane as well as the Universe. On any other plane, the light functions as a normal [hooded lantern](link_item_7067).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** The lantern's shutters are open\n\n**Effect** You concentrate on the lantern's light to soften the boundary between the Ethereal Plane and the Universe. Any creature in the lantern's bright light on the Universe gains the effects of the [Ghost Touch](link_item_6992) property rune on all its weapons and [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks. If an affected weapon or attack is [magical](link_trait_1504) and already has the maximum number of property runes, the wielder can choose one to suppress to gain _[ghost touch](link_item_6992)_. This benefit lasts for 5 minutes or until the shutters are closed, whichever comes first. It applies to a creature only while it's in the lantern's bright light, and if the creature leaves the light and returns it regains the benefit once more.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12046,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghost Lantern","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2762906254266206","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1850},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1517,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4725","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":60,"color":"#808080","bright":30,"shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"flame","speed":1,"intensity":4},"saturation":-0.9}},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/sundries/lights/lantern-steel.webp"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:06.962802+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Crafted from [cold iron](link_item_15059), this black [hooded lantern](link_item_7067) has gray glass and lenses that emit a pale gray light when the lantern is lit. Anything this light falls on looks gray or desaturated. The lantern uses oil as a standard [hooded lantern](link_item_7067). The lantern's light shines within the Ethereal Plane as well as the Universe. On any other plane, the light functions as a normal [hooded lantern](link_item_7067).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** The lantern's shutters are open\n\n**Effect** You concentrate on the lantern's light to soften the boundary between the Ethereal Plane and the Universe. Any creature in the lantern's bright light on the Universe gains the effects of the [Ghost Touch](link_item_6992) property rune on all its weapons and [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks. If an affected weapon or attack is [magical](link_trait_1504) and already has the maximum number of property runes, the wielder can choose one to suppress to gain _[ghost touch](link_item_6992)_. This benefit lasts for 5 minutes or until the shutters are closed, whichever comes first. It applies to a creature only while it's in the lantern's bright light, and if the creature leaves the light and returns it regains the benefit once more.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12047,"type":"item","before":{"id":12047,"bulk":"0","name":"Ghostcaller's Planchette (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3228865969712124","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":21000},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4764","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"125"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":38}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:07.525452+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This miniature wooden planchette is engraved with symbols designed to attract spirits. When affixed, the symbols begin to glow, and the planchette turns slightly insubstantial. The spell DC of any spell cast by Activating this item is 38.\n\n*   **Armor** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the planchette, you gain resistance 10 to all physical damage (except [_ghost touch_](link_item_6992)) until the start of your next turn. Attacks by [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) creatures (such as a [ghost's](link_trait_2446) ghostly hand) count as _ghost touch_.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) activating the planchette, the affixed weapon gains the effects of the [_ghost touch_](link_item_6992) and [_greater vitaliz