tart of your next turn. Attacks by [incorporeal](link_trait_2424) creatures (such as a [ghost's](link_trait_2446) ghostly hand) count as _ghost touch_.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) activating the planchette, the affixed weapon gains the effects of the [_ghost touch_](link_item_6992) property rune until the end of your next turn.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[void warp](link_spell_4937)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[invoke spirits](link_spell_4690)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12049,"type":"item","before":{"id":12049,"bulk":"2","name":"Ghosthand's Comet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"440430599045372","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":23,"price":{"gp":71300},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1554,1670,2565,1504,3073],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":300,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":12885,"name":"Bane"},{"id":12954,"name":"Impactful (Greater)"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":2,"damageType":"force"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"0","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4892","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"179"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","label":"Bane","dieSize":"d6","selector":"damage","predicate":["target:trait:beast"],"diceNumber":1}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"inubrix","grade":"high"},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:09.349497+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The barrel of this long rifle is translucent in places, forming a swirled pattern along the metal, and its stock is formed of crimson wood. [Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049) is a _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [beast-bane](link_item_23043) [greater impactful](link_item_23051)_ advanced firearm with a range increment of 300 feet. It deals 5d8 [force](link_trait_1560) damage and has the [backstabber](link_trait_1554), [concussive](link_trait_3073), [kickback](link_trait_2565), and [fatal d12](link_trait_1670) traits. As a star gun, _[Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049)_ runs on magic and doesn't use ammunition or [black powder](link_item_13495). The weapon is silent when fired.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You attempt a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) with [Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049)\n\n**Effect** For the triggering [Strike](link_action_19856), _[Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049)_ changes its damage type to your choice of [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [sonic](link_trait_1484).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** On your next attempt at a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) with _[Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049)_, the shot phases through any material or [magical](link_trait_1504) obstacle, such as a *[wall of force](link_spell_4942)*, in its path, ignoring all cover. You must attempt the [Strike](link_action_19856) by the end of your turn or this effect is lost.\n\n**Destruction** If the [Grim Reaper](link_creature_10113) slays the wielder of [Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049), the Reaper's scythe, as it strikes the killing blow, is destined to slice the star gun in half.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12049,"bulk":"2","name":"Ghosthand's Comet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"440430599045372","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":23,"price":{"gp":71300},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1554,1670,2565,1504,3073]