vate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** On your next attempt at a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) with _[Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049)_, the shot phases through any material or [magical](link_trait_1504) obstacle, such as a *[wall of force](link_spell_4942)*, in its path, ignoring all cover. You must attempt the [Strike](link_action_19856) by the end of your turn or this effect is lost.\n\n**Destruction** If the [Grim Reaper](link_creature_10113) slays the wielder of [Ghosthand's Comet](link_item_12049), the Reaper's scythe, as it strikes the killing blow, is destined to slice the star gun in half.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12050,"type":"item","before":{"id":12050,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gi","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4229735834991939","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1599],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"cloth","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=62","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"10"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":5,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":0,"category":"unarmored_defense","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":null,"base_item":"gi","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":0,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:10.369841+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Also called martial arts suits or practice clothes, [gi](link_item_12050) are outfits of tough cloth built for comfort and unrestricted movement—ideal for practicing martial arts. They have reinforced stitching resistant to strenuous use.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"cr