ry Effect** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr>; **Effect** Reduce your sickened value by 1, if any. The chew becomes inert.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12052,"type":"item","before":{"id":12052,"bulk":"0","name":"Gliding","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1903855161312614","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4364","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:11.463981+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The armor allows you to make a controlled descent.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Effect** You glide slowly toward the ground, 5 feet down and up to 25 feet forward through the air. Provided you spend at least 1 action gliding on your turn and haven't yet reached the ground, you remain in the air at the end of your turn. Otherwise, you fall.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12052,"bulk":"0","name":"Gliding","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1903855161312614","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4364","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},