of multicolored motes in a 10-foot burst from a corner of the [missive](link_trait_2874)'s space. Creatures in the area are covered in sparkling dust that remains luminous for 1 hour. Visible creatures can't be concealed while covered by the luminous dust; any invisible creatures are concealed while covered in the luminous dust, rather than being undetected.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12053,"bulk":"0","name":"Glimmering Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2300306948757622","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1517,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4595","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:54:51.918Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:12.017621+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [glimmering missive](link_item_12053) sparkles as you [compose](link_action_43788) it. When activated, it explodes, disintegrating into a shower of multicolored motes in a 10-foot burst from a corner of the [missive](link_trait_2874)'s space. Creatures in the area are covered in sparkling dust that remains luminous for 1 hour. Visible creatures can't be concealed while covered by the luminous dust; any invisible creatures are concealed while covered in the luminous dust, rather than being undetected.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12054,"type":"item","before":{"id":12054,"bulk":"0","name":"Golden Breath Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7790890039043215","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":8100},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1442,1504,1544,1478],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4569","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:55:20.045Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:12.669267+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You take damage.\n\nAn enterprising chirurgeon reversed the forces evoked by a *[void thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12528)* to create the *[golden breath fulu](link_item_12054)*, which fortifies qi and the body as elements move out of balance. When you Activate this [fulu](link_trait_2854), you regain 75 Hit Points and attempt a flat check to end any persistent damage affecting you. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) is particularly appropriate help for ending any persistent damage. Also, if you would regain more Hit Points from the [fulu](link_trait_2854) than your maximum, you can gain the excess as temporary Hit Points or distribute the excess among creatures of your choice within 30 feet. The temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":12054,"bulk":"0","name":"Golden Breath Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7790890039043215","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":8100},"usage":"affixed to armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1442,1504,1544,1478],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4569","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"77"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T21:55:20.045Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:12.669267+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You take damage.\n\nAn enterprising chirurgeon reversed the forces evoked by a *[void thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12528)* to create the *[golden breath fulu](link_item_12054)*, which fortifies qi and the body as elements move out of balance. When you Activate this [fulu](link_trait_2854), you regain 75 Hit Points and attempt a flat check to end any persistent damage affecting you. The [fulu](link_trait_2854) is particularly appropriate help for ending any persistent damage. Also, if you would regain more Hit Points from the [fulu](link_trait_2854) than your maximum, you can gain the excess as temporary Hit Points or distribute the excess among creatures of your choice within 30 feet. The temporary Hit Points last for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12055,"type":"item","before":{"id":12055,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gorgon's Breath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6120151726437384","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":475},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1578,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4537","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"69"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:13.339366+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Gorgon's breath](link_item_12055) is a fine powder that can easily enter living creatures' bloodstreams through their lungs before binding to mucous membranes and causing any nearby soft tissues to harden.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 32 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 round; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** slowed 1 (1 round); **Stage 2** 4d6 bludgeoning damage and slowed 1 (1 round); **Stage 3** petrified (1 round); **Stage 4** petrified permanently","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12055,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gorgon's Breath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6120151726437384","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":475},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1578,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4537","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"69"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:13.339366+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n[Gorgon's breath](link_item_12055) is a fine powder that can easily enter living creatures' bloodstreams through their lungs before binding to mucous membranes and causing any nearby soft tissues to harden.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 32 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 round; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** slowed 1 (1 round); **Stage 2** 4d6 bludgeoning damage and slowed 1 (1 round); **Stage 3** petrified (1 round); **Stage 4** petrified permanently","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12056,"type":"item","before":{"id":12056,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gossip's Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1087050887351536","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4692","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:46:35.755Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:13.860573+00:00","operations":[],"description":"These discrete prosthetics have been the secret behind more than a few salacious rumors getting out among Taldan high society. This functions like a [magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184), but with an added benefit.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You whisper \"spy for me\" to the eye, which removes itself from your eye socket and begins to relay its signal to you even at range. Although it can't move on its own, you can place the eye in a discrete location (using your Stealth DC) to avoid detection. For 10 minutes, you can see what the eye sees as long as you're within 100 feet of the eye. The eye's signal can penetrate most barriers but is blocked by lead of any thickness, as well as denser materials. The eye's signal is visual only.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12056,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gossip's Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1087050887351536","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4692","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:46:35.755Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:13.860573+00:00","operations":[],"description":"These discrete prosthetics have been the secret behind more than a few salacious rumors getting out among Taldan high society. This functions like a [magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184), but with an added benefit.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You whisper \"spy for me\" to the eye, which removes itself from your eye socket and begins to relay its signal to you even at range. Although it can't move on its own, you can place the eye in a discrete location (using your Stealth DC) to avoid detection. For 10 minutes, you can see what the eye sees as long as you're within 100 feet of the eye. The eye's signal can penetrate most barriers but is blocked by lead of any thickness, as well as denser materials. The eye's signal is visual only.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12057,"type":"item","before":{"id":12057,"bulk":"0","name":"Goz Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1224844292573480","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":240},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4880","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:58:26.225Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:14.393969+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Originally designed by a sect of Gozren priests, _[goz masks](link_item_12057)_ were designed to help navigate the area around the Eye of Abendego. The masks couldn't contend with the might of the storm, but people all around the Mwangi Expanse still use them. These masks are typically made of wood and sport round, exaggerated features.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You ignore concealment caused by fog, smoke, and other obscuring vapors for 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12057,"bulk":"0","name":"Goz Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1224844292573480","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":240},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes"