selectable":false,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:25.126511+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Often used for hunting exceptionally large [aquatic](link_trait_2429) creatures, the [harpoon](link_item_12069) is similar to a [javelin](link_item_7056) but features a barbed head and [rope](link_item_7715) tether so it (or the corpse it's attached to) can be easily retrieved.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12069,"bulk":"1","name":"Harpoon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7235695410859867","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1535,1575],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"dart","range":30,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=648","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"31"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:51:13.151Z"},"hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:25.126511+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Often used for hunting exceptionally large [aquatic](link_trait_2429) creatures, the [harpoon](link_item_12069) is similar to a [javelin](link_item_7056) but features a barbed head and [rope](link_item_7715) tether so it (or the corpse it's attached to) can be easily retrieved.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12070,"type":"item","before":{"id":12070,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Harrow Spellcards","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2619901708740980","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":425},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4712","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"112"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:25.763924+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Crafted of sturdy paper, each card of this [harrow deck](link_item_14168) showcases a beautiful watercolor illustration with space to inscribe a spell below. When shuffled, its cards seem to fly between one another of their own accord.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** Your last action was to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855) that has the [detection](link_trait_1508), [prediction](link_trait_1896), [revelation](link_trait_1907), or [scrying](link_trait_1590) trait; **Effect** You draw forth a card to gain insight into future challenges you'll face. Draw a card from a [harrow deck](link_item_14168) or roll 1d6:\n\n1.  hammers (Athletics)\n    \n2.  keys (Acrobatics)\n    \n3.  shields (Survival)\n    \n4.  books (any [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753))\n    \n5.  stars (Religion)\n    \n6.  crowns (Diplomacy)\n    \n\nThe next time you attempt a check of the same type as your result, roll twice and take the better result, as the spirits of the harrow guide your actions. If not used by your next daily preparations, this benefit disappears.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12070,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Harrow Spellcards","si