vel":16,"price":{"gp":10000},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4868","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:27.601074+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Headbands of translocation](link_item_12073)_ are silk bands that come in pairs and usually feature a prominent symbol of a nation or team. If both wearers [Invest](link_action_20775) their headbands at the same time and think of the same symbol while doing so, both headbands change to display that symbol until they are removed. If you both have [Invested](link_action_20775) your headbands, you can [Aid](link_action_19604) each other without taking an action to prepare and when you get a critical failure when attempting to [Aid](link_action_19604) an ally with a paired headband, you get a failure instead.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You remove your headband, which teleports you to a space adjacent to the other Invested wearer's location, if you are within 1 mile of each other.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12073,"bulk":"0","name":"Headbands of Translocation","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7480455212198572","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":10000},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4868","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:27.601074+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Headbands of translocation](link_item_12073)_ are silk bands that come in pairs and usually feature a prominent symbol of a nation or team. If both wearers [Invest](link_action_20775) their headbands at the same time and think of the same symbol while doing so, both headbands change to display that symbol until they are removed. If you both have [Invested](link_action_20775) your headbands, you can [Aid](link_action_19604) each other without taking an action to prepare and when you get a critical failure when attempting to [Aid](link_action_19604) an ally with a paired headband, you get a failure instead.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You remove your headband, which teleports you to a space adjacent to the other Invested wearer's location, if you are within 1 mile of each other.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12074,"type":"item","before":{"id":12074,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Healing Vapor (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5013208072914190","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":400},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4474","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T22:08:25.962Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:28.177409+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Healing vapor](link_item_12074) is a substance that accelerates natural recovery processes by dispersing a mist infused with a variety of reagents typically used for healing and recovery. When deployed from a sealed container, the vapors fill a 5-foot burst, last for 10 minutes, and can affect up to four living creatures at one time. Any creatures beyond the first four gain no benefit, though if a creature leaves before the duration is over, a new creature that enters can benefit from the mist. A creature benefiting from the vapors regains 2 Hit Points every minute. While affected, a creature also gains a +2 item bonus to saving throws against [diseases](link_trait_1857) and [poisons](link_trait_1476). If the areas of more than one [healing vapor](link_item_12074) overlap, only the strongest applies to creatures inside overlapping areas. Strong wind disperses the mist, rendering it ineffective while the wind blows.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12074,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Healing Vapor (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5013208072914190","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":400},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4474","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T22:08:25.962Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:28.177409+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Heal