while the wind blows.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12078,"type":"item","before":{"id":12078,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Heartblood Ring","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8023665204732989","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"worn ring","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4900","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"187"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:16:10.746Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:30.577446+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed inside the hidden compartment of a gold ring, heartblood has an unmistakable coppery taste, along with a thick mouth feel. A whiff of the concoction is pleasantly stimulating.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 1 (1 Week)** The first time you enter this stage from a particular dose of heartblood, you are affected as if by *[regenerate](link_spell_4798)*. Each round this effect functions, it attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) one [disease](link_trait_1857) or [poison](link_trait_1476) affecting you with a bonus equal to your class DC – 10. Heartblood also reduces physical signs of aging, altering your appearance to that of vigorous adulthood for your ancestry. (Non-adults who drink heartblood change only in apparent vigor, not age.)\n\nYou have fast healing equal to half your level, as well as resistance to [void](link_trait_1485) damage and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage equal to half your level. Also, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws (or any other defense) against [death](link_trait_1904) effects, [disease](link_trait_1857), paralysis, [poison](link_trait_1476), and [sleep](link_trait_1650). Treat the outcome of any saving throw you roll against [death](link_trait_1904), paralyze, or [sleep](link_trait_1650) effects as one step better.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 2 (1 Month)** You gain [low-light vision](link_sense_19330), or you gain [darkvision](link_sense_20769) if your ancestry already has [low-light vision](link_sense_19330). Reduce your current and maximum Hit Points by 2 × your level; you are doomed 1. You develop a pallor and a dislike of bright light, especially sunlight. If suddenly exposed to bright light, you are dazzled until the end of your next turn. While in an area of sunlight, you remain dazzled until 1 round after the exposure ends. Normal food is unsatisfying, and you have urges to consume blood; when confronted with the opportunity to do so, you must succeed at a Will save to avoid it. Doing so once after each time you roll initiative is enough. Your normal coloration returns for a few hours after you drink blood.\n\nIf you die at this stage or higher, your body becomes a bloody mist that sinks 6 feet into the ground. The third night thereafter, you rise from the earth as a [vampire](link_trait_2470). This typically makes you [unholy](link_trait_1846). You are under the control of the heartblood's creator unless your level is higher than that creature's. The controlling [vampire](link_trait_2470) senses you and guides you to them via psychic link. Significant destruction of your body and circumstances that prevent the formation of [undead](link_trait_2425) stop this effect.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 3 (1 Month)** You gain [darkvision](link_sense_20769) and now have fast healing equal to your level. A [death](link_trait_1904) effect can't automatically kill you or increase your dying value. Reduce your current and maximum Hit Points by 4 × your level, rounded up, instead of 2 × your level; you are doomed 2. Your hunger for blood increases, so if you fail to drink a cup or so each day, you are considered to have gone without food that day. You are also slowed 1 while in sunlight, becoming slowed 2 after 1 minute. Your shadow is wispy, and your reflection in mirrors ghostly, which are apparent signs of vampirism to those who know such facts.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 4** You die.\n\n* * *\n\n**Purging** Heartblood loses its potency if the [vampire](link_trait_2470) who created it is destroyed. However, a dose of heartblood imposes a –2 status penalty to your saving throws against the powers of the [vampire](link_trait_2470) who created it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12078,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Heartblood Ring","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8023665204732989","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"worn ring","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4900","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"187"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:16:10.746Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:30.577446+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed inside the hidden compartment of a gold ring, heartblood has an unmistakable coppery taste, along with a thick mouth feel. A whiff of the concoction is pleasantly stimulating.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 1 (1 Week)** The first time you enter this stage from a particular dose of heartblood, you are affected as if by *[regenerate](link_spell_4798)*. Each round this effect functions, it attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) one [disease](link_trait_1857) or [poison](link_trait_1476) affecting you with a bonus equal to your class DC – 10. Heartblood also reduces physical signs of aging, altering your appearance to that of vigorous adulthood for your ancestry. (Non-adults who drink heartblood change only in apparent vigor, not age.)\n\nYou have fast healing equal to half your level, as well as resistance to [void](link_trait_1485) damage and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage equal to half your level. Also, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to saving throws (or any other defense) against [death](link_trait_1904) effects, [disease](link_trait_1857), paralysis, [poison](link_trait_1476), and [sleep](link_trait_1650). Treat the outcome of any saving throw you roll against [death](link_trait_1904), paralyze, or [sleep](link_trait_1650) effects as one step better.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 2 (1 Month)** You gain [low-light vision](link_sense_19330), or you gain [darkvision](link_sense_20769) if your ancestry already has [low-light vision](link_sense_19330). Reduce your current and maximum Hit Points by 2 × your level; you are doomed 1. You develop a pallor and a dislike of bright light, especially sunlight. If suddenly exposed to bright light, you are dazzled until the end of your next turn. While in an area of sunlight, you remain dazzled until 1 round after the exposure ends. Normal food is unsatisfying, and you have urges to consume blood; when confronted with the opportunity to do so, you must succeed at a Will save to avoid it. Doing so once after each time you roll initiative is enough. Your normal coloration returns for a few hours after you drink blood.\n\nIf you die at this stage or higher, your body becomes a bloody mist that sinks 6 feet into the ground. The third night thereafter, you rise from the earth as a [vampire](link_trait_2470). This typically makes you [unholy](link_trait_1846). You are under the control of the heartblood's creator unless your level is higher than that creature's. The controlling [vampire](link_trait_2470) senses you and guides you to them via psychic link. Significant destruction of your body and circumstances that prevent the formation of [undead](link_trait_2425) stop this effect.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 3 (1 Month)** You gain [darkvision](link_sense_20769) and now have fast healing equal to your level. A [death](link_trait_1904) effect can't automatically kill you or increase your dying value. Reduce your current and maximum Hit Points by 4 × your level, rounded up, instead of 2 × your level; you are doomed 2. Your hunger for blood increases, so if you fail to drink a cup or so each day, you are considered to have gone without food that day. You are also slowed 1 while in sunlight, becoming slowed 2 after 1 minute. Your shadow is wispy, and your reflection in mirrors ghostly, which are apparent signs of vampirism to those who know such facts.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 4** You die.\n\n* * *\n\n**Purging** Heartblood loses its potency if the [vampire](link_trait_2470) who created it is destroyed. However, a dose of heartblood imposes a –2 status penalty to your saving throws against the powers of the [vampire](link_trait_2470) who created it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12079,"type":"item","before":{"id":12079,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Bull)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7591851120862961","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:24:42.349Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:31.149908+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a *[heartening missive](link_item_12079)* by creating a short message or image intended to grant the recipient moral support. You must dedicate the [missive](link_trait_2874) to an individual creature you know and address it to their location (typically the settlement where you think they are). Once you finish [composing](link_action_43788) the [missive](link_trait_2874), it folds itself into the shape of an animal and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a speed of 45 feet (about 15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near the recipient or in their hand. After Activating the [missive](link_trait_2874), the recipient gets its benefit and becomes temporarily immune to all *[heartening missives](link_item_12079)* for 24 hours.\n\nIf the [missive](link_trait_2874) fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, it returns to its sender at the same pace, becoming non-[magical](link_trait_1504) when it arrives. After imparting or losing its magic, the [missive](link_trait_2874) remains as a normal document.\n\nFolded into a bull, this [missive](link_trait_2874) grants the recipient a sense of solidity. The recipient gains a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saves for the next 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12079,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Bull)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7591851120862961","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:24:42.349Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:31.149908+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a *[heartening missive](link_item_12079)* by creating a short message or image intended to grant the recipient moral support. You must dedicate the [missive](link_trait_2874) to an individual creature you know and address it to their location (typically the settlement where you think they are). Once you finish [composing](link_action_43788) the [missive](link_trait_2874), it folds itself into the shape of an animal and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a speed of 45 feet (about 15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near the recipient or in their hand. After Activating the [missive](link_trait_2874), the recipient gets its benefit and becomes temporarily immune to all *[heartening missives](link_item_12079)* for 24 hours.\n\nIf the [missive](link_trait_2874) fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, it returns to its sender at the same pace, becoming non-[magical](link_trait_1504) when it arrives. After imparting or losing its magic, the [missive](link_trait_2874) remains as a normal document.\n\nFolded into a bull, this [missive](link_trait_2874) grants the recipient a sense of solidity. The recipient gains a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saves for the next 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12080,"type":"item","before":{"id":12080,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Butterfly)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7350045267514999","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:31.785174+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate—** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a [heartening missive](link_item_12080) by creating a short message or image intended to grant the recipient moral support. You must dedicate the [missive](link_trait_2874) to an individual creature you know and address it to their location (typically the settlement where you think they are). Once you finish [composing](link_action_43788) the [missive](link_trait_2874), it folds itself into the shape of an animal and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a speed of 45 feet (about 15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near the recipient or in their hand. After Activating the [missive](link_trait_2874), the recipient gets its benefit and becomes temporarily immune to all [heartening missives](link_item_12080) for 24 hours.\n\nIf the [missive](link_trait_2874) fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, it returns to its sender at the same pace, becoming non-[magical](link_trait_1504) when it arrives. After imparting or losing its magic, the [missive](link_trait_2874) remains as a normal document.\n\nFolded into a delicate butterfly, this [missive](link_trait_2874) grants the recipient a sense of grace and poise. Once during the next 24 hours, when the recipient fails a Diplomacy or Performance check, they can improve the result from a failure to a success or from a critical failure to a failure. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12080,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Butterfly)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7350045267514999","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:31.785174+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate—** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a [heartening missive](link_item_12080) by creating a short message or image intended to grant the recipient moral support. You must dedicate the [missive](link_trait_2874) to an individual creature you know and address it to their location (typically the settlement where you think they are). Once you finish [composing](link_action_43788) the [missive](link_trait_2874), it folds itself into the shape of an animal and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a speed of 45 feet (about 15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near the recipient or in their hand. After Activating the [missive](link_trait_2874), the recipient gets its benefit and becomes temporarily immune to all [heartening missives](link_item_12080) for 24 hours.\n\nIf the [missive](link_trait_2874) fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, it returns to its sender at the same pace, becoming non-[magical](link_trait_1504) when it arrives. After imparting or losing its magic, the [missive](link_trait_2874) remains as a normal document.\n\nFolded into a delicate butterfly, this [missive](link_trait_2874) grants the recipient a sense of grace and poise. Once during the next 24 hours, when the recipient fails a Diplomacy or Performance check, they can improve the result from a failure to a success or from a critical failure to a failure. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12081,"type":"item","before":{"id":12081,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Rabbit)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1830376404394040","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:32.317242+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a *[heartening missive](link_item_12081)* by creating a short message or image intended to grant the recipient moral support. You must dedicate the [missive](link_trait_2874) to an individual creature you know and address it to their location (typically the settlement where you think they are). Once you finish [composing](link_action_43788) the [missive](link_trait_2874), it folds itself into the shape of an animal and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a speed of 45 feet (about 15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near the recipient or in their hand. After Activating the [missive](link_trait_2874), the recipient gets its benefit and becomes temporarily immune to all *[heartening missives](link_item_12081)* for 24 hours.\n\nIf the [missive](link_trait_2874) fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, it returns to its sender at the same pace, becoming non-[magical](link_trait_1504) when it arrives. After imparting or losing its magic, the [missive](link_trait_2874) remains as a normal document.\n\nFolded into a rabbit sitting on its haunches, this [missive](link_trait_2874) grants the recipient a sense of mischief and agility. The recipient gains a +1 item bonus to Reflex saves for the next 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12081,"bulk":"0","name":"Heartening Missive (Rabbit)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1830376404394040","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4596","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:32.317242+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nYou [compose](link_action_43788) a *[hear