:null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":24,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":24,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=26","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"heavy-rondache","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":12},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:33.429519+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Similar in size to a buckler, this steel shield is intended to absorb as many blows as possible instead of deflecting attacks. It features multiple layers of metal and is reinforced with additional wood.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12083,"bulk":"1","name":"Heavy Rondache","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5493738917313933","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":24,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":24,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=26","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"heavy-rondache","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":12},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:33.429519+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Similar in size to a buckler, this steel shield is intended to absorb as many blows as possible instead of deflecting attacks. It features multiple layers of metal and is reinforced with additional wood.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12084,"type":"item","before":{"id":12084,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Heckling Tools","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6359329225436616","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4911","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:34.038782+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +9; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy (two common languages)\n\n**Skills** Intimidation +9, one skill associated with their use +9\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +2, **Cha** +2\n\n**Will** +7\n\nTools that are severely misused or left in malevolent circumstances can develop malicious sapience, dedicated to critiquing those who use them. Such [heckling tools](link_item_12084) are often born from implements useful to adventurers because such people are the likely to misuse tools or leave them in a corrupting situation. When you first set to using the tools, they fuse to you. Used for their intended purpose, the tools telepathically badger and disparage you, mocking your abilities and giving you ill-founded advice. You must succeed at a DC 19 Will save to realize this badgering comes from the tools and not your own negative thoughts. Instead of the tool's usual bonus, you take a –2 circumstance penalty to checks made using [heckling tools](link_item_12084). Once you realize the tools are cursed, you can suppress their negative effects, gaining their typical bonus for 24 hours if you succeed at a DC 17 Deception or Diplomacy check to placate them, often by offering obsequious, public admiration.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12084,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Heckling Tools","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6359329225436616","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4911","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:34.038782+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +9; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy (two common languages)\n\n**Skills** Intimidation +9, one skill associated with their use +9\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +2, **Cha** +2\n\n**Will** +7\n\nTools that are severely misused or left in malevolent circumstances can develop malicious sapience, dedicated to critiquing those who use them. Such [heckling tools](link_item_12084) are often born from implements useful to adventurers because such people are the likely to misuse tools or leave them in a corrupting situation. When you first set to using the tools, they fuse to you. Used for their intended purpose, the tools telepathically badger and disparage you, mocking your abilities and giving you ill-founded advice. You must succeed at a DC 19 Will save to realize this badgering comes from the tools and not your own negative thoughts. Instead of the tool's usual bonus, you take a –2 circumstance penalty to checks made using [heckling tools](link_item_12084). Once you realize the tools are cursed, you can suppress their negative effects, gaining their typical bonus for 24 hours if you succeed at a DC 17 Deception or Diplomacy check to placate them, often by offering obsequious, public admiration.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12085,"type":"item","before":{"id":12085,"bulk":"1","name":"Hell Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5655728557005500","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":13000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831,1846],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6961,"name":"Flaming","rune":{"id":6961,"bulk":"0","name":"Flaming","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":4993225368646954,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1542,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"fire"},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:57:36.63508+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A weapon with this [rune](link_item_7716) is empowered by flickering flame. The weapon deals an additional 1d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a successful [Strike](link_action_19856), plus 1d10 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a critical hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}},{"id":7911,"name":"Unholy","rune":{"id":7911,"bulk":"0","name":"Unholy","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":2344268032703624,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"etched onto a weapon that isn't holy","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1846],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"spirit"},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:34:02.780539+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An [unholy](link_item_7911) rune instills fiendish power into the etched weapon. [Strikes](link_action_19856) made with it gain the [unholy](link_trait_1846) trait and deal an extra 1d4 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage, or an extra 2d4 against a [holy](link_trait_1630) target. If you are [holy](link_trait_1630), you are enfeebled 2 while carrying or wielding this weapon.\n\n**Activate—_Unholy Bloodshed_** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You critically succeed at an attack roll against a [holy](link_trait_1630) creature with the weapon; **Effect** The target takes persistent bleed damage equal to 1d8 per weapon damage die of the etched weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":"You are [unholy](link_trait_1846)."}}],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4787","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"132"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7853,"bulk":"1","name":"Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1577800666839305,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3630,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":3,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6,"base_item_content":{"id":7853,"bulk":"1","name":"Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1577800666839305,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1831,3074],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:21:38.977535+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This long piece of wood can aid in walking and deliver a mighty blow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-02-06T08:21:38.977535+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This long piece of wood can aid in walking and deliver a mighty blow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:35.332302+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[hell staff](link_item_12085)_ is a tall, pointed staff forged of red-tinted steel with [Diabolic](link_language_99) inscriptions that march neatly down its sides. At its top sits an inverted ruby pyramid divided into nine sections. Found mostly in Cheliax or other lands where diabolic influences hold sway, when used as a weapon the staff is a [_+3_](link_item_7952) [_greater striking_](link_item_7860) [_flaming_](link_item_6961) [_unholy_](link_item_7911) [_staff_](link_item_7853). When you prepare this staff, if you're [holy](link_trait_1630), you become drained 1 until your next daily preparations.\n\nThe staff's _[summon lesser servitor](link_spell_6777) spell_ can be used only to summon [animals](link_trait_2409) with the [fiend](link_trait_2415) trait, [devils](link_trait_2436), or [hell hounds](link_creature_10124) (at 4th rank). Its _[summon fiend](link_spell_4873)_ spell can summon only [devils](link_trait_2436) or [hell hounds](link_creature_10124).\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[divine lance](link_spell_4578)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[protection](link_spell_4782)*, *[summon lesser servitor](link_spell_6777)*\n    \n*   **2nd** *[darkvision](link_spell_4553)*, *[summon lesser servitor](link_spell_6777)*\n    \n*   **3rd** *[chilling darkness](link_spell_4519)*, *[darkvision](link_spell_4553)*, *[summon lesser servitor](link_spell_6777)*\n    \n*   **4th** *[divine wrath](link_spell_4579)*, *[summon lesser servitor](link_spell_6777)*\n    \n*   **5th** *[darkvision](link_spell_4553)*, *[divine immolation](link_spell_4576)*, *[summon fiend](link_spell_4873)*\n    \n*   **6th** *[devil form](link_spell_8856)*, *[summon fiend](link_spell_4873)*\n    \n*   **7th** *[divine decree](link_spell_4575)*, *[summon fiend](link_spell_4873)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You're [unholy](link_trait_1846). Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12085,"bulk":"1","name":"Hell Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5655728557005500","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":13000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831,1846],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6961,"name":"Flaming","rune":{"id":6961,"bulk":"0","name":"Flaming","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":4993225368646954,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1542,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"b