l,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12093,"type":"item","before":{"id":12093,"bulk":"0","name":"Herd Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1656637328289011","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4881","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:43.3294+00:00","operations":null,"description":"All _[herd masks](link_item_12093)_ are linked to at least one other [herd mask](link_item_12093) and are usually sold in sets of multiple masks. Linked _[herd masks](link_item_12093)_ look like one another, with only slight differences to tell them apart.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You swap locations with another creature wearing a linked _[herd mask](link_item_12093)_ within 100 feet. If you and the creature you swapped with are disguised as each other, other creatures gain an immediate Perception check against the lower of your or the other wearer's Deception DCs to [Impersonate](link_action_19731) each other. On a failure, they don't realize the swap occurred.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[translocate](link_spell_4906)*. You can link a herd mask you create to another herd mask in your possession when you finish crafting it, which causes it to be linked to the chosen mask as well as all other herd masks that are also linked to the chosen mask."},"after":{"id":12093,"bulk":"0","name":"Herd Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1656637328289011","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4881","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:43.3294+00:00","operations":null,"description":"All _[herd masks](link_item_12093)_ are linked to at least one other [herd mask](link_item_12093) and are usually sold in sets of multiple masks. Linked _[herd masks](link_item_12093)_ look like one another, with only slight differences to tell them apart.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You swap locations with another creature wearing a linked _[herd mask](link_item_12093)_ within 100 feet. If you and the creature you swapped with are disguised as each other, other creatures gain an immediate Perception check against the lower of your or the other wearer's Deception DCs to [Impersonate](link_action_19731) each other. On a failure, they don't realize the swap occurred.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[translocate](link_spell_4906)*. You can link a herd mask you create to another herd mask in your possession when you finish crafting it, which causes it to be linked to the chosen mask as well as all other herd masks that are also linked to the chosen mask."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12094,"type":"item","before":{"id":12094,"bulk":"0","name":"Hexing Jar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8315013863224837","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4856","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"hexingJarSelection","prompt":"Select your Patron","choices":[{"label":"Baba Yaga","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Curse","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Fate","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Fervor","value":"religion"},{"label":"Mosquito Witch","value":"nature"},{"label":"Night","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Pacts","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Rune","value":"arcana"},{"label":"Wild","value":"nature"},{"label":"Winter","value":"nature"}]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"{item|flags.pf2e.rulesSelections.hexingJarSelection}"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:43.880737+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Dangling from a simple cord, a _[hexing jar](link_item_12094)_ houses rich soil. When a [witch](link_class_27) who has invested the jar wears it overnight, a miniature thing grows from the soil. Your patron chooses the form, commonly including glowing mushrooms, venus flytraps, mandragora roots, or [undead](link_trait_2425) hands reaching up. The thing whispers secrets it learned from your patron, giving you a +2 item bonus to your patron skill.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [witch](link_class_27) hex spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You roll a critical success on an attack roll with a [witch](link_class_27) spell, or your target rolls a critical failure on its saving throw against a [witch](link_class_27) spell or hex you cast\n\n**Effect** The thing in the jar becomes more energetic—glowing, dancing, rapping on the glass, or some other action appropriate to its appearance. It encourages you until the start of your next turn, granting you and your [familiar](link_feat_20136) a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws and a +2 status bonus against [mental](link_trait_1448) effects.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [witch](link_class_27)."},"after":{"id":12094,"bulk":"0","name":"Hexing Jar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8315013863224837","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4856","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"148"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"ChoiceSet","flag":"hexingJarSelection","prompt":"Select your Patron","choices":[{"label":"Baba Yaga","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Curse","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Fate","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Fervor","value":"religion"},{"label":"Mosquito Witch","value":"nature"},{"label":"Night","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Pacts","value":"occultism"},{"label":"Rune","value":"arcana"},{"label":"Wild","value":"nature"},{"label":"Winter","value":"nature"}]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"{item|flags.pf2e.rulesSelections.hexingJarSelection}"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:43.880737+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Dangling from a simple cord, a _[hexing jar](link_item_12094)_ houses rich soil. When a [witch](link_class_27) who has invested the jar wears it overnight, a miniature thing grows from the soil. Your patron chooses the form, commonly including glowing mushrooms, venus flytraps, mandragora roots, or [undead](link_trait_2425) hands reaching up. The thing whispers secrets it learned from your patron, giving you a +2 item bonus to your patron skill.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 [Focus Point](link_trait_1856), which you can use only to cast a [witch](link_class_27) hex spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this [Focus Point](link_trait_1856) is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You roll a critical success on an attack roll with a [witch](link_class_27) spell, or your target rolls a critical failure on its saving throw against a [witch](link_class_27) spell or hex you cast\n\n**Effect** The thing in the jar becomes more energetic—glowing, dancing, rapping on the glass, or some other action appropriate to its appearance. It encourages you until the start of your next turn, granting you and your [familiar](link_feat_20136) a +1 status bonus to AC and saving throws and a +2 status bonus against [mental](link_trait_1448) effects.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [witch](link_class_27)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12095,"type":"item","before":{"id":12095,"bulk":"1","name":"Hide Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4242949722796972","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2890],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=27","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"","hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:45.868647+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Hide shields come in a variety of shapes and sizes. Specialized tanning techniques combined with tough hides from creatures such as [griffons](link_creature_10111) result in these particularly tough shields. The hardened hide of the shield still has enough flexibility to diminish the impact of battering and pummeling attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12095,"bulk":"1","name":"Hide Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4242949722796972","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2890],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=27","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"","hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:45.868647+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Hide shields come in a variety of shapes and sizes. Specialized tanning techniques combined with tough hides from creatures such as [griffons](link_creature_10111) result in these particularly tough shields. The hardened hide of the shield still has enough flexibility to diminish the impact of battering and pummeling attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12096,"type":"item","before":{"id":12096,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Hippogriff in a Jar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"617515831477348","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4482","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"56"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:46.484936+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis bottle contains a shrunken [hippogriff](link_creature_10127). When opened, the contents reconstitute into a Large effigy of a [hippogriff](link_creature_10127). The [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) waits up to 1 round and allows two creatures to mount it, then [Flies](link_action_19721) up to 65 feet and waits 1 more round to give the mounted creatures time to dismount. Creatures who are still mounted on the [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) when it dissolves fall prone in the space where the [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) corpse ends its movement.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) corpse."},"after":{"id":12096,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Hippogriff in a Jar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"617515831477348","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4482","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"56"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:46.484936+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis bottle contains a shrunken [hippogriff](link_creature_10127). When opened, the contents reconstitute into a Large effigy of a [hippogriff](link_creature_10127). The [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) waits up to 1 round and allows two creatures to mount it, then [Flies](link_action_19721) up to 65 feet and waits 1 more round to give the mounted creatures time to dismount. Creatures who are still mounted on the [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) when it dissolves fall prone in the space where the [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) corpse ends its movement.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a [hippogriff](link_creature_10127) corpse."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12097,"type":"item","before":{"id":12097,"bulk":"0","name":"Homeward Swallow","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1307171685113771","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4743","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:47.023135+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This small [tattoo](link_trait_2857) of a swallow always points toward your home. The tattooing must take place at a location you consider to be your home, or the magic fails to bind with the ink. When you travel to your home using [teleportation](link_trait_1470) that can be off target, such as *[teleport](link_spell_4895)* or *[interplanar teleport](link_spell_4687)*, you arrive exactly at your home. If your home is destroyed or you come to believe a new place is your home, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades from your skin.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** You sense the direction toward your home.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12097,"bulk":"0","name":"Homeward Swallow","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1307171685113771","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4743","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:47.023135+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This small [tattoo](link_trait_2857) of a swallow always points toward your home. The tattooing must take place at a location you consider to be your home, or the magic fails to bind with the ink. When you travel to your home using [teleportation](link_trait_1470) that can be off target, such as *[teleport](link_spell_4895)* or *[interplanar teleport](link_spell_4687)*, you arrive exactly at your home. If your home is destroyed or you come to believe a new place is your home, this [tattoo](link_trait_2857) fades from your skin.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** You sense the direction toward your home.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12098,"type":"item","before":{"id":12098,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Horrid Figurine","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2410292548939842","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4726","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:47.568173+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Carved in a putrid jade, the color of disease, this figurine is a bloated humanoid mass of writhing vermin and serpents, all rendered in disgusting detail. The creeping pattern is carved so they seem to move and contort the more one views the figurine. When activated, the effect is amplified to a disgusting or horrifying degree. The figurine can be activated twice per day. If you try to activate it a third time during a day, it dissolves into a puddle of non-[magical](link_trait_1504), putrid glue, causing you to become sickened 3.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** Holding the figurine over your head and speaking one command word causes a wave of nausea in a 20-foot emanation. Each creature in the emanation must succeed at a DC 24 Fortitude save or become sickened 2. You're immune to this effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** Holding the figurine over your head and speaking a different command word causes those around to tremble in fear. Each creature in a 20-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 24 Will save or become frightened 3. You're immune to this effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12098,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Horrid Figurine","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2410292548939842","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4726","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:47.568173+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Carved in a putrid jade, the color of disease, this figurine is a bloated humanoid mass of writhing vermin and serpents, all rendered in disgusting detail. The creeping pattern is carved so they seem to move and contort the more one views the figurine. When activated, the effect is amplified to a disgusting or horrifying degree. The figurine can be activated twice per day. If you try to activate it a third time during a day, it dissolves into a puddle of non-[magical](link_trait_1504), putrid glue, causing you to become sickened 3.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** Holding the figurine over your head and speaking one command word causes a wave of nausea in a 20-foot emanation. Each creature in the emanation must succeed at a DC 24 Fortitude save or become sickened 2. You're immune to this effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** Holding the figurine over your head and speaking a different command word causes those around to tremble in fear. Each creature in a 20-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 24 Will save or become frightened 3. You're immune to this effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12099,"type":"item","before":{"id":12099,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Hovering Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8695715162105895","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4619","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:48.200476+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA foamy, cloudy liquid, [hovering potion](link_item_12099) enables you to defy gravity for 5 minutes. By default, the potion causes you to float several inches off the ground. If you take a [Stride](link_action_19855) action, you can move 10 feet up or down in the air. You can instead [Climb](link_action_19612) at your full Speed or [Stride](link_action_19855) to move along a horizontal surface at half your Speed. The GM determines which surfaces can be climbed or moved across this way. If you fall while this potion is in effect, you can use the [Arrest a Fall](link_action_19606) reaction as if you had a fly Speed. If you have a fly Speed, you remain airborne at the end of your turn, even if you didn't use a [Fly](link_action_19721) action this round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12099,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Hovering Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8695715162105895","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4619","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:48.200476+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA foamy, cloudy liquid, [hovering potion](link_item_12099) enables you to defy gravity for 5 minutes. By default, the potion causes you to float several inches off the ground. If you take a [Stride](link_action_19855) action, you can move 10 feet up or down in the air. You can instead [Climb](link_action_19612) at your full Speed or [Stride](link_action_19855) to move along a horizontal surface at half your Speed. The GM determines which surfaces can be climbed or moved across this way. If you fall while this potion is in effect, you can use the [Arrest a Fall](link_action_19606) reaction as if you had a fly Speed. If you have a fly Speed, you remain airborne at the end of your turn, even if you didn't use a [Fly](link_action_19721) action this round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12100,"type":"item","before":{"id":12100,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gnawbone Toxin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"210775308836556","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":235},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1566,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2005","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"69"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:49.210014+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nMade from the ground bones of [ghouls](link_trait_2447) or other cannibalistic creatures processed into a green-gray paste, [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) imparts an insatiable desire to consume the flesh of intelligent creatures. If the victim eats at least a mouthful of [humanoid](link_trait_2399) flesh, it ignores the enfeebled condition from [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) for 1 minute. Victims under the effect of [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) regain only half as many Hit Points from [healing](link_trait_1442) effects unless they’ve eaten at least a mouthful of [humanoid](link_trait_2399) flesh in the last minute.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 30 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 minute; **Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** enfeebled 2 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** enfeebled 3 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** enfeebled 4 (1d4 minutes)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":12100,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Gnawbone Toxin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"210775308836556","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":235},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1566,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2005","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"69"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:49.210014+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nMade from the ground bones of [ghouls](link_trait_2447) or other cannibalistic creatures processed into a green-gray paste, [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) imparts an insatiable desire to consume the flesh of intelligent creatures. If the victim eats at least a mouthful of [humanoid](link_trait_2399) flesh, it ignores the enfeebled condition from [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) for 1 minute. Victims under the effect of [gnawbone toxin](link_item_12100) regain only half as many Hit Points from [healing](link_trait_1442) effects unless they’ve eaten at least a mouthful of [humanoid](link_trait_2399) flesh in the last minute.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 30 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 minute; **Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** enfeebled 2 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** enfeebled 3 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** enfeebled 4 (1d4 minutes)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12101,"type":"item","before":{"id":12101,"bulk":"0","name":"Hungering Maw","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7995275057604901","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2200},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4642","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:49.754417+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You attempt a saving throw against a [possession](link_trait_2133) effect; **Requirements** You are a master in Will saves\n\nA shining onyx gemstone clutched in a pair of black steel jaws, this pendant is a potent defense against hostile spirits and other beings who commandeer the bodies of others. When you Activate it, you gain a +4 item bonus to your saving throw against the triggering effect. If your result prevents you from being possessed, the creature that attempted to possess you is subject to a DC 37 *[seize soul](link_spell_4823)* spell, which can trap it in the [talisman](link_trait_1544) as if it had recently died. The [talisman](link_trait_1544)'s magic is exhausted after use, but a soul trapped this way remains imprisoned inside, as detailed in the spell description. Starting at the end of its next turn, the trapped creature gets a new save to end the effect at the end of each of its turns.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12101,"bulk":"0","name":"Hungering Maw","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7995275057604901","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2200},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4642","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:49.754417+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You attempt a saving throw against a [possession](link_trait_2133) effect; **Requirements** You are a master in Will saves\n\nA shining onyx gemstone clutched in a pair of black steel jaws, this pendant is a potent defense against hostile spirits and other beings who commandeer the bodies of others. When you Activate it, you gain a +4 item bonus to your saving throw against the triggering effect. If your result prevents you from being possessed, the creature that attempted to possess you is subject to a DC 37 *[seize soul](link_spell_4823)* spell, which can trap it in the [talisman](link_trait_1544) as if it had recently died. The [talisman](link_trait_1544)'s magic is exhausted after use, but a soul trapped this way remains imprisoned inside, as detailed in the spell description. Starting at the end of its next turn, the trapped creature gets a new save to end the effect at the end of each of its turns.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12102,"type":"item","before":{"id":12102,"bulk":"0","name":"Hunter's Arrowhead","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7121573667149022","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4875","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"153"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":["attack-roll","survival"],"predicate":["hunted-prey"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:50.350645+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8bf0697b-e53b-4381-b5fb-9959913cd2e0","data":{"text":"against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with Hunt Prey. ","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"SKILL_SURVIVAL"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"0e5a3efe-a002-4da1-a8f7-222b5be57baf","data":{"text":"against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with Hunt Prey. ","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"ATTACK_ROLLS_BONUS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A [hunter's arrowhead](link_item_12102) is meant to be worn as a charm, such as a pendant, or carried in a pocket or quiver. The arrowhead is etched with images sacred to the [elven](link_trait_1348) god Ketephys. While you wear or carry the arrowhead, it infuses you with great skill at hunting, and you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks and attack rolls against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with [Hunt Prey](link_feat_19728). A [hunter's arrowhead](link_item_12102) is also a religious symbol of Ketephys.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You would miss with an attack made with a bow; **Effect** You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll, possibly turning a miss into a hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12102,"bulk":"0","name":"Hunter's Arrowhead","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7121573667149022","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4875","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"153"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":["attack-roll","survival"],"predicate":["hunted-prey"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:50.350645+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8bf0697b-e53b-4381-b5fb-9959913cd2e0","data":{"text":"against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with Hunt Prey. ","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"SKILL_SURVIVAL"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"0e5a3efe-a002-4da1-a8f7-222b5be57baf","data":{"text":"against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with Hunt Prey. ","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"ATTACK_ROLLS_BONUS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A [hunter's arrowhead](link_item_12102) is meant to be worn as a charm, such as a pendant, or carried in a pocket or quiver. The arrowhead is etched with images sacred to the [elven](link_trait_1348) god Ketephys. While you wear or carry the arrowhead, it infuses you with great skill at hunting, and you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks and attack rolls against any creature you've currently designated as your prey with [Hunt Prey](link_feat_19728). A [hunter's arrowhead](link_item_12102) is also a religious symbol of Ketephys.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You would miss with an attack made with a bow; **Effect** You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your attack roll, possibly turning a miss into a hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12103,"type":"item","before":{"id":12103,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Illuminated Folio","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7615091342617330","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4200},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4713","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"112"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:51.119919+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The pages of this part-spellbook, part-bestiary are illustrated with all manner of creatures, [magical](link_trait_1504) and mundane. The illustrations shift and move around the page when examined.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a [summon](link_trait_3070) spell prepared from this grimoire, you summon creatures from the _[illuminated folio](link_item_12103)_ rather than their usual source. These summoned creatures appear as living illustrations, granting them resistance to physical damage equal to half their level and weakness 5 to [fire](link_trait_1542) and to any ability with the [water](link_trait_1584) trait. They can also fold themselves up to pass through spaces only an inch or so wide as part of their movement.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12103,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Illuminated Folio","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7615091342617330","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4200},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4713","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"112"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:51.119919+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The pages of this part-spellbook, part-bestiary are illustrated with all manner of creatures, [magical](link_trait_1504) and mundane. The illustrations shift and move around the page when examined.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to cast a [summon](link_trait_3070) spell prepared from this grimoire, you summon creatures from the _[illuminated folio](link_item_12103)_ rather than their usual source. These summoned creatures appear as living illustrations, granting them resistance to physical damage equal to half their level and weakness 5 to [fire](link_trait_1542) and to any ability with the [water](link_trait_1584) trait. They can also fold themselves up to pass through spaces only an inch or so wide as part of their movement.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12104,"type":"item","before":{"id":12104,"bulk":"5","name":"Immortal Bastion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8298670509031158","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1594,2865,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6973,"name":"Fortification (Greater)"}],"resilient":2},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4380","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"bastion-plate","check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:52.757443+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This impressive _[+3](link_item_6721) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [greater fortification](link_item_6973) [bastion plate](link_item_11740)_ is built like an impregnable castle, with multiple layers of defense and no weak points. When you activate the armor's [deflect melee](link_trait_2864) trait, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against melee attacks instead of +1, and you gain 10 temporary Hit Points that last until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You are reduced to 0 Hit Points or would die from a [death](link_trait_1904) effect; **Effect** You drop to 1 Hit Point instead of being reduced to 0 HP or dying, and you gain 100 temporary Hit Points that last until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You would gain or increase the doomed or wounded condition; **Effect** You avoid gaining or increasing the condition. If the triggering effect imposes both doomed and wounded, choose only one to prevent. This doesn't remove either of the conditions if you already have them, nor does it prevent the same triggering effect from giving or increasing the prevented condition later.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12104,"bulk":"5","name":"Immortal Bastion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8298670509031158","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1594,2865,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6973,"name":"Fortification (Greater)"}],"resilient":2},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4380","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"15"},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"bastion-plate","check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:52.757443+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This impressive _[+3](link_item_6721) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [greater fortification](link_item_6973) [bastion plate](link_item_11740)_ is built like an impregnable castle, with multiple layers of defense and no weak points. When you activate the armor's [deflect melee](link_trait_2864) trait, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to AC against melee attacks instead of +1, and you gain 10 temporary Hit Points that last until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You are reduced to 0 Hit Points or would die from a [death](link_trait_1904) effect; **Effect** You drop to 1 Hit Point instead of being reduced to 0 HP or dying, and you gain 100 temporary Hit Points that last until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You would gain or increase the doomed or wounded condition; **Effect** You avoid gaining or increasing the condition. If the triggering effect imposes both doomed and wounded, choose only one to prevent. This doesn't remove either of the conditions if you already have them, nor does it prevent the same triggering effect from giving or increasing the prevented condition later.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12105,"type":"item","before":{"id":12105,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Immovable Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2156578209461492","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4620","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:53.733723+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you drink the thick, slate-colored [immovable potion](link_item_12105), you become anchored in place, even defying gravity, rendering you immobilized for 1 minute or until you [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. While you are immobilized this way, the DC to move you from your place, including knocking you prone, is 40.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12105,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Immovable Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2156578209461492","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4620","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:53.733723+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nWhen you drink the thick, slate-colored [immovable potion](link_item_12105), you become anchored in place, even defying gravity, rendering you immobilized for 1 minute or until you [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. While you are immobilized this way, the DC to move you from your place, including knocking you prone, is 40.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12106,"type":"item","before":{"id":12106,"bulk":"0","name":"Immovable","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4183796929585080","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"etched-onto-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4365","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:54.281288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune utilizes [magical](link_trait_1504) principles to manipulate gravity and turn you into an immovable object.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** Your armor anchors you in place, even defying gravity, rendering you immobilized until you [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the Activation. While you're immobilized in this way, you can be moved only if a creature succeeds at a DC 40 Athletics check to [Force Open](link_action_19722) your armor. You can also be moved if 8,000 pounds of pressure are placed upon you, though this is likely fatal.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12106,"bulk":"0","name":"Immovable","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4183796929585080","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1800},"usage":"etched-onto-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4365","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"12"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:54.281288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune utilizes [magical](link_trait_1504) principles to manipulate gravity and turn you into an immovable object.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** Your armor anchors you in place, even defying gravity, rendering you immobilized until you [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the Activation. While you're immobilized in this way, you can be moved only if a creature succeeds at a DC 40 Athletics check to [Force Open](link_action_19722) your armor. You can also be moved if 8,000 pounds of pressure are placed upon you, though this is likely fatal.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12107,"type":"item","before":{"id":12107,"bulk":"0","name":"Imp Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4343083553298592","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":24},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4585","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:54.815926+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nThis black-and-red ammunition contains an egg-shaped capsule. When an activated [imp shot](link_item_12107) hits, the capsule cracks open and releases a manifestation that resembles a Tiny [imp](link_creature_10147) that can't act in any way or provide benefits outside those described here. If the [Strike](link_action_19856) misses the target, the [imp](link_creature_10147) appears, makes a rude gesture at you, and vanishes in a puff of sulfuric smoke. On a hit, though, the [imp](link_creature_10147) harries the target for up to 1 minute, remaining in the target's space, slapping, nipping, hurling insults, and moving with the target as it moves. A creature harried by the [imp](link_creature_10147) is off-guard and takes a –2 circumstance penalty to attack rolls and skill checks. At the start of your turn on each round while the [imp](link_creature_10147) is active, you must attempt a DC 11 flat check. On a failure, the [imp](link_creature_10147) makes a final vulgar gesture at the target and vanishes in a cloud of brimstone.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12107,"bulk":"0","name":"Imp Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4343083553298592","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":24},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4585","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:54.815926+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nThis black-and-red ammunition contains an egg-shaped capsule. When an activated [imp shot](link_item_12107) hits, the capsule cracks open and releases a manifestation that resembles a Tiny [imp](link_creature_10147) that can't act in any way or provide benefits outside those described here. If the [Strike](link_action_19856) misses the target, the [imp](link_creature_10147) appears, makes a rude gesture at you, and vanishes in a puff of sulfuric smoke. On a hit, though, the [imp](link_creature_10147) harries the target for up to 1 minute, remaining in the target's space, slapping, nipping, hurling insults, and moving with the target as it moves. A creature harried by the [imp](link_creature_10147) is off-guard and takes a –2 circumstance penalty to attack rolls and skill checks. At the start of your turn on each round while the [imp](link_creature_10147) is active, you must attempt a DC 11 flat check. On a failure, the [imp](link_creature_10147) makes a final vulgar gesture at the target and vanishes in a cloud of brimstone.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12108,"type":"item","before":{"id":12108,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Implosion Dust (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6153806579575476","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4100},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4475","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:53:09.131Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:55.407647+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed in a packet so it can be released in a pressurized puff, [implosion dust](link_item_12108) causes amorphous creatures to compress and shrink by hardening and even evaporating the liquid components of their physical forms. It's effective at weakening [water elementals](link_trait_1584), [air elementals](link_trait_1524), [ooze](link_trait_2448), and other creatures the GM determines are similarly amorphous, which can even include particularly gelatinous [aberrations](link_trait_2427). You release the dust toward one creature within 5 feet of you, which must attempt a DC 38 Fortitude saving throw. The target must repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. [Implosion dust](link_item_12108) functions for up to 6 rounds. It then becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Critical Success** The dust becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Success** The target increases in size one step, up to its normal size. If it's at its normal size after the increase, the effect ends.\n\n**Failure** The target decreases in size one step, to a minimum of Tiny. The reach of each of its [Strikes](link_action_19856) decreases by 5 feet, to a minimum of 5 feet if the creature is Small or larger, or a minimum of 0 feet if the creature is Tiny. Shrinking also imposes a status penalty to the creature's physical melee damage. This penalty is –2 for every step lower than its normal size the creature is.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target decreases in size by two steps.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12108,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Implosion Dust (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6153806579575476","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4100},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4475","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T09:53:09.131Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:55.407647+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed in a packet so it can be released in a pressurized puff, [implosion dust](link_item_12108) causes amorphous creatures to compress and shrink by hardening and even evaporating the liquid components of their physical forms. It's effective at weakening [water elementals](link_trait_1584), [air elementals](link_trait_1524), [ooze](link_trait_2448), and other creatures the GM determines are similarly amorphous, which can even include particularly gelatinous [aberrations](link_trait_2427). You release the dust toward one creature within 5 feet of you, which must attempt a DC 38 Fortitude saving throw. The target must repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. [Implosion dust](link_item_12108) functions for up to 6 rounds. It then becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Critical Success** The dust becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Success** The target increases in size one step, up to its normal size. If it's at its normal size after the increase, the effect ends.\n\n**Failure** The target decreases in size one step, to a minimum of Tiny. The reach of each of its [Strikes](link_action_19856) decreases by 5 feet, to a minimum of 5 feet if the creature is Small or larger, or a minimum of 0 feet if the creature is Tiny. Shrinking also imposes a status penalty to the creature's physical melee damage. This penalty is –2 for every step lower than its normal size the creature is.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target decreases in size by two steps.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12109,"type":"item","before":{"id":12109,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Implosion Dust (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5487104025291630","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":40},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4475","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"54"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:56.066553+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed in a packet so it can be released in a pressurized puff, [implosion dust](link_item_12109) causes amorphous creatures to compress and shrink by hardening and even evaporating the liquid components of their physical forms. It's effective at weakening [water elementals](link_trait_1584), [air elementals](link_trait_1524), [oozes](link_trait_2448), and other creatures the GM determines are similarly amorphous, which can even include particularly gelatinous [aberrations](link_tra