px?ID=4475","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:04:13.455Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:56.665603+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed in a packet so it can be released in a pressurized puff, [implosion dust](link_item_12110) causes amorphous creatures to compress and shrink by hardening and even evaporating the liquid components of their physical forms. It's effective at weakening [water](link_trait_1584) elementals, [air](link_trait_1524) elementals, [ooze](link_trait_2448), and other creatures the GM determines are similarly amorphous, which can even include particularly gelatinous [aberration](link_trait_2427). You release the dust toward one creature within 5 feet of you, which must attempt a DC 29 Fortitude saving throw. The target must repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. [Implosion dust](link_item_12110) functions for up to 6 rounds. It then becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Critical Success** The dust becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Success** The target increases in size one step, up to its normal size. If it's at its normal size after the increase, the effect ends.\n\n**Failure** The target decreases in size one step, to a minimum of Tiny. The reach of each of its [Strikes](link_action_19856) decreases by 5 feet, to a minimum of 5 feet if the creature is Small or larger, or a minimum of 0 feet if the creature is Tiny. Shrinking also imposes a status penalty to the creature's physical melee damage. This penalty is –2 for every step lower than its normal size the creature is.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target decreases in size by two steps.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12110,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Implosion Dust (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7748244246371192","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":370},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4475","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:04:13.455Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:56.665603+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSealed in a packet so it can be released in a pressurized puff, [implosion dust](link_item_12110) causes amorphous creatures to compress and shrink by hardening and even evaporating the liquid components of their physical forms. It's effective at weakening [water](link_trait_1584) elementals, [air](link_trait_1524) elementals, [ooze](link_trait_2448), and other creatures the GM determines are similarly amorphous, which can even include particularly gelatinous [aberration](link_trait_2427). You release the dust toward one creature within 5 feet of you, which must attempt a DC 29 Fortitude saving throw. The target must repeat the saving throw at the end of each of its turns. [Implosion dust](link_item_12110) functions for up to 6 rounds. It then becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Critical Success** The dust becomes inert, and the creature returns to its normal size.\n\n**Success** The target increases in size one step, up to its normal size. If it's at its normal size after the increase, the effect ends.\n\n**Failure** The target decreases in size one step, to a minimum of Tiny. The reach of each of its [Strikes](link_action_19856) decreases by 5 feet, to a minimum of 5 feet if the creature is Small or larger, or a minimum of 0 feet if the creature is Tiny. Shrinking also imposes a status penalty to the creature's physical melee damage. This penalty is –2 for every step lower than its normal size the creature is.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target decreases in size by two steps.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12111,"type":"item","before":{"id":12111,"bulk":"0","name":"Impossible","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1218332911535989","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4401","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:57.270352+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune makes a weapon capable of impossible offense and defense. The etched weapon is immune to *[dispel magic](link_spell_4572)* and similar effects that could [counteract](link_action_27519) its magic. If it's a ranged weapon or [thrown](link_trait_1575) weapon, its range increment is doubled.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [teleportation](link_trait_1470)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You and the weapon flash to a perfect attacking position, then return to where you started. Make a [Strike](link_action_19856) with the etched weapon against one creature you can see, even if the target is beyond the weapon's reach or range. On this [Strike](link_action_19856), ignore any circumstance penalty, status penalty, and range increment penalty.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12111,"bulk":"0","name":"Impossible","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1218332911535989","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4401","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:57.270352+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune makes a weapon capable of impossible offense and defense. The etched weapon is immune to *[dispel magic](link_spell_4572)* and similar effects that could [counteract](link_action_27519) its magic. If it's a ranged weapon or [thrown](link_trait_1575) weapon, its range increment is doubled.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [teleportation](link_trait_1470)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You and the weapon flash to a perfect attacking position, then return to where you started. Make a [Strike](link_action_19856) with the etched weapon against one creature you can see, even if the target is beyond the weapon's reach or range. On this [Strike](link_action_19856), ignore any circumstance penalty, status penalty, and range increment penalty.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12112,"type":"item","before":{"id":12112,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Injection Reservoir","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1634166285064713","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"applied-to-a-non-injection-melee-weapon-piercing-damage","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2858,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4510","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:57.974802+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This reservoir and spring-loaded needle can be attached to a weapon to let it inject deadly [poisons](link_trait_1476). Additionally, the reservoir can be filled with an [injury](link_trait_1564) [poison](link_trait_1476). Immediately after a successful attack with the adjusted weapon, you can inject the target with the loaded [poison](link_trait_1476) by activating the reservoir with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. Refilling the reservoir with a new [poison](link_trait_1476) requires 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions and uses both hands.\n\nAdding an [injection reservoir](link_item_12112) to a weapon throws off its balance, causing the multiple attack penalty with the weapon to be one greater than usual (usually –6 on a second attack and –11 on a third; or –5 and –10 with an [agile](link_trait_1569) weapon).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12112,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Injection Reservoir","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1634166285064713","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"applied-to-a-non-injection-melee-weapon-piercing-damage","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2858,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4510","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"63"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:57.974802+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This reservoir and spring-loaded needle can be attached to a weapon to let it inject deadly [poisons](link_trait_1476). Additionally, the reservoir can be filled with an [injury](link_trait_1564) [poison](link_trait_1476). Immediately after a successful attack with the adjusted weapon, you can inject the target with the loaded [poison](link_trait_1476) by activating the reservoir with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. Refilling the reservoir with a new [poison](link_trait_1476) requires 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions and uses both hands.\n\nAdding an [injection reservoir](link_item_12112) to a weapon throws off its balance, causing the multiple attack penalty with the weapon to be one greater than usual (usually –6 on a second attack and –11 on a third; or –5 and –10 with an [agile](link_trait_1569) weapon).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12113,"type":"item","before":{"id":12113,"bulk":"0","name":"Inquisitive Quill","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4884879231142537","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand-or-free-standing","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4925","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:58.5403+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +11; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech (five languages)\n\n**Skills** Arcana +12, Nature +9, Occultism +10, Religion +9, Scribing Lore +12, Society +10\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +1\n\n**Will** +11\n\nA colorful feather adorns an _[inquisitive quill](link_item_12113)_, which never runs out of ink. Essentially a Tiny [construct](link_trait_2410), an _[inquisitive quill](link_item_12113)_ can stand on its own when given a surface, balancing as it writes or stands. (Drawing a line gives it an effective Speed of 5 feet.) It has strong curiosity, eagerly writing any information offered to it, often acting as a scribe for its partner. The quill copies text and drawings it can see or transcribes dictation it hears. It writes at a rate that rivals that of an expert scribe.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12113,"bulk":"0","name":"Inquisitive Quill","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4884879231142537","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand-or-free-standing","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4925","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"194"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:58.5403+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +11; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech (five languages)\n\n**Skills** Arcana +12, Nature +9, Occultism +10, Religion +9, Scribing Lore +12, Society +10\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +1\n\n**Will** +11\n\nA colorful feather adorns an _[inquisitive quill](link_item_12113)_, which never runs out of ink. Essentially a Tiny [construct](link_trait_2410), an _[inquisitive quill](link_item_12113)_ can stand on its own when given a surface, balancing as it writes or stands. (Drawing a line gives it an effective Speed of 5 feet.) It has strong curiosity, eagerly writing any information offered to it, often acting as a scribe for its partner. The quill copies text and drawings it can see or transcribes dictation it hears. It writes at a rate that rivals that of an expert scribe.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12114,"type":"item","before":{"id":12114,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Insight Coffee (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6620091597835501","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":7500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4453","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:59.090449+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA popular choice for [investigators](link_class_110) studying alchemy, [insight coffee](link_item_12114) is infused with [alchemical](link_trait_1529) flavoring during percolation. For 1 hour after you drink an [insight coffee](link_item_12114), you use d8s instead of d6s for your extra damage from the [strategic strike](link_class-feature_33010) class feature, if you have it. You also gain a +4 item bonus to checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) with a skill determined by the blend chosen when the item is crafted.\n\n* **Double Coffee** Religion\n* **Hazelnut** Nature\n* **Mocha** Arcana\n* **Vanilla** Society\n* **Pumpkin Spice** Occultism\n* **Toffee** Medicine","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12114,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Insight Coffee (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6620091597835501","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":7500},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4453","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:18:59.090449+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA popular choice for [investigators](link_class_110) studying alchemy, [insight coffee](link_item_12114) is infused with [alchemical](link_trait_1529) flavoring during percolation. For 1 hour after you drink an [insight coffee](link_item_12114), you use d8s instead of d6s for your extra damage from the [strategic strike](link_class-feature_33010) class feature, if you have it. You also gain a +4 item bonus to checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) with a skill determined by the blend chosen when the item is crafted.\n\n* **Double Coffee** Religion\n* **Hazelnut** Nature\n* **Mocha** Arcana\n* **Vanilla** Society\n* **Pumpkin Spic