ull,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:00.268231+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA popular choice for [investigators](link_class_110) studying alchemy, [insight coffee](link_item_12116) is infused with [alchemical](link_trait_1529) flavoring during percolation. For 1 hour after you drink an [insight coffee](link_item_12116), you use d8s instead of d6s for your extra damage from the [strategic strike](link_class-feature_33010) class feature, if you have it. You also gain a +3 item bonus to checks to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) with a skill determined by the blend chosen when the item is crafted.\n\n* **Double Coffee** Religion\n* **Hazelnut** Nature\n* **Mocha** Arcana\n* **Vanilla** Society\n* **Pumpkin Spice** Occultism\n* **Toffee** Medicine","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12117,"type":"item","before":{"id":12117,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Animal)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3173485968960206","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:01.092245+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12117)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. Your bestial instincts take over, granting you greater ferocity. You can [Stride](link_action_19855) as part of the activation, and you gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [rage](link_feat_31184). Until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184), you deal 3 additional damage with your animal's [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks, and those [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks gain the [deadly d8](link_trait_1852) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12117,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Animal)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3173485968960206","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:01.092245+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12117)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. Your bestial instincts take over, granting you greater ferocity. You can [Stride](link_action_19855) as part of the activation, and you gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [rage](link_feat_31184). Until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184), you deal 3 additional damage with your animal's [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks, and those [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attacks gain the [deadly d8](link_trait_1852) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12118,"type":"item","before":{"id":12118,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Dragon)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3043168735418845","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:01.694304+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12118)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. The might of dragons surrounds you in the form of dancing flames, poisonous wisps, or another appropriate manifestation. Until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184), adjacent creatures that hit you with a melee attack, as well as creatures that touch you or hit you with an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack, take 2d6 damage each time they do. The damage type is that of your instinct's dragon breath.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12118,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Dragon)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3043168735418845","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:01.694304+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12118)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. The might of dragons surrounds you in the form of dancing flames, poisonous wisps, or another appropriate manifestation. Until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184), adjacent creatures that hit you with a melee attack, as well as creatures that touch you or hit you with an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack, take 2d6 damage each time they do. The damage type is that of your instinct's dragon breath.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12119,"type":"item","before":{"id":12119,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Fury)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6043174096370110","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:02.536068+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12119)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. Your boundless fury allows you push past your natural limits, moving with unmatched speed. You become quickened until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184). You can use your extra action only to [Stride](link_action_19855) or [Strike](link_action_19856).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12119,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Fury)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6043174096370110","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken