(or by 10 feet if you were Tiny). You deal 2 additional damage when using your larger weapon. Also, when you [Stride](link_action_19855) along the ground, you can shatter the earth with your footfalls, and any squares you move through become difficult terrain. You ignore the difficult terrain you create. The ground reverts to normal when your [rage](link_feat_31184) ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12120,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Giant)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8264728102923861","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:03.121328+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12120)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. If you have the space to do so and aren't already, you become Large. Your equipment grows with you but returns to its natural size if removed. Increase your reach by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if you were Tiny). You deal 2 additional damage when using your larger weapon. Also, when you [Stride](link_action_19855) along the ground, you can shatter the earth with your footfalls, and any squares you move through become difficult terrain. You ignore the difficult terrain you create. The ground reverts to normal when your [rage](link_feat_31184) ends.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12121,"type":"item","before":{"id":12121,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Spirit)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7519074557057995","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:03.830114+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An _[instinct crown](link_item_12121)_ is a [magical](link_trait_1504) headpiece imbued with the essence of instincts that barbarians draw upon in combat. Each crown is fashioned to represent the instinct it's tied to, such as a wolf's head for an [animal instinct crown](link_item_12117) or a simple helmet with [Jotun](link_language_88) runes for a _[giant instinct crown](link_item_12120)_. When worn, the crown allows you to tap further into your instincts, granting you even greater benefits if the crown's essence matches your instinct. You must be able to [Rage](link_feat_31184) to use the crown's activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You roll initiative; **Requirements** You have [quick-tempered](link_class-feature_31201) and meet its requirements\n\n**Effect** You use [Quick-Tempered](link_feat_31200) and gain 10 additional temporary Hit Points from your [Rage](link_feat_31184).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. You take on the partial form of a spirit, becoming somewhat [incorporeal](link_trait_2424). Your raging resistance applies to all physical damage and [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, although you halve this resistance against [magical](link_trait_1504) attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12121,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Instinct Crown (Spirit)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7519074557057995","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4870","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"