rait_1432), [rage](link_trait_1455))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** You're raging, and the crown's instinct matches your [barbarian](link_class_108) instinct\n\n**Effect** You draw upon your instinct to gain a boon. Your body fights off the effects of magic with even greater effect. Until the end of your [rage](link_feat_31184), when you attempt a saving throw against magic, roll twice and take the higher result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. Also, your raging resistance applies to all magic traditions while you [rage](link_feat_31184).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12123,"type":"item","before":{"id":12123,"bulk":"0","name":"Inventor's Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5889773375118932","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"affixed to an innovation","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4570","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:05.085134+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You critically fail an action with the [unstable](link_trait_3071) trait\n\nSome [inventors](link_class_37) in Tian Xia put fried snacks near their innovations, a charm to make devices behave as intended. The practice rubbed off on other [inventors](link_class_37), who replaced the food with a drawing on an _[inventor's fulu](link_item_12123)_. When you Activate the fulu, your critical failure becomes a failure, and you can spend just 1 minute to return your innovation to full functionality. The fulu then burns up, and its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12123,"bulk":"0","name":"Inventor's Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5889773375118932","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"affixed to an innovation","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4570","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:05.085134+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You critically fail an action with the [unstable](link_trait_3071) trait\n\nSome [inventors](link_class_37) in Tian Xia put fried snacks near their innovations, a charm to make devices behave as intended. The practice rubbed off on other [inventors](link_class_37), who replaced the food with a drawing on an _[inventor's fulu](link_item_12123)_. When you Activate the fulu, your critical failure becomes a failure, and you can spend just 1 minute to return your innovation to full functionality. The fulu then burns up, and its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12124,"type":"item","before":{"id":12124,"bulk":"1","name":"Jiu Huan Dao","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1342382855357229","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"sp":9},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1562],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.asp