efore":{"id":12128,"bulk":"0","name":"Journeybread (Power)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6115534149489549","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4454","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:08.428787+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Journeybread](link_item_12129) contains a mix of fruits, nuts, and grains with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) boost. Eating one [journeybread](link_item_12129) provides all the food and water you need for a day. If you subsist on nothing else for a week, you become temporarily immune to [journeybread](link_item_12129) until you eat real food and drink water normally for 24 hours.\n\nIn addition to the benefits of [journeybread](link_item_12129), [power journeybread](link_item_12128) grants you a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Climb](link_action_19612), [Force Open](link_action_19722), and [Swim](link_action_19859), and to Fortitude saving throws against being sickened. The number of minutes you can [Hustle](link_action_21201) changes to your Constitution modifier × 20. These benefits last for 4 hours.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12128,"bulk":"0","name":"Journeybread (Power)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6115534149489549","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":15},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4454","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:08.428787+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Journeybread](link_item_12129) contains a mix of fruits, nuts, and grains with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) boost. Eating one [journeybread](link_item_12129) provides all the food and water you need for a day. If you subsist on nothing else for a week, you become temporarily immune to [journeybread](link_item_12129) until you eat real food and drink water normally for 24 hours.\n\nIn addition to the benefits of [journeybread](link_item_12129), [power journeybread](link_item_12128) grants you a +1 item bonus to Athletics checks to [Climb](link_action_19612), [Force Open](link_action_19722), and [Swim](link_action_19859), and to Fortitude saving throws against being sickened. The number of minutes you can [Hustle](link_action_21201) changes to your Constitution modifier × 20. These benefits last for 4 hours.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12129,"type":"item","before":{"id":12129,"bulk":"0","name":"Journeybread","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4700928018438963","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4454","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:08.966939+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Journeybread](link_item_12129) contains a mix of fruits, nuts, and grains with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) boost. Eating one [journeybread](link_item_12129) provides all the food and water you need for a day. If you subsist on nothing else for a week, you become temporarily immune to [journeybread](link_item_12129) until you eat real food and drink water normally for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12129,"bulk":"0","name":"Journeybread","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4700928018438963","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4454","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:08.966939+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Journeybread](link_item_12129) contains a mix of fruits, nuts, and grains with an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) boost. Eating one [journeybread](link_item_12129) provides all the food and water you need for a day. If you subsist on nothing else for a week, you become temporarily immune to [journeybread](link_item_12129) until you eat real food and drink water normally for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12130,"type":"item","before":{"id":12130,"bulk":"0","name":"Judgment Thurible (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1486052689720314","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":14000},"usage":"affixed-to-armor-or-a-weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2232","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"126"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":35}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:09.569695+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The golden religious symbol on the top of this spherical incense holder shifts its form to match the faith of its bearer. You gain no benefit from a [judgment thurible](link_item_12130) if you don't worship a deity. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 35.\n\n**Armor** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the thurible casts 3rd-rank *[protection](link_spell_4782)* on you, with a duration of 1 round.\n\n**Weapon** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the weapon gains a rune that lasts until the end of your next turn. It gains the [holy rune](link_item_7040) if your deity allows [holy](link_trait_1630) sanctification or the [unholy rune](link_item_7911) if your deity allows [unholy](link_trait_1846) sanctification. If your deity allows both, you can choose which rune the weapon gains. If your deity allows neither, your weapon doesn't gain a rune.\n\nThe additional damage from the rune granted by the thurible is 2d6.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You cast *[divine lance](link_spell_4578)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast 6th-rank *[divine wrath](link_spell_4579)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast *[divine decree](link_spell_4575)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,