You take a long swig on the jug and then [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about a creature you can see, with a +2 circumstance bonus to the check. If you fail but don't critically fail this check, you get a success instead. You're then stupefied 1 for 3 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12133,"bulk":"0","name":"Jug of Fond Remembrance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1907653507143413","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4727","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"diplomacy"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:11.340185+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This large jug always seems to contain just enough of the holder's favorite alcohol to share with a friend. As long as you're holding the jug, you gain a +1 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks. If you share a sip of the liquor from the jug with a creature, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your next Diplomacy check to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) or [Request](link_action_19844) something from that creature any time within the next month.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You take a long swig on the jug and then [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about a creature you can see, with a +2 circumstance bonus to the check. If you fail but don't critically fail this check, you get a success instead. You're then stupefied 1 for 3 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"dis