ype":"select"}],"description":"A _[jyoti's feather](link_item_12134)_ is a shimmering red-and-gold feather that seems almost metallic, although it's delicate and flexible to the touch. Though most aren't made from true [jyoti](link_creature_11041) feathers, as the reclusive outsiders avoid visitors from the Universe, the creatures' connection to life energy lent these spellhearts their name.\n\n*   **Armor** You gain a +3 item bonus to saving throws against [death](link_trait_1904) effects and [void](link_trait_1485) effects.\n    \n*   **Weapon** The weapon has the [_vitalizing_](link_item_7920) rune while the feather is affixed.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[stabilize](link_spell_4857)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 5th-rank *[vital beacon](link_spell_4935)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[healing well](link_spell_8909)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12134,"bulk":"0","name":"Jyoti's Feather (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8295030687734446","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4100},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1442,1504,2570,1478],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4767","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"126"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:11.862501+00:00","operations":[{"id":"bfbc5dfb-70f1-46d5-a449-d8a6c17f15b2","data":{"title":"What is the spellheart affixed 