 **Effect** You cast *[vital beacon](link_spell_4935)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12137,"type":"item","before":{"id":12137,"bulk":"0","name":"Kaiju Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6792971233907782","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"affixed-to-load-bearing-wall-or-pillar","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4571","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:13.712411+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 week\n\nDespite the name, a [kaiju fulu](link_item_12137) protects a building against damage of all sorts. When an affixed structure no larger than 100 feet × 100 feet and up to 50 feet tall takes damage, the structure is as hard as [standard-grade adamantine](link_item_14880) against that damage and any damage that occurs within 1 hour thereafter. The fulu then crumbles to dust, and its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12137,"bulk":"0","name":"Kaiju Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6792971233907782","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"affixed-to-load-bearing-wall-or-pillar","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4571","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:13.712411+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 week\n\nDespite the name, a [kaiju fulu](link_item_12137) protects a building against damage of all sorts. When an affixed structure no larger than 100 feet × 100 feet and up to 50 feet tall takes damage, the structure is as hard as [standard-grade adamantine](link_item_14880) against that damage and any damage that occurs within 1 hour thereafter. The fulu then crumbles to dust, and its effects end.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12138,"type":"item","before":{"id":12138,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kaldemash's Lament","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5365496003218960","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1841,1686,3073,1459],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":90,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":7682,"name":"Quickstrike"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"force"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4423","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"38"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:14.486346+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Resembling little more than a simple iron pipe with a handle, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ is one of the most well-known star guns in all of Arcadia. Legends state the Crowned Regent Kaldemash helped forge one of the first star guns millennia ago. While the star gun served Kaldemash as a powerful weapon, its most notable achievement was the accidental killing of one of Kaldemash's greatest friends. This death is what caused the regent to recognize the true destructive power of the star guns and led to him developing the Star Code, a set of rules of engagement and proper use of firearms still in use in Arcadia today. Although Kaldemash never named the weapon himself, all legends that mention the weapon refer to it as _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_.\n\nThe legendary weapon is a [+3](link_item_7952) [major striking](link_item_7861) [quickstrike](link_item_7682) advanced firearm with a range increment of 90 feet. It deals 4d6 [force](link_trait_1560) damage (with the [major striking](link_item_7861) rune included) and has the [concealable](link_trait_1841), [concussive](link_trait_3073), and [fatal d10](link_trait_1686) traits. You don't take a penalty when dealing [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) damage with the weapon. Like most star guns, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ uses magic to function and doesn't require ammunition or [black powder](link_item_13495).\n\nIf you use _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ as part of a duel in which all parties are in agreement on the terms, the gun's supernatural instincts help you make the quickest draw. You roll twice and take the higher result on your initiative roll for the duel; this is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. In addition, you can draw _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ as a free action at the start of your turn during the duel. If you attempt to fire the star gun in bad faith at a dueling opponent once they have surrendered, been defeated, or the duel is over, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ flies out of your hand and you can't pick it up, hold it, or wield it for 10 minutes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You target a creature with an attack\n\n**Effect** You adjust the damage that _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ deals before firing. _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_'s damage type changes to either [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [force](link_trait_1560) until you change the type again.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** You leave _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ to fire on its own. You release the star gun and it begins to move independently, flying through the air and firing. You still gain the benefits of the gun's [quickstrike](link_item_7682) rune while it's moving independently. It has a space of 5 feet but doesn't block or impede enemies attempting to move through that space. It always remains within 30 feet of you and intentionally resists being taken or otherwise moved; all attempts to Grab it fail. _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ moves this way for 3 rounds, after which it returns to your hand. If you don't have a free hand to hold it, the gun instead holsters itself on your person.\n\nWhile _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ is moving independently, you can command it to make a [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature as an action, which has the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait. It makes a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) using your attack modifier while wielding it or a +31 bonus, whichever is higher. This attack increases your multiple attack penalty as normal, and the gun uses your multiple attack penalty when determining its attack bonus. Since the star gun is constantly moving and attempting to line up the appropriate shot, creatures it targets are off-guard to the gun's attacks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You unleash a barrage of attacks in an instant. You deal [Strike](link_action_19856) damage to all creatures in a 30-foot cone (DC 45 basic Reflex save). This barrage counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12138,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kaldemash's Lament","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5365496003218960","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1841,1686,3073,1459],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":90,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":7682,"name":"Quickstrike"}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"force"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4423","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"38"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:14.486346+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Resembling little more than a simple iron pipe with a handle, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ is one of the most well-known star guns in all of Arcadia. Legends state the Crowned Regent Kaldemash helped forge one of the first star guns millennia ago. While the star gun served Kaldemash as a powerful weapon, its most notable achievement was the accidental killing of one of Kaldemash's greatest friends. This death is what caused the regent to recognize the true destructive power of the star guns and led to him developing the Star Code, a set of rules of engagement and proper use of firearms still in use in Arcadia today. Although Kaldemash never named the weapon himself, all legends that mention the weapon refer to it as _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_.\n\nThe legendary weapon is a [+3](link_item_7952) [major striking](link_item_7861) [quickstrike](link_item_7682) advanced firearm with a range increment of 90 feet. It deals 4d6 [force](link_trait_1560) damage (with the [major striking](link_item_7861) rune included) and has the [concealable](link_trait_1841), [concussive](link_trait_3073), and [fatal d10](link_trait_1686) traits. You don't take a penalty when dealing [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) damage with the weapon. Like most star guns, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ uses magic to function and doesn't require ammunition or [black powder](link_item_13495).\n\nIf you use _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ as part of a duel in which all parties are in agreement on the terms, the gun's supernatural instincts help you make the quickest draw. You roll twice and take the higher result on your initiative roll for the duel; this is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. In addition, you can draw _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ as a free action at the start of your turn during the duel. If you attempt to fire the star gun in bad faith at a dueling opponent once they have surrendered, been defeated, or the duel is over, _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ flies out of your hand and you can't pick it up, hold it, or wield it for 10 minutes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You target a creature with an attack\n\n**Effect** You adjust the damage that _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ deals before firing. _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_'s damage type changes to either [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [force](link_trait_1560) until you change the type again.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** You leave _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ to fire on its own. You release the star gun and it begins to move independently, flying through the air and firing. You still gain the benefits of the gun's [quickstrike](link_item_7682) rune while it's moving independently. It has a space of 5 feet but doesn't block or impede enemies attempting to move through that space. It always remains within 30 feet of you and intentionally resists being taken or otherwise moved; all attempts to Grab it fail. _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ moves this way for 3 rounds, after which it returns to your hand. If you don't have a free hand to hold it, the gun instead holsters itself on your person.\n\nWhile _[Kaldemash's Lament](link_item_12138)_ is moving independently, you can command it to make a [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature as an action, which has the [concentrate](link_trait_1432) trait. It makes a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) using your attack modifier while wielding it or a +31 bonus, whichever is higher. This attack increases your multiple attack penalty as normal, and the gun uses your multiple attack penalty when determining its attack bonus. Since the star gun is constantly moving and attempting to line up the appropriate shot, creatures it targets are off-guard to the gun's attacks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You unleash a barrage of attacks in an instant. You deal [Strike](link_action_19856) damage to all creatures in a 30-foot cone (DC 45 basic Reflex save). This barrage counts as three attacks for your multiple attack penalty.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12139,"type":"item","before":{"id":12139,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mala Beads of Foresight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2069566684569120","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1300},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2325","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"150"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:15.113337+00:00","operations":[{"id":"a55f775f-8dd2-4744-bce2-226f37f207ae","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"As you move your body, qi flows into [mala beads of foresight](link_item_12139) you wear and have invested, making them one with your life force. In their usual form, beads are spheres of wood, but versions customized to different martial orders are common. You gain a +2 item bonus to Religion checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a [divine](link_trait_1475) [monk](link_class_111) qi spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You have just [Refocused](link_action_19754) by meditating; **Effect** While meditating, you searched your feelings for a portent of the future. You’re affected by an *[augury](link_spell_4406)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [monk](link_class_111) with [divine](link_trait_1475) qi spells."},"after":{"id":12139,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mala Beads of Foresight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2069566684569120","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1300},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2325","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"150"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:15.113337+00:00","operations":[{"id":"a55f775f-8dd2-4744-bce2-226f37f207ae","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"As you move your body, qi flows into [mala beads of foresight](link_item_12139) you wear and have invested, making them one with your life force. In their usual form, beads are spheres of wood, but versions customized to different martial orders are common. You gain a +2 item bonus to Religion checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a [divine](link_trait_1475) [monk](link_class_111) qi spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You have just [Refocused](link_action_19754) by meditating; **Effect** While meditating, you searched your feelings for a portent of the future. You’re affected by an *[augury](link_spell_4406)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [monk](link_class_111) with [divine](link_trait_1475) qi spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12140,"type":"item","before":{"id":12140,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kindled Tome","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2611818557058593","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2855,1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4926","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"195"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:15.673358+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +17; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet, imprecise sense of heat 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy ([Common](link_language_81), [Pyric](link_language_98), and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Arcana +21, Fire Lore +23, Nature +17\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +0, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +17\n\nA [kindled tome](link_item_12140) is a _[book of lingering blazes](link_item_23294)_ awakened to sapience and imbued with an enthusiasm for fire. It encourages you to learn new [fire](link_trait_1542) spells to inscribe within its pages. When you attempt a skill check to [Learn a Spell](link_action_19736) to add a spell with the [fire](link_trait_1542) trait to the [kindled tome](link_item_12140), you treat your result as one step better than you rolled. The tome can be disparaging about other spells as \"a waste of good page space,\" especially if those spells have the [cold](link_trait_1519) or [water](link_trait_1584) traits. In addition to the activation of a [book of lingering blazes](link_item_23294), a [kindled tome](link_item_12140) has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) with the [fire](link_trait_1542) trait\n\n**Effect** The tome makes the flames linger, dealing 2d6 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage to all you hit with or who fail the saving throw against the effect (doubling on a critical success on a spell attack and on a critical failure on a saving throw).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The tome casts *[fireball](link_spell_4623)* at 5th rank to your specifications.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) dealing [fire](link_trait_1542) damage that you prepared from this grimoire, you superheat the flames, allowing the spell to ignore up to 10 resistance to [fire](link_trait_1542) of creatures affected by the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12140,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kindled Tome","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2611818557058593","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2855,1613,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4926","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"195"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:15.673358+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +17; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet, imprecise sense of heat 30 feet\n\n**Communication** telepathy ([Common](link_language_81), [Pyric](link_language_98), and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Arcana +21, Fire Lore +23, Nature +17\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +0, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +17\n\nA [kindled tome](link_item_12140) is a _[book of lingering blazes](link_item_23294)_ awakened to sapience and imbued with an enthusiasm for fire. It encourages you to learn new [fire](link_trait_1542) spells to inscribe within its pages. When you attempt a skill check to [Learn a Spell](link_action_19736) to add a spell with the [fire](link_trait_1542) trait to the [kindled tome](link_item_12140), you treat your result as one step better than you rolled. The tome can be disparaging about other spells as \"a waste of good page space,\" especially if those spells have the [cold](link_trait_1519) or [water](link_trait_1584) traits. In addition to the activation of a [book of lingering blazes](link_item_23294), a [kindled tome](link_item_12140) has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) with the [fire](link_trait_1542) trait\n\n**Effect** The tome makes the flames linger, dealing 2d6 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage to all you hit with or who fail the saving throw against the effect (doubling on a critical success on a spell attack and on a critical failure on a saving throw).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The tome casts *[fireball](link_spell_4623)* at 5th rank to your specifications.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [spellshape](link_trait_1465))\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) dealing [fire](link_trait_1542) damage that you prepared from this grimoire, you superheat the flames, allowing the spell to ignore up to 10 resistance to [fire](link_trait_1542) of creatures affected by the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12141,"type":"item","before":{"id":12141,"bulk":"1","name":"Klar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7115254876001488","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2892],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":10,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":10,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=28","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"klar","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":5},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:17.459484+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This traditional Shoanti armament combines a short metal blade with the skull of a large horned lizard, fashioned as a shield. The lightweight shield allows for quick attacks with its integrated blade.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12141,"bulk":"1","name":"Klar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7115254876001488","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2892],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":10,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":10,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=28","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"21"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"klar","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":5},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:17.459484+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This traditional Shoanti armament combines a short metal blade with the skull of a large horned lizard, fashioned as a shield. The lightweight shield allows for quick attacks with its integrated blade.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12142,"type":"item","before":{"id":12142,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kraken Bottle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1030515443560831","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":5000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4483","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"56"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:17.998333+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nCoiled tentacles make it all but impossible to see anything else inside this ampoule. When opened, a Gargantuan [kraken](link_creature_10166) bursts forth, which can appear in water instead of on the ground. Its arms attempt to grasp up to four creatures with a reach of 60 feet. The [kraken](link_creature_10166) repositions grabbed creatures to a different space within its reach unless the target succeeds at a DC 38 Fortitude save.\n\nIf the [kraken](link_creature_10166) is in water, it then releases a cloud of ink in an 80-foot emanation. This cloud has no effect outside of water. Creatures inside the cloud are undetected, can't use their sense of smell, and are exposed to [kraken](link_creature_10166) ink [poison](link_trait_1476). The cloud dissipates after 1 minute.\n\n[Krakens](link_creature_10166) are immune to this [poison](link_trait_1476).\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 39 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and sickened 1 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 5d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and sickened 2 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a [kraken](link_creature_10166)."},"after":{"id":12142,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Kraken Bottle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1030515443560831","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":5000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"versi