ders. This armor disperses blows much like rings of [chain mail](link_item_6778) but is much tighter in construction, making it quieter.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12145,"bulk":"2","name":"Lattice Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6101547865815677","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"chain","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":null,"dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=67","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"10"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":1,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":4,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":3,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:19.811451+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Also known as “varman” in some parts of the Impossible Lands, this armor is made from fine metal cables woven into latticework patterns with plated segments to protect the head, neck, and shoulders. This armor disperses blows much like rings of [chain mail](link_item_6778) but is much tighter in construction, making it quieter.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12146,"type":"item","before":{"id":12146,"bulk":"0","name":"Laurel of the Empath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8818745475974406","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn circlet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1460,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4672","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollTwice","keep":"higher","selector":"initiative","removeAfterRoll":false}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:20.881482+00:00","operations":[{"id":"61fb0877-8307-4fbd-9a12-4b5bf6eee1f2","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"dd9e4b69-948f-4681-9600-039d3e74fc0f","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":{"value":6,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":"4","operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"f31fb911-dfc9-4bf4-aad9-9d477d44fbce","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"80688add-ac39-49a0-abd5-a16cd7637459","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"255978ea-e632-4fab-b2cd-177c88625e28","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This silvery, woven ring of leaves sits on top of the head. While wearing it, when you roll Perception for initiative, you can roll twice and take the higher result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. Whenever you spend at least 1 minute talking with a living creature, you automatically become aware of its attitude toward you. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the laurel, you either increase your Wisdom modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** You're hit by an attack; **Effect** You take half damage from the triggering attack.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You fail, but don't critically fail, a saving throw; **Effect** You anticipate the danger and guard against it, often in unconventional or almost inconceivable ways. Treat the failed saving throw as a success.\n\n**Activate** 10 minutes ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460), [mental](link_trait_1448)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You spend 10 minutes talking with one living creature, conversing in inspirational, religious, or philosophical terms. You gain valuable insights into the personality of your target—their hopes, dreams, and fears. When the ritual is over, you gain a +4 item bonus to all Perception checks made concerning the target for one month. Also, the target gains inspirational insight, allowing the target to use one of the two reactions listed above once during the next 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12146,"bulk":"0","name":"Laurel of the Empath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8818745475974406","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"worn circlet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1460,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4672","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"103"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollTwice","keep":"higher","selector":"initiative","removeAfterRoll":false}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:20.881482+00:00","operations":[{"id":"61fb0877-8307-4fbd-9a12-4b5bf6eee1f2","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"dd9e4b69-948f-4681-9600-039d3e74fc0f","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":{"value":6,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS","type":"attr","value":"4","operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"f31fb911-dfc9-4bf4-aad9-9d477d44fbce","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"80688add-ac39-49a0-abd5-a16cd7637459","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"255978ea-e632-4fab-b2cd-177c88625e28","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_WIS"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This silvery, woven ring of leaves sits on top of the head. While wearing it, when you roll Perception for initiative, you can roll twice and take the higher result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect. Whenever you spend at least 1 minute talking with a living creature, you automatically become aware of its attitude toward you. When you [invest](link_action_20775) the laurel, you either increase your Wisdom modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** You're hit by an attack; **Effect** You take half damage from the triggering attack.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** You fail, but don't critically fail, a saving throw; **Effect** You anticipate the danger and guard against it, often in unconventional or almost inconceivable ways. Treat the failed saving throw as a success.\n\n**Activate** 10 minutes ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460), [mental](link_trait_1448)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You spend 10 minutes talking with one living creature, conversing in inspirational, religious, or philosophical terms. You gain valuable insights into the personality of your target—their hopes, dreams, and fears. When the ritual is over, you gain a +4 item bonus to all Perception checks made concerning the target for one month. Also, the target gains inspirational insight, allowing the target to use one of the two reactions listed above once during the next 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12147,"type":"item","before":{"id":12147,"bulk":"1","name":"Leaf Weave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"693254247930899","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=68","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"10"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:21.462176+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Specialized crafters, often [elves](link_ancestry_3), create [leaf weave](link_item_12147) out of sturdy leaves from ancient or magically enriched trees. Such leaves, when treated properly, have the strength of leather, and other tough plant materials hold the leaves together to form the armor. Such suits are popular among those who wish to avoid materials taken from slain beasts. As a material, [leaf weave](link_item_12147) has the same statistics as thin wood.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12147,"bulk":"1","name":"Leaf Weave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"693254247930899","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=68","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"10"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:21.462176+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Specialized crafters, often [elves](link_ancestry_3), create [leaf weave](link_item_12147) out of sturdy leaves from ancient or magically enriched trees. Such leaves, when treated properly, have the strength of leather, and other tough plant materials hold the leaves together to form the armor. Such suits are popular among those who wish to avoid materials taken from slain beasts. As a material, [leaf weave](link_item_12147) has the same statistics as thin wood.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12148,"type":"item","before":{"id":12148,"bulk":"1","name":"Leather Lamellar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8982252059552775","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"composite","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=69","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leather-lamellar","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:22.070013+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Leather lamellar](link_item_12148) is a composite armor made of small rectangular pieces of lacquered leather laced together with high-quality cord. It's typically worn with an undershirt.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12148,"bulk":"1","name":"Leather Lamellar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8982252059552775","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"composite","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=69","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leather-lamellar","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:22.070013+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Leather lamellar](link_item_12148) is a composite armor made of small rectangular pieces of lacquered leather laced together with high-quality cord. It's typically worn with an undershirt.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12149,"type":"item","before":{"id":12149,"bulk":"0","name":"Legerdemain Handkerchief","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"481027650701193","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4728","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:22.670016+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This frilled, silvery-gray handkerchief is a stylish tool for personal hygiene by all appearances, but it can be used to covertly make very small items vanish.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** The handkerchief is entirely covering an item of negligible Bulk\n\n**Effect** The handkerchief transports the item it covers into its [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space. The handkerchief can hold only one item within its [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space at a time, so any item taken is replaced by any item already within the space. You can also use this action to expel an item already within the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space without replacing it. This activation can't be used on an attended item unless the creature with that item allows it. Placing the handkerchief over an item typically takes an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12149,"bulk":"0","name":"Legerdemain Handkerchief","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"481027650701193","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":25},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4728","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"115"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:22.670016+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This frilled, silvery-gray handkerchief is a stylish tool for personal hygiene by all appearances, but it can be used to covertly make very small items vanish.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** The handkerchief is entirely covering an item of negligible Bulk\n\n**Effect** The handkerchief transports the item it covers into its [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space. The handkerchief can hold only one item within its [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space at a time, so any item taken is replaced by any item already within the space. You can also use this action to expel an item already within the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space without replacing it. This activation can't be used on an attended item unless the creature with that item allows it. Placing the handkerchief over an item typically takes an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12150,"type":"item","before":{"id":12150,"bulk":"1","name":"Leiomano","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"348324992258494","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1686,1837],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=626","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"leiomano","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6,"base_item_content":{"id":12150,"bulk":"1","name":"Leiomano","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":348324992258494,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1686,1837],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"leiomano","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"