0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"leiomano","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:23.668549+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This thick club is inset with sharp teeth, typically from a shark, that easily tear flesh. It's the preferred weapon of many Minatan warriors.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:23.668549+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This thick [club](link_item_6820) is inset with sharp teeth, typically from a shark, that easily tear flesh. It's the preferred weapon of many Minatan warriors.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12151,"type":"item","before":{"id":12151,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fraudslayer Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6180302941747482","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":650},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1566,1476,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2006","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"69"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:24.417851+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nMade from a rare root that reacts to the physical changes that happen when someone is being deceitful, [fraudslayer oil](link_item_12151) is a blunt instrument. It can compel truth, but it carries a fatal price if the victim can’t stop themself from repeatedly telling lies. While under the effect of [fraudslayer oil](link_item_12151), the victim takes the listed [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for any time they voluntarily and knowingly tell a lie, due to the [poison](link_trait_1476)’s increased blood pressure to their brain. They take this damage once per round at most, even if they lie several times in rapid succession. The victim is aware of this effect and can choose to not answer or give only evasive, technically truthful, answers.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 34 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 minute; **Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** stupefied 1, 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 3d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** stupefied 2, 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 4d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** stupefied 3, 5d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 5d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying, and the damage becomes a [death](link_trait_1904) effect. If it reduces the victim to 0 Hit Points, the victim's head explodes, causing death (1 minute).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":12151,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Fraudslayer Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6180302941747482","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":650},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1566,1476,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2006","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"69"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:24.417851+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nMade from a rare root that reacts to the physical changes that happen when someone is being deceitful, [fraudslayer oil](link_item_12151) is a blunt instrument. It can compel truth, but it carries a fatal price if the victim can’t stop themself from repeatedly telling lies. While under the effect of [fraudslayer oil](link_item_12151), the victim takes the listed [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for any time they voluntarily and knowingly tell a lie, due to the [poison](link_trait_1476)’s increased blood pressure to their brain. They take this damage once per round at most, even if they lie several times in rapid succession. The victim is aware of this effect and can choose to not answer or give only evasive, technically truthful, answers.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 34 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 minute; **Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** stupefied 1, 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 3d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** stupefied 2, 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 4d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** stupefied 3, 5d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and 5d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage for lying, and the damage becomes a [death](link_trait_1904) effect. If it reduces the victim to 0 Hit Points, the victim's head explodes, causing death (1 minute).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12152,"type":"item","before":{"id":12152,"bulk":"1","name":"Librarian Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6523049172950353","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4788","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"133"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:25.193656+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[librarian staff](link_item_12152)_ is a slender pole composed of thousands of coiled and compressed book pages swirling into one another, with a mishmash of letters tumbling across its surface. The sound of rustling pages can be heard when the staff moves.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You store one portable text of 1 Bulk or less—typically a book or scroll—in an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space in the staff. You can also use this activation to retrieve one text stored in the staff. The staff can store up to 100 texts.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[approximate](link_spell_8800)*, *[read aura](link_spell_4794)*\n*   **1st** *[pocket library](link_spell_7610)*, *[quick sort](link_spell_9010)*, *[share lore](link_spell_7366)*\n*   **2nd** *[translate](link_spell_4905)*, *[timely tutor](link_spell_9053)*\n*   **3rd** *[translate](link_spell_4905)*, *[pocket library](link_spell_7610)*, *[quick sort](link_spell_9010)*, *[share lore](link_spell_7366)*\n*   **4th** *[translate](link_spell_4905)*\n*   **5th** *[quick sort](link_spell_9010)*, *[share lore](link_spell_7366)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all li