ck_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:01.72031+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Sankeit is common armor among Varki in the northern Land of the Linnorm Kings, made of small wooden plates or longer slats, typically vertical, joined with sinew or cord and painted with decorations. Varki warriors traditionally wear sankeit with a fearsome wooden helm carved in the shape of a mighty creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:38.355483+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The first suit of [+3](link_item_6721) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [antimagic](link_item_6709) [sankeit](link_item_12366) made in this fashion was crafted for the Varki linnorm king Nankou, after he claimed his title by slaying a [taiga linnorm](link_creature_11164). By Varki tradition, the armor was crafted using some of the slain linnorm’s body to decorate the breastplate and helm, which imbued the armor with several of the linnorm’s natural abilities. Though the helm is shaped like the beast’s head, a linnorm’s actual head would be too large for a proper helmet.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You breathe a 60-foot cone of electrified vapor, dealing 17d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) damage to creatures in the area (DC 38 basic Reflex save). The electrified mist persists in the area for 2 rounds, dealing 5d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) damage (DC 38 basic Reflex save) to each creature that ends its turn in the mist. If you slew the linnorm this armor is made from, you can use the higher of your class DC or spell DC instead of the listed DCs for this effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Trigger** A creature adjacent to you targets you with a melee attack; **Effect** The creature takes 4d6 piercing damage as previously invisible magical spines leap outwards from the armor to punish them for the attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the hide and skull of any type of linnorm."},"after":{"id":12174,"bulk":"2","name":"Linnorm's Sankeit","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1478839753862115","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":22750},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2860,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6709,"name":"Antimagic"}],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4382","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"sankeit","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":12366,"bulk":"1","name":"Sankeit","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":8906569033590767,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:01.72031+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Sankeit is common armor among Varki in the northern Land of the Linnorm Kings, made of small wooden plates or longer slats, typically vertical, joined with sinew or cord and painted with decorations. Varki warriors traditionally wear sankeit with a fearsome wooden helm carved in the shape of a mighty creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:38.355483+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The first suit of [+3](link_item_6721) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [antimagic](link_item_6709) [sankeit](link_item_12366) made in this fashion was crafted for the Varki linnorm king Nankou, after he claimed his title by slaying a [taiga linnorm](link_creature_11164). By Varki tradition, the armor was crafted using some of the slain linnorm’s body to decorate the breastplate and helm, which imbued the armor with several of the linnorm’s natural abilities. Though the helm is shaped like the beast’s head, a linnorm’s actual head would be too large for a proper helmet.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You breathe a 60-foot cone of electrified vapor, dealing 17d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) damage to creatures in the area (DC 38 basic Reflex save). The electrified mist persists in the area for 2 rounds, dealing 5d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) damage (DC 38 basic Reflex save) to each creature that ends its turn in the mist. If you slew the linnorm this armor is made from, you can use the higher of your class DC or spell DC instead of the listed DCs for this effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Trigger** A creature adjacent to you targets you with a melee attack; **Effect** The creature takes 4d6 piercing damage as previously invisible magical spines leap outwards from the armor to punish them for the attack.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the hide and skull of any type of linnorm."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12175,"type":"item","before":{"id":12175,"bulk":"1","name":"Living Leaf Weave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6903624769179576","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1442,2860,1654],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4511","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:38.933658+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis suit of [leaf weave](link_item_12147) armor is specially modified to metabolize the [alchemical](link_trait_1529) accelerants in medicinal compounds. A special receptacle in the armor can hold an [elixir of life](link_item_6905), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded suit of [living leaf weave](link_item_12175) can be activated to grow slithering vines from the armor, granting an item bonus to Athletics checks to [Grapple](link_action_19725), to your Fortitude DC to resist [Grapple](link_action_19725), [Disarm](link_action_19626), or [Shove](link_action_19849) attempts, and to your Reflex DCs to resist [Trip](link_action_19865) attempts. The bonus is equal to the elixir's item bonus. The effects last for 3 rounds, consuming the [elixir of life](link_item_6905), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12175,"bulk":"1","name":"Living Leaf Weave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6903624769179576","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1442,2860,1654],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4511","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leaf-weave","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:38.933658+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis suit of [leaf weave](link_item_12147) armor is specially modified to metabolize the [alchemical](link_trait_1529) accelerants in medicinal compounds. A special receptacle in the armor can hold an [elixir of life](link_item_6905), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded suit of [living leaf weave](link_item_12175) can be activated to grow slithering vines from the armor, granting an item bonus to Athletics checks to [Grapple](link_action_19725), to your Fortitude DC to resist [Grapple](link_action_19725), [Disarm](link_action_19626), or [Shove](link_action_19849) attempts, and to your Reflex DCs to resist [Trip](link_action_19865) attempts. The bonus is equal to the elixir's item bonus. The effects last for 3 rounds, consuming the [elixir of life](link_item_6905), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12176,"type":"item","before":{"id":12176,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Lodestone Bomb (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8006317605703353","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1530,1531,1560,1532],"version