:1,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2156","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"105"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:47.271854+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This prosthetic eye converts visible light into a telepathic signal that is relayed to the wearer's mind using divination magic. As the wearer's mind must process the telepathic signal in the same way as it would a nerve impulse, the acuity and other abilities related to the vision provided by the _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ matches that of other members of your ancestry (for instance, a [goblin](link_ancestry_6) with a _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ would be able to see in [darkvision](link_sense_20769), while a [human](link_ancestry_8) wearing the same prosthetic would need illumination). You can remove or replace a _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ using an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12184,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Magical Prosthetic Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2618816153195461","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2156","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"105"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:47.271854+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This prosthetic eye converts visible light into a telepathic signal that is relayed to the wearer's mind using divination magic. As the wearer's mind must process the telepathic signal in the same way as it would a nerve impulse, the acuity and other abilities related to the vision provided by the _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ matches that of other members of your ancestry (for instance, a [goblin](link_ancestry_6) with a _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ would be able to see in [darkvision](link_sense_20769), while a [human](link_ancestry_8) wearing the same prosthetic would need illumination). You can remove or replace a _[magical prosthetic eye](link_item_12184)_ using an [Interact](link_action_19733) action.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12185,"type":"item","before":{"id":12185,"bulk":"1","name":"Magnetic Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5847975750927156","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1492],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4512","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:47.93338+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nCopper rings spiral around this [steel shield](link_item_7855). Twin electrical probes near the grip can socket into a jar of [moderate (or higher leveled) bottled lightning](link_item_16069), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded [magnetic shield](link_item_12185) can be activated to convert it into an electromagnet. When an activated [magnetic shield](link_item_12185) is raised, the circumstance bonus increases by 1 against attacks made with weapons primarily made of metal. If you use a [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) against a creature attacking you with such a weapon, you also gain a +1 item bonus to [Disarm](link_action_19626) attempts against that weapon until the end of your next turn. The shield remains charged for 3 rounds, consuming the [bottled lightning](link_item_16069), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12185,"bulk":"1","name":"Magnetic Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5847975750927156","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1492],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4512","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:47.93338+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nCopper rings spiral around this [steel shield](link_item_7855). Twin electrical probes near the grip can socket into a jar of [moderate (or higher leveled) bottled lightning](link_item_16069), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded [magnetic shield](link_item_12185) can be activated to convert it into an electromagnet. When an activated [magnetic shield](link_item_12185) is raised, the circumstance bonus increases by 1 against attacks made with weapons primarily made of metal. If you use a [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) against a creature attacking you with such a weapon, you also gain a +1 item bonus to [Disarm](link_action_19626) attempts against that weapon until the end of your next turn. The shield remains charged for 3 rounds, consuming the [bottled lightning](link_item_16069), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12186,"type":"item","before":{"id":12186,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetic Shot (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3847549505141465","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2200},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4587","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"82"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"AdjustStrike","mode":"add","value":"deadly-d12","property":"weapon-traits","definition":["item:id:{item|_id}"]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","diceNumber":4},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":2,"selector":"{item|_id}-attack"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:48.680591+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nShiny gray metal that slightly thrums when touched makes up the metal parts of a [magnetic shot](link_item_12186). When activated, the shot is more effective against a target wearing metal armor or made of metal. The activated ammunition grants a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls against such targets. Due to magnetic acceleration, the ammunition deals four additional weapon damage dice and is [deadly d12](link_trait_2529).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12186,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetic Shot (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3847549505141465","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2200},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4587","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"82"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"AdjustStrike","mode":"add","value":"deadly-d12","property":"weapon-traits","definition":["item:id:{item|_id}"]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","diceNumber":4},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":2,"selector":"{item|_id}-attack"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:48.680591+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nShiny gray metal that slightly thrums when touched makes up the metal parts of a [magnetic shot](link_item_12186). When activated, the shot is more effective against a target wearing metal armor or made of metal. The activated ammunition grants a +2 circumstance bonus to attack rolls against such targets. Due to magnetic acceleration, the ammunition deals four additional weapon damage dice and is [deadly d12](link_trait_2529).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12187,"type":"item","before":{"id":12187,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetic Shot (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6507343916204136","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":nul