k_item_12188). When activated, the shot is more effective against a target wearing metal armor or made of metal. The activated ammunition grants a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls against such targets. Due to magnetic acceleration, the ammunition deals three additional weapon damage dice and is [deadly d10](link_trait_1706).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12188,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetic Shot (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7961100145672325","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4587","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"82"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"AdjustStrike","mode":"add","value":"deadly-d10","property":"weapon-traits","definition":["item:id:{item|_id}"]},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","diceNumber":3},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"{item|_id}-attack"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:50.393453+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nShiny gray metal that slightly thrums when touched makes up the metal parts of a [magnetic shot](link_item_12188). When activated, the shot is more effective against a target wearing metal armor or made of metal. The activated ammunition grants a +1 circumstance bonus to attack rolls against such targets. Due to magnetic acceleration, the ammunition deals three additional weapon damage dice and is [deadly d10](link_trait_1706).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12189,"type":"item","before":{"id":12189,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetizing","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1416672346883862","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"etched-onto-metal-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4366","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:51.081489+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune alters the magnetic polarity of your armor, making other metal items drawn to it ever so slightly. You can amplify the magnetic power of the armor to keep another creature from getting away from you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Requirements** A creature adjacent to you is made of metal or wearing metal armor\n\n**Effect** You magnetize your armor. If you or the target attempt to move away from one another, treat each square as difficult terrain. This doesn't affect movement that keeps you the same distance from one another, so you could still [Step](link_action_19853) if you remained adjacent to the target. This effect ends once either of you is no longer adjacent to the other at the end of an action.\n\nThis Activation might work on some creatures partially made of metal, such as those with metal scales, as determined by the GM. Likewise, the GM might determine some metal creatures are non-magnetic, depending on the metal they're made of.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12189,"bulk":"0","name":"Magnetizing","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1416672346883862","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"etched-onto-metal-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4366","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:51.081489+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune alters the magnetic polarity of your armor, making other metal items drawn to it ever so slightly. You can amplify the magnetic power of the armor to keep another creature from getting away from you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Requirements** A creature adjacent to you is made of metal or wearing metal armor\n\n**Effect** You magnetize your armor. If you or the target attempt to move away from one another, treat each square as difficult terrain. This doesn't affect movement that keeps you the same distance from one another, so you could still [Step](link_action_19853) if you remained adjacent to the target. This effect ends once either of you is no longer adjacent to the other at the end of an action.\n\nThis Activation might work on some creatures partially made of metal, such as those with metal scales, as determined by the GM. Likewise, the GM might determine some metal creatures are non-magnetic, depending on the metal they're made of.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12190,"type":"item","before":{"id":12190,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Majordomo Torc","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4654706127841833","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4927","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"195"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"society"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:51.815724+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +13; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and 1 imparted language)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +13, Nobility Lore +13, Society +13\n\n**Int** +3 **Wis** +3, **Cha** +3\n\n**Will** +14\n\nForged in platinum, a [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) is engraved with heraldic insignias along with one language's alphabet, much like a [choker of elocution](link_item_6795). You gain a +1 item bonus to Society checks and the ability to understand, speak, and write the torc's language. Your excellent elocution reduces the DC of the flat check to perform an [auditory](link_trait_1469) action while deafened from 5 to 3.\n\nUpon being invested, the torc appoints itself your majordomo and, given the chance, takes over coordinating your social calendar, engagements, and wardrobe. A [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) has a prim, fussy disposition, and although it defers to you, it can grow sardonic if you frequently ignore its advice. The torc has the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) casts *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)* on you, usually to your specifications. However the torc can also choose the appearance of the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12190,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Majordomo Torc","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4654706127841833","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4927","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"195"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"society"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:51.815724+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +13; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and 1 imparted language)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +13, Nobility Lore +13, Society +13\n\n**Int** +3 **Wis** +3, **Cha** +3\n\n**Will** +14\n\nForged in platinum, a [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) is engraved with heraldic insignias along with one language's alphabet, much like a [choker of elocution](link_item_6795). You gain a +1 item bonus to Society checks and the ability to understand, speak, and write the torc's language. Your excellent elocution reduces the DC of the flat check to perform an [auditory](link_trait_1469) action while deafened from 5 to 3.\n\nUpon being invested, the torc appoints itself your majordomo and, given the chance, takes over coordinating your social calendar, engagements, and wardrobe. A [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) has a prim, fussy disposition, and although it defers to you, it can grow sardonic if you frequently ignore its advice. The torc has the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [majordomo torc](link_item_12190) casts *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)* on you, usually to your specifications. However the torc can also choose the appearance of the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12191,"type":"item","before":{"id":12191,"bulk":"1","name":"Mantis Shell","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6383897225362583","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":null,"rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2873],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=70","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"mantis-shell","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:52.375559+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Construction of [mantis shell](link_item_12191) armor originates with the Red Mantis assassins. Authentic [mantis shell](link_item_12191) can be found in some dark markets, but wearing such armor can attract deadly attention from the armor's originators. [Mantis shell](link_item_12191) comes with the [weapon harness](link_item_12712) adjustment, though these special vambraces are meant to hold [sawtooth sabers](link_item_7724), and attaching anything else is an insult to the Red Mantis. A character who is a member of the Red Mantis assassins has access to this uncommon armor.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12191,"bulk":"1","name":"Mantis Shell","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6383897225362583","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":null,"rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2873],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=70","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"mantis-shell","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:52.375559+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Construction of [mantis shell](link_item_12191) armor originates with the Red Mantis assassins. Authentic [mantis shell](link_item_12191) can be found in some dark markets, but wearing such armor can attract deadly attention from the armor's originators. [Mantis shell](link_item_12191) comes with the [weapon harness](link_item_12712) adjustment, though these special vambraces are meant to hold [sawtooth sabers](link_item_7724), and attaching anything else is an insult to the Red Mantis. A character who is a member of the Red Mantis assassins has access to this uncommon armor.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12192,"type":"item","before":{"id":12192,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mantle of Amazing Health","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7246831937870741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":40000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4673","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":2,"selector":"fortitude","predicate":[{"or":["disease","poison"]}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:52.921446+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This ragged cloak doesn't appear to be anything special at first glance, seemingly made from mangy black bear fur with various rings of blackened iron piercing the edge of the skin. While somewhat off-putting, the mantle grants a +2 status bonus to all Fortitude saving throws against [disease](link_trait_1857) and [poison](link_trait_1476). When you invest the mantle, you either increase your Constitution modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever is higher.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per round; **Trigger** You take damage\n\n**Effect** Drawing the cloak around you, you reduce the damage taken by 10.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** If you're currently afflicted by a [poison](link_trait_1476) or a [disease](link_trait_1857), you can hold the cloak tight to your body and immediately attempt a saving throw to end the effect. If that saving throw succeeds, you end the effect of either the [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) no matter the stage of the affliction. Furthermore, you gain immunity to that [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12192,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mantle of Amazing Health","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7246831937870741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":40000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4673","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"status","value":2,"selector":"fortitude","predicate":[{"or":["disease","poison"]}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:52.921446+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This ragged cloak doesn't appear to be anything special at first glance, seemingly made from mangy black bear fur with various rings of blackened iron piercing the edge of the skin. While somewhat off-putting, the mantle grants a +2 status bonus to all Fortitude saving throws against [disease](link_trait_1857) and [poison](link_trait_1476). When you invest the mantle, you either increase your Constitution modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever is higher.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per round; **Trigger** You take damage\n\n**Effect** Drawing the cloak around you, you reduce the damage taken by 10.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** If you're currently afflicted by a [poison](link_trait_1476) or a [disease](link_trait_1857), you can hold the cloak tight to your body and immediately attempt a saving throw to end the effect. If that saving throw succeeds, you end the effect of either the [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) no matter the stage of the affliction. Furthermore, you gain immunity to that [poison](link_trait_1476) or [disease](link_trait_1857) for 24 hours.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12193,"type":"item","before":{"id":12193,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Miraculous Paintbrush","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"931187718254598","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":325},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2120","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:53.617859+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThe bristles on a [miraculous paintbrush](link_item_12193) shift in a rainbow of colors, and can magically create an object painted with them. The paint flows as you Activate the [miraculous paintbrush](link_item_12193) and changes color at your whim as you paint. The paint can cover a 10-foot-square, two-dimensional surface. When you’re done painting, attempt a DC 30 Crafting check.\n\n**Critical Success** The object you painted emerges from the surface as a real, permanent object no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. It’s non-magical and inanimate and has no value except to certain art collectors. If you paint a creature, machine, or form of energy (such as a campfire), these depictions appear only as inanimate sculptures. The created object has a painterly appearance that clearly marks its unusual origin, but is as real as any other.\n\n**Success** As critical success, but the object constantly sheds flakes of paint until it falls apart, destroyed, after 24 hours.\n\n**Failure** The pigments leave a painting that doesn’t quite look right and doesn’t become an object.\n\n**Critical Failure** Is it a dog? Whatever you made is a pretty lousy painting and doesn’t resemble what you set out to make.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12193,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Miraculous Paintbrush","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"931187718254598","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":325},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2120","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:53.617859+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nThe bristles on a [miraculous paintbrush](link_item_12193) shift in a rainbow of colors, and can magically create an object painted with them. The paint flows as you Activate the [miraculous paintbrush](link_item_12193) and changes color at your whim as you paint. The paint can cover a 10-foot-square, two-dimensional surface. When you’re done painting, attempt a DC 30 Crafting check.\n\n**Critical Success** The object you painted emerges from the surface as a real, permanent object no larger than 10 feet in any dimension. It’s non-magical and inanimate and has no value except to certain art collectors. If you paint a creature, machine, or form of energy (such as a campfire), these depictions appear only as inanimate sculptures. The created object has a painterly appearance that clearly marks its unusual origin, but is as real as any other.\n\n**Success** As critical success, but the object constantly sheds flakes of paint until it falls apart, destroyed, after 24 hours.\n\n**Failure** The pigments leave a painting that doesn’t quite look right and doesn’t become an object.\n\n**Critical Failure** Is it a dog? Whatever you made is a pretty lousy painting and doesn’t resemble what you set out to make.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12194,"type":"item","before":{"id":12194,"bulk":"0","name":"Mask of Mercy","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2444093084153670","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4882","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"medicine"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:54.159642+00:00","operations":[{"id":"7bb6334e-a0c3-418a-b161-ccfc7b1c7511","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"+1","variable":"SKILL_MEDICINE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This porcelain or alabaster mask portrays an angelic visage of kindness and mercy. The mask grants a +1 item bonus to Medicine checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You are about to roll a variable number of Hit Points you restore from an action with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait;\n\n**Effect** Roll twice to determine the number of Hit Points you restore and take the higher result.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12194,"bulk":"0","name":"Mask of Mercy","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2444093084153670","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4882","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"medicine"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:54.159642+00:00","operations":[{"id":"7bb6334e-a0c3-418a-b161-ccfc7b1c7511","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"+1","variable":"SKILL_MEDICINE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This porcelain or alabaster mask portrays an angelic visage of kindness and mercy. The mask grants a +1 item bonus to Medicine checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You are about to roll a variable number of Hit Points you restore from an action with the [healing](link_trait_1442) trait;\n\n**Effect** Roll twice to determine the number of Hit Points you restore and take the higher result.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12195,"type":"item","before":{"id":12195,"bulk":"0","name":"Mask of the Cursed Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1738225758041682","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":475},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4883","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:54.705175+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[mask of the cursed eye](link_item_12195)_ is decorated with at least one wide, staring eye. The first time each day you’re targeted with a [detection](link_trait_1508), [prediction](link_trait_1896), [revelation](link_trait_1907), or [scrying](link_trait_1590) spell by a creature on your plane that you can’t perceive, the creature targeting you must attempt a DC 24 Will save. This effect is automatic and does not require you to Activate the item.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is unaffected, but you know you’ve been targeted with a spell that has one of these traits.\n\n**Failure** The creature is sickened 1 and dazzled for 1 minute. You know you’ve been targeted with a spell that has one of these traits.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is sickened 2 and dazzled for 10 minutes, and the spell is disrupted. You gain a brief mental glimpse of the triggering creature and learn its approximate distance and direction.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12195,"bulk":"0","name":"Mask of the Cursed Eye","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1738225758041682","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":475},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4883","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:54.705175+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[mask of the cursed eye](link_item_12195)_ is decorated with at least one wide, staring eye. The first time each day you’re targeted with a [detection](link_trait_1508), [prediction](link_trait_1896), [revelation](link_trait_1907), or [scrying](link_trait_1590) spell by a creature on your plane that you can’t perceive, the creature targeting you must attempt a DC 24 Will save. This effect is automatic and does not require you to Activate the item.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is unaffected, but you know you’ve been targeted with a spell that has one of these traits.\n\n**Failure** The creature is sickened 1 and dazzled for 1 minute. You know you’ve been targeted with a spell that has one of these traits.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is sickened 2 and dazzled for 10 minutes, and the spell is disrupted. You gain a brief mental glimpse of the triggering creature and learn its approximate distance and direction.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12196,"type":"item","before":{"id":12196,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mask of Uncanny Breath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4130575052205610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4858","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"poison","value":10,"predicate":["inhaled"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"occultism"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:55.265668+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1c178593-e100-4ff2-a51a-f4fd068c3f18","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_OCCULTISM"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"c9b39b41-1266-4c88-b68b-26f7c5d8aa11","data":{"value":"inhaled poisons,10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"A thin wooden mask carved in the shape of a skull, monstrous face, or eerily featureless visage, a [mask of uncanny breath](link_item_12196) fully covers your face. While wearing it, each breath you take feels cool and pure, perfectly flowing to feed your qi. You gain resistance 10 to [inhaled](link_trait_1578) [poisons](link_trait_1476) and can breathe in an airless or toxic environment. When you breathe in, fragments of bizarre knowledge flow through you, granting you a +2 item bonus to Occultism checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast an [occult](link_trait_1514) [monk](link_class_111) qi spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** Your [unarmed](link_trait_2398) [Strike](link_action_19856) hits a creature that breathes; **Effect** The mask contorts and inhales, sucking breath from your target’s lungs. The target falls unconscious but doesn’t fall prone or drop what it’s holding. It wakes up at the end of your turn if it hasn’t been woken up already.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [monk](link_class_111) with [occult](link_trait_1514) qi spells."},"after":{"id":12196,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mask of Uncanny Breath","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4130575052205610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4858","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"poison","value":10,"predicate":["inhaled"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"occultism"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:55.265668+00:00","operations":[{"id":"1c178593-e100-4ff2-a51a-f4fd068c3f18","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_OCCULTISM"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"c9b39b41-1266-4c88-b68b-26f7c5d8aa11","data":{"value":"inhaled poisons,10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"A thin wooden mask carved in the shape of a skull, monstrous face, or eerily featureless visage, a [mask of uncanny breath](link_item_12196) fully covers your face. While wearing it, each breath you take feels cool and pure, perfectly flowing to feed your qi. You gain resistance 10 to [inhaled](link_trait_1578) [poisons](link_trait_1476) and can breathe in an airless or toxic environment. When you breathe in, fragments of bizarre knowledge flow through you, granting you a +2 item bonus to Occultism checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast an [occult](link_trait_1514) [monk](link_class_111) qi spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** Your [unarmed](link_trait_2398) [Strike](link_action_19856) hits a creature that breathes; **Effect** The mask contorts and inhales, sucking breath from your target’s lungs. The target falls unconscious but doesn’t fall prone or drop what it’s holding. It wakes up at the end of your turn if it hasn’t been woken up already.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [monk](link_class_111) with [occult](link_trait_1514) qi spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12197,"type":"item","before":{"id":12197,"bulk":"0","name":"Master Magus Ring","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3062521313857443","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1459,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4859","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"arcana"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:55.969721+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5d23d427-2361-4f0b-bc51-4da57d056ba9","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_ARCANA"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Elegant jewelry such as the _[master magus ring](link_item_12197)_ adorns experienced magi. Each ring has a significant metal and symbol to represent a particular hybrid study, such as a heavy iron ring with an icon of a mountain for [Inexorable Iron](link_feat_34421), or glittering silver with a shield-like emblem for [Sparkling Targe](link_feat_34423). You gain a +2 item bonus to Arcana checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a [magus](link_class_77) conflux spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The ring transports you and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space you can see within a range equal to your Speed. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container—the activation fails and is used.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [magus](link_class_77)."},"after":{"id":12197,"bulk":"0","name":"Master Magus Ring","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3062521313857443","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1459,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4859","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"arcana"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:55.969721+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5d23d427-2361-4f0b-bc51-4da57d056ba9","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_ARCANA"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Elegant jewelry such as the _[master magus ring](link_item_12197)_ adorns experienced magi. Each ring has a significant metal and symbol to represent a particular hybrid study, such as a heavy iron ring with an icon of a mountain for [Inexorable Iron](link_feat_34421), or glittering silver with a shield-like emblem for [Sparkling Targe](link_feat_34423). You gain a +2 item bonus to Arcana checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a [magus](link_class_77) conflux spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The ring transports you and any items you're wearing and holding from your current space to an unoccupied space you can see within a range equal to your Speed. If this would bring another creature with you—even if you're carrying it in an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) container—the activation fails and is used.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [magus](link_class_77)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12198,"type":"item","before":{"id":12198,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Maw of Hungry Shadows","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7191324741794684","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":21000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1481,1504,1901,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4715","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"112"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:56.849256+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Shadows swirl around this soot-black tome, swallowing up any light that touches them. A faint whispering emanates from the grimoire's pages when opened.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was to cast a spell prepared from this grimoire that has the [shadow](link_trait_1901) trait\n\n**Effect** Your shadow, and that of the tome, elongates and reaches hungrily for one foe within 30 feet, who must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is blinded for 1 round and drained 1 as the shadows scrape across it.\n\n**Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 minute and drained 2 as the shadows seize it.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the shadows also pull the creature into the tome, teleporting it to the Netherworld.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12198,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Maw of Hungry Shadows","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7191324741794684","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":21000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1481,1504,1901,1470],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4715","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"112"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:56.849256+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Shadows swirl around this soot-black tome, swallowing up any light that touches them. A faint whispering emanates from the grimoire's pages when opened.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was to cast a spell prepared from this grimoire that has the [shadow](link_trait_1901) trait\n\n**Effect** Your shadow, and that of the tome, elongates and reaches hungrily for one foe within 30 feet, who must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is blinded for 1 round and drained 1 as the shadows scrape across it.\n\n**Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 minute and drained 2 as the shadows seize it.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the shadows also pull the creature into the tome, teleporting it to the Netherworld.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12199,"type":"item","before":{"id":12199,"bulk":"0","name":"Memoir Map","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"343658648833867","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":13},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4744","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:57.538509+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Your journeys and the major events in your life that occur after you obtain this tattoo appear on it, your life story traced upon your skin. Each time you journey somewhere new or accomplish something noteworthy to you, a design or symbol appears, representing the event. The positions of these images are relative in location, but measurements aren't exact. A [memoir map](link_item_12199) starts with an icon representing your location when you receive the tattoo, usually over the heart, and grows from there. Traveling to another plane causes a new portion to appear on a different part of your body to represent that plane. If you want a record of your life before you receive your [memoir map](link_item_12199), you can have the tattoo artist embellish the map to represent past events.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12199,"bulk":"0","name":"Memoir Map","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"343658648833867","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":13},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4744","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"120"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:57.538509+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Your journeys and the major events in your life that occur after you obtain this tattoo appear on it, your life story traced upon your skin. Each time you journey somewhere new or accomplish something noteworthy to you, a design or symbol appears, representing the event. The positions of these images are relative in location, but measurements aren't exact. A [memoir map](link_item_12199) starts with an icon representing your location when you receive the tattoo, usually over the heart, and grows from there. Traveling to another plane causes a new portion to appear on a different part of your body to represent that plane. If you want a record of your life before you receive your [memoir map](link_item_12199), you can have the tattoo artist embellish the map to represent past events.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12200,"type":"item","before":{"id":12200,"bulk":"0","name":"Menacing (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4133685308945454","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"applied-to-any-visible-article-of-clothing","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4833","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"intimidation","predicate":["action:coerce"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:58.106789+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Common among brutes who use the magic to scare others into compliance, [menacing](link_item_12200) runes lend you a formidable appearance, granting you a +2 item bonus to Intimidation checks to [Coerce](link_action_19613) others.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The rune casts a 3rd-rank *[fear](link_spell_4616)* spell (DC 25).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12200,"bulk":"0","name":"Menacing (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4133685308945454","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"applied-to-any-visible-article-of-clothing","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4833","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"intimidation","predicate":["action:coerce"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:58.106789+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Common among brutes who use the magic to scare others into compliance, [menacing](link_item_12200) runes lend you a formidable appearance, granting you a +2 item bonus to Intimidation checks to [Coerce](link_action_19613) others.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The rune casts a 3rd-rank *[fear](link_spell_4616)* spell (DC 25).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"