 to Intimidation checks to [Coerce](link_action_19613) others.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12202,"type":"item","before":{"id":12202,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mender's Soup","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4162862239523338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4455","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:19:59.747505+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis hot, broth-based soup typically contains tubers, leeks, zesty spices, reagents, and if desired, the meat of livestock. Civic authorities commission batches of [mender's soup](link_item_12202) for workers if a tricky job is on the agenda. After you eat the soup, its effects last 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first. You gain a +1 item bonus to Crafting checks to [Repair](link_action_19756) and restore an additional 5 Hit Points to items you successfully [Repair](link_action_19756) during this time.\n\nIf you eat [mender's soup](link_item_12202) over the entire period required to attempt a Crafting check to [Craft](link_action_19617) (typically a minimum of eating the soup each day for 4 days), the +1 bonus from the soup can be applied to that check, too.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12202,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mender's Soup","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4162862239523338","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1