,"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:00.366876+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSmelling strongly of herbs and pine resin, _[merciful balm](link_item_12203)_ is a thick, sticky paste that can be used to anoint a weapon, granting the weapon the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait for 1 hour.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12203,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Merciful Balm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4868454246176781","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4605","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"86"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:00.366876+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSmelling strongly of herbs and pine resin, _[merciful balm](link_item_12203)_ is a thick, sticky paste that can be used to anoint a weapon, granting the weapon the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait for 1 hour.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12204,"type":"item","before":{"id":12204,"bulk":"","name":"Merciful","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4978571554728361","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4402","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:03.302997+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Merciful](link_item_12204) weapons are sheathed in an unmistakable wispy green aura recognized by both gladiators and guards around the world. A _[merciful](link_item_12204)_ weapon has the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait and can't be used to make a lethal attack. Any persistent damage the weapon would deal is negated.\n\nOn a critical hit, a [merciful](link_item_12204) weapon causes the target to become fascinated with the weapon's wielder for 1 minute, as the target is bombarded with feelings of guilt and remorse. This is a [mental](link_trait_1448) effect. If you have access to the weapon's critical specialization effect, you choose whether to use it or the _[merciful](link_item_12204)_ effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12204,"bulk":"","name":"Merciful","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4978571554728361","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4402","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:03.302997+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Merciful](link_item_12204) weapons are sheathed in an unmistakable wispy green aura recognized by both gladiators and guards around the world. A _[merciful](link_item_12204)_ weapon has the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait and can't be used to make a lethal attack. Any persistent damage the weapon would deal is negated.\n\nOn a critical hit, a [merciful](link_item_12204) weapon causes the target to become fascinated with the weapon's wielder for 1 minute, as the target is bombarded with feelings of guilt and remorse. This is a [mental](link_trait_1448) effect. If you have access to the weapon's critical specialization effect, you choose whether to use it or the _[merciful](link_item_12204)_ effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12205,"type":"item","before":{"id":12205,"bulk":"0","name":"Messenger Missive (Multiple)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3492858840236134","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4597","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:03.843481+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA messenger [missive](link_trait_2874) sends itself. When [composing](link_action_43788) the missive, you write a location upon it. You can also include an individual creature you expect to be in that location as a recipient; if you don't, the first creature in the location to touch the missive is treated as the recipient. Once you finish [Composing](link_action_43788) the missive, it folds itself into the shape of a bird and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a Speed of 45 feet (15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near its recipient or in their hand. When activated, the missive becomes non-magical but retains its contents. If it fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, the missive burns to ash.\n\nYou can write up to four locations on the missive, one on each edge of the paper; you can include a recipient for each location, as well. When you finish [Composing](link_action_43788) the missive, it folds into four identical missive birds, each one flying to one of the locations carrying the same message.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12205,"bulk":"0","name":"Messenger Missive (Multiple)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3492858840236134","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4597","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:03.843481+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA messenger [missive](link_trait_2874) sends itself. When [composing](link_action_43788) the missive, you write a location upon it. You can also include an individual creature you expect to be in that location as a recipient; if you don't, the first creature in the location to touch the missive is treated as the recipient. Once you finish [Composing](link_action_43788) the missive, it folds itself into the shape of a bird and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a Speed of 45 feet (15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near its recipient or in their hand. When activated, the missive becomes non-magical but retains its contents. If it fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, the missive burns to ash.\n\nYou can write up to four locations on the missive, one on each edge of the paper; you can include a recipient for each location, as well. When you finish [Composing](link_action_43788) the missive, it folds into four identical missive birds, each one flying to one of the locations carrying the same message.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12206,"type":"item","before":{"id":12206,"bulk":"0","name":"Messenger Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2274024656889319","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":18},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4597","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:04.474758+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [messenger missive](link_item_12206) sends itself. When composing the missive, you write a location upon it. You can also include an individual creature you expect to be in that location as a recipient; if you don't, the first creature in the location to touch the missive is treated as the recipient. Once you finish composing the missive, it folds itself into the shape of a bird and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a Speed of 45 feet (15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near its recipient or in their hand. When activated, the missive becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) but retains its contents. If it fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, the missive burns to ash.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12206,"bulk":"0","name":"Messenger Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2274024656889319","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":18},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4597","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:04.474758+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA [messenger missive](link_item_12206) sends itself. When composing the missive, you write a location upon it. You can also include an individual creature you expect to be in that location as a recipient; if you don't, the first creature in the location to touch the missive is treated as the recipient. Once you finish composing the missive, it folds itself into the shape of a bird and [Flies](link_action_19721) at a Speed of 45 feet (15 miles per hour) toward the location for up to 24 hours. It alights near its recipient or in their hand. When activated, the missive becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) but retains its contents. If it fails to reach its recipient in 24 hours, the missive burns to ash.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fiel