brightly colored [electricity](link_trait_1576) flicker through the cloudy [mind-swap potion](link_item_12209). The potion often comes in a double-chambered flask, because when you drink it, you consume half the contents. If another creature of the same ancestry consumes the remainder of the contents within 1 minute, your minds swap per the effect of a critical success on a *[mind swap](link_spell_9090)* ritual. The effects last for 24 hours or until one of you [Dismisses](link_action_19627) the activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12209,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mind-Swap Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"67226379610313","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1448,2133,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4621","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:07.209803+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSmall bolts of brightly colored [electricity](link_trait_1576) flicker through the cloudy [mind-swap potion](link_item_12209). The potion often comes in a double-chambered flask, because when you drink it, you consume half the contents. If another creature of the same ancestry consumes the remainder of the contents within 1 minute, your minds swap per the effect of a critical success on a *[mind swap](link_spell_9090)* ritual. The effects last for 24 hours or until one of you [Dismisses](link_action_19627) the activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12210,"type":"item","before":{"id":12210,"bulk":"2","name":"Mindlance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4460414445708153","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1459,1670,2565,1448,1571,3073],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":150,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"damageType":"mental"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4424","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"39"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"arquebus","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:08.074099+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [arquebus](link_item_13810)_ is used by caravan guards to nonlethally—though powerfully—deter large game and bandits. When fired, the spark gun deals [mental](link_trait_1448) damage and adds the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait to the attack. Each [mindlance](link_item_12210) also includes a [reinforced stock](link_item_13707) that benefits from any fundamental runes on the firearm. When you critically succeed at an attack roll with a [mindlance](link_item_12210), the target becomes frightened 2 unless it succeeds at a DC 24 Will save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12210,"bulk":"2","name":"Mindlance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4460414445708153","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1459,1670,2565,1448,1571,3073],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":150,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"damageType":"mental"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4424","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"39"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"arquebus","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:08.074099+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [arquebus](link_item_13810)_ is used by caravan guards to nonlethally—though powerfully—deter large game and bandits. When fired, the spark gun deals [mental](link_trait_1448) damage and adds the [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) trait to the attack. Each [mindlance](link_item_12210) also includes a [reinforced stock](link_item_13707) that benefits from any fundamental runes on the firearm. When you critically succeed at an attack roll with a [mindlance](link_item_12210), the target becomes frightened 2 unless it succeeds at a DC 24 Will save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12211,"type":"item","before":{"id":12211,"bulk":"0","name":"Mindlock Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7747561511880416","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4588","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:08.652893+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n_[Mindlock shot](link_item_12211)_ is made of luminous ectoplasm in a crystalline form. When you command this ammunition, you pick a [Stride](link_action_19855) or [Strike](link_action_19856). If you hit a creature with the ammunition, it falls under a [mental](link_trait_1448) effect that makes it use its first action on its next turn to take the action you picked. It chooses exactly how to use that action, and if you choose [Stride](link_action_19855), the target can [Step](link_action_19853) if doing so is beneficial for it. On a critical hit, the target must use its next 2 actions to do as you chose, within the same parameters.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12211,"bulk":"0","name":"Mindlock Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7747561511880416","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4588","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:08.652893+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n_[Mindlock shot](link_item_12211)_ is made of luminous ectoplasm in a crystalline form. When you command this ammunition, you pick a [Stride](link_action_19855) or [Strike](link_action_19856). If you hit a creature with the ammunition, it falls under a [mental](link_trait_1448) effect that makes it use its first action on its next turn to take the action you picked. It chooses exactly how to use that action, and if you choose [Stride](link_action_19855), the target can [Step](link_action_19853) if doing so is beneficial for it. On a critical hit, the target must use its next 2 actions to do as you chose, within the same parameters.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12212,"type":"item","before":{"id":12212,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mind's Light Circlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6908835286887719","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504,1517,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4860","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"occultism"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:11.133279+00:00","operations":[{"id":"e4cc30c4-e35c-4c54-b696-2989cb16186d","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_OCCULTISM"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Gemstones of many colors adorn the silver of a _[mind's light circlet](link_item_12212)_. When you're charged with mental power, the jewels scintillate with light, with different gems resonating based on your emotions. If you have at least 1 Focus Point, the gems cast dim light in a 10-foot radius. When you [amp](link_trait_2955) a spell, the light increases to bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light to the next 20 feet) until the start of your next turn.\n\nYou gain a +2 item bonus to Occultism checks. You also gain the following [amp](link_trait_2955), which you can apply to any of your [psi cantrips](link_class-feature_24727) that have a target or area, much like an [amp](link_trait_2955) gained from a feat.\n\n**Amp** You transfer some of the [magical](link_trait_1504) luminescence from the [mind's light circlet](link_item_12212) to one of the creatures. Choose a creature targeted by the spell or in its area. Until the start of your next turn, that creature sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light to the next 20 feet) and can't be Concealed. If the creature is Invisible, it's concealed while alight, rather than being undetected.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to use a [psychic](link_class_46) [amp](link_trait_2955). If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [psychic](link_class_46)."},"after":{"id":12212,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Mind's Light Circlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6908835286887719","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504,1517,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4860","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"150"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"occultism"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:11.133279+00:00","operations":[{"id":"e4cc30c4-e35c-4c54-b696-2989cb16186d","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_OCCULTISM"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Gemstones of many colors adorn the silver of a _[mind's light circlet](link_item_12212)_. When you're charged with mental power, the jewels scintillate with light, with different gems resonating based on your emotions. If you have at least 1 Focus Point, the gems cast dim light in a 10-foot radius. When you [amp](link_trait_2955) a spell, the light increases to bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light to the next 20 feet) until the start of your next turn.\n\nYou gain a +2 item bonus to Occultism checks. You also gain the following [amp](link_trait_2955), which you can apply to any of your [psi cantrips](link_class-feature_24727) that have a target or area, much like an [amp](link_trait_2955) gained from a feat.\n\n**Amp** You transfer some of the [magical](link_trait_1504) luminescence from the [mind's light circlet](link_item_12212) to one of the creatures. Choose a creature targeted by the spell or in its area. Until the start of your next turn, that creature sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius (and dim light to the next 20 feet) and can't be Concealed. If the creature is Invisible, it's concealed while alight, rather than being undetected.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to use a [psychic](link_class_46) [amp](link_trait_2955). If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a [psychic](link_class_46)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12213,"type":"item","before":{"id":12213,"bulk":"0","name":"Mirror Goggles (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3895742967478340","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":19000},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4847","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["perception","saving-throw"],"predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:12.395584+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These goggles feature highly reflective lenses. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +3 item bonus to [visual](link_trait_1479) Perception checks and to saving throws against [visual](link_trait_1479) effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** A creature within 60 feet targets you with a [visual](link_trait_1479) effect\n\n**Effect** You turn your head to reflect aspects of the triggering effect back at its creator. The creature must attempt a Fortitude 40 save as it becomes disoriented by this reflection. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). The creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12213,"bulk":"0","name":"Mirror Goggles (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3895742967478340","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":19000},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4847","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["perception","saving-throw"],"predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:12.395584+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These goggles feature highly reflective lenses. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +3 item bonus to [visual](link_trait_1479) Perception checks and to saving throws against [visual](link_trait_1479) effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"actio