ing-throw"],"predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:13.497709+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These goggles feature highly reflective lenses. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +2 item bonus to [visual](link_trait_1479) Perception checks and to saving throws against [visual](link_trait_1479) effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** A creature within 60 feet targets you with a [visual](link_trait_1479) effect\n\n**Effect** You turn your head to reflect aspects of the triggering effect back at its creator. The creature must attempt a Fortitude 30 save as it becomes disoriented by this reflection. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). The creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12215,"bulk":"0","name":"Mirror Goggles (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8772573582599563","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4847","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":["perception","saving-throw"],"predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:13.497709+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These goggles feature highly reflective lenses. While wearing the goggles, you gain a +2 item bonus to [visual](link_trait_1479) Perception checks and to saving throws against [visual](link_trait_1479) effects.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** A creature within 60 feet targets you with a [visual](link_trait_1479) effect\n\n**Effect** You turn your head to reflect aspects of the triggering effect back at its creator. The creature must attempt a Fortitude 30 save as it becomes disoriented by this reflection. On a failure, the creature is sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). The creature is temporarily immune for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12216,"type":"item","before":{"id":12216,"bulk":"0","name":"Misleading","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2630337807608825","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"etched-onto-light-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4367","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:14.096817+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune attempts to obfuscate your location through illusory trickery. When you're concealed, the DC of the flat check to target you with an effect is 6 instead of 5.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The armor casts *[mislead](link_spell_4727)*, affecting you. It lasts until the end of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12216,"bulk":"0","name":"Misleading","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2630337807608825","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":8000},"usage":"etched-onto-light-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4367","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:14.096817+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune attempts to obfuscate your location through illusory trickery. When you're concealed, the DC of the flat check to target you with an effect is 6 instead of 5.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The armor casts *[mislead](link_spell_4727)*, affecting you. It lasts until the end of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12217,"type":"item","before":{"id":12217,"bulk":"0","name":"Missive Mint","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2723830229720650","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1458],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4456","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:15:28.197Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:14.662663+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis white mint with a chalky coating appears to be a normal candy unless someone examining it succeeds at a DC 15 Crafting check to [Identify Alchemy](link_action_19729). If the crafter has the [powerful alchemy](link_class-feature_31232) class feature, this DC is their class DC instead, if it's higher. The mint's crafter can imbue a [missive mint](link_item_12217) with a message containing up to 25 words while creating it. Someone who consumes the [missive mint](link_item_12217) hears the message in a fizzing voice as the mint's coating bubbles away, which takes the same amount of time as it would to speak the message. The mint's eater has no way of knowing who the original sender was, what they sound like, or who the message was intended for.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12217,"bulk":"0","name":"Missive Mint","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2723830229720650","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1458],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4456","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"49"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:15:28.197Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:14.662663+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis white mint with a chalky coating appears to be a normal candy unless someone examining it succeeds at a DC 15 Crafting check to [Identify Alchemy](link_action_19729). If the crafter has the [powerful alchemy](link_class-feature_31232) class feature, this DC is their class DC instead, if it's higher. The mint's crafter can imbue a [missive mint](link_item_12217) with a message containing up to 25 words while creating it. Someone who consumes the [missive mint](link_item_12217) hears the message in a fizzing voice as the mint's coating bubbles away, which takes the same amount of time as it would to speak the message. The mint's eater has no way of knowing who the original sender was, what they sound like, or who the message was intended for.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12218,"type":"item","before":{"id":12218,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Moonlit Spellgun (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"713668380430100","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1542,1517,1504,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4654","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:15.337673+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nElegant [silver](link_item_15062) filigree contains the body of this ephemeral item, which is made of solid light. Its shape resembles a pistol, and it's often carried by hunters of [werecreatures](link_trait_2471) and [vampires](link_trait_2470). You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun emits a silvery ray of pure moonlight that deals 12d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage at night, or 12d6 at other times. The spellgun's damage is treated as [silver](link_item_15062) for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage and is dazzled until the start of your next turn. If it has a weakness to [silver](link_item_15062) or a resistance that can be bypassed by [silver](link_item_15062), it's also enfeebled 1 for 1 minute.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage and is dazzled until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12218,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Moonlit Spellgun (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"713668380430100","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1542,1517,1504,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4654","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:15.337673+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nElegant [silver](link_item_15062) filigree contains the body of this ephemeral item, which is made of solid light. Its shape resembles a pistol, and it's often carried by hunters of [werecreatures](link_trait_2471) and [vampires](link_trait_2470). You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun emits a silvery ray of pure moonlight that deals 12d8 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage at night, or 12d6 at other times. The spellgun's damage is treated as [silver](link_item_15062) for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage and is dazzled until the start of your next turn. If it has a weakness to [silver](link_item_15062) or a resistance that can be bypassed by [silver](link_item_15062), it's also enfeebled 1 for 1 minute.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage and is dazzled until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12219,"type":"item","before":{"id":12219,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Moonlit Spellgun (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2254015268054064","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1542,1517,1504,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4654","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:16.09872+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nElegant [silver](link_item_15062) filigree contains the body of this ephemeral item, which is made of solid light. Its shape resembles a pistol, and it's often carried by hunters of [werecreatures](link_trait_2471) and [vampires](link_trait_2470). You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range inc