id":"5346143013012914","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4485","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:32.329206+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nMiniature octopus arms press up against the sides of this bottle, obscuring the rest of its contents. When opened, a Huge octopus bursts forth, which can appear in water instead of on the ground. Its arms attempt to grasp a creature with a reach of 15 feet. The octopus repositions that creature to a different space within its reach unless the target succeeds at a DC 24 Fortitude save.\n\nIf the octopus is in water, it then releases a cloud of ink in a 30-foot emanation. This cloud has no effect outside of water. Creatures inside the cloud are undetected and can't use their sense of smell. The cloud dissipates after 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a [giant octopus](link_creature_10079) corpse."},"after":{"id":12245,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Octopus Bottle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5346143013012914","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4485","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_thre