ith [oil of ownership](link_item_12248), or \"red-handed oil\" as some call it. Once applied, this clear oil remains active for 24 hours. Anyone who touches an object coated with this oil comes away with a red stain that won't wash off for 1 week.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12249,"type":"item","before":{"id":12249,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oil of Skating","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1733044765936032","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4607","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:35.23259+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis thin, slippery oil shimmers with a golden hue. Coating your shoes or feet with [oil of skating](link_item_12249) enables you to skate quickly along flat surfaces for 1 hour. You gain a +10-foot status bonus to your Speed, which doubles if you move on a downhill surface. You lose this bonus if moving on difficult terrain, greater difficult terrain, or uneven ground. Also, you treat any uphill movement as moving on difficult terrain while your feet are oiled and treat the results of any Acrobatics checks made to [Balance](link_action_19608) as one degree worse.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12249,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oil of Skating","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1733044765936032","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4607","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:35.23259+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis thin, slippery oil shimmers with a golden hue. Coating your shoes or feet with [oil of skating](link_item_12249) enables you to skate quickly along flat surfaces for 1 hour. You gain a +10-foot status bonus to your Speed, which doubles if you move on a downhill surface. You lose this bonus if moving on difficult terrain, greater difficult terrain, or uneven ground. Also, you treat any uphill movement as moving on difficult terrain while your feet are oiled and treat the results of any Acrobatics checks made to [Balance](link_action_19608) as one degree worse.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12250,"type":"item","before":{"id":12250,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oil of Swiftness","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5047897932268840","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4608","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:35.740191+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAnoint a weapon with [oil of swiftness](link_item_12250), which hisses upon application, to give it the benefits of the *[quickstrike](link_item_7682)* rune for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12250,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oil of Swiftness","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5047897932268840","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4608","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:35.740191+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAnoint a weapon with [oil of swiftness](link_item_12250), which hisses upon application, to give it the benefits of the *[quickstrike](link_item_7682)* rune for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12251,"type":"item","before":{"id":12251,"bulk":"0","name":"Olfactory Stimulators","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6447700869016564","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4683","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"106"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:36.310546+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This cluster of sensitive wire whiskers fits over the nose or snout to provide sensory information as it reacts to nearby odors and other scents. A creature wearing [olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251) gains a sense of smell, which is as precise as an average member of its species, as well as the scent special ability if members of its species typically have that ability. [Olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251) can be fitted to animal companions as well as sapient creatures; stimulators produced for companion use have the [companion](link_trait_1538) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12251,"bulk":"0","name":"Olfactory Stimulators","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6447700869016564","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4683","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"106"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:36.310546+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This cluster of sensitive wire whiskers fits over the nose or snout to provide sensory information as it reacts to nearby odors and other scents. A creature wearing [olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251) gains a sense of smell, which is as precise as an average member of its species, as well as the scent special ability if members of its species typically have that ability. [Olfactory stimulators](link_item_12251) can be fitted to animal companions as well as sapient creatures; stimulators produced for companion use have the [companion](link_trait_1538) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12252,"type":"item","before":{"id":12252,"bulk":"0","name":"One Hundred Victories","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6308053781410277","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4748","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"121"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"intimidation"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:36.947251+00:00","operations":[{"id":"fafb6d34-9b33-4833-9491-c890726f7aea","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_INTIMIDATION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"da37090f-f911-4f7d-b031-8488aaad122f","data":{"id":20379,"text":"**One Hundred Victories** If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"7b25fa72-d9f2-46c1-9b60-4e8b72ba6385","data":{"id":28153,"text":"**One Hundred Victories** If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"One hundred cuts, healed into diamond-shaped scars, represent the ability to withstand the attacks of your enemies. [Orc](link_ancestry_10) warriors covet these scar patterns and cluster them around what they consider to be their strongest assets—a pattern around the heart signifies a warrior with great endurance, while one along the arms indicates great upper body strength.\n\nYou gain a +1 item bonus to Intimidation checks. If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12252,"bulk":"0","name":"One Hundred Victories","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6308053781410277","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4748","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"121"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"intimidation"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:36.947251+00:00","operations":[{"id":"fafb6d34-9b33-4833-9491-c890726f7aea","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_INTIMIDATION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"da37090f-f911-4f7d-b031-8488aaad122f","data":{"id":20379,"text":"**One Hundred Victories** If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"7b25fa72-d9f2-46c1-9b60-4e8b72ba6385","data":{"id":28153,"text":"**One Hundred Victories** If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","type":"feat"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"One hundred cuts, healed into diamond-shaped scars, represent the ability to withstand the attacks of your enemies. [Orc](link_ancestry_10) warriors covet these scar patterns and cluster them around what they consider to be their strongest assets—a pattern around the heart signifies a warrior with great endurance, while one along the arms indicates great upper body strength.\n\nYou gain a +1 item bonus to Intimidation checks. If you have Ferocity (such as from the [Orc Ferocity](link_feat_20379) feat or a similar ability), the first time each day you use it, instead of remaining at 1 Hit Point, your Hit Points are set to an amount equal to your ancestry Hit Points, even if this amount is more than you had before using Ferocity.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12253,"type":"item","before":{"id":12253,"bulk":"0","name":"Ooze Ammunition (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2484768822097062","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4433","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"43"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","override":{"damageType":"acid"},"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Text","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Title","selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.CriticalHitText","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Title","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:37.483562+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Ooze ammunition](link_item_12253) is a capsule containing a sticky substance. If you hit a creature with activated [ooze ammunition](link_item_12253), it deals [acid](link_trait_1528) damage instead of its normal damage type, and the creature then takes a -10-foot penalty to Speed and 3d4 persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage until it ends the effects. On a critical hit, the creature is immobilized for 1 round in addition to the other effects. The target can end the effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 29) the sticky foam. Other creatures can provide the actions, although doing so deals half the ammunition's persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to the assisting creature. A creature that ends the effect still takes the persistent damage that turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12253,"bulk":"0","name":"Ooze Ammunition (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2484768822097062","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4433","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"43"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","override":{"damageType":"acid"},"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Text","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Title","selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.CriticalHitText","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Greater.Title","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:37.483562+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Ooze ammunition](link_item_12253) is a capsule containing a sticky substance. If you hit a creature with activated [ooze ammunition](link_item_12253), it deals [acid](link_trait_1528) damage instead of its normal damage type, and the creature then takes a -10-foot penalty to Speed and 3d4 persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage until it ends the effects. On a critical hit, the creature is immobilized for 1 round in addition to the other effects. The target can end the effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 29) the sticky foam. Other creatures can provide the actions, although doing so deals half the ammunition's persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to the assisting creature. A creature that ends the effect still takes the persistent damage that turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12254,"type":"item","before":{"id":12254,"bulk":"0","name":"Ooze Ammunition (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4794371300591972","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":7},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4433","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"43"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","override":{"damageType":"acid"},"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Lesser.Text","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Lesser.Title","selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.CriticalHitText","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Lesser.Title","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:38.127762+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Ooze ammunition](link_item_12254) is a capsule containing a sticky substance. If you hit a creature with activated [ooze ammunition](link_item_12254), it deals [acid](link_trait_1528) damage instead of its normal damage type, and the creature then takes a -5-foot penalty to Speed and 1d4 persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage until it ends the effects. On a critical hit, the creature is immobilized for 1 round in addition to the other effects. The target can end the effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 16) the sticky foam. Other creatures can provide the actions, although doing so deals half the ammunition's persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to the assisting creature. A creature that ends the effect still takes the persistent damage that turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12254,"bulk":"0","name":"Ooze Ammunition (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4794371300591972","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":7},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage"