that ends the effect still takes the persistent damage that turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12256,"bulk":"0","name":"Ooze Ammunition (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2033114112023663","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":42},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1528,1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4433","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"43"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"DamageDice","override":{"damageType":"acid"},"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Moderate.Text","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Moderate.Title","selector":"{item|_id}-damage"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.CriticalHitText","title":"PF2E.AmmunitionNotes.OozeAmmunition.Moderate.Title","outcome":["criticalSuccess"],"selector":"{item|_id}-damage"}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:39.265436+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Ooze ammunition](link_item_12256) is a capsule containing a sticky substance. If you hit a creature with activated [ooze ammunition](link_item_12256), it deals [acid](link_trait_1528) damage instead of its normal damage type, and the creature then takes a -10-foot penalty to Speed and 2d4 persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage until it ends the effects. On a critical hit, the creature is immobilized for 1 round in addition to the other effects. The target can end the effects by [Escaping](link_action_19632) (DC 20) the sticky foam. Other creatures can provide the actions, although doing so deals half the ammunition's persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) damage to the assisting creature. A creature that ends the effect still takes the persistent damage that turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12257,"type":"item","before":{"id":12257,"bulk":"1","name":"Ooze Skin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6102887496852490","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4513","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leather-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:39.926174+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [leather armor](link_item_7068) has been treated with extract from [oozes](link_trait_2448), which can be reactivated in the presence of a strong [acid](link_trait_1528). A receptacle in the armor can hold an [acid flask](link_item_6671), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded suit of [ooze skin](link_item_12257) can be activated to cause the leather to weep slippery protoplasm, granting an item bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) and [Squeeze](link_action_21205) checks equal to the [acid flask](link_item_6671)'s item bonus. The protoplasm also irritates the skin on prolonged contact, causing any creature that [grapples](link_action_19725) or swallows you to take [acid](link_trait_1528) damage equal to the [acid flask](link_item_6671)'s [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. [Ooze skin](link_item_12257) remains activated for a number of rounds equal to the level of the [acid flask](link_item_6671) installed. The effects consume the [acid flask](link_item_6671), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12257,"bulk":"1","name":"Ooze Skin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6102887496852490","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4513","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"64"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":4,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":0,"base_item":"leather-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:39.926174+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis [leather armor](link_item_7068) has been treated with extract from [oozes](link_trait_2448), which can be reactivated in the presence of a strong [acid](link_trait_1528). A receptacle in the armor can hold an [acid flask](link_item_6671), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. A loaded suit of [ooze skin](link_item_12257) can be activated to cause the leather to weep slippery protoplasm, granting an item bonus to [Escape](link_action_19632) and [Squeeze](link_action_21205) checks equal to the [acid flask](link_item_6671)'s item bonus. The protoplasm also irritates the skin on prolonged contact, causing any creature that [grapples](link_action_19725) or swallows you to take [acid](link_trait_1528) damage equal to the [acid flask](link_item_6671)'s [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. [Ooze skin](link_item_12257) remains activated for a number of rounds equal to the level of the [acid flask](link_item_6671) installed. The effects consume the [acid flask](link_item_6671), and once the reaction has begun it can't be deactivated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12258,"type":"item","before":{"id":12258,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oracular Crown","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"785496947467595","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4861","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:40.567766+00:00","operations":[{"id":"9b79e4ab-b67f-4ef7-9ecb-f0dac749ed48","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Patterns themed to your curse cover your [oracular crown](link_item_12258). As your curse worsens, the appearance of the crown changes, introducing extreme angles, stronger colors, or other indications of the intensity of your curse. Similarly, it gets closer to its natural form when you reduce the effects of your curse. You gain a +2 item bonus to Religion checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast an [oracle](link_trait_3631) [revelation](link_trait_1907) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [healing](link_trait_1442), [vitality](link_trait_1478)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your cursebound value is 1 or higher; **Effect** You regain 3d8 Hit Points. The amount of [healing](link_trait_1442) increases to 5d8 if you’re cursebound 2, 7d8 if you’re cursebound 3, or 9d8 if you’re cursebound 4. If you have the [void healing](link_physical-feature_27438) ability, this activation has the [void](link_trait_1485) trait instead of the [healing](link_trait_1442) and [vitality](link_trait_1478) traits.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an [oracle](link_class_112)."},"after":{"id":12258,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Oracular Crown","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"785496947467595","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1200},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1475,1526,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4861","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"religion"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:40.567766+00:00","operations":[{"id":"9b79e4ab-b67f-4ef7-9ecb-f0dac749ed48","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_RELIGION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Patterns themed to your curse cover your [oracular crown](link_item_12258). As your curse worsens, the appearance of the crown changes, introducing extreme angles, stronger colors, or other indications of the intensity of your curse. Similarly, it gets closer to its natural form when you reduce the effects of your curse. You gain a +2 item bonus to Religion checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast an [oracle](link_trait_3631) [revelation](link_trait_1907) spell. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [healing](link_trait_1442), [vitality](link_trait_1478)) **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your cursebound value is 1 or higher; **Effect** You regain 3d8 Hit Points. The amount of [healing](link_trait_1442) increases to 5d8 if you’re cursebound 2, 7d8 if you’re cursebound 3, or 9d8 if you’re cursebound 4. If you have the [void healing](link_physical-feature_27438) ability, this activation has the [void](link_trait_1485) trait instead of the [healing](link_trait_1442) and [vitality](link_trait_1478) traits.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an [oracle](link_class_112)."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12259,"type":"item","before":{"id":12259,"bulk":"1","name":"Ouroboros Buckles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"177345690196808","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"cp":"","gp":40000,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2873,1582,1527,1504,1599],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6926,"name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","rune":{"id":6926,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":860967069707925,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1650},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:47.066606+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 5 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the [rune](link_item_7716). Multiple [energy-resistant runes](link_item_6927) can be etched onto a suit of armor; rather than using only the strongest effect, each must provide resistance to a different damage type. For instance, a [+2](link_item_6720) [acid-resistant](link_item_6927) [greater fire-resistant](link_item_6926) [breastplate](link_item_6765) would give you [acid](link_trait_1528) resistance 5 and [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}}],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4383","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"buckle-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":11818,"bulk":"1","name":"Buckle Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1518090259431343,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2873,1582],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:49.511135+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Absalom style once led famous adventurers to wear clothing with an unusual number of buckles, pouches, and straps. This fashion birthed a trend that led to \"buckle armor,\" a colloquial name for chic armor with spacious tool storage. Buckle armor comes with the storage armor adjustment.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:41.131223+00:00","operations":[{"id":"a27eea47-e0c3-460c-bc3a-34f94e361444","data":{"value":"acid,10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"This ominous-looking [_+3_](link_item_6721) [_greater resilient_](link_item_7701) [_greater acid‑resistant_](link_item_6926) [_buckle armor_](link_item_11818) is deep red in color, favored by assassins who worship Norgorber or Asmodeus, and if unfastened, the many belts and buckles writhe like living snakes. Its form and abilities were inspired by [ouroboros](link_creature_11759), embodiments of eternity that continually consume and regenerate their bodies and appear to be formed from masses of snakes. _[Ouroboros buckles](link_item_12259)_ have the [comfort](link_trait_1599) trait. However, while wearing _[ouroboros buckles](link_item_12259)_, the unfathomable concept of infinity pulls at your mind, and each time you awaken, you’d swear the armor hissed into your ear while you were asleep. The hissing suggested secret wisdom to you in [Aklo](link_language_93), though you only ever remember it vaguely, like a fading dream.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You call forth the cursed regenerative blood of an [ouroboros](link_creature_11759) to recover from your wounds. You gain regeneration 15 for 1 minute; [fire](link_trait_1542) damage deactivates this regeneration. Each time you regain Hit Points from this regeneration, if you’re in your normal form, you collapse into a Large [swarm](link_trait_2413) of Tiny snakes. This is a [polymorph](link_trait_1453) effect that changes you into a battle form.\n\nWhen you’re a [swarm](link_trait_2413) of snakes, you gain [low-light vision](link_sense_19330), [imprecise scent](link_sense_20773) (30 feet), a Speed of 20 feet, a climb Speed of 20 feet, and a swim Speed of 20 feet. You have an AC of 16 + your level and ignore your armor’s check penalty and Speed reduction. Also, you gain resistance 5 to physical damage and weakness 5 to area damage and [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. You can use none of your normal [Strikes](link_action_19856). Instead, you can use Swarming Bites, a single action that deals 4d4 piercing damage plus 2d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage to creatures in your space with a DC 41 basic Reflex save.\n\nIf you’re in this battle form and are already at full HP when your regeneration occurs, the snakes instantaneously slither together, and you transform into your original form.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** A foe within 15 feet hits you with a [Strike](link_action_19856) that deals slashing or piercing damage; **Effect** Your _[ouroboros buckles](link_item_12259)_ spray acidic blood in a 15-foot cone toward the foe, dealing 5d6 [acid](link_trait_1528) damage with a DC 41 basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":12259,"bulk":"1","name":"Ouroboros Buckles","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"177345690196808","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"cp":"","gp":40000,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[2873,1582,1527,1504,1599],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":6926,"name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","rune":{"id":6926,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":860967069707925,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1650},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:47.066606+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 5 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the [rune](link_item_7716). Multiple [energy-resistant runes](link_item_6927) can be etched onto a suit of armor; rather than using only the strongest effect, each must provide resistance to a different damage type. For instance, a [+2](link_item_6720) [acid-resistant](link_item_6927) [greater fire-resistant](link_item_6926) [breastplate](link_item_6765) would give you [acid](link_trait_1528) resistance 5 and [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}}],"resilient":2},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4383","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"buckle-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":11818,"bulk":"1","name":"Buckle Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1518090259431343,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":4},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2873,1582],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:14:49.511135+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Absalom style once led famous adventurers to wear clothing with an unusual number of buckles, pouches, and straps. This fashion birthed a trend that led to \"buckle armor,\" a colloquial name for chic armor with spacious tool storage. Buckle armor comes with the storage armor adjustment.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:41.131223+00:00","operations":[{"id":"a27eea47-e0c3-460c-bc3a-34f94e361444","data":{"value":"acid,10","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"This ominous-looking [_+3_](link_item_6721) [_greater resilient_](link_item_7701) [_greater acid‑resistant_](link_item_6926) [_buckle armor_](link_item_11818) is deep red in col