 damage to creatures in your space with a DC 41 basic Reflex save.\n\nIf you’re in this battle form and are already at full HP when your regeneration occurs, the snakes instantaneously slither together, and you transform into your original form.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** A foe within 15 feet hits you with a [Strike](link_action_19856) that deals slashing or piercing damage; **Effect** Your _[ouroboros buckles](link_item_12259)_ spray acidic blood in a 15-foot cone toward the foe, dealing 5d6 [acid](link_trait_1528) damage with a DC 41 basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12260,"type":"item","before":{"id":12260,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Owl Screech Egg","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4791592579266294","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":60,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1486,1487,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1924","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"50"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:41.650691+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nNot only are the eggs of giant owls delicious when boiled, but when infused with a mix of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) reagents, they also make you emit a long and terrifying screech. All creatures in a 30-foot emanation must attempt a DC 23 Will save. Regardless of the result, creatures in the area are temporarily immune to this screech for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is frightened 1.\n\n**Failure** The creature is frightened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is frightened 3 and fleeing for 1 round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12260,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Owl Screech Egg","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4791592579266294","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":60,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1469,1531,1486,1487,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1924","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"50"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:41.650691+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nNot only are the eggs of giant owls delicious when boiled, but when infused with a mix of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) reagents, they also make you emit a long and terrifying screech. All creatures in a 30-foot emanation must attempt a DC 23 Will save. Regardless of the result, creatures in the area are temporarily immune to this screech for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is frightened 1.\n\n**Failure** The creature is frightened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is frightened 3 and fleeing for 1 round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12261,"type":"item","before":{"id":12261,"bulk":"0","name":"Pacifying","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7405266756836498","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4403","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:42.193552+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune turns weapons into instruments of peacemaking.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [mental](link_trait_1448)); **Trigger** You damage a creature with the etched weapon; **Effect** The damaged creature must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be pacified. A pacified creature takes a –2 penalty to attack rolls on any attacks that aren't [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) for 1 minute, and the creature also experiences a clear psychic warning that they should stop making attacks that could kill.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12261,"bulk":"0","name":"Pacifying","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7405266756836498","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4403","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:42.193552+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune turns weapons into instruments of peacemaking.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [mental](link_trait_1448)); **Trigger** You damage a creature with the etched weapon; **Effect** The damaged creature must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be pacified. A pacified creature takes a –2 penalty to attack rolls on any attacks that aren't [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) for 1 minute, and the creature also experiences a clear psychic warning that they should stop making attacks that could kill.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12262,"type":"item","before":{"id":12262,"bulk":"0","name":"Pactmaster's Grace","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4485302054940647","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4000},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4876","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"153"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","slug":"pactmasters-grace-saves","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["terrain:urban"]},{"key":"AdjustModifier","mode":"override","slug":"pactmasters-grace-saves","value":3,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["skill:soc:rank:4"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["mercantile","mercantile-lore","lore-mercantile"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:42.72471+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Granted by Katapesh's Pactmasters to influential merchants, exceptional [Zephyr Guards](link_archetype_169), and favorite retainers, a pactmaster's grace is a crystal-studded blue platinum ring that sharpens the wearer's urban instincts. While invested, the ring grants a +2 item bonus to saving throws while you are in an urban setting, and this increases to a +3 item bonus if you have legendary proficiency in Guild Lore, Katapesh Lore, Mercantile Lore, or Society. You also gain a +3 item bonus to Mercantile Lore checks while wearing the ring, and you can attempt checks that require a proficiency rank of master in Society.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12262,"bulk":"0","name":"Pactmaster's Grace","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4485302054940647","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4000},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4876","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"153"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","slug":"pactmasters-grace-saves","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["terrain:urban"]},{"key":"AdjustModifier","mode":"override","slug":"pactmasters-grace-saves","value":3,"selector":"saving-throw","predicate":["skill:soc:rank:4"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["mercantile","mercantile-lore","lore-mercantile"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:42.72471+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Granted by Katapesh's Pactmasters to influential merchants, exceptional [Zephyr Guards](link_archetype_169), and favorite retainers, a pactmaster's grace is a crystal-studded blue platinum ring that sharpens the wearer's urban instincts. While invested, the ring grants a +2 item bonus to saving throws while you are in an urban setting, and this increases to a +3 item bonus if you have legendary proficiency in Guild Lore, Katapesh Lore, Mercantile Lore, or Society. You also gain a +3 item bonus to Mercantile Lore checks while wearing the ring, and you can attempt checks that require a proficiency rank of master in Society.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12263,"type":"item","before":{"id":12263,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pale Fade","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5948113490346242","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4543","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:43.44429+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Pale fade](link_item_12263) is a white ointment with a sharp, earthy scent. The [poison](link_trait_1476) rapidly desiccates flesh, which then crumbles and forms a cloud of pallid dust. If the victim is concealed by this [poison](link_trait_1476), then the cloud of dust also conceals other creatures from the victim.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 42 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 10d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and drained 1 (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 12d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, drained 1, and concealed (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 15d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, drained 1, and concealed (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12263,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pale Fade","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5948113490346242","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"leve