":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:44.469387+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This weapon has practical uses in both farming and butchering, thanks to the efficiency and brutality of its forward-curving blade. It can be wielded in one or two hands.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12264,"bulk":"1","name":"Panabas","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2052161924582803","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1598,1562,1644],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"axe","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=616","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:44.469387+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This weapon has practical uses in both farming and butchering, thanks to the efficiency and brutality of its forward-curving blade. It can be wielded in one or two hands.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12265,"type":"item","before":{"id":12265,"bulk":"0","name":"Pathfinder's Mentor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6948521012649579","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4928","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"196"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"skill-check","option":"compass-in-possession","requiresEquipped":false}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:45.022347+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +15; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Pathfinder Lore +15, Society +13, Survival +13\n\n**Int** +3, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +1\n\n**Will** +14\n\nA [Pathfinder's mentor](link_item_12265) is a [wayfinder](link_item_7949) that has developed sapience. It has two aeon stone slots, and both stones grant their resonant powers without interfering with each other. If both slots are filled, the [wayfinder](link_item_7949) and two stones count as two items toward your investiture limit. Most [Pathfinder's mentors](link_item_12265) are eager explorers that object to staying in one location for long, urging their bearers toward ancient ruins to explore, relics to study, and discoveries to make. To this end, the [wayfinder](link_item_7949) acts as a guide, making Survival checks on your behalf during your travels. A [Pathfinder's mentor](link_item_12265) also has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The [wayfinder](link_item_7949) casts *[know the way](link_spell_4695)* on you.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [wayfinder](link_item_7949) casts *[wanderer's guide](link_spell_6786)* on you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12265,"bulk":"0","name":"Pathfinder's Mentor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6948521012649579","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4928","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"196"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"skill-check","option":"compass-in-possession","requiresEquipped":false}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:45.022347+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +15; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Pathfinder Lore +15, Society +13, Survival +13\n\n**Int** +3, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +1\n\n**Will** +14\n\nA [Pathfinder's mentor](link_item_12265) is a [wayfinder](link_item_7949) that has developed sapience. It has two aeon stone slots, and both stones grant their resonant powers without interfering with each other. If both slots are filled, the [wayfinder](link_item_7949) and two stones count as two items toward your investiture limit. Most [Pathfinder's mentors](link_item_12265) are eager explorers that object to staying in one location for long, urging their bearers toward ancient ruins to explore, relics to study, and discoveries to make. To this end, the [wayfinder](link_item_7949) acts as a guide, making Survival checks on your behalf during your travels. A [Pathfinder's mentor](link_item_12265) also has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The [wayfinder](link_item_7949) casts *[know the way](link_spell_4695)* on you.\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The [wayfinder](link_item_7949) casts *[wanderer's guide](link_spell_6786)* on you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12266,"type":"item","before":{"id":12266,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Perfected Robes","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3737331301044921","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":22,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4893","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"179"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:45.643943+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These unadorned white robes, fastened with simple brass pins in the shape of a human hand, can't be soiled or blemished. While wearing _[perfected robes](link_item_12266)_, you don't need to eat, sleep, or drink, but you can if you choose to. The robes bless you with constant *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* (+32 [counteract](link_action_27519) bonus). A creature who dons these robes without earning them is clumsy 3, enfeebled 3, and stupefied 3 while wearing them, gaining the *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* but otherwise unable to use the robes' magic.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to attempt a d20 roll with which you have legendary proficiency, roll twice and take the better result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast *[avatar](link_spell_4407)*, gaining the abilities for Irori.\n\n**Destruction** If the wearer ever willingly turns from the path of self-perfection into corruption or overindulgence, their _[perfected robes](link_item_12266)_ crumble to nothing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12266,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Perfected Robes","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3737331301044921","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":22,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1475,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4893","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"179"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:45.643943+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These unadorned white robes, fastened with simple brass pins in the shape of a human hand, can't be soiled or blemished. While wearing _[perfected robes](link_item_12266)_, you don't need to eat, sleep, or drink, but you can if you choose to. The robes bless you with constant *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* (+32 [counteract](link_action_27519) bonus). A creature who dons these robes without earning them is clumsy 3, enfeebled 3, and stupefied 3 while wearing them, gaining the *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* but otherwise unable to use the robes' magic.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to attempt a d20 roll with which you have legendary proficiency, roll twice and take the better result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast *[avatar](link_spell_4407)*, gaining the abilities for Irori.\n\n**Destruction** If the wearer ever willingly turns from the path of self-perfection into corruption or overindulgence, their _[perfected robes](link_item_12266)_ crumble to nothing.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12267,"type":"item","before":{"id":12267,"bulk":"2","name":"Phalanx Piercer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1594951566141251","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1+","level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3073,3611,1579,2862,1684],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"bow","range":80,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d10","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=656","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"31"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:46.439206+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Phalanx Piercer Bolts](link_item_19878)\n\n* * *\n\nThis massive bow is made from bone or wood reinforced with flexible metal strips and strung with reinforced cord. Designed by [hobgoblin](link_ancestry_141) engineers to take down shielded opponents, the [phalanx piercer](link_item_12267) fires heavy, iron-shod bolts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12267,"bulk":"2","name":"Phalanx Piercer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1594951566141251","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1+","level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3073,3611,1579,2862,1684],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"bow","range":80,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d10","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=656","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"31"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:46.439206+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Phalanx Piercer Bolts](link_item_19878)\n\n* * *\n\nThis massive bow is made from bone or wood reinforced with flexible metal strips and strung with reinforced cord. Designed by [hobgoblin](link_ancestry_141) engineers to take down shielded opponents, the [phalanx piercer](link_item_12267) fires heavy, iron-shod bolts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12268,"type":"item","before":{"id":12268,"bulk":"0","name":"Phantasmal Doorknob (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5410365812521777","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1486,1504,1448,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4769","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"127"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":27}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:47.061854+00:00","operations":[{"id":"90ec64dc-5f7e-4297-8ee3-5e6ef40b39bb","da