 one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12279,"type":"item","before":{"id":12279,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Piston Gauntlets","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1919944863504598","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":2800},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1833,1573,1595,3074],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":6961,"name":"Flaming"}],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4405","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"34"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","domain":"damage","option":"piston-gauntlet","toggleable":true},{"key":"DamageDice","selector":"{item|_id}-damage","predicate":["piston-gauntlet"],"diceNumber":2}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:55.956615+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The striking surface of this _[+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [flaming](link_item_6961) [pantograph gauntlet](link_item_13513)_ releases a puff of [fire](link_trait_1542) each time it reaches the end of its linkage.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You supercharge the gauntlet's attack. Make a melee [Strike](link_action_19856). This counts as two attacks when calculating your multiple attack penalty. If this [Strike](link_action_19856) hits, you deal an extra two dice of weapon damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12279,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Piston Gauntlets","size":"MEDIUM","