12284) is a zesty, sweet rock candy that pops and crackles in your mouth. For 1 hour, you have a +3 item bonus to saving throws against [poison](link_trait_1476) and being petrified.\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([poison](link_trait_1476))\n\n**Effect** You bite the [poison fizz](link_item_12284) to release its poisonous liquid center and spray green mist in a 15-foot cone. This deals 5d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage with a DC 34 basic Reflex save. A creature that critically fails is also blinded until the end of your next turn and is then temporarily immune to being blinded by [poison fizz](link_item_12284) for 1 hour.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12284,"bulk":"0","name":"Poison Fizz (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4708729184163253","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4459","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:59.751512+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nMade from a special mixture of honey and [alchemical](link_trait_1529) reagents, [poison fizz](link_item_12284) is a zesty, sweet rock candy that pops and crackles in your mouth. For 1 hour, you have a +3 item bonus to saving throws against [poison](link_trait_1476) and being petrified.\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([poison](link_trait_1476))\n\n**Effect** You bite the [poison fizz](link_item_12284) to release its p