earing footwear with the rune, you can walk on the surface of water and other liquids without falling through. This offers no protection against damage the liquid deals. You can go under the liquid's surface, but you must [Swim](link_action_19859) if you do.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12288,"bulk":"0","name":"Pontoon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4293442266083176","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":650},"usage":"applied-to-footwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4834","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:04.871683+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Footwear with _[pontoon runes](link_item_12288)_ allows you to traverse waterways with ease. While wearing footwear with the rune, you can walk on the surface of water and other liquids without falling through. This offers no protection against damage the liquid deals. You can go under the liquid's surface, but you must [Swim](link_action_19859) if you do.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12289,"type":"item","before":{"id":12289,"bulk":"0","name":"Poracha Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7617181952430441","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4573","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:05.513598+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Folklore from near the Forest of Spirits tells of the origin of the _[poracha fulu](link_item_12289)_. Once, a traveler saved an eight-legged feline who turned out to be a [poracha](link_creature_10250) prince. In return, the prince gave the traveler a fulu that later prevented a fast-acting [poison](link_trait_1476) from slaying them. Traditionally, one wears a string of up to nine _[poracha fulus](link_item_12289)_, which counts as one talisman. Each time you take persistent damage, one _[poracha fulu](link_item_12289)_ affixed to you negates the damage and crumbles to dust. This response is automatic, but you can use a free action (envision) to prevent your fulus from responding. If you do, any _[poracha fulus](link_item_12289)_ affixed to you never respond to that persistent damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12289,"bulk":"0","name":"Poracha Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7617181952430441","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4573","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:05.513598+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Folklore from near the Forest of Spirits tells of the origin of the _[poracha fulu](link_item_12289)_. Once, a traveler saved an eight-legged feline who turned out to be a [poracha](link_creature_10250) prince. In return, the prince gave the traveler a fulu that later prevented a fast-acting [poison](link_trait_1476) from slaying them. Traditionally, one wears a string of up to nine _[poracha fulus](link_item_12289)_, which counts as one talisman. Each time you take persistent damage, one _[poracha fulu](link_item_12289)_ affixed to you negates the damage and crumbles to dust. This response is automatic, but you can use a free action (envision) to prevent your fulus from responding. If you do, any _[poracha fulus](link_item_12289)_ affixed to you never respond to that persistent damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12290,"type":"item","before":{"id":12290,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Planar Tunnel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1384128395603637","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{"ignored":1000000,"capacity":1000000,"held_or_stowed":0.1},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2195","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"115"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:06.14311+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A complex, collapsible mechanism forms the outer surface of a _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_. It’s linked to a passageway that can be accessed if the tunnel is fully opened. The passage is [extradimensional](link_trait_1559), but borders another plane of existence. Each _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_ is keyed to one specific plane.\n\nIf another [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space is opened inside the _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_, rather than deactivating either item as typical for [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) spaces, a rift to the keyed plane tears open and destroys both items. Any creature or unattended object in the [planar tunnel](link_item_12290) is instantly transported to the keyed plane, though a creature can avoid this by succeeding at a DC 30 Reflex save.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You open the collapsed mechanism to fully open the tunnel, revealing an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space that stays in place. The tunnel is 6 feet across—just big enough to cover a 5-foot square—and 10 feet deep. The passage’s depth is perpendicular to the surface, so it’s most commonly placed on a floor to make a hole straight down or on a wall to create a horizontal passage through it. The atmosphere is hospitable to travel even if the keyed plane wouldn’t be.\n\nAnyone adjacent to either edge of the tunnel can [Interact](link_action_19733) to collapse the opening. This closes both entrances to the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space. Any objects or creatures within the tunnel remain inside, and any that can’t fit fully inside are ejected into the nearest open space. No matter how many items are in the [planar tunnel](link_item_12290), its Bulk never changes. Items can be stowed or retrieved only while the tunnel is fully open. When the tunnel is closed, the interior remains a stable environment for 10 minutes, after which any creature or object inside is subjected to the environment of the keyed plane as it seeps through the boundary. A living creature placed inside can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) against a DC of 13. An item inside the tunnel provides no benefits unless it’s retrieved first. Anything in the tunnel can’t be detected by magic that detects only things on the same plane.\n\n**Special** A _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_ can be used as a planar key for the *[interplanar teleport](link_spell_4687)* spell, and has the same rarity as the key, as specified in the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12290,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Planar Tunnel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1384128395603637","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1559,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{"ignored":1000000,"capacity":1000000,"held_or_stowed":0.1},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2195","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"115"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:06.14311+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A complex, collapsible mechanism forms the outer surface of a _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_. It’s linked to a passageway that can be accessed if the tunnel is fully opened. The passage is [extradimensional](link_trait_1559), but borders another plane of existence. Each _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_ is keyed to one specific plane.\n\nIf another [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space is opened inside the _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_, rather than deactivating either item as typical for [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) spaces, a rift to the keyed plane tears open and destroys both items. Any creature or unattended object in the [planar tunnel](link_item_12290) is instantly transported to the keyed plane, though a creature can avoid this by succeeding at a DC 30 Reflex save.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Effect** You open the collapsed mechanism to fully open the tunnel, revealing an [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space that stays in place. The tunnel is 6 feet across—just big enough to cover a 5-foot square—and 10 feet deep. The passage’s depth is perpendicular to the surface, so it’s most commonly placed on a floor to make a hole straight down or on a wall to create a horizontal passage through it. The atmosphere is hospitable to travel even if the keyed plane wouldn’t be.\n\nAnyone adjacent to either edge of the tunnel can [Interact](link_action_19733) to collapse the opening. This closes both entrances to the [extradimensional](link_trait_1559) space. Any objects or creatures within the tunnel remain inside, and any that can’t fit fully inside are ejected into the nearest open space. No matter how many items are in the [planar tunnel](link_item_12290), its Bulk never changes. Items can be stowed or retrieved only while the tunnel is fully open. When the tunnel is closed, the interior remains a stable environment for 10 minutes, after which any creature or object inside is subjected to the environment of the keyed plane as it seeps through the boundary. A living creature placed inside can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) against a DC of 13. An item inside the tunnel provides no benefits unless it’s retrieved first. Anything in the tunnel can’t be detected by magic that detects only things on the same plane.\n\n**Special** A _[planar tunnel](link_item_12290)_ can be used as a planar key for the *[interplanar teleport](link_spell_4687)* spell, and has the same rarity as the key, as specified in the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12291,"type":"item","before":{"id":12291,"bulk":"0","name":"Portable","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7109691710054729","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":660},"usage":"etched-onto-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4368","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:06.804866+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune allows your armor to collapse into a disguised, portable form.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You doff your armor, which folds into another wearable object, such as a bangle or amulet with light Bulk. This wearable object has features that hint at the armor it hides. You aren't wearing the armor while it's in this form, but at the GM's discretion, you can still activate properties that might feasibly come from the wearable item the armor has become. If the armor is in its portable form, you can use this activation to revert it to armor, which you can don in 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12291,"bulk":"0","name":"Portable","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7109691710054729","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":660},"usage":"etched-onto-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4368","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:06.804866+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune allows your armor to collapse into a disguised, portable form.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You doff your armor, which folds into another wearable object, such as a bangle or amulet with light Bulk. This wearable object has features that hint at the armor it hides. You aren't wearing the armor while it's in this form, but at the GM's discretion, you can still activate properties that might feasibly come from the wearable item the armor has become. If the armor is in its portable form, you can use this activation to revert it to armor, which you can don in 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12292,"type":"item","before":{"id":12292,"bulk":"0","name":"Potion Patch (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"679332763263936","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4656","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:07.47214+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Requirements** You must have the _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ affixed to your skin.\n\n* * *\n\nA _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ is a sticky, bandage-like pad that can be filled with one [potion](link_trait_1565) of any level and affixed to the skin. Filling the patch and affixing it is a 1-minute activity that takes two hands and has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait. When you Activate the patch, the [potion](link_trait_1565) affects you without you needing to have the [potion](link_trait_1565) in your hand. The patch's magic is negated after it's used, the next time you make your daily preparations, or when another _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ is affixed to you, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12292,"bulk":"0","name":"Potion Patch (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"679332763263936","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4656","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:07.47214+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Requirements** You must have the _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ affixed to your skin.\n\n* * *\n\nA _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ is a sticky, bandage-like pad that can be filled with one [potion](link_trait_1565) of any level and affixed to the skin. Filling the patch and affixing it is a 1-minute activity that takes two hands and has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait. When you Activate the patch, the [potion](link_trait_1565) affects you without you needing to have the [potion](link_trait_1565) in your hand. The patch's magic is negated after it's used, the next time you make your daily preparations, or when another _[potion patch](link_item_12292)_ is affixed to you, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12293,"type":"item","before":{"id":12293,"bulk":"0","name":"Potion Patch (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3130517933685411","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4656","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T03:19:27.997Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:08.045312+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** You must have the _[potion patch](link_item_12293)_ affixed to your skin.\n\n* * *\n\nA _[potion patch](link_item_12293)_ is a sticky, bandage-like pad that can be filled with one [potion](link_trait_1565) and affixed to the skin. Filling the patch and affixing it is a 1-minute activity that takes two hands and has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait. A patch has a maximum level of [potion](link_trait_1565) it can absorb, depending on the patch's type. When you Activate the patch, the [potion](link_trait_1565) affects you without you needing to have the [potion](link_trait_1565) in your hand. The patch's magic is negated after it's used, the next time you make your daily preparations, or when another _[potion patch](link_item_12293)_ is affixed to you, whichever comes first.\n\nThe [potion](link_trait_1565) must be 10th level or lower.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12293,"bulk":"0","name":"Potion Patch (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3130517933685411","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","di