category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:08.981471+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** You must have the _[potion patch](link_item_12294)_ affixed to your skin.\n\n* * *\n\nA _[potion patch](link_item_12294)_ is a sticky, bandage-like pad that can be filled with one [potion](link_trait_1565) and affixed to the skin. Filling the patch and affixing it is a 1-minute activity that takes two hands and has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait. A patch has a maximum level of [potion](link_trait_1565) it can absorb, depending on the patch's type. When you Activate the patch, the [potion](link_trait_1565) affects you without you needing to have the [potion](link_trait_1565) in your hand. The patch's magic is negated after it's used, the next time you make your daily preparations, or when another _[potion patch](link_item_12294)_ is affixed to you, whichever comes first.\n\nThe [potion](link_trait_1565) must be 15th level or lower.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12295,"type":"item","before":{"id":12295,"bulk":"4","name":"Powered Full Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4095704636800051","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1529,1594],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4515","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"full-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":6985,"bulk":"4","name":"Full Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":2956369100729206,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1594],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"full-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:04:44.975791+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Plate mail consists of interlocking plates that encase nearly the entire body in a carapace of steel. It is costly and heavy, and the wearer often requires help to don it correctly, but it provides some of the best defense armor can supply. A suit of this armor comes with an undercoat of [padded armor](link_item_7635) and a pair of [gauntlets.](link_item_6987)","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:09.571208+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Stasian actuators help the limbs of this [full plate](link_item_6985) move of their own accord, as long as they're supplied with power. A chamber in the chest plate can hold a single [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** A [bottled lightning](link_item_16068) is installed in the armor; **Effect** The armor powers up for 10 minutes. While it’s powered up, add the [bottled lightning](link_item_16068)’s item bonus to your Athletics checks to [Force Open](link_action_19722), [High Jump](link_action_19727), [Long Jump](link_action_19738), and [Shove](link_action_19849). The armor’s Strength requirement is lowered by 1, or by 2 if the loaded [bottled lightning](link_item_16068)’s item bonus to attack rolls is +3 or higher. The armor’s normal penalties still apply, based on this altered Strength. The activation uses up the [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), and the armor can’t be activated again until a new one is installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12295,"bulk":"4","name":"Powered Full Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4095704636800051","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1529,1594],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4515","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"full-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":6985,"bulk":"4","name":"Full Plate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":2956369100729206,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1594],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"plate","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":0,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":6,"category":"heavy","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":4,"base_item":"full-plate","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-3,"speed_penalty":-10,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:04:44.975791+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Plate mail consists of interlocking plates that encase nearly the entire body in a carapace of steel. It is costly and heavy, and the wearer often requires help to don it correctly, but it provides some of the best defense armor can supply. A suit of this armor comes with an undercoat of [padded armor](link_item_7635) and a pair of [gauntlets.](link_item_6987)","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:09.571208+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Stasian actuators help the limbs of this [full plate](link_item_6985) move of their own accord, as long as they're supplied with power. A chamber in the chest plate can hold a single [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), which takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** A [bottled lightning](link_item_16068) is installed in the armor; **Effect** The armor powers up for 10 minutes. While it’s powered up, add the [bottled lightning](link_item_16068)’s item bonus to your Athletics checks to [Force Open](link_action_19722), [High Jump](link_action_19727), [Long Jump](link_action_19738), and [Shove](link_action_19849). The armor’s Strength requirement is lowered by 1, or by 2 if the loaded [bottled lightning](link_item_16068)’s item bonus to attack rolls is +3 or higher. The armor’s normal penalties still apply, based on this altered Strength. The activation uses up the [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), and the armor can’t be activated again until a new one is installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12296,"type":"item","before":{"id":12296,"bulk":"0","name":"Preserving (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4573827827541575","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"applied-to-a-basket-bag-or-other-container","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4835","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:10.201408+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Preserving runes](link_item_12296)_ are common among merchants and other travelers who are on the road for weeks or months at a time. Any non-[magical](link_trait_1504) food and drink inside a container with a _[greater preserving rune](link_item_12296)_ never spoils. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The container casts *[cleanse cuisine](link_spell_4523)* on all the food and drink within.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12296,"bulk":"0","name":"Preserving (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4573827827541575","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"applied-to-a-basket-bag-or-other-container","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4835","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:10.201408+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Preserving runes](link_item_12296)_ are common among merchants and other travelers who are on the road for weeks or months at a time. Any non-[magical](link_trait_1504) food and drink inside a container with a _[greater preserving rune](link_item_12296)_ never spoils. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The container casts *[cleanse cuisine](link_spell_4523)* on all the food and drink within.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12297,"type":"item","before":{"id":12297,"bulk":"0","name":"Preserving","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3271266584957560","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":45},"usage":"applied-to-a-basket-bag-or-other-container","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4835","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:10.820349+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Preserving runes](link_item_12297)_ are common among merchants and other travelers who are on the road for weeks or months at a time. Any non-magical food and drink inside a container with a _[preserving rune](link_item_12297)_ remains fresher for longer, taking ten times as long to spoil. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12297,"bulk":"0","name":"Preserving","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3271266584957560","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":45},"usage":"applied-to-a-basket-bag-or-other-container","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4835","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"144"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:10.820349+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Preserving runes](link_item_12297)_ are common among merchants and other travelers who are on the road for weeks or months at a time. Any non-magical food and drink inside a container with a _[preserving rune](link_item_12297)_ remains fresher for longer, taking ten times as long to spoil. This feature doesn't prolong the duration of [alchemical](link_trait_1529) items.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12298,"type":"item","before":{"id":12298,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pucker Pickle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"111624220912381","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4460","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:39:33.807Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:11.359264+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSharp and pungent, but tasty, [pucker pickles](link_item_12298) were created by [goblin](link_ancestry_6) [alchemists](link_class_107) working to avoid being eaten by larger creatures. For 1 hour after eating a [pucker pickle](link_item_12298), you smell slightly of pickle, but you have a horrendous taste. Once a creature hits you with a [Strike](link_action_19856) using an attack that allows it to taste you, such as a jaws [Strike](link_action_19856), it takes a –2 circumstance penalty to further attacks against you that allow it to taste you, including attacks like [Grapple](link_action_19725) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you using its jaws or Swallowing you Whole. Creatures, especially [animals](link_trait_2409), often choose other targets after tasting you. Any creature that Engulfs you or Swallows you Whole is sickened 1. If it spends an action retching to reduce the sickened condition, you can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) as a reaction.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12298,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pucker Pickle","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"111624220912381","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4460","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:39:33.807Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:11.359264+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSharp and pungent, but tasty, [pucker pickles](link_item_12298) were created by [goblin](link_ancestry_6) [alchemists](link_class_107) working to avoid being eaten by larger creatures. For 1 hour after eating a [pucker pickle](link_item_12298), you smell slightly of pickle, but you have a horrendous taste. Once a creature hits you with a [Strike](link_action_19856) using an attack that allows it to taste you, such as a jaws [Strike](link_action_19856), it takes a –2 circumstance penalty to further attacks against you that allow it to taste you, including attacks like [Grapple](link_action_19725) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you using its jaws or Swallowing you Whole. Creatures, especially [animals](link_trait_2409), often choose other targets after tasting you. Any creature that Engulfs you or Swallows you Whole is sickened 1. If it spends an action retching to reduce the sickened condition, you can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) as a reaction.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12299,"type":"item","before":{"id":12299,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pummel-Growth Toxin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1501044049068081","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":550},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1456,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4544","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:12.030357+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis substance is the result of a failed [alchemical](link_trait_1529) experiment to regrow a severed arm. An extra outsized, uncontrolled limb of the sort used for manipulation grows from the victim's body. The limb initially flails about, throwing the creature off-balance. Once it \"matures,\" the limb pummels the victim instead. The limb can't deal its bludgeoning damage if the victim is unable to take actions. Upon recovery from the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, the extra limb withers and falls off.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 32 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 1, and must succeed at a DC 5 flat check to perform an action with the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait or the action fails and is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 1, slowed 1, 2d6 bludgeoning damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 2, slowed 2, 4d6 bludgeoning damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12299,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pummel-Growth Toxin","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1501044049068081","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":550},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1456,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4544","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:12.030357+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis substance is the result of a failed [alchemical](link_trait_1529) experiment to regrow a severed arm. An extra outsized, uncontrolled limb of the sort used for manipulation grows from the victim's body. The limb initially flails about, throwing the creature off-balance. Once it \"matures,\" the limb pummels the victim instead. The limb can't deal its bludgeoning damage if the victim is unable to take actions. Upon recovery from the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, the extra limb withers and falls off.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 32 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 1, and must succeed at a DC 5 flat check to perform an action with the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait or the action fails and is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 1, slowed 1, 2d6 bludgeoning damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, clumsy 2, slowed 2, 4d6 bludgeoning damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12300,"type":"item","before":{"id":12300,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Purloining Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6161211784809503","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1552,1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4930","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"196"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["acrobatics","stealth"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","label":"Attack from Enemy Reaction due to Movement","value":2,"selector":"ac","predicate":["reaction:movement"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Attack from Enemy Reaction due to Movement","domain":"all","option":"reaction:movement","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:12.537726+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +30; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and two other languages, usually regional and ancestral)\n\n**Skills** Society +31, Thievery +31, Underworld Lore +31\n\n**Int** +5, **Wis** +5, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +30\n\nEach [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) is a [mercurial mantle](link_item_23287) once worn by a legendary thief or two. The cloak became infused with a daredevil spirit and a penchant for high-stakes thievery. If its owner isn't willing to partake in such activities, the cloak tries to convince them to sell or give it to someone who will. A [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) can use tendrils of its cloth to attempt Thievery checks to [Palm an Object](link_action_19743) or [Steal](link_action_19852), proudly offering you its loot later. In addition to those of a [mercurial mantle](link_item_23287), a [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The cloak casts 2nd-rank *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)* on you, usually to your specifications. However the cloak can choose the appearance of the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The cloak assesses the price of valuables it can see. This valuation doesn't include the value of features the cloak can't discern, such as [magical](link_trait_1504) properties.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** An enemy misses you with a melee [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n**Effect** You slip around the attacking creature with ease. You [Step](link_action_19853), without moving away from the triggering enemy, and then make a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) against the triggering enemy if it's within reach. If you do make a [Strike](link_action_19856), the target attempts a DC 38 Perception check before you roll.\n\n**Failure** This creature is off-guard against the [Strike](link_action_19856).\n\n**Critical Failure** This creature is off-guard against all your attacks until the end of their next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [teleportation](link_trait_1470)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The cloak hums with power as you whirl it around yourself, disappearing amid a brief flash of light. Teleport up to double your Speed to a location you can see. At the end of the [teleportation](link_trait_1470), you can make a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature within reach, if there is one.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12300,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Purloining Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6161211784809503","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"worn cloak","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1552,1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4930","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"196"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":["acrobatics","stealth"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","label":"Attack from Enemy Reaction due to Movement","value":2,"selector":"ac","predicate":["reaction:movement"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Attack from Enemy Reaction due to Movement","domain":"all","option":"reaction:movement","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:12.537726+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +30; [precise vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, [imprecise hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and two other languages, usually regional and ancestral)\n\n**Skills** Society +31, Thievery +31, Underworld Lore +31\n\n**Int** +5, **Wis** +5, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +30\n\nEach [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) is a [mercurial mantle](link_item_23287) once worn by a legendary thief or two. The cloak became infused with a daredevil spirit and a penchant for high-stakes thievery. If its owner isn't willing to partake in such activities, the cloak tries to convince them to sell or give it to someone who will. A [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) can use tendrils of its cloth to attempt Thievery checks to [Palm an Object](link_action_19743) or [Steal](link_action_19852), proudly offering you its loot later. In addition to those of a [mercurial mantle](link_item_23287), a [purloining cloak](link_item_12300) has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The cloak casts 2nd-rank *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)* on you, usually to your specifications. However the cloak can choose the appearance of the [illusion](link_trait_1447) for you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** The cloak assesses the price of valuables it can see. This valuation doesn't include the value of features the cloak can't discern, such as [magical](link_trait_1504) properties.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** An enemy misses you with a melee [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n**Effect** You slip around the attacking creature with ease. You [Step](link_action_19853), without moving away from the triggering enemy, and then make a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) against the triggering enemy if it's within reach. If you do make a [Strike](link_action_19856), the target attempts a DC 38 Perception check before you roll.\n\n**Failure** This creature is off-guard against the [Strike](link_action_19856).\n\n**Critical Failure** This creature is off-guard against all your attacks until the end of their next turn.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [teleportation](link_trait_1470)); **Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The cloak hums with power as you whirl it around yourself, disappearing amid a brief flash of light. Teleport up to double your Speed to a location you can see. At the end of the [teleportation](link_trait_1470), you can make a melee [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature within reach, if there is one.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12301,"type":"item","before":{"id":12301,"bulk":"0","name":"Quenching (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6671568798113115","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4369","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:13.098101+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune counters burning and corrosive agents. Armor with this rune reduces the DC of the flat check to end persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage affecting you from 15 to 10 (5 with particularly effective assistance).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id