cription":"This rune counters burning and corrosive agents. Armor with this rune reduces the DC of the flat check to end persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage affecting you from 15 to 8 (3 with particularly effective assistance).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12302,"bulk":"0","name":"Quenching (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2193680577290529","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4369","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T03:49:07.118Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:13.632566+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune counters burning and corrosive agents. Armor with this rune reduces the DC of the flat check to end persistent [acid](link_trait_1528) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage affecting you from 15 to 8 (3 with particularly effective assistance).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12303,"type":"item","before":{"id":12303,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Quenching Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1996762014182022","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":85},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4622","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:14.204608+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\n_[Quenching potion](link_item_12303)_ is a clear liquid that tastes like fresh, cool spring water. Drinking this potion or pouring it over yourself completely hydrates you and cleanses your system. Immediately attempt a flat check to end any persistent [acid](link_trait_1528), [fire](link_trait_1542), [poison](link_trait_1476), or [void](link_trait_1485) damage affecting you, and attempt a new saving throw against any [poison](link_trait_1476) affecting you. [Poison](link_trait_1476) can't progress to a worse stage due to this saving throw. The potion counts as a particularly appropriate type of help against persistent [acid](link_trait_1528), [fire](link_trait_1542), [poison](link_trait_1476), and [void](link_trait_1485) damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12303,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Quenching Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1996762014182022","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":85},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4622","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:14.204608+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-A