ken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:15.824823+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Quilted armor](link_item_12306) is built in a long coat intended for defensive use without other armor. [Quilted armor](link_item_12306) protects the upper body and legs, differentiating it further from the typical padded undercoat. This armor is frequently made in stylish colors or patterns to facilitate use as protective outerwear or a military uniform.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12307,"type":"item","before":{"id":12307,"bulk":"0","name":"Radiant Prism (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"459097302329935","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":20500},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4770","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"127"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":38}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:16.442172+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This glass prism pays homage to its namesake pantheon—the Radiant Prism of Sarenrae, Desna, and Shelyn. Any armor or weapon the prism is affixed to glows softly with colored lights. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 38.\n\n*   **Armor** ([light](link_trait_1517)) After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the prism, you glow with dim light in a multitude of shimmering hues, shedding light like a [torch](link_item_7899) and making you concealed for 2 rounds.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the prism, your [Strikes](link_action_19856) with the weapon gain the [_brilliant_](link_item_6767) property rune until the end of your next turn. The damage from the [_brilliant_](link_item_6767) rune increases to 2d4 of each type.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[light](link_spell_4699)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[fiery body](link_spell_4619)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[confusing colors](link_spell_6693)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12307,"bulk":"0","name":"Radiant Prism (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"459097302329935","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":20500},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4770","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"127"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":38}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:16.442172+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This glass prism pays homage to its namesake pantheon—the Radiant Prism of Sarenrae, Desna, and Shelyn. Any armor or weapon the prism is affixed to glows softly with colored lights. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 38.\n\n*   **Armor** ([light](link_trait_1517)) After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the prism, you glow with dim light in a multitude of shimmering hues, shed