cription":"This glass prism pays homage to its namesake pantheon—the Radiant Prism of Sarenrae, Desna, and Shelyn. Any armor or weapon the prism is affixed to glows softly with colored lights. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 35.\n\n*   **Armor** ([light](link_trait_1517)) After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the prism, you glow with dim light in a multitude of shimmering hues, shedding light like a [torch](link_item_7899) and making you concealed until the end of your next turn.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the prism, your [Strikes](link_action_19856) with the weapon gain the [_brilliant_](link_item_6767) property rune until the end of your next turn.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[light](link_spell_4699)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[fiery body](link_spell_4619)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12310,"type":"item","before":{"id":12310,"bulk":"0","name":"Ranging Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2040255336998001","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4589","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:18.298624+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nStrange striations and pits mark the head of a [ranging shot](link_item_12310). When the activated ammunition is fired, it sends out whistling pings along its path until it hits something or reaches its maximum range. As long as you can perceive the sounds the ammunition makes, you can tell exactly how far it has flown. The sounds are audible to creatures who didn't Activate the ammunition, but they receive no special information from the [ranging shot](link_item_12310)'s whistling.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12310,"bulk":"0","name":"Ranging Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2040255336998001","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":9},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4589","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:18.298624+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nStrange striations and pits mark the head of a [ranging shot](link_item_12310). When the activated ammunition is fired, it sends out whistling pings along its path until it hits something or reaches its maximum range. As long as you can perceive the sounds the ammunition makes, you can tell exactly how far it has flown. The sounds are audible to creatures who didn't Activate the ammunition, but they receive no special information from the [ranging shot](link_item_12310)'s whistling.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12311,"type":"item","before":{"id":12311,"bulk":"1","name":"Razor Disc","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2043070097838465","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2895,2896],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":16,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":16,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=30","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"razor-disc","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":8},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:21.441121+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Integrated 1d6 S](link_trait_2895), [shield throw 20 ft.](link_trait_2896)\n\nSeveral small blades line the outside edge of this [steel shield](link_item_7855). This specialized throwing shield is common among warriors in the Mwangi Expanse, where its blades can cut down foliage as it flies.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12311,"bulk":"1","name":"Razor Disc","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2043070097838465","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2895,2896],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":16,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":16,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=30","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"razor-disc","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":8},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:21.441121+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Integrated 1d6 S](link_trait_2895), [shield throw 20 ft.](link_trait_2896)\n\nSeveral small blades line the outside edge of this [steel shield](link_item_7855). This specialized throwing shield is common among warriors in the Mwangi Expanse, where its blades can cut down foliage as it flies.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12312,"type":"item","before":{"id":12312,"bulk":"0","name":"Reading Glyphs","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"498128854073540","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":90},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4749","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"121"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:21.976791+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These tattoos on your knuckles look like strange glyphs in an unknown language. If you press your fingertips to text in any language, these glyphs cycle in appearance through those of various extant languages. Encrypted text causes your glyphs to turn to a recognizable \"null\" symbol.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You sync the tattoos with the text your fingertips are touching. By running your fingers across the text, you translate it, with glyphs on your knuckles showing the translation in a language you can read. Your tattooed glyphs can't translate encrypted or encoded text, language couched in metaphor, and the like, subject to GM discretion.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12312,"bulk":"0","name":"Reading Glyphs","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"498128854073540","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":90},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4749","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"121"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:21.976791+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These tattoos on your knuckles look like strange glyphs in an unknown language. If you press your fingertips to text in any language, these glyphs cycle in appearance through those of various extant languages. Encrypted text causes your glyphs to turn to a recognizable \"null\" symbol.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You sync the tattoos with the text your fingertips are touching. By running your fingers across the text, you translate it, with glyphs on your knuckles showing the translation in a language you can read. Your tattooed glyphs can't translate encrypted or encoded text, language couched in metaphor, and the like, subject to GM discretion.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12313,"type":"item","before":{"id":12313,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Reaper's Crescent","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"138468992253286","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":575},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1517,1537],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4412","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"sickle","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:22.690893+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The blade of this alabaster [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [sickle](link_item_7769) grows thick and pitted as the moon waxes, and it thins to a sharp sliver as the moon wanes. Moonlight also causes a second rune on the blade to change shape with the moon's phases: during the new and crescent moon, the weapon has the [ghost touch](link_item_6992) rune; during the quarter moon, the [fearsome](link_item_6953) rune; and during the gibbous and full moon, the [wounding](link_item_7962) rune.\n\nWhen wielded under moonlight of any strength, the [reaper's crescent](link_item_12313) deals additional [cold](link_trait_1519) damage equal to the number of damage dice.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12313,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Reaper's Crescent","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"138468992253286","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":575},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1517,1537],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4412","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"sickle","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:22.690893+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The blade of this alabaster [+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [sickle](link_item_7769) grows thick and pitted as the moon waxes, and it thins to a sharp sliver as the moon wanes. Moonlight also causes a second rune on the blade to change shape with the moon's phases: during the new and crescent moon, the weapon has the [ghost touch](link_item_6992) rune; during the quarter moon, the [fearsome](link_item_6953) rune; and during the gibbous and full moon, the [wounding](link_item_7962) rune.\n\nWhen wielded under moonlight of any strength, the [reaper's crescent](link_item_12313) deals additional [cold](link_trait_1519) damage equal to the number of damage dice.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12314,"type":"item","before":{"id":12314,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Reaper's Spellgun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8587601418583503","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1904,1504,2868,1485],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4657","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:23.533686+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nA rod of blackened bone with a bulb at one end comprises a _[reaper's spellgun](link_item_12314)_, which feels heavier than it looks. You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun fires a shadowy ray, then dissolves into gray mist.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes 4d6 [void](link_trait_1485) damage and is drained 2 and doomed 1. If it had fewer than half its maximum Hit Points after taking the [void](link_trait_1485) damage, it's drained 3 instead. If the Hit Point loss from being drained drops the creature to 0 Hit Points, it dies.\n\n**Success** As critical success, but for the drained condition, the target is drained 1, or drained 2 if it had fewer than half its maximum HP.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12314,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Reaper's Spellgun","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8587601418583503","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1904,1504,2868,1485],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4657","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:23.533686+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nA rod of blackened bone with a bulb at one end comprises a _[reaper's spellgun](link_item_12314)_, which feels heavier than it looks. You Activate the spellgun by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun fires a shadowy ray, then dissolves into gray mist.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes 4d6 [void](link_trait_1485) damage and is drained 2 and doomed 1. If it had fewer than half its maximum Hit Points after taking the [void](link_trait_1485) damage, it's drained 3 instead. If the Hit Point loss from being drained drops the creature to 0 Hit Points, it dies.\n\n**Success** As critical success, but for the drained condition, the target is drained 1, or drained 2 if it had fewer than half its maximum HP.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12315,"type":"item","before":{"id":12315,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Rebirth Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"636933431291160","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4623","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:24.149443+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA small bit from a [humanoid](link_trait_2399)—such as a hair, scale, or feather—steeps in the clear liquid of a [rebirth potion](link_item_12315). When the potion is created, this bit determines the ancestry and heritage the potion changes the imbiber to. After you drink the potion, you transform into that ancestry over 8 hours during your next period of rest, finishing the transformation after the 8 hours are up. Throughout this time, you are clumsy 2, enfeebled 2, and stupefied 2. Once the transformation is complete, the potion's magic ends and can't be [counteracted](link_action_27519). Replace your ancestry Hit Points, size, Speeds, ability boosts, ability flaws, traits, and special abilities with those of your new ancestry. You lose your ancestry feats, selecting replacements valid for your new ancestry. You have mild control over the change, but you end up with a unique appearance fitting for your new ancestry, and some quirks of your body remain, such as relative age, general health, scars, and missing digits, limbs, or organs.\n\nDrinking a [rebirth potion](link_item_12315) of your current ancestry works normally, allowing you to rearrange some of the cited ancestry elements and change your appearance (provided you abide by the potion's limitations regarding health and age).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12315,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Rebirth Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"636933431291160","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4623","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"90"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:24.149443+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA small bit from a [humanoid](link_trait_2399)—such as a hair, scale, or feather—steeps in the clear liquid of a [rebirth potion](link_item_12315). When the potion is created, this bit determines the ancestry and heritage the potion changes the imbiber to. After you drink the potion, you transform into that ancestry over 8 hours during your next period of rest, finishing the transformation after the 8 hours are up. Throughout this time, you are clumsy 2, enfeebled 2, and stupefied 2. Once the transformation is complete, the potion's magic ends and can't be [counteracted](link_action_27519). Replace your ancestry Hit Points, size, Speeds, ability boosts, ability flaws, traits, and special abilities with those of your new ancestry. You lose your ancestry feats, selecting replacements valid for your new ancestry. You have mild control over the change, but you end up with a unique appearance fitting for your new ancestry, and some quirks of your body remain, such as relative age, general health, scars, and missing digits, limbs, or organs.\n\nDrinking a [rebirth potion](link_item_12315) of your current ancestry works normally, allowing you to rearrange some of the cited ancestry elements and change your appearance (provided you abide by the potion's limitations regarding health and age).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12316,"type":"item","before":{"id":12316,"bulk":"0","name":"Red-Handed Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2973181712843380","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1855,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4598","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:25.262243+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nComposed to look like an important document, a [red-handed missive](link_item_12316) is a trap used by those who suspect someone has been going through their correspondence. If activated, the missive dissolves into red dye that coats anything touching the missive. Magic in the dye prevents it from washing off for 1 week.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12316,"bulk":"0","name":"Red-Handed Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2973181712843380","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1855,1504,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4598","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:25.262243+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nComposed to look like an important document, a [red-handed missive](link_item_12316) is a trap used by those who suspect someone has been going through their correspondence. If activated, the missive dissolves into red dye that coats anything touching the missive. Magic in the dye prevents it from washing off for 1 week.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12317,"type":"item","before":{"id":12317,"bulk":"2","name":"Reef Heart (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"540967073137902","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":2},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4384","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"@actor.attributes.speed.total","selector":"swim"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"coral-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:25.841687+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [coral armor](link_item_11887)_, often favored by allies of merfolk and aquatic elves, is made of living coral carefully harvested from the ocean depths. Legends speak of a variety of similar [coral armors](link_item_11887) with distinct powers, but surface-dwellers know of _[reef heart](link_item_12317)_ as a magic armor that makes it easier for them to travel under the sea. _[Reef heart](link_item_12317)_ enables you to breathe underwater and gives you a swim Speed equal to your land Speed.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast a 7th level *[coral eruption](link_spell_8843)*. If you conjure the coral underwater, it ceases dealing damage after 1 minute, but its duration is unlimited. If the [magical](link_trait_1504) coral remains in place for 1 year, it becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) coral from which a reef might grow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12317,"bulk":"2","name":"Reef Heart (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"540967073137902","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":2},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4384","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"@actor.attributes.speed.total","selector":"swim"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"coral-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:25.841687+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+2](link_item_6720) [greater resilient](link_item_7701) [coral armor](link_item_11887)_, often favored by allies of merfolk and aquatic elves, is made of living coral carefully harvested from the ocean depths. Legends speak of a variety of similar [coral armors](link_item_11887) with distinct powers, but surface-dwellers know of _[reef heart](link_item_12317)_ as a magic armor that makes it easier for them to travel under the sea. _[Reef heart](link_item_12317)_ enables you to breathe underwater and gives you a swim Speed equal to your land Speed.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast a 7th level *[coral eruption](link_spell_8843)*. If you conjure the coral underwater, it ceases dealing damage after 1 minute, but its duration is unlimited. If the [magical](link_trait_1504) coral remains in place for 1 year, it becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) coral from which a reef might grow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12318,"type":"item","before":{"id":12318,"bulk":"2","name":"Reef Heart","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7670378767413467","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4384","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"floor(@actor.attributes.speed.total/2)","selector":"swim"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"coral-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:26.386334+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [coral armor](link_item_11887)_, often favored by allies of merfolk and aquatic elves, is made of living coral carefully harvested from the ocean depths. Legends speak of a variety of similar [coral armors](link_item_11887) with distinct powers, but surface-dwellers know of _[reef heart](link_item_12318)_ as a magic armor that makes it easier for them to travel under the sea. _[Reef heart](link_item_12318)_ enables you to breathe underwater and gives you a swim Speed equal to half your land Speed.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast *[coral eruption](link_spell_8843)*. If you conjure the coral underwater, it ceases dealing damage after 1 minute, but its duration is unlimited. If the [magical](link_trait_1504) coral remains in place for 1 year, it becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) coral from which a reef might grow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12318,"bulk":"2","name":"Reef Heart","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7670378767413467","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2879,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4384","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"18"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"floor(@actor.attributes.speed.total/2)","selector":"swim"}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"coral-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:26.386334+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [coral armor](link_item_11887)_, often favored by allies of merfolk and aquatic elves, is made of living coral carefully harvested from the ocean depths. Legends speak of a variety of similar [coral armors](link_item_11887) with distinct powers, but surface-dwellers know of _[reef heart](link_item_12318)_ as a magic armor that makes it easier for them to travel under the sea. _[Reef heart](link_item_12318)_ enables you to breathe underwater and gives you a swim Speed equal to half your land Speed.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You cast *[coral eruption](link_spell_8843)*. If you conjure the coral underwater, it ceases dealing damage after 1 minute, but its duration is unlimited. If the [magical](link_trait_1504) coral remains in place for 1 year, it becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) coral from which a reef might grow.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12319,"type":"item","before":{"id":12319,"bulk":"0","name":"Reflected Moonlight Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7298894647669099","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":750},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1460,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4574","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:27.569288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You fail to save against a [death](link_trait_1904) or [void](link_trait_1485) effect\n\nAn acolyte accidentally left fulu paper outdoors overnight during a divine ceremony to Tsukiyo conducted only during a supermoon, creating the first [reflected moonlight fulu](link_item_12319). When you Activate this fulu, you reroll your saving throw against the triggering effect and take the better result. If this new roll is a critical success, the effect is reflected on its creator, who's treated as the effect's target, with any [void](link_trait_1485) damage converted to [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage. A reflected effect or spell affects only the original creator, even if it was an area spell or one that affects more than one creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12319,"bulk":"0","name":"Reflected Moonlight Fulu","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7298894647669099","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":750},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1460,2854,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4574","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"78"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:27.569288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You fail to save against a [death](link_trait_1904) or [void](link_trait_1485) effect\n\nAn acolyte accidentally left fulu paper outdoors overnight during a divine ceremony to Tsukiyo conducted only during a supermoon, creating the first [reflected moonlight fulu](link_item_12319). When you Activate this fulu, you reroll your saving throw against the triggering effect and take the better result. If this new roll is a critical success, the effect is reflected on its creator, who's treated as the effect's target, with any [void](link_trait_1485) damage converted to [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage. A reflected effect or spell affects only the original creator, even if it was an area spell or one that affects more than one creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12320,"type":"item","before":{"id":12320,"bulk":"0","name":"Reflecting Shard (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1063317460760163","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2500},"usage":"affixed-to-a-shield","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4644","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:28.179967+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Trigger** You are targeted by a spell; **Requirements** You're a master in Athletics, and you have the affixed shield [raised](link_action_19750)\n\nThis mirrored metal fragment is bolted or welded to the face of the affixed shield. When you Activate it, you attempt to reflect the triggering spell back at its caster with *[spell riposte](link_spell_6354)*, using your Athletics modifier for the [counteract](link_action_27519) check. The talisman's [counteract](link_action_27519) rank is 9th.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12320,"bulk":"0","name":"Reflecting Shard (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1063317460760163","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2500},"usage":"affixed-to-a-shield","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4644","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_