roup":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":6927,"name":"Energy-Resistant","rune":{"id":6927,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":8292860819286133,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":420},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:56.534521+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 5 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the rune. Multiple [energy-resistant](link_item_6927) runes can be etched onto a suit of armor; rather than using only the strongest effect, each must provide resistance to a different damage type. For instance, a [+2](link_item_6720) [acid-resistant](link_item_6927) [greater fire-resistant](link_item_6926) [breastplate](link_item_6765) would give you [acid](link_trait_1528) resistance 5 and [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance 10.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}}],"resilient":1},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"niyaháat","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":12236,"bulk":"2","name":"Niyaháat","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":476041034844908,"group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2860],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"niyahaat","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:20:26.800167+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Erutaki communities deep in the Crown of the World, where wood is hard to come by, fashion armor from slats and strips of bone or horn, along with whole bones or horns. Wealthier wearers sometimes pay for decorative embellishments made of more precious materials. Niyaháat is usually woven together with strong cord, forming a suit like a breastplate. This suit is worn over heavy clothing or a surcoat like padded armor. Some suits incorporate parts of powerful creatures, creating a storied history for the suit and its wearers.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1852","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"19"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:29.364154+00:00","operations":[{"id":"be44fefe-3fa1-407d-92a3-44b44f4d2d96","data":{"value":"fire,5","variable":"RESISTANCES"},"type":"adjValue"}],"description":"This [+1](link_item_6719) [resilient](link_item_7703) [fire-resistant](link_item_6927) [niyaháat](link_item_12236) is often created to mark the passage of an Erutaki warrior into adulthood, plates salvaged from the exploded remains of a firewyrm elemental, with larger pieces protecting the chest, shoulders, and head. As you fight, the armor glows red hot.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The armor casts *[fire shield](link_spell_4622)* on you.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You're dealt 30 or more [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, before any reduction from your [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance; **Requirements** You’ve used the *[fire shield](link_spell_4622)* activation already today; Effect The *[fire shield](link_spell_4622)* activation recharges.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the carapace of a firewyrm"},"after":{"id":12322,"bulk":"2","name":"Smoldering Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"482285780831419","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"cp":"","gp":975,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1542,2860,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"skeletal","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":6927,"name":"Energy-Resistant","rune":{"id":6927,"bulk":"0","name":"Energy-Resistant","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":8292860819286133,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":420},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:48:56.534521+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These symbols convey protective forces from the Elemental Planes. You gain resistance 5 to [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), or [fire](link_trait_1542). The crafter chooses the damage type when creating the 