76],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4461","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T10:46:32.387Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:21:50.524206+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe euphemistically named [saboteur's friend](link_item_12354) looks, smells, and tastes like an appetizing chocolate square. You lace the chocolate with reagents that induce a strong laxative effect. [Saboteur's friend](link_item_12354) is useful for incapacitating rather than dealing lasting harm. Unlike some poisons, [saboteur's friend](link_item_12354) can have its sickened condition reduced (but changing to a higher or lower stage after a save applies any sickened condition listed for that stage, as normal).\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 20 Fortitude; **Onset** 10 minutes; **Maximum Duration** 1 hour; **Stage 1** sickened 1 (10 minutes); **Stage 2** enfeebled 1 and sickened 2 (10 minutes); **Stage 3** enfeebled 1, fatigued, and sickened 3 (10 minutes)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12354,"bulk":"0","name":"Saboteur's Friend","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8554304092192738","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":14},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1555,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"ex