ged, bony growth narrows to a sharp, pointed tip. Deep groves from some former battle scar its surface. The bearer of a _[saurian spike](link_item_12376)_ often feels a sudden surge in power and confidence. The spell attack modifier of any spell cast by activating this item is +15.\n\n*   **Armor** You gain [imprecise scent](link_sense_20773) with a range of 30 feet.\n    \n*   **Weapon** ([auditory](link_trait_1469), [emotion](link_trait_1486), [fear](link_trait_1487), [visual](link_trait_1479)) When you cast a [polymorph](link_trait_1453) spell by activating the spike, your battle form is exceptionally fearsome. Each enemy in a 30-foot emanation must succeed at a DC 27 Will saving throw or become frightened 1 (frightened 2 on a critical failure).\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[gouging claw](link_spell_4645)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[dinosaur form](link_spell_4566)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12377,"type":"item","before":{"id":12377,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scale of Igroon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6953171332710115","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":21,"price":{},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":160,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":160,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4894","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"180"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":20,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":80},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:08.27005+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Carved from a scale of the kaiju Igroon, this jagged shield refracts light around it in a shimmering haze. A [scale of Igroon](link_item_12377) (Hardness 20, HP 160, BT 80) recovers 4 Hit Points at the start of its wielder's turn. When you [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750), you can use the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction with the _[scale of Igroon](link_item_12377)_ to block an attack or effect that deals [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), [force](link_trait_1560), or [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage as well as physical damage.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're in an area of bright or dim light\n\n**Effect** You angle the shield to refract light. Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +4 item bonus to Stealth checks to [Hide](link_action_19726) and [Sneak](link_action_19850) and can do so while observed. This bonus ends if you Activate another ability or use the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're in an area of bright light\n\n**Effect** You angle the shield at a target within 60 feet, reflecting light into its eyes. It must attempt a Fortitude 42 save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is blinded until its next turn begins.\n\n**Failure** The target is blinded for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is blinded for 2d4 hours.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You use [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) and prevent yourself from taking energy damage from a line, ray, or a direct attack, including a [force barrage](link_spell_4630) spell\n\n**Effect** You reflect the energy along a trajectory you choose. The effect travels only up to its remaining range, using its original parameters if it strikes other targets.\n\n**Destruction** If a deity, kaiju, spawn of a deity, titan, or being of similar power stomps on a [scale of Igroon](link_item_12377) while in absolute darkness, the shield is destroyed permanently.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12377,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scale of Igroon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6953171332710115","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":21,"price":{},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":160,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":160,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4894","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"180"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":20,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":80},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:08.27005+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Carved from a scale of the kaiju Igroon, this jagged shield refracts light around it in a shimmering haze. A [scale of Igroon](link_item_12377) (Hardness 20, HP 160, BT 80) recovers 4 Hit Points at the start of its wielder's turn. When you [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750), you can use the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction with the _[scale of Igroon](link_item_12377)_ to block an attack or effect that deals [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), [force](link_trait_1560), or [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage as well as physical damage.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're in an area of bright or dim light\n\n**Effect** You angle the shield to refract light. Until the start of your next turn, you gain a +4 item bonus to Stealth checks to [Hide](link_action_19726) and [Sneak](link_action_19850) and can do so while observed. This bonus ends if you Activate another ability or use the [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) reaction.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're in an area of bright light\n\n**Effect** You angle the shield at a target within 60 feet, reflecting light into its eyes. It must attempt a Fortitude 42 save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is blinded until its next turn begins.\n\n**Failure** The target is blinded for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is blinded for 2d4 hours.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You use [Shield Block](link_feat_20534) and prevent yourself from taking energy damage from a line, ray, or a direct attack, including a [force barrage](link_spell_4630) spell\n\n**Effect** You reflect the energy along a trajectory you choose. The effect travels only up to its remaining range, using its original parameters if it strikes other targets.\n\n**Destruction** If a deity, kaiju, spawn of a deity, titan, or being of similar power stomps on a [scale of Igroon](link_item_12377) while in absolute darkness, the shield is destroyed permanently.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12378,"type":"item","before":{"id":12378,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scarlet Mist","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6513951444172618","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4545","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:08.876467+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDerived from a mixture of krooth venom and an agitating agent, [scarlet mist](link_item_12378) causes bleeding that turns into a foaming mist. When a creature under the effects of [scarlet mist](link_item_12378) takes persistent bleed damage from the toxin, creatures within 5 feet take the splash damage. The persistent damage can't be staunched until the [poison](link_trait_1476)'s effects end. A creature that can't bleed doesn't take the bleed damage or cause the splash damage but can still take the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 25 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 1d4 persistent bleed damage, and 1 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 2d4 persistent bleed damage, and 2 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 3d4 persistent bleed damage, and 3 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12378,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scarlet Mist","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6513951444172618","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4545","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:08.876467+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDerived from a mixture of krooth venom and an agitating agent, [scarlet mist](link_item_12378) causes bleeding that turns into a foaming mist. When a creature under the effects of [scarlet mist](link_item_12378) takes persistent bleed damage from the toxin, creatures within 5 feet take the splash damage. The persistent damage can't be staunched until the [poison](link_trait_1476)'s effects end. A creature that can't bleed doesn't take the bleed damage or cause the splash damage but can still take the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 25 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 1d4 persistent bleed damage, and 1 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 2d4 persistent bleed damage, and 2 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 3d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, 3d4 persistent bleed damage, and 3 [poison](link_trait_1476) splash damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12379,"type":"item","before":{"id":12379,"bulk":"0","name":"Scholar's Drop","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8676599844148252","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":40},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4462","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:09.661238+00:00","operations":null,"description":"University students in Katapesh first used the [scholar's drop](link_item_12379) to gain an edge over their academic rivals, but the candy has since spread across Golarion. The flavor of this hard, sugar-coated candy is highly refreshing and based on lemon and green tea. For 1 hour, you gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against effects that could render you fatigued.\n\n**Secondary Effect** 2\n\n**Requirements** You're fatigued\n\n**Effect** Ignore the effects of the fatigued condition for 10 minutes. The drop's other effects end for you, and when the 10 minutes are up, you're temporarily immune to scholar's drops for 1 hour. If you use this effect three times in a single day, you become temporarily immune to scholar's drops entirely until you get a full night's rest.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12379,"bulk":"0","name":"Scholar's Drop","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8676599844148252","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":40},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4462","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"50"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:09.661238+00:00","operations":null,"description":"University students in Katapesh first used the [scholar's drop](link_item_12379) to gain an edge over their academic rivals, but the candy has since spread across Golarion. The flavor of this hard, sugar-coated candy is highly refreshing and based on lemon and green tea. For 1 hour, you gain a +1 item bonus to saving throws against effects that could render you fatigued.\n\n**Secondary Effect** 2\n\n**Requirements** You're fatigued\n\n**Effect** Ignore the effects of the fatigued condition for 10 minutes. The drop's other effects end for you, and when the 10 minutes are up, you're temporarily immune to scholar's drops for 1 hour. If you use this effect three times in a single day, you become temporarily immune to scholar's drops entirely until you get a full night's rest.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12380,"type":"item","before":{"id":12380,"bulk":"1","name":"Scizore of the Crab","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3833753185657390","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn on 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1604,2524,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1887","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"36"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"scizore","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:10.56592+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[scizore of the crab](link_item_12380)_ is a _[+1](link_item_7950) [scizore](link_item_12381)_ that has the [grapple](link_trait_2524) trait in addition to its normal weapon traits.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** Your last action was a successful [Strike](link_action_19856) with this weapon, or you have a creature grabbed with this weapon; **Effect** The target is grabbed until the end of your next turn. A grabbed creature can use the [Escape](link_action_19632) action to get out of the Grab, and the Grab ends for a grabbed creature if you move away from it. This functions as the Grab creature ability.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per round; **Requirements** You have a creature grabbed with this weapon; **Effect** The crab claw animates and pinches open and shut, dealing slashing damage equal to the [scizore of the crab](link_item_12380)'s number of damage dice.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a claw from a giant crab or similar creature."},"after":{"id":12380,"bulk":"1","name":"Scizore of the Crab","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3833753185657390","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn on 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1604,2524,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1887","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"36"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"scizore","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:10.56592+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[scizore of the crab](link_item_12380)_ is a _[+1](link_item_7950) [scizore](link_item_12381)_ that has the [grapple](link_trait_2524) trait in addition to its normal weapon traits.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** Your last action was a successful [Strike](link_action_19856) with this weapon, or you have a creature grabbed with this weapon; **Effect** The target is grabbed until the end of your next turn. A grabbed creature can use the [Escape](link_action_19632) action to get out of the Grab, and the Grab ends for a grabbed creature if you move away from it. This functions as the Grab creature ability.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per round; **Requirements** You have a creature grabbed with this weapon; **Effect** The crab claw animates and pinches open and shut, dealing slashing damage equal to the [scizore of the crab](link_item_12380)'s number of damage dice.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include a claw from a giant crab or similar creature."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12381,"type":"item","before":{"id":12381,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scizore","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7300252252712042","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"sp":9},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1604,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=617","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"27"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"scizore","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10,"base_item_content":{"id":12381,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Scizore","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":7300252252712042,"group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":9},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1604,1572],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"knife","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"scizore","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:11.130711+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A scizore is a gauntlet or protective leather tube worn over the forearm and featuring a half-moon blade mounted to the end of the cap on a short pole.