"operations":null,"description":"This ivory flute is adorned with many carvings of eyes. Each has jade pupils and a semiprecious stone as its iris. The eyes flutter open and closed when the flute is played, as if it held the eyes of many independent beings. While playing the flute, you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks and Performance checks.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from this instrument to cast a spell from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[guidance](link_spell_4649)*, *[read aura](link_spell_4794)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[object reading](link_spell_6756)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12386,"type":"item","before":{"id":12386,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sense-Dulling Hood (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3885174660551775","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4477","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:00:49.435Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:14.229622+00:00","operations":[{"id":"9eac693a-b004-4e4c-95bb-6e1882372f71","data":{"text":"to Perception checks","type":"item","value":"-1","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"740fa06d-583a-45bf-9388-bd102882c42e","data":{"text":"against auditory, olfactory, and visual effects","type":"item","value":"4","variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"c2c58566-b476-41bb-9f9c-71edc4bb5113","data":{"text":"against auditory, olfactory, and visual effects","type":"item","value":"4","variable":"SAVE_REFLEX"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"fdb98c52-9fa8-4bff-a96e-b7e7d587c568","data":{"text":"against auditory, olfactory, and visual effects","type":"item","value":"4","variable":"SAVE_WILL"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nSometimes, an enemy’s dangerous special ability makes relatively standard sensory capabilities a liability. From an ofalth emitting its stench to a banshee wailing, plenty of creatures use their prey’s senses against them. A [sense-dulling hood](link_item_12386) is a wide, single-use mask designed to be pulled from an airtight package and slipped over the head. The mask grants you a +4 item bonus to saving throws against [auditory](link_trait_1469), [olfactory](link_trait_2131), and [visual](link_trait_1479) effects for 1 hour. Since it dulls your senses without depriving you of them, the mask also imposes a –1 penalty to rolls and checks using Perception for the same duration.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12386,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sense-Dulling Hood (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3885174660551775","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":350},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":0,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4477","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:00:49.435Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectab