the original item. If placed on other objects, the oil fails and is wasted. This false snake has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. It remains in snake form for 1 minute before returning to its object state. If slain, the item returns to its original form, unharmed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12392,"type":"item","before":{"id":12392,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Serpent Oil (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1718615680060537","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":24},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4609","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:18.82893+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis glistening oil has a green hue and tiny snake scales floating within. If you slather [serpent oil](link_item_12392) on an object that is snakelike in shape, the object transforms. The oil can be applied to a Small object, producing a [Sea Snake](link_creature_11134), or a Medium object, producing a Ball Python, keeping some of the same colors and patterns of the original item. If placed on other objects, the oil fails and is wasted. This false snake has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. It remains in snake form for 1 minute before returning to its object state. If slain, the item returns to its original form, unharmed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12392,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Serpent Oil (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1718615680060537","group":"GENERAL","h