-04-19T04:22:19.425114+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis glistening oil has a green hue and tiny snake scales floating within. If you slather [serpent oil](link_item_12393) on a Huge object that is snakelike in shape, from a stick to a scarf, the object transforms into a [Giant Anaconda](link_creature_10065), keeping some of the same colors and patterns of the original item. If placed on other objects, the oil fails and is wasted. This false snake has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. It remains in snake form for 1 minute before returning to its object state. If slain, the item returns to its original form, unharmed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12393,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Serpent Oil (True)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6318720058294160","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":1100},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4609","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:19.425114+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis glistening oil has a green hue and tiny snake scales floating within. If you slather [serpent oil](link_item_12393) on a Huge object that is snakelike in shape, from a stick to a scarf, the object transforms into a [Giant Anaconda](link_creature_10065), keeping some of the same colors and patterns of the original item. If placed on other objects, the oil fails and is wasted. This false snake has the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. It remains in snake form for 1 minute before returning to its object state. If slain, the item returns to its original form, unharmed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12394,"type":"item","before":{"id":12394,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Seventh Prism (Pentagonal)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8306495155782060","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":52},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4561","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"75"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:20.072288+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n* * *\n\nBeloved by the church of the Seventh Veil, a _[seventh prism](link_item_12394)_ is a crystal that disperses its internal light, casting an aurora of color. If you use a [seventh prism](link_item_12394) to cast *[dizzying colors](link_spell_4580)*, the area increases to a 20-foot cone, targets are dazzled for twice as long as their saving throw indicates, and the DC for the flat check against the target being concealed increases to 7. On a critical failure, the target is dazzled for 1 minute after its blinded condition ends. Motes of shifting rainbow hues cloud the eyes, making it difficult to see details.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12394,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Seventh Prism (Pentagonal)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8306495155782060","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":52},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","t