cult to see details.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12396,"type":"item","before":{"id":12396,"bulk":"1","name":"Sextant of the Night","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"297448666334478","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":95},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4730","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"survival"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"survival","predicate":["action:sense-direction"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:21.261141+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This finely wrought sextant is made from silver with several onyx mirrors and shades made from thin sets of crystal glass. A [fine spyglass](link_item_7819) made of silver is affixed to the frame; removing the spyglass destroys the sextant. By all appearances, the sextant shouldn't function, as the shades and mirrors are swapped, but when you look through the spyglass, you see a night sky during the day and the sun during the night, as if day and night were inverted.\n\nWhen you use the sextant, you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks, which increases to a +2 item bonus when you [Sense Direction](link_action_19846).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12396,"bulk":"1","name":"Sextant of the Night","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"297448666334478","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":95},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4730","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"survival"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"survival","predicate":["action:sense-direction"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:21.261141+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This finely wrought sextant is made from silver with several onyx mirrors and shades made from thin sets of crystal glass. A [fine spyglass](link_item_7819) made of silver is affixed to the frame; removing the spyglass destroys the sextant. By all appearances, the sextant shouldn't function, as the shades and mirrors are swapped, but when you look through the spyglass, you see a night sky during the day and the sun during the night, as if day and night were inverted.\n\nWhen you use the sextant, you gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks, which increases to a +2 item bonus when you [Sense Direction](link_action_19846).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12397,"type":"item","before":{"id":12397,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Shadowmist Cape","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7911357952882457","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":40000},"usage":"worn cape","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4676","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"stealth"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:22.032094+00:00","operations":[{"id":"12df99df-432a-4f81-b908-a49407749264","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"3","variable":"SKILL_STEALTH"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"37680e1f-69a5-4c9f-aca2-aa1413968483","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"2dec95cc-41f0-4489-96a6-edb2a70b3f8b","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":{"value":4,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"b575e439-9d7a-4775-84fd-8cb414505440","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"28006422-2129-4ebe-86a7-f373695adb19","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"e84171ab-63df-439e-874c-d70aca253fc4","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This black cape flows more like a vaporous liquid than fabric. The cape grants you a +3 item bonus to Stealth checks. When you invest the cape, you either increase your Dexterity modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** A creature misses you with an attack; **Effect** Attempt a Stealth check against the triggering creature's Perception DC. If you roll a success, you're hidden from that creature until the end of your next turn or until right after you use a hostile action against that creature. If you roll a critical success, you're hidden from that creature until the end of your next turn, even if you use hostile actions against that creature.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** With a twirl of the cape, you transform yourself into a puff of gray smoke. You cast *[vapor form](link_spell_4927)* on yourself.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12397,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Shadowmist Cape","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7911357952882457","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":40000},"usage":"worn cape","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4676","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"stealth"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:22.032094+00:00","operations":[{"id":"12df99df-432a-4f81-b908-a49407749264","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"3","variable":"SKILL_STEALTH"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"37680e1f-69a5-4c9f-aca2-aa1413968483","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"2dec95cc-41f0-4489-96a6-edb2a70b3f8b","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":{"value":4,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"b575e439-9d7a-4775-84fd-8cb414505440","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"28006422-2129-4ebe-86a7-f373695adb19","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"e84171ab-63df-439e-874c-d70aca253fc4","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"This black cape flows more like a vaporous liquid than fabric. The cape grants you a +3 item bonus to Stealth checks. When you invest the cape, you either increase your Dexterity modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** A creature misses you with an attack; **Effect** Attempt a Stealth check against the triggering creature's Perception DC. If you roll a success, you're hidden from that creature until the end of your next turn or until right after you use a hostile action against that creature. If you roll a critical success, you're hidden from that creature until the end of your next turn, even if you use hostile actions against that creature.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** With a twirl of the cape, you transform yourself into a puff of gray smoke. You cast *[vapor form](link_spell_4927)* on yourself.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12398,"type":"item","before":{"id":12398,"bulk":"0","name":"Shapespeak Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5186045821060835","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4885","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:24.006461+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[shapespeak mask](link_item_12398)_ is carved into the shape of an animal, usually tailored to a species of beast that the user favors. While wearing this mask, you can speak even when polymorphed into an animal. The [shapespeak mask](link_item_12398) removes no other limitations, such as the inability to cast spells when transformed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12398,"bulk":"0","name":"Shapespeak Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5186045821060835","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4885","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:24.006461+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[shapespeak mask](link_item_12398)_ is carved into the shape of an animal, usually tailored to a species of beast that the user favors. While wearing this mask, you can speak even when polymorphed into an animal. The [shapespeak mask](link_item_12398) removes no other limitations, such as the inability to cast spells when transformed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12399,"type":"item","before":{"id":12399,"bulk":"3","name":"Shared-Pain Sankeit","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1582869616288572","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1527,2860,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":6974,"name":"Fortification"}],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4915","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"duskwood","grade":"standard"},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"sankeit","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:24.729743+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[shared-pain sankeit](link_item_12399)_ seems to be an impressive suit of _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [fortification](link_item_6974) [duskwood](link_item_15061) [sankeit](link_item_12366)_ shaped to resemble a mighty linnorm. However, it protects you by drawing on the health of your nearby allies. When you roll the flat check for the armor's [fortification](link_item_6974) rune, it protects you normally when you roll a 20. When you roll a 17, 18, or 19, though, the GM determines damage for the critical hit normally, then distributes half to you and the other half evenly among allies within 30 feet of you. If no ally is within range to take the distributed damage, the [fortification](link_item_6974) rune fails to function. This effect manifests the first time an attacker scores a critical hit on you, after which the armor fuses with you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12399,"bulk":"3","name":"Shared-Pain Sankeit","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1582869616288572","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1527,2860,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":6974,"name":"Fortification"}],"resilient":1},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4915","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"dex_cap":3,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"category":"light","hardness":0,"material":{"type":"duskwood","grade":"standard"},"quantity":1,"strength":1,"base_item":"sankeit","check_penalty":-1,"speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:24.729743+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[shared-pain sankeit](link_item_12399)_ seems to be an impressive suit of _[+2](link_item_6720) [resilient](link_item_7703) [fortification](link_item_6974) [duskwood](link_item_15061) [sankeit](link_item_12366)_ shaped to resemble a mighty linnorm. However, it protects you by drawing on the health of your nearby allies. When you roll the flat check for the armor's [fortification](link_item_6974) rune, it protects you normally when you roll a 20. When you roll a 17, 18, or 19, though, the GM determines damage for the critical hit normally, then distributes half to you and the other half evenly among allies within 30 feet of you. If no ally is within range to take the distributed damage, the [fortification](link_item_6974) rune fails to function. This effect manifests the first time an attacker scores a critical hit on you, after which the armor fuses with you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12400,"type":"item","before":{"id":12400,"bulk":"1","name":"Shattered Plan","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5634644184935362","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2872,1575],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":60,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4410","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"boomerang","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:25.271936+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Though the body of this _[+2](link_item_7951) [striking](link_item_7862) [impactful](link_item_23050) [boomerang](link_item_11789)_ is riddled with glowing hairline cracks, the weapon feels reassuringly solid in the hand. If you damage a target that has been struck by a _[rime foil](link_item_12338)_ within the last round, you bruise its chilled body, and the target takes a –5-foot penalty to all its Speeds, or a –10-foot penalty on a critical hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12400,"bulk":"1","name":"Shattered Plan","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5634644184935362","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2872,1575],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":60,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4410","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"boomerang","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:25.271936+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Though the body of this _[+2](link_item_7951) [striking](link_item_7862) [impactful](link_item_23050) [boomerang](link_item_11789)_ is riddled with glowing hairline cracks, the weapon feels reassuringly solid in the hand. If you damage a target that has been struck by a _[rime foil](link_item_12338)_ within the last round, you bruise its chilled body, and the target takes a –5-foot penalty to all its Speeds, or a –10-foot penalty on a critical hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12401,"type":"item","before":{"id":12401,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Shatterstone (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7798780290692263","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":3800},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1530,1531,1484,1532],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"bomb","range":20,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":4,"damageType":"sonic"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4438","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"44"},"foundry":{"bonus":3,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":4},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"alchemical-bomb","broken_threshold":0,"attack_bonus":3},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:25.909222+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\nA [shatterstone](link_item_12401) is a small ceramic orb. Inside are reactive agents that set up an intense field of sonic vibration when the stone breaks. The bomb grants a +3 item bonus to attack rolls and deals 4d6 [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage and 4 [sonic](link_trait_1484) splash damage. Much of the sound is ultrasonic, and creatures with [sonic](link_trait_1484) weakness that take damage from the bomb must succeed at a DC 40 Fortitude save or be deafened until the end of their next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12401,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Shatterstone (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7798780290692263","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":3800},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1530,1531,1484,1532],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"bomb","range":20,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":4,"damageType":"sonic"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4438","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"44"},"foundry":{"bonus":3,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":4},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"alchemical-bomb","broken_threshold":0,"attack_bonus":3},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:25.909222+00:00","operation