s total draw strength and penetrating power.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:27.390935+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** [Arrows](link_item_6722)\n\n* * *\n\nAs the name implies, a [shield bow](link_item_12403) is a bow with an integrated shielding surface. While versatile and effective, a [shield bow](link_item_12403)'s architecture limits its flexibility somewhat, decreasing its total draw strength and penetrating power.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12404,"type":"item","before":{"id":12404,"bulk":"0","name":"Shrieking Key","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7223354477861641","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":125},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4916","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":-2,"selector":"thievery","predicate":["action:pick-a-lock"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:28.052565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A skull-topped metal _[shrieking key](link_item_12404)_ appears to be a _[Skeleton Key](link_item_7777)_, useful in place of _[Thieves' Tools](link_item_7887)_ when attempting to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747). A _[shrieking key](link_item_12404)_ has no activation, however. When you use it to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747), the key emits a loud shriek audible for 500 feet despite ambient noise. Physical barriers still block or muffle the shriek as normal. You also take a –2 circumstance penalty to the Thievery check rather than enjoying a bonus. After you attempt such a check with the key the first time, it fuses to you, returning to your possession if discarded. To use another device to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747), you must first succeed at a DC 20 Will save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12404,"bulk":"0","name":"Shrieking Key","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7223354477861641","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":125},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4916","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"192"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":-2,"selector":"thievery","predicate":["action:pick-a-lock"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:28.052565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A skull-topped metal _[shrieking key](link_item_12404)_ appears to be a _[Skeleton Key](link_item_7777)_, useful in place of _[Thieves' Tools](link_item_7887)_ when attempting to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747). A _[shrieking key](link_item_12404)_ has no activation, however. When you use it to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747), the key emits a loud shriek audible for 500 feet despite ambient noise. Physical barriers still block or muffle the shriek as normal. You also take a –2 circumstance penalty to the Thievery check rather than enjoying a bonus. After you attempt such a check with the key the first time, it fuses to you, returning to your possession if discarded. To use another device to [Pick a Lock](link_action_19747), you must first succeed at a DC 20 Will save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12405,"type":"item","before":{"id":12405,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sightless Tincture","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7285749815476532","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"cp":"","gp":115,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1555,1476,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2013","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"70"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:28.615067+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nWith an incredibly deep black hue, [sightless tincture](link_item_12405) is usually concealed in wine, blood pudding, or other darkly colored foods. The oil at first faintly dims its victim’s sight, then blacks it out entirely.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 28 Fortitude; **Onset** 10 minutes; **Maximum Duration** 14 hours\n\n**Stage 1** dazzled and a –2 status penalty to visual Perception checks (1 hour)\n\n**Stage 2** dazzled and a –4 status penalty to visual Perception checks (1 hour)\n\n**Stage 3** blinded (2d6 hours); stage 3 is an [incapacitation](link_trait_1481) effect, and if the victim is still blinded from the poison when the poison has run its course, the blindness lasts for an additional 24 hours afterward.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":12405,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sightless Tincture","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7285749815476532","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"cp":"","gp":115,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1555,1476,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2013","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"70"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:28.615067+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nWith an incredibly deep black hue, [sightless tincture](link_item_12405) is usually concealed in wine, blood pudding, or other darkly colored foods. The oil at first faintly dims its victim’s sight, then blacks it out entirely.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 28 Fortitude; **Onset** 10 minutes; **Maximum Duration** 14 hours\n\n**Stage 1** dazzled and a –2 status penalty to visual Perception checks (1 hour)\n\n**Stage 2** dazzled and a –4 status penalty to visual Perception checks (1 hour)\n\n**Stage 3** blinded (2d6 hours); stage 3 is an [incapacitation](link_trait_1481) effect, and if the victim is still blinded from the poison when the poison has run its course, the blindness lasts for an additional 24 hours afterward.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12406,"type":"item","before":{"id":12406,"bulk":"0","name":"Sighting Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6311669826343741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":72},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1517,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4590","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:29.250734+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nEyes are carved onto a [sighting shot](link_item_12406). When you Activate the ammunition, it glows, shedding bright light for 20 feet and dim light for 20 feet beyond that. If you shot the activated ammunition, your mind swirls with images of what the [sighting shot](link_item_12406) passed and hit as if you sprinted along the ammunition's course. You see this path as if with your normal visual senses. Once a [sighting shot](link_item_12406) hits anything or reaches its maximum range, it stops transmitting images to you. A [sighting shot](link_item_12406)'s light is visible to creatures who didn't Activate the ammunition, but they receive no special information from it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12406,"bulk":"0","name":"Sighting Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6311669826343741","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":72},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1517,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4590","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"81"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:29.250734+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nEyes are carved onto a [sighting shot](link_item_12406). When you Activate the ammunition, it glows, shedding bright light for 20 feet and dim light for 20 feet beyond that. If you shot the activated ammunition, your mind swirls with images of what the [sighting shot](link_item_12406) passed and hit as if you sprinted along the ammunition's course. You see this path as if with your normal visual senses. Once a [sighting shot](link_item_12406) hits anything or reaches its maximum range, it stops transmitting images to you. A [sighting shot](link_item_12406)'s light is visible to creatures who didn't Activate the ammunition, but they receive no special information from it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12407,"type":"item","before":{"id":12407,"bulk":"0","name":"Silver Crescent (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5799195519258569","group":"GENERAL","hands":"1","level":16,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1517,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4463","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:36:47.723Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:29.883545+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8afa1f70-de29-4279-883c-c915145d678d","data":{"text":"against olfactory effects","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"59c84d78-6acd-4e92-8011-93ec9e5b5980","data":{"text":"against olfactory effects","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_REFLEX"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"f28fc28e-d47b-4cda-bc3a-26c18f97b094","data":{"text":"against olfactory effects","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_WILL"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A piquant tamarind and chili-lime flavor infuses a [silver crescent](link_item_12407), which was first created to aid those battling the [undead](link_trait_2425). For 1 hour, you shed cool, white light like a [torch](link_item_7899), and you gain a +3 item bonus to saving throws against [olfactory](link_trait_2131) effects. While shedding this light, you can't be concealed if you're visible, and if you're invisible, you're concealed instead rather than being undetected.\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> **Effect** A ray of light descends on a 5-foot square of your choice within 120 feet. Any creature in that space takes 9d6 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage with a basic Reflex save (DC 35) and is dazzled until the end of its next turn on a failed save. This is treated as [silver](link_item_15062) for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like. The [silver crescent](link_item_12407) becomes inert.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12407,"bulk":"0","name":"Silver Crescent (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5799195519258569","group":"GENERAL","hands":"1","level":16,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1517,2876],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4463","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T13:36:47.723Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:29.883545+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8afa1f70-de29-4279-883c-c915145d678d","data":{"text":"against olfactory effects","type":"item","value":3,"variable":"SAVE_FORT"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"59c84d78-6acd-4e92-8011-93ec9e5b5980","data":{"text":"against olfactory effects","type":"item","value":3,"v