're invisible, you're concealed instead rather than being undetected.\n\n**Secondary Effect** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> **Effect** A ray of light descends on a 5-foot square of your choice within 120 feet. Any creature in that space takes 7d6 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage with a basic Reflex save (DC 28) and is dazzled until the end of its next turn on a failed save. This is treated as [silver](link_item_15062) for the purposes of weaknesses, resistances, and the like. The [silver crescent](link_item_12409) becomes inert.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12410,"type":"item","before":{"id":12410,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Skinsaw Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8304668112940097","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1475,1846,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4886","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Skinsaw Mask (Seek Frightened target)","value":1,"selector":"perception","predicate":["action:seek","target:condition:frightened"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:31.562015+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A patchwork of humanoid flesh makes up a _[skinsaw mask](link_item_12410)_, which is stitched together with black silk or wire. It is distinctive for its bulbous orange eye- crafted from a [magical](link_trait_1504) glass bauble-and wide row of teeth. When worn, the mask amplifies your ability to sense fear in other creatures. You know the value of the frightened condition of any observed creature, and you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to [Seek](link_action_19845) frightened creatures. Whenever you deal precision damage to a frightened creature, you deal 1 additional precision damage. If you are not [unholy](link_trait_1846), you are drained 2 while wearing the _[skinsaw mask](link_item_12410)_.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12410,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Skinsaw Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8304668112940097","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1475,1846,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4886","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Skinsaw Mask (Seek Frightened target)","value":1,"selector":"perception","predicate":["action:seek","target:condition:frightened"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:31.562015+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A patchwork of humanoid flesh makes up a _[skinsaw mask](link_item_12410)_, which is stitched together with black silk or wire. It is distinctive for its bulbous orange eye- crafted from a [magical](link_trait_1504) glass bauble-and wide row of teeth. When worn, the mask amplifies your ability to sense fear in other creatures. You know the value of the frightened condition of any observed creature, and you gain a +1 item bonus to Perception checks to [Seek](link_action_19845) frightened creatures. Whenever you deal precision damage to a frightened creature, you deal 1 additional precision damage. If you are not [unholy](link_trait_1846), you are drained 2 while wearing the _[skinsaw mask](link_item_12410)_.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12411,"type":"item","before":{"id":12411,"bulk":"1","name":"Skittering Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2984523373022883","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4887","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:32.216394+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[skittering mask](link_item_12411)_ is a hand-carved, wooden, full-head mask that sports several holes along each side of the face. The first time each day that you begin your turn unconscious and within 25 feet of an enemy, metallic insect legs emerge from the holes in the mask and [Step](link_action_19853) 15 feet away from the nearest enemy, dragging your body along with the mask. For 1 minute, each time you begin your turn unconscious and within 25 feet of an enemy, the mask [Steps](link_action_19853) 15 feet away from the nearest enemy again. An ally can signal the mask with a single action, which has the [auditory](link_trait_1469) and [concentrate](link_trait_1432) traits. If the mask hears the signal, it attempts to move you towards that ally when it [Steps](link_action_19853) away from the nearest enemy.\n\nIf more than one enemy is equidistant, the mask [Steps](link_action_19853) away from one of them at random. The mask possesses no special senses and does not react to hidden or undetected enemies, nor can it distinguish that a creature not acting openly hostile is an enemy.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12411,"bulk":"1","name":"Skittering Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2984523373022883","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1