ersion":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4547","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:40.167837+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Smother shroud](link_item_12418) robs a victim of distinguishing features, making it difficult for anyone to identify the corpse. Swelling and distention of facial features makes the victim unrecognizable. Increase the DC of any checks made to identify a creature under the effects of [smother shroud](link_item_12418) by twice the stage of the [poison](link_trait_1476). If the victim dies while under the effects of this [poison](link_trait_1476), its corpse retains an inability to take actions with the auditory trait, and if it tries to speak and fails, it counts against responses to the *[talking corpse](link_spell_4887)* spell.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 22 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 2d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and dazzled (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, dazzled, a –4 status penalty to Perception checks to hear and smell, and must succeed at a DC 10 flat check to take actions with the auditory trait or the action is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, blinded, deafened, unable to smell, unable to take actions with the auditory trait, and unable to breathe","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12418,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Smother Shroud","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4607545521624809","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4547","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"70"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:40.167837+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n[Smother shroud](link_item_12418) robs a victim of distinguishing features, making it difficult for anyone to identify the corpse. Swelling and distention of facial features makes the victim unrecognizable. Increase the DC of any checks made to identify a creature under the effects of [smother shroud](link_item_12418) by twice the stage of the [poison](link_trait_1476). If the victim dies while under the effects of this [poison](link_trait_1476), its corpse retains an inability to take actions with the auditory trait, and if it tries to speak and fails, it counts against responses to the *[talking corpse](link_spell_4887)* spell.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 22 Fortitude\n\n**Maximum Duration** 10 rounds\n\n**Stage 1** 2d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and dazzled (1 round)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, dazzled, a –4 status penalty to Perception checks to hear and smell, and must succeed at a DC 10 flat check to take actions with the auditory trait or the action is lost (1 round)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, blinded, deafened, unable to smell, unable to take actions with the auditory trait, and unable to breathe","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12419,"type":"item","before":{"id":12419,"bulk":"0","name":"Snarling Badger (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2146944863164367","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":