e","value":2,"variable":"SKILL_DIPLOMACY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A _[socialite staff](link_item_12425)_ is designed as an ornate cane, its metal body glimmering with jewels and gold inlays. A sculpture carved from obsidian tops the head of the staff, its design depending on its wielder's taste. Common choices include birds, flowers, or family crests. While wielding a [socialite staff](link_item_12425), you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) on members of high society.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[read the air](link_spell_9011)*\n*   **1st** *[charm](link_spell_4516)*, *[restyle](link_spell_9015)*\n*   **2nd** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[phantom crowd](link_spell_9000)*\n*   **3rd** *[bottomless stomach](link_spell_8817)*, *[shift blame](link_spell_5449)*\n*   **4th** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[suggestion](link_spell_4865)*\n*   **5th** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[charm](link_spell_4516)*, *[glimmer of charm](link_spell_5367)*, *[suggestion](link_spell_4865)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12425,"bulk":"1","name":"Socialite Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"754438803886308","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4791","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"134"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":2,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["action:make-an-impression"]}],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:44.726367+00:00","operations":[{"id":"d423f91c-8ef7-40a4-bfb1-b0eecbb2732e","data":{"text":"to Make an Impression on members of high society","type":"circumstance","value":2,"variable":"SKILL_DIPLOMACY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A _[socialite staff](link_item_12425)_ is designed as an ornate cane, its metal body glimmering with jewels and gold inlays. A sculpture carved from obsidian tops the head of the staff, its design depending on its wielder's taste. Common choices include birds, flowers, or family crests. While wielding a [socialite staff](link_item_12425), you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) on members of high society.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[read the air](link_spell_9011)*\n*   **1st** *[charm](link_spell_4516)*, *[restyle](link_spell_9015)*\n*   **2nd** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[phantom crowd](link_spell_9000)*\n*   **3rd** *[bottomless stomach](link_spell_8817)*, *[shift blame](link_spell_5449)*\n*   **4th** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[suggestion](link_spell_4865)*\n*   **5th** *[befitting attire](link_spell_8803)*, *[charm](link_spell_4516)*, *[glimmer of charm](link_spell_5367)*, *[suggestion](link_spell_4865)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12426,"type":"item","before":{"id":12426,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Solar Shellflower","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3811723121440009","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1686,3073,1459,1542],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":70,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"fire"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1892","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"39"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"flintlock-musket","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:45.684378+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [flintlock musket](link_item_13574)_ features multiple triangular panels that can be folded out of the stock, like the petals of a tigridia flower, that collect sunlight and feed it into the spark gun's core. All damage dealt by a _[solar shellflower](link_item_12426)_ is [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day (but see below); **Effect** One of the panels from the _[solar shellflower](link_item_12426)_ detaches and unfurls into a tigridia-shaped construct of flame. For the next 1 minute, whenever you [Strike](link_action_19856) an enemy with the _[solar shellflower](link_item_12426)_, the construct fires a smaller jet of [fire](link_trait_1542) that automatically hits the target, dealing 3d4 additional persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage or twice that on a critical hit.\n\nThe _[solar shellflower](link_item_12426)_ usually requires a full day to replenish enough solar energy to recharge this Activation, but if used in an environment with especially strong sunlight, such as in a desert, cliff above the clouds, or near the summer solstice, it can recharge in 1 hour instead.","availability":null,"cont