tion, but if used in an environment with especially strong sunlight, such as in a desert, cliff above the clouds, or near the summer solstice, it can recharge in 1 hour instead.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12427,"type":"item","before":{"id":12427,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Soothing Powder (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5033717366533079","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4478","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:27:17.900Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:46.202406+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSoothing powders are remedies made to stop a particular type of persistent damage. Each damage type requires a different formula, with the most popular being bleed [soothing powder](link_item_12427), [poison](link_trait_1476) [soothing powder](link_item_12427), [fire](link_trait_1542) [soothing powder](link_item_12427), and [acid](link_trait_1528) [soothing powder](link_item_12427). You Activate [soothing powder](link_item_12427) by sprinkling it on yourself or another creature within reach. The target can immediately attempt a new flat check to remove persistent damage the powder works against. This powder lowers the DC to 10, as normal for a particularly appropriate type of help.\n\nIn addition to the effects described above, the powder persists for 1 minute, lowering the DCs of flat checks against that type of persistent damage due to particularly effective assistance.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12427,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Soothing Powder (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5033717366533079","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4478","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:27:17.900Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:46.202406+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSoothing powders are remedies made to stop a particular type of persistent damage. Each damage type requires a different formula, with the most popular being bleed [soothing powder](link_item_12427), [poison](link_trait_1476) [soothing powder](link_item_12427), [fire](link_trait_1542) [soothing powder](link_item_12427), and [acid](link_trait_1528) [soothing powder](link_item_12427). You Activate [soothing powder](link_item_12427) by sprinkling it on yourself or another creature within reach. The target can immediately attempt a new flat check to remove persistent damage the powder works against. This powder lowers the DC to 10, as normal for a particularly appropriate type of help.