re](link_trait_1542) damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage, takes double persistent damage, is blinded for 1 round, and is dazzled while the persistent damage lasts.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage, full persistent damage, and is dazzled while the persistent damage lasts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12437,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sparking Spellgun (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1540460377247259","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1542,1504,2868],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4658","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"98"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:53.316682+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nA broad wooden tube with a handle, a _[sparking spellgun](link_item_12437)_ radiates warmth. You Activate the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun fires a small ball of sparks and fire, then crumbles to ash. The ball explodes in a flash when it hits, dealing 7d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage and 3d4 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542) damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage, takes double persistent damage, is blinded for 1 round, and is dazzled while the persistent damage lasts.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage, full persistent damage, and is dazzled while the persistent damage lasts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12438,"type":"item","before":{"id":12438,"bulk":"","name":"Sparkler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3882853470275396","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"sp":4},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1542],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4479","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:53.907033+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Access** Sparklers are common in Tian Xia and Vudra and can be [Crafted](link_action_19617) by those who can specifically [Craft](link_action_19617) fireworks (such as a [fireworks technician](link_feat_25718)).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA [sparkler](link_item_12438) gives off colorful sparks, burning for 1 minute. It provides bright light in a 10-foot radius (and dim light for the next 10 feet). While the [sparkler](link_item_12438) burns, you can use it as an improvised weapon, dealing 1 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a hit. On a critical hit, you cause the target to become dazzled for 1 round.\n\nYou can touch a [sparkler](link_item_12438) to a flammable object as part of the action you spend Activating it or as a separate [Interact](link_action_19733) action while the [sparkler](link_item_12438) is already activated. If you do so, the [sparkler](link_item_12438) can ignite flammable objects the way a [matchstick](link_item_7578) does.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12438,"bulk":"","name":"Sparkler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3882853470275396","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"sp":4},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1542],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4479","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"55"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:53.907033+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Access** Sparklers are common in Tian Xia and Vudra and can be [Crafted](link_action_19617) by those who can specifically [Craft](link_action_19617) fireworks (such as a [fireworks technician](link_feat_25718)).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA [sparkler](link_item_12438) gives off colorful sparks, burning for 1 minute. It provides bright light in a 10-foot radius (and dim light for the next 10 feet). While the [sparkler](link_item_12438) burns, you can use it as an improvised weapon, dealing 1 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a hit. On a critical hit, you cause the target to become dazzled for 1 round.\n\nYou can touch a [sparkler](link_item_12438) to a flammable object as part of the action you spend Activating it or as a separate [Interact](link_action_19733) action while the [sparkler](link_item_12438) is already activated. If you do so, the [sparkler](link_item_12438) can ignite flammable objects the way a [matchstick](link_item_7578) does.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12439,"type":"item","before":{"id":12439,"bulk":"0","name":"Spectacles of Inquiry","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6463576230445341","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4848","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"perception"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:54.446147+00:00","operations":[{"id":"23a10ea1-0231-4720-b8c6-5e86a2129bcc","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Anything viewed through these thin spectacles looks crisp and clear, and the earpieces accentuate sounds around you. You gain a +2 item bonus to Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** The spectacles key in on someone to show you their social cues in perfect clarity. Choose a creature you can see. You gain a +3 item bonus on Perception checks you make to use [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) against that creature. This benefit lasts until you Activate the item again in this way.  \nIf you're an investigator, you can use this activation as part of the [Devise a Stratagem](link_feat_33008) action (even if you're doing it as a free action). Alternatively, you can use it as part of the [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995) activity, even though you can't see the creature. You must choose the same creature you chose for [Devise a Stratagem](link_feat_33008) or [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an investigator."},"after":{"id":12439,"bulk":"0","name":"Spectacles of Inquiry","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6463576230445341","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4848","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"perception"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:54.446147+00:00","operations":[{"id":"23a10ea1-0231-4720-b8c6-5e86a2129bcc","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Anything viewed through these thin spectacles looks crisp and clear, and the earpieces accentuate sounds around you. You gain a +2 item bonus to Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** The spectacles key in on someone to show you their social cues in perfect clarity. Choose a creature you can see. You gain a +3 item bonus on Perception checks you make to use [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) against that creature. This benefit lasts until you Activate the item again in this way.  \nIf you're an investigator, you can use this activation as part of the [Devise a Stratagem](link_feat_33008) action (even if you're doing it as a free action). Alternatively, you can use it as part of the [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995) activity, even though you can't see the creature. You must choose the same creature you chose for [Devise a Stratagem](link_feat_33008) or [Pursue a Lead](link_feat_30995).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are an investigator."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12440,"type":"item","before":{"id":12440,"bulk":"0","name":"Spectacles of Piercing Sight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7887863780286337","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4849","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:54.990016+00:00","operations":null,"description":"With lenses set in a silver frame, [spectacles of piercing sight](link_item_12440) grant you a +3 item bonus to visual Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You can see into and through solid matter for 1 minute. This vision can pierce through solid materials up to 20 feet away as if looking at something in normal light even if no illumination is available. You can see through up to 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of metal, or 3 feet of wood or dirt. A thin sheet of lead blocks this vision entirely.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12440,"bulk":"0","name":"Spectacles of Piercing Sight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7887863780286337","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"worn eyepiece","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4849","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"147"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":3,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:54.990016+00:00","operations":null,"description":"With lenses set in a silver frame, [spectacles of piercing sight](link_item_12440) grant you a +3 item bonus to visual Perception checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You can see into and through solid matter for 1 minute. This vision can pierce through solid materials up to 20 feet away as if looking at something in normal light even if no illumination is available. You can see through up to 1 foot of stone, 1 inch of metal, or 3 feet of wood or dirt. A thin sheet of lead blocks this vision entirely.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12441,"type":"item","before":{"id":12441,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spell Duelist's Siphon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3894036489287035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4716","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:55.622567+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Metal clasps line the spine of this book, and diagrams displaying proper somatic casting forms are etched into its cover.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You're targeted with an [arcane](link_trait_1459) spell attack and you have this grimoire raised; **Requirements** You have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat\n\n**Effect** The grimoire attempts to absorb knowledge of the spell targeting you. You attempt to [counteract](link_action_27519) the triggering spell. If you succeed, the spell is absorbed into the grimoire, and the diagrams on the cover change to indicate the somatic gestures and sigils for the [counteracted](link_action_27519) spell. While the grimoire contains a spell, you can spend a spell slot of the same or higher rank as the spell in the grimoire to cast that spell instead, heightened to the appropriate rank (if you spent a higher-rank spell slot). After you cast the spell, it's expended from the grimoire.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12441,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spell Duelist's Siphon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3894036489287035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4716","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:55.622567+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Metal clasps line the spine of this book, and diagrams displaying proper somatic casting forms are etched into its cover.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You're targeted with an [arcane](link_trait_1459) spell attack and you have this grimoire raised; **Requirements** You have the [Raise a Tome](link_feat_22570) feat\n\n**Effect** The grimoire attempts to absorb knowledge of the spell targeting you. You attempt to [counteract](link_action_27519) the triggering spell. If you succeed, the spell is absorbed into the grimoire, and the diagrams on the cover change to indicate the somatic gestures and sigils for the [counteracted](link_action_27519) spell. While the grimoire contains a spell, you can spend a spell slot of the same or higher rank as the spell in the grimoire to cast that spell instead, heightened to the appropriate rank (if you spent a higher-rank spell slot). After you cast the spell, it's expended from the grimoire.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12442,"type":"item","before":{"id":12442,"bulk":"0","name":"Spell Echo Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5981383387860277","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":5500},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4591","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"82"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:56.486212+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nGenerous amounts of [djezet](link_item_15058) and [orichalcum](link_item_15145) mix in a [spell echo shot](link_item_12442). When you Activate it, you name up to four creatures, in addition to you, that the ammunition's magic works for. When [spell echo shot](link_item_12442) strikes a target, which can be a square, it remains intact. It moves with a creature it struck, unless the GM determines otherwise, until that creature regains any Hit Points. If it doesn't stick to the target, the active ammunition instead falls into the target's space, remaining active. If you or one of the four selected creatures include the ammunition in the area of a spell that is 5th rank or lower; has an area of a burst, cone, or line; and does not have a duration, the materials in the ammunition immediately duplicate that spell with the same parameters. A duplicated spell can't be duplicated again by another effect. Duplicating a spell destroys the ammunition, which otherwise remains active for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12442,"bulk":"0","name":"Spell Echo Shot","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5981383387860277","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":5500},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4591","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"82"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:22:56.486212+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\nGenerous amounts of [djezet](link_item_15058) and [orichalcum](link_item_15145) mix in a [spell echo shot](link_item_12442). When you Activate it, you name up to four creatures, in addition to you, that the ammunition's magic works for. When [spell echo shot](link_item_12442) strikes a target, which can be a square, it remains intact. It moves with a creature it struck, unless the GM determines otherwise, until that creature regains any Hit Points. If it doesn't stick to the target, the active ammunition instead falls into the target's space, remaining active. If you or one of the four selected creatures include the ammunition in the area of a spell that is 5th rank or lower; has an area of a burst, cone, or line; and does not have a duration, the materials in the ammunition immediately duplicate that spell with the same parameters. A duplicated spell can't be duplicated again by another effect. Duplicating a spell destroys the ammunition, which otherwise remains active for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12451,"type":"item","before":{"id":12451,"bulk":"1","name":"Spellstriker Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7866148388481494","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7755,"name":"Shifting"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4792","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"134"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7853,"bulk":"1","name":"Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":1577800666839305,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[3630,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":3,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","image_url