llstrike](link_feat_25595)—explodes out. All creatures in a 5-foot emanation take 1d6 damage per rank of the spell, with a basic Reflex save against your spell DC. This damage is the same type the spell would have dealt, and the activation gains that trait; if the spell would have dealt multiple types of damage, choose one of them. If the damage of the explosion is [mental](link_trait_1448), the save is basic Will instead of Reflex.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[ignition](link_spell_4674)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[echoing weapon](link_spell_8865)*, *[sure strike](link_spell_4881)*\n    \n*   **2nd** *[acid grip](link_spell_4389)*, *[telekinetic maneuver](link_spell_4892)*\n    \n*   **3rd** *[echoing weapon](link_spell_8865)*, *[haste](link_spell_4654)*\n    \n*   **4th** *[acid grip](link_spell_4389)*, *[weapon storm](link_spell_4951)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You have the magus's [Spellstrike](link_feat_25595) activity. Supply one casting of all listed ranks of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12451,"bulk":"1","name":"Spellstriker Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7866148388481494","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1400},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7755,"name":"Shifting"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4792","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"134"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":"staff","image_url":"","is_sho