":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4499","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"61"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:39:33.652Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:06.853395+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis sticky fluid is made from the silk glands of giant spiders. When you drink a [spiderfoot brew](link_item_12456), tiny hairs grow on your hands and feet, granting you a climb Speed and an item bonus to Athletics checks made to [Climb](link_action_19612) for the listed duration.\n\nThe climb Speed is 20 feet, the item bonus is +2, and the duration is 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12456,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spiderfoot Brew (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"927833704935205","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1456],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4499","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"61"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:39:33.652Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:06.853395+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis sticky fluid is made from the silk glands of giant spiders. When you drink a [spiderfoot brew](link_item_12456), tiny hairs grow on your hands and feet, granting you a climb Speed and an item bonus to Athletics checks made to [Climb](link_action_19612) for the listed duration.\n\nThe climb Speed is 20 feet, the item bonus is +2, and the duration is 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12457,"type":"item","before":{"id":12457,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spiritual Warhorn (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8986874462726829","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1560,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4659","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"98"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:48:44.156Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:07.416542+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA *[spiritual warhorn](link_item_12457)* is a trumpet made of horn, leather, and metal. When you play a single, long note from the warhorn, it calls forth six Medium spiritual manifestations of warriors to aid you. Each warrior appears in an open square adjacent to an enemy within 60 feet of you, makes a [Strike](link_action_19856) for 2d6 [force](link_trait_1560) damage (with a +22 attack bonus), and then disappears. The warriors can flank with one another and with you and your allies. Once the magic is used, the warhorn remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [musical instrument](link_item_7602).\n\nSix warriors manifest with a +22 attack modifier.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12457,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spiritual Warhorn (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8986874462726829","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1560,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4659","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"98"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T11:48:44.156Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:07.416542+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA *[spiritual warhorn](link_item_12457)* is a trumpet made of horn, leather, and metal. When you play a single, long note from the warhorn, it calls forth six Medium spiritual manifestations of warriors to aid you. Each warrior appears in an open square adjacent to an enemy within 60 feet of you, makes a [Strike](link_action_19856) for 2d6 [force](link_trait_1560) damage (with a +22 attack bonus), and then disappears. The warriors can flank with one another and with you and your allies. Once the magic is used, the warhorn remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [musical instrument](link_item_7602).\n\nSix warriors manifest with a +22 attack modifier.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12458,"type":"item","before":{"id":12458,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spiritual Warhorn (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5108053440015147","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":30},"usage":"he