er hour\n\n**Effect** You [Stride](link_action_19855) up to twice your speed or [Leap](link_action_19735) up to 20 feet horizontally and 5 feet vertically.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12463,"bulk":"1","name":"Spring Heel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8689815989228178","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":150},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1539],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4695","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:13.1851+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Fitted into each of these prosthetic legs is a large spring, tightly bound around a collapsible shaft. When released, the spring unspools rapidly and the shaft telescopes out and back, returning to its compressed form and catapulting you forward.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You [Stride](link_action_19855) up to twice your speed or [Leap](link_action_19735) up to 20 feet horizontally and 5 feet vertically.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12464,"type":"item","before":{"id":12464,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sprite Apple (Chartreuse)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6015028794130817","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":26},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1517],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1932","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"51"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:13.826565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA sparkling candy coating covers a [sprite apple](link_item_12464). For 10 minutes after consuming a [sprite apple](link_item_12464), you shed bright light in a 20-foot emanation (and dim light for the next 20 feet). While shedding this light, you can't be concealed if you're visible, and if you're invisible, you're concealed instead rather than being undetected. The light matches the vibrant color of the apple's candy coating. Creatures in the bright light feel more in tune with nature, gaining a +1 item bonus to Nature checks and to Diplomacy checks attempted against [animals](link_trait_2409) or [plants](link_trait_1654) (if they have the [Animal Empathy](link_feat_19908) feat, [Plant Empathy](link_feat_20412) feat, or some other ability to make such checks).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12464,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sprite Apple (Chartreuse)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6015028794130817","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":26},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1517],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1932","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"51"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:13.826565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA sparkling candy coating covers a [s