ou're visible, and if you're invisible, you're concealed instead rather than being undetected. The light matches the vibrant color of the apple's candy coating. Creatures in the bright light feel a sense of calm, gaining a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12467,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sprite Apple (Teal)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2171525403160584","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":41},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1517],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1932","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"51"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:15.565021+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 1 minute ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA sparkling candy coating covers a [sprite apple](link_item_12467). For 10 minutes after consuming a [sprite apple](link_item_12467), you shed bright light in a 20-foot emanation (and dim light for the next 20 feet). While shedding this light, you can't be concealed if you're visible, and if you're invisible, you're concealed instead rather than being undetected. The light matches the vibrant color of the apple's candy coating. Creatures in the bright light feel a sense of calm, gaining a +1 item bonus to saving throws against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12468,"type":"item","before":{"id":12468,"bulk":"1","name":"Spurned Lute","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6523838997023638","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4918","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["playing"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:16.246071+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Made of a deep-brown rosewood, a [spurned lute](link_item_12468) is adorned with carved flowers. The lute appears to be and functions as a [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604). (Other spurned instruments exist, but the lute is the least rare.) This lute has a jealous streak, demanding total loyalty from its \"partner\" musician. After you play the lute for the first time, it fuses to you. If you go a day without using it to [Perform](link_action_19746), you become stupefied 1 until you next do so. After that, when you attempt a Performance check using an instrument other than the lute, you take a –4 circumstance penalty to do so, and you must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12468,"bulk":"1","name":"Spurned Lute","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6523838997023638","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4918","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"performance","predicate":["playing"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:16.246071+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Made of a deep-brown rosewood, a [spurned lute](link_item_12468) is adorned with carved flowers. The lute appears to be and functions as a [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604). (Other spurned instruments exist, but the lute is the least rare.) This lute has a jealous streak, demanding total loyalty from its \"partner\" musician. After you play the lute for the first time, it fuses to you. If you go a day without using it to [Perform](link_action_19746), you become stupefied 1 until you next do so. After that, when you attempt a Performance check using an instrument other than the lute, you take a –4 circumstance penalty to do so, and you must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or become stupefied 1 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12469,"type":"item","before":{"id":12469,"bulk":"1","name":"Spy Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5988832760884496","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1175},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4793","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"134"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"staff","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:17.113283+00:00","operations":null,"description":"In its normal form, a _[spy staff](link_item_12469)_ is a slim rod of burnished wood with subtle etchings of eyes upon its sides. The first to develop the [spy staff](link_item_12469) were agents of Andoran's Twilight Talons, but such staves have spread to espionage agencies throughout the Inner Sea region and beyond.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** You change the shape and appearance of this staff to that of an ordinary handheld accessory of your choosing of the same Bulk. The staff's statistics don't change. Only a creature benefiting from *[truesight](link_spell_4912)* or a similar effect can attempt to disbelieve this illusion, with a DC of 32.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from the staff to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[message](link_spell_4720)*\n*   **1st** *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)*, *[invisible item](link_spell_6752)*, *[message rune](link_spell_7359)*\n*   **2nd** *[humanoid form](link_spell_4664)*, *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)*, *[disguise magic](link_spell_4570)*\n*   **3rd** *[clairaudience](link_spell_4520)*, *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)*, *[veil of privacy](link_spell_4930)*\n*   **4th** *[clairvoyance](link_spell_4521)*, *[peaceful bubble](link_spell_4754)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"after":{"id":12469,"bulk":"1","name":"Spy Staff (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5988832760884496","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1175},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1546,1831],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4793","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"134"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"ma