 <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nComposing a [stage fright missive](link_item_12482) usually involves creating a scathing review, insulting letter, or embarrassing image that ridicules the recipient. The activating creature must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be overcome with embarrassment for 1 hour, taking a –1 status penalty to Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, and Performance checks. During this time, if the creature attempts to speak or perform in front of an audience, they become sickened 1. When they recover from this sickened condition, the missive's effects end. You choose when composing the missive whether it remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) document or burns to ash after imparting its magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12482,"bulk":"0","name":"Stage Fright Missive","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5475751053637342","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":22},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1855,1504,1448,2874],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4599","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"85"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:27.489812+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nComposing a [stage fright missive](link_item_12482) usually involves creating a scathing review, insulting letter, or embarrassing image that ridicules the recipient. The activating creature must succeed at a DC 20 Will save or be overcome with embarrassment for 1 hour, taking a –1 status penalty to Deception, Diplomacy, Intimidation, and Performance checks. During this time, if the creature attempts to speak or perform in front of an audience, they become sickened 1. When they recover from this sickened condition, the missive's effects end. You choose when composing the missive whether it remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) document or burns to ash after imparting its magic.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12483,"type":"item","before":{"id":12483,"bulk":"1","name":"Standard of the Primeval Howl","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1036761054727035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4731","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":["intimidation","initiative"]},{"key":"Aura","slug":"standard-of-the-primeval-howl","radius":20,"traits":[],"effects":[{"uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: Standard of the Primeval Howl","events":["enter"],"affects":"all","includesSelf":false}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:28.034165+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These standards are always constructed from uncut wood and a leather banner painted with the visage of a snarling beast—a wolf, boar, bear, lion, dragon, or similarly imposing creature. And while it might become lost on a battlefield scattered with gaudier standards, its effect bolsters those around a competent leader. When carrying this banner, you gain a +1 item bonus to Intimidation checks and initiative rolls, and creatures in a 20-foot emanation also gain a +1 item bonus to initiative checks.\n\n\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** An ally within 20 feet of you critically hits with a [Strike](link_action_19856); **Requirements** You have the [Battle Cry](link_feat_19945) skill feat\n\n**Effect** You attempt to [Demoralize](link_action_19624) the foe the [Strike](link_action_19856) hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12483,"bulk":"1","name":"Standard of the Primeval Howl","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1036761054727035","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4731","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":["intimidation","initiative"]},{"key":"Aura","slug":"standard-of-the-primeval-howl","radius":20,"traits":[],"effects":[{"uuid":"Compendium.pf2e.equipment-effects.Item.Effect: Standard of the Primeval Howl","events":["enter"],"affects":"all","includesSelf":false}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:28.034165+00:00","operations":null,"description":"These standards are always constructed from uncut wood and a leather banner painted with the visage of a snarling beast—a wolf, boar, bear, lion, dragon, or similarly imposing creature. And while it might become lost on a battlefield scattered with gaudier standards, its effect bolsters those around a competent leader. When carrying this banner, you gain a +1 item bonus to Intimidation checks and initiative rolls, and creatures in a 20-foot emanation also gain a +1 item bonus to initiative checks.\n\n\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour; **Trigger** An ally within 20 feet of you critically hits with a [Strike](link_action_19856); **Requirements** You have the [Battle Cry](link_feat_19945) skill feat\n\n**Effect** You attempt to [Demoralize](link_action_19624) the foe the [Strike](link_action_19856) hit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12484,"type":"item","before":{"id":12484,"bulk":"1","name":"Starfall Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3911076183525367","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":23000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":100,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":100,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4394","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"fire","value":15}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":17,"material":{"type":"adamantine","grade":"high"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"heavy-rondache","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":50},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:28.668115+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [high-grade adamantine](link_item_14879) [heavy rondache](link_item_12083) (Hardness 17, HP 100, BT 50) bears a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [shield boss](link_item_7753)_ and has dents that resemble craters on its surface. While wielding the shield, you have [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance 15.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You [Stride](link_action_19855) up to three times. This movement doesn't trigger reactions and ignores difficult terrain. At the end of your movement, you deal 6d10 bludgeoning damage in a 10-foot emanation and 14d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage in a 40-foot emanation (DC 40 basic Reflex save, with the results applying to both the bludgeoning and [fire](link_trait_1542) damage). The space where you end your movement and all adjacent spaces become difficult terrain for 1 minute, and the shield glows red-hot for 10 minutes, during which it gains the effect of the [greater flaming](link_item_6960) property rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12484,"bulk":"1","name":"Starfall Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3911076183525367","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":19,"price":{"gp":23000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":100,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":100,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4394","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"fire","value":15}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":1,"hardness":17,"material":{"type":"adamantine","grade":"high"},"quantity":1,"base_item":"heavy-rondache","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":50},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:28.668115+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This [high-grade adamantine](link_item_14879) [heavy rondache](link_item_12083) (Hardness 17, HP 100, BT 50) bears a _[+3](link_item_7952) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [shield boss](link_item_7753)_ and has dents that resemble craters on its surface. While wielding the shield, you have [fire](link_trait_1542) resistance 15.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You [Stride](link_action_19855) up to three times. This movement doesn't trigger reactions and ignores difficult terrain. At the end of your movement, you deal 6d10 bludgeoning damage in a 10-foot emanation and 14d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage in a 40-foot emanation (DC 40 basic Reflex save, with the results applying to both the bludgeoning and [fire](link_trait_1542) damage). The space where you end your movement and all adjacent spaces become difficult terrain for 1 minute, and the shield glows red-hot for 10 minutes, during which it gains the effect of the [greater flaming](link_item_6960) property rune.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12485,"type":"item","before":{"id":12485,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Starfaring Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6138641114073734","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":24,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1475,1527,1517],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4895","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"180"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"@actor.attributes.speed.total","selector":"fly"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":10,"selector":"speed"},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":10,"color":"#9b7337","shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"torch","speed":1,"intensity":4}}},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/equipment/back/cloak-collared-blue-gold.webp"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:29.270137+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ee49e3da-03d6-4667-90be-a1805b335bf3","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"+10","variable":"SPEED"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"08afd622-4d4e-4605-8df1-dce98d90ef92","data":{"value":{"storeId":"CHARACTER","variable":"SPEED"},"variable":"SPEED_FLY"},"type":"bindValue"}],"description":"The swirling folds of a _[starfaring cloak](link_item_12485)_ appear to contain the night sky, with the stars rotating hypnotically through its firmament shedding dim light to a range of 10 feet. While wearing the cloak, you gain a +10-foot item bonus to your Speed and a fly Speed equal to your Speed. You can survive comfortably without breathing, in the void of space, and in severe or extreme cold or heat. Also, you gain sustenance from starlight and sunlight, so if you're outdoors for an hour or more per day, you don't need to eat or drink. While wearing the cloak, you can navigate perfectly and unerringly by looking up at the sky.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You make an attack roll, skill check, or saving throw; **Effect** Reroll the triggering roll and take the higher result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The cloak casts *[sleep](link_spell_4837)* at 4th rank (DC 42).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per week; **Effect** The cloak casts *[teleport](link_spell_4895)* at 10th rank. If you name no destination, it teleports you to a random planet in a random location that's safe for you.\n\n**Destruction** If the wearer of a _[starfaring cloak](link_item_12485)_ is bound by *[imprisonment](link_spell_7318)* for a century and a day, the cloak dissolves into light. This time is reduced to a year and a day if the wearer is placed in eternal slumber by *[imprisonment](link_spell_7318)* and subjected to the *[nightmare](link_spell_4741)* spell once per day.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12485,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Starfaring Cloak","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6138641114073734","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":24,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1568,1475,1527,1517],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4895","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"180"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"BaseSpeed","value":"@actor.attributes.speed.total","selector":"fly"},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":10,"selector":"speed"},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":10,"color":"#9b7337","shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"torch","speed":1,"intensity":4}}},{"key":"TokenEffectIcon","value":"icons/equipment/back/cloak-collared-blue-gold.webp"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:29.270137+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ee49e3da-03d6-4667-90be-a1805b335bf3","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"+10","variable":"SPEED"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"08afd622-4d4e-4605-8df1-dce98d90ef92","data":{"value":{"storeId":"CHARACTER","variable":"SPEED"},"variable":"SPEED_FLY"},"type":"bindValue"}],"description":"The swirling folds of a _[starfaring cloak](link_item_12485)_ appear to contain the night sky, with the stars rotating hypnotically through its firmament shedding dim light to a range of 10 feet. While wearing the cloak, you gain a +10-foot item bonus to your Speed and a fly Speed equal to your Speed. You can survive comfortably without breathing, in the void of space, and in severe or extreme cold or heat. Also, you gain sustenance from starlight and sunlight, so if you're outdoors for an hour or more per day, you don't need to eat or drink. While wearing the cloak, you can navigate perfectly and unerringly by looking up at the sky.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [fortune](link_trait_1460)) **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You make an attack roll, skill check, or saving throw; **Effect** Reroll the triggering roll and take the higher result. This is a [fortune](link_trait_1460) effect.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The cloak casts *[sleep](link_spell_4837)* at 4th rank (DC 42).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per week; **Effect** The cloak casts *[teleport](link_spell_4895)* at 10th rank. If you name no destination, it teleports you to a random planet in a random location that's safe for you.\n\n**Destruction** If the wearer of a _[starfaring cloak](link_item_12485)_ is bound by *[imprisonment](link_spell_7318)* for a century and a day, the cloak dissolves into light. This time is reduced to a year and a day if the wearer is placed in eternal slumber by *[imprisonment](link_spell_7318)* and subjected to the *[nightmare](link_spell_4741)* spell once per day.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12486,"type":"item","before":{"id":12486,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Stargazer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3558886440938714","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1590,1626],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4413","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"club","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:30.579173+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you invest this [clear quartz crystal ball](link_item_6849), it orbits your head like an aeon stone. As long as you have the [stargazer](link_item_12486) invested, you can use an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to direct it to orbit one of your hands where you can telekinetically smash the orb into foes, wielding it as a _[+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [returning](link_item_7708) [club](link_item_6820)_. While you're directing the [stargazer](link_item_12486), your hand is full, and you can send it back to your head with another [Interact](link_action_19733) action. On a critical hit, the [stargazer](link_item_12486) pulses with hypnotic starlight, [dazzling](link_condition_dazzled) the struck creature for 1 round. A [stargazer](link_item_12486) doesn't add critical specialization effects.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12486,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Stargazer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3558886440938714","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504,1590,1626],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"potency":2,"property":[{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4413","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"35"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"simple","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"club","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:30.579173+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you invest this [clear quartz crystal ball](link_item_6849), it orbits your head like an aeon stone. As long as you have the [stargazer](link_item_12486) invested, you can use an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to direct it to orbit one of your hands where you can telekinetically smash the orb into foes, wielding it as a _[+2](link_item_7951) [greater striking](link_item_7860) [returning](link_item_7708) [club](link_item_6820)_. While you're directing the [stargazer](link_item_12486), your hand is full, and you can send it back to your head with another [Interact](link_action_19733) action. On a critical hit, the [stargazer](link_item_12486) pulses with hypnotic starlight, [dazzling](link_condition_dazzled) the struck creature for 1 round. A [stargazer](link_item_12486) doesn't add critical specialization effects.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12487,"type":"item","before":{"id":12487,"bulk":"0","name":"Staring Skull","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3535368526839412","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":550},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4751","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:31.129409+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo usually depicts a humanoid skull with staring eyes in its sockets, but any creature with two eyes and a skull is possible, such as a wolf, phoenix, or psychopomp. When your dying condition increases to a value that would kill you, this tattoo reduces your dying value to 1 fewer than would kill you. If a [death](link_trait_1904) effect would kill you—provided the effect is from a creature of 8th level or lower or a spell of 4th rank or lower—this tattoo activates and keeps you alive instead. You can benefit from this ability only once per day. Each time the tattoo prevents you from dying, one of its eyes disappears, the image now featuring either an empty socket or an eyepatch or other covering. After both eyes vanish, the tattoo becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) and no longer protects you. If you receive a new _[staring skull](link_item_12487)_ tattoo, any other you have loses its staring eyes and becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12487,"bulk":"0","name":"Staring Skull","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3535368526839412","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":550},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4751","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:31.129409+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo usually depicts a humanoid skull with staring eyes in its sockets, but any creature with two eyes and a skull is possible, such as a wolf, phoenix, or psychopomp. When your dying condition increases to a value that would kill you, this tattoo reduces your dying value to 1 fewer than would kill you. If a [death](link_trait_1904) effect would kill you—provided the effect is from a creature of 8th level or lower or a spell of 4th rank or lower—this tattoo activates and keeps you alive instead. You can benefit from this ability only once per day. Each time the tattoo prevents you from dying, one of its eyes disappears, the image now featuring either an empty socket or an eyepatch or other covering. After both eyes vanish, the tattoo becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504) and no longer protects you. If you receive a new _[staring skull](link_item_12487)_ tattoo, any other you have loses its staring eyes and becomes non-[magical](link_trait_1504).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12488,"type":"item","before":{"id":12488,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Starsong Nectar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5650343262250120","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":14000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1460,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4626","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:31.722376+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA liquid with the appearance of an expressive night sky and a taste that's sheer pleasure, _[starsong nectar](link_item_12488)_ grants you cheerful confidence and incredible luck for 10 minutes after you drink it. However, if you show too much caution at any point during this time (GM's discretion), you must succeed at a DC 6 flat check or the potion's effects end. While the potion lasts, you gain a +3 status bonus to attack rolls, initiative rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks, and you aren't off-guard to creatures due to them flanking you or being hidden from or undetected by you. You are temporarily immune to this potion for 24 hours once its effects end.\n\nWhile the potion lasts, though, if you take a moment to imagine the future, you choose the best courses of action. This aspect of the potion grants you the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per round; **Effect** Until the start of your next turn, roll two d20s for any attack rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks you make and take the higher result.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12488,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Starsong Nectar","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5650343262250120","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":14000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1460,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4626","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:31.722376+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA liquid with the appearance of an expressive night sky and a taste that's sheer pleasure, _[starsong nectar](link_item_12488)_ grants you cheerful confidence and incredible luck for 10 minutes after you drink it. However, if you show too much caution at any point during this time (GM's discretion), you must succeed at a DC 6 flat check or the potion's effects end. While the potion lasts, you gain a +3 status bonus to attack rolls, initiative rolls, Perception checks, saving throws, and skill checks, and you aren't off-guard to creatures due to them flanking you or being hidden from or undetected by you. You are temporarily immune to this potion for 24 hours once its effects end.\n\nWhile the potion lasts, though, if you take 