,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"sukgung","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:38.314253+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The sukgung is an extremely efficient crossbow most common in the nation of Hwanggot. Capable of lethal shots at remarkable distances, the sukgung is well-balanced enough to be fired with one hand.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:38.314253+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** [bolts](link_item_6751)\n\n* * *\n\nThe [sukgung](link_item_12495) is an extremely efficient crossbow most common in the nation of Hwanggot. Capable of lethal shots at remarkable distances, the [sukgung](link_item_12495) is well-balanced enough to be fired with one hand.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12496,"type":"item","before":{"id":12496,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sun Dazzler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4964329723781549","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1517,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4517","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:38.828545+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis metallic tube has a complex array of lenses and prisms at one end and a hatch at the other. The hatch can be unlocked, loaded with a [glow rod](link_item_6997), and refastened using 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions. A loaded [sun dazzler](link_item_12496) can be activated to burn the [glow rod](link_item_6997) to dust in a single focused flash, creating a 30-foot cone of scintillating light. All creatures in the cone must attempt a Fortitude 24 save, with the following effects.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 round or until it spends an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to rub its eyes, ending the blinded condition.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12496,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sun Dazzler","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4964329723781549","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":450},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1517,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4517","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:38.828545+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis metallic tube has a complex array of lenses and prisms at one end and a hatch at the other. The hatch can be unlocked, loaded with a [glow rod](link_item_6997), and refastened using 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions. A loaded [sun dazzler](link_item_12496) can be activated to burn the [glow rod](link_item_6997) to dust in a single focused flash, creating a 30-foot cone of scintillating light. All creatures in the cone must attempt a Fortitude 24 save, with the following effects.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 round or until it spends an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to rub its eyes, ending the blinded condition.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is blinded for 1 round.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12497,"type":"item","before":{"id":12497,"bulk":"0","name":"Sun Sight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6857839127431904","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":850},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4752","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","value":2,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:39.401885+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5b1a0d07-33fe-4730-8ecd-d34d79d4938f","data":{"text":"to Perception checks that involve sight.","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Placed under the eyes like rays of light, this tattoo burns away illusions with the unmerciful brilliance of the sun. You gain a +2 bonus to Perception checks that involve sight. If you're dazzled, you receive a new save at the start of each of your turns to end your dazzled condition.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> to <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The tattoo casts a 4th-rank [_blazing bolt_](link_spell_4414), with the rays emitting from your eyes. The number of actions you spend Activating the tattoo determines _[blazing bolt](link_spell_4414)_'s number of rays. The tattoo also attempts to dispel each [illusion](link_trait_1447) on a creature hit by a ray ([counteract](link_action_27519) rank 5th, [Counteract](link_action_27519) modifier +19).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12497,"bulk":"0","name":"Sun Sight","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6857839127431904","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":850},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4752","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","value":2,"selector":"perception","predicate":["visual"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:39.401885+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5b1a0d07-33fe-4730-8ecd-d34d79d4938f","data":{"text":"to Perception checks that involve sight.","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"PERCEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Placed under the eyes like rays of light, this tattoo burns away illusions with the unmerciful brilliance of the sun. You gain a +2 bonus to Perception checks that involve sight. If you're dazzled, you receive a new save at the start of each of your turns to end your dazzled condition.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> to <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The tattoo casts a 4th-rank [_blazing bolt_](link_spell_4414), with the rays emitting from your eyes. The number of actions you spend Activating the tattoo determines _[blazing bolt](link_spell_4414)_'s number of rays. The tattoo also attempts to dispel each [illusion](link_trait_1447) on a creature hit by a ray ([counteract](link_action_27519) rank 5th, [Counteract](link_action_27519) modifier +19).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12498,"type":"item","before":{"id":12498,"bulk":"1","name":"Sure-Step Crampons","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1982910621943248","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"worn shoes","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4844","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":2,"selector":["fortitude","reflex"],"predicate":["sure-step-crampons",{"or":["inflicts:prone","inflicts:forced-movement","action:trip","action:shove"]}]},{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"sure-step-crampons","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:40.021829+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Sure-step crampons](link_item_12498)_ are sturdy leather boots with warm fur lining and magically augmented steel crampons that offer the wearer purchase on even the slipperiest ice slicks. They allow you to walk across ice without difficulty, ignoring the uneven ground and difficult terrain caused by ice, and reducing greater difficult terrain caused by ice to difficult terrain.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're standing on an earthen, icy, or wooden surface\n\n**Effect** You dig the crampons into the spot where you're standing, offering additional support until the next time you move. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude or Reflex DC against attempts to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you. This bonus also applies to saving throws against spells or effects that attempt to move you or knock you prone. The bonus lasts until you move from your current spot.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12498,"bulk":"1","name":"Sure-Step Crampons","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1982910621943248","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":210},"usage":"worn shoes","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4844","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"146"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":2,"selector":["fortitude","reflex"],"predicate":["sure-step-crampons",{"or":["inflicts:prone","inflicts:forced-movement","action:trip","action:shove"]}]},{"key":"RollOption","domain":"all","option":"sure-step-crampons","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:40.021829+00:00","operations":null,"description":"_[Sure-step crampons](link_item_12498)_ are sturdy leather boots with warm fur lining and magically augmented steel crampons that offer the wearer purchase on even the slipperiest ice slicks. They allow you to walk across ice without difficulty, ignoring the uneven ground and difficult terrain caused by ice, and reducing greater difficult terrain caused by ice to difficult terrain.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Requirements** You're standing on an earthen, icy, or wooden surface\n\n**Effect** You dig the crampons into the spot where you're standing, offering additional support until the next time you move. You gain a +2 circumstance bonus to your Fortitude or Reflex DC against attempts to [Shove](link_action_19849) or [Trip](link_action_19865) you. This bonus also applies to saving throws against spells or effects that attempt to move you or knock you prone. The bonus lasts until you move from your current spot.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12499,"type":"item","before":{"id":12499,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sure-Step Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1493210006756735","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":17},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4627","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:40.627252+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe light-brown liquid of a [sure-step potion](link_item_12499) helps you find your footing. After drinking it, you gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks to [Balance](link_action_19608) for 1 hour. In addition, you can [Step](link_action_19853) into difficult terrain, and you aren't off-guard on uneven ground.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12499,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Sure-Step Potion","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1493210006756735","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":17},"usage":"held in one hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4627","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:40.627252+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe light-brown liquid of a [sure-step potion](link_item_12499) helps you find your footing. After drinking it, you gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks to [Balance](link_action_19608) for 1 hour. In addition, you can [Step](link_action_19853) into difficult terrain, and you aren't off-guard on uneven ground.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12500,"type":"item","before":{"id":12500,"bulk":"0","name":"Swallow-Spike (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7859365978612044","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4371","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:41.25621+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Your armor responds to your desire to break free of a creature grabbing you by growing spikes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([attack](link_trait_1520), [concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You become grabbed, restrained, or otherwise held immobilized in a creature's grasp, such as by being engulfed or swallowed; **Effect** Your armor suddenly grows spikes, attacking the triggering creature. The armor makes a melee attack with an attack modifier of +22 that deals 3d6 piercing damage. If the creature is swallowing or engulfing you, the attack deals an additional 2d6 damage, and damage from this attack can cut you free if it equals or exceeds the Rupture value of the immobilizing ability. This attack gets an item bonus to the attack roll equal to the armor's item bonus to your AC and an item bonus to damage equal to double that amount.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([attack](link_trait_1520), [concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** You're being held immobilized as described in the rune's other activation; **Effect** Your armor attacks the creature immobilizing you. The armor makes a melee attack against the creature, as described in the rune's other activation.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12500,"bulk":"0","name":"Swallow-Spike (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7859365978612044","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":1750},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4371","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"13"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":nul