ds":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":460},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4879","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"154"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"Resistance","type":"physical","value":10,"predicate":["origin:trait:swarm"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:43.280765+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[swarmeater's clasp](link_item_12503)_ features carved reliefs of verminous, swarming creatures. When you wear the clasp, you gain resistance 10 to physical damage from swarm creatures.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** a swarm creature is within your reach\n\n**Effect** You thrust your hand into the swarm, draw forth a squirming mass of vermin, and devour it. You recover 3d10+8 Hit Points and deal the same amount of bludgeoning damage to the swarm. The Hit Point recovery is a [vitality](link_trait_1478) [healing](link_trait_1442) effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12504,"type":"item","before":{"id":12504,"bulk":"0","name":"Swarming","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1414331228376515","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"etched-onto-thrown-weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4404","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:43.868427+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Able to copy itself many times over when thrown until the air is filled with deadly blades, a [swarming](link_item_12504) weapon turns a single weapon into a shower of devastation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You fling your weapon and it multiplies as it flies through the air, filling a 30-foot cone. All creatures within the area take damage equal to double the weapon's number of damage dice, with a DC 27 basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12504,"bulk":"0","name":"Swarming","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1414331228376515","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"etched-onto-thrown-weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4404","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"33"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:43.868427+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Able to copy itself many times over when thrown until the air is filled with deadly blades, a [swarming](link_item_12504) weapon turns a single weapon into a shower of devastation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** You fling your weapon and it multiplies as it flies through the air, filling a 30-foot cone. All creatures within the area take damage equal to double the weapon's number of damage dice, with a DC 27 basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12505,"type":"item","before":{"id":12505,"bulk":"1","name":"Swordstealer Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1137159685038700","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":6},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2904],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=32","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"swordstealer-shield","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:45.822352+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This specialized [steel shield](link_item_7855) features several wide metal hooks along its surface. These hooks help catch swords and other blades, reducing the impact of their incoming attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12505,"bulk":"1","name":"Swordstealer Shield","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1137159685038700","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":6},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2904],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Shields.aspx?ID=32","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":4,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"swordstealer-shield","speed_penalty":0,"broken_threshold":10},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:45.822352+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This specialized [steel shield](link_item_7855) features several wide metal hooks along its surface. These hooks help catch swords and other blades, reducing the impact of their incoming attacks.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12506,"type":"item","before":{"id":12506,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tactician's Helm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1797244896102888","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4871","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"warfare-lore"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Equipment.TacticiansHelm.ReactiveStrikeNote","title":"{item|name}","outcome":["success","criticalSuccess"],"selector":"melee-strike-attack-roll","predicate":["encounter",{"not":"self:participant:own-turn"}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:46.394344+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Repurposing and enchanting a helmet worn by a battlefield commander can create a [tactician's helm](link_item_12506), imparting knowledge of battlefield tactics that feeds off your minor victories. The helm grants you a +1 item bonus to Warfare Lore checks. Also, a jewel adorns the brow of the helmet. This jewel becomes charged each time you hit a creature with a [Reactive Strike](link_feat_19751). A [tactician's helm](link_item_12506) can hold up to 2 charges, and its charges reset to 0 when you invest it.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** One charge in the helm's jewel expires, and you choose one of the following effects.\n\n*   **Charge!** [Stride](link_action_19855) twice.\n*   **Move It!** You gain a +2 status bonus to Acrobatics and Athletics checks until the end of this turn. \n*   **Protect!** If you're wielding a shield, [Stride](link_action_19855) to a space adjacent to an ally, then [Raise your Shield](link_action_19750).\n*   **Re-Arm!** [Interact](link_action_19733) up to three times. Each of these actions must be used to do something on Changing Equipment.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12506,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tactician's Helm","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1797244896102888","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4871","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"152"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"warfare-lore"},{"key":"Note","text":"PF2E.SpecificRule.Equipment.TacticiansHelm.ReactiveStrikeNote","title":"{item|name}","outcome":["success","criticalSuccess"],"selector":"melee-strike-attack-roll","predicate":["encounter",{"not":"self:participant:own-turn"}]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:46.394344+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Repurposing and enchanting a helmet worn by a battlefield commander can create a [tactician's helm](link_item_12506), imparting knowledge of battlefield tactics that feeds off your minor victories. The helm grants you a +1 item bonus to Warfare Lore checks. Also, a jewel adorns the brow of the helmet. This jewel becomes charged each time you hit a creature with a [Reactive Strike](link_feat_19751). A [tactician's helm](link_item_12506) can hold up to 2 charges, and its charges reset to 0 when you invest it.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** One charge in the helm's jewel expires, and you choose one of the following effects.\n\n*   **Charge!** [Stride](link_action_19855) twice.\n*   **Move It!** You gain a +2 status bonus to Acrobatics and Athletics checks until the end of this turn. \n*   **Protect!** If you're wielding a shield, [Stride](link_action_19855) to a space adjacent to an ally, then [Raise your Shield](link_action_19750).\n*   **Re-Arm!** [Interact](link_action_19733) up to three times. Each of these actions must be used to do something on Changing Equipment.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12507,"type":"item","before":{"id":12507,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Talespinner's Lyre","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1965816783971423","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":235},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1504,1479,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2127","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"98"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:46.935948+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nPlucking a [talespinner's lyre](link_item_12507) while focusing on an event you witnessed causes the instrument to create an illusion in a 50-foot emanation that plays out your memory of the event in real time, complete with sights, sounds, and smells. You can [Sustain the Activation](link_action_19858) for up to 1 minute to keep it playing. The scene reproduces only what's in its area, including nothing beyond that even if present in the memory. The scene is realistic, but all observers can clearly tell it's an illusion. Observers can't interact with the scene directly nor can they taste or touch elements of it to get a sensation you didn't personally experience, but they can attempt skill checks to discern more about the scene without altering its contents. For example, no one could see something you didn't, such as the true form of a creature polymorphed into a squirrel, but an observer might be able to use Perception and [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) to discern the squirrel was acting unlike a squirrel should. Once the magic is used, the lyre remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12507,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Talespinner's Lyre","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1965816783971423","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":235},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1469,1531,1504,1479,2131],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2127","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"98"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:46.935948+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nPlucking a [talespinner's lyre](link_item_12507) while focusing on an event you witnessed causes the instrument to create an illusion in a 50-foot emanation that plays out your memory of the event in real time, complete with sights, sounds, and smells. You can [Sustain the Activation](link_action_19858) for up to 1 minute to keep it playing. The scene reproduces only what's in its area, including nothing beyond that even if present in the memory. The scene is realistic, but all observers can clearly tell it's an illusion. Observers can't interact with the scene directly nor can they taste or touch elements of it to get a sensation you didn't personally experience, but they can attempt skill checks to discern more about the scene without altering its contents. For example, no one could see something you didn't, such as the true form of a creature polymorphed into a squirrel, but an observer might be able to use Perception and [Sense Motive](link_action_19847) to discern the squirrel was acting unlike a squirrel should. Once the magic is used, the lyre remains as a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12508,"type":"item","before":{"id":12508,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Splatrope Extruder","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4051041444393513","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1985","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"65"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:47.504109+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This portable nozzle-and-trigger assembly based on spider spinnerets can extrude and weave alchemical adhesives into temporary constructions. As an [Interact](link_action_19733) action, you can attach a [glue bomb](link_item_6999) to the extruder.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** A [glue bomb](link_item_6999) is installed in the extruder; **Effect** The extruder converts the [glue bomb](link_item_6999) into a [30-foot rope](link_item_7715), [whip](link_item_7954), or [net](link_item_7608), depending on the nozzle die you choose when activating the device. The created object lasts for 1 hour. The DC to [Escape](link_action_19632) a created [rope](link_item_7715) (if used to bind a creature) or [net](link_item_7608) is equal to the consumed [glue bomb](link_item_6999)’s DC and [Escaping](link_action_19632) destroys the created object.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12508,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Splatrope Extruder","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4051041444393513","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1985","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"65"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:47.504109+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This portable nozzle-and-trigger assembly based on spider spinnerets can extrude and weave alchemical adhesives into temporary constructions. As an [Interact](link_action_19733) action, you can attach a [glue bomb](link_item_6999) to the extruder.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Requirements** A [glue bomb](link_item_6999) is installed in the extruder; **Effect** The extruder converts the [glue bomb](link_item_6999) into a [30-foot rope](link_item_7715), [whip](link_item_7954), or [net](link_item_7608), depending on the nozzle die you choose when activating the device. The created object lasts for 1 hour. The DC to [Escape](link_action_19632) a created [rope](link_item_7715) (if used to bind a creature) or [net](link_item_7608) is equal to the consumed [glue bomb](link_item_6999)’s DC and [Escaping](link_action_19632) destroys the created object.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12509,"type":"item","before":{"id":12509,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Taster's Folly","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1725921262650474","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1555,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4550","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"71"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:48.06182+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDevised to bypass detection, a dose of [taster's folly](link_item_12509) consists of two compounds that aren't mixed but placed in the contents of one meal. Each compound is harmless on its own. The DC to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about this [poison](link_trait_1476) from one of its components is 23 and attempts to use magic to detect the unmixed components require a successful DC 23 [counteract](link_action_27519) check. The onset period begins only if a victim consumes both compounds during the same hour. If the two compounds mix prior to consumption, they become toxic and are detectable as such. The sickened condition can't be ended until the [poison](link_trait_1476)'s effects end.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 21\n\n**Onset** 10 minutes\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** 2d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) and sickened 1 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) and sickened 1 (1 minute)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12509,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Taster's Folly","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1725921262650474","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":20},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1555,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4550","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"71"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:48.06182+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDevised to bypass detection, a dose of [taster's folly](link_item_12509) consists of two compounds that aren't mixed but placed in the contents of one meal. Each compound is harmless on its own. The DC to [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753) about this [poison](link_trait_1476) from one of its components is 23 and attempts to use magic to detect the unmixed components require a successful DC 23 [counteract](link_action_27519) check. The onset period begins only if a victim consumes both compounds during the same hour. If the two compounds mix prior to consumption, they become toxic and are detectable as such. The sickened condition can't be ended until the [poison](link_trait_1476)'s effects end.\n\n**Saving Throw** Fortitude 21\n\n**Onset** 10 minutes\n\n**Maximum Duration** 6 minutes\n\n**Stage 1** 2d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 2** 3d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) and sickened 1 (1 minute)\n\n**Stage 3** 4d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) and sickened 1 (1 minute)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12510,"type":"item","before":{"id":12510,"bulk":"1","name":"Tattletale Orb (Clear Quartz)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1635288967066971","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3800},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504,1590],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4919","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:48.613004+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A [tattletale orb](link_item_12510) is a polished crystal sphere that appears to function as a [crystal ball](link_item_6849) (Clear Quartz). If those whom you use the orb to scry on roll better than a critical failure on their saving throw, they receive a telepathic message alerting them to the scrying. A success or better at the save allows the target to choose to allow you to scry anyway, knowing they can use an aspect of the orb against you, according to the orb's type. A creature that rolls a critical success on the saving throw also learns your name and location. Once you Activate a [tattletale orb](link_item_12510) or use it to cast one of your scrying spells, it fuses to you. You must succeed at a Will save, using the scrying Will DC of a [crystal ball](link_item_6849) of the orb's type, to use another such device.\n\nTattletale orbs come in the same types as [crystal balls](link_item_6849), with the same activations and powers. However, your target must roll a critical failure on the saving throw for the orb to function as normal for that type of [crystal ball](link_item_6849).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12510,"bulk":"1","name":"Tattletale Orb (Clear Quartz)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1635288967066971","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3800},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504,1590],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4919","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:48.613004+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A [tattletale orb](link_item_12510) is a polished crystal sphere that appears to function as a [crystal ball](link_item_6849) (Clear Quartz). If those whom you use the orb to scry on roll better than a critical failure on their saving throw, they receive a telepathic message alerting them to the scrying. A success or better at the save allows the target to choose to allow you to scry anyway, knowing they can use an aspect of the orb against you, according to the orb's type. A creature that rolls a critical success on the saving throw also learns your name and location. Once you Activate a [tattletale orb](link_item_12510) or use it to cast one of your scrying spells, it fuses to you. You must succeed at a Will save, using the scrying Will DC of a [crystal ball](link_item_6849) of the orb's type, to use another such device.\n\nTattletale orbs come in the same types as [crystal balls](link_item_6849), with the same activations and powers. However, your target must roll a critical failure on the saving throw for the orb to function as normal for that type of [crystal ball](link_item_6849).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12511,"type":"item","before":{"id":12511,"bulk":"1","name":"Tattletale Orb (Moonstone)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1694253875786979","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":7500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504,1590],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":