at extend from their fist. Adherents of \\[\\[Bastet\\]\\]{Bastet } favor the tekko-kagi for catching their foes off guard.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:51.823312+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Four curved blades attached to a sturdy handlebar give the wielder of this close-combat weapon the illusion of having claws that extend from their fist. Adherents of Bastet favor the [tekko-kagi](link_item_12515) for catching their foes off guard.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12516,"type":"item","before":{"id":12516,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tentacle Potion (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7709462299606073","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":660},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4628","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:52.375767+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nUpon consuming this mottled, foul-tasting liquid, the [tentacle potion](link_item_12516) causes you to extrude a long, flexible limb of ectoplasm. Your clothing doesn't need to accommodate this limb of ghostly matter, which can extrude through your clothing and armor. The limb lasts 24 hours, and you can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. You can't hide or disguise the tentacle. You can use the limb to perform simple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions, such as opening an unlocked door. Your limb can't perform actions that require significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check to accomplish. At one time, you can have only one extra limb from any version of this potion. Stronger tentacle potions replace the effects of weaker ones.\n\nYou can use the limb to hold an item of up to 1 Bulk or be used as a second hand to help hold an item of up to 2 Bulk. You can also use the limb to make an unarmed attack that deals 1d6 bludgeoning damage and has the [sweep](link_trait_1562) trait. You can also use the whole limb to hold onto a suitable anchor point, such as a tree branch, balcony, or rocky outcropping, subject to the GM's discretion. While using your limb this way, you have free use of all your other limbs, so you can perform tasks that require both hands.\n\nIf you have the [Flexible Tail](link_feat_32377) or [Skillful Tail](link_feat_20546) feats, the [Tailed Goblin](link_heritage_26840) heritage, or a similar feature the GM believes would benefit, this potion can instead fortify your tail. A fortified tail benefits from any [tentacle potion](link_item_12516) as if the potion were the next better type.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12516,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tentacle Potion (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7709462299606073","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":660},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4628","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:52.375767+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nUpon consuming this mottled, foul-tasting liquid, the [tentacle potion](link_item_12516) causes you to extrude a long, flexible limb of ectoplasm. Your clothing doesn't need to accommodate this limb of ghostly matter, which can extrude through your clothing and armor. The limb lasts 24 hours, and you can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. You can't hide or disguise the tentacle. You can use the limb to perform simple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions, such as opening an unlocked door. Your limb can't perform actions that require significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check to accomplish. At one time, you can have only one extra limb from any version of this potion. Stronger tentacle potions replace the effects of weaker ones.\n\nYou can use the limb to hold an item of up to 1 Bulk or be used as a second hand to help hold an item of up to 2 Bulk. You can also use the limb to make an unarmed attack that deals 1d6 bludgeoning damage and has the [sweep](link_trait_1562) trait. You can also use the whole limb to hold onto a suitable anchor point, such as a tree branch, balcony, or rocky outcropping, subject to the GM's discretion. While using your limb this way, you have free use of all your other limbs, so you can perform tasks that require both hands.\n\nIf you have the [Flexible Tail](link_feat_32377) or [Skillful Tail](link_feat_20546) feats, the [Tailed Goblin](link_heritage_26840) heritage, or a similar feature the GM believes would benefit, this potion can instead fortify your tail. A fortified tail benefits from any [tentacle potion](link_item_12516) as if the potion were the next better type.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12517,"type":"item","before":{"id":12517,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tentacle Potion (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1910842310504230","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":33},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","