ion](link_item_12518) as if the potion were the next better type.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12518,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tentacle Potion (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4109981589296624","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":155},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1565],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4628","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"91"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:53.455783+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nUpon consuming this mottled, foul-tasting liquid, the [tentacle potion](link_item_12518) causes you to extrude a long, flexible limb of ectoplasm. Your clothing doesn't need to accommodate this limb of ghostly matter, which can extrude through your clothing and armor. The limb lasts 8 hours, and you can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. You can't hide or disguise the tentacle. You can use the limb to perform simple [Interact](link_action_19733) actions, such as opening an unlocked door. Your limb can't perform actions that require significant manual dexterity, including any action that would require a check to accomplish. At one time, you can have only one extra limb from any version of this potion. Stronger tentacle potions replace the effects of weaker ones.\n\nYou can use the limb to hold an item of up to light Bulk. You can also use the whole limb to hold onto a suitable anchor point, such as a tree branch, balcony, or rocky outcropping, subject to the GM's discretion. While using your limb this way, you have free use of all your other limbs, so you can perform tasks that require both hands.\n\nIf you have the [Flexible Tail](link_feat_32377) or [Skillful Tail](link_feat_20546) feats, the [Tailed Goblin](link_heritage_26840) heritage, or a similar feature the GM believes would benefit, this potion can instead fortify your tail. A fortified tail benefits from any [tentacle potion](link_item_12518) as if the potion were the next better type.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12519,"type":"item","before":{"id":12519,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Theatrical Mutagen (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5304011940133327","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":300},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4501","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"61"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:54.102044+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDeveloped and widely used by students at the Kitharodian Academy in Oppara, the [theatrical mutagen](link_item_12519) stimulates the creative centers of your brain. This causes your movements to become exaggerated and your voice to become clear. However, the erratic surges of inspiration overload your senses, making it difficult to focus on mundane tasks. This lasts for 10 minutes.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +3 item bonus to Acrobatics checks, Crafting checks, and Performance checks. If you're untrained in any of these skills, your proficiency bonus is equal to your level instead of +0. You also gain a +10 feet status bonus to your Speed.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to Perception checks and Will saves. After any round where you don't spend at least 1 action to [Interact](link_action_19733) with an object, [Perform](link_action_19746), [Step](link_action_19853), or [Stride](link_action_19855), you're off-guard until the start of your next turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12519,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Theatrical Mutagen (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5304011940133327","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":300},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4501","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"61"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:54.102044+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDeveloped and widely used by students at the Kitharodian Academy in Oppara, the [theatrical mutagen](link_item_12519) stimulates the creative centers of your brain. This causes your movements to become exaggerated and your voice to become clear. However, the erratic surges of inspiration overload your senses, making it difficult to focus on mundane tasks. This lasts for 10 minutes.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +3 item bonus to Acrobatics checks, Crafting checks, and Performance checks. If you're untrained in any of these skills, your proficiency bonus is equal to your level instead of +0. You also gain a +10 feet status bonus to your Speed.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to Perception checks and Will saves. After any round where you don't spend at least 1 action to [Interact](link_action_19733) with an object, [Perform](link_action_19746), [Step](link_action_19853), or [Stride](link_action_19855), you're off-guard until the start of your next turn.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12520,"type":"item","before":{"id":12520,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Theatrical Mutagen (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1232395091233440","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1563,1453],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4501","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"61"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:54.726438+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nDeveloped and widely used by students at the Kitharodian Academy in Oppara, the [theatrical mutagen](link_item_12520) stimulates the creative centers of your brain. This causes your movements to become exaggerated and your voice to become clear. However, the erratic surges of inspiration overload your senses, making it difficult to focus on mundane tasks. This lasts for 1 minute.\n\n**Benefit** You gain a +1 item bonus to Acrobatics checks, Crafting checks, and Performance checks. If you're untrained in any of these skills, your proficiency bonus is equal to your level instead of +0. You also gain a +5 feet status bonus to your Speed.\n\n**Drawback** You take a –1 penalty to Perception checks and Will saves. After any round where you don't spend at least 1 action to [Interact](link_action_19733) with an object, [Perform](link_action_19746), [Step](link_action_19853), or [Stride](link_action_19855), you're off-guard until the start of your next turn.\n\n","availability":null,"c