nute\n\nCreated by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a _[thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12523)_ blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a basic Fortitude save against damage determined by the fulu’s type. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.\n\nThis red fulu feels rigid, its edges sharp, and looking at it makes you feel feverish. The DC is 23, and the fulu deals 5d6 slashing damage as meridians burst and cut through flesh. On a failure or critical failure, if the target fails to take an action with the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) or [move](link_trait_1505) trait on each of its turns, it takes 1d6 persistent slashing damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12523,"bulk":"0","name":"Thousand-Pains Fulu (Blade)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6130829599675322","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":90},"usage":"affixed to a creature","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4577","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"79"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:56.428194+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 minute\n\nCreated by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a _[thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12523)_ blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a basic Fortitude save against damage determined by the fulu’s type. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.\n\nThis red fulu feels rigid, its edges sharp, and looking at it makes you feel feverish. The DC is 23, and the fulu deals 5d6 slashing damage as meridians burst and cut through flesh. On a failure or critical failure, if the target fails to take an action with the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) or [move](link_trait_1505) trait on each of its turns, it takes 1d6 persistent slashing damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12524,"type":"item","before":{"id":12524,"bulk":"0","name":"Thousand-Pains Fulu (Burl)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2887702531387909","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2700},"usage":"affixed to a creature","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4577","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"79"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:57.006175+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 minute\n\nCreated by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a _[thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12524)_ blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a basic Fortitude save against damage determined by the fulu’s type. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.\n\nThough this green fulu looks inviting, it has a foreboding aura. The DC is 35, and the fulu deals 10d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, causing the target's body to respond adversely to their qi. On a failure or critical failure, if the target takes [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, it takes 2d8 persistent [poison](link_trait_1476) damage as well. These effects have the [poison](link_trait_1476) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12524,"bulk":"0","name":"Thousand-Pains Fulu (Burl)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2887702531387909","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":2700},"usage":"affixed to a creature","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,2854,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4577","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"79"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:23:57.006175+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Duration** 1 minute\n\nCreated by a chirurgeon who threw away morality in search of endless life, a _[thousand-pains fulu](link_item_12524)_ blocks the natural flow of elements in the body. A creature to which the fulu is affixed must attempt a basic Fortitude save against damage determined by the fulu’s type. Failure or critical failure primes the target for persistent damage triggered by a specific condition that must be met within the fulu's duration.\n\nThough this green fulu looks inviting, it has a foreboding aura. The DC is 35, and the fulu deals 10d8 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage, causing the target's body to respond adversely to their qi. On a failure or critical failure, if the target takes [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, it takes 2d8 persistent [poison](link_trait_1476) damage as well. These effects have the [poison](link_trait_1476) trait.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12525,"type":"item","before":{"id":12525,"bulk":"0","name":"Thousand-Pains Fulu (Icicle)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7107672925911430","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"pric