_item_7862) [blunderbuss](link_item_14078)_, the spark gun's magical core is visible amid several reflectors. All damage dealt by a [thundercrasher](link_item_12535) is [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage. On a critical hit, the target must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be deafened for 1 minute.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You overload the _[thundercrasher](link_item_12535)_ to emit chaotic [sonic](link_trait_1484) frequencies that soften earth and stone. When you next fire the _[thundercrasher](link_item_12535)_ it also partially liquefies any natural earth or stone surfaces within range of its [scatter](link_trait_2905) trait, making the area difficult terrain.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12535,"bulk":"2","name":"Thundercrasher","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2524622805310747","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":155},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[3073,1459],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"firearm","range":40,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"damageType":"sonic"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"1","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1894","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"39"},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"blunderbuss","broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:07.590499+00:00","operations":null,"description":"While looking straight down the barrel of this _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [blunderbuss](link_item_14078)_, the spark gun's magical core is visible amid several reflectors. All damage dealt by a [thundercrasher](link_item_12535) is [sonic](link_trait_1484) damage. On a critical hit, the target must succeed at a Fortitude save against your class DC or be deafened for 1 minute.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You overload the _[thundercrasher](link_item_12535)_ to emit chaotic [sonic](link_trait_1484) frequencies that soften earth and stone. When you next fire the _[thundercrasher](link_item_12535)_ it also partially liquefies any natural earth or stone surfaces within range of its [scatter](link_trait_2905) trait, making the area difficult terrain.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12536,"type":"item","before":{"id":12536,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tlil Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2406197973325610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4888","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:08.149632+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Colorful, beaded _tlil masks_ are commonly found on the distant continent of Arcadia, but trade between the two regions means that they can also be found in the Mwangi Expanse as curiosities. These masks usually bear floral patterns and attune your senses to plants of all varieties.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** Your vision up to 60 feet sees through small amounts of living plant matter as though it were transparent. While this effect is active, creatures can't be concealed from you due to living plants, such as small trees, vines, and grass. This also prevents them from [Hiding](link_action_19726) or [Sneaking](link_action_19850) past you using only living plants for concealment or cover. Other than the inability to use the cover to [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850), this ability doesn't prevent plants from providing cover to creatures or blocking line of effect. It also doesn't allow you to see through dead plant matter, such as the wooden walls of a building, or thick plant matter, such as the walls of a dungeon built entirely inside an enormous living tree. The effect lasts for 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12536,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tlil Mask (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2406197973325610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4888","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:08.149632+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Colorful, beaded _tlil masks_ are commonly found on the distant continent of Arcadia, but trade between the two regions means that they can also be found in the Mwangi Expanse as curiosities. These masks usually bear floral patterns and attune your senses to plants of all varieties.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** Your vision up to 60 feet sees through small amounts of living plant matter as though it were transparent. While this effect is active, creatures can't be concealed from you due to living plants, such as small trees, vines, and grass. This also prevents them from [Hiding](link_action_19726) or [Sneaking](link_action_19850) past you using only living plants for concealment or cover. Other than the inability to use the cover to [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850), this ability doesn't prevent plants from providing cover to creatures or blocking line of effect. It also doesn't allow you to see through dead plant matter, such as the wooden walls of a building, or thick plant matter, such as the walls of a dungeon built entirely inside an enormous living tree. The effect lasts for 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12537,"type":"item","before":{"id":12537,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tlil Mask","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"730379165811802","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"worn mask","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4888","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"155"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:08.666028+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Colorful, beaded _tlil masks_ are commonly found on the distant continent of Arcadia, but trade between the two regions means that they can also be found in the Mwangi Expanse as curiosities. These masks usually bear floral patterns and attune your senses to plants of all varieties.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** Your vision up to 60 feet sees through small amounts of living plant matter as though it were transparent. While this effect is active, creatures can't be concealed from you due to living plants, such as small trees