g](link_action_19726) or [Sneaking](link_action_19850) past you using only living plants for concealment or cover. Other than the inability to use the cover to [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850), this ability doesn't prevent plants from providing cover to creatures or blocking line of effect. It also doesn't allow you to see through dead plant matter, such as the wooden walls of a building, or thick plant matter, such as the walls of a dungeon built entirely inside an enormous living tree. The effect lasts for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12538,"type":"item","before":{"id":12538,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tome of Restorative Cleansing (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8134846964804944","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":3750},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4717","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:09.437078+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This book is dark blue on the night of the new moon, gradually shifting to bright red as the moon waxes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [healing](link_trait_1442), [vitality](link_trait_1478))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Requirements** Your last action was to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) prepared from this grimoire, and the spell removed a harmful condition or affliction from yourself or an ally\n\n**Effect** Choose one creature whose condition was removed by the required spell. That creature gains 3d8 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour.\n\n","availability"