n ally\n\n**Effect** Choose one creature whose condition was removed by the required spell. That creature gains 1d8 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12540,"type":"item","before":{"id":12540,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tome of Restorative Cleansing (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7312461725323962","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4717","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:21:00.403Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:10.49668+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This book is dark blue on the night of the new moon, gradually shifting to bright red as the moon waxes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [healing](link_trait_1442), [vitality](link_trait_1478)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855), and the spell removed a harmful condition or affliction from yourself or an ally; **Effect** Choose one creature whose condition was removed by the required spell. That creature gains 2d8 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12540,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tome of Restorative Cleansing (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7312461725323962","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2855,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4717","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:21:00.403Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:10.49668+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This book is dark blue on the night of the new moon, gradually shifting to bright red as the moon waxes.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [healing](link_trait_1442), [vitality](link_trait_1478)); **Frequency** once per day; **Requirements** Your last action was to [cast a spell](link_action_19611) prepared from this [grimoire](link_trait_2855), and the spell removed a harmful condition or affliction from yourself or an ally; **Effect** Choose one creature whose condition was removed by the required spell. That creature gains 2d8 temporary Hit Points that last for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12541,"type":"item","before":{"id":12541,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tome of Scintillating Sleet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7424710747203965","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":430},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1519,2855,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4718","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:11.121026+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The first 12 pages of this tome tell the same story in two languages: 6 pages in [Skald](link_language_414) and 6 pages in the ancient [Jotun](link_language_88) dialect used by saumen kar, a species of ice-dwelling humanoids. The story is a tale of a saumen kar stricken with snow blindness after spending too long under the sun building snow giants.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to [cast](link_action_19611) a [cold](link_trait_1519) spell that deals damage, all creatures damaged by the spell are also dazzled for 3 rounds by light refracting and reflecting within and around the spell's chilling effects. If an affected creature critically failed its save against the required spell, or if you critically succeeded on your spell attack roll against the creature, it's instead blinded for 1 round and then dazzled for 3 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12541,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tome of Scintillating Sleet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7424710747203965","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":430},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1519,2855,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4718","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:11.121026+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The first 12 pages of this tome tell the same story in two languages: 6 pages in [Skald](link_language_414) and 6 pages in the ancient [Jotun](link_language_88) dialect used by saumen kar, a species of ice-dwelling humanoids. The story is a tale of a saumen kar stricken with snow blindness after spending too long under the sun building snow giants.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** If your next action is to [cast](link_action_19611) a [cold](link_trait_1519) spell that deals damage, all creatures damaged by the spell are also dazzled for 3 rounds by light refracting and reflecting within and around the spell's chilling effects. If an affected creature critically failed its save against the required spell, or if you critically succeeded on your spell attack roll against the creature, it's instead blinded for 1 round and then dazzled for 3 rounds.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12542,"type":"item","before":{"id":12542,"bulk":"2","name":"Toolkit of Bronze Whispers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6684288721693247","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1613],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4931","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Artisan's Tools, Sterling (craft items)","value":1,"selector":"crafting","predicate":["action:craft"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:11.870877+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +12; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Clockwork Lore +15, Crafting +13, Religion +11\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +0\n\n**Will** +12\n\nSacred to the faith of Brigh, a [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) has been used with such devotion it has developed a consciousness and personality that can be a blessing to a partnered crafter. A [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) functions as a set of [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). Such toolkits focus on new creations and enthusiastically suggest crafting techniques to wielders. A [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) knows common item formulas of its level or lower and any other formulas the GM chooses. It can teach these formulas. You must still spend the time to copy a formula before you can use it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12542,"bulk":"2","name":"Toolkit of Bronze Whispers","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6684288721693247","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1475,1613],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4931","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Artisan's Tools, Sterling (craft items)","value":1,"selector":"crafting","predicate":["action:craft"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:11.870877+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +12; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages)\n\n**Skills** Clockwork Lore +15, Crafting +13, Religion +11\n\n**Int** +4, **Wis** +3, **Cha** +0\n\n**Will** +12\n\nSacred to the faith of Brigh, a [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) has been used with such devotion it has developed a consciousness and personality that can be a blessing to a partnered crafter. A [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) functions as a set of [sterling artisan's tools](link_item_6724). Such toolkits focus on new creations and enthusiastically suggest crafting techniques to wielders. A [toolkit of bronze whispers](link_item_12542) knows common item formulas of its level or lower and any other formulas the GM chooses. It can teach these formulas. You must still spend the time to copy a formula before you can use it.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12543,"type":"item","before":{"id":12543,"bulk":"0","name":"Tooth and Claw Tattoo (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"467712033893053","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4753","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:12.421682+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo resembles an animal's fangs, claws, or similar natural weapons, letting you wield such weapons and turn into the same beast. When you receive the tattoo, choose the animal from among the following: ape, bear, bull, canine, cat, deer, frog, shark, or snake. You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals of that kind. This tattoo is usually located on the body part or parts it's meant to transform—on the back of the hands for claws, around the mouth for jaws, on the forehead for horns, and so on.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [morph](link_trait_1456))\n\n**Effect** You gain an unarmed attack matching the tattoo for 1 minute. It has the same damage as your best unarmed attack and has the same traits. Its damage type is bludgeoning for a fist or frog's jaws; piercing for an antler, fangs, horns, or most jaws; or slashing for claws.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [polymorph](link_trait_1453))\n\n**Effect** The tattoo casts 4th-rank *[animal form](link_spell_4396)* to transform you into the animal that matches your tattoo.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12543,"bulk":"0","name":"Tooth and Claw Tattoo (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"467712033893053","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4753","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:12.421682+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo resembles an animal's fangs, claws, or similar natural weapons, letting you wield such weapons and turn into the same beast. When you receive the tattoo, choose the animal from among the following: ape, bear, bull, canine, cat, deer, frog, shark, or snake. You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals of that kind. This tattoo is usually located on the body part or parts it's meant to transform—on the back of the hands for claws, around the mouth for jaws, on the forehead for horns, and so on.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [morph](link_trait_1456))\n\n**Effect** You gain an unarmed attack matching the tattoo for 1 minute. It has the same damage as your best unarmed attack and has the same traits. Its damage type is bludgeoning for a fist or frog's jaws; piercing for an antler, fangs, horns, or most jaws; or slashing for claws.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [polymorph](link_trait_1453))\n\n**Effect** The tattoo casts 4th-rank *[animal form](link_spell_4396)* to transform you into the animal that matches your tattoo.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12544,"type":"item","before":{"id":12544,"bulk":"0","name":"Tooth and Claw Tattoo (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6236346453376691","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4753","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:13.063906+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo resembles an animal's fangs, claws, or similar natural weapons, letting you wield such weapons and turn into the same beast. When you receive the tattoo, choose the animal from among the following: ape, bear, bull, canine, cat, deer, frog, shark, or snake. You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals of that kind. This tattoo is usually located on the body part or parts it's meant to transform—on the back of the hands for claws, around the mouth for jaws, on the forehead for horns, and so on.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [morph](link_trait_1456))\n\n**Effect** You gain an unarmed attack matching the tattoo for 1 minute. It has the same damage as your best unarmed attack and has the same traits. Its damage type is bludgeoning for a fist or frog's jaws; piercing for an antler, fangs, horns, or most jaws; or slashing for claws.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [polymorph](link_trait_1453))\n\n**Effect** The tattoo casts 5th-level *[animal form](link_spell_4396)* to transform you into the animal that matches your tattoo.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12544,"bulk":"0","name":"Tooth and Claw Tattoo (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6236346453376691","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"tattooed-on-the-body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4753","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:13.063906+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This tattoo resembles an animal's fangs, claws, or similar natural weapons, letting you wield such weapons and turn into the same beast. When you receive the tattoo, choose the animal from among the following: ape, bear, bull, canine, cat, deer, frog, shark, or snake. You can ask questions of, receive answers from, and use the Diplomacy skill with animals of that kind. This tattoo is usually located on the body part or parts it's meant to transform—on the back of the hands for claws, around the mouth for jaws, on the forehead for horns, and so on.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" 