ge increment of 30 feet. The spellgun blasts a powerful jet of water that deals 7d6 bludgeoning damage, then disintegrates into sand.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage and is knocked back 10 feet.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage and is knocked back 5 feet.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12549,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Torrent Spellgun (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7583779640463175","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":70},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1531,1504,2868,1584],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4661","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"98"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:16.038758+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856)\n\n* * *\n\nCarved of seashell, a *[torrent spellgun](link_item_12549)* is damp to the touch, and seaweed wraps around its grip. You Activate the [spellgun](link_trait_2868) by aiming it at one creature and making your choice of a spell attack roll or a firearm attack roll against the target's AC. This spellgun has a range increment of 30 feet. The spellgun blasts a powerful jet of water that deals 7d6 bludgeoning damage, then disintegrates into sand.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage and is knocked back 10 feet.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage and is knocked back 5 feet.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12550,"type":"item","before":{"id":12550,"bulk":"0","name":"Toshigami Blossom","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5687150503269700","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4932","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:19.206961+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +30; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) ([darkvision](link_sense_20769)) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages; *[speak with plants](link_spell_4848)*)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +28, Medicine +32, Nature +32\n\n**Int** +6, **Wis** +10, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +32\n\nAn encounter with a [toshigami](link_creature_11851), the enigmatic [kami](link_trait_3605) who protect cherry trees, is rare, though often sought after and treasured by those who achieve such an encounter. Only a handful of mortals can truthfully claim to have seen a [toshigami](link_creature_11851), let alone met one, though many popular fireside tales tell of virtuous souls receiving a [toshigami](link_creature_11851)'s blessing to fight for a worthy cause. Such stories have a basis in fact; every so often, a [toshigami](link_creature_11851) gives a worthy mortal a flower from their ward, time-locked in perfect bloom and granted sapience. Such _[toshigami blossoms](link_item_12550)_ are more sociable than their creators. Like [toshigami](link_creature_11851), a blossom has a strong curiosity about the mortal world. If you wear a _[toshigami blossom](link_item_12550)_, it can intercede for you, helping you make a good impression.\n\nA _[toshigami blossom](link_item_12550)_ has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The blossom [casts](link_action_19611) *[nature's pathway](link_spell_4738)* on you to your specifications. If you teleport through only cherry trees, the spell is cast at 6th rank.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** The blossom [casts](link_action_19611) *[soothing blossoms](link_spell_8836)* to your specifications.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** The blossom sends a flurry of cherry blossoms outward in a 20-foot burst that lasts 1 round. You and your allies can see through these blossoms. To all other creatures, creatures within the cloud of blossoms become concealed, and creatures outside the cloud become concealed to creatures within it. When you or an ally succeeds with a [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature in the blossoms, the [Strike](link_action_19856) deals an additional 1d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage and an additional 1d6 [void](link_trait_1485) damage to living creatures, or an additional 1d6 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage to [undead](link_trait_2425).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12550,"bulk":"0","name":"Toshigami Blossom","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5687150503269700","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4932","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:19.206961+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Perception** +30; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) ([darkvision](link_sense_20769)) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) ([Common](link_language_81) and two other common languages; *[speak with plants](link_spell_4848)*)\n\n**Skills** Diplomacy +28, Medicine +32, Nature +32\n\n**Int** +6, **Wis** +10, **Cha** +5\n\n**Will** +32\n\nAn encounter with a [toshigami](link_creature_11851), the enigmatic [kami](link_trait_3605) who protect cherry trees, is rare, though often sought after and treasured by those who achieve such an encounter. Only a handful of mortals can truthfully claim to have seen a [toshigami](link_creature_11851), let alone met one, though many popular fireside tales tell of virtuous souls receiving a [toshigami](link_creature_11851)'s blessing to fight for a worthy cause. Such stories have a basis in fact; every so often, a [toshigami](link_creature_11851) gives a worthy mortal a flower from their ward, time-locked in perfect bloom and granted sapience. Such _[toshigami blossoms](link_item_12550)_ are more sociable than their creators. Like [toshigami](link_creature_11851), a blossom has a strong curiosity about the mortal world. If you wear a _[toshigami blossom](link_item_12550)_, it can intercede for you, helping you make a good impression.\n\nA _[toshigami blossom](link_item_12550)_ has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The blossom [casts](link_action_19611) *[nature's pathway](link_spell_4738)* on you to your specifications. If you teleport through only cherry trees, the spell is cast at 6th rank.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** The blossom [casts](link_action_19611) *[soothing blossoms](link_spell_8836)* to your specifications.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per minute\n\n**Effect** The blossom sends a flurry of cherry blossoms outward in a 20-foot burst that lasts 1 round. You and your allies can see through these blossoms. To all other creatures, creatures within the cloud of blossoms become concealed, and creatures outside the cloud become concealed to creatures within it. When you or an ally succeeds with a [Strike](link_action_19856) against a creature in the blossoms, the [Strike](link_action_19856) deals an additional 1d6 [mental](link_trait_1448) damage and an additional 1d6 [void](link_trait_1485) damage to living creatures, or an additional 1d6 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage to [undead](link_trait_2425).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12551,"type":"item","before":{"id":12551,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tracker's Stew","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8131664476350046","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4466","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:19.742058+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAlchemical reagents add punch to [tracker's stew](link_item_12551): a rich, fiery mixture of tomatoes, ground nuts, onions, and tubers, often with poultry added. It's usually served with or over rice or noodles. Once you've eaten the stew, it improves your ability to sense and follow tracks for 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first. You gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks to [Cover Tracks](link_action_19616) and [Track](link_action_19861). You can do either while moving at full speed or both while moving at half speed.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12551,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tracker's Stew","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8131664476350046","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,2859],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4466","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:19.742058+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** 10 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAlchemical reagents add punch to [tracker's stew](link_item_12551): a rich, fiery mixture of tomatoes, ground nuts, onions, and tubers, often with poultry added. It's usually served with or over rice or noodles. Once you've eaten the stew, it improves your ability to sense and follow tracks for 24 hours or until you make your next daily preparations, whichever comes first. You gain a +1 item bonus to Survival checks to [Cover Tracks](link_action_19616) and [Track](link_action_19861). You can do either while moving at full speed or both while moving at half speed.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12552,"type":"item","before":{"id":12552,"bulk":"0","name":"Trackless (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7857756925787216","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"applied-to-footwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4836","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:20.459658+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Trackless](link_item_12552) runes are common among hunters and trappers, as well as thieves and anyone flee&#105;ng pursuit. While wearing [trackless](link_item_12552) footwear, you are continuously affected by the *[vanishing tracks](link_spell_4926)* spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You extend the effect of your rune out to a 20-foot emanation. The emanation remains for 8 hours, affecting up to 10 creatures of your choice within the area. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) this effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12552,"bulk":"0","name":"Trackless (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7857756925787216","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":900},"usage":"applied-to-footwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4836","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:20.459658+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Trackless](link_item_12552) runes are common among hunters and trappers, as well as thieves and anyone flee&#105;ng pursuit. While wearing [trackless](link_item_12552) footwear, you are continuously affected by the *[vanishing tracks](link_spell_4926)* spell.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You extend the effect of your rune out to a 20-foot emanation. The emanation remains for 8 hours, affecting up to 10 creatures of your choice within the area. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) this effect.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12553,"type":"item","before":{"id":12553,"bulk":"0","name":"Trackless","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2843129931270543","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"applied-to-footwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4836","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:20.979687+00:00","operations":null,"description":"[Trackless](link_item_12553) runes are common among hunters and trappers, as well as thieves and anyone flee&#105;ng pursuit. While wearing [trackless](link_item_12553) footwear, you are continuously affected by the *[vanishing tracks](link_spell_4926)* spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12553,"bulk":"0","name":"Trackless","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2843129931270543","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":225},"usage":"applied-to-footwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4836","book":"Treasu