ations":[{"id":"1775e617-8b41-472c-8bff-cbd881c6b713","data":{"text":"while playing the mandolin","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"627cbd14-dac7-4d21-8252-60f27629487b","data":{"text":"while playing the mandolin","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_DECEPTION"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"Sought after by many unscrupulous bards, this instrument is surprisingly light and easy to carry, but also empowered with a number of spells carefully selected to help with fooling others or making a hasty retreat. While playing the mandolin, you gain a +1 item bonus to Deception and Performance checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** You change the instrument's color and shape to one you prefer, and you can turn it into a different handheld string instrument that takes two hands to play.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Effect** You expend a number of charges from this instrument to [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) from its list.\n\n*   **Cantrip** *[prestidigitation](link_spell_4778)*\n    \n*   **1st** *[illusory disguise](link_spell_4677)*, *[item facade](link_spell_4691)*, *[ventriloquism](link_spell_4931)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply one casting of all listed levels of all listed spells."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12562,"type":"item","before":{"id":12562,"bulk":"2","name":"Troll Hide","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3942665830976566","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4519","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7038,"bulk":"2","name":"Hide Armor","size":"MEDIUM","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:14:52.017148+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A mix of furs, sturdy hide, and sometimes molded boiled leather, this armor provides protection due to its layers of leather, though its bulkiness slows the wearer down and decreases mobility.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:26.214204+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Tissue from a living forest troll has been integrated through this [hide armor](link_item_7038). This armor has two organic receptacles on its back that can each hold a single [elixir of life](link_item_6905). One elixir takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. For the armor to function properly, each elixir must be the same level.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** Two elixirs of life are installed in the armor; **Effect** Regenerating tissue from the armor fills your wounds for 8 rounds. At the start of each of your turns, you regain Hit Points equal to the level of the loaded elixirs. Each time you regain at least 13 Hit Points from the armor, you regrow one damaged or ruined organ. During a round that you regain 9 or more Hit Points from the armor, you can reattach severed body parts by spending an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to hold the body part to the area it was severed from. If you take [electricity](link_trait_1576) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, the armor deactivates until the end of your next turn. (Similar armor from other types of trolls might be deactivated by different damage types.) In the event the armor itself is damaged, it will restore its own Hit Points before it resumes healing you. The activation uses up the elixirs, and the armor can’t be activated again until two new ones are installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12562,"bulk":"2","name":"Troll Hide","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3942665830976566","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4519","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7038,"bulk":"2","name":"Hide Armor","size":"MEDIUM","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:14:52.017148+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A mix of furs, sturdy hide, and sometimes molded boiled leather, this armor provides protection due to its layers of leather, though its bulkiness slows the wearer down and decreases mobility.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:26.214204+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Tissue from a living forest troll has been integrated through this [hide armor](link_item_7038). This armor has two organic receptacles on its back that can each hold a single [elixir of life](link_item_6905). One elixir takes 3 [Interact](link_action_19733) actions to install. For the armor to function properly, each elixir must be the same level.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Requirements** Two elixirs of life are installed in the armor; **Effect** Regenerating tissue from the armor fills your wounds for 8 rounds. At the start of each of your turns, you regain Hit Points equal to the level of the loaded elixirs. Each time you regain at least 13 Hit Points from the armor, you regrow one damaged or ruined organ. During a round that you regain 9 or more Hit Points from the armor, you can reattach severed body parts by spending an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to hold the body part to the area it was severed from. If you take [electricity](link_trait_1576) or [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, the armor deactivates until the end of your next turn. (Similar armor from other types of trolls might be deactivated by different damage types.) In the event the armor itself is damaged, it will restore its own Hit Points before it resumes healing you. The activation uses up the elixirs, and the armor can’t be activated again until two new ones are installed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12563,"type":"item","before":{"id":12563,"bulk":"2","name":"Trollhound Vest","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1440206271342214","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":230},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4387","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"19"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","slug":"trollhound-vest-penalty","type":"circumstance","value":-1,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["target:trait:troll"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["action:make-an-impression","troll-plagued-community"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:26.816441+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This suit of _[+1](link_item_6719) hide armor_ is sickly green and covered in thick warts and nodules, fashioned from the hide of a trollhound and imbued with some of the beast's vitality. Wearing this armor gives you a –1 circumstance penalty to all checks made using Diplomacy to interact with trolls and a +1 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks used to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) in communities traditionally plagued by troll attacks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You take damage from a melee attack while you have half or fewer of your normal maximum Hit Points\n\n**Effect** Your body knits itself back together, healing you for 3d8 Hit Points.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the hides of at least two trollhounds."},"after":{"id":12563,"bulk":"2","name":"Trollhound Vest","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1440206271342214","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":230},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4387","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"19"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","slug":"trollhound-vest-penalty","type":"circumstance","value":-1,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["target:trait:troll"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":1,"selector":"diplomacy","predicate":["action:make-an-impression","troll-plagued-community"]}],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:26.816441+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This suit of _[+1](link_item_6719) hide armor_ is sickly green and covered in thick warts and nodules, fashioned from the hide of a trollhound and imbued with some of the beast's vitality. Wearing this armor gives you a –1 circumstance penalty to all checks made using Diplomacy to interact with trolls and a +1 circumstance bonus to Diplomacy checks used to [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) in communities traditionally plagued by troll attacks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Trigger** You take damage from a melee attack while you have half or fewer of your normal maximum Hit Points\n\n**Effect** Your body knits itself back together, healing you for 3d8 Hit Points.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the hides of at least two trollhounds."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12564,"type":"item","before":{"id":12564,"bulk":"0","name":"Troubadour's Cap","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5808050614117387","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{"gp":15000},"usage":"worn headwear","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4677","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":["diplomacy","performance"]}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:27.403835+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5c42e95f-1a88-4bc5-a128-d4b3de034155","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_DIPLOMACY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"8346da37-a8c3-4821-b66e-70e89d0e7903","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_PERFORMANCE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"a17ea73e-f8ae-4280-9e6f-6a31735bf0ec","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"2dec95cc-41f0-4489-96a6-edb2a70b3f8b","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":{"value":0,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_CHA","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"b575e439-9d7a-4775-84fd-8cb414505440","