escription":"The face of this [standard-grade silver](link_item_15062) [salvo shield](link_item_12355) (Hardness 7, HP 28, BT 14) is polished to a mirror finish.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">R</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per 10 minutes\n\n**Trigger** A ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) using ammunition such as arrows, bolts, or bullets (but not siege rounds or larger projectiles) misses you\n\n**Requirements** You have the [turnabout shield](link_item_12567) raised\n\n**Effect** The ammunition enters the shield and is redirected with the same force with which it was originally fired. Make a ranged [Strike](link_action_19856) using the ammunition with an attack modifier of +19, targeting a creature within 60 feet.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12568,"type":"item","before":{"id":12568,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tyrant Ampoule","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6825619533388610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":175},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4486","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:30.609801+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe body of a fearsome tyrannosaurus is shrunken and contained in this bottle, its desiccated form barely constrained within the glass. The effigy of a Gargantuan tyrannosaurus forms when you open the bottle, causing devastation as it rampages. The tyrannosaurus [Strides](link_action_19855) up to 40 feet. It can move through the spaces of Huge or smaller creatures and can attempt to Trample each creature whose space it enters, dealing 2d10+12 bludgeoning damage with a DC 27 basic Reflex save. It can attempt to Trample each creature only once.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a tyrannosaurus."},"after":{"id":12568,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Tyrant Ampoule","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6825619533388610","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":175},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4486","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:30.609801+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThe body of a fearsome tyrannosaurus is shrunken and contained in this bottle, its desiccated form barely constrained within the glass. The effigy of a Gargantuan tyrannosaurus forms when you open the bottle, causing devastation as it rampages. The tyrannosaurus [Strides](link_action_19855) up to 40 feet. It can move through the spaces of Huge or smaller creatures and can attempt to Trample each creature whose space it enters, dealing 2d10+12 bludgeoning damage with a DC 27 basic Reflex save. It can attempt to Trample each creature only once.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a tyrannosaurus."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12569,"type":"item","before":{"id":12569,"bulk":"0","name":"Unbreakable Heart","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5500392173318439","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4756","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"diplomacy"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:31.847588+00:00","operations":[{"id":"90ef4956-26a0-4514-93ac-1d53abf7562f","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_DIPLOMACY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The name of your beloved adorns this stylized image of a heart. An [unbreakable heart](link_item_12569) tattoo can be received only at the end of a successful *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)* ritual, serving as your token. The other participant can have a token other than a tattoo if they wish. If you have more than one *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*, each [unbreakable heart](link_item_12569) you have serves as a token for only one of them. The love exuding from you grants you a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy checks. When you use *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*'s activity to learn your beloved's present state, you can also grant them a small gift, choosing from the following options each time. Make your choice after learning their state.\n\n*   Your beloved gains 5 temporary Hit Points that last for 10 minutes.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[guidance](link_spell_4649)* on your beloved.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[stabilize](link_spell_4857)* on your beloved.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[light](link_spell_4699)* on your beloved's token from *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12569,"bulk":"0","name":"Unbreakable Heart","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5500392173318439","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4756","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"122"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":1,"selector":"diplomacy"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:31.847588+00:00","operations":[{"id":"90ef4956-26a0-4514-93ac-1d53abf7562f","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"1","variable":"SKILL_DIPLOMACY"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"The name of your beloved adorns this stylized image of a heart. An [unbreakable heart](link_item_12569) tattoo can be received only at the end of a successful *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)* ritual, serving as your token. The other participant can have a token other than a tattoo if they wish. If you have more than one *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*, each [unbreakable heart](link_item_12569) you have serves as a token for only one of them. The love exuding from you grants you a +1 item bonus to Diplomacy checks. When you use *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*'s activity to learn your beloved's present state, you can also grant them a small gift, choosing from the following options each time. Make your choice after learning their state.\n\n*   Your beloved gains 5 temporary Hit Points that last for 10 minutes.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[guidance](link_spell_4649)* on your beloved.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[stabilize](link_spell_4857)* on your beloved.\n    \n*   The tattoo casts *[light](link_spell_4699)* on your beloved's token from *[heartbond](link_spell_6684)*","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12570,"type":"item","before":{"id":12570,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Undertaker's Manifest","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5285500788910916","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1900,2855,1504,1901],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4719","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:32.816224+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This grim collection of spreadsheets is used both by undertakers who occasionally need to avoid the notice of their more restless clients, and by industrious necromancers looking to avoid catching the notice of cemetery guards and vigilant undertakers.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** If your next action is to cast a [shadow](link_trait_1901) or [void](link_trait_1485) spell, the spell's casting is accompanied by a roiling cloud of [shadow](link_trait_1901) that spills out around you, creating dim light in a 30-foot emanation centered on you for the next 3 rounds. This has no effect on areas where the lighting level is already darker than dim light.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12570,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Undertaker's Manifest","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5285500788910916","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":220},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1900,2855,1504,1901],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4719","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"113"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:32.816224+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This grim collection of spreadsheets is used both by undertakers who occasionally need to avoid the notice of their more restless clients, and by industrious necromancers looking to avoid catching the notice of cemetery guards and vigilant undertakers.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** If your next action is to cast a [shadow](link_trait_1901) or [void](link_trait_1485) spell, the spell's casting is accompanied by a roiling cloud of [shadow](link_trait_1901) that spills out around you, creating dim light in a 30-foot emanation centered on you for the next 3 rounds. This has no effect on areas where the lighting level is already darker than dim light.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12571,"type":"item","before":{"id":12571,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Unending Itch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1330696183676581","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476,1567],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4551","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"71"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:33.366686+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nInvented to cause a lengthy and unpleasant demise, this [poison](link_trait_1476) manifests as an itch that can't be soothed. The victim experiences the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage as irritation rather than pain or sickness and must succeed at a Perception 34 check to realize they're poisoned. The [poison](link_trait_1476) can also be identified with a Medicine 34 check. Once the victim has lost half or more of its Hit Points, the DC drops to 30 for either check. As long as the victim doesn't realize it's poisoned, the GM makes its saving throws in secret.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 34 Fortitude ([secret](link_trait_1463))\n\n**Maximum Duration** 5 minutes\n\n**Stages 1–5** 1d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12571,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Unending Itch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1330696183676581","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476,1567],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4551","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"71"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:33.366686+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nInvented to cause a lengthy and unpleasant demise, this [poison](link_trait_1476) manifests as an itch that can't be soothed. The victim experiences the [poison](link_trait_1476) damage as irritation rather than pain or sickness and must succeed at a Perception 34 check to realize they're poisoned. The [poison](link_trait_1476) can also be identified with a Medicine 34 check. Once the victim has lost half or more of its Hit Points, the DC drops to 30 for either check. As long as the victim doesn't realize it's poisoned, the GM makes its saving throws in secret.\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 34 Fortitude ([secret](link_trait_1463))\n\n**Maximum Duration** 5 minutes\n\n**Stages 1–5** 1d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12572,"type":"item","before":{"id":12572,"bulk":"1","name":"Unfathomable Stargazer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7838755445971238","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4920","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:33.946773+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An [unfathomable stargazer](link_item_12572) is a handheld brass telescope etched with constellations, the patterns of which form bizarre, shifting runes. You can observe the night sky with an [unfathomable stargazer](link_item_12572), however, the constellations you glimpse through the telescope distort with expanding and contracting fields of darkness among them. You use Occultism instead of Perception or Astronomy Lore when observing the skies with this item, and gain a +2 item bonus on all checks to do so. Once you use it, it fuses to you, and you must succeed at a DC 35 Will save to use another device to observe the stars, including your naked eyes. The telescope imposes a –4 circumstance penalty to Survival checks to [Sense Direction](link_action_19846) or navigate. If you critically fail this Survival check, you're subjected to *[warp mind](link_spell_4947)* (DC 34) as you glimpse something horrifying and alien amid the darkness.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12572,"bulk":"1","name":"Unfathomable Stargazer","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7838755445971238","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1558,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4920","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"193"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:33.946773+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An [unfathomable stargazer](link_item_12572) is a handheld brass telescope etched with constellations, the patterns of which form bizarre, shifting runes. You can observe the night sky with an [unfathomable stargazer](link_item_12572), however, the constellations you glimpse through the telescope distort with expanding and contracting fields of darkness among them. You use Occultism instead of Perception or Astronomy Lore when observing the skies with this item, and gain a +2 item bonus on all checks to do so. Once you use it, it fuses to you, and you must succeed at a DC 35 Will save to use another device to observe the stars, including your naked eyes. The telescope imposes a –4 circumstance penalty to Survival checks to [Sense Direction](link_action_19846) or navigate. If you critically fail this Survival check, you're subjected to *[warp mind](link_spell_4947)* (DC 34) as you glimpse something horrifying and alien amid the darkness.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12573,"type":"item","before":{"id":12573,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ursine Avenger Hood","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2453284399945122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1527,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4897","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"183"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:34.48634+00:00","operations":[{"id":"e06b2490-12a0-4673-b28c-43e246695f80","data":{"text":"to [Command an Animal](link_action_19614) (+2 if the animal is a bear)","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"SKILL_NATURE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A gift passed from warrior to warrior, this cowl is made from a [cave bear](link_creature_9968)'s skull and fur. Once invested, the wearer gains a +1 item bonus to Nature checks to [Command an Animal](link_action_19614), which increases to +2 if the animal is a bear. The wearer of the hood feels a constant longing for the wilderness and wild places and takes a –1 item penalty to all Diplomacy checks to [Gather Information](link_action_19723) or [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) if they go more than 5 days inside a large town or city without spending at least 4 hours in the wilderness.\n\n**Destruction** Soak the [Ursine Avenger Hood](link_item_12573) in the blood of a linnorm that is at least 16th level and then burn it in a fire that uses only oak and chrysanthemum as fuel.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12573,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ursine Avenger Hood","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2453284399945122","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{},"usage":"worn","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1527,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4897","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"183"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:34.48634+00:00","operations":[{"id":"e06b2490-12a0-4673-b28c-43e246695f80","data":{"text":"to [Command an Animal](link_action_19614) (+2 if the animal is a bear)","type":"item","value":1,"variable":"SKILL_NATURE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"A gift passed from warrior to warrior, this cowl is made from a [cave bear](link_creature_9968)'s skull and fur. Once invested, the wearer gains a +1 item bonus to Nature checks to [Command an Animal](link_action_19614), which increases to +2 if the animal is a bear. The wearer of the hood feels a constant longing for the wilderness and wild places and takes a –1 item penalty to all Diplomacy checks to [Gather Information](link_action_19723) or [Make an Impression](link_action_19739) if they go more than 5 days inside a large town or city without spending at least 4 hours in the wilderness.\n\n**Destruction** Soak the [Ursine Avenger Hood](link_item_12573) in the blood of a linnorm that is at least 16th level and then burn it in a fire that uses only oak and chrysanthemum as fuel.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12574,"type":"item","before":{"id":12574,"bulk":"2","name":"Urumi","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8391448963555248","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1706,1562],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.