too in particular. The tattoo of the Wind clan depicts a pegasus riding a gust of wind. The clans would seal alliances in ancient days by tattooing their emblems on members of other clans to symbolically share their gifts. Though these tattoos are respected, the clans reserve their most prestigious symbols for true members of the clan.\n\nThe tattoo allows you to understand and speak [Shoanti](link_language_416). If you already know that language, you instead gain a +1 item bonus on Diplomacy checks you make when speaking [Shoanti](link_language_416) to someone who understands it.\n\n**Activate** The actions required to Activate the tattoo are the same as those needed to cast its spell; **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The tattoo casts *[tailwind](link_spell_4885)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12577,"bulk":"0","name":"Unifying Emblem (Tamiir-Quah)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3213035527932545","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":60},"usage":"tattooed on the body","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504,2857],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2223","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"123"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:37.326922+00:00","operations":[{"id":"5e28fafe-d8d1-469c-bd64-3504873a267e","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"e8906191-f868-40c0-a18c-19acc0185035","data":{"name":"LANGUAGE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":[]},"name":"LANGUAGE_NAMES","type":"list-str","value":"shoanti","operator":"INCLUDES"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"828edcd3-98dc-44e3-831f-9dcf48600184","data":{"text"