s known for one tattoo in particular. The tattoo of the Axe clan depicts a raw fish cut into portions. The clans would seal alliances in ancient days by tattooing their emblems on members of other clans to symbolically share their gifts. Though these tattoos are respected, the clans reserve their most prestigious symbols for true members of the clan.\n\nThe tattoo allows you to understand and speak [Shoanti](link_language_416). If you already know that language, you instead gain a +1 item bonus on Diplomacy checks you make when speaking [Shoanti](link_language_416) to someone who understands it.\n\n**Activate** The actions required to Activate the tattoo are the same as those needed to cast its spell; **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The tattoo casts *[cleanse cuisine](link_spell_4523)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12584,"type":"item","before":{"id":12584,"bulk":"1","name":"Vaultbreaker's Harness","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6391493955861086","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":230},"usage":"worn backpack","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4839","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:41.192534+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[vaultbreaker's harness](link_item_12584)_ has four pockets across the chest. The pockets contain a set of [Thieves' Tools (Infiltrator)](link_item_7885), [Thieves' Tools (Infiltrator Picks)](link_item_7884), a [Crowbar (Levered)](link_item_6842), and a [Glass Cutter](link_item_14754). These items are magically bound to the harness; if they are more than 1 foot away from you, they disappear, then reappear in the harness at the next sunset. Broken or destroyed items similarly reappear, restored, in their proper pockets at sunset.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You cinch the harness to prepare for mischief. You gain a +1 item bonus to Stealth checks and a +10-foot item bonus to your Speed for 1 minute.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12584,"bulk":"1","name":"Vaultbreaker's Harness","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6391493955861086","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":230},"usage":"worn backpack","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4839","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"145"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:41.192534+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A _[vaultbreaker's harness](link_item_12584)_ has four pockets across the chest. The pockets contain a set of [Thieves' Tools (Infiltrator)](link_item_7885), [Thieves' Tools (Infiltrator Picks)](link_item_7884), a [Crowbar (Levered)](link_item_6842), and a [Glass Cutter](link_item_14754). These items are magically bound to the harness; if they are more than 1 foot away from you, they disappear, then reappear in the harness at the next sunset. Broken or destroyed items similarly reappear, restored, in their proper pockets at sunset.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** You cinch the harness to prepare for mischief. You gain a +1 item bonus to Stealth checks and a +10-foot item bonus to your Speed for 1 minute.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12585,"type":"item","before":{"id":12585,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Verdant Branch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8621401050900581","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1654,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4696","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:41.712835+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Woody vines and branches curl and twist around each other, growing small twigs, leaves, and flowers across the surface of this prosthetic arm or leg.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** A branch grows from your prosthesis, quickly flowering and then producing 1d4 ripe and flavorful fruits. A creature can pick and eat a fruit with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to regain 2d6+5 Hit Points. The fruits wither away after 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12585,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Verdant Branch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8621401050900581","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":360},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1654,1454],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4696","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"108"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:41.712835+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Woody vines and branches curl and twist around each other, growing small twigs, leaves, and flowers across the surface of this prosthetic arm or leg.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** A branch grows from your prosthesis, quickly flowering and then producing 1d4 ripe and flavorful fruits. A creature can pick and eat a fruit with an [Interact](link_action_19733) action to regain 2d6+5 Hit Points. The fruits wither away after 10 minutes.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12586,"type":"item","before":{"id":12586,"bulk":"0","name":"Vigilant Eye (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7583951681577155","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4775","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"129"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:42.231921+00:00","operations":[{"id":"0d165573-dbde-4e37-9d6a-bf8c34b4bbeb","data":{"title":"What is the spellheart affixed to?","modeType":"PREDEFINED","optionType":"CUSTOM","optionsPredefined":[{"id":"6022b6bd-eae7-453e-af79-d53f4bc304bf","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Armor","operations":[],"description":"You aren't off-guard to hidden or undetected creatures of the eye's level or lower, or creatures of the eye's level or lower using surprise attack, though you can still be flanked."},{"id":"1a6b53ad-4c2a-4cda-912b-e2055a2aed17","type":"CUSTOM","title":"Weapon","operations":[],"description":"When you make a [Strike](link_action_19856) with the weapon against a target that's concealed, hidden, or undetected, the DC of your flat check to target it is 3 if the target is concealed or 9 if it's hidden or undetected."}]},"type":"select"}],"description":"Carved in this wooden disc is a [humanoid](link_trait_2399) eye, painted in muted shades that blend in with the wood. The eye's pupil continually twitches and moves, scanning its bearer's surroundings.\n\n*   **Armor** ([revelation](link_trait_1907)) You aren't off-guard to hidden or undetected creatures of the eye's level or lower, or creatures of the eye's level or lower using [surprise attack](link_class-feature_21296), though you can still be flanked.\n    \n*   **Weapon** When you make a [Strike](link_action_19856) with the weapon against a target that's concealed, hidden, or undetected, the DC of your flat check to target it is 3 if the target is concealed or 9 if it's hidden or undetected.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[detect magic](link_spell_4562)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[web of eyes](link_spell_9071)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[clairvoyance](link_spell_4521)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12586,"bulk":"0","name":"Vigilant Eye (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7583951681577155","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4775","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"129"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity