your target has been defeated.\n\nThe weapon has a space of 5 feet, acts on your initiative, and gains two actions. It doesn’t block or impede enemies attempting to move through that space, nor does it benefit from or provide flanking. The weapon can’t use reactions, and it acts on your turn.\n\nWhile Activated, a [vine whip](link_item_12589) makes [Strikes](link_action_19856) with an attack modifier of +22 plus its item bonus to attack rolls (normally +24 total). It uses the weapon’s normal damage but has a +0 Strength modifier. The whip’s abilities that automatically trigger on a hit or critical hit still function, but the weapon can’t be Activated or benefit from any of your abilities while rooted. Each round, when the [vine whip](link_item_12589) is finished using its actions, attempt a DC 6 flat check. On a failure, the Activation ends and the [vine whip](link_item_12589) becomes inanimate. You can’t Activate the item again for 10 minutes. Removing the [vine whip](link_item_12589) from the ground takes an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. While rooted, the [vine whip](link_item_12589) gains fast healing 1.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the vine from a plant creature with a vine attack."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12590,"type":"item","before":{"id":12590,"bulk":"1","name":"Violin of the Waves","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1085364912620084","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1469,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4733","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance","predicate":["violin"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Violin of the Waves (Ship or Ocean)","value":3,"selector":"performance","predicate":["ocean","violin"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Playing the Violin of the Waves","domain":"performance","option":"violin","toggleable":true},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Adjacent to the ocean","domain":"performance","option":"ocean","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:44.365905+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This violin is crafted from finely wrought rosewood that emits a strong, but pleasant, smell of salt water and ocean life. It's engraved with images of sailors working and waves gently rolling. When you make a Performance check using the _[violin of the waves](link_item_12590)_, you gain a +2 item bonus to the check. This bonus increases to +3 if the performer is currently aboard a ship, walking on the ocean, or otherwise immediately adjacent to ocean water.\n\nThe violin was created to play a specific tune, one that springs instantly into the mind of anyone who so much as casually strums the instrument. It's a tune of calm waters and safety, but also of pranks played upon shipmates and revelry.\n\n**Activate** 5 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Requirements** You must be aboard a ship\n\n**Effect** You play the song. Once it's completed, the weather immediately calms to the normal as it would for the season, as control weather. For the next day, the weather remains in this state, unless affected by other magical effects. Anyone aboard the ship finds their mind wanders when performing tasks however, daydreaming of drunken revelry or other forms of entertainment, and the crew of the ship takes a –2 status penalty to skill checks to do anything other than participate in such revelry.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12590,"bulk":"1","name":"Violin of the Waves","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1085364912620084","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1469,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4733","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"116"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"performance","predicate":["violin"]},{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","label":"Violin of the Waves (Ship or Ocean)","value":3,"selector":"performance","predicate":["ocean","violin"]},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Playing the Violin of the Waves","domain":"performance","option":"violin","toggleable":true},{"key":"RollOption","label":"Adjacent to the ocean","domain":"performance","option":"ocean","toggleable":true}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:44.365905+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This violin is crafted from finely wrought rosewood that emits a strong, but pleasant, smell of salt water and ocean life. It's engraved with images of sailors working and waves gently rolling. When you make a Performance check using the _[violin of the waves](link_item_12590)_, you gain a +2 item bonus to the check. This bonus increases to +3 if the performer is currently aboard a ship, walking on the ocean, or otherwise immediately adjacent to ocean water.\n\nThe violin was created to play a specific tune, one that springs instantly into the mind of anyone who so much as casually strums the instrument. It's a tune of calm waters and safety, but also of pranks played upon shipmates and revelry.\n\n**Activate** 5 minutes ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Requirements** You must be aboard a ship\n\n**Effect** You play the song. Once it's completed, the weather immediately calms to the normal as it would for the season, as control weather. For the next day,