hin piercing blade with a basket hilt. It is prized among many as a dueling weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:38:54.838102+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The rapier is a long and thin piercing blade with a basket hilt. It is prized among many as a dueling weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:45.230149+00:00","operations":[{"id":"cf930f21-83fd-405c-b1be-98a4fd647d90","data":{"id":19855,"text":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Stride.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"271f8303-df44-4724-b024-5c8aa106a47f","data":{"id":19608,"text":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Balance.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"450642aa-d3df-4685-b0f3-523b54f174a4","data":{"id":19867,"text":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Tumble Through.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"8d792784-c2ea-448e-a55d-19db8950f98b","data":{"conditions":[{"id":"2dec95cc-41f0-4489-96a6-edb2a70b3f8b","data":{"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":{"value":1,"partial":false}},"name":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX","type":"attr","value":4,"operator":"LESS_THAN"}],"trueOperations":[{"id":"b575e439-9d7a-4775-84fd-8cb414505440","data":{"value":{"value":4},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"setValue"}],"falseOperations":[{"id":"28006422-2129-4ebe-86a7-f373695adb19","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"},{"id":"e84171ab-63df-439e-874c-d70aca253fc4","data":{"value":{"value":1},"variable":"ATTRIBUTE_DEX"},"type":"adjValue"}]},"type":"conditional"}],"description":"Crafted from flawless jade, the guard of this rapier takes the form of a twisting serpent with the blade thrusting from its open mouth. This rapier functions as a [_+3_](link_item_7952) [_greater striking_](link_item_7860) [_quickstrike_](link_item_7682) [_rapier_](link_item_7685). While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you [Stride](link_action_19855), [Balance](link_action_19608), or [Tumble Through](link_action_19867). When you invest the rapier, you either increase your Dexterity modifier by 1 or increase it to +4, whichever would give you a higher value.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per day; **Trigger** You fail, but don't critically fail, an attack using the [viper rapier](link_item_12591); **Effect** The tip of the rapier briefly takes the form of a viper's head, and the blade twists and contorts, biting the target you missed. The target is affected as if successfully poisoned with [cave worm venom](link_item_16354) (DC 43).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** A creature misses or critically misses you with an attack; **Effect** With a slight, obviously mocking bow or curtsy, you [Step](link_action_19853).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You twirl your rapier in a serpentine pattern, causing your form to become a blur of motion. You're concealed for 1 minute or until you take a hostile action. While you're concealed, you also gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Reflex saving throws.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12591,"bulk":"1","name":"Viper Rapier","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2618912362056037","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"potency":3,"property":[{"id":7682,"name":"Quickstrike","rune":{"id":7682,"bulk":"0","name":"Quickstrike","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":2798917388344067,"group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":16,"price":{"gp":10000},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T07:38:31.340071+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Attacks with a quickstrike weapon are supernaturally swift. While wielding a quickstrike weapon, you gain the quickened condition, but you can use the additional action granted only to make a <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Strike](link_action_19856) with the etched weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}}],"striking":2},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4678","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"104"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"rapier","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7685,"bulk":"1","name":"Rapier","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":8255205891597188,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1852,1604,1570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"sword","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"piercing"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bon