ng the target you missed. The target is affected as if successfully poisoned with [cave worm venom](link_item_16354) (DC 43).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** A creature misses or critically misses you with an attack; **Effect** With a slight, obviously mocking bow or curtsy, you [Step](link_action_19853).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You twirl your rapier in a serpentine pattern, causing your form to become a blur of motion. You're concealed for 1 minute or until you take a hostile action. While you're concealed, you also gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Reflex saving throws.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[{"path":["operations","0","data","text"],"before":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Stride.","after":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you [Stride](link_action_19855)."},{"path":["operations","1","data","text"],"before":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Balance.","after":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you [Balance](link_action_19608)."},{"path":["operations","2","data","text"],"before":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you Tumble Through.","after":"**Viper Rapier** While wielding the rapier, your movement doesn't trigger reactions when you [Tumble Through](link_action_19867)."}]},{"table":"item","id":12592,"type":"item","before":{"id":12592,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Voice From The Grave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"417448308785589","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1700},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4734","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"117"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:45.827475+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This onyx skull emits eerie whispers when on its own, but when held the skull enables you to speak with spirits and haunts you can see, even if you don't share a language. The [voice from the grave](link_item_12592) translates anything the spirit or haunt says, using a language you understand, and translates your words for the spirit or haunt in kind. This doesn't make the target friendly or even cooperative, but it does enable communication. The GM determines the language in the case of a haunt. You can't communicate with mindless spirits using the skull.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** The onyx skull casts a DC 27 *[charm](link_spell_4516)* spell on one spirit or haunt you can communicate with using the skull. If you target a haunt that doesn't have a Will modifier, it automatically gets a failure on its save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12592,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Voice From The Grave","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"417448308785589","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1700},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1448],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4734","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"117"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:45.827475+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This onyx skull emits eerie whispers when on its own, but when held the skull enables you to speak with spirits and haunts you can see, even if you don't share a language. The [voice from the grave](link_item_12592) translates anything the spirit or haunt says, using a language you understand, and translates your words for the spirit or haunt in kind. This doesn't make the target friendly or even cooperative, but it does enable communication. The GM determines the language in the case of a haunt. You can't communicate with mindless spirits using the skull.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per hour\n\n**Effect** The onyx skull casts a DC 27 *[charm](link_spell_4516)* spell on one spirit or haunt you can communicate with using the skull. If you target a haunt that doesn't have a Will modifier, it automatically gets a failure on its save.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12593,"type":"item","before":{"id":12593,"bulk":"0","name":"Voicebox","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2295099874298983","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":5},"usage":"worn necklace","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4703","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"109"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:46.365824+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This box contains small, magical amplifiers that allow a nonverbal character to translate thought into speech, which emits from the necklace. The speech produced matches any language you understand.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12593,"bulk":"0","name":"Voicebox","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2295099874298983","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"sp":5},"usage":"worn necklace","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4703","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"109"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:46.365824+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This box contains small, magical amplifiers that allow a nonverbal character to translate thought into speech, which emits from the necklace. The speech produced matches any language you understand.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12594,"type":"item","before":{"id":12594,"bulk":"0","name":"Void Fragment","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"487312580376169","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{},"usage":"touched","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4902","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"189"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:46.908488+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nHovering midair, thrumming and whispering of its power, a _[void fragment](link_item_12594)_ is a crystalline fragment of swirling colors, reminiscent of stars and deep darkness. It thrums intermittently with a beckoning vibration, drawing attention from and pulling at nearby creatures with a tangible sense of gravity. A chill hangs in the air around it. At a touch, the wisp vanishes, giving the point of contact a gangrenous color. If the partaker succeeds at the initial save, the wisp reappears somewhere on the same planet.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 1 (8 Days)** The first time you enter this stage from a given [void fragment](link_item_12594), you gain the effect of a [potion of truespeech](link_item_7673) for 3 days. The wisp grants you [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) with a range of 30 feet. Also, you are under the effects of *[hidden mind](link_spell_6334)*, except that its status bonus is +1 and it [counteracts](link_action_27519) with a bonus equal to your class DC – 9. The wisp grants you resistance to [mental](link_trait_1448) damage equal to half your level. You also have access to the following activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> or <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [teleportation](link_trait_1470)); **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You teleport up to 30 feet to an unoccupied space you can see. If you used 2 actions, you can teleport up to 60 feet.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 2 (24 Days)** You gain [imprecise thoughtsense](link_sense_30026) to half your [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884)'s range, which increases to 60 feet. However, you have a tough time filtering the mental noise. If any creatures can be detected by your thoughtsense, you take a –1 penalty to Perception checks. When you arrive in a space after using the activation to teleport, you create a 10-foot emanation that works like *[strange geometry](link_spell_6775)* for 1 round. This emanation can affect you.\n\nIf you die at this stage or higher, your body implodes. Your soul reincarnates as an [aberration](link_trait_2427) of a level close to yours, which extrudes from the location of your implosion. Common forms include [jah-tohl](link_creature_10154), [gosreg](link_creature_10101), [quelaunt](link_creature_10260), [rhu-chalik](link_creature_10272), [shoggoth](link_creature_10542), and [xoarian](link_creature_10388). This creature isn't you, but fleeting memories of your former existence remain with it. You can't be raised from the dead while this monster endures. The [void fragment](link_item_12594) reappears somewhere on the same planet.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 3 (32 Days)** Your [telepathy](link_physical-feature_28884) range increases to 100 feet, and the wisp grants you resistance to [mental](link_trait_1448) damage equal to your level. The mental noise increases the penalty to Perception to –2. Whenever you roll initiative, you become confused for up to 1d4 rounds.\n\n* * *\n\n**Stage 4** You die.\n\n* * *\n\n**Purging** You must find and slay a powerful [aberration](link_trait_2427) or a servant of such creatures the GM deems appropriate. The creature must be of your level or higher. Then, someone must cast a *[rest eternal](link_spell_6688)* ritual on you and the dead being; you must be anointed with the same oils the ritual normally requires. If the ritual results in a success, it casts the slain creature into the void along with the _[void fragment](link_item_12594)_ inside you, ending its effects on you.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12594,"bulk":"0","name":"Void Fragment","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"487312580376169","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{},"usage":"touched","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1531,1504,1514],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4902","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"189"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules