link_spell_4999)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12598,"type":"item","before":{"id":12598,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Chromatic Burst (4th-level)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4934538241165281","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1517,1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2273","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"138"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:49.446996+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This intricately carved quartz wand changes color, cycling through the colors of the rainbow.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[chromatic armor](link_spell_5139)*. Additionally, the target can use the Chromatic Armor Burst action.\n\n**Chromatic Armor Burst** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [light](link_trait_1517), [magical](link_trait_1504))\n\n**Requirements** You're affected by *[chromatic armor](link_spell_5139)* created by the [wand of chromatic burst](link_item_12598).\n\n**Effect** Choose one color of the *[chromatic armor](link_spell_5139)* the wand created for you. The spell ends and light of that color flashes brightly in a 20-foot emanation. Creatures in the area take 4d6 damage of the type associated with the color you chose, with a basic Reflex save against your spell DC. This action has the trait corresponding to the damage type you chose.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[chromatic armor](link_spell_5139)* of the appropriate rank."},"after":{"id":12598,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Chromatic Burst (4th-l