The bone's worn epiphysis forms the wand's pommel, and black leather wraps around the handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)*. After you cast the spell, if the target is enfeebled, it releases a 10-foot emanation that doesn't include itself. Each creature in that area must attempt a Fortitude save as if struck by the *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)* but gets an outcome one degree of success better than it rolled.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)*."},"after":{"id":12603,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Contagious Frailty","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2049211165542647","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":160},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4809","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"139"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:52.694413+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Cracks and healed fractures spiderweb the shaft of this bone wand, worsening each time the wand is used. The bone's worn epiphysis forms the wand's pommel, and black leather wraps around the handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)*. After you cast the spell, if the target is enfeebled, it releases a 10-foot emanation that doesn't include itself. Each creature in that area must attempt a Fortitude save as if struck by the *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)* but gets an outcome one degree of success better than it rolled.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[enfeeble](link_spell_4599)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12604,"type":"item","before":{"id":12604,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Crushing Leaps","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5204110625861367","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4810","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"139"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:53.38218+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This supple, light wooden wand drifts to the ground like a feather or leaf when dropped, landing unharmed. A thin coil of metal wraps around the wand's handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast *[jump](link_spell_4692)*, but can jump up to 60 feet. When you land you shatter the ground, making each creature in a 5-foot emanation off-guard until the start of its next turn. In addition, the space you land in and all squares in the emanation become difficult terrain for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of 1st-rank *[jump](link_spell_4692)*."},"after":{"id":12604,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Crushing Leaps","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5204110625861367","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":80},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4810","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"139"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:53.38218+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This supple, light wooden wand drifts to the ground like a feather or leaf when dropped, landing unharmed. A thin coil of metal wraps around the wand's handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast *[jump](link_spell_4692)*, but can jump up to 60 feet. When you land you shatter the ground, making each creature in a 5-foot emanation off-guard until the start of its next turn. In addition, the space you land in and all squares in the emanation become difficult terrain for 1 minute.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of 1st-rank *[jump](link_spell_4692)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12605,"type":"item","before":{"id":12605,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Dazzling Rays (3rd-level)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4359396407182879","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1542,1630,1517,1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4811","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"139"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.ActivatedItem","domain":"all","option":"wand-of-dazzling-rays-activated","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":40,"color":"#fffb80","bright":20,"shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"starlight","speed":2,"intensity":2}},"predicate":[{"not":"wand-of-dazzling-rays-activated"}]},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":20,"color":"#fffb80","shadows":0.2,"animation":{"type":"starlight","speed":2,"intensity":2}},"predicate":["wand-of-dazzling-rays-activated"]}],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:24:53.930566+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Solidified radiance comprises this slender, featureless wand. It sheds bright light in a 20-foot radius and dim light for the next 20 feet. After you Activate the wand, the light fades, so it only sheds dim light in a 20-foot radius. The wand returns to its original brightness each dawn.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast 3rd-rank *[holy light](link_spell_4660)*, dazzling your target with the beam's intensity. A creature that takes damage from the spell is blinded for 1 round and dazzled for a number of rounds equal to the spell rank. On a critical success on the attack roll, the target is also blinded for as long as it's dazzled from the spell. However, it can attempt a Fortitude saving throw against your spell DC at the end of each of its turns, ending the blinded condition on a success (but remaining dazzled).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[holy light](link_spell_4660)* of the appropriate rank."},"after":{"id":12605,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Dazzling Rays (3rd-level)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4359396407182879","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1542,1630,1517,1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4811","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"139"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"RollOption","label":"PF2E.SpecificRule.ActivatedItem","domain":"all","option":"wand-of-dazzling-rays-activated","toggleable":true},{"key":"TokenLight","value":{"dim":40,"color":"#fffb80","bright":20,"shado