,"description":"Carved from a hawthorn branch, this wand has a smooth handle, but the shaft remains covered in bark and long thorns. Polished red stones, arranged like a cluster of berries, decorate the pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast *[oaken resilience](link_spell_4744)* at 2nd rank, and the target sprouts long thorns like those of a hawthorn tree. While _oaken resilience_ lasts, any creature that hits the target with an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) [Strike](link_action_19856) or otherwise touches it takes 1d4 piercing damage from the thorns. A creature that has engulfed or swallowed the target takes this damage as well at the start of each of the target's turns.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[oaken resilience](link_spell_4744)* of the appropriate rank."},"after":{"id":12619,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Hawthorn (2nd-rank Spell)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7084112101132653","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2938,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2279","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"140"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:04.415202+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Carved from a hawthorn branch, this wand has a smooth handle, but the shaft remains covered in bark and long thorns. Polished red stones, arranged like a cluster of berries, decorate the pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus over