7","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":55000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1453,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4814","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"140"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:10.588323+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The grain of this simple wooden wand forms shifting images of sharp claws, snapping jaws, and countless creatures.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); This activation takes <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> if the spell normally takes <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> to cast, or <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> if the spell normally takes <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr>\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You [Cast the Spell](link_action_19611), selecting two forms from among those you can normally choose. You gain the benefits of both forms. For example, if one form can breathe air and the other can breathe underwater, you can breathe in both situations. If there's overlap in abilities, you gain the better one. For instance, if both have a fly Speed, you get the higher one, and if both forms have claws, you gain only the claw [Strike](link_action_19856) you prefer. The GM determines which abilities overlap and which are cumulative.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of a spell of the appropriate rank. The spell must have a casting time of 1 or 2, must have the polymorph trait, and must allow more than one choice of battle form."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12631,"type":"item","before":{"id":12631,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Legerdemain (1st-level)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1571039557728623","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4815","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"140"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:11.15336+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This wand of lacquered black wood has a handle wrapped in interwoven colorful ribbons. A silver bell caps the wand's tasseled pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You [Cast the Spell](link_action_19611).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Interact](link_action_19733) ([emotion](link_trait_1486), [illusion](link_trait_1447), [light](link_trait_1517), [mental](link_trait_1448), [visual](link_trait_1479))\n\n**Requirements** The last action you took this turn was to [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611) from the wand\n\n**Effect** You make yourself the center of attention. An illusory spotlight shines bright light upon your space as you pull inane objects from the wand's tip, such as confetti, silk flowers, streamers, or a long string of colorful kerchiefs knotted end to end. Each enemy within 30 feet must attempt a Will save against your spell DC, receiving a +4 circumstance bonus to the save if you or any of your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it. On a failure, the creature becomes fascinated with you until the end of your next turn. The fascination ends if the target is subject to a hostile act, or if another creature succeeds at a Diplomacy or Intimidation check against it. The spotlight follows you wherever you move. You can't be concealed while in the spotlight. The effect ends if you become invisible, attempt a Stealth check, or [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the activation. You can [Sustain this Activation](link_action_19858) for up to 1 minute. Since you need to keep performing tricks, [Sustain an Activation](link_action_19858) has the [manipulate](link_trait_1433) trait. [Sustaining](link_action_19858) extends the spotlight, and keeps fascinated creatures fascinated, but doesn't cause creatures not already fascinated to become fascinated.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of a spell of the appropriate rank."},"after":{"id":12631,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Legerdemain (1st-level)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1571039557728623","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":100},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4815","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"140"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:11.15336+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This wand of lacquered black wood has a handle wrapped in interwoven colorful ribbons. A silver bell caps the wand's tasseled pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You [Cast the Spell](link_action_19611).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [Interact](link_action_19733) ([emotion](link_trait_1486), [illusion](link_trait_1447), [light](link_trait_1517), [mental](link_trait_1448), [visual](link_trait_1479))\n\n**Requir