lectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:48.426521+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This pale wooden wand is carved to resemble a thigh bone with metal caps at each end. Ghostly tendrils seem to swirl around it every so often.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge.\n\n**Effect** You cast *[false vitality](link_spell_4614)* at 9th rank. During the duration of the spell, wisps that resemble spirits flit around you as long as you have any temporary Hit Points from *[false vitality](link_spell_4614)*, and you can use the following action.\n\n**Trigger** You successfully impart the frightened 1 condition on a creature.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Requirements** You have at least 1 temporary Hit Point from *[false vitality](link_spell_4614)*\n\n**Effect** You end *[false vitality](link_spell_4614)* and increase the creature's frightened condition value to 2.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of False Life at 9th rank"},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12695,"type":"item","before":{"id":12695,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of the Ash Puppet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8082584070677760","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4827","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:49.043177+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This wand is composed of ash that has been compressed, shaped, and sealed with a clear lacquer. When you trace the wand's tip along a solid surface, it leaves a black trail of charcoal. Writing with the wand in this way never damages or wears the wand down.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast [Disintegrate](link_spell_4571). If the spell reduces a living creature to fine powder, you animate that creature's ashes into a [Sulfur Zombie](link_creature_11836) with the same general appearance as the disintegrated creature. You control this [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836), which gains the [minion](link_trait_2527) and [summoned](link_trait_2134) traits. You can issue a verbal command to the [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836) as a single action with the [auditory](link_trait_1469) and [concentrate](link_trait_1432) traits. The [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836) crumbles into inanimate ash when reduced to 0 Hit Points or after 1 minute, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of Disintegrate."},"after":{"id":12695,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of the Ash Puppet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8082584070677760","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":4500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4827","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:49.043177+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This wand is composed of ash that has been compressed, shaped, and sealed with a clear lacquer. When you trace the wand's tip along a solid surface, it leaves a black trail of charcoal. Writing with the wand in this way never damages or wears the wand down.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast [Disintegrate](link_spell_4571). If the spell reduces a living creature to fine powder, you animate that creature's ashes into a [Sulfur Zombie](link_creature_11836) with the same general appearance as the disintegrated creature. You control this [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836), which gains the [minion](link_trait_2527) and [summoned](link_trait_2134) traits. You can issue a verbal command to the [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836) as a single action with the [auditory](link_trait_1469) and [concentrate](link_trait_1432) traits. The [sulfur zombie](link_creature_11836) crumbles into inanimate ash when reduced to 0 Hit Points or after 1 minute, whichever comes first.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of Disintegrate."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12696,"type":"item","before":{"id":12696,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of the Pampered Pet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5719830229474941","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4828","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:49.653348+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This extravagant wand is made of gold and capped with a large, sparkling gemstone. Its handle is wrapped in plush, padded fabric.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast *[pet cache](link_spell_4760)* but the accommodations inside the extradimensional space are luxurious and spacious. The food is delicious gourmet cuisine tailored to the pet's palate, the habitat is the perfect temperature and environment for the pet, complete with comfortable bed or lounging area. A pair of phantom hands pamper the pet, patting, grooming, or playing with it at the creature's whim.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[pet cache](link_spell_4760)*."},"after":{"id":12696,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of the Pampered Pet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5719830229474941","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":4,"price":{"gp":75},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1559,1504,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4828","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:49.653348+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This extravagant wand is made of gold and capped with a large, sparkling gemstone. Its handle is wrapped in plush, padded fabric.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast *[pet cache](link_spell_4760)* but the accommodations inside the extradimensional space are luxurious and spacious. The food is delicious gourmet cuisine tailored to the pet's palate, the habitat is the perfect temperature and environment for the pet, complete with comfortable bed or lounging area. A pair of phantom hands pamper the pet, patting, grooming, or playing with it at the creature's whim.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[pet cache](link_spell_4760)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12697,"type":"item","before":{"id":12697,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Tormented Slumber","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2321865733891157","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1650,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4829","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:50.271425+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The carved talon of an unidentifiable beast comprises this wand. Blood-stained cloth wraps the thicker part of the talon, which acts as a handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[sleep](link_spell_4837)*, but the slumbering creatures have terrifying nightmares. A creature knocked unconscious by this spell takes 1d6 persistent [mental](link_trait_1448) damage. This damage wakes the creature from unconsciousness only if it deals 4 or more damage on a single roll. If the creature awakens from its unconsciousness due to damage (whether it was the persistent [mental](link_trait_1448) damage or not), it's frightened 1. If it awakens from damage on its own turn, the creature doesn't reduce its frightened condition automatically on that turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of 4th-rank *[sleep](link_spell_4837)*."},"after":{"id":12697,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Tormented Slumber","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2321865733891157","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":1000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1650,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4829","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:50.271425+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The carved talon of an unidentifiable beast comprises this wand. Blood-stained cloth wraps the thicker part of the talon, which acts as a handle.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast 4th-rank *[sleep](link_spell_4837)*, but the slumbering creatures have terrifying nightmares. A creature knocked unconscious by this spell takes 1d6 persistent [mental](link_trait_1448) damage. This damage wakes the creature from unconsciousness only if it deals 4 or more damage on a single roll. If the creature awakens from its unconsciousness due to damage (whether it was the persistent [mental](link_trait_1448) damage or not), it's frightened 1. If it awakens from damage on its own turn, the creature doesn't reduce its frightened condition automatically on that turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of 4th-rank *[sleep](link_spell_4837)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12698,"type":"item","before":{"id":12698,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Toxic Blades (6th-Rank Spell)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8289080077461474","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1560,1504,1476,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4830","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"ite