611); **Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge; **Effect** You cast 8th-rank *[blessed boundary](link_spell_4416)*. Damage from the wall also exposes the damaged creature to [cerulean scourge](link_item_16355). The [poison](link_trait_1476) uses its normal DC. A creature can be exposed to the [poison](link_trait_1476) no more than once per turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[blessed boundary](link_spell_4416)* of the appropriate rank."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12701,"type":"item","before":{"id":12701,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Traitorous Thoughts","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1088026787831434","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4831","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:52.612309+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you hold this sleek, shiny gray wand, you hear a faint chorus of overlapping whispers.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[mind probe](link_spell_4723)*. The first time the target rolls a success at a Deception check to mislead your probe, it gets a result one step worse than it rolled. This means you learn the answer if the target's Deception check would have succeeded, and you learn nothing rather than believing a falsehood if the check would have been a critical success.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[mind probe](link_spell_4723)*."},"after":{"id":12701,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Traitorous Thoughts","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1088026787831434","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":12,"price":{"gp":2000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4831","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:52.612309+00:00","operations":null,"description":"When you hold this sleek, shiny gray wand, you hear a faint chorus of overlapping whispers.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[mind probe](link_spell_4723)*. The first time the target rolls a success at a Deception check to mislead your probe, it gets a result one step worse than it rolled. This means you learn the answer if the target's Deception check would have succeeded, and you learn nothing rather than believing a falsehood if the check would have been a critical success.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[mind probe](link_spell_4723)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12702,"type":"item","before":{"id":12702,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Wearying Dance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7838296050281525","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4832","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:53.294938+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This colorfully painted wand has a few jingling bells tied to the pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[uncontrollable dance](link_spell_4914)*. When the spell's duration ends, if the target was forced to dance for 1 minute, it becomes fatigued.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[uncontrollable dance](link_spell_4914)*."},"after":{"id":12702,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wand of Wearying Dance","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7838296050281525","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,1448,1665],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4832","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"143"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:53.294938+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This colorfully painted wand has a few jingling bells tied to the pommel.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n**Frequency** once per day, plus overcharge\n\n**Effect** You cast *[uncontrollable dance](link_spell_4914)*. When the spell's duration ends, if the target was forced to dance for 1 minute, it becomes fatigued.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply a casting of *[uncontrollable dance](link_spell_4914)*."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12703,"type":"item","before":{"id":12703,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Warden's Signet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2451936999232750","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4862","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"nature"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:53.871263+00:00","operations":[{"id":"01f09b19-5bb3-4a42-9495-ae0113bce0c0","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_NATURE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This symbol shows your dedication to the magic practiced by some rangers. Most rangers wear it on an amulet, ring, or piercing. You gain a +2 item bonus to Nature checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a ranger warden spell. When you use this Focus Point, the [warden's signet](link_item_12703) also casts a 4th-rank *[oaken resilience](link_spell_4744)* spell on you. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a ranger with at least one warden spell."},"after":{"id":12703,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Warden's Signet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2451936999232750","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":1250},"usage":"worn","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1526,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4862","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"151"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"nature"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:53.871263+00:00","operations":[{"id":"01f09b19-5bb3-4a42-9495-ae0113bce0c0","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_NATURE"},"type":"addBonusToValue"}],"description":"This symbol shows your dedication to the magic practiced by some rangers. Most rangers wear it on an amulet, ring, or piercing. You gain a +2 item bonus to Nature checks.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You gain 1 Focus Point, which you can use only to cast a ranger warden spell. When you use this Focus Point, the [warden's signet](link_item_12703) also casts a 4th-rank *[oaken resilience](link_spell_4744)* spell on you. If not used by the end of your turn, this Focus Point is lost.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"You are a ranger with at least one warden spell."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12704,"type":"item","before":{"id":12704,"bulk":"4","name":"Warding Escutcheon (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3931542866874764","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":55000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":80,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":80,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4396","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":20,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"tower-shield","speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":40},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:54.470831+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An image of a keyhole adorns the coat of arms of this stone [tower shield](link_item_7900) (Hardness 20, HP 80, BT 40).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield becomes a locked door in an empty, adjacent space no wider than 5 feet, becoming flush with the surrounding structure so it blocks all passage. The door has the same Hardness, HP, and Broken Threshold as the shield, with Athletics and Thievery DCs of 43 to open. The door remains in place for 1 hour, until it's opened or broken, or until you spend an action to end this effect, at which point the shield returns to your hand (or falls to the ground in your space if your hands are full).\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield floats lazily in the air as bricks quickly fly from it to form a tall stone keep around it. You cast *[resplendent mansion](link_spell_6762)*, with the shield becoming the door.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12704,"bulk":"4","name":"Warding Escutcheon (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3931542866874764","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":55000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":80,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":80,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4396","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"22"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":20,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"tower-shield","speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":40},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:54.470831+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An image of a keyhole adorns the coat of arms of this stone [tower shield](link_item_7900) (Hardness 20, HP 80, BT 40).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield becomes a locked door in an empty, adjacent space no wider than 5 feet, becoming flush with the surrounding structure so it blocks all passage. The door has the same Hardness, HP, and Broken Threshold as the shield, with Athletics and Thievery DCs of 43 to open. The door remains in place for 1 hour, until it's opened or broken, or until you spend an action to end this effect, at which point the shield returns to your hand (or falls to the ground in your space if your hands are full).\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield floats lazily in the air as bricks quickly fly from it to form a tall stone keep around it. You cast *[resplendent mansion](link_spell_6762)*, with the shield becoming the door.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12705,"type":"item","before":{"id":12705,"bulk":"4","name":"Warding Escutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1699961574102228","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":625},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":40,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":40,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":10,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"tower-shield","speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1863","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"23"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:55.030565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An image of a keyhole adorns the coat of arms of this stone [tower shield](link_item_7900) (Hardness 10, HP 40, BT 20).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield becomes a locked door in an empty, adjacent space no wider than 5 feet, becoming flush with the surrounding structure so it blocks all passage. The door has the same Hardness, HP, and Broken Threshold as the shield, with Athletics and Thievery DCs of 25 to open. The door remains in place for 1 hour, until it's opened or broken, or until you spend an action to end this effect, at which point the shield returns to your hand (or falls to the ground in your space if your hands are full).\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield floats lazily in the air as bricks quickly fly from it to form a squat stone tower around it. You cast *[cozy cabin](link_spell_4541)*, with the shield becoming the door.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12705,"bulk":"4","name":"Warding Escutcheon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1699961574102228","group":"SHIELD","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":625},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":40,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":40,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":2,"hardness":10,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"tower-shield","speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1863","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"23"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:55.030565+00:00","operations":null,"description":"An image of a keyhole adorns the coat of arms of this stone [tower shield](link_item_7900) (Hardness 10, HP 40, BT 20).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield becomes a locked door in an empty, adjacent space no wider than 5 feet, becoming flush with the surrounding structure so it blocks all passage. The door has the same Hardness, HP, and Broken Threshold as the shield, with Athletics and Thievery DCs of 25 to open. The door remains in place for 1 hour, until it's opened or broken, or until you spend an action to end this effect, at which point the shield returns to your hand (or falls to the ground in your space if your hands are full).\n\n**Activate** 1 minute ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** The shield floats lazily in the air as bricks quickly fly from it to form a squat stone tower around it. You cast *[cozy cabin](link_spell_4541)*, with the shield becoming the door.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12706,"type":"item","before":{"id":12706,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Warding Element Draught","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7979246650152413","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":60,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1934","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"51"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:55.589662+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nUsing ingredients collected from pure elemental sources, a [warding element draught](link_item_12706) instills enough of the essence of the element in the imbiber to partially protect them against it. Each draught includes one of the following ingredients, chosen when the elixir is distilled, and grants a +1 item bonus to AC and saving throws against [alchemical](link_trait_1529) effects, spells, and [magic](link_trait_1504) effects with the listed elemental trait for 10 minutes.\n\n*   **Blood** [Metal](link_trait_2132)\n*   **Effervescent Gas** [Air](link_trait_1524)\n*   **Grains** [Earth](link_trait_1523)\n*   **Hot Peppers** [Fire](link_trait_1542)\n*   **Spring Water** [Water](link_trait_1584)\n*   **Wormwood** [Wood](link_trait_1680)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12706,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Warding Element Draught","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7979246650152413","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"cp":"","gp":60,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1934","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"51"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:25:55.589662+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nUsing ingredients collected from pure elemental sources, a [warding element draught](link_item_12706) instills enough of the essence of the element in the imbiber to partially protect them against it. Each draught includes one of the following ingredients, chosen when the elixir is distilled, and grants a +1 item bonus to AC and saving throws against [alchemical](link_trait_1529) effects, spells, and [magic](link_trait_1504) effects with the listed elemental trait for 10 minutes.\n\n*   **Blood** [Metal](link_trait_2132)\n*   **Effervescent Gas** [Air](link_trait_1524)\n*   **Grains** [Earth](link_trait_1523)\n*   **Hot Peppers** [Fire](lin