r":{"id":12716,"bulk":"0","name":"Weapon Shot (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7855614774327667","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"other","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4592","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"83"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:01.844712+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Ammunition** any\n\nThe body of a [weapon shot](link_item_12716) is translucent and filled with quicksilver. It imparts its magic to the weapon used to fire it or it summons a translucent weapon, made of [force](link_trait_1560), to fire it. It's a favorite of killers and sharpshooters who need just one shot in a situation where carrying ammunition is easier than carrying a weapon.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432))\n\n**Effect** For the [Strike](link_action_19856) with which you consume the ammunition, the weapon is a [+2](link_item_7951) [striking](link_item_7862) weapon, instead of those of the weapon firing it.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Effect** A ghostly weapon made of [force](link_trait_1560) appears, wielded by you and loaded with the [weapon shot](link_item_12716) you activated. The conjured weapon sublimates into motes of briefly luminous dust if the [weapon shot](link_item_12716) deactivates without you using it or just after you use the activated shot. For the [Strike](link_action_19856) with which it functions, the weapon is a [+2](link_item_7951) [striking](link_item_7862) weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12717,"type":"item","before":{"id":12717,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Weapon Siphon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4726108692027407","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"attached to a melee weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2858,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4520","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:03.04299+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis set of tubing snakes down the striking surface of a weapon to deliver alchemical explosives. A single lesser alchemical bomb can be fitted to the [weapon siphon](link_item_12717) as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. The bomb must be one that deals energy damage, such as an [acid flask](link_item_6671), [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689), [blasting stone](link_item_16404), [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), or [frost vial](link_item_16419). The next three attacks made with the weapon deal 1d4 damage of the bomb's damage type in addition to the weapon's normal damage. If the second and third attacks aren't all made within 1 minute of the first attack, the bomb's energy is wasted. These attacks never deal [splash](link_trait_1532) damage or other special effects of the bomb and aren't modified by any abilities that add to or modify a bomb's effect.\n\nAdding a [weapon siphon](link_item_12717) to a weapon throws off its balance, causing the multiple attack penalty with the weapon to be one greater than usual (usually –6 on a second attack and –11 on a third; or –5 and –10 with an [agile](link_trait_1569) weapon).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12717,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Weapon Siphon","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4726108692027407","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":10},"usage":"attached to a melee weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2858,1529],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4520","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"65"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:03.04299+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nThis set of tubing snakes down the striking surface of a weapon to deliver alchemical explosives. A single lesser alchemical bomb can be fitted to the [weapon siphon](link_item_12717) as an [Interact](link_action_19733) action. The bomb must be one that deals energy damage, such as an [acid flask](link_item_6671), [alchemist's fire](link_item_6689), [blasting stone](link_item_16404), [bottled lightning](link_item_16068), or [frost vial](link_item_16419). The next three attacks made with the weapon deal 1d4 damage of the bomb's damage type in addition to the weapon's normal damage. If the second and third attacks aren't all made within 1 minute of the first attack, the bomb's energy is wasted. These attacks never deal [splash](link_trait_1532) damage or other special effects of the bomb and aren't modified by any abilities that add to or modify a bomb's effect.\n\nAdding a [weapon siphon](link_item_12717) to a weapon throws off its balance, causing the multiple attack penalty with the weapon to be one greater than usual (usually –6 on a second attack and –11 on a third; or –5 and –10 with an [agile](link_trait_1569) weapon).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12718,"type":"item","before":{"id":12718,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Weapon-Weird Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2125243165472973","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4610","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:03.619833+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nEach dose of [weapon-weird oil](link_item_12718) is keyed to a particular melee weapon group, selected from among axe, brawling, club, flail, hammer, knife, pick, polearm, shield, spear, and sword. The oil creates a synergy between skill and weapon, enabling you to wield the weapon in unexpected ways. You must have proficiency with the original weapon to benefit from the oil; however, you use your proficiency rank with the oil's keyed group instead of the weapon's original group. Also, you apply the critical specialization effect from the oil's keyed group instead of the weapon's normal critical specialization effect. While the oil remains effective, the [Grievous](link_item_7011) rune and similar magic react as if the weapon belongs to the oil's group. A weapon can be coated in only one type of [weapon-weird oil](link_item_12718) at a time. Any new application of this oil supersedes any previous one. These effects last for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12718,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Weapon-Weird Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2125243165472973","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":55},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4610","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:03.619833+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nEach dose of [weapon-weird oil](link_item_12718) is keyed to a particular melee weapon group, selected from among axe, brawling, club, flail, hammer, knife, pick, polearm, shield, spear, and sword. The oil creates a synergy between skill and weapon, enabling you to wield the weapon in unexpected ways. You must have proficiency with the original weapon to benefit from the oil; however, you use your proficiency rank with the oil's keyed group instead of the weapon's original group. Also, you apply the critical specialization effect from the oil's keyed group instead of the weapon's normal critical specialization effect. While the oil remains effective, the [Grievous](link_item_7011) rune and similar magic react as if the weapon belongs to the oil's group. A weapon can be coated in only one type of [weapon-weird oil](link_item_12718) at a time. Any new application of this oil supersedes any previous one. These effects last for 1 hour.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12719,"type":"item","before":{"id":12719,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Whelming Scrimshaw","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8320473602266644","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1855],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4663","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"99"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:04.197705+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn etching of some [aquatic](link_trait_2429) beast dragging a figure beneath the waves adorns the ivory of a [whelming scrimshaw](link_item_12719). When you Activate this item, you break it and choose one creature within 30 feet. The target must attempt a Fortitude 30 save; [amphibious](link_trait_2416) and [aquatic](link_trait_2429) creatures are immune.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target becomes sickened 1 and unable to breathe until this sickened condition ends.\n\n**Failure** As success, but sickened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** As success, but sickened 3.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12719,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Whelming Scrimshaw","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8320473602266644","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":500},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1855],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4663","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"99"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:04.197705+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nAn etching of some [aquatic](link_trait_2429) beast dragging a figure beneath the waves adorns the ivory of a [whelming scrimshaw](link_item_12719). When you Activate this item, you break it and choose one creature within 30 feet. The target must attempt a Fortitude 30 save; [amphibious](link_trait_2416) and [aquatic](link_trait_2429) creatures are immune.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target becomes sickened 1 and unable to breathe until this sickened condition ends.\n\n**Failure** As success, but sickened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** As success, but sickened 3.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12720,"type":"item","before":{"id":12720,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Whipstaff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3896957107089144","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1572,1562,3630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":12,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":12,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=634","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"30"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":3,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"whipstaff","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":6,"base_item_content":{"id":12720,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Whipstaff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":3896957107089144,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1569,1570,1572,1562,3630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":"","reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":