type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:05.375849+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nOpening this vial releases a mighty gust, forming into a fearsome Huge elemental hurricane. The elemental breathes a 30-foot cone of air. Each creature in the cone must succeed at a DC 28 Fortitude save or be knocked away from the elemental. A creature knocked into a solid object stops moving and takes 4d6 bludgeoning damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is pushed 10 feet.\n\n**Failure** The creature is pushed 20 feet.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is pushed 20 feet and knocked prone.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply magical residue from a slain elemental hurricane."},"after":{"id":12721,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Whirlwind Vial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4413563187401801","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":11,"price":{"gp":250},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4487","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T12:08:52.489Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:05.375849+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nOpening this vial releases a mighty gust, forming into a fearsome Huge elemental hurricane. The elemental breathes a 30-foot cone of air. Each creature in the cone must succeed at a DC 28 Fortitude save or be knocked away from the elemental. A creature knocked into a solid object stops moving and takes 4d6 bludgeoning damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is pushed 10 feet.\n\n**Failure** The creature is pushed 20 feet.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is pushed 20 feet and knocked prone.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply magical residue from a slain elemental hurricane."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12722,"type":"item","before":{"id":12722,"bulk":"2","name":"Whisperer of Souls","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2798791244766930","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":28,"price":{},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1852,1475,1598,1573],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"polearm","range":null,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":6766,"name":"Brilliant (Greater)","rune":{"id":6766,"bulk":"0","name":"Brilliant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"fire"},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:10:22.707136+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune causes a weapon to transform into pure, brilliant energy. The weapon deals an additional 1d4 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a successful [Strike](link_action_19856), as well as 1d4 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage to [fiends](link_trait_2415) and 1d4 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage to [undead](link_trait_2425). On a critical hit, the target must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save or be blinded for 1 round. Damage dealt by this weapon ignores the target's resistances to [fire](link_trait_1542), [spirit](link_trait_1556), and [vitality](link_trait_1478).\n\n**Activate—Shine Bright** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [light](link_trait_1517))\n\n**Effect** You plunge your weapon into darkness to return the light. Attempt a [counteract](link_action_27519) check with a [counteract](link_action_27519) rank of 9 and +31 [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier to end a [magical](link_trait_1504) [darkness](link_trait_1900) effect whose area is within reach of the weapon.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}},{"id":7061,"name":"Keen","rune":{"id":7061,"bulk":"0","name":"Keen","size":"MEDIUM","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000},"usage":"etched onto a piercing or slashing melee weapon","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:20:32.806856+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The edges of a *[keen](link_item_7061)* weapon are preternaturally sharp. Attacks with this weapon are a critical hit on a 19 on the die as long as that result is a success. This property has no effect on a 19 if the result would be a failure.","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":null}}],"striking":3},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"slashing"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4896","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"180"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"glaive","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:06.376829+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This _+4 [major striking](link_item_7861) [greater brilliant](link_item_6766) [keen](link_item_7061) [glaive](link_item_6995)_ binds the souls of powerful creatures it slays. The soul can't be returned to life by any means while imprisoned within the glaive and can be freed only by a deed of great benevolence or selflessness. While using the glaive as a weapon, whenever you reduce a sapient creature of 18th level or higher to 0 Hit Points or roll a critical success with a [Strike](link_action_19856) against such a target, the creature must attempt a DC 50 Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** No additional effect.\n\n**Success** The glaive siphons the creature's essence, rendering it drained 1. If the creature dies from the [Strike](link_action_19856) or while drained in this way, the creature's soul is bound in the glaive.\n\n**Failure** As success, but the creature is drained 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** As success, but the creature is drained 4.\n\nThe glaive also has the following activations.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You [Strike](link_action_19856) with the _[Whisperer of Souls](link_item_12722)_; **Effect** You choose whether the [Strike](link_action_19856) deals lethal or [nonlethal](link_trait_1571) damage. If the glaive has a reason for doing so, such as slaying a creature whose soul the glaive can absorb, it can defy your choice if you fail a DC 50 Will save.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">F</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Trigger** You attempt an Occultism check to [Decipher Writing](link_action_19622), [Identify Magic](link_action_19730), [Learn a Spell](link_action_19736), or [Recall Knowledge](link_action_19753); **Effect** You listen to eldritch secrets the weapon whispers, gaining a +4 item bonus to the triggering check.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per week; **Effect** Attempt an Occultism check as if you cast the *[collective memories](link_spell_4527)* ritual about a subject. If you roll a success or critical success, you can repeat what the _[Whisperer of Souls](link_item_12722)_ relates to you about the subject. On a critical failure, you and the glaive are drawn into a murmuring void of cold, where your mind is assaulted by strange visions for an entire week. At the end of this time, you reappear and must attempt a DC 50 Will save.\n\n**Success** When you return, you can retrain one of your skills into a Lore skill about evil creatures or places, as if you had spent 1 week retraining.\n\n**Failure** As success, but you are stupefied 2 for 1 week.\n\n**Critical Failure** As success, but you become [unholy](link_trait_1846). If you were [holy](link_trait_1630), you instead lose that trait. You must retrain one of your skills into a Lore about [unholy](link_trait_1846) creatures or places. You become obsessed with increasing your forbidden knowledge, turning to wicked forces that offer such secrets and compromising your morals further if you must.\n\n**Destruction** If the _[Whisperer of Souls](link_item_12722)_ is used to slay Shelyn's herald, it disintegrates, bringing about great evil in its wake.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12722,"bulk":"2","name":"Whisperer of Souls","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2798791244766930","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":28,"price":{},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"UNIQUE","traits":[1568,1852,1475,1598,1573],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"polearm","range":null,"runes":{"potency":4,"property":[{"id":6766,"name":"Brilliant (Greater)","rune":{"id":6766,"bulk":"0","name":"Brilliant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":18,"price":{"gp":24000},"usage":"etched onto a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"fire"},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T04:10:22.707136+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This rune causes a weapon to transform into pure, brilliant energy. The weapon deals an additional 1d4 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage on a successful [Strike](link_action_19856), as well as 1d4 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage to [fiends](link_trait_2415) and 1d4 [vitality](link_trait_1478) damage to [undead](link_trait_2425). On a critical hit, the target must succeed at a DC 41 Fortitude save or be blinded for 1 round. Damage dealt by this weapon ignores the target's resistances to [fire](link_trait_1542), [spirit](link_trait_1556), and [vitality](link_trait_1478).\n\n**Activate—Shine Bright** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432), [light](link_trait_1517))\n\n**Effect** You plunge your weapon into darkness to return the light. Attempt a [counteract](link_action_27519) check with a [counteract](link_action_27519) rank of 9 and +31 [counteract](link_action_27519) modifier to end a [magical](link_trait_1504) [darkness](link_trait_1900) effect whose area is within reach of the weapon.","availability":null,"content_