ect. On a critical failure, you and the glaive are drawn into a murmuring void of cold, where your mind is assaulted by strange visions for an entire week. At the end of this time, you reappear and must attempt a DC 50 Will save.\n\n**Success** When you return, you can retrain one of your skills into a Lore skill about evil creatures or places, as if you had spent 1 week retraining.\n\n**Failure** As success, but you are stupefied 2 for 1 week.\n\n**Critical Failure** As success, but you become [unholy](link_trait_1846). If you were [holy](link_trait_1630), you instead lose that trait. You must retrain one of your skills into a Lore about [unholy](link_trait_1846) creatures or places. You become obsessed with increasing your forbidden knowledge, turning to wicked forces that offer such secrets and compromising your morals further if you must.\n\n**Destruction** If the _[Whisperer of Souls](link_item_12722)_ is used to slay Shelyn's herald, it disintegrates, bringing about great evil in its wake.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12723,"type":"item","before":{"id":12723,"bulk":"1","name":"Whispering Staff","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4385324138382839","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":20,"price":{"gp":70000},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1552,1527,1504,1546],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"club","range":null,"runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"","source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4679","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"105"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"circumstance","value":3,"selector":"skill-check","predicate":[{"or":["action:decipher-writing","action:identify-magic","action:recall-knowledge"]}]},{"key":"ActiveEffectLike","mode":"add","path":"system.abilities.int.mod","value":1},{"key":"Acti