inutes.\n\nIf you've already Activated the tattoo, you can supply a separate casting of _[one with plants](link_spell_4746)_ to recharge the tattoo instead of having the spell's normal effect. This allows you to Activate the tattoo again in the same day. You can do so multiple times each day, but only as many times as you continue to cast _[one with plants](link_spell_4746)_ to recharge the tattoo after each use.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12727,"type":"item","before":{"id":12727,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wind At Your Back","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3324865530167598","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4735","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"117"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:09.932611+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This object can only be described as a gray, solidified, miniature cloud that feels spongy to the touch. The cloud is incredibly soft and can be easily lifted with little effort, though its ephemeral nature requires using two hands to ensure it doesn't slip from your grasp.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You blow across the surface of the cloud, and it floats free of you and calls up a strong breeze. For the next 8 hours, it floats behind you and your companions, increasing the amount of time the group can [Hustle](link_action_21201) during exploration to the lowest Constitution modifier in the group × 20 instead of × 10. You must all remain within 100 feet to get the benefit. If you activate the item aboard a vehicle, you instead grant the vehicle a +10-foot circumstance bonus to its Speeds for 8 hours. If the vehicle is powered by wind, such as a sailing ship, the bonus increases to +20 feet. When the 8 hours are up, the cloud stops blowing and floats back into your hands.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12727,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wind At Your Back","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3324865530167598","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4735","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"117"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:09.932611+00:00","operations":null,"description":"This object can only be described as a gray, solidified, miniature cloud that feels spongy to the touch. The cloud is incredibly soft and can be easily lifted with little effort, though its ephemeral nature requires using two hands to ensure it doesn't slip from your grasp.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n**Frequency** once per day\n\n**Effect** You blow across the surface of the cloud, and it floats free of you and calls up a strong breeze. For the next 8 hours, it floats behind you and your companions, increasing the amount of time the group can [Hustle](link_action_21201) during exploration to the lowest Constitution modifier in the group × 20 instead of × 10. You must all remain within 100 feet to get the benefit. If you activate the item aboard a vehicle, you instead grant the vehicle a +10-foot circumstance bonus to its Speeds for 8 hours. If the vehicle is powered by wind, such as a sailing ship, the bonus increases to +20 feet. When the 8 hours are up, the cloud stops blowing and floats back into your hands.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12728,"type":"item","before":{"id":12728,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wind Ocarina","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8632299623669511","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1492,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4664","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"99"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:10.545976+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA blue finish decorates the ceramic body of a [wind ocarina](link_item_12728). When you play a note on this ocarina, for 1 minute, winds sweep into strong gusts in a 5-foot emanation around you. The winds have the following effects.\n\n*   Ammunition from physical ranged attacks—such as arrows, bolts, sling bullets, and other objects of comparable size—can't pass through the area. Passing through the area causes attacks with bigger ranged weapons, such as thrown weapons, to take a –2 circumstance penalty to their attack rolls if their paths pass through the emanation. Massive ranged weapons and spell effects that don't create physical objects can pass through the emanation with no penalty.\n*   The area is difficult terrain to creatures attempting to move through it.\n*   Gases, including creatures in gaseous form, can't pass through the emanation. When the emanation arises, such gases are removed from the area, including your space.\n*   The area, including your space, has breathable air.\n\nOnce the magic is used, the ocarina remains a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso musical instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12728,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wind Ocarina","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8632299623669511","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1492,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4664","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"99"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:10.545976+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nA blue finish decorates the ceramic body of a [wind ocarina](link_item_12728). When you play a note on this ocarina, for 1 minute, winds sweep into strong gusts in a 5-foot emanation around you. The winds have the following effects.\n\n*   Ammunition from physical ranged attacks—such as arrows, bolts, sling bullets, and other objects of comparable size—can't pass through the area. Passing through the area causes attacks with bigger ranged weapons, such as thrown weapons, to take a –2 circumstance penalty to their attack rolls if their paths pass through the emanation. Massive ranged weapons and spell effects that don't create physical objects can pass through the emanation with no penalty.\n*   The area is difficult terrain to creatures attempting to move through it.\n*   Gases, including creatures in gaseous form, can't pass through the emanation. When the emanation arises, such gases are removed from the area, including your space.\n*   The area, including your space, has breathable air.\n\nOnce the magic is used, the ocarina remains a non-[magical](link_trait_1504) [virtuoso musical instrument](link_item_7604).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12729,"type":"item","before":{"id":12729,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Windlass Bola","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"987866448763363","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1571,1575],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"sling","range":20,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"bola","broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1873","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"34"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:12.461308+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Clockwork mechanisms tick away inside the weights of these _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [returning](link_item_7708) bolas_, spooling out more cord in midair.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The cord of the bola snakes out as you throw it, allowing the weapon to wrap around a group of enemies. You use the bolas to attempt a ranged [Trip](link_action_19865) against all creatures in a 5-foot radius burst within the weapon's first range increment. Roll a separate Athletics check for each target. Each attempt counts toward your multiple attack penalty, but don't increase your penalty until you have made all the attempts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12729,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Windlass Bola","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"987866448763363","group":"WEAPON","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":200},"usage":"held-in-one-hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[2877,1571,1575],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"sling","range":20,"runes":{"potency":1,"property":[{"id":7708,"name":"Returning"}],"striking":1},"damage":{"die":"d6","dice":1,"damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":0,"reload":"-","foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"martial","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":"bola","broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1873","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"34"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:12.461308+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Clockwork mechanisms tick away inside the weights of these _[+1](link_item_7950) [striking](link_item_7862) [returning](link_item_7708) bolas_, spooling out more cord in midair.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** The cord of the bola snakes out as you throw it, allowing the weapon to wrap around a group of enemies. You use the bolas to attempt a ranged [Trip](link_action_19865) against all creatures in a 5-foot radius burst within the weapon's first range increment. Roll a separate Athletics check for each target. Each attempt counts toward your multiple attack penalty, but don't increase your penalty until you have made all the attempts.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12730,"type":"item","before":{"id":12730,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Witch's Finger","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2705990271293816","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":11},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4468","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:14:12.088Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:13.370317+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nShaped like a pointed, gnarled finger on a stick, [witch's finger](link_item_12730) is a frozen treat imbued with berries that lend it a blood-red hue. A popular tale claims Irriseni winter witches created this dessert, but the story is apocryphal; an enterprising ice cream shop owner in New Stetven invented the treat and, as a marketing ploy, the myth surrounding it. Taking a bite makes you feel warm. For 1 hour, you have [cold](link_trait_1519) resistance 3, and for 8 hours, the treat negates the damage you would take from severe environmental [cold](link_trait_1519) and reduces the damage you take from extreme [cold](link_trait_1519) to that of severe [cold](link_trait_1519).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12730,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Witch's Finger","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2705990271293816","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":3,"price":{"gp":11},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4468","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"51"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","cleaning":{"updatedAt":"2026-04-12T05:14:12.088Z"},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:13.370317+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nShaped like a pointed, gnarled finger on a stick, [witch's finger](link_item_12730) is a frozen treat imbued with berries that lend it a blood-red hue. A popular tale claims Irriseni winter witches created this dessert, but the story is apocryphal; an enterprising ice cream shop owner in New Stetven invented the treat and, as a marketing ploy, the myth surrounding it. Taking a bite makes you feel warm. For 1 hour, you have [cold](link_trait_1519) resistance 3, and for 8 hours, the treat negates the damage you would take from severe environmental [cold](link_trait_1519) and reduces the damage you take from extreme [cold](link_trait_1519) to that of severe [cold](link_trait_1519).","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12731,"type":"item","before":{"id":12731,"bulk":"2","name":"Wolfjaw Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1093619981400884","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":355},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1454,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4389","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"19"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7038,"bulk":"2","name":"Hide Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":7294922365634688,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:14:52.017148+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A mix of furs, sturdy hide, and sometimes molded boiled leather, this armor provides protection due to its layers of leather, though its bulkiness slows the wearer down and decreases mobility.","availability":null,"content_source_id":1,"craft_requirements":null}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:14.519612+00:00","operations":null,"description":"Barbarians, druids and other outlanders are often forced to spend the harsh winter months protecting their communities from one of the deadliest predators to stalk the forests and taiga of the northern reaches, the fearsome witchwargs. This [_+1_](link_item_6719) [_hide armor_](link_item_7038) is assembled from the hide and fur of a trio of witchwargs, and it conveys on the wearer both an attack akin to the witchwargs’ deadly jaws and the ability to channel the frigid cold of the witchwargs’ Winter Breath.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([cold](link_trait_1519), [manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You breathe a cloud of frost in a 15-foot cone that deals 5d8 [cold](link_trait_1519) damage (DC 23 basic Reflex save).\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433)) **Frequency** once per hour; **Effect** You gain a jaws [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack that you make using your hands. This attack deals 1d8 piercing damage plus 1 [cold](link_trait_1519) damage, is in the brawling group, and has the [trip](link_trait_1537) and [unarmed](link_trait_2398) traits.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"The initial raw materials must include the hides of at least three witchwargs."},"after":{"id":12731,"bulk":"2","name":"Wolfjaw Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1093619981400884","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":7,"price":{"gp":355},"usage":"worn armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1454,1527],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":1,"property":[],"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4389","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"19"},"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"hide-armor","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0,"base_item_content":{"id":7038,"bulk":"2","name":"Hide Armor","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":7294922365634688,"group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"leather","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-02-06T05:14:52.017148+00