:[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=76","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"wooden-breastplate","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:15.168024+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A suit of carved and tempered wood, a [wooden breastplate](link_item_12732) resembles a metal breastplate in shape and function. Such suits can be carved from large pieces of wood, but they most often come from wood coaxed magically from special trees, whether by druids, elves, fey, or plant creatures such as arboreals or leshys.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12732,"bulk":"2","name":"Wooden Breastplate","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6932044382521709","group":"ARMOR","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"gp":6},"usage":null,"rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"wood","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"resilient":0},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Armor.aspx?ID=76","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"11"},"dex_cap":2,"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"ac_bonus":3,"category":"medium","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"strength":2,"base_item":"wooden-breastplate","check_penalty":-2,"speed_penalty":-5,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:15.168024+00:00","operations":null,"description":"A suit of carved and tempered wood, a [wooden breastplate](link_item_12732) resembles a metal breastplate in shape and function. Such suits can be carved from large pieces of wood, but they most often come from wood coaxed magically from special trees, whether by druids, elves, fey, or plant creatures such as arboreals or leshys.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12733,"type":"item","before":{"id":12733,"bulk":"0","name":"Wooden Nickel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8752519445657707","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1447,1504,1544,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4648","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"95"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:15.926394+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** You are a master in Deception.\n\nThis rough wooden coin hangs from a string drilled through a hole at its center. When you Activate the [wooden nickel](link_item_12733), for 10 minutes, you can cause any object you touch of 2 Bulk or less to look, feel, and smell like valuables of a similar size crafted from a precious metal of your choice.\n\nA creature that touches or [Interacts](link_action_19733) with an affected object can attempt a Perception check against your Deception DC to disbelieve the illusion, and a successful check against your Deception DC with Crafting or an appropriate Lore skill will also reveal the item's true nature. After 10 minutes have elapsed since you Activated the [wooden nickel](link_item_12733), all affected objects revert to their true form.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12733,"bulk":"0","name":"Wooden Nickel","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8752519445657707","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":130},"usage":"affixed-to-armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1531,1447,1504,1544,1479],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4648","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"95"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:15.926394+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Requirements** You are a master in Deception.\n\nThis rough wooden coin hangs from a string drilled through a hole at its center. When you Activate the [wooden nickel](link_item_12733), for 10 minutes, you can cause any object you touch of 2 Bulk or less to look, feel, and smell like valuables of a similar size crafted from a precious metal of your choice.\n\nA creature that touches or [Interacts](link_action_19733) with an affected object can attempt a Perception check against your Deception DC to disbelieve the illusion, and a successful check against your Deception DC with Crafting or an appropriate Lore skill will also reveal the item's true nature. After 10 minutes have elapsed since you Activated the [wooden nickel](link_item_12733), all affected objects revert to their true form.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12734,"type":"item","before":{"id":12734,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Worm Vial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1077599530702652","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4488","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:16.492769+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nOpening this vial unleashes its destructive contents: a reconstituted Gargantuan cave worm. The worm has two functions; choose which one to use when you Activate the item.\n\n**Burrow** The worm [Burrows](link_action_19609) up to 80 feet, leaving a tunnel behind it. It can burrow through solid stone, but if it does so it [burrows](link_action_19609) 40 feet instead of 80 feet.\n\n**Eat** The worm attempts to swallow a creature, crush it in its insides, then spit the creature out. The target must be within 15 feet, and it attempts a DC 30 Reflex save. If it fails, it takes 3d6+9 bludgeoning damage (doubled on a critical failure). The worm then spits the creature out to any empty space on the ground within 30 feet, causing the creature to take damage from a 20-foot fall.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a cave worm."},"after":{"id":12734,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Worm Vial","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1077599530702652","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":600},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1668],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":{},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4488","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"57"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:16.492769+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nOpening this vial unleashes its destructive contents: a reconstituted Gargantuan cave worm. The worm has two functions; choose which one to use when you Activate the item.\n\n**Burrow** The worm [Burrows](link_action_19609) up to 80 feet, leaving a tunnel behind it. It can burrow through solid stone, but if it does so it [burrows](link_action_19609) 40 feet instead of 80 feet.\n\n**Eat** The worm attempts to swallow a creature, crush it in its insides, then spit the creature out. The target must be within 15 feet, and it attempts a DC 30 Reflex save. If it fails, it takes 3d6+9 bludgeoning damage (doubled on a critical failure). The worm then spits the creature out to any empty space on the ground within 30 feet, causing the creature to take damage from a 20-foot fall.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Supply the corpse of a cave worm."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12735,"type":"item","before":{"id":12735,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wounding Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4284074761839115","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":45},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4611","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:17.09804+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSmearing _[wounding oil](link_item_12735)_, a crimson fluid, on a weapon causes it to smell strongly of blood and gives it the benefits of the [Wounding](link_item_7962) rune for 1 minute.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12735,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wounding Oil","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4284074761839115","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"gp":45},"usage":"held-in-two-hands","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1543],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"runes":{},"damage":null,"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4611","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"87"},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:17.09804+00:00","operations":null,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\nSmearing _[wounding oil](link_item_12735)_, a crimson fluid, on a weapon causes it to smell strongly of blood and gives it the benefits of the [Wounding](link_item_7962) rune for 1 minute.\n\n","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12736,"type":"item","before":{"id":12736,"bulk":"2","name":"Wrecker","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2081310751633550","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[3369,1467,2862,1573],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=348","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"31"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:18.631902+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8a88bd4e-3221-4dfe-bcb3-6809f2436911","data":{"itemId":16605},"type":"giveItem"}],"description":"The [wrecker](link_item_12736) combines a [dwarven dorn-dergar](link_item_11952) with a heavy, gear-reinforced arm cover that allows it to be fired like an oversized [sling](link_item_7786), then retrieved and reloaded by manually activating a [clockwork](link_trait_2877) spool. A [wrecker](link_item_12736) must be loaded to be switched from its ranged configuration to its melee configuration.\n\n* * *\n\n_Combination Weapon:_ **_Melee_**_,_ [_Ranged_](link_item_16605)\n\n* * *\n\n### Ranged\n\n[Dwarf](link_trait_1467), [Ranged Trip](link_trait_1574), [Razing](link_trait_2862)  \n**Damage** 1d6 B  \n**Range** 20 ft.  \n**Reload** 1  \n**Group** Sling","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12736,"bulk":"2","name":"Wrecker","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2081310751633550","group":"WEAPON","hands":"2","level":0,"price":{"gp":8},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[3369,1467,2862,1573],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":20,"bulk":{},"group":"flail","range":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d8","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":20,"reload":"","charges":{},"foundry":{"bonus":0,"items":[],"rules":[],"bonus_damage":0,"container_id":null,"splash_damage":0},"category":"advanced","hardness":5,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=348","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"31"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:18.631902+00:00","operations":[{"id":"8a88bd4e-3221-4dfe-bcb3-6809f2436911","data":{"itemId":16605},"type":"giveItem"}],"description":"The [wrecker](link_item_12736) combines a [dwarven dorn-dergar](link_item_11952) with a heavy, gear-reinforced arm cover that allows it to be fired like an oversized [sling](link_item_7786), then retrieved and reloaded by manually activating a [clockwork](link_trait_2877) spool. A [wrecker](link_item_12736) must be loaded to be switched from its ranged configuration to its melee configuration.\n\n* * *\n\n_Combination Weapon:_ **_Melee_**_,_ [_Ranged_](link_item_16605)\n\n* * *\n\n### Ranged\n\n[Dwarf](link_trait_1467), [Ranged Trip](link_trait_1574), [Razing](link_trait_2862)  \n**Damage** 1d6 B  \n**Range** 20 ft.  \n**Reload** 1  \n**Group** Sling","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12737,"type":"item","before":{"id":12737,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wrestler's Armbands","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3237277194075499","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":645},"usage":"worn armbands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4933","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"athletics"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:19.50289+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ef0ecd09-c6d9-4b22-8899-cacde7a7bc27","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"dca05ce9-e096-4b69-8f99-ca1c6fa73688","data":{"id":19612,"text":"**Wrestler's Armbands** Whenever you use an action to [Climb](link_action_19612) and you succeed at the Athletics check, add a +5-foot item bonus to the distance you move.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"4df4eb22-bf58-444a-b043-4937f9f51b1f","data":{"id":19859,"text":"**Wrestler's Armbands** Whenever you use an action to [Swim](link_action_19859) and you succeed at the Athletics check, add a +5-foot item bonus to the distance you move.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Perception** +17; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and one other common or regional language)\n\n**Skills** Intimidation +19, Sports Lore +17\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +4, **Cha** +4\n\n**Will** +17\n\n* * *\n\n[Wrestler's armbands](link_item_12737) are a set of [armbands of athleticism](link_item_6718) that have gained their own boisterous sapience. Often, such items aren't created intentionally but rather are the result of a truly charismatic champion whose heart and body are unusually strong wearing the [armbands of athleticism](link_item_6718) on many adventures as their most important item. Eventually, the essence of their earnest and adventurous spirit has so thoroughly inundated the item it gains a matching spirit and will of its own. Such armbands view themselves as a tough, but fair, trainer for whomever inherits them next, inspiring you to new heights of athleticism. They also spoil for contests, telepathically calling out competitors on your behalf; typically the armbands won't challenge a foe you're unprepared to face, but particularly eager [wrestler's armbands](link_item_12737) might have an unfortunate habit of overestimating your abilities and pushing you into a conflict that's beyond your proven capacity. These armbands have the following Activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** You succeed or critically succeed at an Athletics check; **Effect** The armbands taunt a creature you're competing with, boasting of your prowess and attempting an Intimidation check to [Demoralize](link_action_19624) that creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12737,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Wrestler's Armbands","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"3237277194075499","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":9,"price":{"gp":645},"usage":"worn armbands","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1613,1527,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4933","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"197"},"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[{"key":"FlatModifier","type":"item","value":2,"selector":"athletics"}],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:19.50289+00:00","operations":[{"id":"ef0ecd09-c6d9-4b22-8899-cacde7a7bc27","data":{"text":"","type":"item","value":"2","variable":"SKILL_ATHLETICS"},"type":"addBonusToValue"},{"id":"dca05ce9-e096-4b69-8f99-ca1c6fa73688","data":{"id":19612,"text":"**Wrestler's Armbands** Whenever you use an action to [Climb](link_action_19612) and you succeed at the Athletics check, add a +5-foot item bonus to the distance you move.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"4df4eb22-bf58-444a-b043-4937f9f51b1f","data":{"id":19859,"text":"**Wrestler's Armbands** Whenever you use an action to [Swim](link_action_19859) and you succeed at the Athletics check, add a +5-foot item bonus to the distance you move.","type":"action"},"type":"injectText"}],"description":"**Perception** +17; precise [vision](link_sense_20776) 30 feet, imprecise [hearing](link_sense_21081) 30 feet\n\n**Communication** speech ([Common](link_language_81) and one other common or regional language)\n\n**Skills** Intimidation +19, Sports Lore +17\n\n**Int** +2, **Wis** +4, **Cha** +4\n\n**Will** +17\n\n* * *\n\n[Wrestler's armbands](link_item_12737) are a set of [armbands of athleticism](link_item_6718) that have gained their own boisterous sapience. Often, such items aren't created intentionally but rather are the result of a truly charismatic champion whose heart and body are unusually strong wearing the [armbands of athleticism](link_item_6718) on many adventures as their most important item. Eventually, the essence of their earnest and adventurous spirit has so thoroughly inundated the item it gains a matching spirit and will of its own. Such armbands view themselves as a tough, but fair, trainer for whomever inherits them next, inspiring you to new heights of athleticism. They also spoil for contests, telepathically calling out competitors on your behalf; typically the armbands won't challenge a foe you're unprepared to face, but particularly eager [wrestler's armbands](link_item_12737) might have an unfortunate habit of overestimating your abilities and pushing you into a conflict that's beyond your proven capacity. These armbands have the following Activation.\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"REACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">5</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)); **Frequency** once per minute; **Trigger** You succeed or critically succeed at an Athletics check; **Effect** The armbands taunt a creature you're competing with, boasting of your prowess and attempting an Intimidation check to [Demoralize](link_action_19624) that creature.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":12738,"type":"item","before":{"id":12738,"bulk":"0","name":"Wyrm Spindle (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2468991985822383","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"foundry":{"items":[],"rules":[],"container_id":null},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{"type":null,"grade":null},"quantity":1,"base_item":null,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2243","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"129"}},"created_at":"2024-04-19T04:26:20.444466+00:00","operations":null,"description":"The broken tips of four dragon claws—one of each magical tradition—are set into a silver fitting. They protrude in the shape of a star or compass.\n\n*   **Armor** After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the spindle, you gain resistance 10 to [fire](link_trait_1542), [force](link_trait_1560), [mental](link_trait_1448), and [spirit](link_trait_1556) for 1 minute.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you cast a non-[cantrip](link_trait_1858) spell by activating the spindle, you gain a Dragon Breath activity that takes 2 actions and deals 9d6 damage to all creatures in a 30-foot cone with a DC 34 basic Reflex save. Choose the type of damage when you use Dragon Breath: [fire](link_trait_1542), [force](link_trait_1560), [mental](link_trait_1448), or [spirit](link_trait_1556). You can use this activity once before the end of your next turn.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[gouging claw](link_spell_4645)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 7th-rank *[summon dragon](link_spell_4869)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":null},"after":{"id":12738,"bulk":"0","name":"Wyrm Spindle (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2468991985822383","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":15,"price":{"gp":6500},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"hp":0,"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"charges":{},"