 (Dose or Round)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4827135999197842","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"cp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-05-01T20:02:24.842401+00:00","operations":[],"description":"The smallest unit of black powder that still has a simple use, a dose can be a simple package paper parcel around black powder or it can be packaged with a metal bullet or pellet to be used as ammunition. When ignited with a fuse or exposed to direct flame, a dose of black powder explodes. This isn't powerful enough to deal damage but makes a loud sound and could trigger further explosions. A fuse for a dose can be created with a few twists of paper and causes the dose to explode the round after it's lit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":13495,"bulk":null,"name":"Black Powder (Dose or Round)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4827135999197842","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{"cp":1},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-05-01T20:02:24.842401+00:00","operations":[],"description":"The smallest unit of black powder that still has a simple use, a dose can be a simple package paper parcel around black powder or it can be packaged with a metal bullet or pellet to be used as ammunition. When ignited with a fuse or exposed to direct flame, a dose of black powder explodes. This isn't powerful enough to deal damage but makes a loud sound and could trigger further explosions. A fuse for a dose can be created with a few twists of paper and causes the dose to explode the round after it's lit.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":13513,"type":"item","before":{"id":13513,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pantograph Gauntlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4011478523216109","group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1833,3630,1573,1595],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"hp_max":20,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Weapons.aspx?ID=547","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"63"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"martial","hardness":5,"material":{},"quantity":1,"base_item":"pantograph-gauntlet","image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":null,"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":10,"base_item_content":{"id":13513,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pantograph Gauntlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":4011478523216109,"group":"WEAPON","hands":"1","level":0,"price":{"gp":2},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1833,1573,1595,3630],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"brawling","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"d4","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":"bludgeoning"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"martial","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"grade":"COMMERCIAL","slots":[]},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-05-02T08:23:14.908109+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A pantograph gauntlet is a heavy, fist-like weight, mounted on an extendable frame and attached to your outer arm with a series of leather straps. The frame's set of mechanical linkages connected at various hinges allow movements to propagate across the frame based on reshaping parallelograms, further controlled by a crossbar grasped in your hand. A pantograph gauntlet is driven by your own motion and mirrors your arm's movements—a punch thrown with your fist moves the pantograph, extending the weight out at a rapid speed to land blows up to 10 feet away. In some regions, such as Alkenstar and Ustalav, pantograph gauntlets are occasionally constructed entirely of metal and fashioned in the likeness of oversized arms, incorporating a complex system of gears or a miniature steam engine in place of the simpler pantograph mechanism.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""}},"created_at":"2024-05-02T08:23:14.908109+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A pantograph gauntlet is a heavy, fist-like weight, mounted on an extendable frame and attached to your outer arm with a series of leather straps. The frame's set of mechanical linkages connected at various hinges allow movements to propagate across the frame based on reshaping parallelograms, further controlled by a crossbar grasped in your hand. A pantograph gauntlet is driven by your own motion and mirrors your arm's movements—a punch thrown with your fist moves the pantograph, extending the weight out at a rapid speed to land blows up to 10 feet away. In some regions, such as Alkenstar and Ustalav, pantograph gauntlets are occasionally constructed entirely of metal and fashioned in the likeness of oversized arms, incorporating a complex system of gears or a miniature steam engine in place of the simpler pantograph mechanism.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":13513,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Pantograph Gauntlet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4011478523216109","group":"WEAPON","