play_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":14240,"type":"item","before":{"id":14240,"bulk":null,"name":"Black Powder (Horn)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2539347268403403","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T22:22:42.894062+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** round\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nBlack powder is a volatile and explosive [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance commonly used in the production of firearm munitions. Black powder becomes inert and useless when wet and must be kept in a sealed, [water](link_trait_1584)\\-tight container.\n\nA horn contains 500 [doses](link_item_13495) worth of black powder. A horn can be detonated by leaving a small trail of black powder and then lighting it. Each 5-foot square requires one [dose](link_item_13495) of black powder to create a trail through. As long as the horn is mostly full (at least 400 [doses](link_item_13495) remaining) it can be detonated to deal 1d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage in a 5-foot burst (DC 16 basic Reflex save). It takes 1 round per 15 feet of powder trail laid down for a horn to detonate after the trail is lit. If multiple horns detonate simultaneously, it can increase the area of the explosion, but the damage in overlapping areas doesn't increase.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":14240,"bulk":null,"name":"Black Powder (Horn)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2539347268403403","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":2,"price":{"gp":5},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T22:22:42.894062+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** round\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nBlack powder is a volatile and explosive [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance commonly used in the production of firearm munitions. Black powder becomes inert and useless when wet and must be kept in a sealed, [water](link_trait_1584)\\-tight container.\n\nA horn contains 500 [doses](link_item_13495) worth of black powder. A horn can be detonated by leaving a small trail of black powder and then lighting it. Each 5-foot square requires one [dose](link_item_13495) of black powder to create a trail through. As long as the horn is mostly full (at least 400 [doses](link_item_13495) remaining) it can be detonated to deal 1d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage in a 5-foot burst (DC 16 basic Reflex save). It takes 1 round per 15 feet of powder trail laid down for a horn to detonate after the trail is lit. If multiple horns detonate simultaneously, it can increase the area of the explosion, but the damage in overlapping areas doesn't increase.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":14241,"type":"item","before":{"id":14241,"bulk":null,"name":"Black Powder (Keg)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7641218718284656","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-06-05T22:24:12.232921+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Ammunition** round\n\n**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nBlack powder is a volatile and explosive [alchemical](link_trait_1529) substance commonly used in the production of firearm munitions. Black powder becomes inert and useless when wet and must be kept in a sealed, [water](link_trait_1584)\\-tight container.\n\nA keg contains 5,000 [doses](link_item_13495) of black powder and can be detonated in the same way as a [horn](link_item_14240). As long as the keg is mostly full (at least 4,000 [doses](link_item_13495) remaining) this deals 3d6 [fire](link_trait_1542) damage in a 20-foot burst (DC 20 basic Reflex save). Detonating multiple kegs can increase the area, but not the damage, of this effect; detonating a keg and any [horns](link_item_14240) at the same time in an overlapping area also doesn't increase the damage.","availability":null,"content_source_id":17,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":14241,"bulk":null,"name":"Black Powder (Keg)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7641218718284656","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":50},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1529,1531],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4294","book":"Guns & Gears","page":"169"},"ch