nselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-07T17:06:43.832537+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This rust red metal is liquid at room temperature, making it challenging for all but the most skilled metallurgists to craft with and earning it the name \"quickiron\" in some places. Djezet is also extremely reactive to [magic](link_trait_1504), even in its solid, workable alloyed form. It glows when targeted by [magic](link_trait_1504), and objects crafted with djezet alloys glow with scarlet striations, which lead some smiths to nickname it \"tiger iron.\" When targeted by spells, objects crafted from djezet alloys exhibit these glowing red markings that last for 1 round or the duration of the spell, whichever is longer. A [djezet mass](link_item_14460) contains enough djezet to refine into up to two [djezet doses](link_item_14459).\n\n#### Djezet Alloy\n\n| Djezet Alloy Items | Hardness | HP | BT |\n\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n| Thin Items: Standard-grade | 5 | 20 | 10 |\n\n| Thin Items: High-grade | 8 | 32 | 16 |\n\n| Items: Standard-grade | 9 | 36 | 18 |\n\n| Items: High-grade | 12 | 48 | 24 |\n\n| Structures: Standard-grade | 18 | 72 | 136 |\n\n| Structures: High-grade | 24 | 96 | 48 |","availability":null,"content_source_id":23,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15058,"bulk":null,"name":"Djezet","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"5445260964004989","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1533],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1410","book":"Grand Bazaar","page":"97"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-07T17:06:43.832537+00:00","operations":[],"description":"This rust red metal is liquid at room temperature, making i