um's time-bending properties protect it, granting it greater Hardness and Hit Points. If an orichalcum item takes damage but isn't destroyed, it repairs itself completely 24 hours later.\n\n#### **Orichalcum Items**\n\n| Orichalcum Items | Hardness | HP | BT |\n\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n| Thin Items: High-grade | 16 | 64 | 32 |\n\n| Items: High-grade | 18 | 72 | 36 |\n\n| Structures: High-grade | 35 | 140 | 70 |","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15145,"bulk":null,"name":"Orichalcum","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6155554787340774","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":17,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"RARE","traits":[1533],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2919","book":"GM Core","page":"254"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-11T17:13:56.727017+00:00","operations":[],"description":"The most rare and valuable skymetal, orichalcum is coveted for its incredible time-related [magical](link_trait_1504) properties. This dull, coppery metal isn't as physically sturdy as [adamantine](link_item_15064), but orichalcum's time-bending properties protect it, granting it greater Hardness and Hit Points. If an orichalcum item takes damage but isn't destroyed, it repairs itself completely 24 hours later.\n\n#### **Orichalcum Items**\n\n| Orichalcum Items | Hardness | HP | BT |\n\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n| Thin Items: High-grade | 16 | 64 | 32 |\n\n| Items: High-grade | 18 | 72 | 36 |\n\n| Structures: High-grade | 35 | 140 | 70 |","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15200,"type":"item","before":{"id":15200,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Vaccine (Minor)","size":"MEDIUM","uu