},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:11:13.817301+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nA [vaccine](link_item_15204) grants a creature immunity to a specific strain of [disease](link_trait_1857) of a level equal to or less than the [vaccine](link_item_15204)'s level, and a +2 item bonus on all saving throws against other strains of the same [disease](link_trait_1857). For example, a [vaccine](link_item_15204) could grant immunity to putrid plague inflicted by harpies but would only grant a +2 bonus against putrid plague inflicted by a giant rat. The duration is permanent.\n\n* * *\n\n**Special** A [vaccine](link_item_15204) is the same rarity as the [disease](link_trait_1857) it's designed to prevent, or as the creature who inflicts the [disease](link_trait_1857) if the [disease](link_trait_1857) itself doesn't list a rarity","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":"Creating a vaccine requires a sample of the disease in question."},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15205,"type":"item","before":{"id":15205,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1887860097901746","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"cp":"","gp":3,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:13:53.931383+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the antiplague and antivenom elixirs, an affliction suppressant is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an affliction suppressant, you gain a +1 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an antiplague, this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a disease, curse, or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":11,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15205,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Lesser)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1887860097901746","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"cp":"","gp":3,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:13:53.931383+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the antiplague and antivenom elixirs, an affliction suppressant is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an affliction suppressant, you gain a +1 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an antiplague, this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a disease, curse, or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":11,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15206,"type":"item","before":{"id":15206,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4573283894144287","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":35,"pp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"}},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:15:08.645544+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15206) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15206), you gain a +2 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15206,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Moderate)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4573283894144287","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":6,"price":{"gp":35,"pp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"}},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:15:08.645544+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15206) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15206), you gain a +2 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15207,"type":"item","before":{"id":15207,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6741118601366373","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":675},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:18:18.369578+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207), you gain a +4 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.\n\nWhen you drink the [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207), you can attempt a save against one affliction of 14th level or lower affecting you. If you succeed, the affliction is suppressed for 10 minutes. The affliction’s duration doesn’t elapse during this time, but its symptoms are suppressed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15207,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Major)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6741118601366373","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":675},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-14T18:18:18.369578+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207), you gain a +4 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.\n\nWhen you drink the [affliction suppressant](link_item_15207), you can attempt a save against one affliction of 14th level or lower affecting you. If you succeed, the affliction is suppressed for 10 minutes. The affliction’s duration doesn’t elapse during this time, but its symptoms are suppressed.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15369,"type":"item","before":{"id":15369,"bulk":null,"name":"Dawnsilver","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"370856026120024","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1533],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2917","book":"GM Core","page":"253"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-23T17:44:11.36139+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Dawnsilver is renowned for its lightness, durability, and effectiveness against a range of creatures including [devils](link_trait_2436) and [werecreatures](link_trait_2471). It has the same sheen as [silver](link_item_15062) but a slightly lighter hue. Dawnsilver weapons and armor are treated as if they were [silver](link_item_15062) for the purpose of damaging creatures with weakness to [silver](link_item_15062). A metal item made of dawnsilver is lighter than one made of iron or steel: the item's Bulk is reduced by 1 (reduced to light Bulk if its normal Bulk is 1, with no effect on an item that normally has light Bulk). The Price of an item made of this material is based on the item's normal Bulk, not its reduced Bulk for being made of dawnsilver, but reduce the Bulk before making any further Bulk adjustments for the size of the item.\n\n#### **Dawnsilver**\n\n| Dawnsilver Items | Hardness | HP | BT |\n\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n| Thin Items: Standard-grade | 5 | 20 | 10 |\n\n| Thin Items: High-grade | 8 | 32 | 16 |\n\n| Items: Standard-grade | 9 | 36 | 18 |\n\n| Items: High-grade | 12 | 48 | 24 |\n\n| Structures: Standard-grade | 18 | 72 | 36 |\n\n| Structures: High-grade | 24 | 96 | 48 |","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15369,"bulk":null,"name":"Dawnsilver","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"370856026120024","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":8,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1533],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2917","book":"GM Core","page":"253"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-23T17:44:11.36139+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Dawnsilver is renowned for its lightness, durability, and effectiveness against a range of creatures including [devils](link_trait_2436) and [werecreatures](link_trait_2471). It has the same sheen as [silver](link_item_15062) but a slightly lighter hue. Dawnsilver weapons and armor are treated as if they were [silver](link_item_15062) for the purpose of damaging creatures with weakness to [silver](link_item_15062). A metal item made of dawnsilver is lighter than one made of iron or steel: the item's Bulk is reduced by 1 (reduced to light Bulk if its normal Bulk is 1, with no effect on an item that normally has light Bulk). The Price of an item made of this material is based on the item's normal Bulk, not its reduced Bulk for being made of dawnsilver, but reduce the Bulk before making any further Bulk adjustments for the size of the item.\n\n#### **Dawnsilver**\n\n| Dawnsilver Items | Hardness | HP | BT |\n\n|---|---|---|---|\n\n| Thin Items: Standard-grade | 5 | 20 | 10 |\n\n| Thin Items: High-grade | 8 | 32 | 16 |\n\n| Items: Standard-grade | 9 | 36 | 18 |\n\n| Items: High-grade | 12 | 48 | 24 |\n\n| Structures: Standard-grade | 18 | 72 | 36 |\n\n| Structures: High-grade | 24 | 96 | 48 |","availability":null,"content_source_id":7,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15373,"type":"item","before":{"id":15373,"bulk":null,"name":"Grinning Pugwampi","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4995536056644955","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"affixed to a weapon","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,1677,1544],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4640","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"94"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":false},"created_at":"2024-07-23T21:37:01.114129+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"FREE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">4</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) **Trigger** You damage an off-guard creature with the affixed weapon.\n\n* * *\n\nThis bone statuette of a sneering [gremlin](link_trait_2452) crumbles to dust when activated, imparting a fraction of its subject's infamous misfortune on those you strike. The damaged creature must attempt a DC 33 Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature must roll twice and take the worse result on the next check it attempts.\n\n**Failure** The creature must roll twice and take the worse result on all checks until the end of its next turn.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15373,"bulk":null,"name":"Grinning Pugwampi","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"4995536056644955","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":14,"price":{"gp":700},"usage":"affixed to a weapon","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1531,1504,167