ng Throw** DC 43 Fortitude; **Onset** 1 hour; **Maximum Duration** 5 days; **Stage 1** frightened 2 once every 1d4 hours, plus fatigued (1 day); **Stage 2** confused for 1 minute once every 1d4 hours, plus frightened 3 and fatigued (1 day); **Stage 3** frightened 3, plus confused for 1d4 minutes, once every hour, plus fatigued (1 day); **Stage 4** death","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15403,"type":"item","before":{"id":15403,"bulk":"0","name":"Bone","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8695170327093041","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2358","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-24T18:17:38.513854+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A durable material when properly treated, [bone](link_item_15403) can replace wood and metal when creating armor, shields, and weapons. The statistics for [bone](link_item_15403) are applicable to a variety of other sturdy [animal](link_trait_2409)-based products, such as chitin, horn, ivory, coral, and shell, which can also be classified as [bone](link_item_15403) for the purposes of determining item statistics. [Bone](link_item_15403) elements from certain [beasts](link_trait_2422), like the horn of a [unicorn](link_creature_10352) or the spikes of a manticore, may even yield [magical](link_trait_1504) properties when worked by a skilled crafter.\n\n| [Bone](link_item_15403) Objects | Hardness | HP | BT |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Thin Items | 4 | 16 | 8 |\n| Items | 6 | 24 | 12 |\n| Structures | 12 | 48 | 24 |\n\n#### Bone Specimen\n\n**Price** 1 sp; **Bulk** 1\n\n#### Bone Object\n\n**Price** 1 sp (per Bulk)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":15403,"bulk":"0","name":"Bone","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"8695170327093041","group":"MATERIAL","hands":null,"level":0,"price":{},"usage":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2358","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"169"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{},"unselectable":true},"created_at":"2024-07-24T18:17:38.513854+00:00","operations":[],"description":"A durable material when properly treated, [bone](link_item_15403) can replace wood and metal when creating armor, shields, and weapons. The statistics for [bone](link_item_15403) are applicable to a variety of other sturdy [animal](link_trait_2409)-based products, such as chitin, horn, ivory, coral, and shell, which can also be classified as [bone](link_item_15403) for the purposes of determining item statistics. [Bone](link_item_15403) elements from certain [beasts](link_trait_2422), like the horn of a [unicorn](link_creature_10352) or the spikes of a manticore, may even yield [magical](link_trait_1504) properties when worked by a skilled crafter.\n\n| [Bone](link_item_15403) Objects | Hardness | HP | BT |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Thin Items | 4 | 16 | 8 |\n| Items | 6 | 24 | 12 |\n| Structures | 12 | 48 | 24 |\n\n#### Bone Specimen\n\n**Price** 1 sp; **Bulk** 1\n\n#### Bone Object\n\n**Price** 1 sp (per Bulk)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":15494,"type":"item","before":{"id":15494,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Probing Cane","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6013076877128988","group":"W