,"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nHarvested from the skin of the poisonous spear frog, this toxin causes a burning rash and weakness in the limbs. Each frog yields enough toxin to [Craft](link_action_19617) one dose of [spear frog poison](link_item_17476).\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 15 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** 1d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round); **Stage 2** 1d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and enfeebled 1 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":17476,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Spear Frog Poison","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6087732222714336","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":1,"price":{"gp":3},"usage":"held in 2 hands","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1564,1476],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4548","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"71"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0},"created_at":"2025-03-11T02:33:49.270954+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nHarvested from the skin of the poisonous spear frog, this toxin causes a burning rash and weakness in the limbs. Each frog yields enough toxin to [Craft](link_action_19617) one dose of [spear frog poison](link_item_17476).\n\n**Saving Throw** DC 15 Fortitude; **Maximum Duration** 6 rounds; **Stage 1** 1d4 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage (1 round); **Stage 2** 1d6 [poison](link_trait_1476) damage and enfeebled 1 (1 round)","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":17580,"type":"item","before":{"id":17580,"bulk":"0","name":"Judgement Thurible","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"6124117937389681","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"gp":975},"usage":"affixed to armor or a weapon","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504,2570],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"property":[]},"damage":{"die":"","dice":"","extra":"","damageType":""},"hp_max":0,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=4766","book":"Treasure Vault","page":"126"},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","hardness":0,"material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"broken_threshold":0,"spellheart_casting":{"dc":27}},"created_at":"2025-04-02T01:47:31.923403+00:00","operations":[],"description":"The golden religious symbol on the top of this spherical incense holder shifts its form to match the faith of its bearer. You gain no benefit from a _[judgment thurible](link_item_17580)_ if you don't worship a deity. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 27.\n\n*   **Armor** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the thurible casts 3rd-rank *[protection](link_spell_4782)* on you, with a duration of 1 round.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the weapon gains a rune that lasts until the end of your next turn. It gains the [_holy_](link_item_7040) rune if your deity allows [holy](link_trait_1630) sanctification or the [_unholy_](link_item_7911) rune if your deity allows [unholy](link_trait_1846) sanctification. If your deity allows both, you can choose which rune the weapon gains. If your deity allows neither, your weapon doesn’t gain a rune.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[divine lance](link_spell_4578)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[divin