 match the faith of its bearer. You gain no benefit from a _[judgment thurible](link_item_17582)_ if you don't worship a deity. The spell DC of any spell cast by activating this item is 43.\n\n*   **Armor** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the thurible casts 3rd-rank *[protection](link_spell_4782)* on you, with a duration of 1 round.\n    \n*   **Weapon** After you [Cast a spell](link_action_19611) by activating the thurible, the weapon gains a rune that lasts until the end of your next turn. It gains the [_holy_](link_item_7040) rune if your deity allows [holy](link_trait_1630) sanctification or the [_unholy_](link_item_7911) rune if your deity allows [unholy](link_trait_1846) sanctification. If your deity allows both, you can choose which rune the weapon gains. If your deity allows neither, your weapon doesn’t gain a rune. The additional damage from the rune granted by the thurible is 2d6.\n    \n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Effect** You cast *[divine lance](link_spell_4578)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast 7th-rank *[divine decree](link_spell_4575)*.\n\n**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611); **Frequency** once per day; **Effect** You cast *[summon deific herald](link_spell_8919)*.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":18074,"type":"item","before":{"id":18074,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1936736855305504","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"cp":"","gp":160,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"}},"created_at":"2025-06-09T20:14:02.862191+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_18074) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_18074), you gain a +3 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":18074,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Affliction Suppressant (Greater)","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"1936736855305504","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":10,"price":{"cp":"","gp":160,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1529,1531,1553,1442],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1956","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"58"}},"created_at":"2025-06-09T20:14:02.862191+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ([manipulate](link_trait_1433))\n\n* * *\n\nFirst created using the same principles as the [antiplague](link_item_6711) and [antivenom](link_item_6705) [elixirs](link_trait_1553), an [affliction suppressant](link_item_18074) is a broadly useful medicine, but sacrifices potency. It applies to a wide variety of afflictions, but lasts a much shorter time. Upon drinking an [affliction suppressant](link_item_18074), you gain a +3 item bonus to all saves against afflictions for 10 minutes.\n\nUnlike with an [antiplague](link_item_6711), this suppressant isn’t long-lasting enough to apply to a daily save against the progression of a [disease](link_trait_1857), [curse](link_trait_1855), or other long-lasting affliction. It can still help protect you from catching such an affliction when you’re initially exposed to it, as well as on saves that occur after stages that last 10 minutes or less.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":18075,"type":"item","before":{"id":18075,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghostcracker","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7112617174319799","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"cp":"","gp":25,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2024","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"74"}},"created_at":"2025-06-09T20:15:09.728475+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n* * *\n\nA _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ pops and smokes when consumed. When you throw the _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ down in your space as part of [casting an](link_action_19611) *[illusory creature](link_spell_4676)* spell, the appearance of the creature twists nightmarishly. When an enemy’s attack or spell ends the *[illusory creature](link_spell_4676)* spell, the creature “dies” in a disturbing fashion, rendering the enemy frightened 1. From this effect, the _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ adds the [emotion](link_trait_1486), [fear](link_trait_1487), and [mental](link_trait_1448) traits to the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":18075,"bulk":"0.1","name":"Ghostcracker","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"7112617174319799","group":"GENERAL","hands":null,"level":5,"price":{"cp":"","gp":25,"pp":"","sp":""},"usage":"held in 1 hand","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[2856,1531,1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=2024","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"74"}},"created_at":"2025-06-09T20:15:09.728475+00:00","operations":[],"description":"**Activate** [Cast a Spell](link_action_19611)\n\n* * *\n\nA _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ pops and smokes when consumed. When you throw the _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ down in your space as part of [casting an](link_action_19611) *[illusory creature](link_spell_4676)* spell, the appearance of the creature twists nightmarishly. When an enemy’s attack or spell ends the *[illusory creature](link_spell_4676)* spell, the creature “dies” in a disturbing fashion, rendering the enemy frightened 1. From this effect, the _[ghostcracker](link_item_18075)_ adds the [emotion](link_trait_1486), [fear](link_trait_1487), and [mental](link_trait_1448) traits to the spell.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"item","id":18176,"type":"item","before":{"id":18176,"bulk":null,"name":"Spellwatch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2367903000470095","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000,"pp":""},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Equipment.aspx?ID=1837","book":"Treasure Vault (Remastered)","page":"13"}},"created_at":"2025-06-27T23:51:07.410415+00:00","operations":[],"description":"Counter-runes chip away at unwanted magic that impedes you. You can attempt a new saving throw against one hostile spell affecting you at the start of each of your turns. If you succeed, the spell ends, and if you fail it continues unchanged, with no additional ill effect. If you’re affected by multiple hostile spells, choose only one each turn to attempt the additional save against.","availability":null,"content_source_id":16,"craft_requirements":""},"after":{"id":18176,"bulk":null,"name":"Spellwatch","size":"MEDIUM","uuid":"2367903000470095","group":"RUNE","hands":null,"level":13,"price":{"gp":3000,"pp":""},"usage":"etched onto armor","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1504],"version":"1.0","meta_data":{"bulk":{},"group":"","runes":{"potency":0,"property":[],"striking":0,"resilient":0},"damage":{"die":"","dice":1,"extra":"","damageType":""},"charges":{},"foundry":{},"category":"","material":{},"quantity":1,"image_url":"","is_shoddy":false,"starfinder":{"slots":[]},"unselectable":false,"source":{"url":"https://