g.\n    \n*   **Sarenrae** Speed 30 feet, fly 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> scimitar ([forceful](link_trait_1598), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> everflame ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [fire](link_trait_1542).\n    \n*   **Shelyn** Speed 70 feet, fly 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> glaive ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), [reach 20 feet](link_trait_4175)), **Damage** 6d8+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> melody of inner beauty, ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [sonic](link_trait_1484).\n    \n*   **Torag** Speed 50 feet, burrow 30 feet, immune to immobilized; shield (Hardness 15, can't be damaged); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> warhammer ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [shove](link_trait_1595)), **Damage** 6d8+6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Urgathoa** Speed 70 feet, fly 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> scythe ([deadly 3d10](link_trait_2530), [trip](link_trait_1537), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d10+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> pallid plague (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [void](link_trait_1485).\n    \n*   **Zon-Kuthon** Speed 70 feet, fly 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> spiked chain ([disarm](link_trait_1604), [trip](link_trait_1537), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> midnight pain ([mental](link_trait_1448), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4408,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4408,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"herbs, 1/5 the value on Creature Creation Rituals table","name":"Awaken Animal","rank":6,"uuid":"6710332356033866","range":"10 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 animal up to the level on the table","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"focus":false,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Nature (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Lore (any), Society, Survival","casters":3}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=109","book":"Player Core","page":"390"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:14:45.947864+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":[],"description":"You grant intelligence to the target, transforming it into a beast. If it was previously an animal companion or minion, it can no longer serve as one.\n\n**Critical Success** The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers each increase to +2 if they were lower, and it becomes helpful to you for awakening it.\n\n**Success** The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers increase to +0 if they were lower and it becomes friendly to you for awakening it.\n\n**Failure** You fail to awaken the target.\n\n**Critical Failure** You accidentally awaken the target with a pure bestial hatred toward you. The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers increase to -2 if they were lower. It becomes hostile to you, attempting to destroy you.\n\nCreatures Creation Rituals\n--------------------------\n\n| Creature Level | Spell Rank Required | Cost |\n\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| -1 or 0 | 2 | 15 gp |\n\n| 1 | 2 | 60 gp |\n\n| 2 | 3 | 105 gp |\n\n| 3 | 3 | 180 gp |\n\n| 4 | 4 | 300 gp |\n\n| 5 | 4 | 480 gp |\n\n| 6 | 5 | 750 gp |\n\n| 7 | 5 | 1,080 gp |\n\n| 8 | 6 | 1,500 gp |\n\n| 9 | 6 | 2,100 gp |\n\n| 10 | 7 | 3,000 gp |\n\n| 11 | 7 | 4,200 gp |\n\n| 12 | 8 | 6,000 gp |\n\n| 13 | 8 | 9,000 gp |\n\n| 14 | 9 | 13,500 gp |\n\n| 15 | 9 | 19,500 gp |\n\n| 16 | 10 | 30,000 gp |\n\n| 17 | 10 | 45,000 gp |","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4408,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"herbs, 1/5 the value on Creature Creation Rituals table","name":"Awaken Animal","rank":6,"uuid":"6710332356033866","range":"10 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 animal up to the level on the table","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"focus":false,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Nature (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Lore (any), Society, Survival","casters":3}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=109","book":"Player Core","page":"390"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:14:45.947864+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":[],"description":"You grant intelligence to the target, transforming it into a beast. If it was previously an animal companion or minion, it can no longer serve as one.\n\n**Critical Success** The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers each increase to +2 if they were lower, and it becomes helpful to you for awakening it.\n\n**Success** The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers increase to +0 if they were lower and it becomes friendly to you for awakening it.\n\n**Failure** You fail to awaken the target.\n\n**Critical Failure** You accidentally awaken the target with a pure bestial hatred toward you. The target's Intelligence, Wisdom, and Charisma modifiers increase to -2 if they were lower. It becomes hostile to you, attempting to destroy you.\n\nCreatures Creation Rituals\n--------------------------\n\n| Creature Level | Spell Rank Required | Cost |\n\n| --- | --- | --- |\n\n| -1 or 0 | 2 | 15 gp |\n\n| 1 | 2 | 60 gp |\n\n| 2 | 3 | 105 gp |\n\n| 3 | 3 | 180 gp |\n\n| 4 | 4 | 300 gp |\n\n| 5 | 4 | 480 gp |\n\n| 6 | 5 | 750 gp |\n\n| 7 | 5 | 1,080 gp |\n\n| 8 | 6 | 1,500 gp |\n\n| 9 | 6 | 2,100 gp |\n\n| 10 | 7 | 3,000 gp |\n\n| 11 | 7 | 4,200 gp |\n\n| 12 | 8 | 6,000 gp |\n\n| 13 | 8 | 9,000 gp |\n\n| 14 | 9 | 13,500 gp |\n\n| 15 | 9 | 19,500 gp |\n\n| 16 | 10 | 30,000 gp |\n\n| 17 | 10 | 45,000 gp |","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4409,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4409,"area":"10-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bane","rank":1,"uuid":"4734434160949062","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1432,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"enemies in the area","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1447","book":"Player Core","page":"317"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:14:56.270383+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt. Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.\n\n_Bane_ can [counteract](link_action_27519) [_bless_](link_spell_4415).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4409,"area":"10-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bane","rank":1,"uuid":"4734434160949062","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1432,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"enemies in the area","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1447","book":"Player Core","page":"317"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:14:56.270383+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You fill the minds of your enemies with doubt. Enemies in the area must succeed at a Will save or take a –1 status penalty to attack rolls as long as they are in the area. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet and force enemies in the area that weren't yet affected to attempt another saving throw.\n\n_Bane_ can [counteract](link_action_27519) [_bless_](link_spell_4415).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4410,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4410,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Banishment","rank":5,"uuid":"1326885638443624","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1481,1433],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature that isn't on its home plane","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1448","book":"Player Core","page":"317"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:07.332362+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"9":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures that aren't on their home plane"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures. The extra cost affects targets to which it is anathema.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You send the target back to its home plane. The target must attempt a Will save. You can spend an extra action while [Casting this Spell](link_action_19611) and add a cost to the spell to give the creature a –2 circumstance penalty to its save. The cost must be a specially gathered object that is anathema to the creature. This spell fails if you aren't on your home plane when you cast it.\n\n**Critical Success** The target resists being banished and you are stunned 1.\n\n**Success** The target resists being banished.\n\n**Failure** The target is banished.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is banished and can't return by any means to the plane it's banished from for 1 week.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4410,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Banishment","rank":5,"uuid":"1326885638443624","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1481,1433],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature that isn't on its home plane","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1448","book":"Player Core","page":"317"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:07.332362+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"9":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures that aren't on their home plane"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures. The extra cost affects targets to which it is anathema.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You send the target back to its home plane. The target must attempt a Will save. You can spend an extra action while [Casting this Spell](link_action_19611) and add a cost to the spell to give the creature a –2 circumstance penalty to its save. The cost must be a specially gathered object that is anathema to the creature. This spell fails if you aren't on your home plane when you cast it.\n\n**Critical Success** The target resists being banished and you are stunned 1.\n\n**Success** The target resists being banished.\n\n**Failure** The target is banished.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is banished and can't return by any means to the plane it's banished from for 1 week.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4411,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4411,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bind Undead","rank":3,"uuid":"5992321804722879","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 mindless undead creature with a level no greater than bind undead's spell rank","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 day","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1449","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:14.991997+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"With a word of power, you seize control of the target. It gains the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. If you or an ally uses any hostile actions against the target, the spell ends.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4411,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bind Undead","rank":3,"uuid":"5992321804722879","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 mindless undead creature with a level no greater than bind undead's spell rank","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 day","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1449","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:14.991997+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"With a word of power, you seize control of the target. It gains the [minion](link_trait_2527) trait. If you or an ally uses any hostile actions against the target, the spell ends.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4412,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4412,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"warding circle ingredients worth a total value of 2 gp × the spell rank × the target's level","name":"Binding Circle","rank":6,"uuid":"2895738957974739","range":"interplanar","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[],"defense":null,"targets":"1 extraplanar creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Arcana (master) or Occultism (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Diplomacy or Intimidation; Arcana or Occultism (whichever isn't used for the primary check)","casters":3}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=110","book":"Player Core","page":"391"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:33.843916+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":[],"description":"You call forth an extraplanar creature of a level no greater than double that of the _binding circle_ ritual's rank and attempt to bargain with it, generally to perform a task for you in exchange for payment.\n\nYou conjure the extraplanar creature within your circle and negotiate a deal with it. A creature that doesn't wish to negotiate at all can attempt a Will save to stay on its home plane. Most extraplanar creatures feel that they have something better to do than cater to the whims of mortals and require a significant gift, especially if your task poses major risks. Fiends and similarly wicked extraplanar creatures are more likely to accept a bargain for a lower cost as long as it allows them to wreak havoc on the Universe or inflict evil upon the world along the way.\n\nMonetary prices usually range from the cost of a consumable item of the creature's level for a short and simple task to a permanent magic item of the creature's level or more to persuade the creature to fight alongside you. However, some extraplanar creatures may want payments other than money, such as permission to cast a Geas on you to fulfill an unspecified later favor or obtain ownership of your soul via an infernal contract.\n\nYou can add an additional secondary caster to create a warding circle that prevents the extraplanar creature from attacking or leaving the circle during the bargain. This uses the Crafting skill and has the same DC as a secondary check would. This protection ends if you use a hostile action against the extraplanar creature or the warding circle breaks.\n\n**Critical Success** You call the extraplanar creature and can prevent it from returning home for up to a full day, potentially allowing you to negotiate a better deal by threatening to leave it in the wards for the duration.\n\n**Success** You call the extraplanar creature and must make your case succinctly, after which the creature can return home at any time.\n\n**Failure** You fail to call the extraplanar creature.\n\n**Critical Failure** You call something vile and horrible, unbound by your wards, and it immediately attempts to destroy you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4412,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"warding circle ingredients worth a total value of 2 gp × the spell rank × the target's level","name":"Binding Circle","rank":6,"uuid":"2895738957974739","range":"interplanar","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[],"defense":null,"targets":"1 extraplanar creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Arcana (master) or Occultism (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Diplomacy or Intimidation; Arcana or Occultism (whichever isn't used for the primary check)","casters":3}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=110","book":"Player Core","page":"391"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:33.843916+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":[],"description":"You call forth an extraplanar creature of a level no greater than double that of the _binding circle_ ritual's rank and attempt to bargain with it, generally to perform a task for you in exchange for payment.\n\nYou conjure the extraplanar creature within your circle and negotiate a deal with it. A creature that doesn't wish to negotiate at all can attempt a Will save to stay on its home plane. Most extraplanar creatures feel that they have something better to do than cater to the whims of mortals and require a significant gift, especially if your task poses major risks. Fiends and similarly wicked extraplanar creatures are more likely to accept a bargain for a lower cost as long as it allows them to wreak havoc on the Universe or inflict evil upon the world along the way.\n\nMonetary prices usually range from the cost of a consumable item of the creature's level for a short and simple task to a permanent magic item of the creature's level or more to persuade the creature to fight alongside you. However, some extraplanar creatures may want payments other than money, such as permission to cast a Geas on you to fulfill an unspecified later favor or obtain ownership of your soul via an infernal contract.\n\nYou can add an additional secondary caster to create a warding circle that prevents the extraplanar creature from attacking or leaving the circle during the bargain. This uses the Crafting skill and has the same DC as a secondary check would. This protection ends if you use a hostile action against the extraplanar creature or the warding circle breaks.\n\n**Critical Success** You call the extraplanar creature and can prevent it from returning home for up to a full day, potentially allowing you to negotiate a better deal by threatening to leave it in the wards for the duration.\n\n**Success** You call the extraplanar creature and must make your case succinctly, after which the creature can return home at any time.\n\n**Failure** You fail to call the extraplanar creature.\n\n**Critical Failure** You call something vile and horrible, unbound by your wards, and it immediately attempts to destroy you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4414,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4414,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blazing Bolt","rank":2,"uuid":"1204342424169610","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1432,1542,1433],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 or more creatures","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1450","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:58.466162+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The damage to each target increases by 1d6 for the 1-action version, or by 2d6 for the 2-action and 3-action versions.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You fire a ray of heat and flame. Make a spell attack roll against a single creature. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 fire damage, and on a critical hit, the target takes double damage.\n\nFor each additional action you use when [Casting](link_action_19611) the Spell, you can fire an additional ray at a different target, to a maximum of three rays targeting three different targets for 3 actions. These attacks each increase your multiple attack penalty, but you don't increase your multiple attack penalty until after you make all the spell attack rolls for _blazing bolt_. If you spend 2 or more actions [Casting](link_action_19611) the Spell, the damage increases to 4d6 fire damage on a hit, and it still deals double damage on a critical hit.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4414,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blazing Bolt","rank":2,"uuid":"1204342424169610","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1432,1542,1433],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 or more creatures","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1450","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:15:58.466162+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The damage to each target increases by 1d6 for the 1-action version, or by 2d6 for the 2-action and 3-action versions.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You fire a ray of heat and flame. Make a spell attack roll against a single creature. On a hit, the target takes 2d6 fire damage, and on a critical hit, the target takes double damage.\n\nFor each additional action you use when [Casting](link_action_19611) the Spell, you can fire an additional ray at a different target, to a maximum of three rays targeting three different targets for 3 actions. These attacks each increase your multiple attack penalty, but you don't increase your multiple attack penalty until after you make all the spell attack rolls for _blazing bolt_. If you spend 2 or more actions [Casting](link_action_19611) the Spell, the damage increases to 4d6 fire damage on a hit, and it still deals double damage on a critical hit.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4415,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4415,"area":"15-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bless","rank":1,"uuid":"6227200568004068","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1432,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"you and allies in the area","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1451","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:06.739165+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"Blessings from beyond help your companions strike true. You and your allies gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls while within the emanation. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet.\n\n_Bless_ can [counteract](link_action_27519) [_bane_](link_spell_4409).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4415,"area":"15-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Bless","rank":1,"uuid":"6227200568004068","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1492,1432,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"you and allies in the area","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1451","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:06.739165+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"Blessings from beyond help your companions strike true. You and your allies gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls while within the emanation. Once per round on subsequent turns, you can [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell to increase the emanation's radius by 10 feet.\n\n_Bless_ can [counteract](link_action_27519) [_bane_](link_spell_4409).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4416,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4416,"area":"up to a 60-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blessed Boundary","rank":6,"uuid":"6519697434183121","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1560,1433,1897],"defense":"Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1452","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:18.163101+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"rQT6Is4xVcbWJIAt":"1d8"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d8.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"Manifestations of divine force appear in the hundreds, swirling in a massive, protective sphere. These typically look like spiky fragments, but often take on an appearance themed to the deity of the caster. The sphere is hollow, with the manifestations forming a shell 2 inches deep on the outer edge. You can choose to make the burst smaller, in 5-foot increments, when you cast it. The shell provides cover and can intersect solid terrain without affecting it. The shell deals 7d8 force damage to each creature who intersects with the shell when the sphere's created, or who attempts to move through the shell. The creature also takes the damage at the end of its turn, but only if it didn't already take damage from the shell that turn. The effects are determined by a creature's Reflex save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage, is pushed up to 10 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage, is pushed up to 20 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4416,"area":"up to a 60-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blessed Boundary","rank":6,"uuid":"6519697434183121","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1560,1433,1897],"defense":"Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1452","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:18.163101+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"rQT6Is4xVcbWJIAt":"1d8"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d8.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"Manifestations of divine force appear in the hundreds, swirling in a massive, protective sphere. These typically look like spiky fragments, but often take on an appearance themed to the deity of the caster. The sphere is hollow, with the manifestations forming a shell 2 inches deep on the outer edge. You can choose to make the burst smaller, in 5-foot increments, when you cast it. The shell provides cover and can intersect solid terrain without affecting it. The shell deals 7d8 force damage to each creature who intersects with the shell when the sphere's created, or who attempts to move through the shell. The creature also takes the damage at the end of its turn, but only if it didn't already take damage from the shell that turn. The effects are determined by a creature's Reflex save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage, is pushed up to 10 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage, is pushed up to 20 feet in the direction of your choice, and ends its movement.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4419,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4419,"area":null,"cast":"REACTION","cost":"","name":"Blood Vendetta","rank":2,"uuid":"1869771290073972","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1855],"defense":"Will","targets":"The triggering creature","trigger":"A creature deals piercing, slashing, or persistent bleed damage to you.","version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1454","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:48.733542+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":2},"text":[{"text":"The persistent bleed damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You curse the target, punishing it for having the audacity to spill your blood. The target takes 2d6 persistent bleed damage and must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half the persistent bleed damage.\n\n**Failure** The target takes the full persistent bleed damage. Until the bleeding stops, the target has weakness 1 to piercing and slashing damage.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target takes double the persistent bleed damage.","availability":null,"requirements":"You can bleed.","content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4419,"area":null,"cast":"REACTION","cost":"","name":"Blood Vendetta","rank":2,"uuid":"1869771290073972","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1855],"defense":"Will","targets":"The triggering creature","trigger":"A creature deals piercing, slashing, or persistent bleed damage to you.","version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1454","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:16:48.733542+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":2},"text":[{"text":"The persistent bleed damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You curse the target, punishing it for having the audacity to spill your blood. The target takes 2d6 persistent bleed damage and must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half the persistent bleed damage.\n\n**Failure** The target takes the full persistent bleed damage. Until the bleeding stops, the target has weakness 1 to piercing and slashing damage.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target takes double the persistent bleed damage.","availability":null,"requirements":"You can bleed.","content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4421,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4421,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blur","rank":2,"uuid":"2522465884224957","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1447,1433,1479],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1455","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:17:17.389888+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"The target's form appears blurry. It becomes concealed. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4421,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Blur","rank":2,"uuid":"2522465884224957","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1447,1433,1479],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1455","book":"Player Core","page":"318"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:17:17.389888+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"The target's form appears blurry. It becomes concealed. As the nature of this effect still leaves the target's location obvious, the target can't use this concealment to [Hide](link_action_19726) or [Sneak](link_action_19850).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4423,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4423,"area":"15-foot cone","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Breathe Fire","rank":1,"uuid":"3622599897420984","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1457","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:17:30.528694+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A gout of flame sprays from your mouth. You deal 2d6 fire damage to creatures in the area with a basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4423,"area":"15-foot cone","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Breathe Fire","rank":1,"uuid":"3622599897420984","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1457","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:17:30.528694+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A gout of flame sprays from your mouth. You deal 2d6 fire damage to creatures in the area with a basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4426,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4426,"area":"10-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Calm","rank":2,"uuid":"7084174718780745","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1481,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1458","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:18:03.541305+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You forcibly calm creatures in the area, soothing them into a nonviolent state; each creature must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** Calming urges impose a -1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls.\n\n**Failure** Any [emotion](link_trait_1486) effects that would affect the creature are suppressed and the creature can't use hostile actions. If the target is subject to hostility from any other creature, it ceases to be affected by _calm_.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but hostility doesn't end the effect.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4426,"area":"10-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Calm","rank":2,"uuid":"7084174718780745","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1481,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1458","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:18:03.541305+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You forcibly calm creatures in the area, soothing them into a nonviolent state; each creature must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** Calming urges impose a -1 status penalty to the creature's attack rolls.\n\n**Failure** Any [emotion](link_trait_1486) effects that would affect the creature are suppressed and the creature can't use hostile actions. If the target is subject to hostility from any other creature, it ceases to be affected by _calm_.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but hostility doesn't end the effect.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4427,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4427,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Canticle of Everlasting Grief","rank":8,"uuid":"1674226522987042","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1855,1486,1487,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1459","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:18:14.961674+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You create a melody distilled from pure grief, conveying the inevitable loss of everything your target cherishes, audible to only them. The target takes 10d6 mental damage depending on its Will save. A creature cursed by this spell can't benefit from circumstance or status bonuses, for the duration noted in the degree of success.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half damage, is frightened 1, and is cursed for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The target takes full damage, is frightened 3, and is cursed for 1 week.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target takes double damage, is frightened 4, and is cursed for an unlimited duration. While the curse remains, the target's allies are also affected by the curse while within 15 feet of the creature.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4427,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Canticle of Everlasting Grief","rank":8,"uuid":"1674226522987042","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1855,1486,1487,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1459","book":"Player Core","page":"319"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T19:18:14.961674+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You create a melody distilled from pure grief, conveying the inevitable loss of everything your target cherishes, audible to only them. The target takes 10d6 mental damage depending on its Will save. A creature cursed by this spell can't benefit from circumstance or status bonuses, for the duration noted in the degree of success.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half damage, is frightened 1, and is cursed for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The target takes full damage, is frightened 3, and is cursed for 1 week.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target takes double damage, is frightened 4, and is cursed for an unlimited duration. While the curse remains, the target's allies are also affected by the curse while within 15 feet of the creature.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4516,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4516,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Charm","rank":1,"uuid":"1549344864617024","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1481,1433,1448,1899],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1463","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:15:42.624776+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(4th)"},{"text":"The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"description":"To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.\n\nYou can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.\n\n**Success** The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of _charm_, unless it identifies the spell.\n\n**Failure** The target's attitude becomes friendly toward you. If it was friendly, it becomes helpful. It can't use hostile actions against you.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target's attitude becomes helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4516,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Charm","rank":1,"uuid":"1549344864617024","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1481,1433,1448,1899],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1463","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:15:42.624776+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(4th)"},{"text":"The duration lasts until the next time you make your daily preparations, and you can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"description":"To the target, your words are honey and your visage seems bathed in a dreamy haze. It must attempt a Will save, with a +4 circumstance bonus if you or your allies recently threatened it or used hostile actions against it.\n\nYou can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell. If you use hostile actions against the target, the spell ends. When the spell ends, the target doesn't necessarily realize it was charmed unless its friendship with you or the actions you convinced it to take clash with its expectations, meaning you could potentially convince the target to continue being your friend via mundane means.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected and aware you tried to charm it.\n\n**Success** The target is unaffected but thinks your spell was something harmless instead of _charm_, unless it identifies the spell.\n\n**Failure** The target's attitude becomes friendly toward you. If it was friendly, it becomes helpful. It can't use hostile actions against you.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target's attitude becomes helpful toward you, and it can't use hostile actions against you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4519,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4519,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Chilling Darkness","rank":3,"uuid":"3406515212557394","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1519,1432,1900,1433,1846],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1464","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:17.408634+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The cold damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against holy creatures increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You shoot an utterly cold ray of darkness tinged with unholy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 cold damage. If the target has the holy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.\n\nIf the ray passes through an area of magical light or targets a creature affected by magical light, chilling darkness attempts to counteract the light. If you need to determine whether the ray passes through an area of light, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4519,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Chilling Darkness","rank":3,"uuid":"3406515212557394","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1519,1432,1900,1433,1846],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1464","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:17.408634+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The cold damage increases by 2d6, and the spirit damage against holy creatures increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You shoot an utterly cold ray of darkness tinged with unholy energy. Make a ranged spell attack. The ray deals 5d6 cold damage. If the target has the holy trait, you deal an extra 5d6 spirit damage.\n\nIf the ray passes through an area of magical light or targets a creature affected by magical light, chilling darkness attempts to counteract the light. If you need to determine whether the ray passes through an area of light, draw a line between yourself and the spell's target.\n\n**Critical Success** The target takes double damage.\n\n**Success** The target takes full damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4520,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4520,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Clairaudience","rank":3,"uuid":"8714507867876812","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1590],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1465","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:26.341429+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create an invisible floating ear at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). It can't move, but you can hear through the ear as if using your normal auditory senses.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4520,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Clairaudience","rank":3,"uuid":"8714507867876812","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1590],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1465","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:26.341429+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create an invisible floating ear at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). It can't move, but you can hear through the ear as if using your normal auditory senses.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4521,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4521,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Clairvoyance","rank":4,"uuid":"6907341938091703","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1590],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1466","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:33.453001+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create an invisible floating eye at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). The eye can't move, but you can see in all directions from that point as if using your normal visual senses.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4521,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Clairvoyance","rank":4,"uuid":"6907341938091703","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1590],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1466","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:33.453001+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create an invisible floating eye at a location within range (even if it's outside your line of sight or line of effect). The eye can't move, but you can see in all directions from that point as if using your normal visual senses.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4522,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4522,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cleanse Affliction","rank":2,"uuid":"3696690347032386","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1442,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 willing creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1467","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:40.632532+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a [disease](link_trait_1857) or [poison](link_trait_1476).","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a [curse](link_trait_1855), [disease](link_trait_1857), or [poison](link_trait_1476).","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","occult","primal"],"description":"Gentle restorative magic pushes back the effects of toxins and more complex maladies. Choose an affliction on the target, such as a [curse](link_trait_1855), [disease](link_trait_1857), or [poison](link_trait_1476). If it has advanced past stage one, reduce the stage by one. This reduction can be applied only once to a given case of an affliction, with the case ending when it's completely cured. Although the reduction can't occur again, heightened versions of this spell attempt to [counteract](link_action_27519) with each casting.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4522,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cleanse Affliction","rank":2,"uuid":"3696690347032386","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1442,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 willing creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1467","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:40.632532+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a [disease](link_trait_1857) or [poison](link_trait_1476).","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"Attempt to counteract the affliction if it is a [curse](link_trait_1855), [disease](link_trait_1857), or [poison](link_trait_1476).","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","occult","primal"],"description":"Gentle restorative magic pushes back the effects of toxins and more complex maladies. Choose an affliction on the target, such as a [curse](link_trait_1855), [disease](link_trait_1857), or [poison](link_trait_1476). If it has advanced past stage one, reduce the stage by one. This reduction can be applied only once to a given case of an affliction, with the case ending when it's completely cured. Although the reduction can't occur again, heightened versions of this spell attempt to [counteract](link_action_27519) with each casting.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4523,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4523,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cleanse Cuisine","rank":1,"uuid":"8554771660190148","range":"10 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 cubic foot","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1468","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:44.888946+00:00","heightened":{"text":[{"text":"Add another cubic foot to the area, which must be contiguous with the rest.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["divine","primal"],"description":"You transform all food and beverages in the area into delicious fare, changing water into wine or another fine beverage, or enhancing the food's taste and ingredients to make it a gourmet treat. You can also choose to remove all toxins and contaminations from the food. This spell doesn't prevent future contamination, natural decay, or spoilage, nor does it make the food any more nutritious.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4523,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cleanse Cuisine","rank":1,"uuid":"8554771660190148","range":"10 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 cubic foot","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1468","book":"Player Core","page":"320"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:16:44.888946+00:00","heightened":{"text":[{"text":"Add another cubic foot to the area, which must be contiguous with the rest.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["divine","primal"],"description":"You transform all food and beverages in the area into delicious fare, changing water into wine or another fine beverage, or enhancing the food's taste and ingredients to make it a gourmet treat. You can also choose to remove all toxins and contaminations from the food. This spell doesn't prevent future contamination, natural decay, or spoilage, nor does it make the food any more nutritious.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4527,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4527,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"rare incense worth a total value of 300 gp","name":"Collective Memories","rank":7,"uuid":"5007986147902456","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Occultism (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Performance, Society","casters":2}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=113","book":"Player Core","page":"391"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:17:29.960141+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":[],"description":"You tap into other mortals' memories, knowledge, legends, tales, and lore about a subject. The subject must be an important person, place, or thing. If the subject is present, increase the degree of success of your primary skill check by one step. If you have only vague information about the subject before attempting the ritual, decrease the degree of success of your primary skill check by one step. These modifiers cancel each other out if you have a subject present with little to no baseline information.\n\n**Critical Success** For 1 hour after the ritual ends, you sort through memories that are mostly coherent, emphasizing more accurate or useful information over misremembered knowledge or exaggerated tales.\n\n**Success** For 1 hour after the ritual ends, you learn useful information for further inquiry that remains generally incomplete or enigmatic. As is the nature of mortal memory and stories, you are likely to learn multiple contradictory versions.\n\n**Failure** You fail to learn any useful legends.\n\n**Critical Failure** Your mind becomes overwhelmed with the vast array of knowledge at your disposal. You can't sense or respond to anything in the present for 1 week except to perform necessities like breathing and sleeping. When you recover, however, you can retrain one of your skills into a Lore based on the knowledge of a subject you were accessing, as if you had spent 1 week retraining.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4527,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"rare incense worth a total value of 300 gp","name":"Collective Memories","rank":7,"uuid":"5007986147902456","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Occultism (master)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Performance, Society","casters":2}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=113","book":"Player Core","page":"391"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:17:29.960141+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":[],"description":"You tap into other mortals' memories, knowledge, legends, tales, and lore about a subject. The subject must be an important person, place, or thing. If the subject is present, increase the degree of success of your primary skill check by one step. If you have only vague information about the subject before attempting the ritual, decrease the degree of success of your primary skill check by one step. These modifiers cancel each other out if you have a subject present with little to no baseline information.\n\n**Critical Success** For 1 hour after the ritual ends, you sort through memories that are mostly coherent, emphasizing more accurate or useful information over misremembered knowledge or exaggerated tales.\n\n**Success** For 1 hour after the ritual ends, you learn useful information for further inquiry that remains generally incomplete or enigmatic. As is the nature of mortal memory and stories, you are likely to learn multiple contradictory versions.\n\n**Failure** You fail to learn any useful legends.\n\n**Critical Failure** Your mind becomes overwhelmed with the vast array of knowledge at your disposal. You can't sense or respond to anything in the present for 1 week except to perform necessities like breathing and sleeping. When you recover, however, you can retrain one of your skills into a Lore based on the knowledge of a subject you were accessing, as if you had spent 1 week retraining.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4528,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4528,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Command","rank":1,"uuid":"2082254010340192","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1458,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the end of the target's next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1470","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:17:41.300051+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the fleeing condition), release what it's holding, drop prone, or stand in place. It can't [Delay](link_action_19623) or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.\n\n**Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Failure** For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4528,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Command","rank":1,"uuid":"2082254010340192","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1458,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the end of the target's next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1470","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:17:41.300051+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"5":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You shout a command that's hard to ignore. You can command the target to approach you, run away (as if it had the fleeing condition), release what it's holding, drop prone, or stand in place. It can't [Delay](link_action_19623) or take any reactions until it has obeyed your command. The effects depend on the target's Will save.\n\n**Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Failure** For the first action on its next turn, the creature must use a single action to do as you command.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target must use all its actions on its next turn to obey your command.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4533,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4533,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Confusion","rank":4,"uuid":"5847720575482593","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1471","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:18:34.35727+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You befuddle your target with strange impulses, causing it to act randomly. The effects are determined by the target's Will save. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target babbles incoherently and is stunned 1.\n\n**Failure** The target is confused for 1 minute. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns to end the confusion.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is confused for 1 minute, with no save to end early.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4533,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Confusion","rank":4,"uuid":"5847720575482593","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1471","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:18:34.35727+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You befuddle your target with strange impulses, causing it to act randomly. The effects are determined by the target's Will save. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target babbles incoherently and is stunned 1.\n\n**Failure** The target is confused for 1 minute. It can attempt a new save at the end of each of its turns to end the confusion.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is confused for 1 minute, with no save to end early.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4536,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4536,"area":"50 feet long by 50 feet wide","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Control Water","rank":5,"uuid":"904928695106854","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1584],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1473","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:19:14.406027+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"By imposing your will upon the water, you can raise or lower the level of water in the chosen area by 10 feet. Creatures that have the [water](link_trait_1584) trait and that are in the area when you [Cast the Spell](link_action_19611) must attempt a Fortitude save, with the effects of the [slow](link_spell_4839) spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4536,"area":"50 feet long by 50 feet wide","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Control Water","rank":5,"uuid":"904928695106854","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1584],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1473","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:19:14.406027+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"By imposing your will upon the water, you can raise or lower the level of water in the chosen area by 10 feet. Creatures that have the [water](link_trait_1584) trait and that are in the area when you [Cast the Spell](link_action_19611) must attempt a Fortitude save, with the effects of the [slow](link_spell_4839) spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4540,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4540,"area":"60-foot emanation","cast":"ONE-ACTION","cost":"","name":"Courageous Anthem","rank":0,"uuid":"1478365417422621","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1341,1858,1895,1432,1486,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 round","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1763","book":"Player Core","page":"370"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:19:54.6711+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":[],"description":"You inspire yourself and your allies with words or tunes of encouragement. You and all allies in the area gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, and saves against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4540,"area":"60-foot emanation","cast":"ONE-ACTION","cost":"","name":"Courageous Anthem","rank":0,"uuid":"1478365417422621","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1341,1858,1895,1432,1486,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 round","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1763","book":"Player Core","page":"370"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:19:54.6711+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":[],"description":"You inspire yourself and your allies with words or tunes of encouragement. You and all allies in the area gain a +1 status bonus to attack rolls, damage rolls, and saves against [fear](link_trait_1487) effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4541,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4541,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Cozy Cabin","rank":3,"uuid":"3464313582738538","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1680],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"12 hours","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1474","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:20:08.13419+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You shape a cabin 20 feet on each side and 10 feet high. This cabin has the [structure](link_trait_1600) trait and the same restrictions as magic items that create structures. The walls of the hut are simple and wooden, with small, square glass windows, and it has one wooden door. It doesn't include its own lock, but it has a fastener to which a lock can be applied.\n\nThe interior contains three cots, one chamber pot, and a small fireplace holding a magical fire. The interior is lit with a small magical light that you can light or extinguish at will using a [Sustain](link_action_19858) action. The climate inside the hut is comfortable and allows creatures inside it to withstand most hostile weather conditions, but incredible heat or cold, powerful storms, and winds of hurricane force or greater destroy the hut. Other creatures can freely enter and exit the hut without damaging it, but if you exit the hut, the spell ends. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4541,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Cozy Cabin","rank":3,"uuid":"3464313582738538","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1680],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"12 hours","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1474","book":"Player Core","page":"321"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:20:08.13419+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You shape a cabin 20 feet on each side and 10 feet high. This cabin has the [structure](link_trait_1600) trait and the same restrictions as magic items that create structures. The walls of the hut are simple and wooden, with small, square glass windows, and it has one wooden door. It doesn't include its own lock, but it has a fastener to which a lock can be applied.\n\nThe interior contains three cots, one chamber pot, and a small fireplace holding a magical fire. The interior is lit with a small magical light that you can light or extinguish at will using a [Sustain](link_action_19858) action. The climate inside the hut is comfortable and allows creatures inside it to withstand most hostile weather conditions, but incredible heat or cold, powerful storms, and winds of hurricane force or greater destroy the hut. Other creatures can freely enter and exit the hut without damaging it, but if you exit the hut, the spell ends. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4544,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4544,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Create Water","rank":1,"uuid":"7088134949458207","range":"0 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1584],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1476","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:20:56.486639+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"],"description":"As you cup your hands, water begins to flow forth from them. You create 2 gallons of water. If no one drinks it, it evaporates after 1 day.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4544,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Create Water","rank":1,"uuid":"7088134949458207","range":"0 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1584],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1476","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:20:56.486639+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":["arcane","divine","primal"],"description":"As you cup your hands, water begins to flow forth from them. You create 2 gallons of water. If no one drinks it, it evaporates after 1 day.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4545,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4545,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Creation","rank":4,"uuid":"6696642101220959","range":"0 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1477","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:21:06.314107+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The item is metal and can include common minerals, like feldspar or quartz. The spell gains the [metal](link_trait_2132) trait if used to create a metal object.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You conjure a temporary object from magical energy. It must consist of earthen or plant-derived matter (such as wood, paper, brick, or stone) and be 5 cubic feet or smaller. It can't rely on intricate artistry or complex moving parts, never fulfills a cost or the like, and can't be made of [precious](link_trait_1533) materials or materials with a rarity of [uncommon](link_trait_2514) or higher. It is obviously temporarily conjured, and thus can't be sold or passed off as a genuine item. The spell gains the appropriate trait for the item created, typically [earth](link_trait_1523), plant, or [wood](link_trait_1680).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4545,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Creation","rank":4,"uuid":"6696642101220959","range":"0 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1477","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:21:06.314107+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The item is metal and can include common minerals, like feldspar or quartz. The spell gains the [metal](link_trait_2132) trait if used to create a metal object.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You conjure a temporary object from magical energy. It must consist of earthen or plant-derived matter (such as wood, paper, brick, or stone) and be 5 cubic feet or smaller. It can't rely on intricate artistry or complex moving parts, never fulfills a cost or the like, and can't be made of [precious](link_trait_1533) materials or materials with a rarity of [uncommon](link_trait_2514) or higher. It is obviously temporarily conjured, and thus can't be sold or passed off as a genuine item. The spell gains the appropriate trait for the item created, typically [earth](link_trait_1523), plant, or [wood](link_trait_1680).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4547,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4547,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Crisis of Faith","rank":3,"uuid":"8757807462813948","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1478","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:21:34.662474+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6 (or by 2d8 if the target is a divine spellcaster).","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You assault the target's faith, riddling the creature with doubt and mental turmoil that deal 6d6 mental damage, or 6d8 mental damage if it can cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells. The effects are determined by its Will save.\n\nTo many deities, casting this spell on a follower of your own deity without significant cause is anathema.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The target takes full damage; if the target can cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells, it's stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target takes double damage, is stupefied 1 for 1 round, and can't cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells for 1 round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4547,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Crisis of Faith","rank":3,"uuid":"8757807462813948","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1478","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:21:34.662474+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6 (or by 2d8 if the target is a divine spellcaster).","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You assault the target's faith, riddling the creature with doubt and mental turmoil that deal 6d6 mental damage, or 6d8 mental damage if it can cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells. The effects are determined by its Will save.\n\nTo many deities, casting this spell on a follower of your own deity without significant cause is anathema.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The target takes full damage; if the target can cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells, it's stupefied 1 for 1 round.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target takes double damage, is stupefied 1 for 1 round, and can't cast [divine](link_trait_1475) spells for 1 round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4550,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4550,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cursed Metamorphosis","rank":6,"uuid":"8435989020925318","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1855,1481,1433,1453],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1479","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:14.591659+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"description":"You transform the target creature into a harmless animal appropriate to the area, with effects based on its Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target's body gains minor features of the harmless animal. Its insides churn as they partially transform, causing it to be sickened 1. When it recovers from the sickened condition, its features revert to normal.\n\n**Failure** The target transforms for 1 minute but keeps its mind. If it spends all its actions on its turn concentrating on its original form, it can attempt a Will save to end the effect immediately.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is transformed into the chosen harmless animal, body and mind, for an unlimited duration.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4550,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Cursed Metamorphosis","rank":6,"uuid":"8435989020925318","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1855,1481,1433,1453],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1479","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:14.591659+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult","primal"],"description":"You transform the target creature into a harmless animal appropriate to the area, with effects based on its Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target's body gains minor features of the harmless animal. Its insides churn as they partially transform, causing it to be sickened 1. When it recovers from the sickened condition, its features revert to normal.\n\n**Failure** The target transforms for 1 minute but keeps its mind. If it spends all its actions on its turn concentrating on its original form, it can attempt a Will save to end the effect immediately.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is transformed into the chosen harmless animal, body and mind, for an unlimited duration.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4552,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4552,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Darkness","rank":2,"uuid":"5615295794948156","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1900,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1480","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:30.768108+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as concealed.","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a [torch](link_item_7899) or [lantern](link_item_7066), do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical [light](link_trait_1517) of your darkness spell's rank or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4552,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Darkness","rank":2,"uuid":"5615295794948156","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1900,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1480","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:30.768108+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Even creatures with darkvision (but not greater darkvision) can barely see through the darkness. They treat targets seen through the darkness as concealed.","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You create a shroud of darkness that prevents light from penetrating or emanating within the area. Light does not enter the area and any non-magical light sources, such as a [torch](link_item_7899) or [lantern](link_item_7066), do not emanate any light while inside the area, even if their light radius would extend beyond the darkness. This also suppresses magical [light](link_trait_1517) of your darkness spell's rank or lower. Light can't pass through, so creatures in the area can't see outside. From outside, it appears as a globe of pure darkness.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4553,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4553,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Darkvision","rank":2,"uuid":"4754913103125775","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1481","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:35.903484+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"touch"},"target":{"value":"1 willing creature"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The spell's range is touch and it targets 1 willing creature.","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"The spell's range is touch and it targets 1 willing creature. The duration is until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You grant yourself supernatural sight in areas of darkness. You gain [Darkvision](link_sense_20769).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4553,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Darkvision","rank":2,"uuid":"4754913103125775","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1481","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:35.903484+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"3":{"range":{"value":"touch"},"target":{"value":"1 willing creature"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The spell's range is touch and it targets 1 willing creature.","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"The spell's range is touch and it targets 1 willing creature. The duration is until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(5th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You grant yourself supernatural sight in areas of darkness. You gain [Darkvision](link_sense_20769).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4554,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4554,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Daze","rank":0,"uuid":"2984024364456703","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1433,1448,1571],"defense":"basic Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 round","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1482","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:43.622555+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/4)}}d6) mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also stunned 1.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4554,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Daze","rank":0,"uuid":"2984024364456703","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1433,1448,1571],"defense":"basic Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 round","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1482","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:22:43.622555+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":2},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You push into the target's mind and daze it with a mental jolt. The jolt deals 1d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/4)}}d6) mental damage, with a basic Will save. If the target critically fails the save, it is also stunned 1.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4556,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4556,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Deafness","rank":2,"uuid":"2399229231731039","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1483","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:23:05.683709+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The target loses hearing; it must attempt a Fortitude save. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is deafened for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The target is deafened for 10 minutes.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is deafened permanently.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4556,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Deafness","rank":2,"uuid":"2399229231731039","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1483","book":"Player Core","page":"322"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:23:05.683709+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The target loses hearing; it must attempt a Fortitude save. The target is then temporarily immune for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is deafened for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The target is deafened for 10 minutes.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is deafened permanently.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4562,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4562,"area":"30-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Detect Magic","rank":0,"uuid":"1084194073031827","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1508,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1485","book":"Player Core","page":"323"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:23:49.968419+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.  \nYou detect [illusion](link_trait_1447) magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an [invisibility potion](link_item_7051)) typically are detected normally.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4562,"area":"30-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Detect Magic","rank":0,"uuid":"1084194073031827","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1508,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1485","book":"Player Core","page":"323"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:23:49.968419+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"You learn the rank or level of the most powerful magical effect the spell detects, as determined by the GM.","amount":"(3rd)"},{"text":"As 3rd rank, but you also pinpoint the source of the highest-rank magic. Like for an imprecise sense, you don't learn the exact location, but can narrow down the source to within a 5-foot cube (or the nearest if larger than that).","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You send out a pulse that registers the presence of magic. You receive no information beyond the presence or absence of magic. You can choose to ignore magic you're fully aware of, such as the magic items and ongoing spells of you and your allies.  \nYou detect [illusion](link_trait_1447) magic only if that magic's effect has a lower rank than the rank of your detect magic spell. However, items that have an illusion aura but aren't deceptive in appearance (such as an [invisibility potion](link_item_7051)) typically are detected normally.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4564,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4564,"area":"30-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Detect Scrying","rank":4,"uuid":"3092317640403303","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1508,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1487","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:24:03.172158+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration is until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"By reading trace auras, you detect the presence of [scrying](link_trait_1590) effects in the area. If _detect scrying_ is higher rank than a scrying effect, you gain a glimpse of the scrying creature and learn its approximate distance and direction.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4564,"area":"30-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Detect Scrying","rank":4,"uuid":"3092317640403303","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1508,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1487","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:24:03.172158+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration is until the next time you make your daily preparations.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"By reading trace auras, you detect the presence of [scrying](link_trait_1590) effects in the area. If _detect scrying_ is higher rank than a scrying effect, you gain a glimpse of the scrying creature and learn its approximate distance and direction.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4566,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4566,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dinosaur Form","rank":4,"uuid":"983800929959433","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1489","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:24:56.11138+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Your battle form is Huge and your attacks have 15-foot reach, or 20-foot reach if they started with 15-foot reach. You instead gain 20 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +18, a damage bonus of +6, double the damage dice, and Athletics +21.","amount":"(5th)"},{"text":"Your battle form is Gargantuan and your attacks have 20-foot reach, or 25-foot reach if they started with 15-foot reach. You instead gain AC = 21 + your level, 25 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +25, a damage bonus of +15, double the damage dice, and Athletics +25.","amount":"(7th)"}]},"traditions":["primal"],"description":"You channel the primal forces of nature to transform into a Large animal battle form, specifically that of a powerful and terrifying dinosaur. When you Cast this Spell, choose a listed battle form. You can decide the specific type of animal, but this has no effect on the form's Size or statistics. While in this form, you gain the animal and dinosaur traits. You can Dismiss the spell.\n\nYou gain the following statistics and abilities regardless of which battle form you choose:\n\n*   AC = 18 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.\n    \n*   15 temporary Hit Points.\n    \n*   Low-light vision and imprecise scent 30 feet.\n    \n*   One or more unarmed melee attacks specific to the battle form you choose, which are the only attacks you can Strike with. You're trained with them. Your attack modifier is +16, and your damage bonus is +9. These attacks are Strength based (for the purpose of the Enfeebled condition, for example). If your unarmed attack modifier is higher, you can use it instead.\n    \n*   Athletics modifier of +18, unless your own is higher.\n    \n\nYou also gain specific abilities based on the form you choose:\n\n*   **Ankylosaurus** Speed 25 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([backswing](link_trait_1619), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Brontosaurus** Speed 25 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d8 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Deinonychus** Speed 40 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> talon ([agile](link_trait_1569)), **Damage** 2d4 piercing plus 1 persistent bleed; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, **Damage** 1d10 piercing.\n    \n*   **Stegosaurus** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 2d8 piercing.\n    \n*   **Triceratops** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> horn, **Damage** 2d8 piercing, plus 1d6 persistent bleed on a critical hit; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Tyrannosaurus** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws ([deadly d12](link_trait_2529), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 1d12 piercing; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 1d10 bludgeoning.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4566,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dinosaur Form","rank":4,"uuid":"983800929959433","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1489","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:24:56.11138+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Your battle form is Huge and your attacks have 15-foot reach, or 20-foot reach if they started with 15-foot reach. You instead gain 20 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +18, a damage bonus of +6, double the damage dice, and Athletics +21.","amount":"(5th)"},{"text":"Your battle form is Gargantuan and your attacks have 20-foot reach, or 25-foot reach if they started with 15-foot reach. You instead gain AC = 21 + your level, 25 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +25, a damage bonus of +15, double the damage dice, and Athletics +25.","amount":"(7th)"}]},"traditions":["primal"],"description":"You channel the primal forces of nature to transform into a Large animal battle form, specifically that of a powerful and terrifying dinosaur. When you Cast this Spell, choose a listed battle form. You can decide the specific type of animal, but this has no effect on the form's Size or statistics. While in this form, you gain the animal and dinosaur traits. You can Dismiss the spell.\n\nYou gain the following statistics and abilities regardless of which battle form you choose:\n\n*   AC = 18 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.\n    \n*   15 temporary Hit Points.\n    \n*   Low-light vision and imprecise scent 30 feet.\n    \n*   One or more unarmed melee attacks specific to the battle form you choose, which are the only attacks you can Strike with. You're trained with them. Your attack modifier is +16, and your damage bonus is +9. These attacks are Strength based (for the purpose of the Enfeebled condition, for example). If your unarmed attack modifier is higher, you can use it instead.\n    \n*   Athletics modifier of +18, unless your own is higher.\n    \n\nYou also gain specific abilities based on the form you choose:\n\n*   **Ankylosaurus** Speed 25 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([backswing](link_trait_1619), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Brontosaurus** Speed 25 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d8 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Deinonychus** Speed 40 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> talon ([agile](link_trait_1569)), **Damage** 2d4 piercing plus 1 persistent bleed; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, **Damage** 1d10 piercing.\n    \n*   **Stegosaurus** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 2d8 piercing.\n    \n*   **Triceratops** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> horn, **Damage** 2d8 piercing, plus 1d6 persistent bleed on a critical hit; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> foot, **Damage** 2d6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Tyrannosaurus** Speed 30 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws ([deadly d12](link_trait_2529), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 1d12 piercing; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 1d10 bludgeoning.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4570,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4570,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Disguise Magic","rank":1,"uuid":"7504206631786883","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1447,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 item or spell effect","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until your next daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1491","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:31.764629+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{}},"text":[{"text":"You can Cast this Spell on a creature, disguising all items and spell effects on it.","amount":"(2nd)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You alter how an item's or spell's magical aura appears to effects like _detect magic_. You can hide the auras entirely, have an item register as a common item of lower level, or make a spell register as a common spell of the same or lower rank. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell. A caster using [_detect magic_](link_spell_4562) or [_read aura_](link_spell_4794) of a higher rank than _disguise magic_ can attempt to disbelieve the [illusion](link_trait_1447) using the skill matching the tradition of the spell (Arcana for [arcane](link_trait_1459), Religion for [divine](link_trait_1475), Occultism for [occult](link_trait_1514), or Nature for [primal](link_trait_1454)). Further attempts by the same caster get the same result as the initial check to disbelieve.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4570,"area":null,"cast":"1 minute","cost":"","name":"Disguise Magic","rank":1,"uuid":"7504206631786883","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1447,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 item or spell effect","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until your next daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1491","book":"Player Core","page":"324"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:31.764629+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{}},"text":[{"text":"You can Cast this Spell on a creature, disguising all items and spell effects on it.","amount":"(2nd)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You alter how an item's or spell's magical aura appears to effects like _detect magic_. You can hide the auras entirely, have an item register as a common item of lower level, or make a spell register as a common spell of the same or lower rank. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell. A caster using [_detect magic_](link_spell_4562) or [_read aura_](link_spell_4794) of a higher rank than _disguise magic_ can attempt to disbelieve the [illusion](link_trait_1447) using the skill matching the tradition of the spell (Arcana for [arcane](link_trait_1459), Religion for [divine](link_trait_1475), Occultism for [occult](link_trait_1514), or Nature for [primal](link_trait_1454)). Further attempts by the same caster get the same result as the initial check to disbelieve.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4571,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4571,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Disintegrate","rank":6,"uuid":"7659656978325603","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature, unattended object, or force construct","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1492","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:44.734881+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d10.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane"],"description":"A black tracer bolt flies toward your target, and upon making contact intensifies into a powerful destructive beam. Make a spell attack against the target. If you hit an object or force construct (such as a [wall of force](link_spell_4942)), it's destroyed with no save unless it's an [artifact](link_trait_1568) or similarly powerful. A single casting can destroy no more than a 10-foot cube of matter.\n\nIf you hit a creature, it takes 12d10 damage (no damage type) with a basic Fortitude save. If you critically hit, the target gets a result one degree of success worse than the outcome of its Fortitude save. A creature reduced to 0 HP is blasted to fine powder; its gear remains.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4571,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Disintegrate","rank":6,"uuid":"7659656978325603","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature, unattended object, or force construct","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1492","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:44.734881+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d10.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane"],"description":"A black tracer bolt flies toward your target, and upon making contact intensifies into a powerful destructive beam. Make a spell attack against the target. If you hit an object or force construct (such as a [wall of force](link_spell_4942)), it's destroyed with no save unless it's an [artifact](link_trait_1568) or similarly powerful. A single casting can destroy no more than a 10-foot cube of matter.\n\nIf you hit a creature, it takes 12d10 damage (no damage type) with a basic Fortitude save. If you critically hit, the target gets a result one degree of success worse than the outcome of its Fortitude save. A creature reduced to 0 HP is blasted to fine powder; its gear remains.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4572,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4572,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dispel Magic","rank":2,"uuid":"1858114821459349","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1493","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:50.829035+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a [counteract](link_action_27519) check against the target. If you successfully counteract a [magic](link_trait_1504) item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an [artifact](link_trait_1568) or similar item, you automatically fail.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4572,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dispel Magic","rank":2,"uuid":"1858114821459349","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 spell effect or unattended magic item","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1493","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:50.829035+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You unravel the magic behind a spell or effect. Attempt a [counteract](link_action_27519) check against the target. If you successfully counteract a [magic](link_trait_1504) item, the item becomes a mundane item of its type for 10 minutes. This doesn't change the item's non-magical properties. If the target is an [artifact](link_trait_1568) or similar item, you automatically fail.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4573,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4573,"area":"10-foot burst centered on one corner of your space","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dispelling Globe","rank":4,"uuid":"6882912781781278","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1494","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:59.28447+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You create an immobile globe around yourself that attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) any spell from outside the globe whose area or targets enter into the globe, as if the globe were a [dispel magic](link_spell_4572) spell 1 rank lower than its actual spell rank.\n\nIf the [counteract](link_action_27519) attempt succeeds, it prevents only the portion of the spell that would have entered the globe (so if the spell also has targets outside the globe, or part of its area is beyond the globe, those targets or that area is affected normally).\n\nYou must form the sphere in an unbroken open space, so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost (though creatures can enter the globe after the spell is cast).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4573,"area":"10-foot burst centered on one corner of your space","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dispelling Globe","rank":4,"uuid":"6882912781781278","range":"","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"10 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1494","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:25:59.28447+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You create an immobile globe around yourself that attempts to [counteract](link_action_27519) any spell from outside the globe whose area or targets enter into the globe, as if the globe were a [dispel magic](link_spell_4572) spell 1 rank lower than its actual spell rank.\n\nIf the [counteract](link_action_27519) attempt succeeds, it prevents only the portion of the spell that would have entered the globe (so if the spell also has targets outside the globe, or part of its area is beyond the globe, those targets or that area is affected normally).\n\nYou must form the sphere in an unbroken open space, so its edges don't pass through any creatures or objects, or the spell is lost (though creatures can enter the globe after the spell is cast).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4575,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4575,"area":"40-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Decree","rank":7,"uuid":"383100224361729","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1495","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:22.2376+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d10, and the level of creatures that must attempt a second save on a critical failure increases by 2.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You utter a potent litany from your faith, a mandate that harms those who oppose your ideals. You deal 7d10 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage to your enemies in the area; each enemy must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute. If you're on your home plane and the creature is not, the creature is sent back to its home plane. A creature of 10th level or lower must also succeed at a Will save or be paralyzed for 1 minute; if it critically fails, it dies (this is a [death](link_trait_1904) effect).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4575,"area":"40-foot emanation","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Decree","rank":7,"uuid":"383100224361729","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1495","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:22.2376+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d10, and the level of creatures that must attempt a second save on a critical failure increases by 2.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You utter a potent litany from your faith, a mandate that harms those who oppose your ideals. You deal 7d10 [spirit](link_trait_1556) damage to your enemies in the area; each enemy must attempt a Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage and is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute. If you're on your home plane and the creature is not, the creature is sent back to its home plane. A creature of 10th level or lower must also succeed at a Will save or be paralyzed for 1 minute; if it critically fails, it dies (this is a [death](link_trait_1904) effect).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4576,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4576,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Immolation","rank":5,"uuid":"8702715758923686","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433,1897,1556],"defense":"Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1496","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:30.693491+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"b9dAiWfV57lyCWpP":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6 and persistent damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"Divine flames scour creatures within the area. Creatures take 6d6 fire damage and 2d6 persistent fire damage. The divine power within the flames scorches the spirit as well; a creature takes spirit damage instead of fire damage from divine immolation if that would be more detrimental to the creature (as determined by the GM).\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage and no persistent damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and persistent damage.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage and double persistent damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4576,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Immolation","rank":5,"uuid":"8702715758923686","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433,1897,1556],"defense":"Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1496","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:30.693491+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"b9dAiWfV57lyCWpP":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6 and persistent damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"Divine flames scour creatures within the area. Creatures take 6d6 fire damage and 2d6 persistent fire damage. The divine power within the flames scorches the spirit as well; a creature takes spirit damage instead of fire damage from divine immolation if that would be more detrimental to the creature (as determined by the GM).\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage and no persistent damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and persistent damage.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes double damage and double persistent damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4578,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4578,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Lance","rank":0,"uuid":"7267797942932440","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1858,1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1498","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:44.59414+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4578,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Lance","rank":0,"uuid":"7267797942932440","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1858,1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1498","book":"Player Core","page":"325"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:44.59414+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You unleash a beam of divine energy. Make a ranged spell attack against the target's AC. On a hit, the target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) spirit damage (double damage on a critical hit).","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4579,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4579,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Wrath","rank":4,"uuid":"3047205529673834","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1499","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:54.883718+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d10.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and is sickened 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes full damage and is sickened 2; while it's sickened, it's also slowed 1.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4579,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Divine Wrath","rank":4,"uuid":"3047205529673834","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1897,1556],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1499","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:26:54.883718+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d10"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d10.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You channel the fury of divinity against your foes. You deal 4d10 spirit damage to enemies in the area, depending on their Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature takes half damage.\n\n**Failure** The creature takes full damage and is sickened 1.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature takes full damage and is sickened 2; while it's sickened, it's also slowed 1.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4580,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4580,"area":"15-foot cone","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dizzying Colors","rank":1,"uuid":"7307619725237299","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1447,1479,1481],"defense":"Will","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 or more rounds (see below)","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1500","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:27:03.669+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You unleash a swirling multitude of colors that overwhelms creatures based on their Will saves.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is stunned 1, blinded for 1 round, and dazzled for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is stunned for 1 round and blinded for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4580,"area":"15-foot cone","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dizzying Colors","rank":1,"uuid":"7307619725237299","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1447,1479,1481],"defense":"Will","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 or more rounds (see below)","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1500","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:27:03.669+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You unleash a swirling multitude of colors that overwhelms creatures based on their Will saves.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature is dazzled for 1 round.\n\n**Failure** The creature is stunned 1, blinded for 1 round, and dazzled for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is stunned for 1 round and blinded for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4581,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4581,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dominate","rank":6,"uuid":"6091899604552313","range":"30 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1481,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1501","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:27:13.11803+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration is unlimited.","amount":"(10th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You take command of the target, forcing it to obey your orders. If you issue an obviously self-destructive order, the target doesn't act until you issue a new order. The effect depends on its Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is stunned 1 as it fights off your commands.\n\n**Failure** You control the target. It gains the controlled condition, but it can attempt a Will save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.\n\n**Critical Failure** As a failure, but the target receives a new save only if you give it a new order that is against its nature, such as killing its allies.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4581,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dominate","rank":6,"uuid":"6091899604552313","range":"30 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1432,1481,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the next time you make your daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1501","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:27:13.11803+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration is unlimited.","amount":"(10th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You take command of the target, forcing it to obey your orders. If you issue an obviously self-destructive order, the target doesn't act until you issue a new order. The effect depends on its Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is stunned 1 as it fights off your commands.\n\n**Failure** You control the target. It gains the controlled condition, but it can attempt a Will save at the end of each of its turns. On a success, the spell ends.\n\n**Critical Failure** As a failure, but the target receives a new save only if you give it a new order that is against its nature, such as killing its allies.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4583,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4583,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dragon Form","rank":6,"uuid":"2362990534214107","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1502","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:29:03.564103+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Your battle form is Huge, you gain a +20-foot status bonus to your fly Speed, and your attacks have 10-foot reach (or 15-foot reach if they previously had 10-foot reach). You instead gain AC = 21 + your level, 15 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +28, a damage bonus of +12, and Athletics +28. Your Dragon Breath deals an additional 4d6 damage.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"Calling upon powerful magic, you gain a Large dragon battle form. When you Cast this Spell, choose one type of common dragon or another type to which your GM allows access. While in this form, you gain the [dragon](link_trait_2402) trait. You have hands in this battle form and can take [manipulate](link_trait_1433) actions. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.\n\nYou gain the following statistics and abilities regardless of which battle form you choose:\n\n*   AC = 18 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.\n    \n*   10 temporary Hit Points.\n    \n*   Speed 40 feet, [fly](link_action_19721) 100 feet. You gain any of the following Speeds the chosen dragon has, but with the listed amount: [burrow](link_action_19609) 20 feet, [climb](link_action_19612) 40 feet, [swim](link_action_19859) 60 feet.\n    \n*   Resistance 10 against the damage type of your Dragon Breath (see below).\n    \n*   [Darkvision](link_sense_20769) and imprecise scent 60 feet.\n    \n*   The following [unarmed](link_trait_2398) melee attacks, which are the only attacks you can [Strike](link_action_19856) with. You're trained with them. Your attack modifier is +22, and your damage bonus is +6. These attacks are Strength based (for the purpose of the enfeebled condition, for example). If your unarmed attack modifier is higher, you can use it instead. See below for more on these attacks.  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, **Damage** 2d12 piercing plus 2d6 damage of the same damage type as your Dragon Breath (see below)  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> claw ([agile](link_trait_1569)), **Damage** 3d10 slashing  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach](link_trait_1573) 10 feet), **Damage** 3d10 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   Athletics modifier of +23, unless your own is higher.\n    \n*   **Dragon Breath** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> You exhale deadly [magical](link_trait_1504) energy in an area, dealing 10d6 damage to each creature in the area with a basic save against your spell DC. The shape, damage type, and save type match that of your chosen dragon's breath. If the chosen dragon's breath can deal more than one type of damage, choose one when you cast _dragon form_. The shape is a 30-foot cone or a 100- foot line. Once activated, Dragon Breath can't be used again for 1d4 rounds. Dragon Breath has the tradition trait matching the type of dragon and the damage trait matching the type of damage it deals, if applicable.\n    \n*   **Tradition Resistance** If the dragon's magical tradition matches that of your dragon form spell, you gain the listed ability.  \n    **Arcane** resistance 5 against damage from spells  \n    **Divine** resistance 10 to spirit, vitality, and void  \n    **Occult** resistance 10 to mental  \n    **Primal** resistance 5 to physical damage.\n    \n\n* * *\n\n#### Monster Core Dragons\n\nThe dragons from Monster Core use the following specifications for dragon form.\n\n| **Dragon** | **Tradition** | **Speeds** | **Dragon Breath** | **Saving Throw** |\n\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | [Primal](link_trait_1454) | Burrow | Cone of bludgeoning | Reflex |\n\n| Conspirator | [Occult](link_trait_1514) | Climb | Cone of poison | Fortitude |\n\n| Diabolic | [Divine](link_trait_1475) | — | Cone of fire | Reflex |\n\n| Empyreal | [Divine](link_trait_1475) | — | Cone of spirit | Reflex |\n\n| Fortune | [Arcane](link_trait_1459) | — | Cone of force | Reflex |\n\n| Horned | [Primal](link_trait_1454) | Swim | Cone of poison | Fortitude |\n\n| Mirage | [Arcane](link_trait_1459) | Climb | Cone of mental | Will |\n\n| Omen | [Occult](link_trait_1514) | — | Cone of mental | Will |\n\n* * *","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4583,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Dragon Form","rank":6,"uuid":"2362990534214107","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1502","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:29:03.564103+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Your battle form is Huge, you gain a +20-foot status bonus to your fly Speed, and your attacks have 10-foot reach (or 15-foot reach if they previously had 10-foot reach). You instead gain AC = 21 + your level, 15 temporary HP, an attack modifier of +28, a damage bonus of +12, and Athletics +28. Your Dragon Breath deals an additional 4d6 damage.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"Calling upon powerful magic, you gain a Large dragon battle form. When you Cast this Spell, choose one type of common dragon or another type to which your GM allows access. While in this form, you gain the [dragon](link_trait_2402) trait. You have hands in this battle form and can take [manipulate](link_trait_1433) actions. You can [Dismiss](link_action_19627) the spell.\n\nYou gain the following statistics and abilities regardless of which battle form you choose:\n\n*   AC = 18 + your level. Ignore your armor's check penalty and Speed reduction.\n    \n*   10 temporary Hit Points.\n    \n*   Speed 40 feet, [fly](link_action_19721) 100 feet. You gain any of the following Speeds the chosen dragon has, but with the listed amount: [burrow](link_action_19609) 20 feet, [climb](link_action_19612) 40 feet, [swim](link_action_19859) 60 feet.\n    \n*   Resistance 10 against the damage type of your Dragon Breath (see below).\n    \n*   [Darkvision](link_sense_20769) and imprecise scent 60 feet.\n    \n*   The following [unarmed](link_trait_2398) melee attacks, which are the only attacks you can [Strike](link_action_19856) with. You're trained with them. Your attack modifier is +22, and your damage bonus is +6. These attacks are Strength based (for the purpose of the enfeebled condition, for example). If your unarmed attack modifier is higher, you can use it instead. See below for more on these attacks.  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, **Damage** 2d12 piercing plus 2d6 damage of the same damage type as your Dragon Breath (see below)  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> claw ([agile](link_trait_1569)), **Damage** 3d10 slashing  \n    **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([reach](link_trait_1573) 10 feet), **Damage** 3d10 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   Athletics modifier of +23, unless your own is higher.\n    \n*   **Dragon Breath** <abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> You exhale deadly [magical](link_trait_1504) energy in an area, dealing 10d6 damage to each creature in the area with a basic save against your spell DC. The shape, damage type, and save type match that of your chosen dragon's breath. If the chosen dragon's breath can deal more than one type of damage, choose one when you cast _dragon form_. The shape is a 30-foot cone or a 100- foot line. Once activated, Dragon Breath can't be used again for 1d4 rounds. Dragon Breath has the tradition trait matching the type of dragon and the damage trait matching the type of damage it deals, if applicable.\n    \n*   **Tradition Resistance** If the dragon's magical tradition matches that of your dragon form spell, you gain the listed ability.  \n    **Arcane** resistance 5 against damage from spells  \n    **Divine** resistance 10 to spirit, vitality, and void  \n    **Occult** resistance 10 to mental  \n    **Primal** resistance 5 to physical damage.\n    \n\n* * *\n\n#### Monster Core Dragons\n\nThe dragons from Monster Core use the following specifications for dragon form.\n\n| **Dragon** | **Tradition** | **Speeds** | **Dragon Breath** | **Saving Throw** |\n\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n\n| Adamantine | [Primal](link_trait_1454) | Burrow | Cone of bludgeoning | Reflex |\n\n| Conspirator | [Occult](link_trait_1514) | Climb | Cone of poison | Fortitude |\n\n| Diabolic | [Divine](link_trait_1475) | — | Cone of fire | Reflex |\n\n| Empyreal | [Divine](link_trait_1475) | — | Cone of spirit | Reflex |\n\n| Fortune | [Arcane](link_trait_1459) | — | Cone of force | Reflex |\n\n| Horned | [Primal](link_trait_1454) | Swim | Cone of poison | Fortitude |\n\n| Mirage | [Arcane](link_trait_1459) | Climb | Cone of mental | Will |\n\n| Omen | [Occult](link_trait_1514) | — | Cone of mental | Will |\n\n* * *","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4584,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4584,"area":null,"cast":"10 minutes","cost":"","name":"Dream Message","rank":3,"uuid":"5817138680124007","range":"planetary","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature you know by name and have met in person","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until your next daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1503","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:29:14.992748+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"4":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures you know by name and have met in person"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures you know by name and have met in person. You must send the same message to all of them; the spell ends for each creature individually","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You send a message to your target's dream. The message is one-way, up to 1 minute of speech (roughly 150 words). If the target is asleep, they receive the message instantly. If not, they receive it the next time they sleep. As soon as they receive it, the spell ends, and you know the message was sent.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4584,"area":null,"cast":"10 minutes","cost":"","name":"Dream Message","rank":3,"uuid":"5817138680124007","range":"planetary","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature you know by name and have met in person","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until your next daily preparations","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1503","book":"Player Core","page":"326"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:29:14.992748+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"4":{"target":{"value":"10 creatures you know by name and have met in person"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to 10 creatures you know by name and have met in person. You must send the same message to all of them; the spell ends for each creature individually","amount":"(4th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You send a message to your target's dream. The message is one-way, up to 1 minute of speech (roughly 150 words). If the target is asleep, they receive the message instantly. If not, they receive it the next time they sleep. As soon as they receive it, the spell ends, and you know the message was sent.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4588,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4588,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Earthbind","rank":3,"uuid":"6059359056839578","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1523,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 flying creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1506","book":"Player Core","page":"327"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:30:08.984087+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Using the weight of earth, you hamper a target's flight, with effects based on its Fortitude save. If the creature reaches the ground safely, it doesn't take falling damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target falls safely up to 120 feet.\n\n**Failure** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't [Fly](link_action_19721), [levitate](link_spell_4697), or otherwise leave the ground for 1 round.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4588,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Earthbind","rank":3,"uuid":"6059359056839578","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1523,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 flying creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1506","book":"Player Core","page":"327"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:30:08.984087+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Using the weight of earth, you hamper a target's flight, with effects based on its Fortitude save. If the creature reaches the ground safely, it doesn't take falling damage.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target falls safely up to 120 feet.\n\n**Failure** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't [Fly](link_action_19721), [levitate](link_spell_4697), or otherwise leave the ground for 1 round.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target falls safely up to 120 feet. If it hits the ground, it can't Fly, levitate, or otherwise leave the ground for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4592,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4592,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Electric Arc","rank":0,"uuid":"2461892246724637","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1576,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"1 or 2 creatures","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1509","book":"Player Core","page":"328"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:30:52.215827+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4592,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Electric Arc","rank":0,"uuid":"2461892246724637","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1576,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"1 or 2 creatures","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1509","book":"Player Core","page":"328"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:30:52.215827+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"An arc of lightning leaps from one target to another. Each target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) electricity damage with a basic Reflex save.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4599,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4599,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enfeeble","rank":1,"uuid":"5207059992984534","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1513","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:20.671092+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You sap the target's strength, depending on its Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is enfeebled 1 until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Failure** The target is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is enfeebled 3 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4599,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enfeeble","rank":1,"uuid":"5207059992984534","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1513","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:20.671092+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult"],"description":"You sap the target's strength, depending on its Fortitude save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is enfeebled 1 until the start of your next turn.\n\n**Failure** The target is enfeebled 2 for 1 minute.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is enfeebled 3 for 1 minute.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4601,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4601,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enlarge","rank":2,"uuid":"6124057272576338","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"1 willing creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"5 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1514","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:34.515708+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"10 willing creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The creature instead grows to size Huge. The status bonus to melee damage is +4 and the creature's reach increases by 10 feet (or 15 feet if the creature started out Tiny). The spell has no effect on a Huge or larger creature.","amount":"(4th)"},{"text":"Choose either the 2nd-rank or 4th-rank version of this spell and apply its effects to up to 10 willing creatures.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Bolstered by magical power, the target grows to size Large. Its equipment grows with it but returns to natural size if removed. The creature is clumsy 1. Its reach increases by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if it started out Tiny), and it gains a +2 status bonus to damage rolls on melee [Strikes](link_action_19856). This spell has no effect on a Large or larger creature.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4601,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enlarge","rank":2,"uuid":"6124057272576338","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"1 willing creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"5 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1514","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:34.515708+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"10 willing creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"The creature instead grows to size Huge. The status bonus to melee damage is +4 and the creature's reach increases by 10 feet (or 15 feet if the creature started out Tiny). The spell has no effect on a Huge or larger creature.","amount":"(4th)"},{"text":"Choose either the 2nd-rank or 4th-rank version of this spell and apply its effects to up to 10 willing creatures.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Bolstered by magical power, the target grows to size Large. Its equipment grows with it but returns to natural size if removed. The creature is clumsy 1. Its reach increases by 5 feet (or by 10 feet if it started out Tiny), and it gains a +2 status bonus to damage rolls on melee [Strikes](link_action_19856). This spell has no effect on a Large or larger creature.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4602,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4602,"area":"all squares in a 20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Entangling Flora","rank":2,"uuid":"3807559010320601","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1680,2938],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1515","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:44.468712+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Plants and fungi burst out or quickly grow, entangling creatures. All surfaces in the area are difficult terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it's also immobilized for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) to remove these effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4602,"area":"all squares in a 20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Entangling Flora","rank":2,"uuid":"3807559010320601","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433,1680,2938],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1515","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:32:44.468712+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"Plants and fungi burst out or quickly grow, entangling creatures. All surfaces in the area are difficult terrain. Each round that a creature starts its turn in the area, it must attempt a Reflex save. On a failure, it takes a –10-foot circumstance penalty to its Speeds until it leaves the area, and on a critical failure, it's also immobilized for 1 round. Creatures can attempt to [Escape](link_action_19632) to remove these effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4603,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4603,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enthrall","rank":3,"uuid":"8430406010494590","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1486,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"all creatures in range","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1516","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:33:00.120161+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"Your words fascinate your targets. You speak or sing without interruption throughout the casting and duration. Targets who notice your speech or song might give their undivided attention; each target must attempt a Will save. The GM might grant a circumstance bonus (to a maximum of +4) if the target is of an opposing religion, ancestry, or political leaning, or is otherwise unlikely to agree with what you're saying.\n\nEach creature that comes within range has to attempt a save when you [Sustain the spell](link_action_20948). If you're speaking, enthrall gains the [linguistic](link_trait_1458) trait.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected and notices that you tried to use magic.\n\n**Success** The target needn't pay attention but doesn't notice you tried to use magic (it might notice others are enthralled).\n\n**Failure** The target is fascinated with you. It can attempt another Will save if it witnesses actions or speech with which it disagrees. If it succeeds, it's no longer fascinated and is temporarily immune for 1 hour. If the target is subject to a hostile act, or if another creature succeeds at a Diplomacy or Intimidation check against it, the fascination ends immediately.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target can't attempt a save to end the fascination if it disagrees with you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4603,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Enthrall","rank":3,"uuid":"8430406010494590","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1469,1432,1486,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"all creatures in range","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1516","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:33:00.120161+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"Your words fascinate your targets. You speak or sing without interruption throughout the casting and duration. Targets who notice your speech or song might give their undivided attention; each target must attempt a Will save. The GM might grant a circumstance bonus (to a maximum of +4) if the target is of an opposing religion, ancestry, or political leaning, or is otherwise unlikely to agree with what you're saying.\n\nEach creature that comes within range has to attempt a save when you [Sustain the spell](link_action_20948). If you're speaking, enthrall gains the [linguistic](link_trait_1458) trait.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected and notices that you tried to use magic.\n\n**Success** The target needn't pay attention but doesn't notice you tried to use magic (it might notice others are enthralled).\n\n**Failure** The target is fascinated with you. It can attempt another Will save if it witnesses actions or speech with which it disagrees. If it succeeds, it's no longer fascinated and is temporarily immune for 1 hour. If the target is subject to a hostile act, or if another creature succeeds at a Diplomacy or Intimidation check against it, the fascination ends immediately.\n\n**Critical Failure** As failure, but the target can't attempt a save to end the fascination if it disagrees with you.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4607,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4607,"area":null,"cast":"THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Everlight","rank":2,"uuid":"5922864231051375","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1517,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"a gemstone worth 6 gp or more","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"unlimited","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1518","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:33:32.090552+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The gemstone you touch glows, spreading bright light with a color of your choice in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet). The spell ends immediately if the gemstone is broken.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4607,"area":null,"cast":"THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Everlight","rank":2,"uuid":"5922864231051375","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1517,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"a gemstone worth 6 gp or more","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"unlimited","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1518","book":"Player Core","page":"329"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:33:32.090552+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The gemstone you touch glows, spreading bright light with a color of your choice in a 20-foot radius (and dim light for the next 20 feet). The spell ends immediately if the gemstone is broken.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4612,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4612,"area":"4 40-foot bursts","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Falling Stars","rank":9,"uuid":"2530216747468297","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1521","book":"Player Core","page":"330"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:24.172127+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"5hgRJg7CfV9pZSUa":"1d10","RrsNfz6nzSiUPvoY":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10, and the energy damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You reach into the skies and call down an array of falling stars that explode upon colliding with the ground. Choose for the falling stars to be airbursts ([sonic](link_trait_1484)), asteroids ([fire](link_trait_1542)), comets ([cold](link_trait_1519)), or plasma ([electricity](link_trait_1576)). The spell gains the trait of the falling star type you chose. The four stars' central 10-foot bursts can't overlap. Each falling star deals 6d10 bludgeoning damage to each creature in the 10-foot burst at the center of its area of effect before exploding, dealing 14d6 energy damage of the type you chose to each creature in its 40-foot burst. A creature in any of the areas attempts one basic Reflex save against the spell no matter how many overlapping explosions it's caught in and can take each type of damage only once.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4612,"area":"4 40-foot bursts","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Falling Stars","rank":9,"uuid":"2530216747468297","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1521","book":"Player Core","page":"330"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:24.172127+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"5hgRJg7CfV9pZSUa":"1d10","RrsNfz6nzSiUPvoY":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The bludgeoning damage increases by 1d10, and the energy damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You reach into the skies and call down an array of falling stars that explode upon colliding with the ground. Choose for the falling stars to be airbursts ([sonic](link_trait_1484)), asteroids ([fire](link_trait_1542)), comets ([cold](link_trait_1519)), or plasma ([electricity](link_trait_1576)). The spell gains the trait of the falling star type you chose. The four stars' central 10-foot bursts can't overlap. Each falling star deals 6d10 bludgeoning damage to each creature in the 10-foot burst at the center of its area of effect before exploding, dealing 14d6 energy damage of the type you chose to each creature in its 40-foot burst. A creature in any of the areas attempts one basic Reflex save against the spell no matter how many overlapping explosions it's caught in and can take each type of damage only once.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4614,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4614,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"False Vitality","rank":2,"uuid":"3818416868866907","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"8 hours","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1523","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:37.235059+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The temporary Hit Points increase by 3.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You augment your flesh with the energies typically used to manipulate the undead. You gain 10 temporary Hit Points.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4614,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"False Vitality","rank":2,"uuid":"3818416868866907","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"8 hours","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1523","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:37.235059+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The temporary Hit Points increase by 3.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You augment your flesh with the energies typically used to manipulate the undead. You gain 10 temporary Hit Points.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4616,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4616,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fear","rank":1,"uuid":"8944503412485645","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1487,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1524","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:58.353788+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to five creatures.","amount":"(3rd)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is frightened 1.\n\n**Failure** The target is frightened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is frightened 3 and fleeing for 1 round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4616,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fear","rank":1,"uuid":"8944503412485645","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1486,1487,1433,1448],"defense":"Will","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"varies","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1524","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:34:58.353788+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"3":{"target":{"value":"5 creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"You can target up to five creatures.","amount":"(3rd)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You plant fear in the target; it must attempt a Will save.\n\n**Critical Success** The target is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The target is frightened 1.\n\n**Failure** The target is frightened 2.\n\n**Critical Failure** The target is frightened 3 and fleeing for 1 round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4618,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4618,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Field of Life","rank":6,"uuid":"8444048987503747","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1442,1433,1478],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1526","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:11.815267+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"","formula":"1d10","applyMod":false,"category":null,"materials":[]}}},"9":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"","formula":"1d12","applyMod":false,"category":null,"materials":[]}}}}},"text":[{"text":"The healing and damage increase to 1d10.","amount":"(8th)"},{"text":"The healing and damage increase to 1d12.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","primal"],"description":"A field of life energy fills the area, exuding warmth and rejuvenating those within. Each living creature that starts its turn in the area regains 1d8 Hit Points, and any undead creature that starts its turn in the area takes 1d8 vitality damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4618,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Field of Life","rank":6,"uuid":"8444048987503747","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1442,1433,1478],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1526","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:11.815267+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"8":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"","formula":"1d10","applyMod":false,"category":null,"materials":[]}}},"9":{"damage":{"0":{"type":"","formula":"1d12","applyMod":false,"category":null,"materials":[]}}}}},"text":[{"text":"The healing and damage increase to 1d10.","amount":"(8th)"},{"text":"The healing and damage increase to 1d12.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","primal"],"description":"A field of life energy fills the area, exuding warmth and rejuvenating those within. Each living creature that starts its turn in the area regains 1d8 Hit Points, and any undead creature that starts its turn in the area takes 1d8 vitality damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4619,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4619,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fiery Body","rank":7,"uuid":"2632401468329736","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1527","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:24.548735+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Creatures touching you take 4d6 fire damage instead of 3d6, your unarmed attacks deal 2d4 additional fire damage, and you have a fly Speed of 60 feet.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You become living flame, giving you fire immunity, resistance 10 to precision damage, and weakness 5 to cold and to water. Any creature that touches you or damages you with an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack or non-[reach](link_trait_1573) melee weapon takes 3d6 fire damage.\n\nYour unarmed attacks deal an additional 1d4 fire damage, and your fire spells deal one additional die of fire damage (of the same damage die the spell uses). You can cast [_ignition_](link_spell_4674) as an innate spell; the casting is reduced from 2 actions to 1.\n\nIn fire form, you have a fly Speed of 40 feet and don't need to breathe.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4619,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fiery Body","rank":7,"uuid":"2632401468329736","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433,1453],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1527","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:24.548735+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"Creatures touching you take 4d6 fire damage instead of 3d6, your unarmed attacks deal 2d4 additional fire damage, and you have a fly Speed of 60 feet.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You become living flame, giving you fire immunity, resistance 10 to precision damage, and weakness 5 to cold and to water. Any creature that touches you or damages you with an [unarmed](link_trait_2398) attack or non-[reach](link_trait_1573) melee weapon takes 3d6 fire damage.\n\nYour unarmed attacks deal an additional 1d4 fire damage, and your fire spells deal one additional die of fire damage (of the same damage die the spell uses). You can cast [_ignition_](link_spell_4674) as an innate spell; the casting is reduced from 2 actions to 1.\n\nIn fire form, you have a fly Speed of 40 feet and don't need to breathe.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4620,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4620,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Figment","rank":0,"uuid":"6578770410639111","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1447,1433,1899],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1528","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:36.801319+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create a simple illusory sound or vision. A sound adds the [auditory](link_trait_1469) trait to the spell and the sound can't include intelligible words or elaborate music. A vision adds the [visual](link_trait_1479) trait, can be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and is clearly crude and undetailed if viewed from within 15 feet. When you [Cast](link_action_19611) or [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell, you can attempt to [Create a Diversion](link_action_19619) with the illusion, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception check. If the attempt fails against a creature, that creature disbelieves the _figment_.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4620,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Figment","rank":0,"uuid":"6578770410639111","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1447,1433,1899],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1528","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:36.801319+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You create a simple illusory sound or vision. A sound adds the [auditory](link_trait_1469) trait to the spell and the sound can't include intelligible words or elaborate music. A vision adds the [visual](link_trait_1479) trait, can be no larger than a 5-foot cube, and is clearly crude and undetailed if viewed from within 15 feet. When you [Cast](link_action_19611) or [Sustain](link_action_19858) the spell, you can attempt to [Create a Diversion](link_action_19619) with the illusion, gaining a +2 circumstance bonus to your Deception check. If the attempt fails against a creature, that creature disbelieves the _figment_.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4622,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4622,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fire Shield","rank":4,"uuid":"1826703953693524","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1529","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:53.634326+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The cold resistance increases by 5, the HP increase by 10, and the fire damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You create a hovering shield made of fire. As long as the shield persists, its heat grants you cold resistance 5 and makes you immune to mild and severe environmental cold. You can [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750) with the _fire shield_ as a normal shield to gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC. You can use the [Shield Block](link_class-feature_19228) reaction with the _fire shield_, which has Hardness 10, is immune to fire, and has 40 HP (with no Broken Threshold), and its Hardness is halved against effects that have the [water](link_trait_1584) trait. If you Shield Block a melee attack that is either an unarmed attack or made by an adjacent attacker, the attacker takes 2d6 fire damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4622,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fire Shield","rank":4,"uuid":"1826703953693524","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1529","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:53.634326+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The cold resistance increases by 5, the HP increase by 10, and the fire damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You create a hovering shield made of fire. As long as the shield persists, its heat grants you cold resistance 5 and makes you immune to mild and severe environmental cold. You can [Raise a Shield](link_action_19750) with the _fire shield_ as a normal shield to gain a +1 circumstance bonus to AC. You can use the [Shield Block](link_class-feature_19228) reaction with the _fire shield_, which has Hardness 10, is immune to fire, and has 40 HP (with no Broken Threshold), and its Hardness is halved against effects that have the [water](link_trait_1584) trait. If you Shield Block a melee attack that is either an unarmed attack or made by an adjacent attacker, the attacker takes 2d6 fire damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4623,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4623,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fireball","rank":3,"uuid":"1361832907217357","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1530","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:57.763905+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A roaring blast of fire detonates at a spot you designate, dealing 6d6 fire damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4623,"area":"20-foot burst","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fireball","rank":3,"uuid":"1361832907217357","range":"500 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1530","book":"Player Core","page":"331"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:35:57.763905+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"2d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 2d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A roaring blast of fire detonates at a spot you designate, dealing 6d6 fire damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4625,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4625,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fleet Step","rank":1,"uuid":"1475247979105746","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1531","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:08.915065+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You gain a +30-foot status bonus to your Speed.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4625,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fleet Step","rank":1,"uuid":"1475247979105746","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1531","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:08.915065+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You gain a +30-foot status bonus to your Speed.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4627,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4627,"area":"5-foot square","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Floating Flame","rank":2,"uuid":"5318096316894504","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1533","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:27.04115+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You create a fire that burns without fuel and moves to your commands. The flame deals 3d6 fire damage to each creature in the square in which it appears, with a basic Reflex save. When you [Sustain](link_action_20948) this spell, you can levitate the flame up to 10 feet. It then deals damage to each creature whose space it shared at any point during its flight. This uses the same damage and save, and you roll the damage once each time you [Sustain](link_action_20948). A given creature can take damage from floating flame only once per round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4627,"area":"5-foot square","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Floating Flame","rank":2,"uuid":"5318096316894504","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1542,1433],"defense":"basic Reflex","targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1533","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:27.04115+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You create a fire that burns without fuel and moves to your commands. The flame deals 3d6 fire damage to each creature in the square in which it appears, with a basic Reflex save. When you [Sustain](link_action_20948) this spell, you can levitate the flame up to 10 feet. It then deals damage to each creature whose space it shared at any point during its flight. This uses the same damage and save, and you roll the damage once each time you [Sustain](link_action_20948). A given creature can take damage from floating flame only once per round.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4628,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4628,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fly","rank":4,"uuid":"2808703816906071","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"5 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1534","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:32.674742+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration increases to 1 hour.","amount":"(7th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The target can soar through the air, gaining a fly Speed equal to its Speed or 20 feet, whichever is greater.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4628,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Fly","rank":4,"uuid":"2808703816906071","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"5 minutes","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1534","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:32.674742+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The duration increases to 1 hour.","amount":"(7th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","divine","occult","primal"],"description":"The target can soar through the air, gaining a fly Speed equal to its Speed or 20 feet, whichever is greater.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4629,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4629,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Forbidding Ward","rank":0,"uuid":"6471473735025039","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 ally and 1 enemy","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1535","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:39.6305+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The status bonus increases to +2.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You ward an ally against the attacks and hostile spells from the target enemy. The target ally gains a +1 status bonus to Armor Class and saving throws against the target enemy's attacks, spells, and other effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4629,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Forbidding Ward","rank":0,"uuid":"6471473735025039","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 ally and 1 enemy","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"sustained up to 1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1535","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:39.6305+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"The status bonus increases to +2.","amount":"(6th)"}]},"traditions":["divine","occult"],"description":"You ward an ally against the attacks and hostile spells from the target enemy. The target ally gains a +1 status bonus to Armor Class and saving throws against the target enemy's attacks, spells, and other effects.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4630,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4630,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Force Barrage","rank":1,"uuid":"5081422023991248","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1560,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1536","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:46.780726+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"You fire one additional shard with each action you spend.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You fire a shard of solidified magic toward a creature that you can see. It automatically hits and deals 1d4+1 force damage. For each additional action you use when [Casting the Spell](link_action_19611), increase the number of shards you shoot by one, to a maximum of three shards for 3 actions. You choose the target for each shard individually. If you shoot more than one shard at the same target, combine the damage before applying bonuses or penalties to damage, resistances, weaknesses, and so forth.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4630,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Force Barrage","rank":1,"uuid":"5081422023991248","range":"120 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1560,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1536","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:36:46.780726+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[{"text":"You fire one additional shard with each action you spend.","amount":"(+2)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"You fire a shard of solidified magic toward a creature that you can see. It automatically hits and deals 1d4+1 force damage. For each additional action you use when [Casting the Spell](link_action_19611), increase the number of shards you shoot by one, to a maximum of three shards for 3 actions. You choose the target for each shard individually. If you shoot more than one shard at the same target, combine the damage before applying bonuses or penalties to damage, resistances, weaknesses, and so forth.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4636,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4636,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Frostbite","rank":0,"uuid":"6666610303869653","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1519,1432,1433],"defense":"basic Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1539","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:37:32.597975+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) [cold](link_trait_1519) damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)}}) to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4636,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Frostbite","rank":0,"uuid":"6666610303869653","range":"60 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1519,1432,1433],"defense":"basic Fortitude","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1539","book":"Player Core","page":"332"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:37:32.597975+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"3bsJUDEgedKhPx6T":"1d4"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d4 and the weakness on a critical failure increases by 1.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"An orb of biting cold coalesces around your target, freezing its body. The target takes 2d4 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d4) [cold](link_trait_1519) damage with a basic Fortitude save. On a critical failure, the target also gains weakness 1 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)}}) to bludgeoning until the start of your next turn.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4638,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4638,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"","name":"Geas","rank":3,"uuid":"3323329170084778","range":"10 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1855,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature of a level no greater than double the geas ritual's rank","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"see text","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Arcana (expert), Occultism (expert), or Religion (expert)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Society or Legal Lore","casters":1}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=118","book":"Player Core","page":"393"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:38:11.324651+00:00","heightened":{"text":[{"text":"You can use <em>geas</em> on an unwilling creature; it can attempt a Will save to negate the effect. If the target fails this Will save, the <em>geas</em> lasts up to 1 week. A <em>cleanse affliction</em> spell can counteract a <em>geas</em> on an unwilling creature, in addition to powerful magic such as a <em>wish</em> ritual. A clever unwilling creature can subvert the <em>geas</em> by contriving situations that prevent it from complying, but in that case it becomes [[Sickened]] (as described above).","amount":"(5th)"},{"text":"As 5th rank, but the <em>geas</em> lasts for up to 1 year on an unwilling creature.","amount":"(7th)"},{"text":"As 5th rank, but the <em>geas</em> lasts for a duration you choose (even unlimited) on an unwilling creature.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":[],"description":"You enforce a magic rule on a willing target, forcing it to either perform or refrain from carrying out a certain act. A _geas_ to perform an act is usually conditional, such as, \"Always offer hospitality to strangers seeking a place to stay.\" An unconditional _geas_ to perform a certain act doesn't require the target to perform that act exclusively, though it must prioritize the task above all leisurely pursuits. The most common _geas_ to refrain from carrying out an act is a specification to avoid violating a contract. In those cases, the secondary caster usually takes charge of making sure the wording of the contract is attuned correctly with the ritual's magic. Because the target is willing, _geas_ can have a duration that lasts for as long as the target agrees to. If the target is unable to fulfill the _geas_, it becomes Sickened{Sickened 1}, and the sickened condition increases by 1 for each consecutive day it is prevented from following the _geas_, to a maximum of sickened 4. The sickened condition ends immediately when it follows the _geas_ again; it can't remove the sickened condition in any other way. Only powerful magic such as a Wish ritual can remove the effects of _geas_ from a willing target.\n\n**Critical Success** The _geas_ succeeds, and the target receives a +1 status bonus to skill checks that directly uphold the _geas_ (at the GM's discretion).\n\n**Success** The _geas_ succeeds.\n\n**Failure** The _geas_ fails.\n\n**Critical Failure** The _geas_ fails, and you are instead affected by the _geas_ you were attempting to place on the target. You are considered an unwilling target, so the _geas_ can be counteracted with a Cleanse Affliction spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"after":{"id":4638,"area":null,"cast":"1 day","cost":"","name":"Geas","rank":3,"uuid":"3323329170084778","range":"10 feet","rarity":"UNCOMMON","traits":[1855,1448],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature of a level no greater than double the geas ritual's rank","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"see text","meta_data":{"focus":true,"damage":[],"ritual":{"primary":{"check":"Arcana (expert), Occultism (expert), or Religion (expert)"},"secondary":{"checks":"Society or Legal Lore","casters":1}},"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Rituals.aspx?ID=118","book":"Player Core","page":"393"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":true}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:38:11.324651+00:00","heightened":{"text":[{"text":"You can use <em>geas</em> on an unwilling creature; it can attempt a Will save to negate the effect. If the target fails this Will save, the <em>geas</em> lasts up to 1 week. A <em>cleanse affliction</em> spell can counteract a <em>geas</em> on an unwilling creature, in addition to powerful magic such as a <em>wish</em> ritual. A clever unwilling creature can subvert the <em>geas</em> by contriving situations that prevent it from complying, but in that case it becomes [[Sickened]] (as described above).","amount":"(5th)"},{"text":"As 5th rank, but the <em>geas</em> lasts for up to 1 year on an unwilling creature.","amount":"(7th)"},{"text":"As 5th rank, but the <em>geas</em> lasts for a duration you choose (even unlimited) on an unwilling creature.","amount":"(9th)"}]},"traditions":[],"description":"You enforce a magic rule on a willing target, forcing it to either perform or refrain from carrying out a certain act. A _geas_ to perform an act is usually conditional, such as, \"Always offer hospitality to strangers seeking a place to stay.\" An unconditional _geas_ to perform a certain act doesn't require the target to perform that act exclusively, though it must prioritize the task above all leisurely pursuits. The most common _geas_ to refrain from carrying out an act is a specification to avoid violating a contract. In those cases, the secondary caster usually takes charge of making sure the wording of the contract is attuned correctly with the ritual's magic. Because the target is willing, _geas_ can have a duration that lasts for as long as the target agrees to. If the target is unable to fulfill the _geas_, it becomes Sickened{Sickened 1}, and the sickened condition increases by 1 for each consecutive day it is prevented from following the _geas_, to a maximum of sickened 4. The sickened condition ends immediately when it follows the _geas_ again; it can't remove the sickened condition in any other way. Only powerful magic such as a Wish ritual can remove the effects of _geas_ from a willing target.\n\n**Critical Success** The _geas_ succeeds, and the target receives a +1 status bonus to skill checks that directly uphold the _geas_ (at the GM's discretion).\n\n**Success** The _geas_ succeeds.\n\n**Failure** The _geas_ fails.\n\n**Critical Failure** The _geas_ fails, and you are instead affected by the _geas_ you were attempting to place on the target. You are considered an unwilling target, so the _geas_ can be counteracted with a Cleanse Affliction spell.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":1},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4645,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4645,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Gouging Claw","rank":0,"uuid":"7936654456260456","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1858,1432,1433,1456],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1546","book":"Player Core","page":"333"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:39:17.553826+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6","3Pz4NTLXD2rzKgf4":"1"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6 and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You temporarily morph your limb into a clawed appendage. Make a melee spell attack roll against your target's AC. If you hit, you deal your choice of 2d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d6) slashing damage or 2d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d6) piercing damage, plus 2 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}) persistent bleed damage. On a critical success, you deal double damage and double bleed damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4645,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Gouging Claw","rank":0,"uuid":"7936654456260456","range":"touch","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1520,1858,1432,1433,1456],"defense":"AC","targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1546","book":"Player Core","page":"333"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:39:17.553826+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d6","3Pz4NTLXD2rzKgf4":"1"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The damage increases by 1d6 and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"You temporarily morph your limb into a clawed appendage. Make a melee spell attack roll against your target's AC. If you hit, you deal your choice of 2d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d6) slashing damage or 2d6 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}d6) piercing damage, plus 2 (⬆️{{ceil(level/2)+1}}) persistent bleed damage. On a critical success, you deal double damage and double bleed damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4649,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4649,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-ACTION","cost":"","name":"Guidance","rank":0,"uuid":"8028104725906475","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the start of your next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1549","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:20.502134+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You ask for the guidance of supernatural entities, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4649,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-ACTION","cost":"","name":"Guidance","rank":0,"uuid":"8028104725906475","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1858,1432],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the start of your next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1549","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:20.502134+00:00","heightened":{"data":{},"text":[]},"traditions":["divine","occult","primal"],"description":"You ask for the guidance of supernatural entities, granting the target a +1 status bonus to one attack roll, Perception check, saving throw, or skill check the target attempts before the duration ends. The target chooses which roll to use the bonus on before rolling. If the target uses the bonus, the spell ends. Either way, the target is then temporarily immune for 1 hour.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4650,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4650,"area":"60-foot line","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Gust of Wind","rank":1,"uuid":"2220896986554251","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the start of your next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1550","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:33.628882+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A violent wind issues forth from your palm, blowing from the point where you are when you Cast the Spell to the line's opposite end. The wind extinguishes small non-magical fires, disperses fog and mist, blows objects of light Bulk or less around, and pushes larger objects. Large or smaller creatures in the area must attempt a Fortitude save. Large or smaller creatures that later move into the gust must attempt the save on entering.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature can't move against the wind.\n\n**Failure** The creature is knocked Prone. If it was flying, it takes the effects of critical failure instead.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is pushed 30 feet in the wind's direction, knocked prone, and takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4650,"area":"60-foot line","cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Gust of Wind","rank":1,"uuid":"2220896986554251","range":"","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1524,1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"until the start of your next turn","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1550","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:33.628882+00:00","heightened":{},"traditions":["arcane","primal"],"description":"A violent wind issues forth from your palm, blowing from the point where you are when you Cast the Spell to the line's opposite end. The wind extinguishes small non-magical fires, disperses fog and mist, blows objects of light Bulk or less around, and pushes larger objects. Large or smaller creatures in the area must attempt a Fortitude save. Large or smaller creatures that later move into the gust must attempt the save on entering.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature can't move against the wind.\n\n**Failure** The creature is knocked Prone. If it was flying, it takes the effects of critical failure instead.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature is pushed 30 feet in the wind's direction, knocked prone, and takes 2d6 bludgeoning damage.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4651,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4651,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Hallucination","rank":5,"uuid":"7568853992825250","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1481,1433,1448,1899],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1551","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:51.596759+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"1 or 10 creatures"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 or any number of creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"Choose to either target up to 10 creatures or change the spell’s duration to until your next daily preparations.","amount":"(6th)"},{"text":"Choose to either target any number of creatures or change the spell's duration to unlimited.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"The target consistently detects one thing as another, can't detect something that's there, or detects something that's not there, though it doesn't alter their beliefs. You choose which of these effects applies, and you determine the specifics of the hallucination. For example, you could make the target see all elves as humans, be unable to detect the presence of their brother, see their beloved good luck charm on their person even when it isn't, or see a tower in the center of town.\n\nThe target can attempt an initial Will save, with effects below. They also receive a Will save to disbelieve the hallucination every time they Seek or directly interact with the hallucination. For example, the target could attempt to disbelieve the hallucination each time they interacted with an elf, bumped into their brother accidentally, tried to check their charm, or studied the tower. The target can attempt to disbelieve with a large circumstance bonus in situations determined by the GM, such as if the target attempted to climb the nonexistent tower.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, but it knows what the hallucination is.\n\n**Failure** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, and it trusts its false senses, taking a -4 circumstance penalty to saves to disbelieve.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4651,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Hallucination","rank":5,"uuid":"7568853992825250","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1447,1481,1433,1448,1899],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 hour","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1551","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:40:51.596759+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"fixed","levels":{"6":{"target":{"value":"1 or 10 creatures"}},"7":{"target":{"value":"1 or any number of creatures"}}}},"text":[{"text":"Choose to either target up to 10 creatures or change the spell’s duration to until your next daily preparations.","amount":"(6th)"},{"text":"Choose to either target any number of creatures or change the spell's duration to unlimited.","amount":"(8th)"}]},"traditions":["arcane","occult"],"description":"The target consistently detects one thing as another, can't detect something that's there, or detects something that's not there, though it doesn't alter their beliefs. You choose which of these effects applies, and you determine the specifics of the hallucination. For example, you could make the target see all elves as humans, be unable to detect the presence of their brother, see their beloved good luck charm on their person even when it isn't, or see a tower in the center of town.\n\nThe target can attempt an initial Will save, with effects below. They also receive a Will save to disbelieve the hallucination every time they Seek or directly interact with the hallucination. For example, the target could attempt to disbelieve the hallucination each time they interacted with an elf, bumped into their brother accidentally, tried to check their charm, or studied the tower. The target can attempt to disbelieve with a large circumstance bonus in situations determined by the GM, such as if the target attempted to climb the nonexistent tower.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Critical Success** The creature is unaffected.\n\n**Success** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, but it knows what the hallucination is.\n\n**Failure** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves.\n\n**Critical Failure** The creature perceives what you chose until it disbelieves, and it trusts its false senses, taking a -4 circumstance penalty to saves to disbelieve.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4653,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4653,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Harm","rank":1,"uuid":"5038309989983530","range":"varies","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1433,1485],"defense":null,"targets":"1 living creature or 1 willing undead creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1552","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:41:13.789127+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You channel void energy to harm the living or heal the undead. If the target is a living creature, you deal 1d8 void damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. If the target is a willing [undead](link_trait_2425) creature, you restore that amount of Hit Points. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.\n\n<abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> The spell has a range of touch.\n\n<abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing an undead creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.\n\n<abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) You disperse void energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the area.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"after":{"id":4653,"area":null,"cast":"ONE-TO-THREE-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Harm","rank":1,"uuid":"5038309989983530","range":"varies","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1433,1485],"defense":null,"targets":"1 living creature or 1 willing undead creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1552","book":"Player Core","page":"334"},"foundry":{"rules":[],"is_focus":false}},"created_at":"2024-03-23T20:41:13.789127+00:00","heightened":{"data":{"type":"interval","damage":{"0":"1d8"},"interval":1},"text":[{"text":"The amount of healing or damage increases by 1d8, and the extra healing for the 2-action version increases by 8.","amount":"(+1)"}]},"traditions":["divine"],"description":"You channel void energy to harm the living or heal the undead. If the target is a living creature, you deal 1d8 void damage to it, and it gets a basic Fortitude save. If the target is a willing [undead](link_trait_2425) creature, you restore that amount of Hit Points. The number of actions you spend when Casting this Spell determines its targets, range, area, and other parameters.\n\n<abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> The spell has a range of touch.\n\n<abbr cost=\"TWO-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">2</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) The spell has a range of 30 feet. If you're healing an undead creature, increase the Hit Points restored by 8.\n\n<abbr cost=\"THREE-ACTIONS\" class=\"action-symbol\">3</abbr> ([concentrate](link_trait_1432)) You disperse void energy in a 30-foot emanation. This targets all living and undead creatures in the area.","availability":null,"requirements":null,"content_source_id":3},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"spell","id":4654,"type":"spell","before":{"id":4654,"area":null,"cast":"TWO-ACTIONS","cost":"","name":"Haste","rank":3,"uuid":"8809149192391288","range":"30 feet","rarity":"COMMON","traits":[1432,1433],"defense":null,"targets":"1 creature","trigger":null,"version":"1.0","duration":"1 minute","meta_data":{"damage":[],"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Spells.aspx?ID=1553","book":"Player Core","pa