":"5874423659103654","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Traits.aspx?ID=797","book":"Player Core 2","page":"61"},"important":true,"class_trait":false,"unselectable":false,"ancestry_trait":false,"creature_trait":false,"archetype_trait":false,"versatile_heritage_trait":false},"created_at":"2024-06-23T01:29:59.722233+00:00","description":"You created an [alchemical](link_trait_1529) item with the infused trait using your infused reagents, and it has a limited time before it becomes inert. Any nonpermanent effects from your infused alchemical items, with the exception of afflictions such as slow-acting [poisons](link_trait_1476), end when you make your daily preparations again.","content_source_id":256},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"trait","id":3605,"type":"trait","before":{"id":3605,"name":"Kami","uuid":"4533553260199986","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Traits.aspx?ID=354","book":"Bestiary 3","page":"309"},"important":false,"class_trait":false,"unselectable":false,"ancestry_trait":false,"creature_trait":true,"archetype_trait":false,"versatile_heritage_trait":false},"created_at":"2024-07-22T15:12:34.81592+00:00","description":"Kami are [spirits](link_trait_1556) of the Universe that bond with a specific object or place.","content_source_id":241},"after":{"id":3605,"name":"Kami","uuid":"4533553260199986","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Traits.aspx?ID=354","book":"Bestiary 3","page":"309"},"important":false,"class_trait":false,"unselectable":false,"ancestry_trait":false,"creature_trait":true,"archetype_trait":false,"versatile_heritage_trait":false},"created_at":"2024-07-22T15:12:34.81592+00:00","description":"Kami are [spirits](link_trait_1556) of the Universe that bond with a specific object or place.","content_source_id":241},"display_fields":[]},{"table":"trait","id":3611,"type":"trait","before":{"id":3611,"name":"Hobgoblin","uuid":"1852300027766009","meta_data":{"source":{"url":"https://2e.aonprd.com/Traits.aspx