e\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"basic bloodline spell\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"4157ef89-d259-4e11-a838-f9b033440caf\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5263,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"a2b31f8c-3fca-47da-8bf3-a51318546555\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"9e94001c-c923-4b5e-bdfc-d95078657535\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"advanced bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"608ff932-04db-4b2f-bc09-6148858bf8d4\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5273,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":3}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"be91f262-9014-4090-8b9b-d9bb57af412e\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"b903460c-13fd-4172-8369-0dd4b86086a5\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"greater bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"7dfb2220-7b86-4a51-8a3c-c988b85e38b5\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5267,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":5}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"919ca495-b5ed-47b4-9454-0cb9d389d041","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"8f5d6bb4-108f-4700-9d09-f21722bf69ea\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"84760cdf-1a39-49a7-99dd-b2ad4a206626\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Toxicologist\",\"description\":\"You specialize in toxins and venoms of all types. You start with the formulas for two common 1st-level [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476) in your [formula book](link_item_6972), in addition to your other formulas. You can apply an [injury](link_trait_1564) [poison](link_trait_1476) you're holding to a weapon you're wielding as a single action, rather than as a 2-action activity, and you can change the DCs of your [infused](link_trait_3540) [poisons](link_trait_1476) to your class DC if it's higher.\\n\\nField Discovery (5th)\\n---------------------\\n\\nWhen using [advanced alchemy](link_class-feature_30034) to make [poisons](link_trait_1476) during your daily preparations, you can spend one batch of reagents to create three [poisons](link_trait_1476) in any combination, instead of just two of the same [poison](link_trait_1476).\\n\\nPerpetual Infusions (7th)\\n-------------------------\\n\\nChoose two common 1st-level [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\\n\\nPerpetual Potency (11th)\\n------------------------\\n\\nChoose two common 5th-level or lower [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\\n\\nGreater Field Discovery (13th)\\n------------------------------\\n\\nYou can apply two different [injury](link_trait_1564) [poisons](link_trait_1476) to the same weapon, though not to a piece of ammunition. The two [poisons](link_trait_1476) can be up to six levels lower than your level, and you can't use the [poisons](link_trait_1476) made without spending a batch of [infused](link_trait_3540) reagents via perpetual infusions. Applying the two [poisons](link_trait_1476) requires a separate action to apply each [poison](link_trait_1476). Once completed, you combine the two [poisons](link_trait_1476) on the weapon into a double [poison](link_trait_1476) with the lower of the two [poisons](link_trait_1476)' DCs. This double [poisons](link_trait_1476) is only [virulent](link_trait_1567) if both [poisons](link_trait_1476) were [virulent](link_trait_1567), and if the [poisons](link_trait_1476) have a different number of stages, the double poison has a number of stages equal to the [poison](link_trait_1476) with the lower number of stages. The target takes the effects of both [poisons](link_trait_1476) for its current stage.\\n\\nPerpetual Perfection (17th)\\n---------------------------\\n\\nChoose two common 11th-level or lower [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"0ad13a93-e712-47d3-8e14-accc4e04e46d\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"class-feature\",\"id\":30185,\"text\":\"When using [advanced alchemy](link_class-feature_30034) to make [poisons](link_trait_1476) during your daily preparations, you can spend one batch of reagents to create three [poisons](link_trait_1476) in any combination, instead of just two of the same [poison](link_trait_1476).\"}},{\"id\":\"6a28c92a-e869-4c2f-aa59-c7f6dd407ab8\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"class-feature\",\"id\":30187,\"text\":\"Choose two common 1st-level [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\"}},{\"id\":\"585c0881-f468-40d9-8cf3-8ab3beb1875e\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"class-feature\",\"id\":30189,\"text\":\"Choose two common 5th-level or lower [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\"}},{\"id\":\"4a88c5e0-31b6-4f35-be87-0aaface57a18\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"class-feature\",\"id\":30190,\"text\":\"You can apply two different [injury](link_trait_1564) [poisons](link_trait_1476) to the same weapon, though not to a piece of ammunition. The two [poisons](link_trait_1476) can be up to six levels lower than your level, and you can't use the [poisons](link_trait_1476) made without spending a batch of [infused](link_trait_3540) reagents via perpetual infusions. Applying the two [poisons](link_trait_1476) requires a separate action to apply each [poison](link_trait_1476). Once completed, you combine the two [poisons](link_trait_1476) on the weapon into a double [poison](link_trait_1476) with the lower of the two [poisons](link_trait_1476)' DCs. This double [poisons](link_trait_1476) is only [virulent](link_trait_1567) if both [poisons](link_trait_1476) were [virulent](link_trait_1567), and if the [poisons](link_trait_1476) have a different number of stages, the double poison has a number of stages equal to the [poison](link_trait_1476) with the lower number of stages. The target takes the effects of both [poisons](link_trait_1476) for its current stage.\"}},{\"id\":\"0c2f4b91-6f10-40e6-b06e-9126ddb6efae\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"class-feature\",\"id\":30192,\"text\":\"Choose two common 11th-level or lower [alchemical](link_trait_1529) [poisons](link_trait_1476).\"}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"7e806719-b779-40e2-957a-aa0e1c5e3210","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"011d9cdd-32ed-453a-b53f-697447880b38\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"7d74e823-7e18-4109-b2e2-65639d25dc28\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Eldritch Trickster\",\"description\":\"When it comes to a big heist, every rogue worth their salt knows that magic can throw meticulous plans into chaos, whether in the form of arcane wards or pesky divinations. You dabble in magic just enough to help handle these problems by jury-rigging spells and throwing a bit of your own magic into the mix. You might be a solitary thief, performing burglaries that can't be explained by skill alone, or a specialist called in by other rogues to deal with magical security measures. You might even be on the up-and-up, hired to test magical defenses or even build them yourself.\\n\\nChoose a [multiclass](link_trait_1446) [archetype](link_trait_1439) that has a basic, expert, and master spellcasting feat. You gain that archetype's [dedication](link_trait_1445) feat as a bonus feat even though you don't meet its level prerequisite, though you must meet its other prerequisites. For you, the Magical Trickster rogue feat has a prerequisite of 2nd level instead of 4th level. You can choose the spellcasting attribute for the [multiclass](link_trait_1446) [archetype](link_trait_1439) you chose as your key attribute.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"b41051de-5639-4998-bc6f-2e68ce0eab5a\",\"type\":\"giveAbilityBlock\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"feat\",\"abilityBlockId\":34063}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"db796088-32ff-451d-bf6e-485161dedbaf","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"314a7c64-3a47-4082-92a2-7914fe109ed9\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"46efe159-978a-4949-81dc-40a4740d9e15\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Genie\",\"description\":\"Through lineage, magic, or wishes made real, the blood of a noble [genie](link_trait_2443) flows through your veins.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"f623a754-3703-4cc7-bebe-b97cde0d60e8\",\"type\":\"defineCastingSource\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"CASTING_SOURCES\",\"value\":\"SORCERER:::SPONTANEOUS-REPERTOIRE:::ARCANE:::ATTRIBUTE_CHA\"}},{\"id\":\"ab3d991f-6294-4227-91eb-c820e92e0ddf\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_ARCANA\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"76c6338d-7571-49ec-a273-3d9f65d9a13c\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_DECEPTION\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"983cff2c-9990-445a-949b-9b564ad3ce3e\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"f54cfe59-53d8-4ae6-b144-d06078c2a687\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"basic bloodline spell\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"55e8de58-fcd2-42a7-9193-cf0c76b68597\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5227,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"0c427c43-40c4-43c0-996b-619404af6765\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"78c31a8b-9060-43c4-94ef-23797af74ad6\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"advanced bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"fd1e4fdd-5a94-4b26-8415-0a026eb9bd37\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5232,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":3}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"12e52d28-e4d7-4294-9383-6ddbbe31771f\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"05ef5764-eb55-4f80-aeee-418b5b896a1b\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"greater bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"906a1bb5-e048-4c99-aadc-aba6c4dfec9f\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5293,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":5}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"046608ec-4af1-4a9f-944e-b1e4e1b780e0","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"314a7c64-3a47-4082-92a2-7914fe109ed9\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"dcd04686-07d0-4526-9830-a41f78ee13b4\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Shadow\",\"description\":\"Whether due to a velstrac's manipulations or a planar jaunt gone horribly wrong, your bloodline was infused with a vein of [shadow](link_trait_1901).\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"9f1f03e1-5b01-40d2-bf73-5127c47afe89\",\"type\":\"defineCastingSource\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"CASTING_SOURCES\",\"value\":\"SORCERER:::SPONTANEOUS-REPERTOIRE:::OCCULT:::ATTRIBUTE_CHA\"}},{\"id\":\"956668c7-d99a-4e88-9a57-b0bca350870b\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_OCCULTISM\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"1ea10d87-5048-4bea-b198-1983068d0b31\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_STEALTH\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"1414134b-e275-4e28-a6c9-5820ea15402f\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"e4db8543-240c-4411-8246-ac489e19d494\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"basic bloodline spell\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"dd677f52-4fe2-4ee5-9df6-12191a9d4b7e\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5215,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"56a6c75e-3ede-4cc1-810c-440f4669262a\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"a67e9102-e796-467c-88d4-aed322f450a3\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"advanced bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"24bb7865-7da3-4118-ae9a-730cef759581\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5275,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":3}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"a0428cbb-f449-409a-b3ae-39cef5f0feb9\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"268ec242-fda7-4bfd-88ab-fb7d6656f678\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"greater bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"91cb2936-8abb-471a-80a9-fee7258e2cfc\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":5206,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":5}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"25f1a538-467e-4432-bc38-eb06011355c3","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"6d59f8b3-64bc-415c-b185-fe9eb39ce26c\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"a518e3ae-5c76-4027-a637-2196ea0829ab\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Psychopomp\",\"description\":\"For good or ill, your ancestors' deeds drew the attention of [psychopomps](link_trait_2457), or you might somehow count one in your family tree. The presence of these shepherds of souls and enemies of undeath has left an indelible mark on you.\\n\\n**Spell List** [divine](link_trait_1475)  \\n**Bloodline Skills** Intimidation, Religion  \\n**Granted Spells** cantrip: [_vitality lash_](link_spell_4936), 1st: [_heal_](link_spell_4656), 2nd: [_calm_](link_spell_4426), 3rd: [_holy light_](link_spell_4660), 4th: [_planar tether_](link_spell_4773), 5th: [_death ward_](link_spell_5698), 6th: [_spirit blast_](link_spell_4853), 7th: [_execute_](link_spell_4609), 8th: [_spirit song_](link_spell_6079), 9th: [_massacre_](link_spell_4718)  \\n**Bloodline Spells** initial: [_sepulchral mask_](link_spell_5263), advanced: [_spirit veil_](link_spell_5273), greater: [_shepherd of souls_](link_spell_5267)  \\n**Blood Magic** The border between life and death becomes blurred to you. Either you gain a +2 status bonus to Fortitude saving throws for 1 round, or a target takes 1 damage per spell level. The damage is void if the target is living or positive if the target is undead. If the spell already deals that type of damage, combine it with the spell's initial damage before determining weaknesses and resistances.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"1b8dae2c-57a8-43c8-b25b-3b82993c00de\",\"type\":\"defineCastingSource\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"CASTING_SOURCES\",\"value\":\"SORCERER:::SPONTANEOUS-REPERTOIRE:::DIVINE:::ATTRIBUTE_CHA\"}},{\"id\":\"e92e8ec2-d453-42fb-935d-0f320b3eaacb\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_INTIMIDATION\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"67dc00a7-b630-423b-9c2a-08f570485637\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_RELIGION\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"U\"}}},{\"id\":\"61dfb1cb-fe8a-424a-87b3-03ed4258ffb9\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":4936,\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}},{\"id\":\"4d3a7604-3997-4a43-8a08-c8831aa51498\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":4656,\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}},{\"id\":\"31cd9acd-6289-4862-a7fb-f24048a595fd\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"ae5715a8-9d56-4b69-bb7e-e599e301a7e5\",\"name\":\"LEVEL\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"LEVEL\",\"type\":\"num\",\"value\":3},\"type\":\"num\",\"operator\":\"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS\",\"value\":3}],\"trueOperati