"opId\":\"620cf16f-48c7-43d9-a5ab-3223d19b65f5\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"c94a9df6-5c7c-4925-a24d-572f873cc765\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Dust\",\"description\":\"You have the power to dry and crumble what opposes you.\\n\\n**Initial Spell** [_Parch_](link_spell_6047)\\n\\n**Advanced Spell** [_Dust Storm_](link_spell_6046)\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"f64bf651-1fb7-408d-91a2-e17265e5a055","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"620cf16f-48c7-43d9-a5ab-3223d19b65f5\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"dbe8ee7a-2018-45ae-b27b-d257a2ccc6e5\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Duty\",\"description\":\"You defend oaths and carry out your divine missions with great dedication.\\n\\n**Initial Spell** [_Oathkeeper's Insignia_](link_spell_6172)\\n\\n**Advanced Spell** [_Dutiful Challenge_](link_spell_6173)\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"63c522c1-2d96-4318-ad5a-8fc0b3866527","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"620cf16f-48c7-43d9-a5ab-3223d19b65f5\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"a77b5643-38bf-45ca-95bf-d346af4045a5\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Glyph\",\"description\":\"You wield power over written words and symbols.\\n\\n**Initial Spell** [_Redact_](link_spell_6240)\\n\\n**Advanced Spell** [_Ghostly Transcription_](link_spell_6231)\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"}],"artwork_url":"","description":"No fantasy setting is complete without a pantheon of powerful deities for its characters to worship or fear. Whether you're a sneaky rogue asking the god of thievery for a blessing on your next heist or a valorous crusader calling the might of your patron down upon the forces of evil, faith and the forces behind it are key to every character's identity. Within this volume you'll find details on the gods and non-deific faiths of the Age of Lost Omens from the perspective of their clergy and lay worshipers. You'll also discover new domains, feats, and spells to customize your character, and an exhaustive index of hundreds of deities from the Pathfinder setting you can worship (and the mechanical benefits of doing so).","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":23,"name":"Grand Bazaar (backport)","row":{"id":23,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq029xo?Pathfinder-Lost-Omens-The-Grand-Bazaar","keys":null,"name":"Grand Bazaar (backport)","group":"lost-omens","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":61,"item":354,"trait":4,"ancestry":1,"heritage":5,"archetype":2,"content_update":624,"physical-feature":3}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:31:34.559116+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"The Grand Bazaar is Absalom's greatest marketplace featuring items from all over Golarion. Here, an adventurer can find equipment of all kinds to help them on their next quest like new weapons, armors, magic items, accessibility items to enable adventures for anyone, new animal companions, and more! The Grand Bazaar is also home to countless unique merchants and shops. Game Masters can use these new shops as part of their campaigns to flesh out the world and inspire new adventures. See what's for sale at the Grand Bazaar, and snap up the good deals while you still can!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":28,"name":"The Mwangi Expanse (backport)","row":{"id":28,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq027ot?Pathfinder-Lost-Omens-The-Mwangi-Expanse","keys":null,"name":"The Mwangi Expanse (backport)","group":"lost-omens","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":91,"trait":7}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:37:58.411229+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[{"id":"61a9c255-339d-4129-9911-31db0d2a9cbe","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"8285e7d2-ea5a-4e96-a512-c358f892e91b\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"41110dc7-ecd7-4141-bcd4-96a6d50ecb27\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Wyrmblessed\",\"description\":\"You lay claim to the might of dragons, but your powers are sacred instead of [arcane](link_trait_1459)—born from a worship of draconic might so powerful it infused your blood or, perhaps, from a celestial or draconic power blessing one of your ancestors received.\\n\\n**Spell List** divine\\n\\n**Bloodline Skills** Intimidation, Religion\\n\\n**Granted Spells** [cantrip](link_trait_1858): [_read aura_](link_spell_4794), 1st: [_mystic armor_](link_spell_4734), 2nd: [_resist energy_](link_spell_4801), 3rd: [_haste_](link_spell_4654), 4th: [_reflective scales_](link_spell_6197), 5th: [_cloak of colors_](link_spell_5800), 6th: [_repulsion_](link_spell_4800), 7th: [_mask of terror_](link_spell_4717), 8th: [_divine inspiration_](link_spell_4577), 9th: [_overwhelming presence_](link_spell_4750)\\n\\n**Bloodline Spells** initial: [_dragon claws_](link_spell_5549), advanced: [_dragon breath_](link_spell_5821), greater: [_dragon wings_](link_spell_5725)\\n\\n**Blood Magic** Draconic might carries in your voice. Either you gain a +1 status bonus to Intimidation checks for 1 round, or a target takes a –1 status penalty to Will saves for 1 round.\\n\\nAt 1st level, choose the type of dragon that influenced your bloodline. You can't change your dragon type later. This choice affects how some of your bloodline spells function.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"e9bd9e34-b524-47d3-8176-fa4ac56f8294\",\"type\":\"defineCastingSource\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"CASTING_SOURCES\",\"value\":\"SORCERER:::SPONTANEOUS-REPERTOIRE:::DIVINE:::ATTRIBUTE_CHA\"}},{\"id\":\"5b6b790b-5d37-4460-947b-54095315b873\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_INTIMIDATION\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"3614fd81-5bcf-49b8-bac0-a868a4b92570\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_OCCULTISM\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"a021a0b2-7a8b-4441-a1d6-3e482c28e929\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":4794,\"type