"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5549,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sea Dragon\"}},{\"id\":\"a1bb2201-e42b-41d4-95ed-731ec2f1c2d9\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5821,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sea Dragon\"}}]},{\"id\":\"de89daf4-3a78-4c0a-9c76-10a401e5c143\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Sky\",\"description\":\"[Electricity](link_trait_1576) damage, 30-foot burst.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"a3ae3d2a-90f4-4330-b7c9-faaca6c35580\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5821,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sky Dragon\"}},{\"id\":\"3a98c9af-c5b1-4b8d-9443-6dc5c3eff740\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5549,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sky Dragon\"}}]},{\"id\":\"daa4a74c-a6d3-4fec-b0a2-e3850e33ff45\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Sovereign\",\"description\":\"[Mental](link_trait_1448) damage, 30-foot cone.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"6a91bee3-cd64-4ab7-99f7-0d71a34d1572\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5821,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sovereign Dragon\"}},{\"id\":\"73433473-15ae-4dc8-b32a-d1a38cb81ca2\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5821,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Sovereign Dragon\"}}]},{\"id\":\"e633d2f5-7ddb-44fe-a19e-51d79d878d6f\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Underworld\",\"description\":\"[Fire](link_trait_1542) damage, 30-foot burst.\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"0ef470a5-8862-4174-b3f6-3e72da13a80c\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5549,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Underworld Dragon\"}},{\"id\":\"4ced3e57-ba5a-4523-9790-b7f4b72c8dfe\",\"type\":\"injectText\",\"data\":{\"type\":\"spell\",\"id\":5821,\"text\":\"**Draconic Bloodline:** Underworld Dragon\"}}]}]}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"}],"artwork_url":"","description":"South of a forbidding range of mountain peaks lies a land of boundless resources and untold opportunity. The Mwangi Expanse has been home to an untold diversity of cultures and peoples since time immemorial, hosting powerful, isolated city states that have often paid little attention to their neighbors. Yet the turning tides of fortune have begun to usher in changes that are rippling across the world. As a band of scholars from an ancient university venture north to aid a disaster-torn Avistan. A revolution-forged nation seeks powerful allies against foreign aggression. An undead god, once a symbol of hope to his declining nation, now grows jealous enough to turn on his self-proclaimed kin. Whether you are a diplomat seeking leverage from the most difficult of positions, a spy seeking the subtlest hint of danger from your surroundings, a guardian hoping to protect your home and people, or a warrior striking back at tyrants both native and foreign, this guide to the Mwangi Expanse offers you the ultimate resource to explore a realm of magic, monsters, and intrigue!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":29,"name":"Pathfinder Society Guide (backport)","row":{"id":29,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq0233q?Pathfinder-Lost-Omens-Pathfinder-Society-Guide","keys":null,"name":"Pathfinder Society Guide (backport)","group":"lost-omens","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":58,"item":78}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:38:55.27983+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"The Pathfinder Society is a globe-trotting organization of adventurers, scholars, and warriors all dedicated to exploration, collecting lost knowledge and treasure, and sharing it with the world. Lost Omens: Pathfinder Society Guide details everything players and GMs need to know about the Pathfinder Society, from the basics of membership, to the Society's various factions, to the various lodges littered throughout the Inner Sea region. This book is the go-to source for the history and lore of the Pathfinder Society and features new rules content including new equipment, wayfinders, and support for Pathfinder-related archetypes! A useful book in its own right, this helpful volume is a must-have for participants in Paizo's massive Pathfinder Society worldwide organized play campaign, and a great way to get involved in the international campaign!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":33,"name":"Agents of Edgewatch (backport) (in progress)","row":{"id":33,"url":"https://paizo.com/store/pathfinder/adventures/adventurePath/agentsOfEdgewatch","keys":null,"name":"Agents of Edgewatch (backport) (in progress)","group":"adventure-path","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":15,"item":59,"spell":13,"trait":2,"creature":1,"archetype":2,"background":11}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:42:49.421992+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"Amid the hustle and bustle of the world-famous centennial Radiant Festival, the guards of the so-called Edgewatch precinct must take down Absalom's sickest serial killers, brashest bank robbers, and cruelest criminal masterminds in order to ensure the festival's success and the safety of Absalom’s citizens. After a string of seemingly unrelated crimes is revealed as part of a much larger criminal plot, the members of one select squad find themselves at the center of things and must put their badges on the line to prevent the city from falling into chaos. By the end of this six-part monthly Adventure Path, there's just one group that can lay down the law and save Absalom: the Agents of Edgewatch!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":34,"name":"Age of Ashes (backport) (in progress)","row":{"id":34,"url":"https://paizo.com/store/pathfinder/adventures/adventurePath/ageOfAshes","keys":null,"name":"Age of Ashes (backport) (in progress)","group":"adventure-path","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":35,"item":31,"spell":8,"trait":6,"background":14}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:43:37.007776+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"The mysterious fires burning atop an abandoned Hellknight citadel are but the first of many discoveries waiting to be uncovered in this six-part, monthly Pathfinder campaign of continent-spanning conflict against cultists, slavers, and a fiery draconic devastation that could unleash an Age of Ashes upon the world!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":37,"name":"Fists of the Ruby Phoenix (backport) (in progress)","row":{"id":37,"url":"https://paizo.com/store/pathfinder/adventures/adventurePath/fistsOfTheRubyPhoenix","keys":null,"name":"Fists of the Ruby Phoenix (backport) (in progress)","group":"adventure-path","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":51,"item":13}},"created_at":"2024-04-21T18:46:39.053067+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[{"id":"64f36323-1712-4d1b-ac9e-62c9c826d04e","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"8285e7d2-ea5a-4e96-a512-c358f892e91b\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"f5121f7d-ccf5-46a6-ae09-d3efb086e659\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"Phoenix\",\"description\":\"You have been blessed by a phoenix, perhaps via some magical interaction with a similarly blessed individual.  \\n  \\nGrant this new sorcerer bloodline to players who finish the Fists of the Ruby Phoenix Adventure Path. Players can then choose this bloodline for any new sorcerer characters they create for future campaigns.  \\n  \\n**Spell List** [primal](link_trait_1454)  \\n**Bloodline Skills** Diplomacy, Nature  \\n**Granted Spells** cantrip: [detect magic](link_spell_4562), 1st: [breathe fire](link_spell_4423), 2nd: [see the unseen](link_spell_4822), 3rd: [fireball](link_spell_4623), 4th: [remove curse](link_spell_6171), 5th: [breath of life](link_spell_4422), 6th: [disintegrate](link_spell_4571), 7th: [contingency](link_spell_4535), 8th: [moment of renewal](link_spell_4729), 9th: [falling stars](link_spell_4612)  \\n**Bloodline Spells** initial: [rejuvenating flames](link_spell_6032), advanced: [shroud of flame](link_spell_6038), greater: [cleansing flames](link_spell_6041)  \\n**Blood Magic** The primal fire of life and death flows through you or one target. Choose to have either you or a target of the spell gain temporary Hit Points equal to the spell's rank for 1 round, or to have a target of the spell take [fire](link_trait_1542) damage equal to the spell's rank (if the spell already deals initial [fire](link_trait_1542) damage, combine this with the spell's initial damage before determining weaknesses and resistances).\",\"operations\":[{\"id\":\"c437ea31-b450-470b-8f89-a362252dc77b\",\"type\":\"defineCastingSource\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"CASTING_SOURCES\",\"value\":\"SORCERER:::SPONTANEOUS-REPERTOIRE:::PRIMAL:::ATTRIBUTE_CHA\"}},{\"id\":\"e40f75a2-1379-4222-b988-0aa1b6fede17\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_DIPLOMACY\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"38e88c70-3312-4444-a0ac-953fb25d5325\",\"type\":\"adjValue\",\"data\":{\"variable\":\"SKILL_NATURE\",\"value\":{\"value\":\"T\"}}},{\"id\":\"cfac92b4-3fcb-4dbb-ac19-61dfe3bcdde2\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":4562,\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":0}},{\"id\":\"2f2fc385-4c60-4be5-863d-34e7acac651a\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":4423,\"type\":\"NORMAL\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":1}},{\"id\":\"5d1da206-3bb7-460f-96c6-fbf5a622ecac\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"c810ee4a-e3cb-44a8-a5c4-8ed72ec96224\",\"name\":\"LEVEL\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"LEVEL\",\"type\":\"num\",\"value\":0},\"type\":\"num\",\"operator\":\"GREATER_THAN_OR_EQUALS\",\"value\":3}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"0d1b4781-09e3-4376-88be-246e0a45e330\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\