S\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"advanced bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"b9712d91-fd42-46e0-bce4-fcb914e73a5c\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":6038,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":3}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}},{\"id\":\"0e8a345b-b13e-4aff-a598-bc296b6723e1\",\"type\":\"conditional\",\"data\":{\"conditions\":[{\"id\":\"f5262c66-4755-4fb0-b86a-7ffaa30c95b3\",\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"data\":{\"name\":\"FEAT_NAMES\",\"type\":\"list-str\",\"value\":[]},\"type\":\"list-str\",\"operator\":\"INCLUDES\",\"value\":\"greater bloodline\"}],\"trueOperations\":[{\"id\":\"f1a7ec27-d9ba-4d95-8504-1377d031fba0\",\"type\":\"giveSpell\",\"data\":{\"spellId\":6041,\"type\":\"FOCUS\",\"castingSource\":\"SORCERER\",\"rank\":5}}],\"falseOperations\":[]}}]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"}],"artwork_url":"","description":"The time has come again for the Ruby Phoenix Tournament! The sorcerer Hao Jin has invited only the strongest martial artists, adventurers, and fortune seekers to her world-famous fighting competition. The motley roster of contenders must compete for this decade's champion title and the choice of one of the Ruby Phoenix's grand treasures. Who will come out on top, and who will be left in the dust? There's only one way to find out! The Fists of the Ruby Phoenix Adventure Path is a three-part series of connected adventures that compose a complete Pathfinder campaign.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":51,"name":"Book of the Dead  (backport) (in progress)","row":{"id":51,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq029wb?Pathfinder-Book-of-the-Dead","keys":null,"name":"Book of the Dead  (backport) (in progress)","group":"legacy","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":144,"item":36,"spell":4,"trait":14,"ancestry":1,"creature":8,"heritage":5,"archetype":12,"background":9,"physical-feature":3}},"created_at":"2024-04-23T18:54:45.016179+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Book of the Dead","operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"The dead are rising! This blasphemous tome gives players and GMs everything they need to bring the shambling menace of the undead to their Pathfinder adventures. This book includes tools for fighting against the undead horde, but also options for the players themselves to control or even become undead creatures. GMs will find new tools and haunts, as well as information about the undead-plagued lands of the Lost Omens campaign setting. A massive bestiary section full of undead creatures brings more threats for GMs to use and summonable creatures for players, including more versions of classic undead like vampires, skeletons, and zombies. This 224-page hardcover rulebook also includes a full adventure themed around fighting the undead!\n\n","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":185,"name":"Howl of the Wild","row":{"id":185,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq02ew4?Pathfinder-Howl-of-the-Wild","keys":null,"name":"Howl of the Wild","group":"pathfinder-core","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":307,"item":170,"mode":2,"sense":3,"creature":2,"content_update":896}},"created_at":"2024-05-22T18:02:28.829813+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Howl of the Wild","operations":[{"id":"c3332a0b-a664-4933-8796-d43bcd51bab7","data":{"id":4396,"text":"*   **Crab**\n    \n    *   Speed 25 feet, swim Speed 15 feet;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> big claw, Damage 2d8 piercing;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> little claw ([agile](link_trait_1569)), Damage 2d4 piercing;\n        \n    *   can breath in water and in air.\n        \n*   **Crocodile**\n    \n    *   Speed 25 feet, swim Speed 30 feet;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, Damage 2d8 piercing;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail ([agile](link_trait_1569)), Damage 1d8 bludgeoning;\n        \n    *   can hold your breath for the duration of the transformation.\n        \n*   **Orca**\n    \n    *   swim Speed 35 feet;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws, Damage 2d8 piercing;\n        \n    *   can hold your breath for the duration of the transformation.\n        \n*   **Seal**\n    \n    *   Speed 20 feet, swim Speed 30 feet;\n        \n    *   **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws ([grapple](link_trait_2524)), Damage 2d6 piercing;\n        \n    *   can hold your breath for the duration of the transformation.","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"},{"id":"9578717d-7318-4a4c-bec9-6a509151ae08","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"09ae096d-ca3e-4ca2-902d-df2908f85d56\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"f99a45bf-07ec-40e4-b42e-4345ad6ab81d","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"bba87593-cc74-4150-9b86-84ce0aaf3b78\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"f6e41644-fc76-48d6-812c-18f68ed618da","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"2aa14bab-b218-47ac-9634-3a4f542b225c\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"708c6f01-fad1-4268-986f-2ec497903b5f","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5