,\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"87ff1a41-4ad9-4ebf-9922-60141cb32843","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"bf976370-de08-4b79-b1f1-9801373dc8d7\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"9987a3a1-66c1-44dc-8a98-1139a23ddb58","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"d7e1afbe-f13d-4af1-92ba-6cf121e16506\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"},{"id":"a6edc332-7cfa-4831-b3ef-65e69074c2cb","data":{"value":"{\"opId\":\"e6f87a5b-704b-499c-99c5-be5668e484b4\",\"option\":{\"id\":\"ae8142ad-8c67-4405-93e7-51607aa74da5\",\"type\":\"CUSTOM\",\"title\":\"\",\"description\":\"\",\"operations\":[]}}","variable":"INJECT_SELECT_OPTIONS"},"type":"injectSelectOption"}],"artwork_url":"","description":"A sound echoes across the world’s farthest wildernesses: the howl of countless animals and beasts! This all-new 224-page Pathfinder rulebook dives deep into the wilderness like never before! With new ancestries, character options, animal companions, wilderness foes and more, Howl of the Wild provides a traveler’s pack worth of value for players and Game Masters alike!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":239,"name":"Bestiary (in progress)","row":{"id":239,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq01y0m?Pathfinder-Bestiary","keys":null,"name":"Bestiary (in progress)","group":"legacy","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"item":1,"trait":5,"creature":177,"language":4}},"created_at":"2024-07-05T19:20:49.199987+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Bestiary","operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"Over 400 of fantasy's fiercest foes burst from the pages of this enormous 360-page compendium of the most popular and commonly encountered creatures in the world of Pathfinder! From familiar enemies like orcs, dragons, and vampires to new horrors like the nightmarish nilith and the three-headed mukradi, to suitable servants for summoners of every alignment, this must-have companion to the Pathfinder Core Rulebook is crawling with creatures to challenge characters of any level.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":240,"name":"Bestiary 2 (in progress)","row":{"id":240,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq022yq","keys":null,"name":"Bestiary 2 (in progress)","group":"legacy","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"trait":6,"creature":331,"language":4,"content_update":6}},"created_at":"2024-07-05T19:21:44.11467+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Bestiary 2","operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"With more than 350 classic and brand new monsters, this 320-page hardcover rulebook greatly expands on the foes found in the Pathfinder Bestiary. From classic creatures like serpentfolk and jabberwock, returning favorites like the primal dragons or the Sandpoint devil, to brand new menaces sure to test even the bravest of heroes, this must-have tome of monsters designed to challenge characters of any level is an essential companion to your Pathfinder game!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":241,"name":"Bestiary 3 (in progress)","row":{"id":241,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq024xj","keys":null,"name":"Bestiary 3 (in progress)","group":"legacy","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"trait":19,"creature":350,"language":11}},"created_at":"2024-07-05T19:22:41.136779+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Bestiary 3","operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"With more than 300 classic and brand-new monsters, this 320-page beautifully illustrated hardcover rulebook completes the collection of creatures begun in the first two Pathfinder Bestiary volumes. From classic creatures like clockworks and tooth fairies, returning favorites like imperial dragons and mighty titans, to brand-new menaces found all over Golarion, this must-have tome of monsters designed to challenge characters of any level is an essential companion to your Pathfinder game!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":256,"name":"Player Core 2","row":{"id":256,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq02ej5?Pathfinder-Player-Core-2","keys":null,"name":"Player Core 2","group":"pathfinder-core","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":1184,"item":310,"mode":7,"class":8,"spell":172,"trait":76,"ancestry":8,"creature":7,"heritage":57,"language":1,"archetype":43,"background":24,"class-feature":273,"content_update":3102,"physical-feature":4,"versatile_heritage":3}},"created_at":"2024-07-23T21:20:10.082602+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":"Pathfinder Player Core 2","operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"Survival in a world beset by magic and evil takes more than a lucky roll of the dice. Pathfinder Player Core 2 significantly expands options available to Pathfinder players, giving them the edge to take on any adventure. This 320-page hardcover rulebook remasters 8 classes from Pathfinder Second Edition, providing everything you need to create a wide array of new characters, ready to take on the world. It also includes more than 40 archetypes, expanded ancestries, and tons of feats, spells, and alchemical items to provide a near-endless array of exciting options for every Pathfinder character! The ideal character option resource for players looking to move beyond the Pathfinder Player Core.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":400,"name":"War of Immortals","row":{"id":400,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq02oar?Pathfinder-War-of-Immortals","keys":null,"name":"War of Immortals","group":"pathfinder-core","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"hazard":5,"creature":11}},"created_at":"2024-11-06T19:01:25.263215+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"A god has been slain and nothing shall ever be the same again! As war and destruction spread across the world, new heroes must rise to the occasion and take arms to protect its mortal inhabitants. Two brand new classes provide new ways to engage with mythic themes—lay claim to your own spark of divinity and charge into battle as a mighty exemplar, or call upon the power of spiritual allies as a wise animist. Alongside these new classes are rules for running mythic games, archetypes for playing legendary characters, and a wide array of new items, spells, and monsters to tell stories straight out of myth and legend—but which fit perfectly into the remastered Pathfinder rules! Claim the power of the gods and battle the Universe’s most fearsome foes with War of Immortals!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1,256]}},{"id":420,"name":"Divine Mysteries","row":{"id":420,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq02oal","keys":null,"name":"Divine Mysteries","group":"lost-omens","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":117,"class_archetype":2}},"created_at":"2024-11-26T10:24:24.706333+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[{"id":"25ec0f22-eeb7-4013-87ff-a28eb920e572","data":{"id":4407,"text":"### Divine Mysteries Forms\n\n*   **Achaekek** Speed 70 feet, climb Speed 50 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> mantis claw ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile P](link_trait_1854)), **Damage** 6d8+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> spine volley (range 60 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 piercing.\n    \n*   **Ah Pook** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> macuahuitl ([backswing](link_trait_1619), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [tearing](link_trait_4071), [versatile B](link_trait_1690)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tormenting glance (range 120 feet, [visual](link_trait_1479)), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Aleth** Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, automatically succeeds at all flat checks to attack a hidden or concealed creature; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> dark embrace ([grapple](link_trait_2524), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile B](link_trait_1690)), **Damage** 6d8+6 cold; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> shroud of mystery ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Alseta** Speed 40 feet, dimensional Speed 60 feet (<abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [translocate](link_spell_4906) at will); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> dagger ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [thrown 40 feet](link_trait_3803), versatile P), **Damage** 6d6+6 piercing, **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> portal toss (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Apsu** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> claw ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 6d10+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> destructive breath (range 60 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [force](link_trait_1560).\n    \n*   **Arazni** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> rapier ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 piercing, **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> call blood (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6 persistent bleed damage.\n    \n*   **Atrogine** Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> hair and claws ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile B](link_trait_1690) or [S](link_trait_1837)), **Damage** 6d6+3 [poison](link_trait_1476); **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> dream-borne scream ([agile](link_trait_1569), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+6 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Besmara** Speed 40 feet, swim Speed 70 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> rapier ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [disarm](link_trait_1604), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> ship’s cannon (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Brigh** Speed 60 feet, fly Speed 60 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> light hammer ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [thrown 40 feet](link_trait_3803)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> bolt of molten bronze (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 fire.\n    \n*   **Camazotz** Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, echolocation 60 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> bloody fangs ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 piercing plus 3d6 persistent bleed.\n    \n*   **Casandalee** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> polytool ([agile](link_trait_1569); [modular B, P, or S](link_trait_3139); [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> logic blast (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Chaldira** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> shortsword ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile S](link_trait_1837)), **Damage** 6d6+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> fistful of buttons ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Dahak** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> burning claws ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 10 feet](link_trait_4173)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing plus 1d6 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542); **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> column of dragon’s fire (range 120 feet), **Damage** 5d6+3 [fire](link_trait_1542) plus 1d6 persistent [fire](link_trait_1542).\n    \n*   **Dajermube** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> lion shadow jaws ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> eclipse blast (range 120 feet), **Damage** 3d6+3 [fire](link_trait_1542) plus 3d6+3 [cold](link_trait_1519).\n    \n*   **Devourer** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 50 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> obliterating touch ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 [force](link_trait_1560); **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> event horizon (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [force](link_trait_1560).\n    \n*   **Embaral** Speed 70 feet, immune to immobilized, [water walk](link_spell_4949); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> water knife ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [thrown 60 feet](link_trait_1575), [versatile S](link_trait_1837), [water](link_trait_1584)), **Damage** 6d4+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> crushing stillness (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Emmeton Galardaria** Speed 60 feet, fly Speed 60 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> mighty pan ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> communal impact (range 60 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Genzaeri** Speed 60 feet, fly Speed 60 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> bladed gauntlet ([agile](link_trait_1569); [finesse](link_trait_1570); [free-hand](link_trait_1714); [modular B, P, or S](link_trait_3139); [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d4+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tactical barrage (range 120 feet), **Damage** 5d6 [acid](link_trait_1528), [cold](link_trait_1519), [electricity](link_trait_1576), [fire](link_trait_1542), or [sonic](link_trait_1484) plus 6 splash damage of the chosen type.\n    \n*   **Ghlaunder** Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> proboscis ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 20 feet](link_trait_4175)), **Damage** 6d6+6 piercing plus 3d6 persistent bleed damage.\n    \n*   **Grandmother Spider** Speed 70 feet, climb Speed 70 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> leg ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile P](link_trait_1854)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> venom web (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [poison](link_trait_1476).\n    \n*   **Groetus** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> war flail ([disarm](link_trait_1604), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [sweep](link_trait_1562), [trip](link_trait_1537)), **Damage** 6d10+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> dreadful thought (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Gruhastha** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> fist ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> arrow of enlightenment ([deadly 3d10](link_trait_2530), range increment 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 piercing.\n    \n*   **Hanspur** Speed 70 feet, immune to immobilized, [water walk](link_spell_4949); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> trident of the currents ([thrown 40 feet](link_trait_3803), [water](link_trait_1584)), **Damage** 6d8+6 [cold](link_trait_1519); **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> flood of rats (range 120 feet); **Damage** 5d6+3 piercing plus 1d6 persistent bleed.\n    \n*   **Hei Feng** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> drunken sword ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [sweep](link_trait_1562)), **Damage** 4d6+6 slashing plus 1d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) [splash](link_trait_1532) damage; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> storm surge ([air](link_trait_1524), range 120 feet, [water](link_trait_1584)), **Damage** 4d6+3 bludgeoning plus 1d6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. The caster is immune to this [splash](link_trait_1532) damage.\n    \n*   **Izuyaku** Speed 60 feet; immune to fatigue, [water walk](link_spell_4949); vaporsight (ignore concealed from mist or steam); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> vital strike ([forceful](link_trait_1598), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> geyser (range 120 feet, [water](link_trait_1584)), **Damage** 3d6+3 bludgeoning plus 3d6 [fire](link_trait_1542).\n    \n*   **Kaldemash** Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> long arm of the law ([reach 20 feet](link_trait_4175)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> star gun ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), range 240 feet, reload 0), **Damage** 6d6+3 [force](link_trait_1560).\n    \n*   **Kazutal** Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> machete ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [sweep](link_trait_1562)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaguar pounce (range 60 feet), **Damage** 5d6+3 piercing plus 1d6 persistent bleed.\n    \n*   **Kurgess** Speed 70 feet, climb Speed 50 feet, swim Speed 50 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> lashing chain ([disarm](link_trait_1604), [reach 20 feet](link_trait_4175), [trip](link_trait_1537)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> javelin (range increment 60 feet, [thrown](link_trait_1575)); **Damage** 6d6+3 piercing.\n    \n*   **Milani** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; shield (15 Hardness, can’t be damaged); **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> morningstar ([reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [versatile P](link_trait_1854)), **Damage** 6d8+6 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Nin** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> vampire fangs ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), [grapple](link_trait_2524), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [unarmed](link_trait_2398)), **Damage** 6d6+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> swarming bats ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), range 60 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 piercing.\n    \n*   **Nivi Rhombodazzle** Speed 60 feet, burrow Speed 30 feet, immune to immobilized; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> [returning](link_item_7708) light hammer ([agile](link_trait_1569), [thrown 60 feet](link_trait_1575)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning. You deal an additional 1 bludgeoning damage for every 6 rolled during the damage roll.\n    \n*   **Nocticula** Speed 30 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> tail blades ([agile](link_trait_1569), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> magnanimous smile ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet, [visual](link_trait_1479)), **Damage** 6d8+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Obari** Speed 50 feet, swim Speed 70 feet, ignores difficult and greater difficult terrain in water; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> crashing wave ([razing](link_trait_2862), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [shove](link_trait_1595), [water](link_trait_1584)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> sudden storm (range 120 feet), **Damage** 5d6+3 slashing plus 6 [electricity](link_trait_1576) [splash](link_trait_1532) damage. The caster is immune to this [splash](link_trait_1532) damage.\n    \n*   **Shizuru** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> katana ([deadly 3d8](link_trait_2530), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [two-hand d10](link_trait_1644), [versatile P](link_trait_1854)), **Damage** 6d6+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> sunbolt arrow (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [fire](link_trait_1542).\n    \n*   **Sivanah** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> bladed scarf ([disarm](link_trait_1604), [finesse](link_trait_1570), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [trip](link_trait_1537)), **Damage** 6d8+6 slashing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> mirror shards (range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 piercing.\n    \n*   **Treerazer** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> jaws ([agile](link_trait_1569), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> corrupting pulse (range increment 120 feet); **Damage** 6d6+3 [poison](link_trait_1476).\n    \n*   **Tsukiyo** Speed 70 feet, fly Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> longspear ([reach 20 feet](link_trait_4175)), **Damage** 6d8+6 piercing; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> moonbeam ([nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet, [silver](link_item_15062)), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Vudravati** Speed 70 feet, ignore difficult terrain and greater difficult terrain; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> embracing arms ([grapple](link_trait_2524), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d8+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> stunning glare ([mental](link_trait_1448), [nonlethal](link_trait_1571), range 120 feet), **Damage** 6d6+3 [mental](link_trait_1448).\n    \n*   **Zjar-Tovan** Speed 50 feet, fly Speed 70 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> everyweapon ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), [versatile P](link_trait_1854) or [S](link_trait_1837), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174)), **Damage** 6d6+6 bludgeoning; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> everyweapon ([fatal d8](link_trait_1653), range 120 feet, reload 0, [versatile P](link_trait_1854) or [S](link_trait_1837)), **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning.\n    \n*   **Zyphus** Speed 60 feet, fly Speed 60 feet; **Melee** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> scythe ([deadly 3d10](link_trait_2530), [reach 15 feet](link_trait_4174), [trip](link_trait_1537)), **Damage** 4d6+6 slashing plus 2d6 persistent bleed; **Ranged** <abbr cost=\"ONE-ACTION\" class=\"action-symbol\">1</abbr> deadly accident (range increment 120 feet, [versatile P](link_trait_1854) or [S](link_trait_1837)); **Damage** 6d6+3 bludgeoning (in the form of a sudden and unexpected fall, toppling objects, collisions, or the like).","type":"spell"},"type":"injectText"}],"artwork_url":"","description":"The influence of all-powerful deities is felt in every corner of the Lost Omens setting. Whether you're a valorous champion calling the righteous power of your patron down upon wicked foes or a sneaky rogue asking the god of thievery for a blessing on your next heist, faith and the forces behind it are key to every character's identity. Within this volume, you'll find details on the gods and non-deific faiths of the Age of Lost Omens from the perspective of their clergy and lay worshippers. The book also grants a glimpse into the machinations of a god, exploring how a new god rises, why a god takes worshippers in the first place, and what occurs when a god dies.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":476,"name":"Prey for Death (backport)","row":{"id":476,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq02eyz","keys":null,"name":"Prey for Death (backport)","group":"standalone-adventure","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":10,"spell":4,"trait":1,"archetype":1}},"created_at":"2025-02-05T17:10:58.171184+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":null,"artwork_url":null,"description":"The infamous Red Mantis assassins are feared throughout the world for their ruthlessness and legacy—those they slay stay dead! Yet they are not without honor, so when a group of assassins sent on a dangerous mission are met with unexpected treachery, they must clear their own names while remaining true to their murderous calling, even as greater plots and shocking truths reveal themselves.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}},{"id":493,"name":"Rival Academies","row":{"id":493,"url":"https://paizo.com/products/btq05yck","keys":null,"name":"Rival Academies","group":"lost-omens","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":78,"spell":43,"creature":1,"class_archetype":2}},"created_at":"2025-02-25T23:49:27.247566+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"The finest mages, scientists, and academics of the Age of Lost Omens are gathering!  \nJourney to a fortress-city in demon-ravaged Sarkoris to learn the ancient magical secrets of the Magaambya's wizards, Lepidstadt's bleeding-edge theories on reanimating flesh with electricity, the extraplanar fey philosophies of the Cobyslarni, and the lore of more than a dozen other academies! With so many prominent scholars in one place, rivalries are sure to abound—whether in the classroom, on the sports fields, or during field trips to dangerous lands.  \nThis 128-page book gives GMs and players a vibrant roster of luminaries, students, athletes, and wizards to build their very own magical academies. Whether players build bonds with classmates or clash with rivals, they'll gain diverse options like advanced spymaster gear, dazzling new martial arts techniques, or new wizard spells and schools, including the remastered Runelord!  \nWritten by: Sharang Biswas, Jeremy Blum, Carlos Cisco, Aoife Ester, Laura Lynn Horst, Andrew Mullen, Kendra Leigh Speedling, Stephanie Lundeen, Mahpiya, Collette Quach, Mikhail Rekun, Erin Roberts, Navaar Seik-Jackson, Shahreena Shahrani, Gina Susanna, Tan Shao Han, Esther Wallace, and Landon Winkler.","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1,256,13,842]}},{"id":842,"name":"Impossible Magic","row":{"id":842,"url":"https://store.paizo.com/pathfinder-impossible-magic/","keys":null,"name":"Impossible Magic","group":"pathfinder-core","user_id":null,"meta_data":{"counts":{"feat":492,"item":311,"mode":1,"class":4,"sense":1,"spell":331,"trait":25,"action":1,"creature":12,"heritage":2,"archetype":11,"class-feature":179,"content_update":183}},"created_at":"2026-06-08T21:54:10.805658+00:00","deprecated":null,"foundry_id":null,"operations":[],"artwork_url":"","description":"The perfect spell can solve just about any problem. From simple cantrips to reality-warping magic, this new rulebook contains a plethora of options for any adventurer who wants to delve into the unknown and unlock their true magical potential.\n\nWithin the confines of these pages lies the magnificent spellcraft of four wonderfully magical and unique classes!\n\n*   Strike with both spell and blade with as a magus.\n    \n*   Command an army of the undead as a necromancer.\n    \n*   Scribe unique magic onto enemies and allies alike as a runesmith.\n    \n*   Fight alongside a powerful magical companion as a summoner.\n    \n\nYou’ll also find over 240 spells that can be cast for both mischief and wonder, new impossible spells so impactful that they scar the soul, several fantastical archetypes that will bring a magical twist to any table, new arcane schools derived from the heart of the Impossible Lands themselves, and wondrous magical items that will allow even the most mundane of characters to experience the power of magic.\n\nAll of this is made manifest before you with Impossible Magic!","require_key":false,"contact_info":null,"is_published":true,"required_content_sources":[1]}}],"counts":{"item":1123,"creature":2,"trait":24},"known_pending_dependencies":[{"id":23323,"type":"spell","ref_id":4579,"content_source_id":1,"state":"PENDING","complete_row_md5":"2b8c86cfadbce240b2041bfe8b76cbb9","identity":{"id":4579,"name":"Divine Wrath","uuid":3047205529673834,"content_source_id":1}},{"id":34957,"type":"item","ref_id":6725,"content_source_id":1,"state":"PENDING","complete_row_md5":"fe72b72e33c5290ae6f5315762694baa","identity":{"id":6725,"name":"Artisan's Toolkit","uuid":246503552736976,"content_source_id":1}}],"write_count":21,"operation_owners":["item:12591","item:12126","item:11884","item:12723","item:12554","item:12474","item:12586","item:12588","item:12587","item:12127","item:12125","item:11885","item:12555","item:11719"],"authored_display_leaves":19,"insert_display_leaves":2,"ownership":"Existing exact operation display strings, six authored-row display templates and one exact100-insert self-reference template only. No operation semantics, saved entities, content updates, source counts, or original100 writes."}$display101$::jsonb;
